lows him to answer the page\n  request.\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc2 "Requirements"\n\n  5D-DummyPage - Requirements\n  ===========================\n\n  o  an Amiga (or compatible - DRACO)\n  o  MUI 2.3+\n  o  an AmiExpress-compatible BBS-program\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc3 "Installation"\n\n  5D-DummyPage - Installation (for AmiExpress)\n  ============================================\n\n  Simply copy the directories in this archive into your bbs-\n  directory.\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc5 "Greetings"\n\n  Greetings\n  =========\n\n  Airworx - Celator - Conan&Newton - Deathknight\n  Enzo - Gilthanas - Lealand Gount - Mad Doc\n  Mad Force - Mad Man - Maverick - MouseBuster\n  Muad''Dib - Nero - Playmate - R/\\! - Rainmain\n  Rebel MC - Rush - Snow - Steel - Thunder\n  Webster - Whiz!\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc6 "How to contact 5D"\n\n  You can write a message to ''SvEN tHE CREAToR'' at the following boards:\n\n  o  Digital Suicide\n  o  Warez Unlimited\n  o  World of Elite\n\n  ... and several more\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',11622,2,0,NULL,NULL,'5d_dp001','scan',1780048351);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('5d_dp002','5D!DP002.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/5D!DP002.LHA','5D-DummyPage','XIM','5D-DummyPage',NULL,'sTc','5D','__|  |__.__.__  __ _|\______\__  _/.__.__. / __  |  |  |  \/ // _____  ___/ |  |  |  | /  \   |  |  | \ \ \_ |_ \/\__ \_ |  |  |  |',replace('5TH :--:              _       _:--:__\n  __|  |__.__.__  __ _|\______\__  _/.__.__.\n / __  |  |  |  \/ // _____  ___/ |  |  |  |\n/  \   |  |  | \ \ \_ |_ \/\__ \_ |  |  |  |\n\______|___  |__\   / _/__\  ___/__  |___  |\n-DYNASTY-/___|---\_/__| /____\----\__|w/___|\n.--)------------------------------------(--.\n`-/  5D-DummyPage II v0.02 ©1995 by sTc  \-''\n (            !Needs MUI 2.3+!            )\n.-\  RELEASE DATE 11-12-95 - AmiExpress  /-.\n`--)------------------------------------(--''\n','\n',char(10)),'5D-DummyPage.guide',replace('@database 5D-DummyPage Documentation\n\nCopyright ©1995 sTc\n\n@remark $VER: (November 12 1995, 0:00)\n@remark AmigaGuide database for the 5D-DummyPage Documentation\n\n@node MAIN "5D-DummyPage Documentation"\n       ._____.\n  __5TH|_    |    ._____. ___________ ________. _______ ___.           ._____.\n__\\   __     |____|_    |_\\   _    ___\\____   |_\\  ___/__  |___    ____|_    |\n\\     \\|    _/     /    |     /    \\     _    |\\_____   /  ___/___/     /    |\n \\     \\    \\     /_    |____/    / \\    \\    |    /   /   \\     \\     /_    |\n  \\__________\\_____     |   /____/   \\________|_______/|__________\\_____     |\n                  |_____|pHS!                                          |_____|\n\n                                                     ... No Fear of Fun!\n\n    5D-DummyPage.Guide - Contents\n    =============================\n\n    1) @{" Introduction " Link ChildDoc1}\n    2) @{" Requirements " Link ChildDoc2}\n    3) @{" Installation " Link ChildDoc3}\n    4) @{" History " Link ChildDoc4}\n    5) @{" Greetings " Link ChildDoc5}\n    6) @{" How to contact 5D " Link ChildDoc6}\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc1 "Introduction"\n\n  5D-DummyPage - Introduction\n  ===========================\n\n  5D-DummyPage is a replacement for the ''O''-command\n  of AmiExpress. So it pages the SysOp by opening\n  a window which allows him to answer the page\n  request.\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc2 "Requirements"\n\n  5D-DummyPage - Requirements\n  ===========================\n\n  o  an Amiga (or compatible - DRACO)\n  o  MUI 2.3+\n  o  an AmiExpress-compatible BBS-program\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc3 "Installation"\n\n  5D-DummyPage - Installation (for AmiExpress)\n  ============================================\n\n  Simply copy the directories in this archive into your bbs-\n  directory.\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc4 "History"\n\n  5D-DummyPage - History\n  ======================\n\n  v0.01 - [RELEASE II]\n  v0.02 - added DisplayBeep()\n        - if pressing "DON''T-CHAT"-button the window\n          will disappear but paging will continue as\n          usual\n        - pager-window should be opened on Workbench\n        - Callerslog-writing added\n        - new design was created by Webster (THANKS!)\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc5 "Greetings"\n\n  Greetings\n  =========\n\n  Airworx - Celator - Conan&Newton - Deathknight\n  Enzo - Gilthanas - Leland Gaunt - Mad Doc\n  Mad Force - Mad Man - Maverick - MouseBuster\n  Muad''Dib - Nero - Playmate - R/\\! - Rainmain\n  Rebel MC - Rush - Snow - Steel - Thunder\n  Webster - Whirlwind - Whiz!\n  ___\n  \\_/ Special thanks go to Whirlwind & Webster.\n   o\n\n@endnode\n@node ChildDoc6 "How to contact 5D"\n\n  You can write a message to ''SvEN tHE CREAToR'' at the following boards:\n\n  o  Eak a Mouse\n  o  Electronic Confusion\n  o  Funky Trading\n  o  Needful Things\n  o  One Eight Seven\n  o  The Undiscovered\n  o  Violator\n  o  Warez Unlimited\n  o  World of Elite\n\n  ... and several more\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',31571,1,0,NULL,NULL,'5d_dp002','scan',1780048351);
