 who don''t know it:\n\n5D-Edit allows the users to edit the descriptions in a most\ncomfortable way by using the cursor keys. Also, there is the\npossibility of defining custom lines which can be simply inserted.\nThe group logo inserting is also a feature which may help the people!\n@endnode\n@node Installation "5D-Edit Installation"\nCopy all files which are in the ''BBS'' directory of the archive\ninto your bbs directory.\n\nContents of archive:\n===================\n\nBBS/ Commands/ BBSCmd/  ED.info\n     Doors/    5D-Edit/ Custom/\n                        Logos/\n                        5D-Edit\n                        5D-Edit.info\n                        5D-Edit.Guide\n\n===================\n@endnode\n@node Greetings "5D-Edit Greetings"\nGreetings go to:\n\n         . Celator ........... Thank you for helping me with /X! .\n         : ByteAndi ............ For helping me to learn coding! :\n         | Snow ...................... Sing mehr lieder, leader! |\n         `------( And all other persons I''ve forgotten!!! )------''\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',36772,33,1,'ED','Doors/5D-Edit','5d_ed121','scan',1780048351);
