ress ''E''. If you want to write a message like before\nyou can simply begin to write the name you want to write to!\n5D-EnterMsg breaks automatically and jumps into normal mode!\nIf you wait you can choose the Handle of the pearson you want to\nwrite to by Cursor Keys or by KeyPad! It ONLY shows the users\nwho have access to THAT conference and aren''t NEW USERS or INACTIVE!\n@endnode\n@node Installation "5D-EnterMsg Installation"\nCopy all files which are in the ''BBS'' directory of the archive\ninto your bbs directory.\n\nContents of archive:\n===================\n\nBBS/ Commands/ BBSCmd/      E.info\n     Doors/    5D-EnterMsg/ 5D-EnterMsg\n                            5D-EnterMsg.info\n                            5D-EnterMsg.Guide\n\n===================\n@endnode\n@node Greetings "5D-EnterMsg Greetings"\nGreetings go to:\n\n         . Celator ........... Thank you for helping me with /X! .\n         : ByteAndi ............ For helping me to learn coding! :\n         | Snow ...................... Sing mehr lieder, leader! |\n         `------( And all other persons I''ve forgotten!!! )------''\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',12529,1,1,'E','Doors/5D-EnterMsg','5d_em009','scan',1780048351);
