____ \|     |   _   \\_____      /       /  |     |\n   /     \   \/    ¦     |   \ \     |   /    \/   /_____/    _  /   ¦     |\n _/       \   \_____     |    \ \_   |   _     \_____   \_     \/_____     |\n \       _/    /   /     |     \     |   /      /   /    /     |     /     |\n  \__________ /__________|     |\ ___|__/_____ /_______ /______|___________|\n            \/           |     ¦ \/          \/       \/\n                         ¦     :     · D · Y · N · A · S · T · Y ·\n                         :\n\n                        ##>>> P r E S E N T S <<<##\n\n                             5D-JoinConf v0.72\n\n                 Coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR of 5th Dynasty\n\n                           @{" Normal Documentation " Link Documentation}\n@endnode\n@node Documentation "5D-JoinConf Documentation"\n              _______________________________________________\n             |                                               |\n             | //                                            |\n             | /                                             |\n             |                                               |\n             |            @{" D e S C R I P T I O N " Link Description}           |\n             |                                               |\n             |           @{" I n S T A L L A T I O N " Link Installation}          |\n             |                                               |\n             |              @{" G r E E T I N G S " Link Greetings}             |\n             |                                               |\n             |                                             / |\n             |                                            // |\n             |_______________________________________________|\n\n@endnode\n@node Description "5D-JoinConf Description"\n5D-JoinConf has been coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D!\n\nIt is a replacement for the normal ''J''-Command of AmiExpress v3.x+.\nYou can also use cursor keys! I hope you like it! smile\n\nAttention: If you want to user the other mode in which all\n           conferences are shown as one under another\n           then write "OLD_MODE" into your CONFCONFIG.info\n\n@endnode\n@node Installation "5D-JoinConf Installation"\nCopy all files which are in the archive bbs directory\nto your bbs directory.\n\nContents of archive:\n===================\n\nBBS/\n    Commands/\n        BBSCmd/\n            >.info\n            <.info\n            J.info\n    Doors/\n        5D-JoinConf/\n            5D-JoinConf\n            5D-JoinConf.info\n            5D-JoinConf.Guide\n\n===================\n\n@endnode\n@node Greetings "5D-JoinConf Greetings"\nGreetings go to:\n\n           Celator ........... Thank you for helping me with /X!\n           ByteAndi ............ For helping me to learn coding!\n           Prophet .................... For being a nice friend!\n           Snow ...................... Sing mehr lieder, leader!\n           Airworx ................. Continue work as Co Leader!\n           Delta-X ................. When you will merry Murdoc?\n           Strider ........ We should spread our standard again!\n\nSorry to all people I forgot but as you know my brain isn''t so well! hehe\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',16799,5,0,NULL,NULL,'5d_jc072','scan',1780048365);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('5d_jc074','5D-JC074.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/5D-JC074.LHA','5D-JoinConf','XIM','5D-JoinConf',NULL,'SvEN','5D','\___  \  \/  / \   /  \__  ___\__  \  \/aw/ 5|  \  \/¯  /_  \ / /\ |_  \_   |  |\/¯  / t|  /  /   / \  ¯/     | \__ \  |  |/   /',replace('_________  ___________________________  ___\n\___  \  \/  / \   /  \__  ___\__  \  \/aw/\n5|  \  \/¯  /_  \ / /\ |_  \_   |  |\/¯  / \nt|  /  /   / \  ¯/     | \__ \  |  |/   /  \nH|____/___/___\_/___/\_|______\_|__|___/__ \n-iF U tHINK 5D iS lAME - fUCK yOURSEF-(°ª°)\n·:·:·:·:·:·:·:·:·:presents·:·:·:·:·:·:·:·:·\n              5D-JoinConf v0.74\n        Coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D\n','\n',char(10)),'5D-JoinConf.Guide',replace('@database 5D-JoinConf Documentation\n@Author SvEN tHE CREAToR Of 5tH DyNASTY\n@Index Documentation\n\nCopyright © 1994 SvEN tHE CREAToR / 5tH DyNASTY\n\n@Remark $VER: 5D-JoinConf v0.74 by sTc/5D\n@Remark AmigaGuide database\n\n@node MAIN "5D-JoinConf Documentation © 1994 SvEN tHE CREAToR Of 5tH DyNASTY"\n                                                              :\n                                                       :      ¦             \n                   ________________  __________________¦      |\n            _______\_______       /  \             /   |      |______\n           |  __   _/     /______/____\  _     _  /    ¦      |  __  |\n           |  \/  _\________    \_\  / \/       \/     _      |  \/  |\n           |______\        /     / \/   |       |      /      |______|\n                   \___________ /       |_______|_____/       |Rpd!\n                              \/                     /________|\n                         :           :                                     :\n            ____   :     ¦     :     ¦      · 5 · T · H ·            :     ¦\n  __________\  /___¦    _|__/\ ¦     |_______ _______________________¦     |\n  \______   \\//   |    \____ \|     |   _   \\_____      /       /  |     |\n   /     \   \/    ¦     |   \ \     |   /    \/   /_____/    _  /   ¦     |\n _/       \   \_____     |    \ \_   |   _     \_____   \_     \/_____     |\n \       _/    /   /     |     \     |   /      /   /    /     |     /     |\n  \__________ /__________|     |\ ___|__/_____ /_______ /______|___________|\n            \/           |     ¦ \/          \/       \/\n                         ¦     :     · D · Y · N · A · S · T · Y ·\n                         :\n\n                        ##>>> P r E S E N T S <<<##\n\n                             5D-JoinConf v0.74\n\n                 Coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR of 5th Dynasty\n\n                           @{" Normal Documentation " Link Documentation}\n@endnode\n@node Documentation "5D-JoinConf Documentation"\n              _______________________________________________\n             |                                               |\n             | //                                            |\n             | /                                             |\n             |                                               |\n             |            @{" D e S C R I P T I O N " Link Description}           |\n             |                                               |\n             |           @{" I n S T A L L A T I O N " Link Installation}          |\n             |                                               |\n             |                @{" S p E C I A L " Link Special}          |\n             |                                               |\n             |              @{" G r E E T I N G S " Link Greetings}             |\n             |                                               |\n             |                                             / |\n             |                                            // |\n             |_______________________________________________|\n\n@endnode\n@node Description "5D-JoinConf Description"\n5D-JoinConf has been coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D!\n\nIt is a replacement for the normal ''J''-Command of AmiExpress v3.x+.\nYou can also use cursor keys!\n@endnode\n@node Installation "5D-JoinConf Installation"\nCopy all files which are in the archive bbs directory\nto your bbs directory.\n\nContents of archive:\n===================\n\nBBS/\n    Commands/\n        BBSCmd/\n            J.info\n    Doors/\n        5D-JoinConf/\n            5D-JoinConf\n            5D-JoinConf.info\n            5D-JoinConf.Guide\n\n===================\n\n@endnode\n@node Greetings "5D-JoinConf Greetings"\nGreetings go to:\n\n           Rainman ........................... Nice to have you!\n           Celator ........... Thank you for helping me with /X!\n           ByteAndi ............ For helping me to learn coding!\n           Prophet .................... For being a nice friend!\n           Snow ...................... Sing mehr lieder, leader!\n           Airworx ................. Continue work as Co Leader!\n\nSorry to all people I forgot but as you know my brain isn''t so well! hehe\n\n@endnode\n@node Special "5D-JoinConf Special things"\nIf you want to show an ansi above the normal JoinConf-Screen then simply\nsave it under ''Doors:5D-JoinConf/5D-JoinConf.txt''. If you want to use\nthe mode where the conferences are shown one under another then simply\nadd the tooltype ''OLD_MODE'' to your ''CONFCONFIG.info''. Sure, the password\noption is back again and for using it you only need to add the tooltype\n''PASSWORD.<CONF_NUMBER>=<PASSWORD'', for example: ''PASSWORD.2=DOSE'' to the\nicon talken about above. I hope that it is like you want it to be but if\nthere are any things which should be changed then call me at my board.\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',16293,2,0,NULL,NULL,'5d_jc074','scan',1780048358);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('5d_jc16','5D-JC16.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/5D-JC16.LHA','5D-JoinConf','XIM','5D-JoinConf',NULL,'SvEN','5D','\___  \  \/  / \   /  \__  ___\__  \  \/aw/ 5|  \  \/¯  /_  \ / /\ |_  \_   |  |\/¯  / t|  /  /   / \  ¯/     | \__ \  |  |/   /',replace('_________  ___________________________  ___ \n\___  \  \/  / \   /  \__  ___\__  \  \/aw/ \n5|  \  \/¯  /_  \ / /\ |_  \_   |  |\/¯  /  \nt|  /  /   / \  ¯/     | \__ \  |  |/   /   \nH|____/___/___\_/___/\_|______\_|__|___/__  \n-iF U tHINK 5D iS lAME - fUCK yOURSEF-(°ª°) \n·:·:·:·:·:·:·:·:·:presents·:·:·:·:·:·:·:·:· \n              5D-JoinConf v0.16             \n        Coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D  \n','\n',char(10)),'5D-JoinConf.guide',replace('@database 5D-JoinConfDoc\n@Author SvEN tHE CREAToR ·OF· 5TH DYNASTY\n@Index MAIN\n\nCopyright (c) 1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR / 5th Dynasty\n\n@Remark $VER: (October 30 1993, 19:00:00)\n@Remark AmigaGuide database for the 5D-JoinConf Documentation\n\n@node MAIN "5D-JoinConf Documentation (c)1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR of 5th Dynasty (October 30 1993, 19:00:00)"\n          ______    ______    ______    ______    ______    ______\n          \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/\n 5th ______\  /_ ____\  /______\  /______\  /______\  /______\  /_ ____\n    //     \\// |   \\\//     \\\//     \\\//     \\\//     \\\// |   \\\n   //       \/  |    \\/       \\/  |    \\/     ---\/       \\/  |    \\\n  /·         \___     ·\     |  ·\        ·\____    \\__      ·\___     ·\\n /·         | \        ·\    |   ·\ |      ·\        ·\ |      ·\        ·\\n \___________ /________ /____|___ /_|______ /________ / |______ /________ /\n            \/        \/        \/        \/        \/        \/    ·cj·\/\n\n                              >>> 5D-JoinConf <<<\n\n                         Code: SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n\n         >>> C·O·N·T·E·N·T·S  O·F  D·O·C·U·M·E·N·T·A·T·I·O·N <<<\n\n\n                         @{"      Introduction      " Link Cap01}\n                         @{"      Requirements      " Link Cap02}\n                         @{"      Installation      " Link Cap03}\n                         @{"       Greetings!       " Link Cap05}\n                         @{"   How to Contact me?   " Link Cap06}\n\n\n         ---------------------------------------------------------\n              Complete Docs for 5D-JoinConf V0.16 [-5th Dynasty-]\n         ---------------------------------------------------------\n         The Documentation has been written by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D.\n\n@endnode\n@node Cap01 "Introduction"\n  =======================================================================\n  5D-JoinConf is a replace for the normal JoinConf-Command: ''J''.\n  It has features like AUTOMATIC INTERN LEVEL CHECK and\n  AUTOMATIC RELATIVE CONFERENCES CHECK and PASSWORD PROTECTION.\n\n  To protect a Conference you need to write something like\n  the following in your ''BBS:ConfConfig.info'':\n\n  PASSWORD.<CONF_NUMBER>=<PASSWORD>\n\n  EXAMPLE:\n  PASSWORD.2=YOHO\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap02 "Requirements"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-JoinConf you must have the following things:\n\n    Programm     Location           Description\n    ----------   --------           -----------\n    5D-JoinConf  Doors:5D-JoinConf  Main program\n\n  - an  Amiga Model (500/600/1000/1200/2000/2500/3000/4000/CDTV/CD³²)\n  - the installed Version of OS\2, OS\3 or higher\n    (Soft- or Hardware Version)\n  - the installed .INFO Files in the directories.\n  - AmiExpress v3.xx or higher.\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap03 "How to install 5D-JoinConf"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-JoinConf you must have all Requirement which were\n  mentioned below. You need the following things.\n\n  --------------------------\n    Doors:5D-JoinConf (dir)\n      ^^^ 5D-JoinConf\n    BBS:Commands/BBSCmd (dir)\n      ^^^ J.info\n      ^^^ >.info\n      ^^^ <.info\n  --------------------------\n\n  Decruch the 5D-JoinConf Archive. Go to your ''Doors:'' Directory\n  and make a Directory called ''5D-JoinConf/''. Copy ''5D-JoinConf''\n  into the Directory. Go to your ''BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/'' Directory.\n  Copy ''J.info'',''>.info'',''<.info'' into it.\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap05 "Greetings go to..."\n  =======================================================================\n\n                        GREETS GO TO:\n\n    Mr.Return/AG ............................ Good friend!\n    ByteAndi/MST ......................... For helping me!\n    Strider/PGS .................... Hope we''ll chat soon!\n    DeSeRt ................................... Co0L aNSiS!\n\n              >>> ALL MEMBERS OF 5TH DYNASTY!!! <<<\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap06 "How to contact me..."\n  =======================================================================\n    ___________________________   ___________   ___________________________\n   /\_______________________ _ \¡/           \¡/  _ ______________________/\\n   \/                            ·5TH DYNASTY·                            \/\n    ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\_______________/¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n    CELTIC CROSS ............... Thunder ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... WHQ\n    POWER BOX II NODE 0 ....... Wolfgang ...... +49-(0)30-3242112 ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX II NODE 1 ....... Wolfgang ...... +49-(0)30-3242160 ..... GHQ\n    MIAMI HEAT ........ Sven The Creator ...... +49-(0)30-7424141 ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX III ........ Frank Maxwell ...... +49-(0)30-4167884 ..... GHQ\n    5TH DYNASTY CLUB .............. Snow ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... GHQ\n\n                 ___ ___    ___    _______    ___ ___    ___\n                /  ¬|  ¬\  /  ¬\  /      ¬\  /  ¬|  ¬\  /  ¬\\n               /         \/     \/         \/         \/     \\n              /           \      \          \          \      \\n            _/             \_     \_  |      \_         \_     \_\n            \      \ /      /      /          / \ /      /      /\n             \      |      /      /   |      /   |      /      /\n              \_____|____ /_____ /____|____ /____|____ /_____ /\n          /\            \/     \/         \/         \/     \/\n_________/  \  /\___________> 5TH DYNASTY GHQ <____________________ ___ __ _\n             \/    ___ ___    _______    _______    _______\n                  /  ¬|  ¬\  /      ¬\  /      ¬\  /      ¬\\n                 /    |    \/         \/         \/         \\n                /           \    |     \          \          \\n              _/             \_     ___/\_  |      \_____     \_\n              \               /    /     /          / |        /\n               \      |      /          /   |      /  |       /\n                \_____|____ /_________ /____|____ /   |_____ /·cj·\n                          \/         \/         \/         \/\n \n                         SYSOP: SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D\n                         COSYS: Airworx/5D\n                                Mr.Return/AG\n \n                   -<>- CaLL: +49-(0)30-742-4141 -<>-\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',18143,5,0,NULL,NULL,'5d_jc16','scan',1780048358);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('5d_lc022','5D-LC022.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/5D-LC022.LHA','5D-LastCallers','XIM','5D-LastCallers',NULL,'sTc/5D','5D','\_    \   \/   /|  |/   \ /   \__ \   \/   / |  |  \  /   /_|  |  |  | \___||  \  /   / |  |  |\/  _/  \  |  |  |     ||  |\/  _/',replace('5th_______  ____ __  ___   ___________  ____\n\_    \   \/   /|  |/   \ /   \__ \   \/   /\n |  |  \  /   /_|  |  |  | \___||  \  /   /\n |  |  |\/  _/  \  |  |  |     ||  |\/  _/\n |  |  | |  |    \_|     | __  ||  | |  |\n |  |  | |  |_sNoW |     |  /  ||  | |  |\n |  |  | |  | \    |  |  | /   ||  | |  |\n |  |  | |  |  \   |  |  |     ||  | |  |\n |_____| |__|__|\__|__|__|____/ |__| |__|\n (=   5D-LaSTCaLLERS V0.22 bY sTc/5D   =)\n (=  NoBODY KnOWS BuT EvERYBODY NeEDS  =)\n','\n',char(10)),'5D-LastCallers.guide',replace('@database 5D-LastCallersDoc\n@Author SvEN tHE CREAToR ·OF· 5TH DYNASTY\n@Index MAIN\n\nCopyright (c) 1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR / 5th Dynasty\n\n@Remark $VER: (December 3 1993, 22:30:00)\n@Remark AmigaGuide database for the 5D-LastCallers Documentation\n\n@node MAIN "5D-LastCallers Documentation (c)1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR of 5th Dynasty (December 3 1993, 22:30:00)"\n\n                                                              :\n                                                       :      ¦             \n                   ________________  __________________¦      |\n            _______\_______       /  \             /   |      |______\n           |  __   _/     /______/____\  _     _  /    ¦      |  __  |\n           |  \/  _\________    \_\  / \/       \/     _      |  \/  |\n           |______\        /     / \/   |       |      /      |______|\n                   \___________ /       |_______|_____/       |Rpd!\n                              \/                     /________|\n                         :           :                                     :\n            ____   :     ¦     :     ¦      · 5 · T · H ·            :     ¦\n  __________\  /___¦    _|__/\ ¦     |_______ _______________________¦     |\n  \______   \\//   |    \____ \|     |   _   \\_____      /       /  |     |\n   /     \   \/    ¦     |   \ \     |   /    \/   /_____/    _  /   ¦     |\n _/       \   \_____     |    \ \_   |   _     \_____   \_     \/_____     |\n \       _/    /   /     |     \     |   /      /   /    /     |     /     |\n  \__________ /__________|     |\ ___|__/_____ /_______ /______|___________|\n            \/           |     ¦ \/          \/       \/\n                         ¦     :     · D · Y · N · A · S · T · Y ·\n                         :\n\n                            >>> 5D-LastCallers <<<\n\n                          Code: SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n\n         >>> C·O·N·T·E·N·T·S  O·F  D·O·C·U·M·E·N·T·A·T·I·O·N <<<\n\n                         @{"      Introduction      " Link Cap01}\n                         @{"      Requirements      " Link Cap02}\n                         @{"      Installation      " Link Cap03}\n                         @{"       Greetings!       " Link Cap05}\n                         @{"   How to Contact me?   " Link Cap06}\n\n         ----------------------------------------------------------\n           Complete Docs for 5D-LastCallers V0.22 [-5th Dynasty-]\n         ----------------------------------------------------------\n         The Documentation has been written by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D.\n\n@endnode\n@node Cap02 "Requirements"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-LastCallers you must have the following things:\n\n    Programm        Location                  Description\n    ----------      --------                  -----------\n    5D-LastCallers  BBS:Utils/5D-LastCallers  Main program\n\n  - an  Amiga Model (500/600/1000/1200/2000/2500/3000/4000/CDTV/CD³²)\n  - the installed Version of OS\2, OS\3 or higher\n    (Soft- or Hardware Version)\n  - the installed .INFO Files in the directories.\n  - AmiExpress v3.xx or higher.\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap03 "How to install 5D-LastCallers"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-LastCallers you must have all Requirement which were\n  mentioned below. You need the following things.\n\n  --------------------------\n    BBS:Utils/ (dir)\n      ^^^ 5D-LastCallers\n  --------------------------\n\n  Decruch the 5D-LastCallers Archive. Go to your ''BBS:Utils/'' Directory.\n  Copy ''5D-LastCallers'' into the Directory. Go to your LogOff-Batch(s) and\n  insert the following:\n\n  Usage  : 5D-LastCallers <NODE NUMBER> <OUTPUT FILE> <USERS> <MODE> {UP_DESC} {DOWN_DESC}\n\n  *** EXAMPLE OF LOGOFF BATCH FOR NODE 1 ***\n\n  ###CUT###\n  BBS:Utils/5D-LastCallers/5D-LastCallers 1 Bulletins:Bull1.TXT 14 1 NO_FILE S:LC.TXT\n  ###CUT###\n\n  <> = HAS TO BE USED\n  {} = CAN BE USED\n\n  If you possibly want to have a .txt under the bull but not before you can use NO_FILE\n  for the <UP/DOWN_DESC> or if ya onyl want the output file to be maken you simply\n  write ONLY_OUTPUT instead of da node number! <MODE> can be between 0 and 2!!!\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap05 "Greetings go to..."\n  =======================================================================\n\n                        GREETS GO TO:\n\n    ByteAndi/MST ......................... For helping me!\n    Strider/PGS .................... Hope we''ll chat soon!\n    Mr.Return/AG ............................ Good friend!\n    Bytemaster ....................... For programming /X!\n    Celator/AFL ..................... For helping me more!\n\n              >>> ALL MEMBERS OF 5TH DYNASTY!!! <<<\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap06 "How to contact me..."\n  =======================================================================\n    ___________________________   ___________   ___________________________\n   /\_______________________ _ \¡/           \¡/  _ ______________________/\\n   \/                            ·5TH DYNASTY·                            \/\n    ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\_______________/¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n    CELTIC CROSS ............... Thunder ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... WHQ\n    DA UNKNOWN .................. Sharon ...... +31-(0)********** ..... EHQ\n    MIAMI HEAT ........ Sven The Creator ...... +49-(0)30-7424141 ..... GHQ\n    HOUSE OF BRAIN ............. Delta-X ...... +49-(0)3328472023 ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX II NODE 0 ....... Wolfgang ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX II NODE 1 ....... Wolfgang ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX III ........ Frank Maxwell ...... +49-(0)30-4167884 ..... GHQ\n    5TH DYNASTY CLUB .............. Snow ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... GHQ\n    HEAVENS GATE ................ Murdoc ...... +49-(0)30-6596730 ..... GDS\n\n                 ___ ___    ___    _______    ___ ___    ___\n                /  ¬|  ¬\  /  ¬\  /      ¬\  /  ¬|  ¬\  /  ¬\\n               /         \/     \/         \/         \/     \\n              /           \      \          \          \      \\n            _/             \_     \_  |      \_         \_     \_\n            \      \ /      /      /          / \ /      /      /\n             \      |      /      /   |      /   |      /      /\n              \_____|____ /_____ /____|____ /____|____ /_____ /\n          /\            \/     \/         \/         \/     \/\n_________/  \  /\___________> 5TH DYNASTY GHQ <____________________ ___ __ _\n             \/    ___ ___    _______    _______    _______\n                  /  ¬|  ¬\  /      ¬\  /      ¬\  /      ¬\\n                 /    |    \/         \/         \/         \\n                /           \    |     \          \          \\n              _/     