INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('5d_vb002','5D-VB002.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/5D-VB002.LHA','5D-ViewBulls','XIM','5D-ViewBulls','0.02','STC/5D','5D',NULL,replace('5D-VIEWBULLS V0.02 CODED BY STC/5D\n','\n',char(10)),'5D-ViewBulls.guide',replace('@database 5D-ViewBullsDoc\n\nCopyright (c) 1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR / 5th Dynasty\n\n@Remark $VER: (October 17 1993, 00:00:00)\n@Remark AmigaGuide database for the 5D-ViewBulls Documentation\n\n@node MAIN "5D-ViewBulls Documentation (c)1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR of 5th Dynasty (October 17 1993, 00:00:00)"\n          ______    ______    ______    ______    ______    ______\n          \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/\n 5th ______\  /_ ____\  /______\  /______\  /______\  /______\  /_ ____\n    //     \\// |   \\\//     \\\//     \\\//     \\\//     \\\// |   \\\n   //       \/  |    \\/       \\/  |    \\/     ---\/       \\/  |    \\\n  /·         \___     ·\     |  ·\        ·\____    \\__      ·\___     ·\\n /·         | \        ·\    |   ·\ |      ·\        ·\ |      ·\        ·\\n \___________ /________ /____|___ /_|______ /________ / |______ /________ /\n            \/        \/        \/        \/        \/        \/    ·cj·\/\n\n                              >>> 5D-ViewBulls <<<\n\n                           Code: SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D\n\n                  __                                        __\n                  \ \                                      / /\n    >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>)    HAPPY BIRTHDAY AIRWORX/5D!!!    (<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<\n                  /_/                                      \_\\n\n                    THIS WISH YA ALL MEMBERS OF 5TH DYNASTY!\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n\n         >>> C·O·N·T·E·N·T·S  O·F  D·O·C·U·M·E·N·T·A·T·I·O·N <<<\n\n\n         REMEMBER: THIS IS ONE OF THE FIRST TOOLS WHICH CHECK FOR THE\n                   NORMAL USER ACCESS. THIS MEANS THAT A USER WITH LEVEL 200\n                   CANNOT USE THE BULLETINS IF IT IS REMOVED IN ACS.200.info!\n\n                         @{"      Introduction      " Link Cap01}\n                         @{"      Requirements      " Link Cap02}\n                         @{"      Installation      " Link Cap03}\n                         @{"       Greetings!       " Link Cap05}\n                         @{"   How to Contact me?   " Link Cap06}\n\n         ---------------------------------------------------------\n              Complete Docs for 5D-ViewBulls V0.02 [-5th Dynasty-]\n         ---------------------------------------------------------\n         The Documentation has been written by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D.\n\n@endnode\n@node Cap01 "Introduction"\n  =======================================================================\n  5D-ViewBulls is a replacement for the normal ViewBulls Command\n  of AmiExpress ''B'' but it supports ONLINE UPDATING! It tries to show\n  the Bulls out of ("Bulletins:") which ya need to assign to a general\n  Bulletin area! For online updating you simply need to write your\n  things normally listed in the logoff-batch in a File called:\n  "Bulletins:Bull<NUMBER>.Script"!\n  For example there can stand:\n  "5D-Top BLUBBEL BLA BLIBBER Bulletins:Bull2.TXT" in "Bulleting:Bull2.Script"\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap02 "Requirements"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-ViewBulls you must have the following things:\n\n    Programm     Location           Description\n    ----------   --------           -----------\n    5D-ViewBulls Doors:5D-ViewBulls Main program\n\n  - an  Amiga Model (500/600/1000/1200/2000/2500/3000/4000/CDTV/CD³²)\n  - the installed Version of OS\2, OS\3 or higher\n    (Soft- or Hardware Version)\n  - the installed .INFO Files in the directories.\n  - AmiExpress V2.xx , v3.xx or higher.\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap03 "How to install 5D-ViewBulls"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-ViewBulls you must have all Requirement which were\n  mentioned below. You need the following things.\n\n  --------------------------\n    Doors:5D-ViewBulls (dir)\n      ^^^ 5D-ViewBulls\n    BBS:Commands/BBSCmd (dir)\n      ^^^ B.info\n  --------------------------\n\n  Decruch the 5D-ViewBulls Archive. Go to your ''Doors:'' Directory\n  and make a Directory called ''5D-ViewBulls''. Copy ''5D-ViewBulls''\n  into the Directory. Go to your ''BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/'' Directory.\n  Copy ''B.info'' into it.\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap05 "Greetings go to..."\n  =======================================================================\n\n           ···­­­> ALL MEMBERS OF 5TH DYNASTY <­­­···\n\n      +-----------------------------------------------------+\n      : And all cool people who I know and all who know me! :\n      `-----------------------------------------------------''\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap06 "How to contact me..."\n  =======================================================================\n    ___________________________   ___________   ___________________________\n   /\_______________________ _ \¡/           \¡/  _ ______________________/\\n   \/                            ·5TH DYNASTY·                            \/\n    ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\_______________/¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n    CELTIC CROSS ............... Thunder ...... +49-OFFLINE ........... WHQ\n    REDSKINS .................. Vanguard ...... +49-OFFLINE ........... EHQ\n    POWER BOX II NODE 0 ....... Wolfgang ...... +49-(0)30-3242112 ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX II NODE 1 ....... Wolfgang ...... +49-(0)30-3242160 ..... GHQ\n    MIAMI HEAT ........ Sven The Creator ...... +49-(0)30-7424141 ..... GHQ\n    DISASTER ZONE ........... Mr.Deicide ...... +49-(0)30-6614471 ..... DIS\n    POWER BOX III ........ Frank Maxwell ...... +49-(0)30-4167884 ..... DIS\n\n                 ___ ___    ___    _______    ___ ___    ___\n                /  ¬|  ¬\  /  ¬\  /      ¬\  /  ¬|  ¬\  /  ¬\\n               /         \/     \/         \/         \/     \\n              /           \      \          \          \      \\n            _/             \_     \_  |      \_         \_     \_\n            \      \ /      /      /          / \ /      /      /\n             \      |      /      /   |      /   |      /      /\n              \_____|____ /_____ /____|____ /____|____ /_____ /\n          /\            \/     \/         \/         \/     \/\n_________/  \  /\___________> 5TH DYNASTY GHQ <____________________ ___ __ _\n             \/    ___ ___    _______    _______    _______\n                  /  ¬|  ¬\  /      ¬\  /      ¬\  /      ¬\\n                 /    |    \/         \/         \/         \\n                /           \    |     \          \          \\n              _/             \_     ___/\_  |      \_____     \_\n              \               /    /     /          / |        /\n               \      |      /          /   |      /  |       /\n                \_____|____ /_________ /____|____ /   |_____ /·cj·\n                          \/         \/         \/         \/\n \n                        aMiGa aNd PC 0-1 dAy wArEz\n \n                         SYSOP: SvEN tHE CREAToR\n                         COSYS: Mr.Return\n                                Cee Jay\n \n                   -<>- CaLL: +49-(0)30-742-4141 -<>-\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',19794,2,0,NULL,NULL,'5d_vb002','scan',1780048358);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('5d_wa125','5D-WA125.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/5D-WA125.LHA','5D-Wall','XIM','5D-Wall',NULL,NULL,'5D','______\     /__|      /___________\___  /___ \_____ \  _/   /     /__\   ____/  _ /_/   / _/  _/  \___  /\    /__/ \____ \_  \/___  /|',replace('      _______   _______           _______   \n______\     /__|      /___________\___  /___\n\_____ \  _/   /     /__\   ____/  _ /_/   /\n_/  _/  \___  /\    /__/ \____ \_  \/___  /|\n\ 5.\    / / /\ \_ / \    / _/  /  |   / / |\n|\______/___/_|\  /___\  /_____/___|____/Rpd\n`---------------\/-----\/-----presents-----''\n    5D-WALL with new CURSOR-CONTROL\n','\n',char(10)),'5D-Wall.guide',replace('@database 5D-WallDoc\n@Author SvEN tHE CREAToR ·OF· 5TH DYNASTY\n@Index MAIN\n\nCopyright (c) 1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR / 5th Dynasty\n\n@Remark $VER: (November 6 1993, 18:00:00)\n@Remark AmigaGuide database for the 5D-Wall Documentation\n\n@node MAIN "5D-Wall Documentation (c)1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR of 5th Dynasty (November 6 1993, 18:00:00)"\n          ______    ______    ______    ______    ______    ______\n          \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/\n 5th ______\  /_ ____\  /______\  /______\  /______\  /______\  /_ ____\n    //     \\// |   \\\//     \\\//     \\\//     \\\//     \\\// |   \\\n   //       \/  |    \\/       \\/  |    \\/     ---\/       \\/  |    \\\n  /·         \___     ·\     |  ·\        ·\____    \\__      ·\___     ·\\n /·         | \        ·\    |   ·\ |      ·\        ·\ |      ·\        ·\\n \___________ /________ /____|___ /_|______ /________ / |______ /________ /\n            \/        \/        \/        \/        \/        \/    ·cj·\/\n\n                              >>> 5D-Wall <<<\n\n                         Code: SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n\n         >>> C·O·N·T·E·N·T·S  O·F  D·O·C·U·M·E·N·T·A·T·I·O·N <<<\n\n\n             REMEMBER: THIS IS THE FIRST WALL DOOR WHICH USES\n                       THE CURSOR KEYS!\n\n             IN THE VERSION BEFORE YOU COULDN''T USE THE CURSOR\n             KEYS IF YA PRESSED M AND THE SIMPLY RETURN WITHOUT\n             WRITING A MESSAGE. THAT HAS BEEN FIXED AND IT HAS\n             BEEN OPTIMIEZED!\n\n\n                         @{"      Introduction      " Link Cap01}\n                         @{"      Requirements      " Link Cap02}\n                         @{"      Installation      " Link Cap03}\n                         @{"       Greetings!       " Link Cap05}\n                         @{"   How to Contact me?   " Link Cap06}\n\n\n         ---------------------------------------------------------\n              Complete Docs for 5D-Wall V1.10 [-5th Dynasty-]\n         ---------------------------------------------------------\n         The Documentation has been written by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D.\n\n@endnode\n@node Cap01 "Introduction"\n  =======================================================================\n  5D-Wall is a door which allows the users to write something on it\n  and to write messages to the wall writer. I programmed this to have\n  more messages of the users for themselve because they will often reply\n  the wall entry (I hope so..hehe). It is the first door which has this\n  feature and the first which supports the CURSOR KEYS!\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap02 "Requirements"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-Wall you must have the following things:\n\n    Programm     Location           Description\n    ----------   --------           -----------\n    5D-Wall      Doors:5D-Wall      Main program\n\n  - an  Amiga Model (500/600/1000/1200/2000/2500/3000/4000/CDTV/CD³²)\n  - the installed Version of OS\2, OS\3 or higher\n    (Soft- or Hardware Version)\n  - the installed .INFO Files in the directories.\n  - AmiExpress v3.xx or higher.\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap03 "How to install 5D-Wall"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-Wall you must have all Requirement which were\n  mentioned below. You need the following things.\n\n  --------------------------\n    Doors:5D-Wall (dir)\n      ^^^ 5D-Wall\n    BBS:Commands/BBSCmd (dir)\n      ^^^ WALL.info\n  --------------------------\n\n  Decruch the 5D-Wall Archive. Go to your ''Doors:'' Directory\n  and make a Directory called ''5D-Wall/''. Copy ''5D-Wall''\n  into the Directory. Go to your ''BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/'' Directory.\n  Copy ''WALL.info'' into it.\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap05 "Greetings go to..."\n  =======================================================================\n\n                        GREETS GO TO:\n\n    ByteAndi/MST ......................... For helping me!\n    Strider/PGS .................... Hope we''ll chat soon!\n    Mr.Return/AG ............................ Good friend!\n    Crayor/SCX .............................. See ya soon!\n\n              >>> ALL MEMBERS OF 5TH DYNASTY!!! <<<\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap06 "How to contact me..."\n  =======================================================================\n    ___________________________   ___________   ___________________________\n   /\_______________________ _ \¡/           \¡/  _ ______________________/\\n   \/                            ·5TH DYNASTY·                            \/\n    ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\_______________/¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n    CELTIC CROSS ............... Thunder ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... WHQ\n    MIAMI HEAT ........ Sven The Creator ...... +49-(0)30-7424141 ..... GHQ\n    HOUSE OF BRAIN ............. Delta-X ...... +49-(0)3328472023 ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX II NODE 0 ....... Wolfgang ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX II NODE 1 ....... Wolfgang ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... GHQ\n    POWER BOX III ........ Frank Maxwell ...... +49-(0)30-4167884 ..... GHQ\n    5TH DYNASTY CLUB .............. Snow ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... GHQ\n\n                 ___ ___    ___    _______    ___ ___    ___\n                /  ¬|  ¬\  /  ¬\  /      ¬\  /  ¬|  ¬\  /  ¬\\n               /         \/     \/         \/         \/     \\n              /           \      \          \          \      \\n            _/             \_     \_  |      \_         \_     \_\n            \      \ /      /      /          / \ /      /      /\n             \      |      /      /   |      /   |      /      /\n              \_____|____ /_____ /____|____ /____|____ /_____ /\n          /\            \/     \/         \/         \/     \/\n_________/  \  /\___________> 5TH DYNASTY GHQ <____________________ ___ __ _\n             \/    ___ ___    _______    _______    _______\n                  /  ¬|  ¬\  /      ¬\  /      ¬\  /      ¬\\n                 /    |    \/         \/         \/         \\n                /           \    |     \          \          \\n              _/             \_     ___/\_  |      \_____     \_\n              \               /    /     /          / |        /\n               \      |      /          /   |      /  |       /\n                \_____|____ /_________ /____|____ /   |_____ /·cj·\n                          \/         \/         \/         \/\n \n                         SYSOP: SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D\n                         COSYS: Airworx/5D\n                                Mr.Return/AG\n \n                   -<>- CaLL: +49-(0)30-742-4141 -<>-\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',16087,1,0,NULL,NULL,'5d_wa125','scan',1780048358);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('5d_wal11','5D-WAL11.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/5D-WAL11.LHA','5D-Wall','XIM','5D-Wall',NULL,NULL,'5D','5 \____\   / \     \____\   __/     /  /   \ t/   / \__   \  t  \  / \___ \   \/___    / h/   /   \     \ |   \    \ /  \   \      /',replace('  ____________________/\___________________\n5 \____\   / \     \____\   __/     /  /   \\n t/   / \__   \  t  \  / \___ \   \/___    /\nh/   /   \     \ |   \    \ /  \   \      /\n/________/     /_|    \/   \____\___\    /\n[===/_________/==|____/_____\rpd!/______/==]\n       5D-Wall V1.10 [-5th Dynasty-]\nDoor which allows the users to write msg''s\nfor all users to see when logging on\n','\n',char(10)),'5D-Wall.guide',replace('@database 5D-WallDoc\n@Author SvEN tHE CREAToR ·OF· 5TH DYNASTY\n@Index MAIN\n\nCopyright (c) 1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR / 5th Dynasty\n\n@Remark $VER: (November 6 1993, 18:00:00)\n@Remark AmigaGuide database for the 5D-Wall Documentation\n\n@node MAIN "5D-Wall Documentation (c)1993 SvEN tHE CREAToR of 5th Dynasty (November 6 1993, 18:00:00)"\n          ______    ______    ______    ______    ______    ______\n          \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/    \   ¬/\n 5th ______\  /_ ____\  /______\  /______\  /______\  /______\  /_ ____\n    //     \\// |   \\\//     \\\//     \\\//     \\\//     \\\// |   \\\n   //       \/  |    \\/       \\/  |    \\/     ---\/       \\/  |    \\\n  /·         \___     ·\     |  ·\        ·\____    \\__      ·\___     ·\\n /·         | \        ·\    |   ·\ |      ·\        ·\ |      ·\        ·\\n \___________ /________ /____|___ /_|______ /________ / |______ /________ /\n            \/        \/        \/        \/        \/        \/    ·cj·\/\n\n                              >>> 5D-Wall <<<\n\n                         Code: SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n\n         >>> C·O·N·T·E·N·T·S  O·F  D·O·C·U·M·E·N·T·A·T·I·O·N <<<\n\n\n             REMEMBER: THIS IS THE FIRST WALL DOOR WHICH USES\n                       THE CURSOR KEYS!\n\n             IN THE VERSION BEFORE YOU COULDN''T USE THE CURSOR\n             KEYS IF YA PRESSED M AND THE SIMPLY RETURN WITHOUT\n             WRITING A MESSAGE. THAT HAS BEEN FIXED AND IT HAS\n             BEEN OPTIMIEZED!\n\n\n                         @{"      Introduction      " Link Cap01}\n                         @{"      Requirements      " Link Cap02}\n                         @{"      Installation      " Link Cap03}\n                         @{"       Greetings!       " Link Cap05}\n                         @{"   How to Contact me?   " Link Cap06}\n\n\n         ---------------------------------------------------------\n              Complete Docs for 5D-Wall V1.10 [-5th Dynasty-]\n         ---------------------------------------------------------\n         The Documentation has been written by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D.\n\n@endnode\n@node Cap01 "Introduction"\n  =======================================================================\n  5D-Wall is a door which allows the users to write something on it\n  and to write messages to the wall writer. I programmed this to have\n  more messages of the users for themselve because they will often reply\n  the wall entry (I hope so..hehe). It is the first door which has this\n  feature and the first which supports the CURSOR KEYS!\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap02 "Requirements"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-Wall you must have the following things:\n\n    Programm     Location           Description\n    ----------   --------           -----------\n    5D-Wall      Doors:5D-Wall      Main program\n\n  - an  Amiga Model (500/600/1000/1200/2000/2500/3000/4000/CDTV/CD³²)\n  - the installed Version of OS\2, OS\3 or higher\n    (Soft- or Hardware Version)\n  - the installed .INFO Files in the directories.\n  - AmiExpress v3.xx or higher.\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap03 "How to install 5D-Wall"\n  =======================================================================\n  To install 5D-Wall you must have all Requirement which were\n  mentioned below. You need the following things.\n\n  --------------------------\n    Doors:5D-Wall (dir)\n      ^^^ 5D-Wall\n    BBS:Commands/BBSCmd (dir)\n      ^^^ WALL.info\n  --------------------------\n\n  Decruch the 5D-Wall Archive. Go to your ''Doors:'' Directory\n  and make a Directory called ''5D-Wall/''. Copy ''5D-Wall''\n  into the Directory. Go to your ''BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/'' Directory.\n  Copy ''WALL.info'' into it.\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap05 "Greetings go to..."\n  =======================================================================\n\n                        GREETS GO TO:\n\n    ByteAndi/MST ......................... For helping me!\n    Strider/PGS .................... Hope we''ll chat soon!\n    Mr.Return/AG ............................ Good friend!\n    Crayor/SCX .............................. See ya soon!\n\n              >>> ALL MEMBERS OF 5TH DYNASTY!!! <<<\n\n  =======================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Cap06 "How to contact me..."\n  =======================================================================\n    ___________________________   ___________   ___________________________\n   /\_______________________ _ \¡/           \¡/  _ ______________________/\\n   \/                            ·5TH DYNASTY·                            \/\n    ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\_______________/¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n    CELTIC CROSS ............... Thunder ...... +49-(0)30-******* ..... WHQ\n    MIAMI HEAT ........ Sven The Creator ...... +49-(0)30-7424141 ..... GHQ\n    HOUSE OF BRAIN ............. Delta-X ...... +49-(0)332847202