rchive bbs directory\nto your bbs directory.\n\nContents of archive:\n===================\n\nBBS/\n    Commands/\n        BBSCmd/\n            WHO.info\n    Doors/\n        5D-Who/\n            5D-Who\n            5D-Who.info\n            5D-Who.Guide\n\n===================\n\n@endnode\n@node Greetings "5D-Who Greetings"\nGreetings go to:\n\n         . Celator ........... Thank you for helping me with /X! .\n         : ByteAndi ............ For helping me to learn coding! :\n         | Snow ...................... Sing mehr lieder, leader! |\n         `------( And all other persons I''ve forgotten!!! )------''\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',12239,1,0,NULL,NULL,'5d_wh300','scan',1780048358);
