ON 1\nDH1:BBS/NODE1/CALLERSLOG    | SOURCE-LOCATION 2\nRAM:CALLERSLOG2             | DEST. -LOCATION 2\n\n\n\nBATCHFILE EXAMPLE, TO USE MY TOOL:\n==================================\n\nRUN AE_CUTV1.EXE\nCOPY RAM:CALLERSLOG1 DH0:BBS/NODE0/CALLERSLOG\nCOPY RAM:CALLERSLOG2 DH1:BBS/NODE1/CALLERSLOG\nDELETE RAM:CALLERSL*\n\n\n\nOK, THATS ALL YOU MUST KNOW AT THE MOMENT...\n\nA RELEASE VERSION WILL BE OUT, SOON AFTER AFEW DAYS BETA-TESTING\nAND AFTER FIXING POSSIBLE BUGS...\n\n\nBTW: YOU CAN USE THIS TOOL (JUST PUBLIC DOMAIN) BUT I CAN''T\n     GUARANTEE FOR NOTHING - THIS IS JUST A *BETA VERSION*!\n\n\nGREETINGS:\n==========\nBLACKSTAR (THANKS, FOR THE NICE IDEE!)\nMAVE \nONYX\nPHANTOM (BERLIN)\nWHITEHEAD\nWIZLER\nYABBAH (USA)\nTO ALL PHREAKER''S AROUND THE WHOLE WORLD, SPECIAL TO ALL GROUP-MEMBERS OF\nPHREAKERS PARADISE (WORLDWIDE) - LET THE THINGS ROLLING....\n\nTO CONTACT ME ONLY, IF YOU FIND ANY BUGS OR IF YOU NEED A NEW TOOL:\n-------------------------------------------------------------------\nWRITE A MESSAGE TO ''HELLFIRE'' (GURU JOSH), IN THE ''DARK CENTURY'' \nOR ''MOVIA'' BBS (BOTH LOCATED IN EUROPE!)\n\nUUCP: [email removed] [192.42.172.1]\n      [email removed]\n\nCUL8ER,\n\nHELLFIRE\n\n\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',23764,5,0,NULL,NULL,'ae_cutv2','scan',1780048385);
