.."\n\n         /\    /\          /\    __        /\    /\\n========/  \==/  \/\======/  \==/  \=======\ \==/  \/\====/\==============\n       /   /\/    \ \  /\/    \/ / /_    /\/\ \/    \ \  /\ \  /\\n      /  \/  \ \   \ \/  \ \   \     \  /  \ \ \ /   \ \/  \ \/  \\n      \   \  /  \  /     /  \  /  \  /  \   \  /  \  /     /     /\n      \\    /\    /\    /\    /\   \//  \\    /\   \/\    /\    //\n       \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //    \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //S\n        \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//      \\//  \\//  \\//  \\// \n=========\/====\/====\/====\/====\/=[v1.4]=\/====\/====\/====\/==M========\n\n      - wRITE lINES wITH hANDLE oR aNONYMOUS!\n      - rEALTIME fOREGROUND cOLOR cHANGE wITH [cTRL-F]\n        - [B] fOR bLACK\n        - [W] fOR wHITE [dEFAULT]\n        - [R] fOR rED\n        - [Y] fOR yELLOW\n        - [D] fOR dARK bLUE\n        - [P] fOR pINK\n        - [C] fOR cYAN\n        - [G] fOR gREEN\n        - aNY oTHER kEY aBORTS!\n      - rEALTIME bACKGROUND cOLOR cHANGE wITH [cTRL-B]\n        - [B] fOR bLACK [dEFAULT]\n        - [W] fOR wHITE\n        - [R] fOR rED\n        - [Y] fOR yELLOW\n        - [D] fOR dARK bLUE\n        - [P] fOR pINK\n        - [C] fOR cYAN\n        - [G] fOR gREEN\n        - aNY oTHER kEY aBORTS!\n      - rEALTIME  sTYLE cHANGE wITH [cTRL-S]\n        - [N] fOR nORMAL sTYLE\n        - [B] fOR bOLD (oNE tIME [cTRL-S] aND [B] tURNS bOLD oN,\n              aGAIN [cTRL-S] aND [B] tURNS bOLD oFF!\n        - [I] fOR iTALIC (oNE tIME [cTRL-S] aND [I] tURNS iTALIC oN,\n              aGAIN [cTRL-S] aND [B] tURNS iTALIC oFF!\n              (iF aNOTHER sTYLE wAS tURNED oN yOU wILL wRITE wITH tWO\n               sTYLES aT oNE tIME (lIKE bOLD&iTALIC!) !)\n        - [U] fOR bOLD (oNE tIME [cTRL-S] aND [U] tURNS uNDERLINE oN,\n              aGAIN [cTRL-S] aND [U] tURNS uNDERLINE oFF!\n        - aNY oTHER kEY aBORTS!\n      - *NEW* tHE nEW fEATURE (nEVER sEEN iN aNY wALLS bEFOR!) iS tO uSE\n        mARKS lIKE [-HANDLE!!!-] ! wHAT`S tHIS ?!\n        pRESS [cTRL-K] aND cHOOSE a fUNCTION ([1]-[9] [T][D][N][H])\n        - [1] fOR tHE hANDLE!              [13]\n        - [2] fOR tHE lOCATION!            [20]\n        - [3] fOR tHE fILES uPPED!         [05]\n        - [4] fOR tHE fILES dOWNED!        [05]\n        - [5] fOR tHE uPPED bYTES!         [10]\n        - [6] fOR tHE dOWNED bYTES!        [10]\n        - [7] fOR tHE dOWNED bYTES tODAY!  [10]\n        - [8] fOR tHE wRITTEN mESSAGES!    [05]\n        - [9] fOR tHE cALLS!               [05]\n        - [T] fOR tHE tIME!                [08]\n        - [D] fOR tHE dATE!                [09]\n        - [N] fOR tHE nODE nUMBER!         [02]\n        - [H] fOR a hELPFILE (dOORS:cOLORWALL/cOLORWALL.hELP) !\n              nOTE: yOU cAN cHANGE tHE hELPFILE iF yOU dOESN`T lIKE mY\n                    oNE!\n        - [A] oR [rETURN] fOR aBORT!\n        @{" rEAD tHIS dOCS! "LINK Docs}\n      - cENTER lINES\n      - bUG rEPORTS aND sUCCESTIONS aRE wELCOME !\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Docs "lITTLE dOCUMENT fOR tHE [cTRL-K] oPTIONS!"\n\n         /\    /\          /\    __        /\    /\\n========/  \==/  \/\======/  \==/  \=======\ \==/  \/\====/\==============\n       /   /\/    \ \  /\/    \/ / /_    /\/\ \/    \ \  /\ \  /\\n      /  \/  \ \   \ \/  \ \   \     \  /  \ \ \ /   \ \/  \ \/  \\n      \   \  /  \  /     /  \  /  \  /  \   \  /  \  /     /     /\n      \\    /\    /\    /\    /\   \//  \\    /\   \/\    /\    //\n       \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //    \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //S\n        \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//      \\//  \\//  \\//  \\// \n=========\/====\/====\/====\/====\/=[v1.4]=\/====\/====\/====\/==M========\n\n iF yOU hAVE cHOOSEN oNE oF tHE tHINGS aBOVE, aNYTHING lIKE [-HANDLE!!!-]\n wILL aPEAR iN yOUR lINE! tHE nUMBER aBOVE wILL bE tHE mAX. lENGTH oF tHE\n uSER`S nAME/lOCATION/aND sO oN...\n\n eVERY uSER, wHICH sTARTS tHE dOOR, dOESN`T sEE tHE [-HANDLE!!!-] iN yOUR\n lINE, sHE/hE wILL sEE hER/hIS oNE nAME/hANDLE !\n\n aT aLL tHE oTHER tHINGS, tHE uSER wILL sEE aLWAYS hER/hIS oNE sTATUS!\n\n aT tIME, sHE/hE wILL sEE tHE aCTUAL tIME, aT dATE tHE aCTUAL dATE aND aT\n tHE nODE nUMBER tHE aCTUAL nODE shE/hE iS lOGGED oN !\n\n i.E.\n\n hELLO [-HANDLE!!!-] wHAT`S gOING oN rIGHT nOW !\n ^^^ tHIS oNE wILL sTAND iN *yOUR* lINE!\n\n hELLO sHADOW mAN wHAT`S gOING oN rIGHT nOW !\n ^^^ tHIS aPEARS iF i sTART tHE dOOR, oR\n\n iT`S nOW [-TIME-], rIGHT?!\n ^^^ aGAIN *yOUR* lINE !\n\n iT`S nOW 22:47:21, rIGHT?!\n ^^^ aND mY lINE !\n\noK ?! nOW hAVE mANY fUN wITH tHIS *nEW* fEATURE !\n\n                               @{" bACK ! "LINK Features}\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Install "aT fIRST, a qUESTION..."\n\n         /\    /\          /\    __        /\    /\\n========/  \==/  \/\======/  \==/  \=======\ \==/  \/\====/\==============\n       /   /\/    \ \  /\/    \/ / /_    /\/\ \/    \ \  /\ \  /\\n      /  \/  \ \   \ \/  \ \   \     \  /  \ \ \ /   \ \/  \ \/  \\n      \   \  /  \  /     /  \  /  \  /  \   \  /  \  /     /     /\n      \\    /\    /\    /\    /\   \//  \\    /\   \/\    /\    //\n       \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //    \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //S\n        \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//      \\//  \\//  \\//  \\// \n=========\/====\/====\/====\/====\/=[v1.4]=\/====\/====\/====\/==M========\n\n  dO yOU iNSTALL tHIS dOOR tHE fIRST tIME oR aRE yOU aN uSER wHICH uSES\n             aN eARLIER vERSION oF cOLORWALL, lIKE v1.3 ?!\n\n                   @{" i`AM iNTALLING iT tHE fIRST tIME! "LINK InstallNew}\n                   @{" i`AM uSING cOLORWALL v1.x!        "LINK Installear}\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node InstallNew "iNTALLING tHE fIRST tIME..."\n\n         /\    /\          /\    __        /\    /\\n========/  \==/  \/\======/  \==/  \=======\ \==/  \/\====/\==============\n       /   /\/    \ \  /\/    \/ / /_    /\/\ \/    \ \  /\ \  /\\n      /  \/  \ \   \ \/  \ \   \     \  /  \ \ \ /   \ \/  \ \/  \\n      \   \  /  \  /     /  \  /  \  /  \   \  /  \  /     /     /\n      \\    /\    /\    /\    /\   \//  \\    /\   \/\    /\    //\n       \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //    \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //S\n        \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//      \\//  \\//  \\//  \\// \n=========\/====\/====\/====\/====\/=[v1.4]=\/====\/====\/====\/==M========\n\n          yEAH... yOU wANT tO iNSTALL tHIS dOOR... gREAT iDEA !!\n        cOPY aLL fILES iNCLUDED iN tHE aRCHIV tO a dIRECTORY cALLED\n                             "dOORS:cOLORWALL/"\n           nOW uSE tHE iCON iNCLUDED iN tHE aRCHIV aND cOPY iT tO\n                           "bBS:cOMMANDS/bBSCMD/"\n                             tHAT`S rEALLY aLL!\n        iF yA wANT tHIS dOOR iN yOUR lOGON sEQUENCE tHEN yOU hAVE tO\n      lOAD tHE "bBS:nODE(x)/lOGON.TXT(.GR)" fILE aND eDIT iT lIKE tHIS:\n=[CUT]===================================================================\n~\n\nyOUR bBS aNSI...\n\n~SP\n~CC_WALL\n=[CUT]===================================================================\n            aND nOW hAVE pLENTY oF pHUN wITH yOUR nEW wALL !!!\n@endnode\n@node Installear "iNSTALL tHE nEW vERSION..."\n\n         /\    /\          /\    __        /\    /\\n========/  \==/  \/\======/  \==/  \=======\ \==/  \/\====/\==============\n       /   /\/    \ \  /\/    \/ / /_    /\/\ \/    \ \  /\ \  /\\n      /  \/  \ \   \ \/  \ \   \     \  /  \ \ \ /   \ \/  \ \/  \\n      \   \  /  \  /     /  \  /  \  /  \   \  /  \  /     /     /\n      \\    /\    /\    /\    /\   \//  \\    /\   \/\    /\    //\n       \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //    \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //S\n        \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//      \\//  \\//  \\//  \\// \n=========\/====\/====\/====\/====\/=[v1.4]=\/====\/====\/====\/==M========\n\n      aT fIRST yOU hAVE tO dELETE yOUR lINES fILE (cOLORWALL.lINES)\n    bECAUSE fROM nOW oN tHE dOOR nEEDS a lOGfILE (cOLORWALL.lOGfILE)!\n       nOTE: iF yOU wANT tO dELETE yOUR lINES wRITTEN iN tHE wALL,\n             dELETE tHE lINES fILE *aND* tHE lOGFILE oTHERWISE tHE dOOR\n             wON`T gO cORRECT!\n\n                 aND nOW dO tHE @{" nORMAL iNSTALLATION! "LINK InstallNew}\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Requ "yOU nEED tHIS tO iNSTALL tHIS dOOR..."\n\n         /\    /\          /\    __        /\    /\\n========/  \==/  \/\======/  \==/  \=======\ \==/  \/\====/\==============\n       /   /\/    \ \  /\/    \/ / /_    /\/\ \/    \ \  /\ \  /\\n      /  \/  \ \   \ \/  \ \   \     \  /  \ \ \ /   \ \/  \ \/  \\n      \   \  /  \  /     /  \  /  \  /  \   \  /  \  /     /     /\n      \\    /\    /\    /\    /\   \//  \\    /\   \/\    /\    //\n       \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //    \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //S\n        \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//      \\//  \\//  \\//  \\// \n=========\/====\/====\/====\/====\/=[v1.4]=\/====\/====\/====\/==M========\n\n                               yOU nEED:\n\n - a fULLY iNSTALLED aMI-eXPRESS 2.x/3.x/4.x oR sIGMA eXPRESS vERSION !\n - aN aMIGA 500,1000,1200,2000,3000,4000 wITH iNSTALLED oS2.0 oR hIGHER!\n - a cOLOR mONITOR tO sEE tHE wONDERFULL cOLORS aND sTYLES !!!\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Greets "sOME gREETINGS..."\n\n         /\    /\          /\    __        /\    /\\n========/  \==/  \/\======/  \==/  \=======\ \==/  \/\====/\==============\n       /   /\/    \ \  /\/    \/ / /_    /\/\ \/    \ \  /\ \  /\\n      /  \/  \ \   \ \/  \ \   \     \  /  \ \ \ /   \ \/  \ \/  \\n      \   \  /  \  /     /  \  /  \  /  \   \  /  \  /     /     /\n      \\    /\    /\    /\    /\   \//  \\    /\   \/\    /\    //\n       \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //    \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //S\n        \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//      \\//  \\//  \\//  \\// \n=========\/====\/====\/====\/====\/=[v1.4]=\/====\/====\/====\/==M========\n\n                  gREETS aT fIRST tO mY bETA-tESTERS:\n\n nAME          bBS                                sYSTEM\n--------------|----------------------------------|------------------------\n rED aLERT     tHE aDDICTION / /X sUPPORT bOARD   ?\n iNTERCODE     lAMERS iNN                         A2000/040/28/10 - /X3.37\n iNUENDO       fARPØINT sTAT¡ØN bBS               ?\n fRANK/aFL     cRASH bBS                          ?\n mARKY & pOWER sPREAD dRAFT                       A4000/040/25/14 - S-Exp.\n--------------|----------------------------------|------------------------\n\n                           sOME gREETINGS tO:\n\n - sPIDER/oSi®iS fOR tEACHING mE `C` aND fOR aLL yOUR hELP!\n - eMPIRE/mYSTIC fOR hIS gREAT hELP iN `C` aND fOR cALLING !\n - tERRORIST/aFL fOR tHE sUPPORT !\n - >> µ£¯|¯®å << fOR tHE gREAT mORAL sUPPORT !\n - cELATOR/aFL   fOR sOME hELP iN `C` aND fOR tHE bUG hELP oN tHIS dOOR!\n - bOBO/mST      gREAT fILE_iD tOOL!\n - kILLRAVEN/mST gREAT wORK oN yOUR cONFsCAN!\n - fATE          kEEP oN wRITING fOR c-nET hEHE!\n - -vINDEX!      tHX fOR aLL tHAT mAILS hAHAHA!\n - aLL aFL mEMBERS !\n aT lAST i wANT tO gREET aLL mY uSERS oN mY oWN bBS!\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node Beta "sTART tO cALL mY bBS aND wRITE mE a mAIL !"\n\n         /\    /\          /\    __        /\    /\\n========/  \==/  \/\======/  \==/  \=======\ \==/  \/\====/\==============\n       /   /\/    \ \  /\/    \/ / /_    /\/\ \/    \ \  /\ \  /\\n      /  \/  \ \   \ \/  \ \   \     \  /  \ \ \ /   \ \/  \ \/  \\n      \   \  /  \  /     /  \  /  \  /  \   \  /  \  /     /     /\n      \\    /\    /\    /\    /\   \//  \\    /\   \/\    /\    //\n       \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //    \\  //\\  //\\  //\\  //S\n        \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//  \\//      \\//  \\//  \\//  \\// \n=========\/====\/====\/====\/====\/=[v1.4]=\/====\/====\/====\/==M========\n\n                      sEARCHING fOR bETA tESTER`S !!!\n\n  i nEED fOR mY dOORS sOME bETA tESTERS fOR tESTING tHE dOORS iN /X2.xx\n  aND sIGMA eXPRESS ! bECAUSE mY bOARD rUNS wITH rEGISTRED /X3.xx, sO i\n                cAN`T tEST tHE dOORS oN /X2.xx vERSIONS yET !\n\n           iF yOU aRE iNTRESTED tHEN cALL tHE @{" cARRIER iN sPACE "LINK jOIN!!!} !!!\n              yOU cAN gET tHE nUMBER oN aN aFL mEMBERSHIP bOARD,\n                        oR oN tHE bETA-tEST bOARDS !\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node jOIN!!! "10...9...8......4......2...1...0...tAKE oFF!!!"\n    ,mmm.         gmmm__    gmmm__               gmmm__         .om.   ,m.\n   g#####.        ###M###s  ###M###s             ###M###s       ]###i  ]##\n  i######Ai       ### V###b ### V###b            ### V###b      ]####  ]##\n ,###AM##A/i      ###  Y### ###  Y###            ###  Y###      ]####b ]##\n W##A  VNA5)      ###  d### ###  d### gm.        ###  d###    gm.~####.]##\ni###!    ''`       ### g###A ### g###A ###        ### g###A    ### ####b]##\nd##A              #######*` #######*` *##        #######*`    *## #####d##\n###[   _.  W###m. #####W    #####W    gm. ,mmms. #####W       gm. ##M#####\n###!  d## ]###### ###Y##W   ###Y##W   ##[i###### ###Y##W      ### ##''#####\nY## ,W##A ###f### ### Y##W. ### Y##W. ##[###  ##[### Y##W.    ### ## !####\n''##W###A` ### ### ###  V###i###  V###i##[###WW##!###  V###i   ### ##  Y###\n ''V***f   ###,### V*f   ''V*`V*f   ''V*`##[###     V*f   ''V*`   ### MA   V*`\n          M##W###i                    ##[###WW##m             ### M\n          ''*M##M#!                    ##[!#####A`             ### ~\n                  gW##Ws  a###Wms.    ''~~  ''~~`.g###s         ''~~\n                 W##*###WC###PM###s            W#####s   > aLPHA fLIGHT! <   \n sPACE gUARDS:  ]##[ M###~###[ Y###[          d######Kt  aMIGA aND cONSOLE\n  sHADOW mAN    ]###.''V*f ###[  ###[         i###fV#AKK[ 3 nODES rINGDOWN!\n >> µ£¯|¯®å <<   M###s    ###[ i###[         ###P  ''V5)/ +49-0-rING