 /  /  /  /  /  / _____/  /  / /iS a\n     /  /  / ___/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  __/\/  /  / /  /X\n    /  /  /  /\/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /\_\/  /  / /xIM dOOR\n    \____/__/ /_____/_____/_______/__/__/__/__/__/__/ / /_____/ /\n=====\___\__\/\_____\_____\_______\__\__\__\_____\__\/  \_____\/==[v1.20]=\n\n    tHE uPDATE wILL bE cOOLER aS tHE fIRST rELEASE ... nOW wITH cOLOR\n        sELECTION aND oTHER nEW oPTIONS... cHECK iT oUT nEXT tIME!\n\n==========================================================================\n\n@endnode\n\n@node bETA!!! "i`AM lOOKING fOR bETA tESTER`S !!!"\n\n        /\_____________  ______/\_  _______  /\____________________\n=======/  /    \_____  \/     /  /\/  /    \/__/    \       /     /\======\n   S M/  /  ___  /  /  /  /  /  /_/  /  /  /  /  /  / _____/  /  / /iS a\n     /  /  / ___/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  __/\/  /  / /  /X\n    /  /  /  /\/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /\_\/  /  / /xIM dOOR\n    \____/__/ /_____/_____/_______/__/__/__/__/__/__/ / /_____/ /\n=====\___\__\/\_____\_____\_______\__\__\__\_____\__\/  \_____\/==[v1.20]=\n\n                      sEARCHING fOR bETA tESTER`S !!!\n\n  i nEED fOR mY dOORS sOME bETA tESTERS fOR tESTING tHE dOORS iN /X2.xx\n  aND sIGMA eXPRESS ! bECAUSE mY bOARD rUNS wITH rEGISTRED /X3.xx, sO i\n                cAN`T tEST tHE dOORS oN /X2.xx vERSIONS yET !\n\n           iF yOU aRE iNTERESTED tHEN cALL tHE cARRIER iN sPACE!!!\nyOU cAN gET tHE nUMBER oN aN aFL mEMBERSHIP bOARD oR fROM tHE bETA-tESTERS\n               aROUND nOW (rED aLERT - fRANK/aFL - iNTERCODE)!\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n\n@node jOIN!!! "aND nOW tAKE tIME tO jOIN tHE sPACE pOWER !"\n    ,mmm.         gmmm__    gmmm__               gmmm__         .om.   ,m.\n   g#####.        ###M###s  ###M###s             ###M###s       ]###i  ]##\n  i######Ai       ### V###b ### V###b            ### V###b      ]####  ]##\n ,###AM##A/i   