Cd-Rom 4 HD''s 7110MB Space Total...\n\n   2 * cREDITZ fOR mAJORS! 3 * cREDITZ fOR mAJORS fROM yOUR oWN gROUP!\n    pROVIDING yOU: Amiga ECS/AGA, PC, AmiExpress, Sex Pic, Sex Stories\n\n          ---»> nO nEW uSER pASSWORD aND/oR sYSTEM pASSWORD! <«---\n\n- -- ---------------------------------------------------------------- -- -\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,19834,9,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048391);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('af_ses10','AF_SES10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/AF_SES10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','/\____    /\_________',NULL,'Psychopath','AF','/ø \  ø\  /ø \       / Agnostic Front //  !\   \//  _______/ proudly present: //   :_\         __!',replace('     /\____    /\_________                \n    /ø \  ø\  /ø \       / Agnostic Front                \n   //  !\   \//  _______/ proudly present:\n  //   :_\         __!                    \n //       \       /     -*- Sesam V1.ø -*-    \n \_______________/  A FrontEnd-Døør for /X\n   (w)''93 by Psychopath / Agnostic Front  \n33.6 DigITal-X Prd/NirVana Dist Site! 33.6\n','\n',char(10)),'Sesam10.DOC',replace('                                   ·  /                     |\n            /\      /\    .___  __/| /___    ______________/|  /_______\n           /  \    // \   |°  \|   |/   °\  /°      /    °/ | /° ___  /\n          //   \  //  /___|:   \   /      \ \   \__/  \  / ||/  |   \/\n         //     \/   /\_   \    \ /   __  \\_\\  \ |:  \/   /  :|\n        /   /\   \   \_/   /  \   \    /  //  \   \||   \  /   ||_____\n       /   ___\  /\_____  / __|\___\__/   /_______/|__  /__\____|____/  \n       \  /    \/       \/|/         /___/-\/iTEX!    \/    \         \n        \/                .                                           \n        /                .                        .\n                .________|_______  /___  .___ .__/|_________\n                |°       /      °\/   °\ |°  \|    _.     °/\n                ||  \___/   |)   /      \|    \   | |  \  /\n                |:   _/ ||      /   __  \\     \ || |  \\/\n                |   |   |:  |   \    /  //   \   :| |   .\\n                |___|   |___|\___\__/   /| __|\___| |__  /\n                :                  /___/ |/            \/\n \n\n                                proudly present:\n\n\n                            -*- S E S A M  V1.ø -*-\n\n                 --- A Frontend-Døør for Ami-Express V2.xx+ ---\n                     (w)1993 by Psychopath / Agnøstic Frønt\n\n\n\n\n1.0 - Introduction\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nOh dear, everone knows this problem: You are the proud owner of a BBS and you\njust do not want 2400-Baud users in there. Alas, your best friend or the \ncoolest dude in your crew just owns this Zombitzu-2400-Lamer-Device and of\ncourse they are not able to call because you installed NoCallersAt2400....\nTough shit, if you remove it, you got millions of lamers hanging around only\nintending to occupy your line(s) for hours just to down that new 10K textfile.\nWhat can you do if you just don''t have the money to run 14 lines........\n\n  Don''t despair, because HERE COMES THE SOLUTION: REVOLUTIONARY, ANARCHISTIC,\n                    THE ONE AND ONLY WAY OUT OF YOUR MISERY!\n\n\n                                 AGNØSTIÇ FRØNT\n         present with an incredible amount of joy and tons of arrogance\n\n                           ÷÷÷÷ S E S A M  V1.ø ÷÷÷÷\n\n\n\n1.1 - What is this garbage?\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nWhat is this invention of the gods capable of???\nWell, this tool replaces all NoCallersAt - Files with a requester, allowing\nall those poor sods not able to buy a decent HST to type in a password which\nwill grant them access on your board.\nOf course, this password also guarantees that these guys stay exceptions!\n\n\n1.2 - How to install Sesam V1.ø\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nWell then, first of all, make sure that all the basic food you are addicted \nis present right beside you working-place. After all, the most important \nthing on this crap-planet is and will continue to be: COFFEINE! Whether you\nprefer it in cold (Coke) or hot form (Coffee) --- I just couldn''t care less.\n2 addtional packages of ''Lucky Strike'' and 3 bags of potato-chips --- And\nfinally here we go.....\n\na.) Copy ''Sesam10.rexx'' in Doors (or whereever you want it to be)\nb.) Grab an editor and load: ''BBS: Commands/SYS.CMD''\nc.) Add the following line: *FrontEnd RM005Doors:Sesam10.rexx\nd.) Save all this junk\ne.) Configurate Sesam (cf. 1.3)\nf.) Then delete all NoCallersAt- Files!\ng.) Send me 100.- DM or the comparable sum in US-Dollars....\n\nRight then, now the tool is installed and on we go....\n\n\n1.3 - Configuration\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nThe configuration can be found in the program itself.\nIf you don''t want to restrict a certain baud-rate at all, then just type in\n''Y''.\n------> ex.:   Baud.14400=''Y''\nIf you are willing to make ''exceptions'' for certain connect-rates, you just\ngive in ''N''.\nAnd if you finally decide to restrict a baud-rate completely, you take ''-''.\n\nShould this new 3921-Baud-modem really appear on the market next time, you\ncan of course expand the program without problems to deal with the new \nbaud-rate....\n------> ex.:   Baud.3921=''Y''\n\nNext step is to install the password for the baud-rates, you want to allow\nexceptions with. Just type the word behind ''PASSWORD''. \nIt doesn''t matter whether the password is written in small or capital letters,\nthe length is also not restricted. So just feel free to take PW''s like for\ninstance ''I LOST MY CAR ON THE MOTHERFUCKING ROAD'' or something like that...\nDreams come to reality, eh?\n\n\n1.4 History of the program\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nV 1.o - No errors detected\n\n\n1.5 Collected junk - Famous Last Words\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nIf errors really should occur (impossible!), just leave a mail on somewhat\nAgnostic Front-BBS (cf. 1.6) and I will delete it, OK?\n\n So, here are some greetings to our contacts (probably not complete as usual)\n ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n               \n   ACUME, ADEPT, ALCATRAZ, ALPHA FLIGHT, AMNESIA, ANALOG, ANARCHY, ANIMATORS \n       ANTHROX, ARISE, COMPLEX, CRYPTOBURNERS, CRYSTAL, DEFIANCE, DESIRE\n  DIAMONDS AND RUST / FAIRLIGHT, DIGITAL, D-TECT, DUAL CREW, ELEVATION, FUSION\n    INFECT, LEGEND, LSD, MIRAGE, MINISTRY, NOXIOUS, PARADISE, PMC, QUARTEX \n   RAZOR 1911, REBELS, SANITY, SCOOPEX, SHINING, SILENTS, SONIC, SPACEBALLS \n                     SUBMISSION, TRSI, TSB, ZENITH, 2000 AD\n\n\n        And of course some x-tra special yahooz to our personal friends\n        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n AlienX/ Razor 1911, Bad Barty, Vitex, Sid Vicious & Holgi, Ice&Dre/ Elevation\n /\RC/ Paradise, HotStar/ Razor 1911, Edo The Ancient & Steve/ D&R/ Fairlight \n            WOTW/ The Silents, PØt-Noodle/ Anthrox, ZigZag/ Scoopex\n\n\n\n1.6 Sick Systems\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n  ¸,o*¤°¬¯¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬¯¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬¯¬°¤*o,¸\n\n           ______   ______/¬\_____   ________________  _  _______\n           \  __¬\ /   _  ¬\ \__ ¬\ /  _ ¬\ _  ¬\  _¬\/¬\/      ¬\\n           /  \¬  \ ___/___/   /   \   /  / ¬\  /__/  \  \  /\___/\n          /   /   / \__  ¬\   /    /  /  /\_  \/ /    /  / / __   \n         /   /   /    /   /  /    / _/  /  ¬   \/    /  / /_/ ¬\ \n        /___/___/\_______/___\___/_____/_______/\   /__/_______/\n                                        _        \_/        \n                  _______________  ____/¬\___________ \n                  \   _  ¬\   _ ¬\/  _ ¬\ \__ ¬\   _¬\\n                  /   /___/  _/__/   /  /   /   \__/  \\n                 /   /__/   /  ¬\   /  /   /    //    / \n                /   /  /   /    / _/  /   /    //    / \n                \__/   \__/    /_____/____\___/ \   / \n                          \___/-rS!+\/iTEX       \_/\n «(-----------------------------------------------------------------------«(\n\n                        CaLL OuR AWeSoMe KiLLeR-SySTeMS:\n                        ÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷÷\n\n\n             PaRaDiSe LoST    +49-(0)-2735-6699     {NUP: Terminal}\n            MoRPHiC FieLDS    +49-(0)-2953-7546     \n             HeaRTLaND  #1    +49-(0)-6831-73378    {NUP: Mario}\n \n  ¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬¯¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬¯¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬°¤*o,¸_¸,o*¤°¬\n\n\n\n\n  --- EOF --- EOF --- EOF --- EOF --- EOF --- EOF --- EOF --- EOF --- EOF ---\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,12372,8,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048391);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('af_vhs2','AF_VHS2.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/AF_VHS2.LHA',NULL,'XIM','Beavis&Butt.RUN',NULL,NULL,'AF','______ /, \/,_//, \/, \/,_//,__/\/,_/_____ ,     / - / /\/ / / / /\  \ / / / /_     , _|_ / /_/\__/_/_/\__/\___//_/_/\__ \ _|_',replace('.       __  ___ __  __  ___ ____  ___    .\n______ /, \/,_//, \/, \/,_//,__/\/,_/_____\n,     / - / /\/ / / / /\  \ / / / /_     ,\n _|_ / /_/\__/_/_/\__/\___//_/_/\__ \ _|_\n  |  \/   /,____ //, \/, \/,__/xxx \/  |\n________ / _//   \ / / / / /______________\n,        \/ /_//_/__/_/_/_/              ,\n \n        8* VhS oRdEr DooR V2.0 *8\n \n','\n',char(10)),'VHSDOOR.DOC',replace('==============================================================================\n=                      VhS moViE BesTel SysTem                               =\n=----------------------------------------------------------------------------=\n=      A Door Written By RuByX In Order Of Mr. Partyman/PDY/DCN              =\n==============================================================================\n\nWriTTen BecAuSE:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n                   . __/\__..·.·.·..·..·.:..·.: .·__/\__.\n                .·:.:\ oo /.·.:.:FRiEndShiP::.·:.·\ oo /.·.\n                 ·.·:/_\/_\:·:·.:·RuLEs!:·:·.·:.·:/_\/_\:·:·\n                   :·.·\/:·.· :.·:·.·.:. ·.: .·.:·.·\/:·.·\n\nWhat Does It Do?\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nIT LET USERS ORDER VHS TAPES ONLINE!\nCHECK THE CONFIGFILES FOR FURTHER INFORMATION... EDIT THEM YOURSELF!\n\nRequirements:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nHmm... a BBS!  /X , a callerslog at each node you want to run VhS,\na file called : BBS:RUBYX/ORDERLOG... if you have no orderlog, nothing\nwill be updated! When the dummy orderlog is not included due to some\nlame checkers, then please create one yourself!\n\n\n\n\n\n                              !IMPORTANT!\n\n\n             cREaTE a FilE ''S:VHSLIST'' for ThE doWNloADz!\n             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n THIS BECAUSE YOU DONNOT WANT YOUR USERS DOWNLOAD THE WHOLE SCREEN VHSLIST!\n        (AND NOW YOU CAN PLACE YOUR ADD IN FRONT OF IT! HEHEHEHEHE)\n\n(NOW YOU SEE PHANTOM/OVL ?! YOU CANNOT READ DOX! THATS WHY IT WAS PLACED IN\n THE S: DIRECTORY!                   (EDITORIAL NOTE TO A BIG LAME ASSHOLE!))\n\n\n\n\nHow To Install 2.39:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nCreate A dir Called: ''DoorS:RuByX''\nCopy the fileS to this directory... (How is it possible!)\n\nInsert the command ''VHs'' to your bbs.cmd\nFor Dildo''s it is shown below how to do... \n\nBbs.CmD:\n~~~~~~~~\n--- cut here ---\n*vhs      RM050DOORS:RUBYX/VHS.REXX\n--- cut here ---\n\n\n\nHow To Install 3.x:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nCreate A dir Called: ''DoorS:RuByX''\nCopy the fileS to this directory... (How is it possible!)\n\nInsert the icon VHS.INFO to your bbs:commands/bbscmd/\n\n\nGreetinx:\n~~~~~~~~~\nSpecial Greetinx must go to my Beta Tester: Mr. Partyman\n                                            ~~~~~~~~~~~~  \nFurther I Would Like To Greet T.U.S./-\T.F.A. - NITRATE - TELEDINGES -\nEMPIRE - THC - VANGOLEN - CREW ONE - PRICE - INKEY - BOUSHH - SOB - SPEED - \nVECTOR/VSN - R/\DIC/\L - BEAST - SPEEDDEVIL - THE WARRIOR AND LOTS-A-MORE!!!!!\n\n                                                                \n                 . __/\__..·.·.·..·..·.:..·.: .·__/\__.\n              .·:.:\ oo /.·.:.:FRiEndShiP::.·:.·\ oo /.·.\n               ·.·:/_\/_\:·:·.:·RuLEs!:·:·.·:.·:/_\/_\:·:·\n                 :·.·\/:·.· :.·:·.·.:. ·.: .·.:·.·\/:·.·\n\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVHS ORDER v2.0 By ViGo/AgNosTiC FrOnt\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nFirSt I would like to thanx to Rubyx, cause he wrote this kool Door!\nWell, I just changed something and fixed A bug!\n\nBuG FixEd:\n~~~~~~~~~~\nWell, in The OlD veRsiOn, theRe was a BuG abOut in DoWnload, So, I cHanged\nthis SmAll bug, Now, You doN''t nEeD to put a File CalleD:\n\nS:VHSLIST\n\nYou just Have To put it in :\n\nBBS:DooRs/RubYx/VHSLIST\n\nSo, It iS woRkinG\n\nWhAt Is ThE DiFfEreNce?:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nNow, I IncLude A fiLe CalLEd :\n\nBBS:DOORS/RuByX/SEARCHLOG\n\nWeLl, A new LiNe i AdDed in To a MAin MenU. So, ThE cuStomer can request\nwhicH moVie He Is sEarcHing For nOw! And, The ReQuest ForM is inCluding to\nA FilE CalLed :\n\nBBS:DOORS/RuByX/SEARCHLOG\n\nAnd, YoU cAn See Who iS reQuesting SomEtHing Now! And i DelEte a QuEstion\nCallEd : SpeCiAl OfFer!\n\nWelL ThaTs aLl. Use It!\n\nGrEeTz to: RuByX - GhOst/Af - MaX/BrOnx - AliEx/MyStiC - ByteAndi/MysTic\n==============================================================================\n             ______    ______                  ____________\n      ______/:::::/\__/:::::/\    ____________/.::::::::::/\\n      \:::::::.::::::/:::::/.:\  /:...:::::::/.::::_:::::/ /\n       \__:: '' .____/:'''': /_:.:\/::.: _ ::. /:::. //____/ /\n        \/ :.  /\__/ :.  /\/   / .:: //____/\ .'': \\____\/\n        /  .: / / /. .  /_     \  . ___/\__\/\  .  \\n       /..:: / / / :.: /\_\     \. //    /\___\ .:  \\n      / ::: / / / ::::/ / /.:   /:      /.   // ::: /\\n      \____/ /  \____/ / / ::. /_______/::..   ::: / /\n       \___\/    \___\/ /_____/\______/___________/ /        _____\n        ______Call:     \_____\/______\___________\/        /::::/\\n       /:.:::/\__90-216-4166955/::::: ::::::/\_________    /::. / /\n      /::::.__ ::\________    /::::::_:::::/::::::::::/\  /:.  / /\n     / ::: /\/:: /::::__::\  /. ::: //____/:'':.: _ :./ / / .  / /\n    /   . /_/   /::: /\/ ::\ \   :  \\____\  .  //__/ / /    / /\n   /     ______/ :. __   . /\ \  .   \  ___\  : \\__\/ /    / /\n  /. .  /\____/ :  /\/.   /_/__\.: .  \/: //.::: \    /____/ /\n /::.::/ /   /:.: / / :: /.:  //::.:: /::   :::; /\  _\____\/\n/:::::/ /   /____/ /____/:::.   :::::/__________/ / /    /\\n\____/ /    \____\/\___/____________/\__________\/ /____/ /\n \___\/                \____________\/             \____\/\n .. T®eSp/\SS BBs .. O.G''s: ViGO ^ GHoST / AgN()sTiC Fr(