         iT`S nOW 100% fASTER tHAN tHE oTHER vERSIONS (rOUTINE cHANGE!)!\n\n    @{"-======================= i = N = D = E = X =======================-" LINK Index}\n\n@endnode\n\n@node uPdOWNiNFO "hEY iNSTALL iT..."\n\n        /\_____________  ______/\_  _______  /\____________________\n=======/  /    \_____  \/        /\/  /    \/__/    \             /\======\n   S M/  /  ___  /  /  /  ___   /_/  /  /  /  /  /  / ________   / /iS a\n     /  /  / ___/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  __/\/  /  / /  /X\n    /  /  /  /\/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /\_\/  /  / /xIM dOOR\n    \____/__/ /_____/_____/_______/__/__/__/__/__/__/ / /_____/ /\n=====\___\__\/\_____\_____\_______\__\__\__\__\__\__\/  \_____\/==[v1.30]=\n\n                        iS fULLY wRITTEN iN `C` !!!\n  tHE cODER gIVE`S yOU oNLY tHE gUARANTY oF a 100% bACKDOOR fREE dOOR,\niF yOU hAVE dOWNLOADED tHE fULL pACKAGE fROM a aVT/rLG mEMBERSHIP bOARD,\n               a bETATEST bOARD (lOOK iNTO tHE @{"gREETS" LINK Greets!} !),\n                oR fROM tHE hOME oF tHIS gREAT pRODUCT !\n\n     sO dON`T mISS tO cALL tHE hOME aND cALL tHE @{"cARRIER iN sPACE!"LINK jOIN!!!}\n\n                         fILESIZES aND fILEHUNKS :\n\n         fILENAME:          sIZE:        hUNK_cODE:\n\n         uPdOWNiNFO.000     17672        (1001/$03E9) 19952 bYTES\n         uPdOWNiNFO.030     17660        (1001/$03E9) 19940 bYTES\n         uPdOWNiNFO.gUIDE   13801        -\n         fLAG-aDDER         12300        (1001/$03E9) 11144 bYTES\n         ^ nOT uPDATED!\n@endnode\n\n@node Index "iT`S tHE iNDEX..."\n\n        /\_____________  ______/\_  _______  /\____________________\n=======/  /    \_____  \/     /  /\/  /    \/__/    \       /     /\======\n   S M/  /  ___  /  /  /  /  /  /_/  /  /  /  /  /  / _____/  /  / /iS a\n     /  /  / ___/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  __/\/  /  / /  /X\n    /  /  /  /\/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /\_\/  /  / /xIM dOOR\n    \____/__/ /_____/_____/_______/__/__/__/__/__/__/ / /_____/ /\n=====\___\__\/\_____\_____\_______\__\__\__\_____\__\/  \_____\/==[v1.30]=\n\n              =============================================\n              ============= i = N = D = E = X =============\n              =============================================\n              ===                                       ===\n              ===     @{"        iNSTALLATION!        " LINK Install}     ===\n              ===     @{"        rEQUIREMENTS!        " LINK Require}     ===\n              ===     @{"          gREETINGS          " LINK Greets!}     ===\n              ===     @{"   wANNA bE a bETA tESTER??  " LINK bETA!!!}     ===\n              ===     @{"         bOARD lIST!         " LINK bOARDS!}     ===\n              ===     @{"    jOIN tHE sPACE pOWER!    " LINK jOIN!!!}     ===\n              ===                                       ===\n              =============================================\n              =============================================\n              =============================================\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Install "iNSTALL pAGE..."\n\n        /\_____________  ______/\_  _______  /\____________________\n=======/  /    \_____  \/     /  /\/  /    \/__/    \       /     /\======\n   S M/  /  ___  /  /  /  /  /  /_/  /  /  /  /  /  / _____/  /  / /iS a\n     /  /  / ___/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  __/\/  /  / /  /X\n    /  /  /  /\/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /\_\/  /  / /xIM dOOR\n    \____/__/ /_____/_____/_______/__/__/__/__/__/__/ / /_____/ /\n=====\___\__\/\_____\_____\_______\__\__\__\_____\__\/  \_____\/==[v1.30]=\n\n           yEAH... yOU wANNA iNSTALL tHIS dOOR... gREAT iDEA !!\n       cOPY  aLL fILES iNCLUDED iN tHE aRCHIV tO a dIRECTORY cALLED\n                             "dOORS:uPdOWNiNFO/"\n          nOW uSE tHE iCON`S iNCLUDED iN tHE aRCHIV aND cOPY iT tO\n                           "bBS:cOMMANDS/sYSCMD/"\nnOW lOAD tHE "bBS:<cONFNAME>/uPLOADMSG.TXT(.GR)" fILE`S aND eDIT iT lIKE\n                                 tHIS:\n=[CUT]====================================================================\n~\n\nyOUR uPLOAD mESSAGE...\n\n~SP\n~CC_UPLOAD\n=[CUT]====================================================================\n       mAKE tHE sAME wITH tHE dOWNLOADMSG.TXT(.GR) fILE aND wRITE:\n~CC_DOWNLOAD\n==========================================================================\n                  yO... i tHINK tHAT`S aLL fOR yOU hEHEHE\n\nsTOP! bUG-iNFO: yOU hAVE pROBLEMS wITH tHE dOWNLOAD iNFO bECAUSE tHE fILES\n                wRITTEN aFTER tHE `D` cOMMAND (D fILE1 fILE2 aND sO oN)\n                wILL nOT lISTET iN tHE sTANDART dOWNLOAD rOUTINE aND yOU\n                mUST eNTER tHE fILE`S aGAIN... nO pROBLEM:\n                cOPY tHE iNCLUDED D.INFO fILE iNTO yOUR bBScMD dIR !\n                nOW yOUR pROBLEM wILL bE fIXED...\n        dANGER: iF yOU aRE uSEING cONFERENCE sCAN fROM kILLRAVEN/mST\n                yOU dOESN`T hAVE tO uSE mY D.INFO fILE... (iT`S sTILL\n                wORKING wITH tHE D.INFO fILE fROM kILLRAVEN/mST !)\n\n   tO uSE tHE rANDOM fILES ... cREAT a fILE iN tHE dOORS:uPdOWNiNFO/\n   dIR aND cALL iT uPLOAD.lINES oR dOWNLOAD.lINES ... wRITE aT tHE tOP\n   oF tHAT fILE tHE nUMBER oF lINES !\n   jUST lOOK oN tHE iNCLUDED fILES !!!\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Require "yOU nEED tHIS tO iNSTALL tHIS dOOR..."\n\n        /\_____________  ______/\_  _______  /\____________________\n=======/  /    \_____  \/     /  /\/  /    \/__/    \       /     /\======\n   S M/  /  ___  /  /  /  /  /  /_/  /  /  /  /  /  / _____/  /  / /iS a\n     /  /  / ___/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  __/\/  /  / /  /X\n    /  /  /  /\/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /\_\/  /  / /xIM dOOR\n    \____/__/ /_____/_____/_______/__/__/__/__/__/__/ / /_____/ /\n=====\___\__\/\_____\_____\_______\__\__\__\_____\__\/  \_____\/==[v1.30]=\n\n                               yOU nEED:\n\n - a fULLY iNSTALLED aMI-eXPRESS 3.xx oR 4.xx vERSION !\n - tHE dOOR lEAVES uNDER /X2.xx aND sIGMA-eXPRESS, tOO! cALL tHE\n   cARRIER iN sPACE fOR fURTHER iNFORMATIONS!\n - aN aMIGA 500,1000,1200,2000,3000,4000 wITH iNSTALLED oS2.0 oR hIGHER!\n\n@endnode\n@node Greets! "hERE aRE sOME gREETINGS..."\n\n        /\_____________  ______/\_  _______  /\____________________\n=======/  /    \_____  \/     /  /\/  /    \/__/    \       /     /\======\n   S M/  /  ___  /  /  /  /  /  /_/  /  /  /  /  /  / _____/  /  / /iS a\n     /  /  / ___/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  __/\/  /  / /  /X\n    /  /  /  /\/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /\_\/  /  / /xIM dOOR\n    \____/__/ /_____/_____/_______/__/__/__/__/__/__/ / /_____/ /\n=====\___\__\/\_____\_____\_______\__\__\__\_____\__\/  \_____\/==[v1.30]=\n\n                  gREETS aT fIRST tO mY bETA-tESTERS:\n\n nAME          bBS                               aMIGA/0x0/MHz/rAM  sOFTW.\n--------------|---------------------------------|-------------------------\n rED aLERT     tHE aDDICTION / /X sUPPORT bOARD  A1200/020/014/?  - /X4.5b\n iNTERCODE     lAMERS iNN                        A2000/040/028/10 - /X4.4\n fRANK/aFL     cRASH bBS                         ?\n mARKY & pOWER sPREAD dRAFT                      A4000/040/025/14 - S-Exp.\n eURoNYMOUS    aNCIENT eNTITY                    A1200/020/014/07 - /X4.5b\n lACOSTE!      dATA sTORM                        A2000....          /X3.38\n--------------|---------------------------------|-------------------------\n\n tHE tOOL wAS nOW tESTET oN /X4.xx aND sIGMA-eXPRESS, iT rUNS fINE!\n\n                           sOME gREETINGS tO:\n\n - sPIDER/oSi®iS ............... fOR tEACHING mE `C` aND fOR aLL yOUR hELP!\n - eMPIRE/mYSTIC ............... fOR hIS gREAT hELP iN `C` aND fOR cALLING!\n - tERRORIST/aFL ......................................... fOR tHE sUPPORT!\n - >> µ£¯|¯®å << ............................. fOR tHE gREAT mORAL sUPPORT!\n - cELATOR/aFL   .. fOR sOME hELP iN `C` aND fOR tHE bUG hELP oN cOLORWALL!\n - bOBO/mST      ...................................... gREAT fILE_iD tOOL!\n - kILLRAVEN/mST ............................. gREAT wORK oN yOUR cONFsCAN!\n - fATE          .......................... kEEP oN wRITING fOR c-nET hEHE!\n - -vINDEX!      ........................... tHX fOR aLL tHAT mAILS hAHAHA!\n - tHE cROW/aVT  ...... iT`S mY nEW cO-sYSOP ... tHX fOR tHE gREAT sUPPORT!\n - hKWD&nOS!/rLG ..................... vERY gREAT sUPPORT iN tHE lAST dAYS!\n - bUG rOGERS/rLG................................. gREAT uPLOADS lAST tIME!\n - lACOSTE!      ............................... tHX fOR tHAT aWESOME cALL!\n - sEAHAWK/oRS   .............................. aNOTHER oSIRIS mEMBER hEHE!\n - aND tO        ................................... aLL rLG & aVT mEMBERS!\n\n aT lAST i wANT tO gREET aLL mY uSERS oN mY oWN bBS!\n\n=========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node bETA!!! "i`AM lOOKING fOR bETA tESTER`S !!!"\n\n        /\_____________  ______/\_  _______  /\____________________\n=======/  /    \_____  \/     /  /\/  /    \/__/    \       /     /\======\n   S M/  /  ___  /  /  /  /  /  /_/  /  /  /  /  /  / _____/  /  / /iS a\n     /  /  / ___/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  __/\/  /  / /  /X\n    /  /  /  /\/  /  /  /  /  / /  /  /  /  /  /  /  /\_\/  /  / /xIM dOOR\n    \____/__/ /_____/_____/_______/__/__/__/__/__/__/ / /_____/ /\n=====\___\__\/\_____\_____\_______\__\__\__\_____\__\/  \_____\/==[v1.30]=\n\n                      sEARCHING fOR bETA tESTER`S !!!\n\n  i nEED fOR mY dOORS sOME bETA tESTERS fOR tESTING tHE dOORS iN /X2.xx\n  aND sIGMA-eXPRESS ! bECAUSE mY bOARD rUNS wITH rEGISTRED /X3.xx, sO i\n                cAN`T tEST tHE dOORS oN /X2.xx vERSIONS yET !\n\n            iF yOU aRE iNTRESTED tHEN cALL tHE cARRIER iN sPACE!!\n         yOU cAN gET tHE nUMBER oN aN aLL rLG/aVT mEMBERSHIP bOARDS,\n                     oR oN oNE oF tHE bETA-tEST bOARDS!\n\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node bOARDS! "gET iN tOUCh wITH tHIS..."\n\n==========================================================================\n        ___________________           _________ _________\n      _/                   \_________|         |         l___\n      \_         |         _/        |         |         ___/______\n   /\\-|                   |         |         |         |         |-//\\n -\\/  |         |         !         |         |         l         |  \//-\n       l_________|         l___________________l_________          |\n                 `---------''                         ÷tC÷`---------''\n                       aVANTGARDE bOARDS rIGHT nOW:\n                 _                   _              _\n .---------------\\------------------\\-------------\\------------------.\n ! sEAQUEST       \\  aVANTGARDE wHQ  \\  tHE cROW   \\ +49-gET-iT!!    !\n ! lUNATIC aSYLUM  \\  aVT-lEADER hQ!  \\  kNUCKLES   \\ +49-gET-iT!!   !\n ! cARRIER iN sPACE \\  aVANTGARDE eHQ  \\  sHADOW mAN \\ +49-gET-iT!!  !\n ! vIRTUAL eNERGY    \\  aVANTGRADE gHQ  \\  vADIUM     \\ +49-gET-iT!! !\n `--------------------\\------------------\\-------------\\-------------''\n                        \                   \              \\n==========================================================================\n@endnode\n@node jOIN!!! "aND nOW tAKE tIME tO jOIN tHE sPACE pOWER !"\n  \n      _________   /\   _________ ________ _/\__ _______  _________\n_ _ _/         \_/  \_/         \_       \____/        \_         \_ _ _\n \ \\_    l_____/ oo \_    l_____/  l_____/   |    l____/    l_____// /\n     |    |____/      |    |   |    |    |    |    ___)_|    |\n     !    |    |  /\  !    |   !    |    !    !    ¦    !    |\n     l____     |      l____|   l____|    l____l____     l____|\n          \____| `---)   \       _ _ _/\__ _______ \____|\n           /              \       \ \\____|       \_ _ _    aVANTGARDE eHQ\n          /________________\          |   |   |   _// /      rELIGION eHQ  \n                   