INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('bk_bossp','BK-BOSSP.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/BK-BOSSP.LHA',NULL,'XIM','_|__  ___  __|_ |__/_ ___ ____ __ __ ___  2F',NULL,NULL,'BK','l___)(___|(___/ |   /(___||   ''| | /(___| -. .------------------------------------------'' |              P r e s e n t s',replace('_|__  ___  __|_ |__/_ ___ ____ __ __ ___  2F\nl___)(___|(___/ |   /(___||   ''| | /(___| -.\n.------------------------------------------''\n|              P r e s e n t s\n`------------------------------------------.\n BossPatch v1 for use with Bosstop Weekly! |  \n                                           |\n   Small /X util to add "Last Week''s Top   |\n     Uploader" to your weektop output.     |\n   Also option to use PC ANSI in output.   |\n- - --- -----------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'Hiztory.Txt',replace('[0m[0 pINSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('bk_bull','BK-BULL.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/BK-BULL.LHA','BuLLCReaToR','XIM','BuLLCReaToR',NULL,'(Mystic/X-DeSign)','BK','+---/    \ \/ / __/_  __/ / __/------------+ |--/ / / /\  /\  /-/ /-/ / /---Siegel------| |--\/ / /-/ /\  /-/ /-/ /\ \-----MsT-------|',replace('     ______  __________________             \n+---/    \ \/ / __/_  __/ / __/------------+\n|--/ / / /\  /\  /-/ /-/ / /---Siegel------|\n|--\/ / /-/ /\  /-/ /-/ /\ \-----MsT-------|\n+---\/\/--\/--\/--\/--\/--\/------X-DeSign-+\n|      BullCreator V1.0 for Bytekiller     |\n|        written by (Mystic/X-DeSign)      |\n`------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'BULLCREATOR.GUIDE',replace('@database Bullcreator.guide\n\n@node Main "BullCreator V1.0 - /X uTiL WRiTTeN BY SieGeL/MsT"\n\n            /\____________.__  _______________________   ________\n           /   ._.____    |  \/    ________ _     /___)_/   .___/\n         _/    | |    \___.   \____.   \_|   \___/          |______\n         \     | |     /  |    /   |    /|    |  |   ____   ¦     /\n          \ ___l_l___ /______ /_______ / |    |  l___ | \________/\n           \/       \/      \/       \/  l____|      \!·A×E·\n \n                              (MYSTiC/X-DeSiGN) \n\n                  iS BaCK WiTH aNoTHeR PRoDuCTioN CaLLeD :\n                                   \n                     BK-BuLLCReaToR V1.00 BY SieGeL/MST\n\n	  		       @{" INTRODUCTION " LINK INTRODUCTION}\n			       @{" REQUIREMENTS " LINK REQUIREMENTS}\n			       @{" INSTALLATION " LINK INSTALLATION}\n			       @{"GREETZ&ADVERTS" LINK GREETINGS}\n\n                         DoCFiLe WRiTTeN BY SieGeL/MST\n@endnode\n\n@node INTRODUCTION "WHaT DiZ iS...;)"\n\n                              iNTRoDuCTioN\n                              ~~~~~~~~~~~~\nWell, if U are using ByteAndi''s BYTEKILLER, U should know that BK (means \nBytekiller !) create a datafile for every conference. This datafile \ncontains all nuked users...and with BK U could take a look to this data-\nfile after "nuking" something...but this list is not sorted, and don''t \nlook very nice...another problem : U must have access to BK to take a \nlook to this list...that means : no access = no list..with BK-BuLLCReaToR \nit''s now possible to create Bulletins for every datafile from BK and \nthis list could be shown to all users....sorted by the amount of faked \nBytes and displays at the end the total number of faked Files & Bytes ! \n\n@endnode\n\n@node REQUIREMENTS "WHaT U NeeD 2 RuN iT!"\n\n                             ReQuiReMeNTS\n                             ~~~~~~~~~~~~\nU need...\n\n o a full working /X 3.xx \n o ByteAndi''s ByteKiller with "CREATEDATA" option switched to on\n o the "confconfig.info" Icon\n \n      NOTE:To run this Tool correctly, you must have a drawer called \n           "DOORS:BYTEKILLER/BULLS/", if not, no Bulls where created !\n\n@endnode\n\n@node INSTALLATION "HoW 2 iNSTaLL iT..."\n\n                            iNSTaLLaTioN\n                            ~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nMake sure to create a drawer called BULLS in yar DOORS:BYTEKILLER/drawer !\nHere U can find the created bulls l8er...\n\nNote:BULLCREATOR creates the Bulls under the following filename:\n     BULL<nr>.TXT , where <nr> is the number of the conference from which\n     the list comes.(sorry for my poor english, but ICH BIN EIN BERLINER!:)\n\nCreate a BullFile under the following Filename:\nBULL<nr>.TXT, <nr> is the number for the call from /X. In this file put the\nfollowing two lines :\n\n*** CUT HERE ***\n~\n~SS_DOORS:BYTEKILLER/BULLS/BULL<nr>.TXT\n*** CUT HERE ***\n\n<nr> is the number of the Bull..blabla...i don''t believe that u are to \nsilly to understand the installation...if so,forget it...:)\n\nFor every Conference you would like to have the bull, you must repeat the \nstep shown above...\n\nAt last, add to ur logoffbatch the following line:\n\n BULLCREATOR <BBSLOCATION> <CONFERENCE> <CONFERENCE>...\n \n<BBSLOCATION> is a valid path to your BBS-Main Directory where BuLLCReaToR \ncan find ur CONFCONFIG.INFO,i.e. BBS: or DH1:BBS/...from this Icon \nBuLLCReaToR get the conferencenames.\n\n<CONFERENCE> are the number(s) for the conferences you whish to create \nbulletins for...here u could enter as many numbers as u want...\n\nA valid call for BuLLCReaToR will be i.e.:\n\n          BuLLCReaToR BBS: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 \n\nThis will create Bulls for the confs 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9 ...easy i think..:)\n\nIf a datafile not exist the requested bulletin wouldn''t be created...\n\nThat''s all I think...:)) enjoy it...\n\n@endnode\n\n@node GREETINGS "LaST BuT NoT LeaST..."\n\n\n                         ·  :                 .     :     :\n -============-   \____ ¬V ¬V___ ¬V___ ¬V___ ¬V ¬|  |___ ¬| MANAGEMENT\n  MYSTIC           | ¬|  |  | ¬|  | ¬|  | ¬|  |  |  | ¬|  | -========-\n       GHQ         |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | ANDi/MST\n -============-    |  |  |  |     |    _|  |  |  |__|  |  | SPY/MST\n                   |  |  |  |  |  |  | ¬|  |  |  | ¬|  |  | FELDMAN\n -ELiTE oNLY-      |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | FuZzY/MsT\n                   |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | SYSTEM\n CALL US NoW FoR   |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | -====-\n THE NEWEST AMiGA/ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | RUNS oN A3000\n PCSTUFF           |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | WiTH 25MHZ AND\n AND ALL MST-      |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | AMiEX (REG.)\n RELEASES.         |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n                 __|_____A__A__A__A_____A_____A_____A_____| SUPPoRTET BY\n WE oNLY ACCEPT    |     :  :     :     :     :     :D!   | -==========-\n 9600 - 16.800     :     ·  .     .           .     ·     : M Y S T I C\n BAUD CoNNECTS.    .        .                                      \n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),'{"ACCESS":"no"}','auto-added',16720,2,0,NULL,NULL,'bk_bull','scan',1780048428);
