n school-work conference for people tired of homework! [»«]\n                     [«»] online for over 1 year [«»]\n                        [»«] telnet available [»«]\n                    [«»] no aminet allowed inside [«»]\n\n   grotesticle whq · digital corruption nhq · jormas nhq · megastyle hq\n\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',86107,3,0,NULL,NULL,'bk_up1','scan',1780048428);
