 "Intro"} .............. What is the purpose of this Door?\n    @{b}2.@{ub} @{" Copyright      " Link "Copy"} .......................... Copyright Information\n    @{b}3.@{ub} @{" Requirements   " Link "Req"} ............................ What do you need ??\n    @{b}4.@{ub} @{" Installation   " Link "Install"} ................... How to install LzxStrip v1.2\n    @{b}5.@{ub} @{" History        " Link "History"} .............................. Back to the Roots\n    @{b}6.@{ub} @{" Greetings      " Link "Greetings"} ............................. Personal Greetings\n    ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n                   @{b}@{i}Lzx Strip v1.2@{ub} is a Cellblock 4 Release.@{ui}\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Intro" "Introduction"\n @{b}1. Introduction of this Door...@{uu}@{ub}\n\nI know you are boried reading Documents, but this Time keep on \nReading, please !\n\nThis is not ONE Lzx Strip Utility !! ... This is the FASTEST around !\n\n- 100% new Lzx Strip Routines !! ... Really !!\n- 100% Arexx made\n- Smaller and faster than all other Lzx Strip Doors (COMPARE!)\n- Better FAST than NICE ;-) ...\n- Not only CLI (/X,/F,DD,C-NET,...)\n- One part of Strip`n`add TNG !!\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Copy" "Copyright"\n\n @{b}2. Copyright information of Lzxstrip v1.2@{uu}@{ub}\n\nThis program is Strip`n`add Ware ... When you use it, then register\nStrip`n`add by sending an E-Mail to : [email removed]\n\n - Whole Stuff of Lzxstrip v1.2 by xXxXxXx / Cb4! \n\n - Guide changed from the one by Shallow/Slt \n\n - Lzx © Data Compression Technologies\n\n If you find any errors or have any ideas for making this program better,\n please drop me a message at @{"www" Link "www"} or by E-Mail.\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "www" "You can contact me on the following boards..."\n\n @{b} You can reach me on that WWW Site...@{uu}@{ub}\n\n                http://come.to/gmx          \n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Req" "What do you need ?"\n\n @{b}3.Requirements... @{uu}@{ub}\n\n\n You need the following to run Lzxstrip v1.2\n\n - an Amiga !\n \n - Os 2.o4+ or higher!\n\n - Running RexxMast!\n\n - Rexxsupport.library in Libs\n\n - Rexxtricks.library in Libs\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Install" "How to install Lzxstrip v1.2"\n\n @{b}4. How to install Lzxstrip v1.2@{uu}@{ub}\n\n- just copy the three file (EXE,STRIP,GUIDE) to any Location you want!\n\n  Thats all ... No more assigns are needed!\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "History" "Program history"\n\n @{b}5. Lzxstrip history...@{uu}@{ub}\n\n v1.o   - First public release.\n\n v1.1	- Second public release.\n	  Now recognizes if there is a LZX file or not ... (simple!)\n\n v1.2	- Third really new release.\n	  Hmmm not changed that much.. just updated a little! :)\n\n@EndNode\n\n\n\n\n@Node "Greetings" "Personal greetings"\n\n @{b}6. Greetings...@{uu}@{ub}\n\n @{b}I would like to thank all Guys who have ever heard my Name !@{ub}\n\n @{b}Group Greeting went to :@{ub}\n    \n   - Cellblock 4\n\n   - Shelter\n\n   - Hellfire\n\n   - Digital Corruption\n\n   - Intellect\n\n   - Mystic\n\n@EndNode\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',23204,1,0,NULL,NULL,'cb4_ls12','scan',1780048435);
