INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('cb4_st13','CB4!ST13.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/CB4!ST13.LHA','DMSDescript','XIM','DMSDescript','1.3','xXxXxXx/Cb4!','CB4','[------------------------------------------] THE BEST MULTISYSTEM CHECKER/STRIPPER/ADDER/ IDSTRIPPER/IDADDER IN THE AMIGA SCENE !!!!!!',replace('[42;34mStrip`n`Add T·N·G [35mv1.30m[44;32m `98 by xXxXxXx/Cb4![0m[32m\n[44;32m[------------------------------------------][0m[32m\n[0mTHE BEST MULTISYSTEM CHECKER/STRIPPER/ADDER/[32m\n[0mIDSTRIPPER/IDADDER IN THE AMIGA SCENE !!!!!![32m\n[0mWAIT FOR SOME REFRESHING NEWS SOON! :)\n[0mTO GET REGGED WRITE TO:[[email removed][32m\n\n[0mNOW W/ ULTRA COOL BBS DESIGN & RAMCOPY FUNC.[32m\n[44;32m[-[Version: 1.3]--------------[06.06.1998]-][0m[32m\n[0m\n','\n',char(10)),'sTRIP_n_aDD.guide',replace('@database Strip`n`add\n@master Strip_n_Add:sTRIP_n_aDD.guide\n@$VER: Documentation v1.3 (06.06.98)"\n@author "FLASH/CB4!"\n@remark Created with Heddley v1.1 (c) Edd Dumbill 1994\n\n@node "Main" "Strip`n`add TNG v1.3 by The Flash / Cellblock 4"\n   _____   _____   ____    ____    ____    ____    _____  _____   _____\n _/  __/ _/  __/ _/  _/  _/  _/  _/ __/_ _/  _/  _/ _/  |/  __/ _/ ___/\n |  /   \|-sHO!¯\|   |¯¯\|   |¯¯\|  \__ \|   |¯¯\|  |   |  /   \|  |  \\n l_______l_______l_______l_______l_______l_______l______l_______l__|   \\n  [ @{i}@{bg fill}fLASH/cB4!@{ui}@{bg back} ]                                       [ f·O·U·R ] l____\\n  .            »·[ @{u}@{bg shine}sTRIP`n`aDD tHE nEXT gENERATION v1.3@{uu}@{bg back} ]·«\n  |\n  `-- -- -- [ @{"iNTRODUCTION" link "Intro" 0} ] -- --.                         .-- -- --»\n                                  |                         |\n                                  `-- -- [ @{"cOPYRIGHT" link "Copy" 0} ] -- --''\n\n .-- [ @{"hISTORY" link "History" 0} ] -- -- [ @{"iNSTALLATION" link "Install" 0} ] -- -- [ @{"rEQUIREMENTS" link "Req" 0} ] -- --«\n |\n `-- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- [ @{"gREETINX" link "Greetings" 0} ] -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- --»\n\n                 **NOW WITH INTELLIGENT RAMCOPY FUNCTION**\n\n                    TEST : ATS-DRAG.DMS : 907422 Bytes\n                   ------------------------------------\n                  WITH RAMCOPY : 09 Seconds (all enabled)\n               WITHOUT RAMCOPY : 48 Seconds (all enabled)\n\nResult : When you have more than 4 MB of FastRAM then you should enable RAMCOPY\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Intro" "Introduction"\n @{b}1. Introduction of this Door...@{ub}@{uu}\n\nI know you are bored of reading Documents, but this time keep on Reading, please!\n\nStrip`n`Add Features :\n\n- strip LHA/LZX/DMS/TXT/!!!ZIP!!! Archives\n\n- add random adverts (unlimited random adverts), but only -2- in yar Archive\n  ( STOP DA FLOOD OF ADDYS )\n\n- the RANDOM ADVERT ROUTINE MIXES 2 RANDOM FILES FROM ADDYZ/ AND \n  STRIP_N_ADD.NAMES AND COPIES IT TO THE ARCHIVE !!!\n\n- add Special FileID Adverts (Randomly) !!\n\n- add Date and Time to File ID (XX-XXX-XXXX,@@:@@:@@)\n\n- stripping FILE_ID Adverts ( using IDStrip )\n\n- check your LHA/LZX/DMS/ZIP Archives\n\n- Cool & Fast ZIP Routines\n\n- X-Tra File Information Adding\n\n- New(!) Keyfile Function ! \n\n- All Strip Routines were programmed by me !!\n\n- very cool Board Design 100% made by me !\n\n- now Intelligent RAM COPY Mode !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n\nSo ... Use This Proggy And Have Phun ! ( U.T.P.A.H.P )\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Copy" "Copyright"\n\n @{b}2. Copyright information of Strip`n`add TNG@{ub}@{uu}\n\n This program is E-Mail Ware ... When you use it, register\n Strip`n`add by sending an E-Mail to : [email removed]\n\n xXxXxXx^cB4! better known as fLASH^cB4! :)\n\n If you like sending me Money, then contact me via E-Mail before!\n\n@node "Req" "What do you need ?"\n\n @{b}3.Requirements... @{ub}@{uu}\n\n You need the following to run Strip`n`add TNG\n\n - an Amiga !\n - Os 2.o4+ or higher!\n - Running RexxMast!\n\nYou need the following Programs :\n\n- iDSTRIP  ( by [tHE dENTiST!]/iNT''96^hF )  - included! \n- mApUs    ( by Eniac`94! )                 - included! \n- snatchdiz( by rASCAL/HELLFiRE )           - included! \n- textdiz                                   - included!\n-dmsdescript( by Re/Y\o(/Y\ystic/X-DeSign) )- included! \n- LHA      ( by Stefan Boberg )             - not included! \n- LZX      ( by Data Compression Technologies )- not included! \n- ZIP      ( by Mark Adler )                - not included! \n- UNZIP    ( by S. H. Smith )               - not included!\n\nin your C: Directory\n\nYou need the following Librarys :\n\n- rexxtricks.library ( Version 38.6 )                - included!\n- rexxsyslib.library ( Version 36.23 )               - not included!\n\nin your LIBS: Directory\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Install" "How to install Strip`n`add TNG"\n\n @{b}4. How to install Strip`n`add TNG v1.3@{ub}@{uu}\n\n- copy all included Files in their Directories !\n\n- assign STRIP_N_ADD: to the Directory you have installed STRIP_N_ADD !!\n  ( WITHOUT ASSIGN, IT WON`T WORK! )\n\n- Edit the File : sTRIP_n_aDD.sTRIP/lzx/zip ( that are the Adverts the program\n  strips\n  out of the lha/lzx/zip archives ) \n\n- Edit the File : sTRIP_n_aDD.nAMES => you can add unlimited filenames\n  to this file!\n\n- Change the Adverts in the Directory "aDDYZ/" to addy.1, addy.2, addy.3, ...\n\n- Edit the File : sTRIP_n_aDD.aDDiD for FileID Advert! (unlimited File.Id`s!)\n  (XX-XXX-XXXX stands for DATE!! and @@:@@:@@ stands for TIME!!)\n\n- Edit the Files "sTRIP_n_aDD.aDDfRONT" and "sTRIP_n_aDD.aDDtAIL" when you want!\n  But don`t forget to keep the first 2 Lines free !\n\n- Edit the Config File ! ( NO/YES ) - It`s self-explaining!\n\n- Install it in your favourite BBS Programm, e.g. DAYDREAM, /X, FAME, C-NET ...\n  Or simply use it in CLI!\n  NOTE : DAYDREAM / C-NET / CLI DOES BEST !\n\n  sTRIP_n_aDD {fILE}\n\n- E-Mail me !!! ( Address : [email removed] )\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "History" "Program history"\n\n @{b}5. Strip`n`add history...@{ub}@{uu}\n\nV1.0        -        Internal Beta, only test!\n\nV1.1        -        dito\n\nV1.5        -        now wiz lzx strip ( by [tHE dENTiST!]/iNT''96^hF )\n\nV1.6        -        File ID Advert in Progress\n\nV1.7        -        betta output ...\n\nV2.0        -        1. real Release :\n\n                Now wiz FULL LZX & DMS Support\n                Can now add FileID Advert\n                fast and cool!\n\nV2.1    -        2. Release :\n                \n                Source twice as big as V2.0\n                Much Advantages ...\n                Better FileID Performance\n                "-?" for Help !! (?)\n                Error Codes added !\n                End-Line added ...\n                Now faster ...\n\nV2.5        -        Not Released\n                Removed some Bugs ...\n                Added File_ID Stripping\n                Added File_ID_Adding in DMS Archives\n                 V3.0 TURBO        3. Release\n                Speeed UP!\n                Added TXT / NFO / DOC / DOK Advert Adding and Stripping of ID`S\n                Source CODE now : >8kb !\n                V2.0 -> 2kb\n                V2.1 -> 4kb\n                Much betta Progress Indicator Look !\n                New File_ID ... with ANSI codez ..\n                cooler OUTPUT ...\n                SECRET Message included ... try to find it in one of the\nfollowing\n                Releases ... ;-) hehehe\n\nV3.1 TURBO        4. Release\n                Implemented ZIP Archive Support ( NOW MULTI ARCHIVE TOOL!! )\n                TXT/NFO/DOC/DOK File ID Adding ...\n                Source CODE now : >11kb !\n                Removed da Registered to : NOBODY ;-( ...\n                USED betta Compression ...\n                SOME BUGZ removed ...\n\nV3.2 TURBO        5. Release\n                More cool Things implemented !\n\nV3.3 TURBO        6. Release\n                TXT Adding Bug Removed ;-)\n\nV3.5 TURBO      7. Release\n                X-Tra File Information Adding added ...\n                100+++ Bugz removed\n                Faster Ansi Sequences (thx Fli7e)\n                Now with real LHA/LZX/ZIP/DMS Checking ...\n                Aborts directly when Error appears in Checking!\n                -? to ? changed\n                Source now over 12kb\n                Strip File optimized and updated\n                Test Routines optimized\n                "Registered" now in Variable\n                Nearly Undeleteable File generated with Information Adding!\n                ZIP adding Fixed (now without Dir : Addyz)\n                Text File adding now with headline (with date)\n\nV4.0 TURBO        8. Release\n                Major Bug fixed !!!!!! (skipped Adding of Advert!)\n                Outfit (Ansi) changed !!! ... (DON`t RIP!!)\n                Text File Header Adding now with 2 Information Lines!\n                Now with cool Information File Adding ! Try to strip ;-)\n                100% fixed Adding Routines !\n                Stripfile Updated & Optimized\n                etc...\n\nV4.1 TURBO        9. Release\n                No Bugs fixed ;-)\n                Now Strip`n`Add adds 2 Adds (from you) - with special \n                advertizing!\n                Now with Information !\n                700% Speed Update in Text Adding Routines !\n                Now with Keyfile Technologie !! ... To get your Keyfile write\n                to : [email removed]\n                When no File_Id.Diz found, the program won`t add \n                or strip the id!\n\nV4.2 TURBO        10. Release\n                Major Bug fixed in the Adding Routine !\n\nV4.3 TURBO      11. Release\n                Faster Keyfile System written !!!\n\nV5.0 TURBO        12. Release\n                Now really E-Mail Ware !\n                Please Register when you don`t want the "UNREGISTERED VERSION"\n                Scrolling ! ;)\n                Many bugs determinated !\n                Now with Cool BBS Design (Optional!!!) - See "?" Page\n\nV5.1 TURBO        13. Release (wow!)\n                One hard adding bug removed!\n                Adding Routine completely new re-written !!!\n                Now you can take unlimited names to unlimited adds!!!!\n                Now with Archive Directory Adding !!\n                X-Tra File Adding improved !!\n                BBS Design Routine fixed ! please write "bbs" or "BBS" but \n                don`t write "bBS" or "bbS" ...\n\nV6.0 TURBO        14. Release (ya can`t stop me!)\n                Now with Random Id Adding !!!\n                Faster Id Adding on all Archives\n                Now with X-treme fast Special Adding at DMS Archive\n                (ENABLE IT NOW!) ;-)\n                Some mini Bugs (hopefully) removed !\n                Now with Date & Time Adding in File ID!\n                All Bugs with ZIP removed\n                Says Last Changes at Prompt\n                Minor Style changes\n                etc ... try it!!        \n\nV6.1 TURBO        Not Released Internal Version \n                The Keyfile Function has been totally rewritten and now\n                it is Ready to go ... So when you are regged, you will\n                receive the new Keyfile, when not you must send me an\n                E-Mail : [email removed]\n                Today i`m working on an BBS Registering System for\n                Daydream, so when you are a Daydream Sysop, just write\n                me with the upper E-Mail Address, and I will send you\n                the Keyfile Generating System for yar BBS ! ...\n                You are not allowed to give your Keyfile Generating\n                System anyone else, say him that he must write me an\n                E-mail to order that system!\n\nV6.2 TURBO        15. Release (ist das nicht coool ??)\n                Removed Bugs in LHA Structure File Id Stripping\n                Removed Bugs in LZX Structure File Id Stripping\n                Changed "?" and normal Design\n                Changed the Output, now it writes all the Lines directly\n                under the Main "Strip`n`add..." Text!\n                Speeded up the DMS Routines...\n                Added LZXStrip.banner !\n                Improved DMS Mapus Adding File ;-)\n                Removed little nasty Bug in ZIP Adding ....\n                X-tra File Adding improved !!\n\nV6.3 TURBO        16. Release ( Major Update Release )\n                Now with own LZX Strip Routines ( delete c:lzxstrip )\n                Now with excellent ZIP Strip Routines !!!\n                Removed Bug with Keyfile Handling\n                Speed Update 20% at Stripping (LZX)                \n                Just cooler !\n\nTNG V1.0          17. Release (Just another Tool!)\n                Now with total changed Design\n                Better for Usage in Boardz!\n                It looks great now, Design 100% made by me !\n		Taste the Difference !\n		Improved adding from LZX/LHA/ZIP ...\n		With new Function called RAMCOPY, it copys File to\n		RAM before it gets stripped !!\n		Just look at the Begin for RAMCOPY Test !!\n		Removed some little Lines from Code !\n\nTNG V1.1	  18. Release (waited too long?)\n		some small Bugs removed\n		Speed Improvement = 2%!\n		New cool Adding in Archive (Just look!)\n		[Only in LHA Archives!] - Others don`t work!\n		Deutsche Nachricht: Der eine hat`s - der andere nicht!\n\nTNG V1.2	  19. Release (back again - i never give up!)\n		Finally the last two bugs has been removed\n		1. too short File Bug\n		2. File_Id.Diz Bug \n		Improved Adding (intern)\n		some little Dezign changes\n\nTNG V1.3	  20. Release (maybe the Step to a new Future!)\n		Just install this new updated Version and wait for\n		the ultimative Pleasure! :)\n		Ram Copy Mode extended! It`s now really intelligent!\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Greetings" "Personal greetings"\n\n @{b}6. Greetings...@{ub}@{uu}\n\n \n                    Greetingz went to (random Order) :\n\n                        ALL WHO EVER HEARD OF ME !\n                                    ;)\n\n@endnode\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',119214,17,0,NULL,NULL,'cb4_st13','scan',1780048435);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('cbd_add','CBD-ADD.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/CBD-ADD.LHA','Cyber-Add','XIM','Cyber-Add',NULL,'grYzor','CBD','|     ____/_.|  ____/____ .\_______ /__ . |    /      ||  \______  \_       /    \_ . |   /       ||        /   /      /      /',replace('. .__________  ._______      __________\n  |     ____/_.|  ____/____ .\_______ /__\n. |    /      ||  \______  \_       /    \_\n. |   /       ||        /   /      /      /\n: l___________|l___________/l____________/¡\n¦                                     ©gZ!¦\n`-=-==-[ Cyber-Adder (w) by grYzor ]-==-=-''\n· One of the fastest text-adders ever!\n· Have a look at this!\n[size of file] - [AquaAdder] - [CyberAdder]\n[   1.5 mb   ] - [ 47 secs ] - [  8 secs  ]\n[   500 k    ] - [ 18 secs ] - [2.5-3 secs]\n\n-=- Why use anything less then the BEST -=-\n','\n',char(10)),'Cyber-Add.doc',replace('_  _ __ ___________ _______________________________________ _______ ___ __ _  _\n__  ________ ______/¬_______ _______ _______ _______ ______/¬____  /¬_______\n  \\\_____ ¬\__   / ______ ¬\_____ ¬\_____ ¬\_____ ¬\__   / ____¬\/ ______ ¬\_\n     /   /___/   /   /  _  __/   /___/  _  __/   /   /   /   /  \ \  /   /___//\n    /   /   /\___   /   /  \/  ___/_/   /  \/   /   /\___   /   /\  /  ___/_\n   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /\n  /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   /\n /___    /___    /___    /___    /___/   /___    /___    /___/   /___    /\n    /___/   /___/   /___/   /___/   /___/   /___/   /___/   /   /kRm/___/\n                                                           /___/_\n                                                              /\n                 Cyber-Add may be freely distributed as long\n                 as the archive contents remains unmodified.\n\n[ Cyber-Add v1 ] Written by grYzor / CyberDyne\n\nIncluded files.\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nC/Cyber-Add               6620\nC/Cyber-Add.doc            137\nS/Cyber-Tailer.txt        1472\nS/Cyber-Header.txt        1494\nBBS/FCheck/TXT.info        522\n\nFast? Faster? Fastest?\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nI don''t claim this to be the fastest txt-adder ever, but DO check this out.\nFirst, i''ll show some choosen lines from AquaAdder''s doc file :\n- ''It is very FAST - as fast as a text adder can be!! Maybe even faster...''\n\nI took a 1.5mb and a 500k text file, and compared. I couldn''t get a accurate\ntime differance with Cyber-Adder on smaller files.\n\n                        [ Cyber-Adder vs. AquaAdder ]\n             [ size of file ] -- [ AquaAdder ] -- [ Cyber-Adder ]\n             [    1.5 mb    ] -- [  47 secs  ] -- [   8 secs    ]\n             [    500 k     ] -- [  18 secs  ] -- [ 2.5-3 secs  ]\n\nAgain, i quote from the documentation of AquaAdder :\n- ''It is very FAST - as fast as a text adder can be!! Maybe even faster...''\n\nYeah right.. very FAST... Some simple math reveals that my adder is *6 times\nfaster then AquaAdder. And AquaAdder is a common adder on swedish bbs''s.\nI used my 030 50mhz for this test, ofcuz the numbers will differ depending\non yer processor, but my adder will always be *6 times faster.\nWhy use anything less then the best?\n\nRequirements.\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nPut yer addys in the s: drawer, and name them ''S:Cyber-Header.txt'' and\n''S:Cyber-Tailer.txt''...\nIf the file can''t be squeezed into yer mem, tough luck. You wont get yer\nso badly wanted comercial added to the file. You won''t get this problem\nwith more then 2mb of free mem. If the tailer/header can''t be located in the\nS: drawer, you won''t get an annoying error message, it simply won''t add it\nto the file.\n\n                                                                - [ grYzor ] -\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',7141,2,0,NULL,NULL,'cbd_add','scan',1780048435);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('cbd_qt10','CBD-QT10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/CBD-QT10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','User Quest (Questions on 1st logon)',NULL,NULL,'CBD',NULL,replace('User Quest (Questions on 1st logon)\n','\n',char(10)),'reference-board.txt',replace(replace('              W h e r e   t h e   w a r e z   c o m e   f r o m\r\n                                               __                /\_____:\r\n__/\__________________________________________|  \______________/  \    |__\r\n\_   ___________  _______ ________  \__   ___ |   _______  _______  \_  l  \\r\n__\____  \    _l   \    |  \     |___/     |  !    \   _l   \   _| __/\____ \_\r\n\_____    \___\     \___|   \___ !   \__   |_____   \__\     \__\    \____   /\r\n -mNT\_____/---\_____/--l____/-\______/\   |----\____/--\_____/--\____/--\__/\r\n                                        \__|\r\n\r\n- -- --> F A i R L i G H T   S W E D i S H   H E A D Q U A R T E R S <-- -- -\r\n\r\n           reference-board is back 2017 after more than 20 years in coma!\r\n\r\n                        Running on AmiExpress TelNet\r\n\r\n                    Connect to: reference-board.zapto.org:1541\r\n\r\n                    or: www.brysk.se/reference-board/index.htm\r\n               \n              UPLOAD DATE: 01-04-18  TIME: 19:08:15  ON NODE: 1\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,1668,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048435);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('cbd_sec','CBD-SEC.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/CBD-SEC.LHA','Cyber-Security','XIM','. .__________  ._______      __________',NULL,'grYzor','CBD','|     ____/_.|  ____/____ .\_______ /__ . |    /      ||  \______  \_       /    \_ . |   /       ||        /   /      /      /',replace('. .__________  ._______      __________\n  |     ____/_.|  ____/____ .\_______ /__\n. |    /      ||  \______  \_       /    \_\n. |   /       ||        /   /      /      /\n: l___________|l___________/l____________/¡\n¦                                     ©gZ!¦\n`-=-=[ Cyber-Security (w) by grYzor ]==-=-''\n· The ultimate security solution for /X!\n· If yer running a bbs, check this out!\n','\n',char(10)),'bull.txt',replace('~\n~CC_SEC\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,10606,1,0,NULL,NULL,'cbd_sec_cyber_security','scan',1780048435);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('cd_dl','CD-DL.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/CD-DL.LHA','SearchMsg','XIM','CD_DL (Rioter Tools)',NULL,'hYBRID!','CD','Requested a-g-e-s ago by hYBRID! Alright m8!',replace('CD Rom Download and Msg base Search for /X\nRequested a-g-e-s ago by hYBRID! Alright m8!\n','\n',char(10)),'CD_DL.DOC',replace('-------------------------------------------------------------[ INTRODUCTION ]--\n\nCD DOWNLOAD v2.0 by RIOTER/EQUINOX 1994\n\n	As i''ve got a CDTV connect to my a3000 i wanted to use it as a \nCDRom for my BBS. But after edited 99 Tooltypes i found out that Ami-Express\ndid not support CD rom at all and i decided to code my own little util for it.\n\nI Thank Agamemnon/Moment 22 for insperation and ideas.\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------[ REQUIREMENTS ]--\n\n- AMIGA\n- CDROM\n- AMIEXPRESS\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------[ INSTALLATION ]--\n\n1. Copy "DOORS/Rioter_Tools/CD_Utils/CD_DL.EXE" to your\n   "DOORS:Rioter_Tools/CD_Utils/CD:DL.EXE"\n\n2. Copy the "BBS/Commands/BBSCmd/CD.info" to your "BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/CD.info"\n\n3. Copy "Libs/AEDoor.library" to "LIBS:AEDoor.Library"\n\n4. Create a filelist with complete paths our your CD and name it "S:FILES1.BBS"\n\n   Open your shell and use this command:\n                  List LFORMAT="%S%S" ALL FILES <dir> >S:FILES1.BBS\n\n\n   EXAMPLE IF YOUR CD IS IN CD0:\n                   List LFORMAT="%S%S" ALL FILES CD0: >S:FILES1.BBS\n\n   EXAMPLE IF YOU RUN PARNET WITH A CDTV/CD32:\n                   List LFORMAT="%S%S" ALL FILES NET:CD0/ >S:FILES1.BBS\n\n\n   I included an example i S: which i use for my EuroScene1 CD with Parnet.\n\n5. In every NODE-Dir (ie. "BBS:Node1/") add a directory called CDTEMP\n   (ie. "BBS:Node1/CDTemp"\n\n6. Add "DELETE BBS:Node1/CDTEMP/#?" in the logoff script for every node.\n   (ie. node2 would be: "DELETE BBS:Node2/CDTEMP/#?")\n\n7. Add the DLPaths in the .info icon for your CD conf.\n   ie.\n       DLPATH.1=BBS:Node0/CDtemp/\n       DLPATH.2=BBS:Node1/CDtemp/\n       DLPATH.3=BBS:Node2/CDtemp/\n       .\n       .\n       .\n       \n--------------------------------------------------------------------[ USAGE ]--\n\nNow you are ready to rock.\n\nWhen you type CD at the main prompt in /X you will be presented a file prompt.\nAfter the filename is typed the door will search S:Files1.BBS for the file\nand if found the user will be prompted if he wants to download it or not.\n\nIf yes the file will be copied from the CD to the CDTemp dir and a fileflag\nwill be set.\n\nA return on a fileprompt will start the Download.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------[ BUGS & REPORTS ]--\n\nI havn''t tested this util very much so there''s probably a couple of annoying\nbugs and stuff in it.\n\nReport the bugs and also your suggestions if you have any to me and it''ll be\nfixed for the next version!\n\n\nI can be found on my board: TOTAL OVERDOSE, or any other major US Board or\nswedish board.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------[ HISTORY ]--\n\nV1.0	Written entirely in Arexx. Filled it purpose but was sloooow!\n	Not Released.\n\nV2.0	Rewritten completely in Assembler.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------[ END ]--\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'XIM-BBSCmd',14224,2,0,NULL,NULL,'cd_dl','scan',1780048435);
