tion   "Link Install}\n  |/::\/::\/::\/::\/:|                @{" !How to Contact! "Link Contact}\n  ¦\::/\::/\::/\::/\:¦\n  : \/  \/  \/  \/  \:\n  ·                  ·\n@endnode\n@node Law\n----[ SPEEDY''S LaW - THE CREDITZ!  ]---------------------------------------\n\n CoDe bY .................................................. SPEEDWOLF/cLe!\n iDeA bY .................................................. SPEEDWOLF/cLe!\n\n\n        ...sOME gREETINX tO mY bEST fRIENDS aND oTHER cOOL gUYS...\n\n       · pSYCHO/cLE! · rENDERMAN/cLe! · mILLE/cLe! · fRAGGLE/cLE! ·\n         · sTARBREAKER/cLe! · kERMIT/cLe! · cHRUSHER/sHINING 8 ·\n · jEFF sTAINE · fACEMAN · jORDAN/5D · vALSHARE/tRSI · dR.bYTE/tHE sMURFS ·\n            · cURE/iLLEGAL! · mAX hEADROOM/tEX · iON pEE/iNDY ·\n         · dELTAFORCE/dELIRIUM · cUSAK/iNDY · bLACK tHUNDER/iNDY ·\n      · cREATOR/rESOLUTION · bREAKER · tURNER/iNDY · tWILIGHT/lEGO! ·\n                     · eXTERMINATOR/rEMEDY · vAMP/iA ·\n\n                   ...aND sOME oTHER I dON''T rEMEMBER...\n\n@endnode\n@node "Intro"\n----[ IntroDuction ]-------------------------------------------------------\n\n Well,this is a very short tool as you might just seen.\n I''ve done this cause of the Question for Ansi on or off when a User \n logs in. Of course there''s QuickAnsi from 5D but if you have an Good BBS \n the most Users will have fast modems and so use Ansi. ANd so i think it''s\n useless for the most sysops! Simply install this Quickie and say bye bye\n to this...\n\n@endnode\n@node "Install"\n----[ Installation ]--------------------------------------------------------\n\n Copy the SysCmd ''ANSI.info'' to your SysCommand Dir and the Contents of\n the DOORS:AnsiSKiP dir included in this package to your Door-Directory!\n\n An'' that''s all...\n\n@endnode\n@node Contact\n\n              To Get MoRe gReaT tOOlS oR 4 CoNtaCt CaLL tHiZ!\n                         ____\n       _ __ ____________/   /______________________________ __ _\n       \\\_\\______   