INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('crx_dl13','CRX-DL13.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/CRX-DL13.LHA','DirLook','XIM','DirLook',NULL,'NIKE','CRX','_____  _ __ ______ __|_   |     ____ . _/   _/___ _____   /    /   |____|   /_ | \    \    |   _/  /.   /    |    .  /  | .',replace('                          ____\n    _____  _ __ ______ __|_   |     ____\n. _/   _/___ _____   /    /   |____|   /_\n| \    \    |   _/  /.   /    |    .  /  | .\n|  \________|___\    |________|____|     | |\n¦ ----- - ----uMn\___|wL! ---- ----|_____|-¦\n:  pRESENTS a nEW dOOR bY NIKE / CRUX ''95! :\n·      DIRLOOK V1.3 - *THE* DIRSTYLER!     ·\n`- -- --- -------------- ---------- --- -- ''\n','\n',char(10)),'DirLook.Guide',replace('@database "dIRLOOK v1.3"\n@font topaz.font 8\n@Node MAIN " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX! "\n@{b}                         ______      _______\n            ____________(______)_____|     |_________.\n            \_______    \_     |    _|  ___|    _____|\n             |     |     |     |    __    \_    ___|___\n             |_____|     |_____|_____|     |_____     |\n                   `-----''           `-----''    `-----''\n@{ub}\n               @{" dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX! " LINK MENY}\n@{b}\n                                          _____\n              _______   _ __ ________ ___|_    |      _____\n            _/     _/____ ______    /     /    |_____|    /_\n            \      \     |    _/   /.    /     |     .   /  |\n             \___________|____\     |__________|_____|      |\n          <-----------------uMn\____|wL!-------------|______|->@{ub}\n@endnode\n@Node MENY " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · mAIN "\n\n                      @{"««   cOPYRiGHt  »»" LINK dlcopy}\n                      @{"««    hISTORY   »»" LINK dlhist}\n                      @{"««   cONTENTS!  »»" LINK dlcont}\n                      @{"««   fEATURES!  »»" LINK dlfeat}\n                      @{"«« iNSTALLATION »»" LINK dlinst}\n                      @{"««   cREDiTS!   »»" LINK dlcred}\n                      @{"««  GREETiNGS!  »»" LINK dlgree}\n                      @{"««  cONTACT mE  »»" LINK dlconc}\n                      @{"««  cRUX iNFO!  »»" LINK crux}\n\n@endnode\n@Node dLcopy " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX /X · cOPYRIGHT "\n\nThis program is (c) 1995 to NIKE/CRUX.\nFreely distributable, anything that screws up your system when using this\nprogram is YOUR fault, and I should not be blamed.\n\n@endnode\n\n@Node dLhist " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · hISTORY"\n\nv1.0 - Released as AUTOFREE. Only free dl on files.\nv1.1 - Released as AUTOFREE. Only free dl on files. Now with bytekillhandler.\nv1.2 - Released as AUTOFREE. Only free dl on files. Now with dirstyling.\nv1.3 - Re-coded from scratch. New design by MARWIC, still the same design in\n       the dir-list.\n       The door can now enter a message to a user (u decide) if the file is\n       a group release etc..\n       Lot''s of optimizing (the old version was kinda slow on jelly 1200''s)\n       This is a totally different program now!\n\n@endnode\n\n@Node dLcont " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · cONTENTS "\n\nThis archive contains a lot of files, but the main files are:\n\nDOORS:DIRLOOK/\n                Dirlook                     9.124 bytes\n                Dirlook.Info                1.036 bytes\n                Dirlook.Cfg                   657 bytes\n                Dirlook.Guide               9.714 bytes\n\n@endnode\n\n@Node dlfeat " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · fEATURES "\n\ndIRLOOK features:\n\n                               @{u}· Dirstyler ·@{uu}\n\n                  Prints out node number, time, and cps.\n  This needs UD_LOG turned on! If the udlog file is not found or is too small\n   it will write LOCAL as CPS. This happens also if you upload locally!\n              (Of course not if the dirstyler is turned off!)\n\n                     @{u}· Bytekillerhandler replacement ·@{uu}\n\n   You dont need to run the handler in the logoff anymore, it takes time\nto check the callerslog/udlog after upload. But dirlook does this while\nthe user uploads.\n\n                               @{u}· Autofree ·@{uu}\n\nDo you hate setting a upload to free download and writing an eall mess\nabout the new release from your own group? Then this is the easiest way of\ndoing it. You simply tells dirlook which ''Group short'' shall be set to\nfree download and then when a user uploads a file from that group, dirlook\nautomatic sets the file to free leech and writing a message to eall (optional)\nwith included file_id and a comment. Minimal risk of forgetting to set your\ngroup(s) releases to free download.\n\n  Written in assembler-optimized Amiga E for maximal speed and minimal size!\n\n@endnode\n@Node dlinst " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · iNSTALLATION "\n\n                Make a directory in @{b}Doors:@{ub} Called "@{b}DIRLOOK@{ub}"\n          Copy the main program and the sample config file there.\n    Edit the config file to suit your needs. Here is the format of it:\n\n-- CUT --\nCRX\n[32m<<<     CRUX! RELEASE! FREE DOWNLOAD!  <<DL![0m\n  CRUX STRiKES BACK WiTH ANOTHER FUNKY RELEASE! FREE DOWNLOAD OF COURSE!\n-- CUT --\n\n  @{b}First row@{ub}: The Group short\n @{b}Second Row@{ub}: If the above row matches the filename then add this line under\n             the filedescription!\n  @{b}Third row@{ub}: If a message is supposed to be written, then add this under the\n             message!\n\nNow go and edit the icon tooltypes too.\n\n- ------- ------------------------------------------------------- ------- -\n@{b}TOOLTYPE:@{ub} DOOR\n@{b}USAGE:@{ub}    Name of the door to start after DirLook is done!\n- ------- ------------------------------------------------------- ------- -\n@{b}TOOLTYPE:@{ub} NAME\n@{b}USAGE:@{ub}    Name of the user (f.ex. EALL) the message about the group releases\n          should be addressed to.\n- ------- ------------------------------------------------------- ------- -\n@{b}TOOLTYPE:@{ub} DIRS\n@{b}USAGE:@{ub}    Switch if the DirStyler is on or off. YES or NO\n- ------- ------------------------------------------------------- ------- -\n@{b}TOOLTYPE:@{ub} ACCESS\n@{b}USAGE:@{ub}    Access to enter an EALL message\n- ------- ------------------------------------------------------- ------- -\n@{b}TOOLTYPE:@{ub} MESSAGE\n@{b}USAGE:@{ub}    Switch. YES or NO. If YES then DirLook will enter an message to\n          <tooltype NAME> if a group release is found.\n- ------- ------------------------------------------------------- ------- -\n\nThe program should be installed as a FILECHECK door.\n\n@endnode\n\n@Node dlgree " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · gREETINGS"\n                                   .\n                 .___     .____ _ _:____©nUp!__ _ _/\_ ____ .__\n              ___|_  \____|_   \___|___/  __|_______ _____/_l_ \_ .\n             /  _l/___/   l/   _/  |_/--\/  |_/--\/ \/  \/   ___/-|- -\n           _/   \_    \_  /     \_ l/    \_ l/    \_     \_  \    |\n           \____.      /_/_______/________/________/______/_______¦\n                `-----/- -                                        :\n                     ·\n sKiZE/lEd        - For this doc and our too-long chats!.. 1988 was the year!\n aGRESSOR/dELiGHT - Hey man, call me someday!\n dEMAX!/dELiGHT   - Your design rules m8! ;)\n sNiPER/iNSANE    - Please stop smileing! It irritates me! ;)\n vEDDER/iNSANE    - Another short hello to you, party-mate!\n xERXES/rAGE      - I will soon crush 1 gig!\n mARWiC/eQUiNOX   - Your design rules too!\n nEPTUNE/oUTLAWS  - F!X will kick ass m8! Call me!\n lOUiE/iNSANE     - How about that CRZ logo you were going to do?\n eXIDOR!          - KOM TILLBAKA!!!!!\n lUSSAR''N/rEBELS  - You are the swedish coder #1!\n oRiGO/c-lOUS     - Don''t know you good, but you keep the swedish scene alive!\n eXOTiC/cRAZE     - Come back!\n sHADE/tRSi       - CAll my board anders!\n aNTiCHRiST/cRZ   - Maybe baby? ;)\n mR rEAL/cRZ      - You''ll win next time!\n mUAD''dIB/rYL     - Talk soon m8!\n mAD mAX/iNS      - Thanx for the support!\n pSYCHE/pRODIGY   - Hi mate, calling you sooon!\n hITPOINT/pRODIGY - Thanx for that cool chat mate! ;)\n fATAL/g-fORCE    - Well, smurf on! No skin-cream please!\n cHROMBACHER/oBS  - I do NOT use skin-cream!\n u-MAN/wHALE      - You are one big dumdidumdi! ;)\n oRCHiD/cRAZE     - SWEDISH WEIGHTLIFTING GOLD! gHA! But you''re so small!\n bETTY bOY/xTD    - Haven''t forgotten you m8!\n nUP/wHALE(?)     - Nuppilainen pissilainen Papperskorgilainen.. h0h0..\n sEVEN /\/\       - Your anims are cool! Italian is not fun! ;)..\n FURY/PRESTIGE    - Hi mate.. Hope ya like this door.. ;)\n cIRCUiT B/dLT    - Hi to you too!! ;)\n\nSorry for the lousy greetings list, i know i have forgotten many important\npersons, but you will just have to complaint! =)\n\n@endnode\n\n@Node dLconc " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · cONTACT mE"\n\n                 INSTANT PLEASURE - +46-510-27660 16k8 DS!\n      Or leave mail on any CRUX or DELIGHT or CRAZE Board worldwide!\n\n@endnode\n\n@Node dLgomd " dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · hIDDEN"\n\n                          Finns inte, syns inte!\n\n@endnode\n\n@NODE dlcred "  dIRlOOK v1.3 bY nIKE/cRUX · cREDiTS"\n\n             Coding, And some Doc writing........ NIKE / CRUX\n             Design ..............................JUAN / TRSI\n             Design (Not Used).................. SHADE / TRSI\n             Design .......................... MARWIC / POSSE\n             This AmigaGuide Doc................. SKIZE / LED\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE crux "  CRUX INFORMATION!!"\n      _____                                                      _____   __\n __  {~._.~}       \\  hIGHER sTATE oF cONSCiOUSNESS //         {~._.~} _\/_\n_\/_--( Y )------------------------------------------------------( Y )--\/\/\n\/\/ ()~*~()                                                    ()~*~()  \n     (_)-(_)                                                    (_)-(_)     \n\n---------- WE ALWAYS SEARCHiNG COOL NEW MEMBERS. CONTACT US !! -------------\n\n\n       -  --  ---(  cALL oUR bULLETiN bOARDS wORLD wiDE  )---  --  -\n\n.---------------------.------------------------------.---------------------.\n: ..........diAL hARD : ....................wORLD HQ : .....+41-735-065-25 :\n: ..........sKY tOWER : .................eUROPEAN HQ : .....+45-748-338-86 :\n: .........cHECKPOiNT : ................nORWEGiAN HQ : .....+47-515-931-23 :\n: .....wEYLAND yUTANi : ....................sWiSS HQ : .....+41-643-734-30 :\n: .......dEEP tHOUGHT : ..................fINLAND HQ : ......+358-pRIVATE! :\n: ................... : ............................ : ................... :\n: sPACE fOR rENT!.... : ........... jUST aSK sHANE ! : .....oN aNY bOARDS !:\n`---------------------^------------------------------^---------------------''\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n        -  --  ---( the ONE`n`ONLY boyz behind CRUX are )---  --  -  \n\n\n        · 243 · bEAST · dEViL & rAVEN · dEXTER · eNZO · FuRY · JMF ·\n\n               · kINGPIN · NiKE · sHANE · sID · sTORM sHADOW ·    \n\n                  · tORMENTOR · tRANCE · tRiViAL · U-MAN ·\n \n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n Greetz to all CRUX lovers! :)\n\n                         ........ cya in our next release !\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',11329,2,0,NULL,NULL,'crx_dl13','scan',1780048448);
