c u m e n t a t i o n           " link index}\n\n\n\n\n@endnode\n\n@node index\n@title "                                             »» i n d e x ««"\n\n\n    @{u}                                                          @{uu}\n\n\n@{b}                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n         ____        __________          ____.   ___________   ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n________(___/________\\ __     /__________\\___l___\\  ____   /__    `½½½½''\n                   _   l/       _      _____/  _      l/      ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n_____            __l___/      __l__    l     __l__  __________½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n    (____________)    /_______)   (__________)   (_____/      ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n                                                              ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n                                                              ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n   @{fg shine} @{"            introduction             "  link introduction      }    @{fg text}                ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n@{fg shine}    @{"            installation             "  link installation      }          @{fg text}          ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n@{fg shine}    @{"              how 2 use              "  link how 2 use         }\n    @{"              copyright              "  link copyright         }\n    @{"          changes ÷ history          " link changes ÷ history  } @{ub} @{fg text}\n\n\n    @{u}                                                          @{uu}\n\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@node introduction\n                                                                 .\n\n                                                                 :\n                                                                 :\n             __________________.______.      ________            :\n          ._(___)_.   ___     _|      l_____\\\\_     /____________:_ _\n          |       |----/      \\        /     \\   __/\\      __    :\n          l_______|   /_______/        |-----/_______\\____       :\n                              l________|(rLf)            /-------:-\n                                                                 :\n                                                                 :\n                                                                 :\n                                                                 .\n\n\n     Curselast is a door for /X and S!X that displays up to @{fg shine}999@{fg text}(!!!!)\n            You can actually scroll up/down with your cursors!!\n    @{fg shine}last callers@{fg text} with a gr8 design! Just @{"install" link installation} it and check it out!!!\n        Curselast was coded in AmigaE and is fairly fast and small.\n\n                            -magz of megastyle-\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@node installation\n\n .\n                                                                              .\n :\n :                                                                            :\n : __        _____ .___.   ______ __.              _________. ____________    :\n_:(__)_______\\_ _/_|_  l___\\__  // _l______.  _____\\__  //  l____)_  _   /____:_\n :    | __    /_  _ /   /     _ // \\     /_l__\\__     _ //   /    |_    / ___ :\n_:____|--/   /-/  //    |--/____/----/__/ \\     /--/____/    |____|/---/\\--/  :\n :      /___/ /___/_____|(rLf)          \\---/__/       l_____|            /___:_\n :                                                                            :\n :                        i n s t a l l a t i o n                             :\n .                                                                            :\n                                                                              .\n\nCopy the files in DOORS/ and COMMANDS/ to your directories named DOORS:\nand BBS:COMMANDS/ Then put in let''s say your LOGON.TXT and/or one of your\nBULL<xx>.TXT files:\n\n-----[ cut ]------\n\n~\n~CC_curselast|\n\n-----[ cut ]------\n\n\nCurselast requires to be updated in the\nlogoffbatch of your bbs. therefore add to your logoffbatch:\n\n-----[ cut ]------\n\nDOORS:-mgs!-curselast/curseupdate <node>\n\n-----[ cut ]------\n\nWhere <node> stands for the node the logoffbatch will\nbe executed by on logoff.\n\n\nEdit the icon "DOORS:-mgs!-curselast/curseupdate.info" to suit your needs:\n                  .\nSYSOP=<sysop>     | Where <sysop> can be 1 (display sysop/local logins) or 0 (ignore sysop/local logins)\nLINES=<lines>     | Where <lines> can be 16-999 which is the number of last callers you want to display\n                  | (16 = No scrolling)\n                  ''\n\nThat should be it :)\n\nFor S!X users.. just make a new line in your bbs.cmd file.. you know how ;)\n\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n@node how 2 use\n@title "                                              )>» h o w  2  u s e «<("\n\n                                      ½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½.\n                                     ½½½½½½½½         ½½½½½½½½\n      ____.            _________         _______      ½½½½½½½½\n   ___\\ __l____________\\       /_________\\     /______½½½½½½½½\n   \\    \\___        _             _      /\\           ½½½½½½½½\n    \\______/      __l__    "    __l__           ___   ½½½½½½½½\n          /_______)   (_________)   (___________) /_  ½½½½½½½½\n                                                   |  ½½½½½½½½\n                ½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½''\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½      ._____      _____    |   _|________\n                ½½½½½½½½______|    /_____/ ___/____|___\\  ____  /___\n                ½½½½½½½½      |       _  \\_______   _       l/     /\n                ½½½½½½½½__    l     __l__       l __l__  _________/\n                ½½½½½½½½ (__________)   (_________)|  (____/\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½  @{fg shine}   h o w       u s e  @{fg text}   |  ½½½½½½½½\n                ½½½½½½½½      @{fg shine}       2    @{fg text}         |  ½½½½½½½½\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |  ½½½½½½½½\n                ½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½\n\n\n\n        Just @{"Install" link installation} it and run it from /X or S!X\n           and a list of lastcallers pops up :) press cursor up\n               to scroll up and cursor down to scroll down.\n\n                                hallelujah!\n\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@node copyright\n            .\n\n            :\n            :                                      ________ _______ _  _\n           _:__________  _________________ ________\\__   _//\n            :      ___/__\\__    __      /\\\\\\ __      /___ /       .\n          _ :_ ____        /___        /     \\______/   /_________:_ _\n            :     /-------/ __/-------/\\______|        ___________|\n            :     _________(___)__________    ________/       /   l_\n           _:____\\\\_     /       |    ___/____\\__   _        /     /\n            :     \\   __/\\_______|   /_         /---/       /      |\n         - -:-----/_______\\(rLf) \\----/________/   /_______/_______|\n            :\n            :                 c o p y r i g h t\n            :\n            .\n\n\n\n                                 ---[%]---\n\n                   CURSELAST is a Megastyle! production\n\n               code, idea & design by   Magz of MGS! GRT INT\n               tooltype read code by    Lizard of TBL MGS!\n\n               \n\n                         Creds for this GUIDE file\n\n               Slapped together by      Magz\n               Asciis by                Relief   of T! MGS! 5D\n                                        Grimlock of GRT E^D MGS!\n\n                                 ---[%]---\n\n\n\n                      Megastyle! does now consist of\n \n               Leader . . . . . . . . . Lizard\n               Code . . . . . . . . . . Lizard\n                                        Magz\n               AscII. . . . . . . . . . Relief\n                                        Grimlock!\n                                        Magz\n                                        U-Man\n               Boards . . . . . . . . . Noiseless - WHQ         LIZARD\n                                        Genetic Waste           MAGZ\n                                        Final Impact (SHQ)      U-MAN\n\n               + alot of betatesters.. as I''m gonna watch a movie now,\n                 I don''t feel like writing more ;)\n\n                                 ---[%]---\n\n\n\n\n\n\n   ............\n   ::        ::\n   ::        ::\n    .        ::\n   /_____    ::          ___________                                          .\n  /_     \\//\\____________\\      ___/_______    _________\n //      \\/        _     /     /_         /____\\___    //                     :\n/--------/     .---/____/   .---/________         _    //                     :\n     -T!/______\\  /_       _|  .______.  \\-----/_______/                      :\n                  __\\   __/____|_     l_          _______.     _____________  :\n   ::        ::   \\  \\__    _ _        /_____ ____\\     _l_____\\     _     /__:_\n   ::        ::    \\--(/      /            _//          \\        ____/____/  /:\n   ::        ::       /____________________ /      /\\-----/_____/   /_________:_\n   ::        ::                           /_______/(rLf)                      :\n   ::........::                                                               :\n                                                                              :\n                        m e g a s t y l e    ¹ 9 9 6                          :\n                                                                              .\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@node changes ÷ history\n\n\n    ___.        __      ____    ___.      _____  ½½½½½½½½½½      .____\n  ._\\ _l_______(_/_____/ __/____\\  l______\\   /__½½½½   ½½½______|   /_.\n  |   \\__   _       _  \\____  _    __/  _        ½½½½½½½''        l     |\n  |____l/  _l_     _l_     l _l_   l   _l_  "  __½½½½   ½½½½½_______  _l\n g®m   /___) (_____) (_______) (_______) (_____) ½½½½   ½½½½½   \\_____)\n                                                 ½½½½   ½½½½½ e^D\n\n                               ...HISTORY...\n\n15.o3.96           Thought the door was finished and released it to all\n                   MGS! members. found some bugs later.\n                                  @{fg shine}(v.o.1)@{fg text}\n\n\n16.o3.96           Finished the door. Both multinode and 1 node version\n                   works fine. Released to all Megastyle! members.\n                                  @{fg shine}(v.o.2)@{fg text}\n\nNext days          Loads of versions spread to the betatesters removing\n                   loads of bugs and shite ;)\n\n21.o3.96           Couldn''t find more bugs. Think they''re all gone(?!) :))\n                   Released @{fg shine}v.o.5ß@{fg text} to the betatesters/mgs! members\n\n17.o7.96           @{fg shine}vo.6@{fg text}: Made it display 28k8 and stuff instead of 28800 + some small\n                   bugfixes..\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',26652,1,0,NULL,NULL,'mgs_c07','scan',1780048460);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('cutlog11','CUTLOG11.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/CUTLOG11.LHA','CutLog','XIM','CutLog','1.1','Mr.Mad',NULL,'Cut''s the Callerslog File to the number of days you want to hold into, it''s possible to cut your UDlog File, too.',replace('        CutLog V1.1 by Mr.Mad & Coke\nCut''s the Callerslog File to the number of\ndays you want to hold into, it''s possible\nto cut your UDlog File, too.\n','\n',char(10)),'CutLog.Doc',replace('       __    __                          _________________________\n      / /   / /                         / _______________________/\n     / /   / /______ ______________    / /  ________ _____     ______ _______\n    / /   / // __  //__  _  ______ \  / /__/_____  // ___/___ / ____// _____/\n   / /   / // / / /__ / // /___ __\ \/ _______/ / // // ____// /___ / /____\n  / /   / // / / // // // ____// / \ \/  / /   / // // /    / ____//____  /\n / /___/ // / / // // // /___ / /___\ \ / /___/ // // /___ / /_________/ /\n/_______//_/ /_//_//_//_____//________//_______//_//_____//_____________/     \n  \n                    ------------------------------------\n                    -                                  -\n                    -   CutLog V1.1 by Mr.Mad & Coke   -\n                    -                                  -\n                    ------------------------------------\n                    -                                  -\n                    -   Touchdown BBS +49-531-501675   -\n                    -                                  -\n                    ------------------------------------\n\n \n 1. Introduction\n\n   This utility is for you, sysop!\n   -It`s cut the Callerslog File to the number of days you want to hold into \n   -It`s possible to cut your UDlog File, too  \n\n 2. How to get started\n \n   Usage :\n   CutLog [Log] [NumDays]\n\n   All the options must be entered in the order shown above. The [Log]\n   file is the full path and filename for your Callerslog and/or UDlog\n   file. [NumDays] is the amount of days you want to hold in your\n   Callerslog and/or UDlog file.\n\n   Example:\n   CutLog BBS:Node0/Callerslog 2\n   CutLog BBS:Node0/UDlog 10\n\n 3. Changes\n\n    V1.1: Bug with the Date-Routine fixed\n\n\n   Programming:    Mr.Mad - United Forces\n   Text & Design:  Coke - United Forces\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',2829,3,0,NULL,NULL,'cutlog11','scan',1780048460);
