--------------------.\n              NERVE AXiS & WHALE! UKHQ - TASTE THE EXPER¦ENCE\n                                                        !\n               .----- AQUARiUS UFO DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE ---''\n               |\n POSSiBLY THE B!GGEST /X DOOR - MODULES - ASCii COLLECTiONS CONFS iN THE UK\n               :\n               `-------.\n         - --{ 2 NODE R¦NGDOWN 28.8K & 16.8K - 2 GiGS ONLiNE }-- -\n                       :\n       - --{ SEXiEST ARTWERK - COOLEST CONFS - CRAZiEST SYSOPS }-- -\n                       :\n               ÷ O · 1 · 7 · O · 4     5 · O · 5 · 8 · 4 · 5 ÷\n\n \n\n                        Righto... On with the crap...\n\n \n\n\n\n                   You''ve just stepped into cYBER''s World:\n                   it''s a social pyschotic state of bliss!\n                    You''ve been delayed in the real world \n                    how many times have you hit & missed?\n\n               .----------------------------------------------.\n               | cY8ER-STAMP v1.O Copyright © cYBER/iNDY 1995 |\n               `----------------------------------------------''\n                   \n                    >>> cY8ER-STAMP v1.O DoCUMENTATION <<<\n\n\n                                  COPYRIGHT\n                                  ---------\n                 Permission is granted to freely distribute  \n               this product for non-commercial purposes only,\n                  as long as all files remain unmodified.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nARCHIVE (cY8ERSV1.LHA) CONTENTS:\n--------------------------------\n   Filename:           Description:                                   \n\n   xxx?Ring?me?LAME    Smeggy 88S adds that add tons of bytes to small files\n                       \n\n\nDOORS:cY8ERSTAMP/\n\n   cY8ER-STAMP.GUIDE   The Dicky Documentation - You''re reading it Doh!\n   cY8ER-STAMP         The actual super sexy orgasmic /X Door\n   ARC.LHA             This /X util in archive form, just incase some twats\n                       lame stripper strips any of the txt''s for this util.\n\n\nBBS:Commands/SYSCmd/\n\n    cY8ER-STAMP.INFO   Doh!\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n------------\n\nA CRANIOTOMY - Look it up dummy\n\n\n\nWHAT THE SMEGGING HELL IS IT?:\n-----------------------------\n\ncY8ER-STAMP is a sexy sentby tool for /X\n\nIt styles your dir lists and adds the uploader''s name, what node he/she\nwas hogging and the time of the actual upload.\n\nI personally can''t stand dir lists with people''s locations, bbs plugs &\ncrap tag lines with bloody illegal characters messing up the place, \ni.e Å,©,° etc, which look oki from the sysops side, but are a godamn\neyesore for the boards users! :( There''s just no need for it!\n\nErm, for those sysop''s that use Bobo''s File Description door (that uses\na sentby function) I suggest that you get your hands on Calypso/GOD''s\ncool Tag-Data Changer Door, which disable''s some of Bobo''s sentby door''s\nfunctions. That way all you will see is the output from cY8ER-STAMP and\nnuffink else =8*)\n\n     (I think the archive name of this is "CAL-TAGD.LHA" and you\n     can get this from most /X supporting BBS''s like 13th Hour ;)\n\nIf you don''t understand all that then forget it dummy...\n\n\n\n\nINSTALLATION:\n------------\n\n\n      Copy COMMANDS/SYScmd/cY8ER-STAMP.info) to the same Dir in your BBS\n\n           Copy the cY8ERSTAMP directory to your DOORS directory\n \n \n   Please note\n   -----------\n     \n   Erm, if you use that cool dupe checker by P0t-NoODLe then execute\n   this door from the dupe checkers config file... most people know\n   how to do this, if you don''t then de teufel help you doh!\n\n   If you don''t use P0t''s dupe checker, then rename the ''cY8ER-STAMP.info''\n   to ''EXAMINEx.info'', where x is the number order in which you want the\n   file examination process to take place.\n\n   i.e EXAMINE.info         <= EXECUTES A FILE DESCRIPTION DOOR\n       EXAMINE2.info        <= EXECUTES cY8ER-STAMP v1.O\n       EXAMINE3.info        <= EXECUTES A FILE CHECKER/STRIPPER etc etc\n\n\nATTENTiON SYSOPS:\n----------------\n\nIf you run this door, you will see a blatent BBS blug!\n\nErm, if you want this changed to whatever you want, then please\nfeel free to mail me with regard to this matter.\n\nErm, Any other doors that you need... mail me & I''ll think & piss\nabout it.\n\n\n\nWHERE O WHERE O WHERE O WHERE:\n------------------------------\n\n\n\nI CAN ALWAYS BE REACHED HERE........\n                                   ||\n                                   \/\n\n           - --{ WHERE iNSANiTY iS CONSiDERED AN ART FORM }-- -\n                          .\n                          .                     .........    .\n    .___________  _______ :__.___.      __.___.:::  | /:::.  |__  _______\n    |  \_____  / /       \/  |   |     /  |   |:::  |/ :::|  |  \/  _ ___\n    |   \_(__  \ \_|   |_/   _   |    /   _   |:::  ·  :::|  |   \  _   /\n    |___/______/   |___| \___|   |    \___|   |:::     :::|______/__|   \_\n                      tGø/wL!`---''        `---''`::.....::''          :____/\n                          :\n                          `-----------------------------.\n              NERVE AXiS & WHALE! UKHQ - TASTE THE EXPER¦ENCE\n                                                        !\n               .----- AQUARiUS UFO DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE ---''\n               |\n POSSiBLY THE B!GGEST /X DOOR - MODULES - ASCii COLLECTiONS CONFS iN THE UK\n               :\n               `-------.\n         - --{ 2 NODE R¦NGDOWN 28.8K & 16.8K - 2 GiGS ONLiNE }-- -\n                       :\n       - --{ SEXiEST ARTWERK - COOLEST CONFS - CRAZiEST SYSOPS }-- -\n                       :\n               ÷ O · 1 · 7 · O · 4     5 · O · 5 · 8 · 4 · 5 ÷\n\n\n\n\nAnd maybe, just maybe (if my fone bill ain''t too high) on these:\n\n\nDigital Candy    +44(01)912-325-527 RINGDOWN (5 FUNKy NODES ^ MULTI-CD ROMS)\n\n                        _  _   _  _          _____      _            _       \nBeyond Reality      _  | || | | ||