INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('dive_fna','DIVE-FNA.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/DIVE-FNA.LHA','FuckNature','XIM','FuckNature',NULL,'Mad','DIVE','/_____  \____/   /   /_______ /   /  /   /   /   /   ____/ .--+*#[(/______/   /_______/    ___/)]#*+--.',replace('         /\_____      /\______\n        /_____  \____/   /   /_______\n         /   /  /   /   /   /   ____/\n.--+*#[(/______/   /_______/    ___/)]#*+--.\n|:::::::::::::/___/:::::::/_______/dNO:::::|\n+---------------[ presents ]---------------+\n|   FuckNature v1.0 by Mad Moose / Dive    |\n|                                          |\n|  A replacement for the S command in /X   |\n| You can add your own logo with the stats |\n`-------------------------------[96/01/23]-''\n','\n',char(10)),'FuckNature.guide',replace('@Database FuckNature v1.0 Documentation\n@Author Mad Moose / Dive\n@Remark $VER FuckNature v1.0 by Mad Moose / Dive\n@Remark AmigaGuide database\n@node MAIN "FuckNature v1.0 by Mad Moose / Dive       · Documentation ·"\n                   ______ ________,                ________ __ __\n       ____________j    /(________ ____  __________\  _ ________/_____\n       \      ______    __|__     \    \/          _/   _____________/\n        `---------------'' `--------\---------------''---------------''[mt]\n\n                                 pRESENTS\n\n                             FuckNature v1.0\n \n                        Coded by Mad Moose / Dive\n\n                           @{"   Introduction   " Link int}\n                           @{"   Requierments   " Link req}\n                           @{"    How To Use    " Link use}\n                           @{"    The config    " Link cfg}\n                           @{"    Dive info     " Link dive}\n                           @{" History   Future " Link hf}\n                           @{"    So far...     " Link far}\n                           @{"    Greetings     " Link gre}\n                           @{"   Coming up...   " Link next}\n@endnode\n\n@node int "Introduction"\n                               What is it?!\n\n          This is a replacement for the internal S command in /X.\n        I coded this door because I couldn''t find any good and nice\n             S door. So I started to code one, and here it is!\n    This is just a fast first version. For bug reports and suggestions\n   read the @{" Dive info " Link dive} for more info how to contact me.\n\n                                  Enjoy!\n@endnode\n\n@node cfg "How to config FuckNature v1.0"\n\n                  The only configuration is that you can\n        add a logo with the stats. I haven''t made any check for how\n      long each line is, because it would be very much work to strip\n          the ansi codes. Just ''draw'' a logo and test if it fits!\n                      (Maximum number of lines is 10)\n\n              [ Logofile=Doors:Dive/FuckNature/FuckNature.logo ]\n@endnode\n\n@node req "FuckNature v1.0 Requierments"\n\n            FuckNature v1.0 works under Ami Express v3.x - 4.x\n        FuckNature WON''T work with Ami Express v2.x and S-Express!\n(It will work but it wont display all the data, some might even be wrong!)\n        FuckNature needs AEDoor.library v 1+ (supplied in archive)\n@endnode\n@node use "How To Use FuckNature v1.0"\n\n              Just copy BBS/Commands/BBSCmd/ to BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/\n                    After that copy BBS/Doors to Doors:\n                And at last copy Libs/AEDoor.library LIBS:\n@endnode\n@node dive "Call This Fine Dive Board"\n                                   .____\n                  _____   ____    _|   /   _____\n               ._/ .  /__/__ /_._/ |  /_._/ .  /_\n               |   |    \_     |   |    \_  |    \_\n               |   |     /     |   |     /  ._____/\n               |   l_   /      |   |    /   |    /\n         ^aRYANl_______/l______|\______/l_______/\n\n\n  Dive WHQ     -» Secret Gate «-   3 nODES     +46-418-19666\n                                               +46-418-26900\n                                               +46-418-14100\n\n Are you a good or know somebody that is a good graphician, musician,\n or coder and want to join Dive, then why don''t you call\n Secret Gate and leave a message to Zync with some of your/his/her work!\n@endnode\n@node far "Doors And Utilities Released So Far By ME!"\n\n                    Releases From » Mad Moose / Dive «\n\n  Dive-JIA.LHA               14874      Jungle Info v1.0         (AmiExpress)\n  Dive-BOA.LHA               14204      BitchOrder v1.0          (AmiExpress)\n  Dive-CLS.LHA                1030      Cls v1.0                 (AmiExpress)\n  Dive-iD.LHA               218470      iD v1.0                  (CLi/SHELL)\n  SRE-MOVd.lha                5140      Mad Move v 0.01d         (AmiExpress)\n  SRE-OEDc.lha                4607      Online Edit v 0.01c      (AmiExpress)\n  SRE-DHEX.lha               14007      Decimal To Hex           (CLi/SHELL)\n  SRE-RUO.lha                 2676      Rexx UnOptimize          (CLi/SHELL)\n  SRE-MSDb.lha                5517      Mad SysDown v 0.01b      (AmiExpress)\n  SRE-oLiN.lha                2037      Online iNFO 0.01a        (AmiExpress)\n  SRE-BEb.lha                 2848      Mad Byte Earner v 0.01b  (AmiExpress)\n  SRE-oLDi.lha                2614      Online Dir v 0.01b       (AmiExpress)\n  SRE-NUPb.lha                4531      Mad NUP v 0.01b          (AmiExpress)\n  SRE-PW1d.lha                5007      Mad SysPW v 0.01d        (AmiExpress)\n  SRE-DELe.lha                4640      Mad Delete v 0.01e       (AmiExpress)\n\n  If you have any ideas to a new door then please contact me at Secret Gate\n  (@{" Dive info " Link dive}) and leave a message to me ("Mad Moose ")\n                                                                    ^\n                                                             Don''t forget!\n@endnode\n@node gre "Greetings"\n\n                               Greetings to\n\n            All members of Dive  · All of you can do better than this!\n            Aryan                · Here''s a nice S door as u wanted!\n            Mortimer Twang       · Thanks for the nice logo in this doc!\n            Dino                 · Thanks for the logo supplied as\n                                   example logo!\n@endnode\n@node next "Coming up..."\n\n           The following doors will be released by me very soon:\n\n         Bash Group Join ·   Most of you have seen texts like:\n                                  Call xxxxx to join us!\n                             Then you must call, get access and then\n                             ask if they want u. But with this door\n                             each sysop can define an account and when\n                             a user logs in under that account he will\n                             be asked to answer a few questions to join in!\n                             It''s hard to explain but wait and test it!\n                             Code & Design by Mad Moose\n         Soul NFO        ·   A door to easy read the .NFO files in the\n                             archives. Supports .ZIP, .LHA and .NFO!\n                             Code & Design by Mad Moose\n         Mad Worm        ·   You all know the game Worm! (Masken, Nibbles!)\n                             Code & Design by Mad Moose\n         Dive Request    ·   A request door with an extra design and\n                             a nice request checker to faster check for\n                             new request to you and other\n                             + some special sysop functions\n                             Code Mad Moose, Design Aryan\n         Milkshake       ·   The first Move, Delete, Fake, Nuke, Edit door.\n                             With date mark, manual mark.\n                             Also possibility to see description at once.\n                             Built in help page. And much much more...\n                             Just wait and cry!\n                             Code Mad Moose, Design Aryan\n\n         And maybe more!? Why don''t you give me some suggestions!?\n                       Read Dive info for more info!\n@endnode\n@node hf "History and future"\n\n                                  History\n                                  «-----»\n\n       v1.0  - This is the first and only release of FuckNature so far!\n\n                                  Future\n                                  «----»\n\n                  Do you have any idea? Read @{" Dive info " Link dive}\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',16734,7,0,NULL,NULL,'dive_fna','scan',1780048474);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('dive_jia','DIVE-JIA.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/DIVE-JIA.LHA','JungleInfo','XIM','/\_____      /\______',NULL,'Mad','DIVE','/_____  \____/   /   /_______ /   /  /   /   /   /   ____/ .--+*#[(/______/   /_______/    ___/)]#*+--.',replace('         /\_____      /\______\n        /_____  \____/   /   /_______\n         /   /  /   /   /   /   ____/\n.--+*#[(/______/   /_______/    ___/)]#*+--.\n|:::::::::::::/___/:::::::/_______/cRL:::::|\n+---------------[ presents ]---------------+\n|  Jungle Info v1.0 by Mad Moose / Dive    |\n|                                          |\n| A info door which displays mem avail,    |\n|   devices, directories and more...       |\n`-------------------------------[95/12/23]-''\n[viRTUAL tHEATRE]----------[viRTUAL tHEATRE]\n','\n',char(10)),'JungleInfo.guide',replace('@Database Jungle Info v1.0 Documentation\n@Author Mad Moose / Dive\n@Remark $VER Jungle Info v1.0 by Mad Moose / Dive\n@Remark AmigaGuide database\n@node MAIN "Jungle Info v1.0 by Mad Moose / Dive       .: Documentation :."\n\n     ::::::::::::::::.   ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  .::::::::::::::::: \n     :::::::: `::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::..         \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::           \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  ::::::::  :::::::: \n     ::::::::.:::::::''   ::::::::  `:::::::..:::::::''  `:::::::..:::::::'' \n\n                                 pRESENTS\n\n                            Jungle Info v1.0\n \n                         Coded by Mad Moose / Dive\n                        Design by Mad Moose / Dive\n                   Document written by Mad Moose / Dive\n\n                          @{"   Requierments   " Link req}\n                          @{"    How To Use    " Link use}\n                          @{"    Dive info     " Link dive}\n                          @{" History   Future " Link hf}\n                          @{"    So far...     " Link far}\n                          @{"    Greetings     " Link gre}\n                          @{"   Coming up...   " Link next}\n@endnode\n\n@node req "Jungle Info v1.0 Requierments"\n\n     Jungle Info v1.0 works under Ami Express v2.x - 4.x and S-Express\n            You also need C:Delete, C:VInfo, C:Assign and C:Dir\n@endnode\n@node use "How To Use Jungle Info v1.0"\n\n              Just copy BBS/Commands/BBSCmd/ to BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/\n                    After that copy BBS/Doors to Doors:\n                   And don''t forget to copy Libs/ LIBS:\n                           At last copy C/ to C:\n\n                                   Done!\n@endnode\n@node dive "Call This Fine Dive Board"\n                                   .____\n                  _____   ____    _|   /   _____\n               ._/ .  /__/__ /_._/ |  /_._/ .  /_\n               |   |    \_     |   |    \_  |    \_\n               |   |     /     |   |     /  ._____/\n               |   l_   /      |   |    /   |    /\n         ^aRYANl_______/l______|\______/l_______/\n\n\n  DiVE WHQ     -» Secret Gate «-   3 nODES     +46-418-19666\n                                               +46-418-26900\n                                               +46-418-14100\n\n Are you a good or know somebody that is a good graphician, musician,\n trader, swapper or coder and want to join Dive, then why don''t you call\n Secret Gate and leave a message to Zync with some of your/his/her work.\n@endnode\n@node far "Doors And Utilities Released So Far By ME!"\n\n                     RELEASES FROM » MAD MOOSE / DiVE «\n\nDiVE-BOA.LHA               13292      BitchOrder v1.0          (AmiExpress)\nDiVE-CLS.LHA                1030      Cls v1.0                 (AmiExpress)\nDiVE-iD.LHA               218470      iD v1.0                  (CLi/SHELL)\nSRE-MOVd.lha                5140      Mad Move v 0.01d         (AmiExpress)\nSRE-OEDc.lha                4607      Online Edit v 0.01c      (AmiExpress)\nSRE-DHEX.lha               14007      Decimal To Hex           (CLi/SHELL)\nSRE-RUO.lha                 2676      Rexx UnOptimize          (CLi/SHELL)\nSRE-MSDb.lha                5517      Mad SysDown v 0.01b      (AmiExpress)\nSRE-oLiN.lha                2037      Online iNFO 0.01a        (AmiExpress)\nSRE-BEb.lha                 2848      Mad Byte Earner v 0.01b  (AmiExpress)\nSRE-oLDi.lha                2614      Online Dir v 0.01b       (AmiExpress)\nSRE-NUPb.lha                4531      Mad NUP v 0.01b          (AmiExpress)\nSRE-PW1d.lha                5007      Mad SysPW v 0.01d        (AmiExpress)\nSRE-DELe.lha                4640      Mad Delete v 0.01e       (AmiExpress)\n\n If you have any ideas to a new door then please contact me at Secret Gate\n (read Dive info) and leave a message to me ("Mad Moose ")\n                                                        ^- don''t forget!\n@endnode\n@node gre "Greetings"\n\n                               Greetings to\n\n            All members of Dive  · All of you can do better than this!\n            319                  · Which school are you in now?? heheh!\n            Aryan                · It''s fun playing Crimson II, but\n                                   how is it with the phone bill?!\n            Atlas                · When is that intro coming??\n\n                           And everybody else...\n@endnode\n@node next "Coming up..."\n\n           The following doors will be released by me very soon:\n\n            Mad Worm     ·   You all know the game Worm! (Masken, Nibbles!)\n                             Code Mad Moose, Design Mad Moose (so far)\n            Dive Request ·   A request door with an extra design and\n                             a nice request checker to faster check for\n                             new request to you and other\n                             + some special sysop functions\n                             Code Mad Moose, Design Aryan\n            Milkshake    ·   The first Move, Delete, Fake, Nuke, Edit door.\n                             With date mark, manual mark.\n                             Also possibility to see description at once.\n                             Built in help page. And much much more...\n                             Just wait and cry!\n                             Code Mad Moose, Design Aryan\n\n         And maybe more!? Why don''t you give me some suggestions!?\n                       Read Dive info for more info!\n@endnode\n@node hf "History and future"\n\n                                  History\n                                  «-----»\n\n       v1.0  - This is the first and only release of Jungle Info so far!\n\n                                  Future\n                                  «----»\n\n                  Do you have any idea? Call Secret Gate!\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,21746,6,0,NULL,NULL,'dive_jia_jungleinfo','scan',1780048474);
