Bloodwolf/Mortuary\n\n\nP.S. : OTHER HIGH-QUALITY /X-TOOLS BY ME :\n------------------------------------------\n\n        LGC-LCK2.LHA    - LHA-Check V2.0\n                          THE BEST LHA-CHECKER AVAILABLE !\n\n        LGC-ZIP.LHA     - ZIP-Check V1.0\n                          Guess what ?\n\n        LGC-QN20.LHA    - QuickNew V2.0\n                          Fucking great util !\n\n        LGC-BEST.LHA    - BestUL V1.0\n                          Nice Topuploaders-XIM !\n\n        All LOGIC and GOD utils ever released are available and\n        FREE-DOWNLOAD on my BBS !\n\n\nGREETINGS:\n----------\n\n      - G.E.M. - Runt&Scottie - Polaris - Skin - XAD - Deltaforce - Andy -\n      - Wedlock - Blackbird - Sisko - Planet Master - Proton - Bloodwolf -\n         - Linebacker - Cujo - Raider - Mitch - Mr.T - Samir - Power -\n\n                         - All LOGIC and GOD Members -\n\n··············································································\n\n           - G·O·D Express Design HQ - LOGIC WHQ - ILLUSION HQ -\n               _ ________           _ ______________\n         /\_______    _ /     _____   ________     /__: _____  sYSOPS:\n        /____  _ /    //_____/o  _/___  /    /____/   |/    /  """""""\n      _____:/  //     /     //   \    \/    /    //   /    /   cALYPSO !\n     /     |\  /__________ /.   /_\   /________ /.    \    \   cASTOR\n __|/____________\       \/_____________\     \/______|\____\  gHOSTRIDER\n   |                                                  :        (yOU ?)\n                     ! lOOKING fOR cOSYSOPs !      :_______|__\n 0.5      /\ __ /\             _______________     |    _ /|\n gIG hD! // \\//  \____________\________   _ /____ |    //   nUMBERS:\n 68o3o  /.   \/    \________   _ /     /   //     \|   o/    """"""""\n       /    \  /    \      /   //\    /    /|      \  ./  +49-7054-8733\n      /      \/______\    /    /  \_______/ |    \    /  +49-7054-eLITE!\n     /_______|        \_______/             |_____\  /\n             :                                Sk!n \/  bOTH nODES 16.8 DS!\n \n      rUNNING (LATEST!) S-eXPRESS - sUPPORTING aMIGA aND sNES oNLY !\n         aLL {<GOD>|<LOGIC>|<ILLUSION>}-Releases fREE dOWNLOAD !!!\n          cALL nOW ! Lotsa INTERNATIONAL cALLERS ! Simply eLITE !\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',9331,5,0,NULL,NULL,'god_wall','scan',1780048532);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('god_wbl1','GOD_WBL1.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/GOD_WBL1.LHA',NULL,'XIM','+--------+[...GLobaL OverDose...]+---------+',NULL,'Jaf/God','GOD','! /\__________   ______ ____ _____________ ! :/  \_ _  ___/___\____ Y _ _\_________   /_: /         /   /      / :   //        / __ /.',replace('+--------+[...GLobaL OverDose...]+---------+\n! /\__________   ______ ____ _____________ !\n:/  \_ _  ___/___\____ Y _ _\_________   /_:\n/         /   /      / :   //        / __ /.\n\__________  /\____________/___________ // |\n+----------\/-----PresenTs:--------Sk!n\/--+\n World BBS Lister v1.0 for /X  [AIM Module]\n Updated with Online Edit,Delete,Add,Search\n         by Jaf/God & KickFace/H&V\n','\n',char(10)),'wbl.doc',replace('           _______________    _________________________________\n   .__.    \_____     /  /    \___    \_____    \_____    \   /        .__.\n   |  |    / ___/____/   \____/   \   /  __/   _/   _/    /   \____ .__|  |__.\n   |  |  _/  \___    \    \   \    \  \  \___   \         \    \   \|___  ___|\n   |  |  \      /     \_  /    \_  /   \_   /    \_  __    \_  /    \_ |  |\n.__|  |__.\    /       / /      / /     /  /      /   /     / /      / |  |\n|___  ___| \_________ /_______ /______ /________ /___/____ /_______ /  |  |\n   |__|     +-------\/-------\/------\/--[P!]--\/--------\/------+\/   |__|\n  ___________________________________________________________________________\n  \___     \   /    \___      ___    \___   \_____     \____      ____      /\n  /   \    /   \    /   \____/  |\   /   \   \    \    /    \____/    \____/\n_/     \   \    \   \     _)/   |/  /    |\   \    \   \______   \      _)__\n\      /    \_  /    \_  /  \_  /   \    |/    \_  /    \_   /    \_   /    \_\n \    /      / /      / /    /  \    \   /      / /      /  /      /  /      /\n  \________ /_______ /_____ /____\    \_______ /_______ /________ /________ /\n   +------\/-------\/-----\/------\____\-----\/-------\/--------\/-------+\/\n\n       <-   -  -- --- + PuRgE WhAt WaS - FeAr WhAt CoMeS + --- --  -   ->\n\nThis update has been made by JaF/God & Kickface/H&V we put the heads together\nand came up with this...Enjoy it....\n\nYou can have 52 country''s in the list now. (will update if needed) 9-)\nSo if a country is not in the list just add the country in the Country''s\nDrawer that''s how simple live can be! 8-)\nThe Traderslist that I used was made by DOT and the Swedish part by Zcandalar\nBut the DOT list in not Uptodate lot''s of bbs''s does not even exists anymore\nbut hey! you can edit the list anyway you like it....\n\nIt''s written in Arexx but soon you will see some stuff from me in Amiga-E or\nC but for now this is the best i can do 9-(\n\nWhat does it do?\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nLet''s you view the traderslist by Country and let''s you Download it by\ncountry or the complete traders list.\nNow you are able to add your bbs to the list no matter what access level\nUsers with the right access level can now : Edit, Delete, Add BBS Numbers\nA search option have been added kinda like a zippy search\n\n* DONT RENAME THE WBL DRAWER SINDS I CREATE A LOGFILE FOR THE CHANGES *\n* THAT HAVE BEEN MADE TO A LIST BY A USER AND THE CONFIG IS ALSO THERE *\n\n\nWhat does it need?\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\ndelete, join, list, sort,  Rexxmast setup + /Xv?.??\n\nHow do I install it?\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nCopy Wbl.info to the bbscmd drawer\nCopy the Wbl drawer to the Doors Drawer\nEdit the wbl.cfg file to your needs\nand your set to go\n\nBug''s?\n~~~~~~\nNone at the moment.\n\nHow to contact for bug reports or whatever ?\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nJAF\n~~~\nIf anyone carez you can leave me mail on all G.O.D bbs''s\nor Mail me with /XNetmail like this JAF@NL0001\n\nor\n\nKickface\n~~~~~~~~\nSUiCiDAL TENDENCY #1  +32-50-427306\nSUiCiDAL TENDENCY #2  +32-50-427032\n\n\n\nAnd now some greetings to!\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nFreddy Krueger ---> Hope that recieve ya 21k6 soon. (USR slow basterds)\n-TCB!-         ---> Got that E now so lets see what I can do with it\nDalai Lama     ---> D-Access still the BEST.\nPurple Haze    ---> What can i say,nothing but good things.(hallogeenlampje)\nBandito        ---> How ya doing mate, tryed to call but ya bbs is to busy.\nMr.Solo        ---> The trading devil.\nMr.Frostie     ---> Keep ya hands off those beers.\nHighlander     ---> Another trading devil.\n\nSyntax/WOT     ---> Thanx for the ''E'' stuff.\nJPS            ---> Best uploader I have, and continue coding lazy ass!\nByteAndi/Mst   ---> Your FileId rules.\nEmpire/Mst     ---> UDClean the best no need to say more.\nB.o.b./CF      ---> For being a pal in hard times. =8^)\nZcandalar      ---> Thanks for the greetings and i used your swedish list.\nShadower       ---> Thanks for the Netmail\n\nKickface/H&V   ---> For his major contribution to this Door\n                    thanks pal!\n\nand all others I seem to have forgotten...\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,40177,5,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048532);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('goofdoor','GOOFDOOR.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/GOOFDOOR.LHA',NULL,'XIM','Callers Lotto Door',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,replace('Callers Lotto Door\n','\n',char(10)),'doors.doc',replace('DOORS.DOC\n---------\n\n\nThis is a VERY small doc to the two online games called\n\nMULTI LOTTO and CALLERS LOTTERY...\n\n\nHow to Install:\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\nBoth of these doors are made in Arexx so dont forget to install them as Arexx\ndoors in you system....\n\nThe Callers lottery should be installed in a textfile thats shown for the\nusers at the logon (or logoff...)\n\nThe only thing that These doors require to run is C:makedir and that you have\nassigned DOORS: somewere on your harddisk...\n\nAnd now for some short descriptions of the games....\n\n\n\nMULTILOTTO:\n^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\nThe user can buy Tickets for the cost of XX Upload Bytes.. if he Loose the\nUpload bytes will be stored in the Pot. If he Wins he will take the Pot !\n(if ya think that users win to often... then change the MAX variabel on row\n29 to a higher value....or lower default is set to 60)\n\n\nCallerslottery:\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\nShould automaticly be started once on every call.... The sysop can define how\noften a user should win.... the price is even here in form of Download\ncredits.... the sysop defines How much!\n\n\n\nWell ill think thats all.... If ya wanna reach me then Please call my Board\n\nLOYD BBS +46-300-64661\nor\nMINOR MISHMASH +46-31-992525\n\n\n\n                                 Goofy/Conny\n\n\nPS. Dont ya &*&%$*&*& Change Anything in these scripts without Asking ME !\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,5329,4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048532);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('go_out','GO_OUT.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/GO_OUT.LHA',NULL,'XIM','GO-OUT! AMIX LOGGOFF DOOR FOR 2.xx AND 3.xx',NULL,NULL,'GO',NULL,replace('GO-OUT! AMIX LOGGOFF DOOR FOR 2.xx AND 3.xx\n','\n',char(10)),'logoff.rexx.english.doc',replace('\nHEY HO! HELLO ALL YOU COOL SYSOPS..\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\nNow it is finaly there..\n\nThe new Version works as good as the old, but instead some graphic and \nprogramm mistakes have been bettered up..\n\nThis Logoff tool works under Amiex 2.xx and 3.xx .\n\nTo install this tool put the following Line into the BBS.cmd\n\n======================= CUT HERE =======================================\n*G        RM010DOORS:LOGOFF/LOGOFF.REXX\n======================= CUT HERE =======================================\n\n\nOf course this doesent work for the 3.XX version.. For that there is an icon \nwitch only should be copied into the bbs.cmb directory.\n\nThen copy fast the mainprogram into the DOORS....\nThese must be assignd..\n\nCOPY LOGOFF.REXX TO DOOR:LOGOFF/\n\nOkay that was all for this version.\nIf you want some newer upates write MURDOC a mail... (maybe my english needs\nalso some updates...)\n\n   |\    |\    |\    |\    |\    |\    |\    |\    |\    |\    |\    |\         \n   :/    :/    :/    :/    :/    :/    :/    :/    :/    :/    :/    :/         \n   /|_   /(_   /(_   /|_   /(_   /(_   /(_   /     /(_   /(_   /(_   /(_        \n  / | | / __| / . | / | | / __| /   | / __| /     /  _| / . | /_ _| / __|       \n /|   |/| __|/|   |/| | |/| __|/| | |/|__ |/[C 0]/| | |/|   |/ | |_/| __|/      \n/ |_| / |_  / |_| / |_  / |_  / |_| / |_  /     / |_  / |_| /  |  / |_  /       \n    |/    )/    |/    )/    )/    |/    )/     /    )/    |/    )/    )/        \n    /:    /:    /:    /:    /:    /:    /:    /:    /:    /:    /:    /:        \n    \|    \|    \|    \|    \|    \|    \|    \|    \|    \|    \|    \|        \n                                                                                \nTHE ANGEL:            NODE1  + 49 - 030 - 478-1740   ZYXEL    THE CO-ANGEL      \n/X\urdoc/DSC          NODE2  + 49 - Ringdown in next time     Thunder/Sha       \nWildstyle/SDC         VOICE  + 49 - 030 - 472-private-line    H o o K           \n                      THE SYSTEM IS NOW RUNNING WITH AMIEX                      \n                                  4 0   M H Z\n\nps: If you have any problems with the installing of this tool or other than\n    write to MURDOC............\n\nMegaSysop Murdoc & System Fighter..... translated by HøøK .....\n\n               /\n            : /                                                    :\n       .....+/-----------------------------------------------------+----.\n       :    /     ___    _____  ___    ___    _____  _/\    _____  :    |\n       :  ./+----/o| \--/o___/-/o. \--/o| \--/o___/-/o. \--/o___/--+-.  |\n       :  /o|   // .  \//._>__// |  \// |  \//._>__// |  \//__. \  |o|  |\n       : /| |  //  |   \ |    \  .   \  |   \ |    \  |   \   |  \ | |  | /\n       :/ | |  \___|___/______/__|___/______/______/__|___/______/ | |  |/\n      -/--| |                _____  ___ .____  _____               | :--/-\n      /|  | | SySoP`Z :     /____/ /o. \|o   //o___/   SyStEm:     | | /:\n     / |  | | MurdoC `n    /o\__ \// |  \:  ///._>__   A2000 40Mhz | |/ :\n       |  |o| WilDsTyLe   //  |   \  .   \  |  |    \  9Mb RaM!    |o/  :\n       |  `-+-------------\_______/__|___/__|_______/--------------+/''  :\n       |    :                                                      /    :\n       `----+-----------------------------------------------------/+....''\n            :         N°de I +49 - 030 - 478 1740 Zyx            / :\n                                                                /','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,55678,5,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048532);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('grt_cw20','GRT-CW20.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/GRT-CW20.LHA',NULL,'XIM','__.',NULL,NULL,'GRT','____._____../  |___ ./.___|  .  ||   .__/., .---> | l__ |  |--''|___    |)! <---.',replace('                     __.\n        ____._____../  |___\n      ./.___|  .  ||   .__/.,\n.---> | l__ |  |--''|___    |)! <---.\n|     \__.  |--''      `----''       |\n|        `--'' GRANiTE PRESENTS     |\n|                                  |\n|          cYBERwALL V 2.0         |\n|                                  |\n|       tHE uLTIMATE /X wALL       |\n|    dOWNLOAD NOW!!!!!!!!!!!!      |\n`----------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'cYBERwALL.DOC',replace('            ___      ___      ___      ___               ___      ___\n           /\  \    /\  \    /\  \    /\  \      ___    /\  \    /\  \\n          /  \  \  /  \  \  /  \  \  /  \  \    /\  \  /  \  \  /  \  \\n         /    \  \/    \  \/    \  \/    \  \  /  \  \ \   \  \/    \  \\n        /      \  \     \  \     \  \     \  \_\   \__\/    \  \     \  \\n       /   /\   \__\/\   \__\/\   \__\/\   \__\ \  /  /      \__\/\   \__\\n      /   /  \  /  /\/   /  / /   /  / /   /  /\ \/__/       /  /__\  /  /\n     /   /  / \/__/     /  /_/   /  / /   /  /  \__\      /\/__/\  \\/__/\n    /   /  / /         /  /\/   /  / /   /  /   /  /     /  /    \__\\n   /   / _/_/        \/__/     /  / /   /  /   /  /     /  / /\  /  /\n  /   /_/\  \  /\    /  /\    /  / /   /  /   /  /     /  / /__\/__/\n  \   \/  \__\/ /   /  / /   /  / /   /  /   /  /     /  /  \  \\n   \      /  /_/   /  /_/   /  /_/   /  /   /  /\    /  /\   \  \\n    \    /  / /   /  / /   /  / /   /  /\  /  /  \  /  /  \   \__\\n     \  /  /  \  /  /  \  /  /  \  /  /  \/__/    \/__/    \  /  /\n      \/__/    \/__/    \/__/    \/__/       [tINTIN]       \/__/\n\n                         Presents cYBERwALL V2.0 !!!!!\n\n   I didn''t feel like writing a new doc so I just modified the V1.1\n   doc. This version scrolles!!!! You can use the numeric pad to \n   scroll the wall up and down. V2.0 only have 11 visible lines, \n   however, you can scroll 11 more!!!!!.......\n\n   Before you install V2.0 of cYBERwALL you MUST delet the V1.1 files\n   as they won''t work with V2.0!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n\n   This is a one of a kind door... Until some lamer copies my script..\n\n   This doc will explain to you how to install the wall and how to\n   configure it..\n\n   Copy all the files to the right directory...\n\n   To configure the wall you will have to edit the cyberwall.con file.\n   The file will look like this:\n\n   aliasmodex=1          /* Will users be able to use different alias?    0=OFF 1=ON */\n   colourmode=1          /* Will users be able to choose tag colour ?     0=OFF 1=ON */           \n   clearmodex=0          /* Will users be able to clear the wall?         0=OFF 1=ON */\n\n   You may only change the number after the mode... DONT CHANGE \n   ANYTHING ELSE!!!!..........\n\n   If you put aliasmodex=0 the users will not be able to use alias.\n   If you put colourmode=0 the users will not be able to choose colours.\n   If you put clearmodex=0 the users will not be able to clear the wall..\n   Sysop will allways be able to clear the wall..\n\n   If you put Colourmode=0 the wall will make every odd tag white, and \n   every even tag cyan.\n\n   If they use an alias, the alias will be coloured yellow..  Why? Because\n   they are chickens....!!!!\n\n   Make use of it!!!! If you like it.. send me a mess..\n\n\n   gREETINGS...:::\n\n   sTORM              : fOR tHE nICE aSCII...\n   -----------------------------------------------\n   [-CEREAL KILLER-]  : fOR bETA tESTING...\n   -----------------------------------------------\n   aND oF cOZ aLL mY m8ES\n\n\n   // tINTIN^GRANiTE','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,9296,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048532);
