ilver Fox\nWardancer\nRamirez\nEmpire\nTarzan\nScratch\nShark\nFrostie\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',11280,5,0,NULL,NULL,'h6v_e001','scan',1780048532);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('h6v_ql10','H6V-QL10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/H6V-QL10.LHA','QuickLogon','XIM','Cp_nähä_Du!!',NULL,'Dux/Humane&Vanity','H6V','___/   __/___  ___/  ___/___ O\____   /    \-\____   /    \-------------O /    _/    //  /     /    //   iN 1994',replace('     ______         ______                  \n ___/   __/___  ___/  ___/___               \nO\____   /    \-\____   /    \-------------O\n  /    _/    //  /     /    //   iN 1994    \n //   __¯   //   \\   /    //               \n/°    /    °/ aND \° /    °/ HUMANE & VANITY\n\____//    / _     \___   / _ /X - Division \nO-zy/_____/-//-------\___/-//--(Pr@s@nts:)-O\nQuickLogon V1.0 For /X  By Dux/Humane&Vanity\n','\n',char(10)),'QuickLogon.doc',replace('ooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo\n\n                              Quick Logon v1.00\n\n                              Code by Dux/Vanity\n\nooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo\n\n\nIntroduction\n~~~~~~~~~~~~\nHave you ever wanted to have a couple of bulletins shown at logon but still\nwanted to keep the time it took to get on your board to a minimum? Then "Quick\nLogon" is the thing you need!\n\n\nInstallation\n~~~~~~~~~~~~\nCopy the supplied QLOGON.info to your BBS:Commands/SYSCMD/ dir.\n\nCopy the QuickLogon and QuickLogon.info to wherever you want them. Eg.\nDOORS:QuickLogon.\n\nNow you need to create you bulletins. You could call your old logon-bull for\nBBS:Screens/NoQuickLogon.txt and make a short version of it called\nBBS:Screens/QuickLogon.txt.\n\nYou can ofcourse also add accesslevel to the files. Eg. NoQuickLogon40.txt.\nMCI codes are also accepted in the bullfiles.\n\nNow you can edit your BBS:Bull.txt to something like this:\n\n--CUT--\n~\n~CC_QLOGON\n--CUT--\n\nNow you need to edit the QuickLogon.info to your own needs!\n\n\nHow to contact\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nI can be reached at my own board Mainline +45-9815 3062/+45-9815 3562 or on\nmost Danish elite boards. Or by /Xnet to ''Dux@DK0001''.\n\nI would appreciate to know who''s using my doors/utils.\n\n\nGreets\n~~~~~~\nDevilstar\nLector\nTarzan\nRamirez\nWardancer\nFrostie\nScratch\nEmpire\nYobbo\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',41973,6,0,NULL,NULL,'h6v_ql10','scan',1780048539);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('h6v_wc11','H6V-WC11.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/H6V-WC11.LHA','WarCalls','XIM','WarCalls',NULL,'WarDancer/H&V','H6V','¦ /   _  \  |  \  \  / \/  |_ \   \ \  ___/ _/    |   \_`   \_ \/   \_ _/  \_\   \_   \_ \_____|____/_____/__\____/_|____/_\___/____/',replace('.--/  | \/  | \___ \/ ___/   \/  \ \   ____/\n¦ /   _  \  |  \  \  / \/  |_ \   \ \  ___/ \n_/    |   \_`   \_ \/   \_ _/  \_\   \_   \_\n\_____|____/_____/__\____/_|____/_\___/____/\n¦\    |    /   \/  \ \__\///____  /   \   / \n¦ \   |   /  |_ \   \ \ \/ \mrv/  \___ \ /¦ \n¦  \  ·  /   _/  \_\   \_   \_/    \_ \  \_ \n¦aND\___/____|____/_\___/____/______/_____/ \n`--------  - -÷p÷r÷e÷s÷e÷n÷t÷s÷- -  ------'' \nWarCalls V1.1 for /X V3.xx  by WarDancer/H&V\n------------------------------>[a·bAsE]<----\n','\n',char(10)),'WarCalls.guide',replace('@database WarCallsDoc\n@Author Wardancer/Humane&Vanity\n@Index MAIN\n\nCopyright 1994 Wardancer/Humane&Vanity\n\n@node MAIN "WarCalls V1.1 Documentation."\n\n                   ___:   :_ ___ _ :  .   __:  :___ _:___.\n                  |   |   | V   | \|  :  /  |  : __) |  _)\n                  :   _   |._.  |\ !  |&(   |  | :\_ ! _/\n                  |   l___!_|   : \___!  \  !  | | |   |\n                  !   ¡   zy:   ! :       `---:'' : l___:\n                (-:   :-----------(Pr@s@nts:)-!  :------+--)\n                                 WarCalls V1.1\n\n                      Made by : Wardancer/Humane&Vanity\n\n\n\n                              Table of contents :\n\n                           @{"     Whats this ?     " Link 01}\n                           @{"     Installation     " Link 02}\n                           @{"        Greets        " Link 03}\n                           @{"   Bug report/ideas   " Link 04}\n                           @{"       History        " Link 05}\n\n@endnode\n\n@node 01 "Whats this ?"\n\n  ========================================================================\n\n  WarCalls is a program  that will allow  you to list all  users that have \n  called below a number of times you specify. Warcalls will list the users\n  handel, location, and  times  called, WarCalls  will also  offer  you to\n  redirect the output to a file.\n\n  ========================================================================\n\n@endnode\n\n@node 02 "Installation"\n\n  ========================================================================\n\n  Installing  this program is really  quite simple, the  only things you\n  have to is to make sure the following is right :\n\n  Program      Location          Description\n  -------      --------          -----------\n  WarCalls     Doors:WarCalls    The main program\n\n  Also make sure that calls.info is in the commands/bbscmd drawer.\n\n  ========================================================================\n\n@endnode\n\n@node 03 "Greets"\n\n  ========================================================================\n\n  I would like to greet the following in no order :\n\n  Kronion, Dux, The Freak, Ramirez, Omar, Striker, Playmate, Calvin,\n  Plexer, Gilthanas, Energy, Shamer, Tactica, Zany, Zeke, Spike,\n  Delirium&Kickface, Mike&Tofke, Norske, Chock, Paranoid, OB1, Curmit,\n  Tin Man, Mandrake, Mr. Orion, Mr. Beer, Marty, Nookman, Poison, Json,\n  Conan&Newton, Tarzan, Jake, HAL 9000, D-Day, Cracy Creep, Mr. Vain,\n  Overlord, Stezotehic\n\n      And all other Humane&Vanity members and people I forgot.\n\n  Specials go to :\n\n  Kronion .......................... For being a great leader\n  Dux .............................. Thanks for helping me with AmiExpress\n  Ramirez .......................... For letting me test at your board\n  Omar ............................. For all sorts of crazy conversation\n\n  ========================================================================\n\n@endnode\n\n@node 04 "Bug report/ideas"\n\n  ========================================================================\n\n  Send your bug reports or ideas to the following boards :\n\n  Susperia ............... +45 434-34236 (Humane&Vanity SCHQ)\n  Somewhere Online ....... +45 597-53801 (Humane&Vanity DKHQ)\n  Suffocation ............ +45 491-80760 (The board where I test my doors)\n  Mainline ............... +45 981-53062 (Also supports netmail)\n\n  ======================================================================== \n\n@endnode\n\n@node 05 "History"\n\n  ========================================================================\n\n  V1.1 - Made WarCalls show users location.\n         Made it possible to redirect output.\n\n  V1.0 - Not released to anybody else than Susperia and Suffocation.\n\n  ========================================================================\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',10387,3,0,NULL,NULL,'h6v_wc11','scan',1780048539);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('hacker','HACKER.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/HACKER.LHA',NULL,'XIM','LE-win5-96.exe',NULL,'Dr.',NULL,'HACKER - 0NLINE GAME FOR AMiExPREsS!!!!!!!!! -------------------------------------------- Original converted by Dr. Ice, but HEAVILY',replace('<«»«»«»(·eVERYwARE!  ÷  tRSi^aCCESs·)«»«»«»>\nHACKER - 0NLINE GAME FOR AMiExPREsS!!!!!!!!!\n--------------------------------------------\nOriginal converted by Dr. Ice, but HEAVILY\nimproved code by Lizard of Spaceballs!!!!!!!\nMany bugs removed, and even faster code.....\n  *** A MUST FOR EVERY COOL /X-BOARD!! ***\n--------------------------------------------\nAnd get you ASS over to GATHERInG''95 aswell!\n--------------------------------------------\n DOWNLOAD-NOW! DOWNLOAD-NOW! DOWNLOAD-NOW!\n ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n','\n',char(10)),'lOSeNDOS.guide',replace('                   \n                     __  _ __  /\__ _  _ __/\  __ _  __\n                    _\/___   \/              \/   ___\/_\n              ......\/\  /........................\  /\/......\n             :         \/                          \/         :\n             :      .___             .___         .___        :\n             :   _ _|   \      ______|   \  ______|   \       :\n             :   \\\__   7___  \______   /  \__   ____/       :\n             :      /.   |   \__/.  l/   \___/_____   \__ _   :\n             :     /::.  |    _/::.       _/::.  l/    _///   :\n             :     \___________\___________\____________\     :\n             :___        .___        .___        .___         :___\n     _ ______|   \ ______|   \ ______|   \ ______|   \  ______|   \\n     \\\__   ____/ \______   / \______   / \______   /  \__   ____/\n        /.   ___|___/.   |   \__/.  _|   \__/.  l/   \___/_____   \__ _\n       /::.  l/   _/::.  |    _/::. \___  _/::.       _/::.  l/    _///\n       \_ _________\_____|_____\___________\___________\___________ \\n         Y   :                                                :[nM$]Y\n      .------''                                                `------.\n      :eXON/rIOT^jORMAS · gHANDY/gODS · rAHIEM/eSSENCE · cELIC/rEKTUM: \n      `------.                                                .------''\n             `------------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',52430,22,0,NULL,NULL,'hacker','scan',1780048539);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('hacker53','HACKER53.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/HACKER53.LHA','CLEAN','XIM','CLEAN',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\_  ___/\/  \___  \   /  \  ____/| \_ __/ Mb/ __/ | \__/  /  /  /\__/ _|_|  _  \ \ /  |/  _  \ |  \  \ /  \ | \_  | |   \ \',replace('  ________  /\___________/\________|\______\n  \_  ___/\/  \___  \   /  \  ____/| \_ __/\n Mb/ __/ | \__/  /  /  /\__/ _|_|  _  \ \\n  /  |/  _  \ |  \  \ /  \ | \_  | |   \ \\n /   /___|___\|__|\  \____\|__|  |_|____\ \\n/____|PRESE|__|NTS-\__\-|__|--|__|---|_____\\n--------------(HACKER v5.3)-----------------\n - - - - - -<THe CL/\SSiC PFiLE>- - - - - - \n','\n',char(10)),'Hacker.doc',replace('\n                     Hacker 5.3 1992 by Marijuana Man\n                     Hemp For Victory! (619)/441-9949\n\nTo install:\n\n1. Copy the CLEAN command to your C: dir.\n\n2. Edit the path & BBS variables in Hacker and Hackermaint.Rexx.\n\n3. Copy Hacker and its data dir to wherever you are going to run it.\n\n4. Add it to your system as an AREXX file.\n\n5. In the game, type RESET to restart the game.\n\n6. Add hackermaint.rexx to your BBSevents as an arexx event.\n\nThat should be it!\n\n     Thank you for your download and hopefully, usage of this program. if you\nwould like to help see further development of these and other programs, please\nsend a $10 donation to help cover BBS expense, etc... The more I get, the more\ntime I can concentrate on bringing you the best of what I write. If you send a\ndonation and you have an account on my BBS, I will make sure your access\nreflects it. Send any donation to :\n                                    George Veeder\n                                    310 S. Anza St. #6\n                                    El Cajon, CA 92020\n\n   Don''t forget also to give our International Distribution Site a call:\n\n                  Proton Palace Professional 613-829-0909\n                   11 High Speed USR V.fast ready modems\n                                 6.1 Gigs\n       Official Distribution Point for all Hemp For Victory PFILES!\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',49865,22,0,NULL,NULL,'hacker53','scan',1780048539);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('hbt_pw21','HBT-PW21.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/HBT-PW21.LHA','PW-FokkUp','XIM','AmigaGuide',NULL,'DiSTLER','HBT','\  |  /  _  \  _ ____  \  _ _/  |  \   ____/ /  _  \  _  /  _  \ /  /  _  \__   /   | __) \__|__/__|__\__|__/____\_____/_____\___|___|',replace('[32m____________________________________________\n\  |  /  _  \  _ ____  \  _ _/  |  \   ____/\n/  _  \  _  /  _  \ /  /  _  \__   /   | __)\n\__|__/__|__\__|__/____\_____/_____\___|___|\n>     gIVE yA iN tHE yEAR oF hAPPINESS  tGø<\n>   PW-FokkUp   version 2.1  by  [0mDiSTLER[32m   <\n>       A PW-Fail door for /X 3.xx +       <\n>       With a nice bulletine output       <\n>       with the Last 1o PW-FokkUp''s       <\n>       and manny other nice things!       <\n`^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^''\n','\n',char(10)),'PW-FokkUp.GUIDE',replace('@database PW-FokkUp Doc\n\n@node MAIN "PW-FokkUp AmigaGuide Document (C) 1994 DiSTLER oF HARDBYTE"\n\n      ____________________________________\n      \    /  ¬\_____  ¬\_____  ¬\_____  ¬\::::::. ::: ::: .::::::.::::::\n      /ø  _    /ø  _    /ø  _  __/ø   /   /::: ::: ::: ::: :::    :::\n     //  /    //  /    //  /    //   /   / ::::::  `:::::: :::    :::::::\n    /___/___ /___/___ /___/___ /_______ /  ::: :::     ::: :::    :::\n          ¬\/      ¬\/      ¬\/tGø   ¬\/   ::::::'' ::::::'' :::    `::::::\n                     .p. .r. .e. .s. .e. .n. .t. .s.\n\n                         P W - F o k k U p  v2.1\n\n                         By DiSTLER oF HARDBYTE\n\n\n   -^+^- C O N T E N T S  O F  T H I S   D O C U M E N T A T I O N -^+^-\n        ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n                           @{" Introduction " Link introduction}\n                           @{" Requirements " Link Requirements}\n                           @{" Contense     " Link Contense}\n                           @{" Installation " Link Installation}\n                           @{" Tooltypes    " Link Tooltypes}\n                           @{" History      " Link History}\n                           @{" Future       " Link Future}\n                           @{" Contact      " Link Contact}\n                           @{" Members      " Link Members}\n                           @{" Greetings    " Link Greetings}\n\n\n@endnode\n@node Contense "Contense"\n\n Contense of what this package _SHOULD_ contain.\n\n            BBS                                   DIR\n            |\n            +-> Commands                          DIR\n            | `-> PWFAIL.info                    1826\n            |\n            `-> PW-FokkUp                         DIR\n              `-> PW-FokkUp.DESC                  495\n                > PW-FokkUp.iFF                  4254\n                > PW-FokkUp_Bulletin_OutPut.iFF  7310\n                > PW-FokkUp_Message.iFF          5076\n                > the SLAmmER.nfo                1288\n                > Wastelands.nfo                  827\n         \n            C                                     DIR\n            |\n            `-> amigaGuide                       6752\n         \n            libs                                  DIR\n            |\n            `-> amigaguide.library              62932\n@endnode\n@node Introduction "Introduction To PW-FokkUp v2.1"\n\n                   -^+^- I N T R O D U C T I O N -^+^-\n                        ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n   When a user connects to your bbs and writes the WRONG password 3 times\n   the dooor will start!\n\n   First of all it check''s which accesslevel the user has that is on the\n   way in! (possible hack atempt too!) If the access level equals one of\n   the access levels you have configured in the config the user will be\n   shown a txt file and then kicked out! (Hehe) And PW-FokkUp will write\n   a message to the user that got ''hacked''!\n\n   If the access don''t exist in the cfg PW-FokkUp will write a message\n   to the user and then enter the menu!\n\n   In the menu the user can do the following things:\n\n   1. Page sysop\n   2. Mail sysop\n   3. Disconnect\n\n   Well.. it''s quite self explaining!...\n\n\n   Let''s Jump over to the @{" Requirements " Link Requirements}\n@endnode\n@node Requirements "Requirements For PW-FokkUp v2.1"\n\n                   -^+^- R E Q U I R E M E N T S -^+^-\n                        ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n  An Commodore Amiga (500, 600, 1000, 1200, 2000, 2500, 3000, 4000)\n  With any CPU/FPU\n\n  And also AmiExpress (C) Joseph Hodge\n  Version 3.x++\n\n  And NOW Let''s @{" Install " Link Installation} This kewl door!!\n\n@endnode\n@node Installation "Installation Info For PW-FokkUp v2.1"\n\n                   -^+^- I N S T A L L A T I O N -^+^-\n                        ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n   Make a directory called PW-FokkUp in your DOORS:\n   Copy the exe file PW-FokkUp to DOORS:PW-FokkUp/\n   Copy the icon file PW-FokkUp.INFO to DOORS:PW-FokkUp/\n   Copy the PWFAIL.INFO icon to BBS:Commands/SYS.CMD/\n\n--------- CUT -------------\n   Makedir DOORS:PW-FokkUp\n   Copy RAM:PW-FokkUp/PW-FokkUp DOORS:PW-FokkUp/\n   Copy RAM:PW-FokkUp/PW-FokkUp.INFO DOORS:PW-FokkUp/\n   Copy RAM:COMMANDS/SYS.CMD/PWFAIL.INFO BBS:COMMANDS/SYS.CMD/\n--------- CUT -------------\n\n   Now edit the icon ''PW-FokkUp.INFO''\n\n   Ohh Yeahh!! And how should the @{" Tooltypes " Link Tooltypes} look like??\n@endnode\n@node Tooltypes "Tooltypes Info For PW-FokkUp v2.1"\n\n                      -^+^- T O O L T Y P E S -^+^-\n                           ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n\n   SYS_ACC=<###>                      = Simply just write the access level\n                                        for sysop''s!\n\n   COSYS_ACC=<###>                    = Same as above! A hint is to use it\n                                        for group member access!\n\n\n   SYS_FILE=<PATH/FILENAME>           = Full path and filename for file to\n                                        be displayed if access equals as\n                                        defined in SYS_ACC=[###] tool\n\n   COSYS_FILE=<PATH/FILENAME>         = Full path and filename for file to\n                                        be displayed if access equals as\n                                        defined in COSYS_ACC=[###] tool\n\n   BULL_OUTPUT=<PATH/FILENAME>        = Full path and filename for the\n                                        bulletine output\n\n   MSG_CONF_PATH=<PATH>               = Full path for the conference that\n                                        you want the msgs to be written!\n                                        like this: BBS:CONF1/\n                                        DON''T forget the ''/''!!!\n\n   MSG_ROWS=<##>                      = Number of rows a user got to write\n                                        a message to the sysop\n\n\n   Cool!! Ehh and now we''ll take a fast look at the @{" History " Link History}\n\n@endnode\n@node History "History Info For PW-FokkUp v2.1"\n\n                        -^+^- H I S T O R Y -^+^-\n                             ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n   v0.5   - First working one! NOT even beta tested!.\n\n   v0.9b  - Some bugs got terminated!\n            First beta tested version.\n\n   v0.91b - Some new ideas got added, Beta tested only.\n\n   v0.92b - Added some cosmetic stuff such as an ABOUT screen!\n            beta release only!\n\n   v1.0   - First public release\n\n   v1.1   - Made a small implement so that users only can page/write\n            3 times and nothing more. Shrunk the code with 3932 Bytes.\n            Speeded up the output a little bit!\n\n   v1.2   - Removed a minor bug in the message structure\n\n   v1.3   - Now pw-fokkup writes a message to the user who has forgot\n            his/her password. Good if it''s someone who are trying to HACK!\n\n   v1.4   - Added a bulletin routine that outputs a nice little bulletine\n            with  the 10 last fokkup''s!\n\n   v1.5   - Made some small adjustments here and there, A little\n            diffrent type of output and optimized all over the place!\n\n   v1.6-9 - Sum beta testing and sugestions added here and there...\n\n   v2.0   - Smaller designbugg fixed!\n\n   v2.1   - Here it is!!!... no buggs! (hopfully!) Should be the final\n            version. (Unless you got a nice idea that you wanna add?)\n\n   That''s cool!! And how is the @{" Future " Link Future} for PW-FokkUp then?\n\n@endnode\n@node Future "Future Info For PW-FokkUp v2.1"\n\n                         -^+^- F U T U R E -^+^-\n                              ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n   There is NO future!! Becoz the future is already here!!!\n\n   Ohh i see! well let''s move on to the @{" Greetings " Link Greetings} then!\n\n@endnode\n@node Greetings "Greetings Info For PW-FokkUp v2.1"\n\n                      -^+^- G R E E T I N G S -^+^-\n                           ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\n   Greetings goes to:\n\n   NiGHTSHADE/HBT          - Fokking kewl! Include stuff youre working on\n   LOOBY/INS               - Thnx for all support when i got STUCK!!\n   NECRONOMiCON/???        - The littil devil!!\n   DEATHWISH/???           - Beta testing is quite NICE!\n   AGAMEMNON/HCD           - Thnx for the cool sources that DON''T work!\n   BORRE/MEDICINE          - Hi Ho Iohooo!!:. Deep Freeze is nice eh?..\n   TBB/MEDICINE            - The little doctor!! ;)\n   Joseph Hodge            - Making /X for me so i can make /X Utils! =)\n\n   And with respect all of the users that are calling my board!\n\n   OK.. And where can i reach @{" DiSTLER " Link Contact} then?\n\n@endnode\n@node Contact "How to reach DiSTLER oF HARDBYTE"\n + NECRONOMiCON / iNSANE ......................... NiGHTSHADE / HARDBYTE  +\n 4 SNiPER / iNSANE       :   DiSTLER / HARDBYTE  : GUS / HARDCORE DESIGN  4\n 6   -  - -- ------------:--- -- - ·THE· - -- ---:------------ -- -  -    6\n          ___________:_  :___________ _______ ___:______________\n 8    _ _/   ____    ¦___/   _  _/   Y  _/   Y  _/   ____    _  ).        8\n       \\_____  \_   |  \_   _  \_      \_      \_   __/\_   _ ¯¯|\n 6       |   |   |   |   |   |   |   Y   |   Y   |   |   |   |   |        6\n 2       |   !   |   !   |   |   |   |   |   |   |   !   |   |   |        2\n 3       |       |       |   |   |   |   |   |   |       |   |   |        3\n         l___    l___    l___|   l___|   l___|   l___    l___|   |\n 0           \___|   \___|   l___|   l___|   l___|kRm\___|   l___|        0\n 1                       :                       :                        1\n     -  - -- ------------:--- -- -  - -  - -- ---:------------ -- -  -\n 9    68o3o/4oMhz        :      HARDBYTE HQ      : 4oo+ Meggs hd space    9\n 6     5 Meggs of ram    :.......................:  0-2! AMiGA-^-SNES     6\n             -^-  UsRobotics 21k6 V.Terbo DualStandard -^-\n     -+^+- + 46 - (O)8 - 623 O1 96 -^- + 46 - (O)8 - 623 O1 96 -+^+-\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n ___. __ __/\  ___________.______     ___:  __/\  ___ .__ ______  ______\n \_ || _)\_  \/  ___/     |\_ __/     \_ ¦  \_  \ \_ \| _)\_    \/  ___/\n /  ||  \/    \___  \\_/  |/  _)_     /  |/\/    \/   \  \/  \   \___  \\n/   /\   \ /\  \ l   \/   /   l  \   /   /  \ /\  \  \    \  l\   \ l   \\n\___/\___///____\____/____\______/DzG\  _____\/____\_|\___/_______/_____/\n«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»\/«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»\n\n SYSOP : NiGHTSHADE/HARDBYTE                              COSYSOP : NONE!\n                           _     _      _  __    __ _\n                   _|_ / |(_  _ (_) _ ||_   // |  / _)\n                    |  ¯¯|(_)   (_)   | _) / ¯¯| / /_\n\n         EQUiPMENT : 030/40 MHz, 21k6 DUAL STANDARD (28.8k SOON)\n\n«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»«»\n\n\n                       @{" Members of HARDBYTE " Link Members}\n@endnode\n@node Members "the Members oF HARDBYTE"\n\n                            THE MEMBERS OF\n\n       /\__ _                          :                     _ __  /\\