n your city\nand scream SATAN IS MY LORD! And NO FUCKING CHRIST have right to run this\ndoor!  This is just for anti-christ''s! JESUS was a lamer!   but over to the\ndoor.. this is a fast status door for /X and the ansi codes can be little \nfucked up on S!X because /X dosent send the real red & white ansi codes but\nS!X do it! so it can look awful on S!X  therefor i made a S!X version to! :)\nCheck the SATAN_IS_HERE.IFF to c how it should look!..  of cozz it gonna fuck\nup on your locale screen but it look really nice on the remote screen!! because\nthe ansi codes are not the same at local and remote. but shit happens!\n\n\n                    IF YOU WANT TO JO¡N ¡NTELLECT!?\n                    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n \n        CALL THE ORDER +46-26-272-656 (NUP=TRUST) AND PAGE ME!\n\n             WE ALWAYS SEARCHING FOR NEW QUALITY MEMBERS!\n\n                CODER, GFX, MUZAK, TRADERS, SUPPLIERS\n\n\n                               GREETS\n                               ~~~~~~\n\n Duracell - u so fucking drunk always! (like i''m)\n mfm      - thx for u''r support, c64 will never die out!\n Charlie  - for everything!\n Wraith   - Aga fix''s sux! heeh\n Snipe    - tnx for you''r gr8 logos!\n XerXes   - i like also CP''n !?!\n Etrigan  - penis!\n Snake    - Good luck for u and Defiance\n Sinister - cyber partys rulez!! \n Activate - drink your sperms!\n Satan    - Whitout u i have''t written this!\n Jesus    - you suxx!!! you gonna burn in hell!\n \n and all others i forgot so fucking tried of writing now!\n\n  \n\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,10158,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048545);
