                             \n                    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~                                        \n                                                                    \n  Just Copy Leech and Leech.info to Doors: if you lay it somewere else \n            it will fuck up! (Sorry fixed in next version)                      \n   Then Copy the directory called IntelliLeech into Doors:Intellect/   \n              Then Copy D.info into BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD/                          \n\n  (I expect you already have AEDOOR.LIBRARY in LIBS: if not so fix it!)            \n\n		        @{" MAIN MENU " link "MAIN"}\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "news" "wHAT iT iS!"\n@toc "menu"\n\nIt check your users if they are loosers or winner! It check               \nthe users ratio, and if it disable than the user have to leech as normal. \nElse it check the users access and compare with the tooltype ACCESS in    \ndoors:leech.info and if the users access over the tooltype nothing happen,\nbut if it''s lower it check users upload bytes and compare it with the     \ntooltype PUMP and if users pump lower than the tooltype the user does''nt\ncan leech before he/she pumped more than the value in the tooltype PUMP\n            \n                     @{" MAIN MENU " link "MAIN"}\n@endnode\n\n@node "rel" "Releases in 96"\n@toc "menu"\n\n                          @{"         Dec/Jan           " link "jan"}\n                          @{"           Feb             " link "feb"} \n\n  \n                                  @{" MAIN MENU " link "MAIN"}\n\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n@endnode\n@node "board" "iNTELLECT BOARDS!"\n@toc "menu"\n\nINSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ilt_inl','ILT-INL.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ILT-INL.LHA','Leech','XIM','Leech',NULL,'mATHEWs.','ILT','l__).\_ _!)  ¬l_--------------------------. .____|   \_    _/_ ·                       | |.  ¬|.   |.   l ¬\: > I N T E L L E C T < |',replace(' __  ____.____.\nl__).\_ _!)  ¬l_--------------------------.\n.