 access is over this limit then\n                          he or she don''t have to upload.\n\nPUMP=XXXXXXXXX          = Minimum ByteUploadLimit. If a users has less then\n                          this He or She must Upload before "he" could leech\n\n\n\n           IF YOU WANT TO CONTACT ME THEN CALL THIS BOARDS.\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n  THE ORDER   - ¡NTELLECT WORLD HEADQUARTER - +46-26-272-656  NUP=TRUST\n     \n       HALL OF FAME · SKYLINE · FUTURE ENTRANCE · POWER STATION\n\n\n\n                    IF YOU WANT TO JO¡N ¡NTELLECT!?\n                    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n \n       CALL THE ORDER +46-26-272-656 (NUP=TRUST) AND PAGE ME!\n\n             WE ALWAYS SEARCHING FOR NEW QUALITY MEMBERS!\n\n                CODER, GFX, MUZAK, TRADERS, SUPPLIERS\n\n\n                               GREETS\n                               ~~~~~~\n\n Duracell - u so fucking drunk always! (like i''m)\n mfm      - thx for u''r support, c64 will never die out!\n Charlie  - for everything!\n Wraith   - for beta testing this door, and u so fucking ugly!\n Snipe    - tnx for you''r gr8 logos!\n XerXes   - i like also CP''n !?!\n Etrigan  - your status door rulez!\n Carabat  - converting pc files? why? pc suxx! ;) heeh  \n Snake    - Good luck for u and Defiance\n Sinister - cyber partys rulez!! \n Activate - drink your sperms!\n \n and all others i forgot so fucking tried of writing now!\n\n                    SOON ¡NTELLECT GONNA RELEASE..\n                    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n                  PWfail - By Charlie    X¡M DOOR\n           Super Comment - By Etrigan    X¡M DOOR\n              Asz² order - By Duracell/WEiRD Al YANKOViC    X¡M DOOR \n             Intellipump - By Mathews    X¡M DOOR\n              Quicklogin - By Mathews    X¡M DOOR\n   Quicklogin DD version - By Mathews   DDDP DOOR\n              Intelliadd - By Mathews CLI COMMAND\n               Front-End - By Charlie    X¡M DOOR\n            Satan s