INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ins_xf10','INS-XF10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/INS-XF10.LHA','AMIKILLER','XIM','AMIKILLER',NULL,NULL,'INS','\     /__ :___/ ______|____    \|  _/____|__ \___/   \|   \_____  \  _ \   \\  | ___   / |   |   \\   |   ____/ _/  \_ |\__| \____/_',replace('__¡____   ·    _______.   _ ___ .____<e> !  \n\     /__ :___/ ______|____    \|  _/____|__\n \___/   \|   \_____  \  _ \   \\  | ___   /\n |   |   \\   |   ____/ _/  \_ |\__| \____/_\n |___|   |\___|___/ _ __\    /_|  \____    /\n _ __ ___|               \__/         \___/ \n  ¡        iNSANE rAPEZ YoU WitH:        |  \n  |        ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯        |\n  |     /X Fucker Virus Killer v1.0!     |\n  !         ©1995 BiGWiG/iNSANE!         !\n  ÷--------------------------------------÷  \n','\n',char(10)),'AMIKILLER.GUIDE',replace('@database "/X Fucker Killer Doc"\n@Author "BiGWiG / iNSANE"\n@(c) "Copyright © 1994 BiGWiG / iNSANE"\n@$VER: StripCompare.Guide 1.0\n\n@Node Main "/X Fucker Killer Doc"\n\n     ______ _______  _____ _ _______ __________________  _______ _________ \n     \_    |_      \|      /   ____/_______.    __     \|      /   _     / \n      /    |/       \     /____.      /    |_   \/      \     /    _)___/  \n   s_/    _/      \     _/     l     /     _/    \_    \    _/     |    \_s\n   c\_____\_______|\____\___________/      l______/    |\___\____________/c\n<-- -------------------------------\_______|-----------''                   \n                        (÷  P. R. E. S. E. N. T. S  ÷)\n                     \n                    >>> THE /X FUCKER VIRUSKILLER V1.0 <<<\n\n            CODING BY: BIGWIG/INSANE!  RELEASE DATE: 19 MARS 1995!\n\n÷=========================================================================÷\n\n		   @{" Disclaimer " Link Disclaimer}\n		   @{" Requierments " Link Requierments}\n		   @{" What is /X Fucker ? " Link WhatIs}\n		   @{" What Does The Killer Do ? " Link WhatKiller}\n		   @{" How To Use The Killer " Link Usage}\n		   @{" How To Contact The Author " Link Author}\n		   @{" Greetings " Link Greets}\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "DisClaimer"\n\n    Disclaimer\n    ----------\n\n    /X Fucker Killer is FREEWARE, which  means it may distributed freely,\n    for non commercial purposes,but the author keeps its COPYRIGHT on it,\n    so you can''t PATCH, MODIFY, or ALTER  the main  program or its  docs.\n\n    You  use this  program  at your  own risks! It is  provided  "as-is",\n    without any  warranties on its reliability.  I may not, by any means,\n    be held  responsible for  any bugs/breakdowns/damages  caused to your\n    software/hardware,  by /X Fucker Killer,  even if every care has been\n    taken  to make this  program as  efficient and  bug-free as possible.\n\n    This  program  may be  spread freely  as long as  no fee  other  than\n    transport/disk is asked for, and the files remain together, not\n    modified. (except for archiving purposes)\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Requierments"\n\n    Requierments\n    ------------\n\n    The /X Fucker Killer should work under any configuration, under\n    OS 2.xx and 3.xx. It has been tested on A500 Kick 2.xx, A1200 and\n    A4000. If it shouldn''t work, try to boot without any external and/or\n    internal extra hardware installed, since it should work fine on a\n    standard os2.xx/3.xx amiga.\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "WhatIs"\n\n    What is /X Fucker Virus ??\n    --------------------------\n\n    The virus is a linkvirus which contaminate executable files with only\n    one HUNK of code, and files  with a similar  header. This virus, Just\n    like every  other virus, copies  itself to a free space in memory and\n    places its adress at the DOS.Library function Open(). This means that\n    every  time a  file is  opened, the  virus  checks if the  file is an\n    executable file, and if  then it links  itself onto that file. But it\n    doesn''t  attack text nor  packed files or  others files with  several\n    HUNKS of code. With one exception thou! If the file thats about to be\n    opened, by any program,that starts with the path "BBS:"infront of the\n    filename, the  virus will change the  parameters for  Open() and then\n    it will create a NEW file, overwriting the existing file. Now this is\n    a real  pain in the ass for the  AmiX BBS Sysops, since  their boards\n    often do  calls like these, resulting  in a major loss of vital data.\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "WhatKiller"\n\n    What Does The Killer Do ??\n    --------------------------\n\n    First of all the  viruskiller checks if the  virus is resident in the\n    memory. If it is, it will  advice the user to  reboot on a  virusfree\n    disk, with a new copy of the viruskiller, since the one just executed\n    is most likely  infected aswell.  Well, If it passed the memorycheck,\n    it will  either prompt you with a  Reqtools-Requester or a CliPrompt,\n    with the simple  request of file(s)/dir(s)  to scan for  the virus...\n\n    WARNING !!!\n\n    If the /X Fucker VirusKiller Executable File Lenght ain''t 7976 bytes\n    unpacked, there is something wrong, maybe some other virus or shite!\n\n    WARNING !!!\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Usage"\n\n    How to use the /X Fucker Killer\n    -------------------------------\n\n    There is two ways of using this killer. First one is to just type its\n    name at the cli prompt and then choose  the file/dir to be scanned in\n    the reqtools-requester that pops up.\n\n    The  other way  is to write directly which file/dir to scan after the\n    commandname. E.g.\n\n		AmiKill dh0:c/assign	;File Scanning\n\n		AmiKill dh0:c		;Directory Scanning\n\n    When choosing a dir to scan, it will allways be recursivly scanned.\n\n\n    Note: There is NO way of breaking the virusscan, since it could\n          result in a Non-Validated device or even worse, some mean\n          checksum errors or other not so very welcome errors.\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Author"\n\n    Authors Words\n    -------------\n\n    Well, if you''d like to contact me for any reason, such as bugreports,\n    ideas, economical contributions ..  whatever ... Feel free to mail me\n    either by  mail or  with  a msg at  the addy/number following  below.\n\n    At the very start, this program was only ment to be a checker, thou I\n    decided after some requests to complete it as a viruschecker/killer !\n    And even I got some trouble with the virus myself, even though I dont\n    run a BBS, causion was that lots of them vital files of my system got\n    infected and even in some cases destroyed,I though that I could spare\n    some hours of hard work for you others non-bbs ownes also ...\n\n    Well, what more is there to say ?  Nothing else, except that it would\n    be gr8 fun if the ones who find this utility usefull, came with their\n    oppinions, ideas or sum, so that i knew i didn''t do it all 4 nothin''!\n\n    Contact:	Mail BiGWiG/iNSANE at\n\n		INSANITARY BBS\n		Tel: +46-8-7595847!\n\n		or write a letter to\n\n		Mickael Lauritsen\n		Ribbingsväg 83\n		191 52 Sollentuna\n		Sweden\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Greets"\n\n    Greets to all Insane Members and all of the others i know.\n\n    Thanx Goes To Twins/Phenomena for the usefull help with\n                   The Fileheader-Structure.. Thanks mates!\n\n                  Cluster/Insane for Sacrificing his BBS to\n                      explore the consequnces of the virus.\n@EndNode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',43923,4,0,NULL,NULL,'ins_xf10','scan',1780048553);
