_____________________.::::|                  |\n::::.                              |       -                             |\n:::.         - --> YaR MasTeR iS  : Mr.SONy                              |\n:::.                               |                                     |\n:::::.             aND dA FirsT onE BehiND iS KaNE / DlT <-- -       /   |\n::::::.                            | - -->                          / /  |\n::::::::.                          |_____________________________________|\n::::::::::........    RePLaY foR da nuMbeRs AnD nEw nuPE   ....  .     ...\n:::::::::::::::::::::::::::: IsDN coMMinG SooN :::::::::::::::::::::::::::\n::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',15523,8,0,NULL,NULL,'kctup11j','scan',1780048560);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('kd_cs13u','KD_CS13U.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/KD_CS13U.LHA','ConfStats','XIM','ConfStats',NULL,NULL,'KD','| _¦/  / \____. \/ ._____. \/ .______. . \ | \¯  /¦  \   :  \ : \¦  ¦  \ ¦n$\¦  ¡_¡  \ |  \  \¦   \  ¦   \·­ \  ¦   \¦   \   :    \',replace(' __  ___________  _________  ____________\n| _¦/  / \____. \/ ._____. \/ .______. . \\n| \¯  /¦  \   :  \ : \¦  ¦  \ ¦n$\¦  ¡_¡  \\n|  \  \¦   \  ¦   \·­ \  ¦   \¦   \   :    \\n|__/\__\___/__|___/___/______/____/___¦____/\n[34m                      ROYAL /X DIVISION[0m\n/X Tough Stats v1.2 & Conference Stats v1.3 \n Updated and 100% from the author himself!\n','\n',char(10)),'Stats.doc',replace('\n\n\n        ______. _______.______   _______________  _______ _ _______\n       \\_   ¬|/   /  ¬\___. ~\-jT  ___/____.  ¬\/___.  ~\        ~\  __/\__\n   __/\__\_   /   /\    \_ |   \   /.__|_  ~|    \   |    \___.     \ \    /\n   \    / |       \      / |    \  \|   ~\  |     \  |     \  | |    \/_  _\\n   /_  _\ |   \    \_   /  |     \        \ |     /  |     /  |_|    _/ \/  \n     \/   |___|\____/__/___|_____/________/______/________/___| |____//\n                                 RoYaL /X DiViSioN\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n                          /X Tough Stats v1.2 by Json\n                 /X Tough Stats v1.3 Conference Stats by Json\n\n It''s the old Stats door by Neurostorm''n''Deature with a lot of new features...\nand BUG FIXED! and also included is a new idea! \n\n The old Stats door was limited to showing the total stats of the user! (so is\nthe v1.2), but after converting to Conf. Accounting I needed something more, so\nI invented the v1.3 Conference Stats (this can only be used with Conf. Acc.)\n\n Seems like I really blew! When this was released the first time, the door had\njust been changed, and not fully tested! so this is the UPDATED versions!\nsorry...\n\n Well... the serious things:\n\nInstallation:\n-------------\n\n    You just throw the doors in your DOORS: directory and put the icons in the\n\n   BBSCMD directory (call them whatever you want!)\n\n    If you''re not using /X v3.x I can''t guarentee that the door works!\n\n\nGreets to:\n----------\n\n   no order!:\n\n      Neurostorm, Deature, Spacebrain, Warner, Wardancer, Bohemian, Philix,\n     Enzo, Pennywise, Conan, Energy, Heat, Paxdei, Ironcode, Zwoolock...\n\n  and the rest!\n\n\nHistory:\n--------\n\n\n  Hm.... can''t remember! just did it! and...\n\n\n\nBug report etc:\n---------------\n\n Call me at:\n\n    Static Chaos ............ +45 8643 9514 (Kingdom DKHq)\n                              +45 8641 8502 (Kingdom Royal /X Division WHq)\n    Sky Tower ............... +45 7514 1744 (Kingdom ScHq)\n\nWell that''s it, and that''s that!\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',12780,5,0,NULL,NULL,'kd_cs13u','scan',1780048560);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('kdz_ludb','KDZ!LUDB.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/KDZ!LUDB.LHA',NULL,'XIM','LE-win5-96.exe',NULL,'sERAPH','KDZ','/   |/  _/   __ \_/  |/  _/  __/__   kEKS /    \    \_  \___/   \    \_____  \_ cNET \____|\    /____  \___|\    /_______/ dESiGN',replace('  ___. __________   __. _________\n /   |/  _/   __ \_/  |/  _/  __/__   kEKS\n/    \    \_  \___/   \    \_____  \_ cNET\n\____|\    /____  \___|\    /_______/ dESiGN\n       \__/kDZ!\___/    \__/cD!\n LAST-UDLOAD v1.0b - Release Date: 12-07-95\n    dONE bY sERAPH   -  !BUGFIXED VERSION!','\n',char(10)),'lOSeNDOS.guide',replace('                   \n                     __  _ __  /\__ _  _ __/\  __ _  __\n                    _\/___   \/              \/   ___\/_\n              ......\/\  /........................\  /\/......\n             :         \/                          \/         :\n             :      .___             .___         .___        :\n             :   _ _|   \      ______|   \  ______|   \       :\n             :   \\\__   7___  \______   /  \__   ____/       :\n             :      /.   |   \__/.  l/   \___/_____   \__ _   :\n             :     /::.  |    _/::.       _/::.  l/    _///   :\n             :     \___________\___________\____________\     :\n             :___        .___        .___        .___         :___\n     _ ______|   \ ______|   \ ______|   \ ______|   \  ______|   \\n     \\\__   ____/ \______   / \______   / \______   /  \__   ____/\n        /.   ___|___/.   |   \__/.  _|   \__/.  l/   \___/_____   \__ _\n       /::.  l/   _/::.  |    _/::. \___  _/::.       _/::.  l/    _///\n       \_ _________\_____|_____\___________\___________\___________ \\n         Y   :                                                :[nM$]Y\n      .------''                                                `------.\n      :eXON/rIOT^jORMAS · gHANDY/gODS · rAHIEM/eSSENCE · cELIC/rEKTUM: \n      `------.                                                .------''\n             `------------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',9033,5,0,NULL,NULL,'kdz_ludb','scan',1780048560);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('kdz_sd11','KDZ!SD11.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/KDZ!SD11.LHA',NULL,'XIM','rexxreqtools.library',NULL,'sERAPH','KDZ','/   |/  _/   __ \_/  |/  _/  __/__   kEKS /    \    \_  \___/   \    \_____  \_ cNET \____|\    /____  \___|\    /_______/ dESiGN',replace('  ___. __________   __. _________\n /   |/  _/   __ \_/  |/  _/  __/__   kEKS\n/    \    \_  \___/   \    \_____  \_ cNET\n\____|\    /____  \___|\    /_______/ dESiGN\n       \__/kDZ!\___/    \__/cD!\n              sYSOPDOWNLOAD V1.1\n   Release Date: 12-16-95 - dONE bY sERAPH\n','\n',char(10)),'sysud.doc',replace('\n                   anotha fine tool by da\n                        ___             ___\n               _ ______/  /____________/  /_________\n                __   _/ _/  _____/   _/ _/\  ______/\n                /    \   \  __/_/    \   \ \____\ \n                \____/   /______\____/   /______/\n               ]KdZ-/   /-----------/   /----cD![\n                    \__/            \__/\n\n                       KEKS CNET DESIGN\nKEKS SYSOPDOWNLOAD V1.1!\n\n1.Introduction\n==============\n\nWith SysopDownload (SD) every User, who has a special Level or who knows\nthe PW can leech all the Files, which are on your HD! Yes... but why should\nyou use SD? Well because not everyone is used to the CNET-SHELL and with \nthis tool he can only download files, whit the SHELL he can also delete \nfiles!\n\nYou can configure which level the user have to have. If his level is below\nthe given level, he have to know the password to proceed. When he starts \ndownloading, it will be asked for a FREE-LEECH-PW . If he knows this PW\nthe bytez and files will not get added to his DOWNLOADBYTEZ /-FILEZ!\n\nIdea:          many guys (i only know the Sysopdownload by \n	       BYTEANDI/X-Design of TRSI)\nCode:          All AREXX-Code done by sERAPH/kDz, but i don''t know\n	       who coded the C-commands!\n\nPLEASE DO NOT CHANGE ANYTHING, AND IF YOU ARE USING THIS NICE TOOL, LET\nUS KNOW IT! CALL ONE OF THE KEKSDESIGN-BOARD OR LEAVE A MESSAGE AT THE\nCOCO-NET! BUG-REPORT AND SUGGESTIONS TO:\n\nCount Dan:       Confusion BBS: (0341 - 6896640) \n				leave a message at the logon-prompt!\n				running latest version of CNET !\n\n2. Contents of this Archive\n===========================\n\n		sysud     - main program (don''t change anything!)\n		sysud.cfg - config file\n		temp/     - required dir !\n		sysud.doc - this doc!\n		sysud.dok - German Doks\n\n3.Installation\n==============\n\nCopy all the files to pfiles: ! THE DIR pfiles:KEKSDESIGN/sysud/TEMP/ must\nexist !!\n\nAdd in your systext:bbsmenu following line where you want to have it\n(if you don''t know where to place it, read in your CNET-manual ;) )\n\nSD	#0pfiles:keksdesign/sysud/sysud}\n	^                               ^\n	|                               ` SHIFT + ALT + "+"\n	` CTRL + "Q"\n\nNow load the sysud.cfg into an editor:\n------------------- cut here -------------------------\n31\nleech\n4free\ndelete\n0\n0\ndh1:\n------------------- cut here -------------------------\n1. line: Level you have to have to use SD without knowing the Password\n	 [If you use 32 everyone have to enter the pw!]\n2. line: The password you have to know to use SD !\n	 [NONE=No Password to know]\n3. line: The password to leech the files for FREE!\n	 [NONE=always for free Dl]\n4. line: The password to delete a file!\n	 [NONE=no password needed to delete the file(s)]\n5. line: 0=Only shows Files ending with .txt, .doc, .dok, .nfo\n	 1=Shows all files (shows also e.g. c:dir,c:list,c:lha)\n6. line: 0=QUICKMODE ACTIVE\n	 1=QUICKMODE INACTIVE\n7. line: the default dir \n	 [if this dir NOT exists, a requester will be open on the\n	  WB-SCREEN - SO BE CAREFULLY!]	\n\nATTENTION: PASSES MUST BE DIFFERENT FROM THE CHAR "Q", BECAUSE WITH Q\n	   YOU CAN QUIT THE PROGRAM AND FROM "NONE", BECAUSE WITH\n	   NONE YOU DISABLE THE PASSWORD-PROTECTION!\n\nTHat''s all folks!\n\n\n4.Requirements\n==============\nAn Amiga (i coded this fine tool on a A1200 with no extras,that means \n14,4 MHZ and 2 MB ram! and it all works fine !)- CNET and an AREXX-Server\n\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\nATTENTION: With 2 MB RAM and running rpstart, CNET, CED i had not have \n	   enough ram for crunching the progs and the computer went down\n	   (GURUUUUUUU , GURUUUUUUUU!! ;) ). Well be carefully !\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n\nCOMMANDS:\n	c:LIST	  - oN aLL wBs\n	c:DELETE  - oN aLL wBs\n	c:ZIP     - yOU hAVE tO hAVE oNE\n	c:LHA	  - yOU hAVE tO hAVE oNE\n	c:echo    - oN aLL wBs\n	libs:rexxreqtools.library - iNCLUDED iN THIS aRCHIV\n	libs:reqtools.library - Shareware\n\nATTENTION:\n	reqtools.library     - (c)OPYRIGHT 1991-1994 by Nico François\n	rexxreqtools.library - (c)OPYRIGHT 1992-1994 by Rafael D''Halleweyn\n\nWhy i have decided to use c-commands? Yes why not? they are written in ASS\n(CNET didn''t support ASS-PROGS, or can you write cNET-tOOLS in ASS? tHEN\n cONTACT mE!), they are fast. And the script get faster and shorter !\n\nYou can get lha- and the zip-command in every PD-Board ! So leech it, if\nyou don''t have it !\n\n5.History\n=========\n\n05-??-95        v0.1ß   Now i remember me ! My first try to copy the\n			Sysopdownload from Byteandi! Very lame (slow \n			also .) ). I never ended it really, but when\n			i installed my new harddisk, i couldn''t save\n			it ! BETTER THAN EVER:\n\n12-03-95	v0.1	first release - only one cruncher available\n			hardly no design - very slow\n			RELEASE DOESN''T WORK (I OPTIMIZED IT WITH \n			REXXOPT V1.6 AND THEN IT WON''T WORK, DON''T\n			KNOW WHY! ;()\n\n12-04-95	v0.2	now 2 cruncher (PC-AMIGA/ZIP-LHA) \n			          !more design ! \n			you can now deselect your selected files\n			in the normal selection base- cleans up the\n			filebuffer, no longer filenumbers like:\n			1 3 5 8! \n			BUG REMOVED: NOW CHECKING LOST CARRIER\n\n12-05-95	v0.3	now you can ONLINE-delete files, after entering\n			a password! You can see all the Textfiles (files)\n			on the hd! Checks if the Dir is empty (BUG)\n			Shows selected files in the FILE-/DIRLISTING\n			\n12-07-95	v0.3b	THE FIRST VERSION, WHERE YOU CAN REALLY DOWNLOAD\n			(I forgot to include the path to the file! ;(((( )\n\n12-11-95	v1.0	Now the Sysop can select the file(s) with an\n			REQTOOLS-FILE-REQUESTER - but take a look!\n\n12-16-95	v1.1	Gain some bytez! REQTOOLS-FILE-REQUESTER NOW\n			WORKS! (i forgot to include the \n			rexxsupport.library!) ! WELL SOME NEW INFOS \n			SHOWN! DELETE OPTION REMOVED!\n\n			\n6.FEATURES\n==========\n\n	What will be new in version 1.2?\n\n		a) TESTING ARCS bEFORE DOWNLOADING!\n		b) yOUR sUGGESTIONS tO cONFUSION bBS!\n\n\n7.WANTED!\n=========\n\nKeks Design is in need of more members! We only search talented CNet-Tools-\nCoders and Ascii Artists! If you can code in C, ASM or Arexx, please contact\nus at the following boards:\n\nSeraph:		Mystic BBS:    (030  - offline)\nCount Dan:	Confusion BBS: (0341 - 6896640)\nrEINER:		Dreamland:	030 - 3457418 (288)\n				030 - 3459976 (144)\n\nLeave a message at the logon-prompt - we''ll call you back!\nThanx a lot!\n\n8.Keks Design Memberlist\n========================\n\nCount Dan:	Leader, Ascii Artist, CNet-Tools-Coder\nSeraph:		German Headquarter Sysop, CNet-Tools-Coder\nMalcolm X:	Ascii Artist, CNet-Tools-Coder\nMeucci:         Script-writer !\n\nPlease note: because of less coding and supporting KeksDesign, TINIC is\nno longer Keks Design Member! But have a look at his great program\nTinyMeter!\n\n9.Bye bye!\n==========\n\nWell, that''s the end of this doc! Have fun with our productions and\nremember: Save the scene! Don''t be lazy! Move your ass!\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',26860,5,0,NULL,NULL,'kdz_sd11','scan',1780048560);
