INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('m_bbct08','M!BBCT08.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/M!BBCT08.LHA',NULL,'XIM','BB-ConfTopUtil.000',NULL,NULL,NULL,'\_     \  /    \  _   |   :/     \_    \ _|  \_/ \/   7  \/|   |   |   7   \  |  \__ |   |   \   j   \|   |   :   j   /  |   \',replace('_/\____    ___________.   ² ______/\___\n\_     \  /    \  _   |   :/     \_    \\n_|  \_/ \/   7  \/|   |   |   7   \  |  \__\n |   |   \   j   \|   |   :   j   /  |   \\n |   |    \______/l___l___j\_____/l__|    \\n_l___jdn  /_____ /T\iNNOVATIONS _____l____/\n     l___/   -> BB-Conftop v0.8 <-\n Conference Top Weekuploader door/util for\n Tempest.\nCode:BiLBo BaGGins/M!^RNX  Design:Sc/DeZIGN\n','\n',char(10)),'BB-ConfTop.guide',replace('@database BB-Conftop\012@master Coding:Sources/C/Tempest/BB-Conftop/BB-Conftop.guide\012@$VER: v0.8 (02-08-95)\012@author "BiLBo BaGGIns/MOTION^REDENX"\012@(c) "1995 MoTioN"\012@wordwrap\012@font topaz.font 8\012@index main\012@help "main"\012@index main\012@remark Created with Heddley v1.1 (c) Edd Dumbill 1994\012\012@node "main" "Guide to BB-Conftop v0.8 by BiLBo BaGGIns/MoTioN"\012@next "intro"\012                                             .:\012                                           .::|\012            _/\____ __    ______/\________::::| _____ _/\_____\012            \_____¬Y ¬\  /    ¬\     ____7::::|/    ¬\\______¬\\012   _  _ __ _ |    7 _  \/   7   \   /   ¬|::::|   7   \|   ¬7  \__ _ __  _\012  (_((_ __ _ |    | 7   \   |    \_/|    :::::|   |    \    |   \_ _ __))_)\012             |    |_|    \  l    /  |    |::::|   l    /    |    \\012             l____j |    /______/   l____j::::l_______/l____j    /\012                    l___/                |::::·         Jdn l___/\012                                         :::·\012                                         :·\012\012                        -^-  Tempest Inovations  -^-\012\012                              BB-Conftop v0.8\012\012                    cODE bY BiLBo BaGGIns/MOTION^REDNEX\012                            dESIGN bY Sc/DeZiGN\012\012                      @{"          iNTRODUCTION          " link "intro" 0} \012                      @{"          iNSTALLATION          " link "install" 0} \012                      @{"          fUTURE pLANS          " link "plans" 0} \012                      @{"           bUG rEPORT           " link "bugs" 0} \012                      @{"             gREETS             " link "greets" 0} \012                      @{"         tOOLS oVERVIEW         " link "tools" 0} \012                      @{"          mOTION iNFOS          " link "motion" 0}\012                      @{"              eXIT              " quit}\012@endnode\012\012@node "intro" "-^- iNTRODUCTION -^-"\012@next "install"\012@prev "main"\012\012  BB-Conftop is a ConferenceWeekTopUploader util/door for Tempest.\012\012  Features:\012  - shows TopUploader, Location, Bytes and Files\012  - nice design by Sc/DeZIGN\012  - fast\012  - Utils and Doorversion included\012  - full multinode compatible\012\012  Changes:\012  - new design by Sc/DeZIGN\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "install" "-^- iNSTALLATION -^-"\012@next "plans"\012@prev "intro"\012\012  Why different versions? Sometimes I wanted to have a realtime updating\012  door. I coded it and later mentioned that it`s not working correct in\012  the C_Area.txt files. Than I tried to do it with the prompts, but the\012  result was not much better. So I decided to update the old Utils version.\012  I`m now running the Door version in the Bulletins and the Utils version\012  in the C_Area.txt files.\012\012\012  Copy BB-Conftop(Util) to Doors:.\012\012  There are different versions for each CPU in the archive. Copy only the\012  one you need to Doors: and cut the .xxx out of the name.\012\012\012  Installation of the Door-version:\012  ---------------------------------\012\012  Edit your Bulletins.opt file:\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  [20-,*,*,*,*] =3   |T-DOOR|Tempest:Doors/BB-Conftop\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012\012\012  Installation of the Util-version:\012  ---------------------------------\012\012  Usage:\012  BB-ConftopUtil <Conf> <Accounts> <Catalogs> <Output>\012\012  Options:\012  <Conf>     Number of the Conference where to create Conftop\012  <Accounts> Path where the Accounts.data are located\012  <Catalogs> Path where the Callerslogs are located\012  <Output>   Name of the Outputfile\012\012  Edit your LogOff(-x).bat file(s):\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  Tempest:Utils/BB-ConftopUtil 2 Tempest: Tempest:Catalogs/ Tempest:Bulletins/Conftop.txt\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "MAIN" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "plans" "-^- fUTURE pLANS -^-"\012@next "bugs"\012@prev "install"\012\012  I`m thinking of some record stats.\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "bugs" "-^- buG rEPORT -^-"\012@next "greets"\012@prev "plans"\012\012  I think everything must run ok now. If you find Bugs some, please report\012  them to me.\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "greets" "-^- gREETINGS fLOW oUT tO -^-"\012@next "tools"\012@prev "bugs"\012\012                        mY pERSONAL gREETINGS gO tO:\012                        ----------------------------     \012                                   Agent\012                                Andy/MoTioN\012                              Aquarius/Outlaws\012                                 BBC/MoTioN\012                                 Ben/MoTioN\012                                 Braindead\012                                Calypso/GOD\012                               Castor/Par