@{"          iNTRODUCTION          " link "intro" 0} \012                      @{"          iNSTALLATION          " link "install" 0} \012                      @{"          fUTURE pLANS          " link "plans" 0} \012                      @{"           bUG rEPORT           " link "bugs" 0} \012                      @{"             gREETS             " link "greets" 0} \012                      @{"         tOOLS oVERVIEW         " link "tools" 0} \012                      @{"          mOTION iNFOS          " link "motion" 0}\012                      @{"              eXIT              " quit}\012@endnode\012\012@node "intro" "-^-> iNTRODUCTION -^-"\012@next "install"\012@prev "main"\012\012  BB-NuKE is a Nuker for Tempest.\012\012  Features:\012  - handles up to 20 filenames/numbers/ranges\012  - deduct/give Credits to the uploader\012  - send mail to uploader\012  - delete file from drive/catalog/lock out\012  - give Credits back to the Downloader/send mail to them\012  - make File freedown/send priority mail about it\012  - fast\012  - coded in C\012\012  Changes:\012  - dateline comment bug fixed\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "install" "-^- iNSTALLATION -^-"\012@next "plans"\012@prev "intro"\012\012  Copy BB-NuKE(.description|dateline) to Doors:\012\012\012  Edit your .opt file(s):\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  [200-,*,*,*,*] =nuke |T-DOOR|Tempest:Doors/BB-NuKE\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012\012\012  Edit your BB-Nuke.dateline file:\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  >>dUPE<<\012  >>oLD!<<\012  aNCIENT!\012  cORRUPT!\012  >>fAKE<<\012  rENAMED!\012  >bANNED<\012  >wRONG!<\012  >>sHIT<<\012  >>cRAP<<\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  Up to 10 comments with max 8 chars.\012\012\012  Edit your BB-Nuke.description file:\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  uSE zIPPY dUDE !!!   \012  nO cRAP uPLOADS !!!  \012  tRY iT AGAIN..       \012  aGAIN -> dELETED !!! \012  aLWAYS tHE sAME...   \012  fIRST oNE wINS !!!   \012  wHAT sHOULD I dO ??  \012  cHECK uR uPLOADS m8!!\012  mAJOR dOUBLEZ !!!    \012  mAJOR tRIPLEZ !!!    \012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  Up to 10 comments with max 21 chars.\012\012\012  How to use it:\012  -  You can enter up to 20 filenames at once or filenumbers/ranges. Ranges\012     must look like that: 11-15.\012  -  You can make files freedown and send a priority mail about it.\012  -  You can deduct Bytes and give. Just type -1 instead of 1.\012  -  Yoi can send a mail to the User about it.\012  -  You can delete it from drive. If you choose that you are asked if you\012     want to lock out it. Lock out means that the nuker is making a 0 Byte\012     file, so that nobody can upload it again. And you can remove it from\012     Catalog, so the file is not shown when viewing the Catalog.\012  -  You can make a Datecomment. That will appear where the Date stands.\012  -  You can make a Descriptioncomment. That will be the last line of the\012     filedescription.\012  -  You can give Creditsback to the downloaders. Every downloader gets his\012     credits back and receives a mail about it.\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "MAIN" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "plans" "-^- fUTURE pLANS -^-"\012@next "bugs"\012@prev "install"\012\012  Build fakecommenter for every user.\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "bugs" "-^- buG rEPORT -^-"\012@next "greets"\012@prev "plans"\012\012  Hope it`s bugfree now. If you find some contact me.\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "greets" "-^- gREETINGS fLOW oUT tO -^-"\012@next "tools"\012@prev "bugs"\012\012       