.\n         In the 2nd Line you have to put your Path to the callerslog.\n\n         *** That''s all ***\n\n\n                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}\n@endnode\n\n@Node Plans "(- Future Plans -)"\n\n * I wanna code some more useful /X-Tools\n   but next time they will be coded in C\n\n\n                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}\n@endnode\n@node Greet "(- Greetings -)"\n\n\n\n                              Greetings go to\n          BBC/MoTioN...............thx for your "Chaos-ASM-Kurs" \n          Andy/MoTioN...................biggest greetings to you\n          Sisko/MoTioN..............................Hello to you\n          Incubus/GOD.......................keep on trading dude\n          \\X/arhawk/Logic................Strip`n Add is the best\n          tHe aDDiCt/5D.....................say thanx to Hillary\n          Calypso/GOD...............I think we have to call more\n                     and all the rest I have forgotten\n\n\n\n                                 @{" WOW ! " link "MAIN"}\n@endnode\n\n@Node Last "(- Last Words -)"\n\n                      Other MoTioN /X tools avaible:\n\n Multi-Diz....................New DIZ system for all files.............Andy\n News In All Conferences......Showing `n s u` in all conferences.......Andy\n On-Line-Message..............Sending online message...................Andy\n OnLineBulletinsUpdater.......Updating bulls if ya wanna se it.........Andy\n PlaY-PeN-PaRt-UpLoAD-MoVeR...Moves files after a system crash.........Andy\n LHADo........................LHA-Checker/Stripper/Adder................BBC\n Textstripper.................Text-Stripper/Adder.......................BBC\n Dream Status.................Status door.............................Bilbo\n StarTrek.....................Star Trek comment door..................Bilbo\n Frontstatus..................Frontend door...........................Bilbo\n Userlist.....................Creates userlist bulletin...............Bilbo\n FileIDAdd....................Add your line to FileID.........BiLBo BaGGins\n User Answer Shower...........Shows the new user answers......BiLBo BaGGins\n SendAnswer...................Sends User Answer to Sysop......BiLBo BaGGins\n sTRIP bBS aDDIES.............Stripps ADDs in File_id.DIZ.gONZALEZ&jOE cOOL\n rEALOG.......................Callerslog Viewer....................gONZALEZ\n nEW uSERS aNSWER.............Shows New Users Answers..............jOE cOOL\n pAGER........................Sysop Pager..........................jOE cOOL\n oPEN.........................Another Open Door....................jOE cOOL\n cOMMENT......................Another Comment Door.................jOE cOOL\n                     \n                      MoTioN -  The Force that moves\n\n\n                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}\n@endnode\n\n@Node Call "(- Call Now -)"\n\n                          MoTioN boards worldwide:\n\n DEEP SPACE NINE     WHQ        #1: +49-7-Ask-For-IT V32.bis   Sisko\n                          2 Ndz RD: +49-7-Ask-For-IT DST 21.6\n                          2 Ndz RD: +49-7-Ask-For-IT ISDN\n SANITARIUM          GHQ        #1: +49-8-Ask-For-IT DST       jMS\n                                #2: +49-8-Ask-For-IT DST\n                                #3: +49-8-Ask-For-IT V32.bis\n WILD MARIA          GHQ        #1: +49-7-Ask-For-IT V32.bis   Joe Cool\n                                #2: +49-7-Ask-For-IT V32.bis\n PARANOID ILLUSION  USHQ        #1:  +1-203-859-0335 DST       Buzz\n\n\n                                  @{" ATDT !" link "MAIN"}\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,6054,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048589);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('m_s_fa6','M!S-FA6.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/M!S-FA6.LHA','idADD','XIM','LE-win5-96.exe',NULL,'F!G','M!S','\__  \  /  \/   ________/              ''96 /  \ \/ /  \_____    \     S T Y L E _/    \  /   |   _\     \_',replace(' _____    /\  ____________   M A G I C\n \__  \  /  \/   ________/              ''96\n  /  \ \/ /  \_____    \     S T Y L E\n_/    \  /   |   _\     \_\n\______\/____|___________/   Presents\n.----------- -  ------  -  -  ---  -  - ---.\n| FullID by F!G Version 0.6 -------------. |\n: FileID.DIZ Adder with a sequential  <--'' :\n. Add! Allow to Add Special Lines For EACH\n  Conference! M!S OutPut Style! Coded in C .\n: `--> File_ID.DIZ ADDER by F!G (c)1995-96 |\n`--- ------ - -  -  --   ---          - ---''\n','\n',char(10)),'idadd.guide',replace('@database "FullID Adder v0.5"\n\n@node MAIN "Amigaguide Documentation for FullId Adder v0.5"\n\n\n - --- ---     - --        -------   -------------- ------------------ -  ---\n                                                ____\n          _____    /\ ___________ ______________\  /__________\n          \__  \  /  \\__    .   \\__  _     /\__\/\__ _     /\n           /  \ \/ /  \/     |___ \/  __\___/__/    /   \___/__.\n         _/    \  /    \_   ____/  \  \____    |  _/    _/     |\n         \______\/______/____|______\__________|__\____________|\n                                   .____.\n          _________________________|    |____.  _____________\n         /   _______\__   ___ \_   \    |    |  \     _     /\n         \______   \ /     \__/    /    |    |__/_.    \___/___.\n         |    _\    \_      \_\______   |  __/    |   ___/     |\n         |___________/_______/   __|    |_________|____________|\n                                /  |    |\n                                \_______|\n\n --- --- ----------- ------------------- ------ -  - ------------------- ----\n\n                           ---- --  -- - --- --- --- \n                             FullId Adder $VER:0.6   \n                              ©1995-96 by F!G/M!S      \n                            Coded in C and compiled  \n                               with SaS/C v6.x       \n                           --- -- ---- - -- ----- -- \n\n\n             @{" Introduction " link intro}                      @{" Requirement " link required}\n\n             @{"   Install    " link insta}                      @{"  Configure  " link config}\n\n             @{"  Greetings   " link greet}                      @{" Contact M!S " link contact}\n\n\n ----[ FullId Adder V0.5 ]---------------[ Magic Style ]----------[ F!G ]----\n\n@endnode\n\n@node intro "Introduction"\n\n\n	This Doors will just add a line to the File_Id.diz Uploaded.\n	At the start or the End it''s up to U!\n	U will be able to insert a Date, Time in the string.\n	It doesn''t support the ToolTypes because I don''t really like\n	it. I think that it is boring... (Who Cares ?! hehe)\n	The output is quite nice and for Ansi 16 colors Terminal. \n	Normal No ? (8 colors is sad....... pfffffff 8-( )\n\n@endnode\n\n@node required "Required"\n\n	An Amiga (500/500+/600/1200/2000/3000/4000/CD³²/DRACO)\n	Microprocessor: Motorola or PowerPC 8*)\n	AmiExpress Profesionnal 4.x+ or S-Express (not tested!)\n	Text Editor! (CygnusEd for example)\n\n@endnode\n\n@node insta "Installation"\n\n	Just copy all the files i the directory DOORS:FullID/\n	Copy Examine(x).info in BBS:SysCmd/\n	(Note that this door must be placed just after your File_Id.DIZ\n	 Un/Packer!)\n	See "Configure" for Infos...\n\n@endnode\n\n@node config "Configuration"\n\n	Edit the file: BBS:Doors/FullId/FullId.CFG\n\n	\n	1st Line: Do U want to Add your line at the end?\n		  \n		  YES / NO\n\n	2nd Line: Do U use a Sent By Line?!\n\n		  YES / NO\n\n		This will Delete the Last Line of the File_ID or Not.\n\n	Next Lines: Packers Configuration\n\n	{EXT}: {Command}\n	  |        |\n     Extension Command String: 	%P = BBS:Node(x)/Playpen/{File}\n				%W = RAM:T/FILE_ID.DIZ\n\n	ie: LHA: LHA R %P %W\n\n	Then Edit the File: BBS:DOORS/FULLID/GENERAL.CFG\n	This file must contain all ur Strings!\n	\n ------------CUT-------------\n[-Last-OutPost----------------------------]\n[-Call Last OutPost Now For Infos---------]\n[-Magic Style Rules!-----------------8*)--]\netC..\n ------------CUT-------------\n\n	Note: Ur string must be 44 chars max!\n	A file called GENERAL.STATS will be created and contains le number\n	of the last line added.\n\n	And Now U can create a file called BBS:DOORS/FullID/2.CFG for\n	example. This is called a Special setting.\n	2 is the number of the conference for which u want special Strings.\n	It works the same as General.CFG and a file 2.Stats in this case\n	will be created.\n	\n@endnode\n\n@node greet "Greetings"\n\n\n	NoBody! I hate making Documentation!\n	They know who they are...MagicStyle Members for example 8*) .\n\n\n@endnode\n\n@node contact "How To Contact Magic Style"\n\n	Just Call The Last OutPost!\n \n\n                       ____ _________ _________ ________ _____\n            MYSTiC    /   / \\  /    \\\  /   _\\\  /   \\\  /     MYSTiC\n                     /   /   \\/   /\ \\\/   /___\\/__   \\\/\n         CONSOLE    /   / /\  /   __   \ \____   \   /   /      AMIGA\n                   /   /_/  \/   / /   /_____/   /  /   /\n       WORLD-HQ    \________X___/ /___/\________/   \__/      EURO-HQ\n      ____ _________ ________ _________ _________ _________ ________ _____\n     /    \\\  /   / \\  /   \\\  /    \\\  /    \\\  /   _\\\  /   \\\  /\n    /   /\ \\\/   / /\\\/__   \\\/   /\ \\\/   /\ \\\/   /___\\/__   \\\/\n   /   / /  \/   / /  \   /   / /   _____\/   / /  \ \____   \   /   /\n  /   /_/   /   /_/   /  /   / /   /     /   /_/   /_____/   /  /   /\n  \________X_________/   \__/  \__/      \________/\________/   \__/\n\n\nAMIGA - SNES - MEGADRIVE - GAMEBOY - GAMEGEAR - PC ENGINE - LYNX NEOGEO - C64\n\n4.5 Gb ONLINE             SYSOP:  EMPiRE / MYSTiC               4.5 Gb ONLINE\n\nHOLLAND:              +31-72-157682  &  +31-72-201182               :HOLLAND\n\nor Call: +33 55.4114.09\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',24712,5,0,NULL,NULL,'m_s_fa6','scan',1780048589);
