ON^REDNEX\012                            dESIGN bY Sc/DeZIGN\012\012                      @{"          iNTRODUCTION          " link "intro" 0} \012                      @{"          iNSTALLATION          " link "install" 0} \012                      @{"          fUTURE pLANS          " link "plans" 0} \012                      @{"           bUG rEPORT           " link "bugs" 0} \012                      @{"             gREETS             " link "greets" 0} \012                      @{"         tOOLS oVERVIEW         " link "tools" 0} \012                      @{"          mOTION iNFOS          " link "motion" 0}\012                      @{"              eXIT              " quit}\012@endnode\012\012@node "intro" "-^-> iNTRODUCTION -^-"\012@next "install"\012@prev "main"\012\012  BB-TopUl is a TopUploader Door/Util for Tempest. You can use it in the\012  Text-Welcome or in the Bulletins.\012\012  Features:\012  - online updating of TopUploaders (only Door-version)\012  - uses less memory\012  - gives every user as much TopUploaders as much lines he has on his\012    screen (only Door-version) or a defined value\012  - nice design\012  - secure running\012  - fast\012  - coded in C\012\012  Changes:\012  - 2 different designs (one from Sc/DeZIGN and the old one)\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "install" "-^- iNSTALLATION -^-"\012@next "plans"\012@prev "intro"\012\012  Installation of the Door-version:\012  =================================\012\012  Copy BB-TopUl to Doors:\012\012  Copy BB-TopUl.cfg to the same dir where BB-TopUl is.\012\012\012  Edit your Text-Welcome file(s):\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  ~TD(Doors:BB-TopUl)\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012\012  Edit your Bulletins.opt file:\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  [20-,*,*,*,*] =2   |T-DOOR|Tempest:Doors/BB-TopUl\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012\012  Edit the BB-TopUl.cfg file:\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  20                                    // Number of Entries to be displayed\012  2                                     // Output (1 <= output >= 2 )\012  1                                     // Design (1 <= design >= 2 )\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  If you want as many entries as the User can display on his screen write 0\012  for numer of entries.\012  You have 2 different outputs to choose from. Number 1 shows the\012  Downloaders in 1 row and number 2 in 2 rows.\012  There are 2 different designs avaible at the moment. One from Sc/DeZIGN\012  and one from me (the old one).\012\012\012  Installation of the Util-version:\012  =================================\012\012  Copy BB-TopUlUtil to Tempest:Utils/\012\012  Copy BB-TopUlUtil.cfg to the same dir where BB-TopUlUtil is.\012\012  Edit your Logoff(-x).bat file(s):\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  Tempest:Utils/BB-TopUlUtil\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012\012  Edit your Bulletins.opt file:\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  [20-,*,*,*,*] =2   |PRINT|Tempest:Bulletins/TopUl.txt\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012\012  Edit the BB-TopUlUtil.cfg file:\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  20                                    // Number of Entries to be displayed\012  2                                     // Output (1 <= output >= 2 )\012  1                                     // Design (1 <= design >= 2 )\012  Tempest:                              // Path of the Accounts.data\012  Tempest:Bulletins/TopUl.txt           // Name of the Outputfile\012  -------------------------> cut here <-------------------------\012  You have 2 different outputs to choose from. Number 1 shows the\012  Downloaders in 1 row and number 2 in 2 rows.\012  There are 2 different designs avaible at the moment. One from Sc/DeZIGN\012  and one from me (the old one).\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "MAIN" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "plans" "-^- fUTURE pLANS -^-"\012@next "bugs"\012@prev "install"\012\012  More designs and outputs.\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "bugs" "-^- buG rEPORT -^-"\012@next "greets"\012@prev "plans"\012\012  I hope it runs without any problems. If you find some bugs, please contact\012  me on Dawn of Eternity or Deep Space Nine.\012\012\012                            @{" bACK tO mAIN mENU " link "main" 0}\012@endnode\012\012@node "greets" "-^- gREETINGS fLOW oUT tO -^-"\012@next "tools"\012@prev "bugs"\012\012                        mY pERSONAL gREETINGS gO tO:\012                        ----------------------------     \012                                   Agent\012                                Andy/MoTioN\012                              Aquarius/Outlaws\012                                 BBC/MoTioN\012                                 Ben/MoTioN\012                                 Braindead\012                                Calypso/GOD\012                               Castor/Paradox\012                            Deathknight/Prestige\012                                Duke/MoTioN\012                               E.F.A./Paradox\012                                Fnord/MoTioN\012                               Fury/Prestige\012                                 Giants/TYT\012                                 Intercode\012                                    JAF\012                              Joe Cool/MoTioN\012                                 Juan/TRSI\012                               Legacy/Hoodlum\012                                Logic/Rebels\012                          