INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mgs__g15','MGS!-G15.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MGS!-G15.LHA','globaldupe','XIM','globaldupe',NULL,'Splash','MGS!','_\_/    / _  __  ______ _______/__  ___    / | _ \  /     /  __/__/   /_ _   /   ___   / |__\ \/ /___/_____________/____/____//___/',replace(' ___     _______________________ _ _________\n_\_/    / _  __  ______ _______/__  ___    /\n| _ \  /     /  __/__/   /_ _   /   ___   /\n|__\ \/ /___/_____________/____/____//___/\n    \  /                   .------------.\n     \/ GlobalDupe 1.5 «-- ÷-  styLE!   ¡\n                 By Splash `------------÷\n Fast Dupechecker that will check all   |\n confs. New features added.             |\n -[23.07.95]------ ---- ---------·st!·--''\n [World release at FlAMe StRiKe MGS! WHQ]\n','\n',char(10)),'GlobalDupe.Guide',replace('@database "GlobalDupe.Guide"\n@WIDTH 77\n@NODE Main "MAIN" "Welcome to GlobalDupe Documentation"\n\n .--------------------  ---(c)-[ mEGAStYLE! pRODUCtiON ''95\n |    ____     _______________________________  _ _____________ _\n ! ___\ _/    / _  ___  __________  _________/_ __   ____       /\n . |    _ \  /      /  ___/_____/    /__ _      /    _//_      / -----.\n ¦ |st!  \ \/ /    /    /      /       /       /     _____    /   -- -÷ -»\n | |______\  /_______________________________________//______/ -------''\n |         \/           \n |\n-÷- -» _____________ ______          _____     _ ______      _ _______ ____\n |  ___\   ________/_     /_       _/    /___         /    _ __  _________/\n |  |__________     /    __/______/     /    \ /     /_______/  ___/_______\n |  |      |       /    /        /     /      \     /       /    /        /\n |  |______________________________________    \_________________________/\n .                              _  _ _____¬_____/\n |\n |\n `--------------------------------------------------- ------------ -[   -»\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n                           GlobalDupe 1.5 (23/07-95)\n     \n                          By Splash/ElTECH & Megastyle\n                                         \n                          @{"What is GlobalDupe ?      " LINK "ABOUT"}   \n                          @{"What is new ?             " LINK "NEW"}\n                          @{"Requirements.             " LINK "REQ"}                \n                          @{"Installation.             " LINK "INSTA"}              \n                          @{"Credits                   " LINK "CREDS"}\n                          @{"Greetings.                " LINK "GREET"}                 \n                          @{"About Megastyle.          " LINK "MEGASTYLE"}\n                          @{"How to contact the Author " LINK "HOWTOCONTACT"}\n              \n@ENDNODE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@NODE "ABOUT" "What is GlobalDupe ?"\n\nGlobalDupe is a duplicate checker that will check if the file uploaded exists\nany other places on your board allready.\n\nIf you have got a board with many confs you have probably been pissed off many \ntimes because of files beeing uploaded in different conferences. This nice \ndupechecker fixes this problem. It will check in all your conferences if a file \nexists. If it does exists the file will be deleted and the desc is moved to the \nHOLD directory and the user will not be rewarded with any bytes for his upload.\n  \nIt is now also possible to check for duplicates BEFORE uploading using \n''GD filname''\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "REQ" "Requirements."\n\n\nA Commodore Amiga computer (Pese suxx :-) running on kick 2.0+, /X \n(I guess any version will do...) \n\nThis door uses the AEDoor.libary, so you should have this in LIBS:\n(If you haven''t got it then call me or your local /X board to get it...) \n@ENDNODE\n\n\n@NODE "INSTA" "Installation."\n\n\n                             \nJust copy the included files to the correct dirs, that''s it.... \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "HOWTOCONTACT" "How to contact the Author"\n\nHow to contact me:\n\n@{"Flame Strike" LINK "FLAME"} :+47 51631702\n\nOr snailmail: Splash/ElTECH & Megastyle\n              Lindeveien 69\n              N-4300 Sandnes\n              Norway\n\nPS. I''m going to the army 15.08.95 so after that you better contact Lizard \ninstead.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "CREDS" "Credits."\n\nCode,Idea    - Splash/ElTECH & Megastyle\nDoor Design  - Magz/Grotesticle\nGuide Design - Splash/ElTECH & Megastyle\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "GREET" "Greetings."\n\n\n                                  \n\n                         Greetings to all my friends ! \n\n                      Special greetings to all /X coders \n\nAND OFCOURSE ALL MEMBERS OF :\n______ ______________ ______ ________    _________/ _|_____/\______ _ __________\n ____ V _________   // ____/_______  \  _\  ______   _  __/  \  __/_________   /\n |   \_/   |   _/  //  \__   |   _/   \/  \___   \   |___     \ \      /  _/  /\n |    |    |  ____/_     |   |   _     /    _/   /   |   \    /  \_   /  ____/_\n |____|    |_______/_________:___\    /_________/____|_______/_______/________/\n      |____|                      \  /                       \n      :    :                       \/\n\n                                   AnD\n\n             _______ /|   _______/\_______________    _____ \n            /~ ____// | __\___  ~__~/  _____/~   ~\  /~ ¡ ~\.  \n           //  __)_// |/ ~\  /  :| //  __) //   .__)//  |  \\\\n           \\     ~\\ ~   \\/   || \\     ~\\   : \\\\      / \  \n            \  ____/\______/\____|  \  ____/\____ // \. |__/  /\n             \/ .____/\______/\_____|\/ .TeTSUo__\/ / \/ ____/\n              \/                      \/          \/   \/ \n\n\n\nPersonal greetings:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nLizard/MGS!      - We ARE growing BIG now!\nWoober/MGS!      - Hi!\nJedi/MGS!        - STILL noe nodes ?  :-)\nNightProwler/HLM - Nice talkin'' to yah! Hope you like this door!\nMiC flAiR/ElT    - We need more releases from ElT.....\nLithium/ElT      - Hope we get the chance to talk more..\nMagz/GrT         - Great dezign.. Nice colly... greet me in the next one!\n\nSo I 4got YOU? Oki... go ahead shoot me.... I''m guilty...\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "FLAME" "Flame Strike"\n           .    .         .         .        .\n   _______/|___/|________/|____ ___/|_______/|\n _/        l_   |    _    l_   |    l_       l_.........................\n/¬     _____j   |    ¬     l   !     l    ____j                        :\nY         |    _|__  .     | \ : /   |  _____j_     ·fLAME^sTRIKE·     :\n|     ____j   /    l :     |  \ /    |        l                        :\n|        |  _/     | :     |   :     |        |ElTECH EHQ·Megastyle WHQ:\n|        |         | !     |   !     |        |                        :\n|       ||        || |     |   |     |       ||                        :\nl________j_________j_|     |___|     |________jHOt WAREZ·CODERS CORNER·.\n :                   l_____j   l_____j [nUMEN] CHAtABlE SYSOP·YouNameIt.\n :  cREW:                    .         .      .     .         .        .\n :Splash/ElTECH^MGS!  ______/|________/|_____/|____/|____ ___/|_______/|\n :UnmaD/eXCALIBUR   _/  _____j_        l_   _ l_    l_   |    l_       l_  \n :MiC FlAiR/ElTECH /_____     l         l   ¬  l     l   !     j    ____j\n :    [YOU?]       Y     \    |    _____j    __j_    |   :  __/   _____j_\n :                 |      \   |      |    .     |    |   .    \         l\n :BIG /X conf with |       \  |      |    :     |    |   :     |        |\n :  400++ files!   |          |      |    !     |    |   !     |        |\n :.[+47·51631702]  |         ||     ||    |     |   ||   |     |       ||\n.:::....... .... ..l__________j______j____|     |____j___|     |________j\n :                                      : l_____j /X 4.9 l_____j :\n .                                      :........................:\n .\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "MEGASTYLE" "About Megastyle"\n\n                                                               @{" Go back.. " Link MAIN}\n\nMegastyle is a new AmiExpress-Support group formed by Lizard of Spaceballs in\nthe middle of may 1995.\n\nOur main goal is to support all the /X-boards out there with the best doors\naround. We try hard to make our products as system-friendly as possible and\nwith unique configuration possibilities.\n\n\nWe want to be the leading /X-development group in the future, and therefore\nneed more skilled coders and ANSI-artist to make our products even better!\n\nIf you''re interesting in teaming up, then take a look at the contact-info.\n\n\n\n   _________ \n    _______ )  ·M·e·g·a·S·t·y·l·e·  ·P·r·o·d·u·c·t·i·o·n·s·\n           )¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n           ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\nEven if we are a pretty new group we have released a couple of doors allready.\n\nSplash:\nAutoreward v1.3\nGlobalDupe v1.5\nSysDL      v3.2\n\nLizard:\nBulls      v1.0\nNodeStatus v1.2\n\nAll these doors are just GREAT so check''em out! And more releases to come in near \nfuture!\n\n\n   _________ \n    _______ )  ·M·e·g·a·S·t·y·l·e·  ·B·o·a·r·d·s·\n           )¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n           ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n           +47-51-631702 -=- @{"FlameStrike" Link "FLAME"} ·oOo· Sysop : Splash\n           +47-51-417240 -=- @{"Noiseless  " Link "NOISELESS"} ·oOo· Sysop : Lizard (NightBBS)\n           +47-77-748689 -=- @{"Eternity   " Link "ETERNITY"} ·oOo· Sysop : Woober\n           +47-51-575227 -=- @{"Total Panic" Link "TOTALPANIC"} ·oOo· Sysop : Jedi\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "NOISELESS" "Propaganda : Noiseless BBS!"\n                                                               @{" Go back.. " Link "MEGASTYLE"}\n\n                                        .\n                                           ·\n   _  _  _ _______  _____ __ _____ _____:  :   _____  _____  _____ __ _  _   _\n_   _  _ ______   ||     (__)     |   __|  |  |   __||  ___||  ____ __ _ _  _\n            |  |  ||  |  |  l  `--|  _/_|  |