d o c u m e n t a t i o n           " link index}\n\n\n\n\n@endnode\n\n@node index\n@title "                                             »» i n d e x ««"\n\n\n    @{u}                                                          @{uu}\n\n\n@{b}                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n                                                               ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n         ____        __________          ____.   ___________   ½½½½½  ½½½½½\n________(___/________\\ __     /__________\\___l___\\  ____   /__    `½½½½''\n                   _   l/       _      _____/  _      l/      ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n_____            __l___/      __l__    l     __l__  __________½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n    (____________)    /_______)   (__________)   (_____/      ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n                                                              ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n                                                              ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n   @{fg shine} @{"            introduction             "  link introduction      }    @{fg text}                ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n@{fg shine}    @{"            installation             "  link installation      }          @{fg text}          ½½½½½½  ½½½½½½\n@{fg shine}    @{"              how 2 use              "  link how 2 use         }\n    @{"              copyright              "  link copyright         }\n    @{"          changes ÷ history          " link changes ÷ history  } @{ub} @{fg text}\n\n\n    @{u}                                                          @{uu}\n\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@node introduction\n                                                                 .\n\n                                                                 :\n                                                                 :\n             __________________.______.      ________            :\n          ._(___)_.   ___     _|      l_____\\\\_     /____________:_ _\n          |       |----/      \\        /     \\   __/\\      __    :\n          l_______|   /_______/        |-----/_______\\____       :\n                              l________|(rLf)            /-------:-\n                                                                 :\n                                                                 :\n                                                                 :\n                                                                 .\n\n\n     Curselast is a door for /X and S!X that displays up to @{fg shine}999@{fg text}(!!!!)\n            You can actually scroll up/down with your cursors!!\n    @{fg shine}last callers@{fg text} with a gr8 design! Just @{"install" link installation} it and check it out!!!\n        Curselast was coded in AmigaE and is fairly fast and small.\n\n                            -magz of megastyle-\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@node installation\n\n .\n                                                                              .\n :\n :                                                                            :\n : __        _____ .___.   ______ __.              _________. ____________    :\n_:(__)_______\\_ _/_|_  l___\\__  // _l______.  _____\\__  //  l____)_  _   /____:_\n :    | __    /_  _ /   /     _ // \\     /_l__\\__     _ //   /    |_    / ___ :\n_:____|--/   /-/  //    |--/____/----/__/ \\     /--/____/    |____|/---/\\--/  :\n :      /___/ /___/_____|(rLf)          \\---/__/       l_____|            /___:_\n :                                                                            :\n :                        i n s t a l l a t i o n                             :\n .                                                                            :\n                                                                              .\n\nCopy the files in DOORS/ and COMMANDS/ to your directories named DOORS:\nand BBS:COMMANDS/ Then put in let''s say your LOGON.TXT and/or one of your\nBULL<xx>.TXT files:\n\n-----[ cut ]------\n\n~\n~CC_curselast|\n\n-----[ cut ]------\n\n\nCurselast requires to be updated in the\nlogoffbatch of your bbs. therefore add to your logoffbatch:\n\n-----[ cut ]------\n\nDOORS:-mgs!-curselast/curseupdate <node>\n\n-----[ cut ]------\n\nWhere <node> stands for the node the logoffbatch will\nbe executed by on logoff.\n\n\nEdit the icon "DOORS:-mgs!-curselast/curseupdate.info" to suit your needs:\n                  .\nSYSOP=<sysop>     | Where <sysop> can be 1 (display sysop/local logins) or 0 (ignore sysop/local logins)\nLINES=<lines>     | Where <lines> can be 16-999 which is the number of last callers you want to display\n                  | (16 = No scrolling)\n                  ''\n\nThat should be it :)\n\nFor S!X users.. just make a new line in your bbs.cmd file.. you know how ;)\n\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n@node how 2 use\n@title "                                              )>» h o w  2  u s e «<("\n\n                                      ½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½.\n                                     ½½½½½½½½         ½½½½½½½½\n      ____.            _________         _______      ½½½½½½½½\n   ___\\ __l____________\\       /_________\\     /______½½½½½½½½\n   \\    \\___        _             _      /\\           ½½½½½½½½\n    \\______/      __l__    "    __l__           ___   ½½½½½½½½\n          /_______)   (_________)   (___________) /_  ½½½½½½½½\n                                                   |  ½½½½½½½½\n                ½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½''\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½      ._____      _____    |   _|________\n                ½½½½½½½½______|    /_____/ ___/____|___\\  ____  /___\n                ½½½½½½½½      |       _  \\_______   _       l/     /\n                ½½½½½½½½__    l     __l__       l __l__  _________/\n                ½½½½½½½½ (__________)   (_________)|  (____/\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |    |\n                ½½½½½½½½  @{fg shine}   h o w       u s e  @{fg text}   |  ½½½½½½½½\n                ½½½½½½½½      @{fg shine}       2    @{fg text}         |  ½½½½½½½½\n                ½½½½½½½½                           |  ½½½½½½½½\n                ½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½½\n\n\n\n        Just @{"Install" link installation} it and run it from /X or S!X\n           and a list of lastcallers pops up :) press cursor up\n               to scroll up and cursor down to scroll down.\n\n                                hallelujah!\n\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@node copyright\n            .\n\n            :\n            :                                      ________ _______ _  _\n           _:__________  _________________ ________\\__   _//\n            :      ___/__\\__    __      /\\\\\\ __      /___ /       .\n          _ :_ ____        /___        /     \\______/   /_________:_ _\n            :     /-------/ __/-------/\\______|        ___________|\n            :     _________(___)__________    ________/       /   l_\n           _:____\\\\_     /       |    ___/____\\__   _        /     /\n            :     \\   __/\\_______|   /_         /---/       /      |\n         - -:-----/_______\\(rLf) \\----/________/   /_______/_______|\n            :\n            :                 c o p y r i g h t\n            :\n            .\n\n\n\n                                 ---[%]---\n\n                   CURSELAST is a Megastyle! production\n\n               code, idea & design by   Magz of MGS! GRT INT\n               tooltype read code by    Lizard of TBL MGS!\n\n               \n\n                         Creds for this GUIDE file\n\n               S