___________________ /      /\-----/_____/   /_________:_\n   ::        ::                           /_______/(rLf)                      :\n   ::........::                                                               :\n                                                                              :\n                        m e g a s t y l e    ¹ 9 9 6                          :\n                                                                              .\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@node changes ÷ history\n\n\n    ___.        __      ____    ___.      _____  ½½½½½½½½½½      .____\n  ._\ _l_______(_/_____/ __/____\  l______\   /__½½½½   ½½½______|   /_.\n  |   \__   _       _  \____  _    __/  _        ½½½½½½½''        l     |\n  |____l/  _l_     _l_     l _l_   l   _l_  "  __½½½½   ½½½½½_______  _l\n g®m   /___) (_____) (_______) (_______) (_____) ½½½½   ½½½½½   \_____)\n                                                 ½½½½   ½½½½½ e^D\n\n                               ...HISTORY...\n\n\n\no3.o3.96                Made this on request from Kingpin at Checkpoint.\n                        Coz his filelists were full of non-existant files! :\\n\n3o.o3.96                Added a fuction so that it shows how many files was removed.\n                        V 1.o .. first public release\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',18052,7,0,NULL,NULL,'mgs_dirx','scan',1780048602);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mgs_ds30','MGS-DS30.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MGS-DS30.LHA','sysdl','XIM','sysdl',NULL,'Splash','MGS','_\_/    / _  __  ______ _______/__  ___    / | _ \  /     /  __/__/   /_ _   /   ___   / |__\ \/ /___/_____________/____/____//___/',replace(' ___     _______________________ _ _________\n_\_/    / _  __  ______ _______/__  ___    /\n| _ \  /     /  __/__/   /_ _   /   ___   /\n|__\ \/ /___/_____________/____/____//___/\n    \  /                   .------------.\n     \/ SysDL 3.0      «-- ÷-  styLE!   ¡\n                 By Splash `------------÷\n Now with remote mode that works like   |\n DOPUS!! THE BEST SYSDL DOOR EVER MADE! |\n -[02.06.95]------ ---- ---------·st!·--''\n [World release at FlAMe StRiKe MGS! WHQ]\n','\n',char(10)),'SysDL30.Guide',replace('@database "SysDL.Guide"\n@WIDTH 77\n@NODE Main "Welcome to SysopDL Documentation"\n                                                   __.       \n______ ______________ ______ ________    _________/ _|_____/\______ _ __________\n ____ V _________   // ____/_______  \  _\  ______   _  __/  \  __/_________   /\n |   \_/   |   _/  //  \___  |   _/   \/  \___   \   |___     \ \      /  _/  /\n |    |    |  ____/_     |   |   _     /    _/   /   |   \    /  \_   /  ____/_\n |____|    |_______/_________:___\    /_________/____|_______/_______/________/\n      |____|                      \  /                       \n      :   _____                    \/\n           ____\__________\n            ____\_______  )\n                 \/     ) ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n                        ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯ ·g·i·v·e·s·  ·y·o·u·\n\n\n          @@@@@*5W@@@WsW@@!********************!@@@@@@@WmZ**]@@@@[@@@@@@\n          5    ,@@@@@@@@@@                      @@@@@@@@@@s ]@@@@[     P   \n          9    ]@@@P  V@@@ ______,___.  ___.,__  @@@@  M@@@. ]@@@[     r \n          ''    ]@@@b   *** @@@@@@]@@@[i@@@@@W@@  @@@@  ]@@@b ]@@@[     e \n          r    ''@@@@Ws.    M@@@@*!M@@!@@@P ''M@@  @@@@  ]@@@W ]@@@[     a \n          e     ''M@@@@@Ws   M@@@b d@! @@@@s.''~~  @@@@  ]@@@@ ]@@@[     c \n          h       ''VM@@@@W  !@@@@_@A  !@@@@@W_   @@@@  ]@@@@ ]@@@[     h \n          c    ,__.  V@@@@[  M@@@@@!   ''*@@@@@W  @@@@  ]@@@D ]@@@[     e \n          a    ]@@b   @@@@[  !@@@@A   __. ~M@@@[ @@@@  d@@@! ]@@@[     r \n          e    ]@@@WmW@@@@!   M@@@!   @@W. d@@@[m@@@@mm@@@A iW@@@Wi    '' \n          r    ]@@A@@@@@@f    !@@A    @@A@@@@@A @@@@@@@@@f  ]@@@@@[    9 \n          P    2XX__XXXX______g@@L____XXL2XXXL__XXXXXXXL____2XXXXXL    5   \n          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~T@A~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n                            ,@A`Sysop Download 3.0 (02/06-95)\n\n                         \n \n                           By Splash/ElTECH^MEGASTYLE\n              \n                          @{"What is Sysop Download ?  " LINK "ABOUT"}   \n                          @{"Requirements.             " LINK "REQ"}                \n                          @{"Features.                 " LINK "FEATURES"}               \n                          @{"Installation.             " LINK "INSTA"}              \n                          @{"How to operate.           " LINK "USE"}              \n                          @{"Future Upgrades           " LINK "FUTURE"}\n                          @{"Credits                   " LINK "CREDS"}\n                          @{"Greetings.                " LINK "GREET"}                 \n                          @{"How to contact the Author " LINK "HOWTOCONTACT"}\n              \n@ENDNODE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@NODE "ABOUT" "What is Sysop Download ?"\n\nSysop DL is a door for all sysops that have lots of users who ask to download\nspesific files... Imagine how hard it is to pack the files and then upload it to \nyour board so that the user can download it..... But now..... The hard woork is \nover......  \nJust have a look at these great @{"features" LINK "FEATURES"} \n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "REQ" "Requirements."\n\n\nA Commodore Amiga computer (Pese suxx :-), /X (I guess any version will do...) \n\nFor this door to work you should also have:\nreqtools.library and AEDoor.library in your LIBS:\n\nIf U want to use the lha packing feature, U must have lha in your path !\nA good place to have it is in C:\n\n\nIf you by any chance should have problems getting this door working, \nthen call me !\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "FEATURES" "Features."\n\n@{i}Features@{ui}\n                               \n\n* Fileselector for sysop to choose files from. \n* Online lha crunching (automatic if a directory is selected)  \n* Also includes a remote function (With PW protection) for cosysops.\n* You can now restrict different files/dirs from being downloaded, by putting\n  these entries i a file called restrict located in the same dir as this door.  \n* This door can now by any time (almost) be exited by pressing Ctrl+c.\n* Now writes a little note in CallersLog\n* NEW and gr8 DEZIGN\n* @{"DOPUS MODE" LINK "DOPUS"} in REMOTE mode!\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "INSTA" "Installation."\n\n\n                             \nJust copy the included files to the correct dirs, that''s it.... \nThe configuration can be found in the SysDL.info. Here you can choose the temp\ndir for lha crunching (The lha file will ofcoz be deleted after the transfer)\nIF you want to have a password before starting this door the password can also \nbe edited here using the PASSWORD= tooltype..\n\nSince only users who are listed in the SysDL.info file can can start the remote \nmode, there is actually no need for a password protection, but I included it \njust in case som of you for some strange reason wanted it..\n\nThe standard mode will also not be started if sysop didn''t start it..\n\nHow to give users axx to remote mode:\nUSER.X=Username (Where x is a number)\n(This is not needed for the sysop who has automaticly access to this...)\nFor example like this:\nUSER.1=Preacher\nUSER.2=UnMad\n\nThe username is ofcoz NOT CASE SENSITIVE.\n\nCouldn''t be more simple.... (I think)\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "USE" "How to operate."\n\n                              \n\nWhen you first start the door U will be asked if U want to use the REMOTE \nfunction. This function is included for cosysops etc. ,so if you are local\n(In front of your computer :-) U should NOT use this. I''ll explain the \ndifference between the two modes:\n\n@{i}@{"REMOTE" LINK "DOPUS"}@{ui}\n------\n\n@{i}FILESELECTOR@{ui}\n------------\nIf U select Continue from the first prompt, A Nice filerequester will pop up,\nand u can select your files or dirs. But before popping up it will check if the \nnodex screen is active, to see if the sysop is around. If not the requester will \nNOT pop up.  \nWhen U are finished, just press OK!, \nand on U go! U are then asked if U would like to Pack the files. If U want that \nthen select Pack, else select Continue.... (or Quit)\n\nSome people wanted me to include a PW routine BEFORE starting the \ndoor, and ofcause I did so, even if I cant find any reason to use it.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "FUTURE" "Future Upgrades & Address."\n@{i}Future@{ui}\n\nI have worked VERY hard and for a long time to make this door as good as \npossible, and I have received much response from people telling me how gr8 this\ndoor is. This gives me much inspiration for further developing. Thank you all for\nthe support!\n\nThis will probably me the last MAJOR release from me for a while since I''m going\nto the army in August, but we''ll see what happens... \n\nI personally think this is the BEST SysDL door ever made for /X (Anybody agree\nwith me ?) I have done everything to make this as perfect as possible for both \nsysop and his users and I can''t see anything missing, so if YOU don''t tell me \nwhat is missing, then this will probably be the last version of SysDL.\n\n\nHere is my @{"address" link "HowToContact"}\n@endnode\n@node "HowToContact"\n\n\nFor any reason give me a call !\n \nHow to contact me:\n\n@{"Flame Strike" LINK "FLAME"} :+47 51631702\n\nOr snailmail: Splash/Megastyle\n              Lindeveien 69\n              N-4300 Sandnes\n              Norway\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "CREDS" "Credits."\n\nCode,Idea    - Splash/ElT^MGS\nDoor Design  - Shade (Standard dezign) and Baffle! (REMOTE dezign)\nGuide Design - Splash/ElT^MGS (Stole some from Lizard though)\nSysDL ASCII  - Logo used in this guide by Preacher/ElTECH\n\nLizard -> Guess I didn''t do everything by myself this time :-)\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "GREET" "Greetings."\n\n\n                                  \n\n                         Greetings to all my friends ! \n\nLizard      : LONG live Megastyle!\nJedi        : Welcome to Megastyle! Hope we can use a design by you soon...\nPreacher    : Håper du kan få deg tlf linje snart.\nSkinner     : How about some more activity in ElTECH ? MORE releases! :-)\nMic Flair   : Hope you like this door, let''s have another chat!\nMaze        : Like DC? New dezign+magpart comming up!\nStratos!    : 2 bad you had to leave, you''ll regret it :-)\nShade       : Hope to C your board up''n''running soon.\nScience     : Still haven''t found any bugs ? :-)\nNike        : Nice talkin'' to yah..\nWoober      : Looking forward to C more releases from you..\nTHEGODFATHER: Board up''n''running soon ?\nACID        : Hi!\n\n\n(+ the rest I 4got..)\n\nAND OFCOURSE ALL MEMBERS OF :\n______ ______________ ______ ________    _________/ _|_____/\______ _ __________\n ____ V _________   // ____/_______  \  _\  ______   _  __/  \  __/_________   /\n |   \_/   |   _/  //  \__   |   _/   \/  \___   \   |___     \ \      /  _/  /\n |    |    |  ____/_     |   |   _     /    _/   /   |   \    /  \_   /  ____/_\n |____|    |_______/_________:___\    /_________/____|_______/_______/________/\n      |____|                      \  /                       \n      :    :                       \/\n\n                                   AnD\n\n             _______ /|   _______/\_______________    _____ \n            /~ ____// | __\___  ~__~/  _____/~   ~\  /~ ¡ ~\.  \n           //  __)_// |/ ~\  /  :| //  __) //   .__)//  |  \\\\n           \\     ~\\ ~   \\/   || \\     ~\\   : \\\\      / \  \n            \  ____/\______/\____|  \  ____/\____ // \. |__/  /\n             \/ .____/\______/\_____|\/ .TeTSUo__\/ / \/ ____/\n              \/                      \/          \/   \/ \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "FLAME" "Flame Strike"\n           .    .         .         .        .\n   _______/|___/|________/|____ ___/|_______/|\n _/        l_   |    _    l_   |    l_       l_.........................\n/¬     _____j   |    ¬     l   !     l    ____j                        :\nY         |    _|__  .     | \ : /   |  _____j_     ·fLAME^sTRIKE·     :\n|     ____j   /    l :     |  \ /    |        l                        :\n|        |  _/     | :     |   :     |        |ElTECH EHQ·Megastyle WHQ:\n|        |         | !     |   !     |        |                        :\n|       ||        || |     |   |     |       ||                        :\nl________j_________j_|     |___|     |________jHOt WAREZ·CODERS CORNER·.\n :                   l_____j   l_____j [nUMEN] CHAtABlE SYSOP·YouNameIt.\n :  cREW:                    .         .      .     .         .        .\n :Splash/ElTECH^MGS!  ______/|________/|_____/|____/|____ ___/|_______/|\n :UnmaD/eXCALIBUR   _/  _____j_        l_   _ l_    l_   |    l_       l_  \n :    [YOU?]       /_____     l         l   ¬  l     l   !     j    ____j\n :                 Y     \    |    _____j    __j_    |   :  __/   _____j_\n :BIG /X conf with |      \   |      |    .     |    |   .    \         l\n :almost 400 files!|       \  |      |    :     |    |   :     |        |\n :                 |          |      |    !     |    |   !     |        |\n :.[+47·51631702]  |         ||     ||    |     |   ||   |     |       ||\n.:::....... .... ..l__________j______j____|     |____j___|     |________j\n :                                      : l_____j /X 4.9 l_____j :\n .                                      :........................:\n .\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "DOPUS" "How to use the REMOTE mode."\n\n@{i}REMOTE@{ui}\n------\nOnly users specified in the sysdl.info will get axx to this feature (sysop will\nautomaticly get ax to this ofcoz...)\nWhen entering this mode U can select files/dirs by using the cursor keys.\nU can select as many items as U like. Pressing any char will make the cursor jump\nto the first entry starting with that char. (Just as in DOPUS!)\n\nIf you like you can put a file called ''restrict'' in the same path as this door.\nIn this txt file you can enter the files/dirs you don''t want the user to have axx\nto. You only have to write a part of an entry you want to restrict.\nFor example ''Sources'' will restrict both ''main:sources'' and ''boot:store/sources''.  \n\nWhen U are finished, just pressing return, or pressing Ctrl+G will bring up a \nrequest of what U want to do. \n\nU can select between: Pack,Continue,Quit...\n\n*Pack will let you LHA pack your files before downloading.\n*Continue will download the files without packing.\n*Quit will Quit the door (Wow !)\n\nPressing Ctrl+P from within REMOTE mode, will let you start packing your files\ndirectly.\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',25090,1,0,NULL,NULL,'mgs_ds30','scan',1780048602);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mgs_gdup','MGS-GDUP.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MGS-GDUP.LHA','globaldupe','XIM','globaldupe',NULL,'Splash','MGS','_\_/    / _  __  ______ _______/__  ___    / | _ \  /     /  __/__/   /_ _   /   ___   / |__\ \/ /___/_____________/____/____//___/',replace(' ___     _______________________ _ _________\n_\_/    / _  __  ______ _______/__  ___    /\n| _ \  /     /  __/__/   /_ _   /   ___   /\n|__\ \/ /___/_____________/____/____//___/\n    \  /                   .------------.\n     \/ GlobalDupe 1.5 «-- ÷-  styLE!   ¡\n                 By Splash `------------÷\n Fast Dupechecker that will check all   |\n confs. New features added.             |\n -[23.07.95]------ ---- ---------·st!·--''\n [World release at FlAMe StRiKe MGS! WHQ]\n','\n',char(10)),'GlobalDupe.Guide',replace('@database "GlobalDupe.Guide"\n@WIDTH 77\n@NODE Main "MAIN" "Welcome to GlobalDupe Documentation"\n\n .--------------------  ---(c)-[ mEGAStYLE! pRODUCtiON ''95\n |    ____     _______________________________  _ _____________ _\n ! ___\ _/    / _  ___  __________  _________/_ __   ____       /\n . |    _ \  /      /  ___/_____/    /__ _      /    _//_      / -----.\n ¦ |st!  \ \/ /    /    /      /       /       /     _____    /   -- -÷ -»\n | |______\  /_______________________________________//______/ -------''\n |         \/           \n |\n-÷- -» _____________ ______          _____     _ ______      _ _______ ____\n |  ___\   ________/_     /_       _/    /___         /    _ __  _________/\n |  |__________     /    __/______/     /    \ /     /_______/  ___/_______\n |  |      |       /    /        /     /      \     /       /    /        /\n |  |______________________________________    \_________________________/\n .                              _  _ _____¬_____/\n |\n |\n `--------------------------------------------------- ------------ -[   -»\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n                           GlobalDupe 1.5 (23/07-95)\n     \n                          By Splash/ElTECH & Megastyle\n                                         \n                          @{"What is GlobalDupe ?      " LINK "ABOUT"}   \n                          @{"What is new ?             " LINK "NEW"}\n                          @{"Requirements.             " LINK "REQ"}                \n                          @{"Installation.             " LINK "INSTA"}              \n                          @{"Credits                   " LINK "CREDS"}\n                          @{"Greetings.                " LINK "GREET"}                 \n                          @{"About Megastyle.          " LINK "MEGASTYLE"}\n                          @{"How to contact the Author " LINK "HOWTOCONTACT"}\n              \n@ENDNODE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n@NODE "ABOUT" "What is GlobalDupe ?"\n\nGlobalDupe is a duplicate checker that will check if the file uploaded exists\nany other places on your board allready.\n\nIf you have got a board with many confs you have probably been pissed off many \ntimes because of files beeing uploaded in different conferences. This nice \ndupechecker fixes this problem. It will check in all your conferences if a file \nexists. If it does exists the file will be deleted and the desc is moved to the \nHOLD directory and the user will not be rewarded with any bytes for his upload.\n  \nIt is now also possible to check for duplicates BEFORE uploading using \n''GD filname''\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "REQ" "Requirements."\n\n\nA Commodore Amiga computer (Pese suxx :-) running on kick 2.0+, /X \n(I guess any version will do...) \n\nThis door uses the AEDoor.libary, so you should have this in LIBS:\n(If you haven''t got it then call me or your local /X board to get it...) \n@ENDNODE\n\n\n@NODE "INSTA" "Installation."\n\n\n                             \nJust copy the included files to the correct dirs, that''s it.... \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "HOWTOCONTACT" "How to contact the Author"\n\nHow to contact me:\n\n@{"Flame Strike" LINK "FLAME"} :+47 51631702\n\nOr snailmail: Splash/ElTECH & Megastyle\n              Lindeveien 69\n              N-4300 Sandnes\n              Norway\n\nPS. I''m going to the army 15.08.95 so after that you better contact Lizard \ninstead.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "CREDS" "Credits."\n\nCode,Idea    - Splash/ElTECH & Megastyle\nDoor Design  - Magz/Grotesticle\nGuide Design - Splash/ElTECH & Megastyle\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "GREET" "Greetings."\n\n\n                                  \n\n                         Greetings to all my friends ! \n\n                      Special greetings to all /X coders \n\nAND OFCOURSE ALL MEMBERS OF :\n______ ______________ ______ ________    _________/ _|_____/\______ _ __________\n ____ V _________   // ____/_______  \  _\  ______   _  __/  \  __/_________   /\n |   \_/   |   _/  //  \__   |   _/   \/  \___   \   |___     \ \      /  _/  /\n |    |    |  ____/_     |   |   _     /    _/   /   |   \    /  \_   /  ____/_\n |____|    |_______/_________:___\    /_________/____|_______/_______/________/\n      |____|                      \  /                       \n      :    :                       \/\n\n                                   AnD\n\n             _______ /|   _______/\_______________    _____ \n            /~ ____// | __\___  ~__~/  _____/~   ~\  /~ ¡ ~\.  \n           //  __)_// |/ ~\  /  :| //  __) //   .__)//  |  \\\\n           \\     ~\\ ~   \\/   || \\     ~\\   : \\\\      / \  \n            \  ____/\______/\____|  \  ____/\____ // \. |__/  /\n             \/ .____/\______/\_____|\/ .TeTSUo__\/ / \/ ____/\n              \/                      \/          \/   \/ \n\n\n\nPersonal greetings:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nLizard/MGS!      - We ARE growing BIG now!\nWoober/MGS!      - Hi!\nJedi/MGS!        - STILL noe nodes ?  :-)\nNightProwler/HLM - Nice talkin'' to yah! Hope you like this door!\nMiC flAiR/ElT    - We need more releases from ElT.....\nLithium/ElT      - Hope we get the chance to talk more..\nMagz/GrT         - Great dezign.. Nice colly... greet me in the next one!\n\nSo I 4got YOU? Oki... go ahead shoot me.... I''m guilty...\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "FLAME" "Flame Strike"\n           .    .         .         .        .\n   _______/|___/|________/|____ ___/|_______/|\n _/        l_   |    _    l_   |    l_       l_.........................\n/¬     _____j   |    ¬     l   !     l    ____j                        :\nY         |    _|__  .     | \ : /   |  _____j_     ·fLAME^sTRIKE·     :\n|     ____j   /    l :     |  \ /    |        l                        :\n|        |  _/     | :     |   :     |        |ElTECH EHQ·Megastyle WHQ:\n|        |         | !     |   !     |        |                        :\n|       ||        || |     |   |     |       ||                        :\nl________j_________j_|     |___|     |________jHOt WAREZ·CODERS CORNER·.\n :                   l_____j   l_____j [nUMEN] CHAtABlE SYSOP·YouNameIt.\n :  cREW:                    .         .      .     .         .        .\n :Splash/ElTECH^MGS!  ______/|________/|_____/|____/|____ ___/|_______/|\n :UnmaD/eXCALIBUR   _/  _____j_        l_   _ l_    l_   |    l_       l_  \n :MiC FlAiR/ElTECH /_____     l         l   ¬  l     l   !     j    ____j\n :    [YOU?]       Y     \    |    _____j    __j_    |   :  __/   _____j_\n :                 |      \   |      |    .     |    |   .    \         l\n :BIG /X conf with |       \  |      |    :     |    |   :     |        |\n :  400++ files!   |          |      |    !     |    |   !     |        |\n :.[+47·51631702]  |         ||     ||    |     |   ||   |     |       ||\n.:::....... .... ..l__________j______j____|     |____j___|     |________j\n :                                      : l_____j /X 4.9 l_____j :\n .                                      :........................:\n .\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "MEGASTYLE" "About Megastyle"\n\n                                                               @{" Go back.. " Link MAIN}\n\nMegastyle is a new AmiExpress-Support group formed by Lizard of Spaceballs in\nthe middle of may 1995.\n\nOur main goal is to support all the /X-boards out there with the best doors\naround. We try hard to make our products as system-friendly as possible and\nwith unique configuration possibilities.\n\n\nWe want to be the leading /X-development group in the future, and therefore\nneed more skilled coders and ANSI-artist to make our products even better!\n\nIf you''re interesting in teaming up, then take a look at the contact-info.\n\n\n\n   _________ \n    _______ )  ·M·e·g·a·S·t·y·l·e·  ·P·r·o·d·u·c·t·i·o·n·s·\n           )¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n           ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\nEven if we are a pretty new group we have released a couple of doors allready.\n\nSplash:\nAutoreward v1.3\nGlobalDupe v1.5\nSysDL      v3.2\n\nLizard:\nBulls      v1.0\nNodeStatus v1.2\n\nAll these doors are just GREAT so check''em out! And more releases to come in near \nfuture!\n\n\n   _________ \n    _______ )  ·M·e·g·a·S·t·y·l·e·  ·B·o·a·r·d·s·\n           )¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n           ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n           +47-51-631702 -=- @{"FlameStrike" Link "FLAME"} ·oOo· Sysop : Splash\n           +47-51-417240 -=- @{"Noiseless  " Link "NOISELESS"} ·oOo· Sysop : Lizard (NightBBS)\n           +47-77-748689 -=- @{"Eternity   " Link "ETERNITY"} ·oOo· Sysop : Woober\n           +47-51-575227 -=- @{"Total Panic" Link "TOTALPANIC"} ·oOo· Sysop : Jedi\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "NOISELESS" "Propaganda : Noiseless BBS!"\n                                                               @{" Go back.. " Link "MEGASTYLE"}\n\n                                        .\n                                           ·\n   _  _  _ _______  _____ __ _____ _____:  :   _____  _____  _____ __ _  _   _\n_   _  _ ______   ||     (__)     |   __|  |  |   __||  ___||  ____ __ _ _  _\n            |  |  ||  |  |  l  `--|  _/_|  |__|  _/_ l  ''--.l  ''--.\n            |  |  ||  |  |  |--,  |  l  |  l  |  l  ||--,  ||--,  |\n            l__|  l|_____l__l__   l__   l__   l__   |l__   ll__   l\n               `--''            `--''  `--''  `--''  `--''   `--''   `--''\n\n                           SysOp : Lizard/Spaceballs\n\n      Phone : +47-51417240, only available between : 23:00PM -> 07:00AM.\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "ETERNITY" "Propaganda : Eternity BBS!"\n                                                               @{" Go back.. " Link "MEGASTYLE"}\n\n                                                               ._____.\n  _____________________________________________________________:__ ._|__\n  \__ _____/___   _   / _____/______  \_   .  _/______ /     _   / |   /\n   /  ___/   /     \_/ ___/    /  _/  _/   |    \    \/¬\     \_/    _/\n  /_________/_______\_________/___\     \__|     \_______\_____\_____|\n                               -cDr\_____\ l______\\n.                                                                       .\n+-÷aMiGA ^ aSCiI ^ mODUlES ^ hACKErS lAnD ^ /X sUPpORT ^ pUBLiC dOMAiN÷-+\n:           [f]EATURING: A1200/020 ^ oNE (n)oDE (14k4 mAXLiTE)          :\n|          [m]ANAGEMENT: [w@@ßE®^tHg^nEo^mGs^bDz]-[SiENCE^tHg]          |\n!   tECHNOLOGY [nHq] · nEO [nHq] · mEGASTYLE [hQ] · bANANa dEZIGn [hQ]  !\n+÷---------------------------------------------------------------------÷+\n:                   [n]UMBER: +47-777-48689 [23 - 07]                   :\n`÷---------------------------------------------------------------------÷''\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "TOTALPANIC" "Propaganda : Total Panic BBS!"\n                                                               @{" Go back.. " Link "MEGASTYLE"}\n\n «*»  Total Panic - 28.8kb v.all - Sysop : Jedi - Number : +47-51-575227  «*»\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE "NEW" "What is new in this version of GlobalDupe?"\n\n*Fixed a bug in the layout.\n\n*Added the possibility to check for duplicate BEFORE uploading by using the ''GD'' \ncommand.\n\n@ENDNOD