\n            .\n\n\n\n                                 ---[%]---\n\n                    MAGZDIRX is a Megastyle! production\n\n               code, idea & design by   Magz of MGS! GRT INT\n               \n\n\n                         Creds for this GUIDE file\n\n               Slapped together by      Magz\n               Asciis by                Relief   of T! MGS! 5D\n                                        Grimlock of GRT E^D MGS!\n\n                                 ---[%]---\n\n\n\n                      Megastyle! does now consist of\n \n               Leader . . . . . . . . . Lizard\n               Code . . . . . . . . . . Lizard\n                                        Magz\n                                        Splash\n                                        Instant(?!)\n               AscII. . . . . . . . . . Relief\n                                        Grimlock!\n                                        Magz\n               Boards . . . . . . . . . Noiseless - WHQ         LIZARD\n                                        Genetic Waste           MAGZ\n                                        Ecstatica               INSTANT\n                                        Final Impact (SHQ)      U-MAN\n\n                                 ---[%]---\n\n\n\n\n\n\n   ............\n   ::        ::\n   ::        ::\n    .        ::\n   /_____    ::          ___________                                          .\n  /_     \//\____________\      ___/_______    _________\n //      \/        _     /     /_         /____\___    //                     :\n/--------/     .---/____/   .---/________         _    //                     :\n     -T!/______\  /_       _|  .______.  \-----/_______/                      :\n                  __\   __/____|_     l_          _______.     _____________  :\n   ::        ::   \  \__    _ _        /_____ ____\     _l_____\     _     /__:_\n   ::        ::    \--(/      /            _//          \        ____/____/  /:\n   ::        ::       /_