  \n   :                                                                   :   \n   |              <+> skID roW euROPEAN heADQUARTERS! <+>              |   \n   |                    + 3 2  - 8 9 -  7 5 3 7 3 7                    :   \n   `------------ - -------- ------------- --------- - ---- ------------''   \n@endnode\n@node Universe\n\n\n                 _ __ __  __ __ __ ___  __________  _____________       \n                / |  |  \\|  |\\/|  |\\  \\/ ____/  _ \\/   ___/ ____/       \n               /  | !|!  \\  | ||  |/ //  _/ |. |/ /\\___  \\\\ __/         \n              //  |  |: \\   | .|  / /// \\\\/\\|: \\  \\/   | \\\\ \\ ¯\\        \n              \\______|__|\\__|__|____/\\_____/|__|\\__/______/____/i!      \n                                                                        \n                            ^ Skid Row German Hq ^                      \n                                                                        \n               ³ Nodes Dual Ringdown  ^  ² Nodes Isdn Ringdown          \n                                                                        \n            Sysops: Pigeon/Sr  ^  Ian/Sr  ^  Ronin/Scx  ^  Bomber       \n                                                                        \n\n\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',31152,5,0,NULL,NULL,'mst_dmex','scan',1780048619);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mst_ed10','MST-ED10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MST-ED10.LHA','Ealldelete000','XIM','Ealldelete000',NULL,NULL,'MST','\   /\ | /\ __/\ . /\ |\ . /| BOBO/MYSTiC | / V \/_. \/_.¬\/_| \/ |/ |_\| ~~~~~~~~~~~ | /  |  \¬|  \¬¦  \¬|  \ |  ¦ ¬\  PRESENTS:  |',replace(' _/\___/¦___/\___/\___/¦_/\__.-------------.\n \   /\ | /\ __/\ . /\ |\ . /| BOBO/MYSTiC |\n / V \/_. \/_.¬\/_| \/ |/ |_\| ~~~~~~~~~~~ |\n/  |  \¬|  \¬¦  \¬|  \ |  ¦ ¬\  PRESENTS:  |\n\__¦  /__  /__  / ¦__/_¦___  /  ~~~~~~~~~  |\n.---\/---\/---\/-/X-Power!-\/^-------------|\n|:.::EALL-Delete! (CLI) - (Version 1.0)::.:|\n|:This will delete all your old EALL msgs.:|\n|:Features: Fast! (2000 msgs - 6 seconds)::|\n|:configable, nice design and everything!.:|\n`------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'Ealldelete.Guide',replace('@DATABASE EallDelete.Guide\n@$VER: Guide for Eall Deleter v1.0 (3rd May 1994)\n\n@REMARK Copyright (c) 1994 Mystic.\n@REMARK All Rights Reserved.\n@REMARK Main Program and Document by Bobo/Mystic.\n\n@REMARK You need MultiView, Amigaguide or any other GUIDE viewer.\n\n@NODE MAIN "EallDelete: Contents."\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n         EALL-Deleter (Version 1.0) [RELEASE 1] - 3rd May 1994\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n          @{"[ Background and Purpose ]" Link Background}      @{"[   Program History   ]" Link History}\n          @{"[    Notable Features    ]" Link Features  }      @{"[  Thanks and Greets  ]" Link Greets}\n          @{"[ How to use Eall Delete ]" Link Use       }\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                  Copyright (c) 1994 by Bobo/Mystic\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n Example Outputs/Scripts come in seperate files with the release archive.\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Background "EealDelete: Background and Purpose"\n[------------( Background and Purpose )-----------------------------------]\n\nThe reason i wrote Eall-Deleter was becouse i am sick and tired of all\nthoose old EALL messages that i no longer needed. Until this util was\nborn, i used EALL by Sigma Seven, but it was coded in AREXX and was really\nslow and required alot of memory. (But the UTIL was really great!!)\n\nNOTE: Take a look at the output example (Ealldelete.Output)\n\nGreetings to SIGMA SEVEN!\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Features "Ealldelete: Notable Features"\n[------------( Notable Features )-----------------------------------------]\n\nSeveral reasons to use EallDelete:\n\n* Written entirely in C for fast code.\n* Nice design.\n* Fast! (Scans 2000 messages in 6 seconds)\n* Scans the messagebase exactly the same way as amiexpress.\n  (Check the included output example.)\n* Special optimized versions for all CPU types.\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Use "EallDelete: Install into Express"\n[------------( How to use Eall Delete )-----------------------------------]\n\nEall Delete is really easy to use. It only requires one argument:\n\nEALLDELETE <confpath>  - eg: EALLDELETE BBS:Elite/\n                             EALLDELETE BBS:Conf1/  or whatever\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE History "EallDelete: Program History"\n[------------( Program History )------------------------------------------]\n\n{ + }-New feature(s)         { - }-Removed feature\n{ * }-changed feature        { ! }-fixed feature (Bug)\n{ # }-Information            { ? }-let me know if this work\n\nEall Deleter v1.0 (04-03-94 > 04-21-94) - [First public version]\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n04-03-94 { + } I started coding this door.\n - ^^ -  { + } Main routines to scan the messagebase.\n04-08-94 { ! } Fixed the design stuff.\n04-10-94 { * } Optimized and maked it safer.\n04-21-94 { + } Maked the final changes.\n - ^^ -  { + } Removed the registration code.\n               Final size: 15124 (Sourcecode: 7339)\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Greets "EallDelete: Thanks and Greets"\n[------------( Thanks and Greets )----------------------------------------]\n\nGreetings to: Pacific/2000 AD, Looby/Insane, Dee/Delight, Agressor/Anthrox,\n              Reactor/Mystic, Easy Rider/Mystic, Ufok/Mystic, Screwball!\n\nMany thanx to Byteandi/TRSI and Remo/Mystic for all help and support!\n\nAnd many many thanx to all my beta testers for bug-reports, suggestions and\nhints & tips to improve this door.\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',22577,1,0,NULL,NULL,'mst_ed10','scan',1780048619);
