INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mst_fc12','MST-FC12.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MST-FC12.LHA','FileIDCLIBox','XIM','FileIDCLIBox',NULL,NULL,'MST','+---/    \ \/ / __/_  __/ / __/------------+ |--/ / / /\  /\  /-/ /-/ / /---Re/Y\o------| |--\/ / /-/ /\  /-/ /-/ /\ \----/Y\ystic---|',replace('     ______  __________________\n+---/    \ \/ / __/_  __/ / __/------------+\n|--/ / / /\  /\  /-/ /-/ / /---Re/Y\o------|\n|--\/ / /-/ /\  /-/ /-/ /\ \----/Y\ystic---|\n+---\/\/--\/--\/--\/--\/--\/-----/X-DeSign-+\n|   FileIDCLIBox v1.2 CLI Interface For    |\n|   Adding, Deleting, Viewing, Changing    |\n| File_ID.Diz To Any Archive You Can Find  |\n|       Archivers For! BUGFixed ! ...      |\n+------------------------------------------+\n','\n',char(10)),'FileIDCLIBox.guide',replace('@database FileIDCLIBoxDoc\n\nCopyright (C) 1993 TekLords/Mystic/X-DeSign, Belgium, LI\nAll Rights Reserved\n\n@Remark $VER: Version V1.0 (Jan 13 1994, 14:24:21)\n@Remark AmigaGuide database for the FileIDCLIBox Documentation\n\n@node MAIN "FileIDCLIBox AmigaGuide Document (C) 1993 TekLords/Mystic/X-DeSign (Jan 13 1994, 14:24:21)"\n\n                                :                                          \n   ________               :     ¦                    /\\                    \n   \\       \\  ____________¦    _|_ ___________ _____/_ \\_ _ __________ __ _\n    \\______ \\/ __ _ _/    |    \\\\\\\\\\_       /\\\\\\_    /__/\\\\\\\\__      //_///\n     /     \\  /     \\     |    _/   /______/     _  /   \\    _/     /      \n   _/       \\/       \\_____   _\\______    \\_      \\/     \\_  \\_____/\\_     \n   \\        ||        /   /   \\      /     /      |       /          /     \n    \\ ______||______ /_________\\_________ /_______|_____ /_________ /      \n     \\/            \\/                   \\/             \\/     Rpd!\\/ \n                              (MYSTiC/X-DeSiGN) \n\n\n              .: C O N T E N T S  O F  D O C U M E N T A T I O N :.\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                         @{"        Introduction        " Link Part01}\n                         @{"        Requirements        " Link Part02}\n                         @{" How To Use This Great Util " Link Part03}\n                         @{"         ToolTypes          " Link ToolTypes}\n                         @{"         Greetings          " Link Part04}\n\n                Docs done by @{" Re/Y\o/TekLords/Mystic/X-DeSign " Link Diabolo}.\n                       Install And Enjoy The Program ...\n@endnode\n@node Part01 "Introduction To FileIDCLIBox by Re/Y\o/TLS/MST "\n\n                              .: Introduction :.\n                              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nWell it is very easy ... FileIDCLIBox can be used to make life easier for\nthe once that want to add the File_ID.Diz to every available archive you\nwant to release ... It allows you to add, delete, view and change the \nFile_ID.Diz in any archive supported by FileIDCLIBox ... It can be used \nfrom Shell, Diskmaster2.x, DirOpus, or any other DirUtil ...\n\nThis release is only because of a few bug fixes ... It wouldn''t take the\nfile_id.diz always ... It had problems with the "Ram Disk:" from the\nreqtools-requester and CED ... So I hope that these problems are fixed\nnow ...\n\n@endnode\n@node Part02 "Requirements"\n\n                              .: Requirements :.\n                              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nAll you need is an ©Amiga, FileIDCLIBox, a textviewer, a texteditor, and some\narchivers ...\nIf you find any BUGS or have some SUGGESTIONS please leave me a messy ... You\nwill most certainly be able to find me at @{" Diabolo " Link Diabolo}.\n\n\n@endnode\n@node Part03 "How To Install FileIDCLIBox by Re/Y\o/TLS/MST"\n\n                            .:Installation Guide:.\n                            ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nThe Program runs on most amiga configurations ... there shouldn''t be much\nlimitations ... except not enough diskspace ... not enough ram ... but it\ndoesn''t consume much itself ... it''s just the archives that might consume\nsome space ...\nJust copy the program where you like it ... and where all your DirUtils that\nyou want to use it with can find it ... Than there should be no problem ...\n\nUsage: FileIDCLIBox <a|c|d|v> <Archive> [<Description>]\n\n       a Add FileDescription\n       c Change FileDescription\n       d Delete FileDescription\n       v View FileDescription\n\nThe Description will only be used in case of ''a'' i.e. Add a description to an\narchive ... and even then if you don''t give a description a requester will pop\nup and ask you for it...\n\nThere are a few Safety requesters just before an operation takes place ...\nThe\n\n                       "Add File_ID.Diz now?"\n                      "Change File_ID.Diz now?"\n\nrequesters are only there if you use an editor that detaches from shell and \nimmediatly returns ... After changing the File_ID.Diz and saving it with your\nfavourit editor just press yes if you want it to be added ... Doing this before\nyou edited the File_ID.Diz will result in the same File_ID.Diz added again ...\n\nI used @{" ToolTypes " Link ToolTypes} in the FileIDCLIBox.info becoz of the\nexistance of FileIDToolBox ... So you can use the same icon for both programs\nand only have to change them once with The ToolTypeWindow or with the\nToolType program by Michael J Barsoom © 1993.\n\nI will not discuss the different DirWorkUtilities becoz there are so many and\nI don''t have them all ... :) So if you want to use it with your favorit tool\njust configure it for this purpose ...\n\n@endnode\n@node ToolTypes "The different ToolTypes"\n\n\n                          .:The different ToolTypes:.\n                          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nThis is how i build them ... First of all I get the extension of the archive,\nthis is like DMS, LHA, LZH, EXE etc ... default is "" (nothing) for executables.\nFor executables there is a program EXEDescript that hangs a description on the\nexecutable without destroying it ... It can also be removed ...\nThen i add something to this extension ...\n\n* ''.A'' : this allows you to specify the add line you want to use for this\n         extension ...\n         e.g. DMS.A=DMSDescript a %f %F\n              ZIP.A=ZIP -u %F %f\n\nNote: if you add the File_ID.Diz by requester it''s name doesn''t have to be\nFile_ID.Diz ... it can be anything and it will be added as File_ID.Diz ...\n\n* ''.E'' : this allows you to specify the edit line you want to use for this\n         extension ...\n         e.g. DMS.E=CED %f\n              ZIP.E=CED %f\n\n* ''.X'' : this allows you to specify the extract line you want to use for this\n         extension ...\n         e.g. DMS.X=DMSDescript x %f %F\n              ZIP.X=UNZIP -o %F %f\n\n* ''.D'' : this allows you to specify the delete line you want to use for this\n         extension ...\n         e.g. DMS.D=DMSDescript d %f %F\n              ZIP.D=ZIP -d %F %f\n\n* ''.V'' : this allows you to specify the view line you want to use for this\n         extension ...\n         e.g. DMS.V=PPMore %f\n              ZIP.V=PPMore %f\n\nThen ... what does the %F and %f mean ... %F will be replaced by the archive\nname and path itself ... %f will always be replaced by FILE_ID.DIZ ... so they\nmust be put there if you want something to happen ... and they have to be at\nthe exact place for your archiver, editor, viewer ...\n\nThere should be enough example ToolTypes in the Icon as is .. so there you can\nhave a look at the possibilities ...\n\n@endnode\n@node Part04 "Greetings To EveryOne"\n\n\n\n               First Of All I Want To Greet Some Betatesters ...\n\n                               @{"     Andi/MST     " Link Diabolo}\n                               @{"     Spy/MST      " Link Paralysis}\n                               @{"    SieGel/MST    " Link Diabolo}\n                               @{" Genghis Khan/TLS " Link WOK}\n                               @{"       Uli        " Link FlyingSaucer}\n                               @{"     Scorpio      " Link LastDesire}\n                               @{"    Ken & Ryu     " Link ShotokanPalace}\n                               @{"      Pigeon      " Link Universe}\n\n               Yankee Rose           -=+=- /\\ltern/\\te Re/\\ality\n               ARGON/MST             -=+=- *||MATROSE ARGON||*\n               Foxx''n''Lynxx          -=+=- </\\/> ZigZag Corp <\\/\\>\n               - GALAXY -            -=+=- Call ULIXYS BBS (ISDN)\n               STB                   -=+=- NoWHeRe\n               RHYS/FAIRLIGHT        -=+=- > > F A I R L I G H T < <\n               Mike                  -=+=- GL0BAL CHA0S BBS\n               [-AmiCom/PDX]         -=+=- SKARA BRAE ISDN\n               SPEEDLOCK             -=+=- Lighthouse 6 NDS -THHG-\n               THE SiLENCER/TRSi     -=+=- »»»[ T R S i ]«««\n                THE CHAMP            -=+=- <*>RANDOM ACCESS<*>\n               dR.dRE!               -=+=- -=====Faith=====-\n               FuZzY/MsT             -=+=- (MySTiC /X-DeSiGN)\n               DELTAFORCE            -=+=- // MEN-TEL BBS //\n               SATAN                 -=+=- {SHINING 8}\n               EMPiRE                -=+=- -÷M÷Y÷S÷T÷i÷C÷-\n               [-bObO-]              -=+=- [» MYSTiC/X-DESiGN «]\n\n                               @{"      Amiga       " Link Amiga}\n\n               Secondly All The Members Of Mystic & TekLords ...\n\n                                 @{"    Mystic    " Link Mystic}\n                                 @{"   TekLords   " Link TekLords}\n\n                            And Last But Not Least ...\n\n        All Ex- And Still-Members Of AFL That I Have Met Over The Years...\n\n        Don''t Shoot Me If I Forgot You ... There Are So Many People I Have\n        To Thank For Testing ... That I Probably Forgot To Mention Here ...\n\n@endnode\n@node Diabolo  "Diabolo -=- Mystic/X-DeSign WHQ -=-"\n\n\n                        ·  :                 .     :     :\n-============-   \\____ ¬V ¬V___ ¬V___ ¬V___ ¬V ¬|  |___ ¬|   MANAGEMENT\n (Mystic/X-Design)| ¬|  |  | ¬|  | ¬|  | ¬|  |  |  | ¬|  |   -========-\n      WHQ         |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |   ANDi/MST\n-============-    |  |  |  |     |    _|  |  |  |__|  |  |   SPY/MST\n                  |  |  |  |  |  |  | ¬|  |  |  | ¬|  |  |   FELDMAN\n-ELiTE oNLY-      |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |   FuZzY/MsT\n                  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |   Wolfmann/TRSI\nCALL US NoW FoR   |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |   (-FaZ! & tERMi-)\nTHE NEWEST AMiGA/ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |     -====-\nPCSTUFF           |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |   RUNS oN A3000\nAND ALL MST-      |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |   WITH 25MHZ AND\nRELEASES.         |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |   AMIEX (REG.)\n                __|_____A__A__A__A_____A_____A_____A_____|D! \nWE oNLY ACCEPT    |     :  :     :     :     :     :     |   SUPPoRTET BY\n9600 - 16.800     :     ·  .     .           .     ·     :   -==========-\nBAUD CoNNECTS.    .        .                                 M Y S T I C\n\n\n@endnode\n@node Paralysis  "Best PD-BBS in Berlin ... Give it a RING"\n\n\n  _______)\\  ________ _____)\\  ________ _____________)\\ ____ _______)\\\n  \\  _____ \\ \\  ____ \\\\  ___ \\ \\  ___  \\\\\\ / //\\\\  ___  / \\\\\\  ___  /\n  _\\/____/ /__\\/___/ /_\\/__/ /__\\/__/  / \\  / \\ \\/ / \\/\\/  // \\/\\/\n  \\  _____/ \\  ___  / \\  ___/ \\  ___  /  / /\\ \\_/ /  \\ \\___\\  /  \\ \\___\n /\\\\//\\\\/  / / /\\\\ \\/\\\\/  / //\\ \\//\\\\___/ /\\ \\___ \\ /\\\\/ /\\ \\___ \\\n// \\// \\  / / // \\\\ \\_// \\  / /// \\ __ // \\// \\ __/ /// \\ // \\ __/ /\n\\__/\\__/  \\/  \\__/ \\ /\\__/  \\/ \\__//__\\\\__/\\__//___/ \\__/ \\__//___/\nV\n         SYSOP : Spy/MST  !    COSYSOP : PHANTOM        SYSOP : Arthur Dent\n.\nAmIgA 3ooo / 25 MhZ / 24H 7DaYz / CoOl RaTiOs / USR DuAl RuLeZ\n\n\n NoDe 1 : 745 2093     U.S.Robotics DUAL Standard 14400 (RINGDOWN FOR NODE 1-3)\n NoDe 2 : 745 2094     U.S.Robotics DUAL Standard 16800\n NoDe 3 : 745 2095     U.S.Robotics DUAL Standard 16800\n NoDe 4 : 746 7782     U.S.Robotics COURIER HST   16800 (ZyXEL 19200 soon)\n\n\n@endnode\n@node WOK  "Wrath Of Khan -=- TekLords WHQ -=-"\n                  INVOKE IF YOU DARE THE... .|\n      __ _    _ _______ _   ____ ____ ____ /||\\   ___ ____      ______\n      \\ Y \\/\\/ Y __ ___Y \\ / ___Y___ Y___// || \\  \\__Y___ \\   /Y    _/\n       \\· / \\\\ ·// Y|_/·_//__|/ ·| / ·\\  /-*()*-\\  / · |/  \\ / · ___/\n        \\_\\__/_/// ·\\_  \\/ \\___ ||/   \\\\// _||  \\\\ \\\\  /  ////  __/\n         \\_||_/ \\__ |\\___\\__||___|\\____/\\___||___/  \\_ ___/ \\_ _|\n           ·|      Y .   Y   .|           . |·        Y       Y\n                 ___/|_ ____/||\\___ ____  |\\__   _|   ·      ·\n                 \\_/ |/Y /_/ || \\__Y___ \\ |_  \\/Y |\n                  /  / ·/ /-*()*-\\|· \\|__\\|    \\·_|\n                 //  \\  \\// _||  \\\\_  __/ \\  \\   _|\n                 \\__ |\\__\\_ _||___/___|| _/__/\\__ |\n                    Y    Y Y ·|   Y     Y |      \\| [Seven M]\n                    ·    · ·      ·     ·         ·\n\n                          -* TekLords WHQ *-\n\n  Sysops: SouLCatcher                        CoSysops:  Percy\n          SkY                                           DIO+CAT/AFL\n          Genghis Khan                                  Ghostrider\n@endnode\n@node FlyingSaucer "Flying Saucer -=- Independent -=-"\n\n\n       .::::::::: ::::       ::::  :::: :::::::::: ::::  :::: .:::::::::\n       ::::       ::::       ::::  ::::    ::::    ::::: :::: ::::\n       :::::::::: ::::       `:::::::::    ::::    :::::::::: :::: :::::\n       ::::       ::::             ::::    ::::    :::: ::::: ::::  ::::\n       ::::       `::::::::: :::::::::'' :::::::::: ::::  :::: `::::::::''\n      