INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mst_olmu','MST-OLMU.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MST-OLMU.LHA','OLM_32','XIM','______  __________________',NULL,NULL,'MST','+---/    \ \/ / __/_  __/ / __/------------+ |--/ / / /\  /\  /-/ /-/ / /---Re/Y\o------| |--\/ / /-/ /\  /-/ /-/ /\ \----Mystic-----|',replace('     ______  __________________\n+---/    \ \/ / __/_  __/ / __/------------+\n|--/ / / /\  /\  /-/ /-/ / /---Re/Y\o------|\n|--\/ / /-/ /\  /-/ /-/ /\ \----Mystic-----|\n+---\/\/--\/--\/--\/--\/--\/-----/X-DeSign-+\n| InterActive OLM ... Which allows instant |\n| reply ... 9 & 32 Node Version Included ! |\n+------------------------------------------+\n','\n',char(10)),'Olm.guide',replace('@database OLMDoc\n\nCopyright (C) 1993 TekLords/Mystic/X-DeSign, Belgium, LI\nAll Rights Reserved\n\n@Remark $VER: Version V1.1 (Jan 13 1994, 14:24:21)\n@Remark AmigaGuide database for the OLM Documentation for /X\n\n@node MAIN "OLM AmigaGuide Document (C) 1993 TekLords/Mystic/X-DeSign (Jan 13 1994, 14:24:21)"\n\n                                :                                          \n   ________               :     ¦                    /\\                    \n   \\       \\  ____________¦    _|_ ___________ _____/_ \\_ _ __________ __ _\n    \\______ \\/ __ _ _/    |    \\\\\\\\\\_       /\\\\\\_    /__/\\\\\\\\__      //_///\n     /     \\  /     \\     |    _/   /______/     _  /   \\    _/     /      \n   _/       \\/       \\_____   _\\______    \\_      \\/     \\_  \\_____/\\_     \n   \\        ||        /   /   \\      /     /      |       /          /     \n    \\ ______||______ /_________\\_________ /_______|_____ /_________ /      \n     \\/            \\/                   \\/             \\/     Rpd!\\/ \n                              (MYSTiC/X-DeSiGN) \n\n\n              .: C O N T E N T S  O F  D O C U M E N T A T I O N :.\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                         @{"        Introduction        " Link Part01}\n                         @{"        Requirements        " Link Part02}\n                         @{" How to install the /X Door " Link Part03}\n                         @{"         Greetings          " Link Part04}\n\n                Docs done by @{" Re/Y\o/TekLords/Mystic/X-DeSign " Link Diabolo}.\n                       Install And Enjoy The Program ...\n@endnode\n@node Part01 "Introduction To OLM by Re/Y\o/TLS/MST "\n\n                              .: Introduction :.\n                              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nWell it is very easy ... OLM will send a message of an unlimited length to any\nuser, who is online at that moment and can be reached through ©Ami-Express\nitselve ... At the same time you get the message, OLM will try to call another\nOLM on the other node you were sending the OLM to ... You can then reply to or\nQuit from the OLM ... There might be some more features in the future then\nthere are now ...\nYou are able to send OLM''s to Handles (with wildcards) or to NodeNumbers or \nofcourse to ALL Nodes ...\n\n\n@endnode\n@node Part02 "Requirements"\n\n                              .: Requirements :.\n                              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nAll you need is an ©Amiga and ©Ami-Express version whatever ... For the rest\nyou need a little bit patience and luck ... The rest is for the @{"Installation" Link Part03}.\nIf you find any BUGS or have some SUGGESTIONS please leave me a messy ... You\nwill most certainly be able to find me at @{" Diabolo " Link Diabolo}.\n\n\n@endnode\n@node Part03 "How To Install OLM by Re/Y\o/TLS/MST"\n\n                            .:Installation Guide:.\n                            ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nThe Program runs on most versions of Ami-Express as far as I have access to all\nthose versions ...\n\n                         @{"  Ami-Express v3.x   9 Nodes" Link Part030}\n                         @{"  Ami-Express v3.x  32 Nodes" Link Part031}\n\n@endnode\n@node Part030 "Ami-Express v3.x  9 Nodes"\n\n                         .:Ami-Express v3.x  9 Nodes:.\n                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nIt is very easy to install this program ... It does not require special\nprograms or preferences ... I might put some language-specific functions in\nit as soon as Bytemaster will start supporting LOCALE in a way ... Could be\nnice if everybody could work in your BBS in his own language ... What did\ncommodore ever invented LOCALE for :) ?\n\nFor the 9 Node version you need the OLM_9 ofcoz ...\n\nJust copy one of the existing Icons you have in your BBSCmd directory and put\nthese tooltypes in it ...\n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~ <- Cut Here :)\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nLOCATION=Doors:OLM\nMULTINODE=YES\nACCESS=10\nTYPE=XIM\nSTACK=20000\n(RESIDENT)\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~ <- Cut Here :)\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nThe OLM Door can be made resident ... To do this just put\nresident OLM Doors:OLM pure add\nin your user-startup or where you want it ... And delete the brackets around\nthe RESIDENT tooltype ...\nLOCATION=Doors:OLM should be changed into LOCATION=Olm ...\n\nThat should be all folks ... \n\n@endnode\n@node Part031 "Ami-Express v3.x 32 Nodes"\n\n                         .:Ami-Express v3.x 32 Nodes:.\n                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nIt is very easy to install this program ... It does not require special\nprograms or preferences ... I might put some language-specific functions in\nit as soon as Bytemaster will start supporting LOCALE in a way ... Could be\nnice if everybody could work in your BBS in his own language ... What did\ncommodore ever invented LOCALE for :) ?\n\nFor the 32 Node version you need the OLM_32 ofcoz ...\n\nJust copy one of the existing Icons you have in your BBSCmd directory and put\nthese tooltypes in it ...\n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~ <- Cut Here :)\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nLOCATION=Doors:OLM\nMULTINODE=YES\nACCESS=10\nTYPE=XIM\nSTACK=20000\n(RESIDENT)\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~ <- Cut Here :)\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nThe OLM Door can be made resident ... To do this just put\nresident OLM Doors:OLM pure add\nin your user-startup or where you want it ... And delete the brackets around\nthe RESIDENT tooltype ...\nLOCATION=Doors:OLM should be changed into LOCATION=Olm ...\n\nThat should be all folks ...\n\n@endnode\n@node Part04 "Greetings To EveryOne"\n\n\n\n               First Of All I Want To Greet Some Betatesters ...\n\n                               @{"     Andi/MST     " Link Diabolo}\n                               @{"     Spy/MST      " Link Paralysis}\n                               @{"    SieGel/MST    " Link Diabolo}\n                               @{" Genghis Khan/TLS " Link WOK}\n                               @{"       Uli        " Link FlyingSaucer}\n                               @{"     Scorpio      " Link LastDesire}\n                               @{"    Ken & Ryu     " Link ShotokanPalace}\n                               @{"      Pigeon      " Link Universe}\n\n               Yankee Rose           -=+=- /\\ltern/\\te Re/\\ality\n               ARGON/MST             -=+=- *||MATROSE ARGON||*\n               Foxx''n''Lynxx          -=+=- </\\/> ZigZag Corp <\\/\\>\n               - GALAXY -            -=+=- Call ULIXYS BBS (ISDN)\n               STB                   -=+=- NoWHeRe\n               RHYS/FAIRLIGHT        -=+=- > > F A I R L I G H T < <\n               Mike                  -=+=- GL0BAL CHA0S BBS\n               [-AmiCom/PDX]         -=+=- SKARA BRAE ISDN\n               SPEEDLOCK             -=+=- Lighthouse 6 NDS -THHG-\n               THE SiLENCER/TRSi     -=+=- »»»[ T R S i ]«««\n                THE CHAMP            -=+=- <*>RANDOM ACCESS<*>\n               dR.dRE!               -=+=- -=====Faith=====-\n               FuZzY/MsT             -=+=- (MySTiC /X-DeSiGN)\n               DELTAFORCE            -=+=- // MEN-TEL BBS //\n               SATAN                 -=+=- {SHINING 8}\n               EMPiRE                -=+=- -÷M÷Y÷S÷T÷i÷C÷-\n               [-bObO-]              -=+=- [» M