         \n ~                                                                           \n ~CC_REQUEST                                                                 \n -----------(cUt)------------                                                \n ThEn, tHis DoOr is InstAllEd nOw! heheh i ThinK eAsy ha?                    \n                                                                             \n HoW To WoRk? :                                                              \n ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~                                                              \n ThIs DooR CreATes A filE CaLleD BbS:DoOrs/ViGos/Req.window.....             \n It iNcludes the user name and request.....                                  \n I HavE soMe iDeas AboUt it, I ThiNk i''ll UpDate And Add Some New ThIngs soon\n                                                                             \n BlA BlA & GrEeTZ :                                                          \n ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~                                                          \n Ok, If You Have Any Ideas or Request or Anything fOr it, PleEz CalL My BBs :\n TrEsPAsS - MySTiC TuRkEy Hq - +90-216-4166955  - SySop Me! hehhe            \n                                                                             \n GrEeTz To:                                                                  \n                                                                             \n * GhOst/AF\n * Max/BrOnx\n * ExAGE/AF\n * AxE/MyStiC\n * AlIeX/MyStiC\n * ByteAndi/MyStic\n * Telekinetik/TfA\n * Don Dog/MyStiC\n * AiBo\n * ShApiro/TrSi\n * IrAta/Trsi\n * Tsm/Mask\n * RuByx\n * CrAyor/ScoopEx\n * AgoNy/ScOopex\n ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n -=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\n CaLL Da ModDaFuCkIn''¦                                                     \n        ______/\____________________________________   ________________    \n        \__   ______._  \    ___/    _____._ \      \ /  ____    _____/    \n          /    :   _|/  /    _/_\____. \__|/  \ _/|  \\____. \ ___. \      \n         /     |   \    \_   \/ \    |  \_____/ \__   \    |  \   |  \     \n         \  ___:    \____/______/_______/  !\____||    \______/______/     \n          \/   |____|                 |____|      |_____/      [ThQ]       \n                            .              !g                              \n  /X 3.32+                  :                                              \n  A 3ooo - 16 MhZ          _!_       =* TrEsPaSs *=                        \n  3oo Mb Hd..    __         |_ -CaLl : +90-216-4166955-__        ___       \n        _____   /  \________| \_______________________/  |______/   \      \n        \_   \_/     __/    :    _/    _______     __/   |______     \_    \n         /   \_/     \_______    \______    \/     |______/    |\_____/    \n        /     |       \_    |     \_   |     \_   _/    _/     |/     \_s  \n      _/      A________/   ________/  ________/__ \____ \_______       /c  \n      \      /      \______/      \___/         \__|  \__|     \______/    \n       \    /                                                              \n        \  /         Tt· Uu· Rr· Kk· Ii· Ss· Hh·  Hh· Qq·                  \n         \/SySOp''S : ViGo/MyStiC - MaX/BrOnX - ExAge ^ GhOSt/AgNoStic FrOnt\n          Co-SySop''S : MiT/ClIquE - SoNy/BlUe MoOn PaRdiSe - GuClU/SkIdRow \n -=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=--=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,4848,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048619);
