ks ¡n S:Lha.str¡p to know what to delete.\n You can ed¡t th¡s F¡le by Double-Cl¡ck¡ng on Wb or load¡ng ¡t ¡nto any\n Text-Ed¡tor.\n After Str¡pp¡ng,he beg¡ns to add your Advert¡sements.\n F¡rst LhaRunner looks for an arguement after the Arch¡vename.\n ¡f there''s a f¡le g¡ven ¡t adds ¡t and ex¡ts the programm.\n Otherw¡se,¡f there''s no f¡lename g¡ven he looks ¡n S:Lha.add to know what\n to add. Note: ¡f you add v¡a the conf¡g-f¡le you can add as many Adver-\n t¡semenst as you l¡ke. ¡f you g¡ve the Advert¡sement as Arguement you can\n only add one f¡le per check.\n\n SPEC¡AL THANKS TO..\n -------------------\n MAXHEADROOM/TEX.........................................for h¡s l¡ttle help!\n PSYCHO/M¡SERY!............................................for Moral Support!\n M¡LLE/M¡SERY!.............................................for Moral Support!\n\n THE USUAL GREET¡NGS GO TO...\n ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n      ·] RENDERMAN/EXPLORERS - MAX HEADROOM/TEX - UNDERTAKER/X-ACT [·\n        ·] METALL¡CA/X-ACT - TW¡L¡GHT/LEGO - VAMP/¡A - CUSAK/¡A [·\n    ·] TURNER/CYBERAKT¡F - DULUX/PR¡ME DES¡GN - EXTERM¡NATOR/REMEDY [·\n          ·] AL¡EX/MYST¡C - COOLSPOT/¡NDP. - EAGLE-EYE/DEFECT [·\n      ·] CHRUSHER/SH¡N¡NG 8 - KERM¡T/EXPLORERS - MAD - JEFF·STA¡NE [·\n          ·] BLUE/PROTECH - DR.BYTE/SCANDAL - FLASHY - DJ J¡M¡ [·\n\n $VER:M¡SERY!-DOCF¡LE V1.0\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',56979,12,0,NULL,NULL,'msy_lr1','scan',1780048628);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mtd_ap07','MTD-AP07.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MTD-AP07.LHA','RPSTART','XIM','RPSTaRT',NULL,'MtD','MTD',NULL,replace('Anti-Lamer-Page V.70 by MtD in 1992\n','\n',char(10)),'lOSeNDOS.guide',replace('                   \n                     __  _ __  /\__ _  _ __/\  __ _  __\n                    _\/___   \/              \/   ___\/_\n              ......\/\  /........................\  /\/......\n             :         \/                          \/         :\n             :      .___             .___         .___        :\n             :   _ _|   \      ______|   \  ______|   \       :\n             :   \\\__   7___  \______   /  \__   ____/       :\n             :      /.   |   \__/.  l/   \___/_____   \__ _   :\n             :     /::.  |    _/::.       _/::.  l/    _///   :\n             :     \___________\___________\____________\     :\n             :___        .___        .___        .___         :___\n     _ ______|   \ ______|   \ ______|   \ ______|   \  ______|   \\n     \\\__   ____/ \______   / \______   / \______   /  \__   ____/\n        /.   ___|___/.   |   \__/.  _|   \__/.  l/   \___/_____   \__ _\n       /::.  l/   _/::.  |    _/::. \___  _/::.       _/::.  l/    _///\n       \_ _________\_____|_____\___________\___________\___________ \\n         Y   :                                                :[nM$]Y\n      .------''                                                `------.\n      :eXON/rIOT^jORMAS · gHANDY/gODS · rAHIEM/eSSENCE · cELIC/rEKTUM: \n      `------.                                                .------''\n             `------------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',80764,5,0,NULL,NULL,'woa_tc11','scan',1780048628);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mth_bb10','MTH-BB10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MTH-BB10.LHA','bibi_after_ul','XIM','______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.',NULL,'wHIRLWIND/mYTH','MTH','\_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  | /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____. /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |',replace(' ______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.      \012 \_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  |      \012  /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____. \012 /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    | \012/________\     \  |   /______    \___|    | \012·-/X--/_________\____/-dESIGN\____\nK|____|-\012      pRESENTS : bIBI aFTER uL V1.o         \012  dISCONNECT aUTOMATICALLY aFTER tHE fIRST  \012  fILE_ID.DIZ eXTRACT! fAST, rELIABLE aND   \012  cOOL! cODED bY wHIRLWIND/mYTH /X dESIGN!  \012--------------------------------------------\012','\012',char(10)),'bibi!.doc',replace('   .\012   |______________________          ._______.\012   ___________  ______.  /     .____|__     |______._________.\012   \_         \/      |_ ______|     _/  __________|__       |__\012    /         \/       /       |     \   \           /       . /________.\012   /___________\      /________.      \___          /________|          |\012             /_______/    \    |  .____\ /_________/nK       |__________|\012                           \______|                   /X-dESIGN!\012               pRESENTS:\012\012                             bIBI aFTER uPLOAD V1.o\012                             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\012\012Introduction:\012~~~~~~~~~~~~~\012\012Handy util, so u can disconnect after the first FILE_ID.DIZ \012extract! So you don''t need to wait any longer while the bbs program\012is testing the uploaded stuff! This program uses configs for any\012node, so no errors may occure! \012\012Installation:\012~~~~~~~~~~~~~\012\012Copy the contents of this archive to ur BBS: dir. Don''t forget to copy\012the BIBI!.CFG in S: & the AEDOOR.LIBRARY in LIBS: !\012You need to execute cHECK_bIBI in the FILECHECK.INFO. If you\012don''t know how to do that, please consult your manual. If you\012already have a door in the FILECHECK.INFO, you should get yourself\012a MULTIDOORSTART door, like 5d-MultiStart! You need to use MCI commands\012in your UPLOADMSG.TXT! For example:\012\012-- cut here --\012~ \012~SS_BBS:DREAMLAND/UPLOAD.AMYRULES \012~SP \012~CC_BIBIAFTER \012~SP \012-- cut here --\012\012If you don''t know how to use MCI commands then I advise you to consult\012your /X Manual!\012\012Config\012~~~~~~\012\012S:BIBI!.CFG:\012~~~~~~~~~~~~\012\012This is the path where u want to keep the datafile for every node!\012\012-- cut here --\012DOORS:BIBI!/BIBI!.CFG\012-- cut here --\012\012The program will create for every node its own datafile. (name of the config\012specified in S:BIBI!.CFG + nodenumber)\012\012You might get a CONFIG error the first time this util is being used\012on a node, but afterwards no error may occure!\012\012Greetings:\012~~~~~~~~~~\012\012Greetz go to:\012\012Sintax/OTL/WOT        - Thanx for ur help & the right units!\012Venom                 - Thanx for ur help!\012GMC!                  - Thanx!\012Crew One/Myth         - Thanx for the moral support :)\012DeltaForce            - Nice chatting to u & thanx for ur help!\012THC/Myth              - Thanx for being a cool leader! :)\012Apollo/DDS            - Gosh, another cool leader :)\012Yankee Rose           - 2 bad ur computer blew up! :(\012Frantik/TRSI          - Thx for betatesting!\012Slime/BP/Myth!        - Thx for betatesting!\012Keyboard Kid/Acs/Myth - This Kid can''t be from Canada! :)\012RaJ!/ACS/Myth         - Trading gives me an orgasm! :)\012\012And to all members of RLG/D&R/DDS/MTH and ofcoz the dudes I didn''t\012mention!\012\012Bugreport, gifts, presents:\012~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\012\012You can reach me at my board:\012 \012        dUTCH dREAMS      - +31(0)53319325\012\012Or:\012        mYSTICAL pLACES   - hOLLAND  (wHIRLWIND)\012        bOONDOCKS         - hOLLAND  (wHIRLWIND)\012        dEVIL''S pOINT     - gERMANY  (wHIRLWIND)\012        sPIRITS oF sOUL   - gERMANY  (wHIRLWIND)\012        tHE mADHOUSE      - sWEDEN   (wHIRLWIND)\012        bABYLON 5         - sPAIN    (wHIRLWIND)\012        lITHIUM           - USA      (wHIRLWIND)\012        dARK sUN          - oZZYLAND (wHIRLWIND)\012\012And at any MYTH/DDS/D&R/RLG board!\012\012\012 ______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.                                         \012 \_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  |                                         \012  /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____.   cALL oNE oF THE mYTH bOARDS      \012 /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |            wORLDWIDE               \012/________\     \  |   /______    \___|    |                                    \012·-----/_________\____/-------\____\nK|____|------ -- -- --- -- --  --  - - -   \012                                                                               \012   mYSTICAL pLACES     WHQ        +31-10-4779507    [3 nODEZ,21k6,rING]        \012                                  +31-10-4774218    [1 nODE, 28k8 oNLY]        \012                                                                               \012   dUTCH dREAMS        DHQ        +31-53-319325     [1 nODE, 14k4]             \012                                                                               \012   rED lIGHT dISTRICT  CHQ        +1-905-508-7356   [1 nODE, 28K8]             \012                                                                               \012   hOMeLESS            GHQ        +49-asK-uS!-nOW   [1 nODE, 14k4]             \012                                                                               \012   oFF-lIMITS          dIST-SITE  +49-aSK-uS!-nOW   [1 nODE, 19k2]             \012                                                                               \012------------------------------------------------ -- -- --- -- --  --  - - -\012','\012',char(10)),NULL,NULL,66468,8,0,NULL,NULL,'mth_bb12_bibi_after_ul','scan',1780048628);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mth_bb12','MTH-BB12.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MTH-BB12.LHA','5D-MultiStart','XIM','5D-MultiStart',NULL,'wHIRLWIND/mYTH','MTH','\_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  | /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____. /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |',replace(' ______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.      \012 \_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  |      \012  /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____. \012 /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    | \012/________\     \  |   /______    \___|    | \012·-/X--/_________\____/-dESIGN\____\nK|____|-\012      pRESENTS : bIBI aFTER uL V1.2         \012  dISCONNECT aFTER tHE fIRST fILE_ID.DIZ    \012 eXTRACT! nEW uPDATE! cOOL oPTIONS aDDED!   \012    cODED bY wHIRLWIND/mYTH /X dESIGN!      \012--------------------------------------------\012','\012',char(10)),'5D-MultiStart.Guide',replace('@database 5D-MultiStart Documentation\n@Author SvEN tHE CREAToR Of 5tH DyNASTY\n@Index Documentation\n\nCopyright © 1994 SvEN tHE CREAToR / 5tH DyNASTY\n\n@Remark $VER: 5D-MultiStart v0.01 by sTc/5D\n@Remark AmigaGuide database\n\n@node MAIN "5D-MultiStart Documentation © 1994 SvEN tHE CREAToR Of 5tH DyNASTY"\n                                                              :\n                                                       :      ¦             \n                   ________________  __________________¦      |\n            _______\_______       /  \             /   |      |______\n           |  __   _/     /______/____\  _     _  /    ¦      |  __  |\n           |  \/  _\________    \_\  / \/       \/     _      |  \/  |\n           |______\        /     / \/   |       |      /      |______|\n                   \___________ /       |_______|_____/       |Rpd!\n                              \/                     /________|\n                         :           :                                     :\n            ____   :     ¦     :     ¦      · 5 · T · H ·            :     ¦\n  __________\  /___¦    _|__/\ ¦     |_______ _______________________¦     |\n  \______   \\//   |    \____ \|     |   _   \\_____      /       /  |     |\n   /     \   \/    ¦     |   \ \     |   /    \/   /_____/    _  /   ¦     |\n _/       \   \_____     |    \ \_   |   _     \_____   \_     \/_____     |\n \       _/    /   /     |     \     |   /      /   /    /     |     /     |\n  \__________ /__________|     |\ ___|__/_____ /_______ /______|___________|\n            \/           |     ¦ \/          \/       \/\n                         ¦     :     · D · Y · N · A · S · T · Y ·\n                         :\n\n                        ##>>> P r E S E N T S <<<##\n\n                            5D-MultiStart v0.01\n\n                 Coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR of 5th Dynasty\n\n                           @{" Normal Documentation " Link Documentation}\n@endnode\n@node Documentation "5D-MultiStart Documentation"\n              _______________________________________________\n             |                                               |\n             | //                                            |\n             | /                                             |\n             |                                               |\n             |            @{" D e S C R I P T I O N " Link Description}           |\n             |                                               |\n             |           @{" I n S T A L L A T I O N " Link Installation}          |\n             |                                               |\n             |              @{" T o O L T Y P E S " Link Tooltypes}             |\n             |                                               |\n             |              @{" G r E E T I N G S " Link Greetings}             |\n             |                                               |\n             |                                             / |\n             |                                            // |\n             |_______________________________________________|\n\n@endnode\n@node Description "5D-MultiStart Description"\n5D-MultiStart has been coded by SvEN tHE CREAToR/5D!\n\nIt allows the sysop to insert more than one XIM-Door or script for\none command. For example for the FILECHECK in BBS:Commands/SysCmd/.\nI wanted to install a Double Upload Checker and the 5D-AutoFree but it\nwasn''t possible for me. So I coded 5D-MultiStart which allows you\nto start as much doors as you want for one command. You can also use\nit to start more doors for a normal command. You can protect any of\nthese doors with a password which you can enter in the icon in\nBBS:Commands/MultiCmd/. In that directory are ALL Icons for 5D-MultiStart.\nFor the normal Command (f.e.: BBS:Commands/SysCmd/FILECHECK) you should\nuse the icon in this archive in that directory. If you want to use\n5D-MultiStart for another command simply clone that icon and make a new\nicon in BBS:Commands/MultiCmd/ with the command name. Look in the\ntooltypes area to see what you can insert in the icon.\n@endnode\n@node Installation "5D-MultiStart Installation"\nCopy all files which are in the archive bbs directory\nto your bbs directory.\n\nContents of archive:\n===================\n\nBBS/\n    Commands/\n        BBSCmd/\n            TEST.info\n        MultiCmd/\n            FILECHECK.info\n            TEST.info\n        SYSCmd/\n            FILECHECK.info\n    Doors/\n        5D-MultiStart/\n            5D-MultiStart\n            5D-MultiStart.info\n            5D-MultiStart.Guide\n\n===================\n\n@endnode\n@node Greetings "5D-MultiStart Greetings"\nGreetings go to:\n\n           Celator ........... Thank you for helping me with /X!\n           ByteAndi ............ For helping me to learn coding!\n           Prophet .................... For being a nice friend!\n           Snow ...................... Sing mehr lieder, leader!\n           Airworx ................. Continue work as Co Leader!\n           Delta-X ................. When you will merry Murdoc?\n           Strider ........ We should spread our standard again!\n\nSorry to all people I forgot but as you know my brain isn''t so well! hehe\n\n@endnode\n@node Tooltypes "5D-MultiStart Tooltypes"\nYou can insert the following tooltypes in the icons in\nBBS:Commands/MultiCmd/\n\n===========\n\nDOORS=8                            - Number of Doors\nLOCATION.3=Doors:5D-Who/5D-Who     - Location of the Door\nSTACK.3=8192                       - Stack of the Door\nPRIORITY.4=3                       - Priority of the Door\nPASSWORD.2=BREULER                 - Password for the Door\n\n===========\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',37075,7,0,NULL,NULL,'sr_kcv10','scan',1780048628);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mth_bir1','MTH-BIR1.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MTH-BIR1.LHA','KN7AD0JU6V13GOZY2WB4','XIM','KN7AD0JU6V13GOZY2WB4',NULL,NULL,'MTH','\_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  | /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____. /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |',replace(' ______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.\012 \_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  |\012  /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____.\012 /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |\012/________\     \  |   /______    \___|    |\012·-----/_________\____/-------\____\nK|____|\012----- cREW^oNE''s bIRC-cHATTER --------------\012A fully IRC-alike chatter-door for /X. V1.00\012--------------------------------------------\012','\012',char(10)),'BIRC.README',replace('The files in this archive are double-packed because birc''s startup files\nlook exactly like bbs-advertisements, and some strippers would strip them.\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',24970,1,0,NULL,NULL,'mth_bir1','scan',1780048628);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mth_bu1','MTH-BU1.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MTH-BU1.LHA','Checker','XIM','Checker',NULL,'cREW^oNE!mYTH!','MTH','\_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  | /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____. /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |',replace(' ______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.\012 \_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  |\012  /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____.\012 /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |\012/________\     \  |   /______    \___|    |\012·dDT!-/_________\____/-------\____\nK|____|\012        /X dIVISION rELEASED tODAY:\012     bACK^uP! v1.00 bY cREW^oNE!mYTH!\012   cHECK fILES wHILE uPLOADING oN /X !\012  sAVES A lOT oF tIME wHEN uPLOADING !!\012\012\012\012','\012',char(10)),'Backup.guide',replace('@DATABASE BACKUP V1.0 Documentation © PLL Developments 1995\012@REM This is an AmigaGuide® - Document\012@REM Please use Multiview or any similar program to read this documentation\012@REM Otherwise ignore the @-Commands in this text.\012@NODE MAIN "BACKUP V1.0 © CREW ONE 1995"\012   .\012   |______________________          ._______.\012   ___________  ______.  /     .____|__     |______._________.\012   \_         \/      |_ ______|     _/  __________|__       |__\012    /         \/       /       |     \   \           /       . /________.\012   /___________\      /________.      \___          /________|          |\012             /_______/    \    |  .____\ /_________/nK       |__________|\012                           \______|\012                                  ·    /________________________________.\012                                                                        |\012\012                                 PRESENTS:\012@{b}\012                         Backup V1.0 - 24 Jul 1995\012                        Copyright (c) 1995 Crew One\012                    Documentation Copyright (c) 1995 PLL\012                            All rights reserved\012                           A /X\YTH Release <MTH>\012                                   @{ub}\012                            @{"   Introduction   " LINK INTRO}\012                            @{"   Installation   " LINK INSTALL}\012                            @{"      Notes       " LINK NOTES}\012                            @{" Revision History " LINK VERSION}\012                            @{" Acknowledgements " LINK GREETS}\012\012                            @{"     Releases     " LINK RELEASES}\012                            @{"   Myth boards    " LINK MYTH}\012                            @{" Mystical Places  " LINK MP}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE INTRO "Introduction..."\012\012The Backup package from the Myth Door Development team is a series of\012programs which makes it possible to check/test files (at the same time)\012while the user is uploading on your Bulletin Board System. Checking files\012while uploading will save the user a tremendous time and thus saves the user\012a large amount of money.\012\012The Backup package requires OS2.04 (V37) and AmiExpress V4.xx or higher.\012Recommended configuration is an 68030/25 processor or better.\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE INSTALL "Installation..."\012\012Backup is very complicated package. In fact, there are 3 doors and 2 CLI-\012programs. So please do not install this if you don''t have any knowledge of\012the Amiga. If you dont have sufficient knowledge of /X and doors DO NOT\012INSTALL THIS!\012\012To install Backup, just copy ALL files in the Backup/BBS drawer to your BBS:\012directory, that means that you need the logical assignment BBS:\012BBS: is an assignment to the root directory of AmiExpress. (configured in\012the ACP.info, for example, BBS_LOCATION=BBS:) Further you need the logical\012assignment DOORS: (DOORS: is an assignment to your BBS:Doors directory).\012\012That means that the files:\012\012DOORS:Back^Up/Executable/Checker        - INTERNAL CHECKER ROUTINES\012DOORS:Back^Up/Executable/Examine        - THE EXAMINE DOOR\012DOORS:Back^Up/Executable/Filecheck      - THE FILECHECK DOOR\012DOORS:Back^Up/Executable/Server         - THE INTERNAL SERVER\012DOORS:Back^Up/Executable/SetUp          - THE SETUP DOOR\012\012and:\012\012BBS:COMMANDS/SYSCMD/EXAMINE.info\012BBS:COMMANDS/SYSCMD/FILECHECK.info\012BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD/SETUP.info\012\012must be present.\012\012\012Install the file : ''Examine'' as the /X internal EXAMINE door.\012(BBS:COMMANDS/SYSCMD/EXAMINE.info)\012( *** THIS IS PREFERABLY THE EXAMINE DOOR, AND NOT THE EXAMINE1 DOOR!)\012\012Example:\012\012------------------ CUT HERE -----------------\012LOCATION=BBS:DOORS/BACK^UP/EXECUTABLE/Examine\012MULTINODE=YES\012ACCESS=20\012TYPE=XIM\012STACK=50000\012------------------ CUT HERE -----------------\012\012NOTE:\012\012If the icon Examine.info already exists rename\012BBS:COMMANDS/SYSCMD/EXAMINE<x>.info to BBS:COMMANDS/SYSCMD/EXAMINE<x+1>.info\012so that there is no more BBS:COMMANDS/SYSCMD/EXAMINE.info\012\012(EXAMINE.info  -> EXAMINE1.info,\012 EXAMINE1.info -> EXAMINE2.info,\012 etc..)\012\012\012Some FILE_ID doors do not run from another position then EXAMINE, ONLY\012if your file_id doors does not work, place bACK^uP''s Examine door at\012EXAMINE1.\012\012\012\012\012Install the file : ''Filecheck'' as the /X internal FILECHECK door.\012(BBS:COMMANDS/SYSCMD/FILECHECK.info)\012( *** THIS MUST BE THE FILECHECK DOOR, 5D-MULTISTART WON''T WORK!)\012\012Example:\012\012------------------ CUT HERE -----------------\012LOCATION=BBS:DOORS/BACK^UP/EXECUTABLE/Filecheck\012MULTINODE=YES\012ACCESS=10\012TYPE=XIM\012STACK=50000\012------------------ CUT HERE -----------------\012\012NOTE:\012\012If there is a file called ''BBS:COMMANDS/SYSCMD/FILECHECK.info'' get rid of\012it by using mYTH''s mOREdOORS multistarter and run it on an examine door.\012(YES, run a FILECHECK door with an EXAMINEx.info icon... only mYTH makes\012 it possible!)\012\012Install the file : ''Setup'' as the /X external ''Setup'' Door.\012(BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD/SETUP.info)\012\012Modify your startup-files so that the ''Setup'' door is runned once at every\012login.\012\012For example in Bull40.txt:\012\012----------- CUT HERE ------------\012~CC_SETUP                          - THE SETUP DOOR\012~4SR_BBS:screens/Logon             - LOGON SCREENS\012~SP                                - WAIT\012~SS_bbs:screens/groups.txt         - SHOW ANOTHER TEXT (GROUPLOGO)\012~SP                                - WAIT\012~SS_s:lastc.txt                    - SHOW ANOTHER TEXT (LASTCALLERS)\012~SP                                - WAIT\012~SS_BBS:screens/topuploader.txt    - SHOW ANOTHER TEXT (TOPUPLOADS)\012----------- CUT HERE ------------\012\012\012\012There is one tooltype. In DOORS:Back^uP/GENERAL.info you can set\012LOGFILE=<Name of Logfile>.\012\012Then Bakc^Up will make a log for you with actions. This is only reccomended\012when you encounter problems or possible bugs.\012\012\012If you have done all this then you have installed Backup correctly,\012congratulations! But before you continue read the NOTES section too, this\012section reveals some other vital information for the Backup package.\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE NOTES "Notes..."\012\012This door will NOT work for LOCAL uploads! Local uploads will be processed\012with the normal modules, on the normal way.\012\012The door ''SetUp'' must be run AT LEAST ONCE before the first upload is\012started. You can put it as a frontend, in a login script, whatever. If this\012door is NOT runned AT LEAST ONCE, all doors related Backup will be\012completely transparent and you won''t even notice it is there!\012\012If you want to DISABLE background checking do this:\012    - REMOVE the ''SetUp'' door.\012    - type ''ECHO *** >T:SHUTSERVER''.\012\012The door ''FileCheck'' MUST be the FILECHECK door. It can be run in a\012multistart door, as long as this door does NOT set the FILECHECK flags.\012\012The door ''Examine'' MUST be the FIRST examine door. DO NOT INSTALL THIS AS\012''EXAMINE1'' or ''EXAMINE2'' or whatever. It *MUST* be ''EXAMINE''.\012\012With some external file_id doors, you need to set the EXAMINE door as\012EXAMINE1.\012\012For all you SnoopDossers out there:\012\012The Setup door ''launches'' a background server that will wake up every 10/50\012second. Once in a few seconds it tries to lock the file T:SHUTSERVER. If the\012server FINDS this file, (It does not matter what is in it) the server goes\012down, and all checkers are unloaded. (Until, of-course, the server is\012activated again.)\012\012There are a LOT of FCHECKers who do NOT work together with bACK^uP!.\012bAKC^uP was succesfully tested on: 68020 / 68030 / 68040 with all possible\012configurations. (Cyberstorm, G-Force, standard, A1200 / A2000 / A3000 / A4000)\012So if it crashes, the most likely cause is one of your fcheck modules:\012\012FCheckers known to crash:\012    - LHA FileCheck         Muad''Dib/DLT\012    - TXT FastAdd\012    - TXT AirAdder          Airco (This door will not crash, but it will\012                                   not be able to add names / times to txt)\012\012FCheckers known to work:\012    - DMS MAPUS\012    - DMS PRODMS\012    - LHA SISSY             ( -NOT- Free ware ! )\012\012bACK^uP is succesfully installed on a lot of dutch boards and a bunch of\012international boards. Contact the sysop of Mystical Places for fcheck\012modules that do work. Or experiment a little with different fcheckers\012yourself.\012\012\012SISSY CONFIGURATION:\012\012You need to set up ALL FCHECK modules from sissy. And you need to set\012''MODE=BACKUP'' to ''BBS:SISSY/GENERAL.info'' (SISSY 1.40+)\012\012If you think files still have to be checked off-line, set MODE=OFFLINE. (Or\012MODE=<#Kb>)\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE VERSION "Revision History..."\012\012 V1.0 - 24 Jul 1995\012      - First public release\012\012If you have any suggestions, bug reports or questions, please contact Crew\012One at one of the electronic mail addresses.\012\012When sending in bug reports, please state exactly under what circumstances\012the bug occurred, what equipment was used and what happened. If possible\012also try to give me enough information to reproduce the bug. It is very\012difficult to find bugs when you don''t know exactly what happened. Please\012don''t just send messages like "Backup doesn''t work", that really doesn''t\012help me. If possible, submit the offending ''error'' to me so I can test it\012myself, or give me a pointer where I can find the error.\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE GREETS "Acknowledgements..."\012\012\012                gREETINGS tO tHEZE dUDEZ: (iN aLPHABETICAL oRDER!)\012\012        Badsector - EMPIRE - Fury - MARIO - MEGA^FORTRESS - Muad''Dib\012     One - Phantom - Price - SAL-1 - sLIME - Snake & Delboy - wHIRLwIND\012\012\012                           All mYTH betatesters !\012                            All mYTH!  members !\012                            All rOYAL! members !\012\012- Sal-1     : Thanx for the bugs !!\012\012- Muad''Dib  : Thanks for helping me with even more bugs !! And\012              good luck with your TXT adder !\012\012\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE RELEASES "Releases..."\012\012MTH-IR12.LHA                      ______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.\012                                  \_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  |\012                                   /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____.\012                                  /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |\012                                 /________\     \  |   /______    \___|    |\012                                 ·-----/_________\____/-------\____\nK|____|\012                                        /X dIVISION rELEASED tODAY:\012                                       bIRC v1.2 uPDATE (27-Jun-95!)\012                       