- cut here ---\nS:ADDME.BOARD\nS:TRILALAL.BOARD\n--- cut here ---\n\nYou can put as much files as you want.\n\nGreetings:\n~~~~~~~~~~\n\nGreetz go to:\n\ncREW oNE/mTH - THC Chat is cool!\nTHC/Myth     - Use this thing! :)\nApollo/DDS   - How long do we know eachother now? :)\nYankee Rose  - And I still haven''t forgot you :)\n\nAnd to all the other dudes I know and I forgot! :)\n\n\nBugreport, gifts, presents:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nYou can reach me at my board:\n \n        dUTCH dREAMS      - +31(0)53319325\n\nOr:\n        mYSTICAL pLACES   - hOLLAND (wHIRLWIND)\n        bOONDOCKS         - hOLLAND (wHIRLWIND)\n        rUNNER''S pOINT    - gERMANY ([rING+rING^wHIRLWIND])\n        eUROPE''S cHAOS    - gERMANY ([rING+rING^wHIRLWIND])\n        dEVIL''S pOINT     - gERMANY ([rING+rING^wHIRLWIND])\n        tHE mADHOUSE      - sWEDEN  (wHIRLWIND)\n        bIO hAZARD        - cANADA  ([rING+rING^wHIRLWIND])\n        aLTERNATE rEALITY - cANADA  ([rING+rING^wHIRLWIND])\n        bABYLON 5         - sPAIN   ([rING+rING^wHIRLWIND])\n\n\n\n                .____.              _____.\n_____ ______.___|    |____  ________\_   | ____________________ __ _  _   _\n      \     |   |    |   /__\__      /   |____.\n________    |   |    |   _____/  ___/_   _    |   dUTCH dREAMS!\n\      /    |   |    |   |    |  \    |  |    |                \n_\_____     |____    |____    |___    |__|    | _______________ __ _  _   _\n      `-----''   `----''   `----''  `----''  `----''\n_   _  _ __ _____ ______.________ ________________.____ ______________ ____\n                  \     |   ____/   ______/___    |    Y       ______/\n            ________    |   \        ___/_   /    |         |____    |\n            \      /    |   |    |   \    |       |    Y    |   /    |\n_   _  _ __ _\_____     |___|    |____    |___    |____|    |____    | ____\n                  `-----''   `----''   `----''  `----''    `----''nK `----''\n  \n[DD sTYLE wHQ] [mYTH dHQ] [rELIGION! dHQ] [nETWORK dST] [dIAMONDS&rUST eHQ]\n[oFFICIAL DD sTYLe /X-bETATEST sITE!] [7oo mB oNLINE!] [68o3o/68882^25 mHZ]\n       [aMIGA & sNES ONLY] [o-1 dAYZ wAREZ!] [nEWUSERPW: pLEASE ]\n                  \n       [dA sYSOP: wHIRLWIND/mYTH/DD sTYLE/rELIGION/dIAMONDS&rUST]\n  [cOS!: rING+rING!/rBS/rLG/d&R][tIB/TFA!][dENNIS tHE mENACE/DD sTYLE!]\n  [jOHN sINCLAIR/rLG!][sADUS/oVl!][mEGA fORTRESS/DD sTYLE (/X dESIGN!)]\n                    [cREW-oNE/mYTH!][oRLINGO/DD sTYLE!]\n                 \n                [nODE1: +31-53319325] [nODE2: +31-pRIVATE!]\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',40431,7,0,NULL,NULL,'mth_fl11','scan',1780048628);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mth_flh3','MTH-FLH3.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MTH-FLH3.LHA','add7','XIM','FUCKLHA3',NULL,'cREW','MTH','\_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  | /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____. /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |',replace(' ______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.\012 \_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  |\012  /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____.\012 /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |\012/________\     \  |   /______    \___|    |\012·-----/_________\____/-------\____\nK|____|\012·                                         ·\012»» pRESENTS: fUCKLHA V3.0 ** bY cREW oNE **\012  cAN sTRIPP aLL FILE, oN-LINE & oFF-LINE\012 vERSION iNCLUDED. wITH nEW aNALYTICAL wAY\012tO sTRIP aDDS. 90-100% aDD-fREE lHA-fILES!!\012·                                         ·\012------------·mYTH /X dESIGN pRODUCTION''95·-\012','\012',char(10)),'FUCKLHA3.GUIDE',replace('@database fucklha3.guide\n\n@node Main "INDEX"\n           /\           _______________\n          /  \  /\_____| \____   ____/¬|____\n         /.   \/  \   ¬|    ¬\   |/  __|   ¬\          CODED BY: CREW ONE\n        //   \__/  \____    ./  :|   \__    .\\n _ __ _/      |     \  |   //   ||     |     \\      A Myth /X )-Sign product\n\\\\_\\_______|      \_____/|    |_____|______/zACk\n-=-=-=-=-=-=-=|_______/-=-=-·    |=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=\n                            :\n    __                         FUCKLHA V3.00                          __\n.--/\_\----÷---÷-------÷-  »»»· tHE mANUAL  ·«««  --÷-----÷---÷------/\_\--.\n|:·\/_/. .                                                        .. \/_/·:|\n| .  .                                                               .  .  |\n:                         @{"What is FUCKLHA!V3.00. " link What }                          :\n:                     @{"Installing FUCKLHA!V3.00. " link Installing }                           :\n.                   @{"Configuring FUCKLHA3.INI. " link Configuring1 }                             .\n                @{"Configuring FUCKLHA3.ADDSCRIPT. " link Configuring2 }\n                   @{"The OFFLINE Header." link Offline }\n.                    @{"The checksums method." link Check }                                 .\n                 @{"The wildcards method." link Wildcards }\n.                      @{"The analysis method." link Analysis }                                .\n:                    @{"Remember these things!" link Remember}                                .\n|.:/\                                                                    .:|\n`-/  \---------÷----÷------÷-----÷-÷------÷-[ mYTH /X dESIGN pRODUCTION! ]-''\n /.___\\n\n @{"                           How to reach Crew One                          " link Reach }\n\n\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Installing "Installing FUCKLHA!V3.00. "\n\nFor correct installation i suggest you copy all these files listed below\nin the ''BBS:FUCKLHA3/'' directory. Files marked with a (*) can be moved\nto another directory, IF you change the ''FUCKLHA3.INI'' file. (With the GUI.)\n\nFUCKLHA3                             -   Main program & stripper.\nFUCKLHA3.ADDSCRIPT         (*)       -   Script file for adding files.\nFUCKLHA3.ANALYSIS          (*)       -   Words to search for.\nFUCKLHA3.CHKSUMS           (*)       -   Checksums of files to be stripped\nFUCKLHA3.COMPILE-AS                  -   ''Compile AddScript''\nFUCKLHA3.DEFADDS           (*)       -   Default add file.\nFUCKLHA3.DOX                         -   Quick Docs.\nFUCKLHA3.GUI                         -   The Graphic User Interface.\nFUCKLHA3.GUI.info                    -   Icon.\nFUCKLHA3.GUIDE                       -   This guide file.\nFUCKLHA3.INI                         -   Configuration file.\nFUCKLHA3.MAKE-AF                     -   Make AddFile.\nFUCKLHA3.OFFLINE                     -   Offline header program.\nFUCKLHA3.OFFLINE.INI                 -   Offline configuration file.\nFUCKLHA3.OFFLINEDOX                  -   Quick docs for offline program.\nFUCKLHA3.WILDCARDS         (*)       -   Standard datafile with wildcards.\n\nTo use the checksums-checking option, you should specify an ''ADDS'' directory\nin the ''FUCKLHA3.INI'' file. (Default: BBS:FUCKLHA3/ADDS/)\nRemember that you must make this directory yourself.\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Configuring1 "Configuring FUCKLHA3.INI."\n\nIt is fairly easy to configure the datafiles. For most options you can\nuse the G.U.I.  But you can also change the .INI file(s) by hand.\nHere is the default FUCKLHA3.INI file.\n\n\n                         Configuring FUCKLHA3.INI\n\n--\n1 BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.WILDCARDS     -   The name of the wildcards file.\n2 BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.ADDSCRIPT     -   The name of the addscript.\n3 BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.DEFADDS       -   The name of the default addfile.\n4 BBS:FUCKLHA3/ADDS                   -   The name of the adds DIRECTORY\n5 BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.CHKSUMS       -   The name of the checksumsfile.\n6 BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.HMDSUMS       -   Hand-made checksums file. (Option).\n7 BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.ANALYSIS      -   The name of the words-analysis file.\n--\n\n** IF THE FILES 5&7 ARE NOT PRESENT, FUCKLHA WIL SKIP THE CHECK **\n** THE WILDCARDS-FILE -MUST- BE PRESENT !!! **\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Configuring2 "Configuring FUCKLHA3.ADDSCRIPT."\n\n                      Configuring FUCKLHA3.ADDSCRIPT\n\nFirst, let me show an example of an ADDSCRIPT file.\n\n---\nwork:textfiles/mth-211294\nTESTJE.ADD\nwork:textfiles/mythboards\n?M?Y?T?H?R?O?O?L?Z?\n---\n\nThe ODD lines (Line 1,3,5,7,9,etc..) are complete file/pathnames of files\n(bbs-advertisements) you wish to add to the archive that is stripped.\n(In the example the files ''mth-211294'' and ''mythboards'' will be added to\nthe archive.)\n\nThe EVEN lines are the filenames as they will appear in the archive.\nNo directories are allowed. An ''?'' will be replaced by a random value.\nIn the example ''mth-211294'' will be renamed as ''TESTJE.ADD'' and ''mythboards''\nwill be renamed as ''?M?Y?T?H?R?O?O?L?Z?''. (Where ''?'' is random.)\n\nYou can specify as many files as you wish, as long as you specify the\noriginal the original AND the ''archive'' name. Be sure the last entry is\nalso terminated by a return.\n\n** THESE FILES ARE PRE-COMPILED BY FUCKLHA3.COMPILE-AS. EVERY TIME YOU\nWANT CHANGES TO TAKE PLACE, YOU MUST RUN FUCKLHA3.COMPILE-AS FIRST.\n(THAT GOES ALSO FOR NEW-RANDOM GENERATED NAMES) **\n\nI SUGGEST YOU PLACE ''FUCKLHA3.COMPILE-AS'' IN YOU LOGOFF-SCRIPTS, SO EVERY\nTIME YOU HAVE NEW RANDOM GENERATED NAMES.\n@endnode\n\n@node Speed "About the Speed."\n\nFUCKLHA V3.00 is not the fastest stripper around. But i guess it is the\nbest released until now. I know some groups have similar strippers, but\ndo not release them, because they are able to strip everything..\n(Like FUCKLHA!)\n\nIf you delete the ''.ANALYSIS'' file FUCKLHA is (i guess) the fastest stripper\naround... the real slow thing in FUCKLHA is the words-check, that means that\nthe -possible- add is extracted and the contents of the file is examined for\nwords the sysop can specify. in 99% if the hits the stripped file is actually\nan add, in 90% of the non-hits the file is not an add. The 10% left are\nIFF-Pictures, executables, etc.. You can strip these by placing them in the\nADDS directory. (BBS:FUCKLHA3/ADDS/) and run ''FUCKLHA3.GENERATE-AF'')\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Check "The checksums method."\n\nThe first check that FUCKLHA does is the checksum check. This is first\nbecause it is the FASTEST check-method around.\nFUCKLHA3 compares the checksum & filelength of the file in the archive with\nthose of the adds in your ADDS dir.\nThese checksums are gathered in a file, ''FUCKLHA3.CHKSUMS'' by default.\nThis file must be generated by FUCKLHA3.MAKE-AF or with the gui.\nIf the checksums match, the file is nuked. Don''t worry about the safety of\nthis method, the chance that checksum & filelength match is approx 1 on\n1 * 10^20 (= a 1 with 20 zeroes afer it..)\nThis method will strip all files that are in your ADDS dir, even when they\nhave a different name. There is only one disadvantage: some adders put the\ntime/uploader/date in the advertisement. (If a bbs has 200 users, there are\n86400 different times and approx 31*12*100=37200 dates the addfile for -ONE- \nadd could grow to 4.7 TERABYTE. :-)\nSo -PLEASE- don''t put any adds with uploader names / date / time in the adds\ndir.. it does not matter very much, but it won''t help you very much because\nthere is a only a chance of 1/(5 * 10^9) that you encounter the same add \nagain.\n\nEvery time you add advertisements or delete them in the ADDS dir, you must\nrun FUCKLHA3.MAKE-AF to let the changes have their effect.\n(In fact, FUCKLHA3.MAKE-AF will generate a file called FUCKLHA3.CHCKSUMS,\nwhich is used by the main program.)\n\n** IF YOU WANT SPEED, COPY AS MANY ADDS AS YOU CAN TO THE ADDS DIR !! **\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Wildcards "The wildcards method."\n\nThis method is the ''classic'' method of stripping files. It compares the\nwildcards in the FUCKLHA3.WILDCARDS with the filename, if the names match,\nthe file is stripped.\nDo not bother putting quotes (") in the file, exept if you want to strip\nfilenames in which these qoutes occur. (e.g. ''"you"cant"strip"me'' )\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Analysis "The analysis method."\n\n** READ THIS CAREFULLY **\n\nThis is a completely new method. If the file can''t be nuked by the two\nformer methods, FUCKLHA will extract the file and will check the file\nfor certain words. If it finds these words, the file will be nuked.\n(The file isn''t nuked if the file is too large for an add and some\nother conditions are not met.)\n\nBefore the file is stripped FUCKLHA must have found 3 DIFFERENT words.\n(If it finds ''BBS'' 10x it will not be stripped, but if it finds ''BBS'' and\n''NODE'' and ''WHQ'' it will be nuked.)\n\nYou can (must) specify these words yourself in the FUCKLHA3.ANALYSIS file.\nIn this file you can put words like ''elite'' ''call now'' ''myth boards'' ''node''\n''14400'' etc..etc.. but BE VERY CAREFUL when putting words that are parts\nof other words in this file, because then non-adds will be stripped also.\nFor example if you put the word ''call'' in this file, textfiles with words\nlike ''logically'',''technically'' will be stripped also. (And that was not \nthe idea, was it ?)\nSafe words are bbs-names, phone numbers, sysop names, etc..etc..\n\nIf you find this method too dangerous, you can delete the FUCKLHA3.ANALYSIS\nfile. The check will be skipped then.\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Offline "The Offline-Header"\n\nIf you think the stripper is too slow, you can also put the stripper off-\nline. The files then will be stripped after the user loggs-off.\nHere is how to do it:\n\nIn stead of specifying ''BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3'' as the checker, you put\n''BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE'' in your <checker>.Info file.\nThen put ''BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE'' in your logoff-script. Be sure /X\ngives the nodenumber as an argument in your logoff-script.\n(Be sure ''BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE 0'' is executed for node 0,\n''BBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE 1'' for node 1, etc..etc..)\nIf you have a single node, you can also put a ''1'' yourself in the logoff-\nscript:\n\n(Like this:)\n---- LOGOFF.SCRIPT\n... Oter logoff-stuff\nBBS:FUCKLHA3/FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE 1\n... etc..etc..\n----\n\nA major advantage of the offline version is that it also CHECKS the file.\nAnd if it is correct, it will be stripped offline, so the user will not have\nto wait very long. FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE has an internal checker, but if you want\nto use an external checker, you can put the name of the checker in the\n''OPTIONS'' tooltype for the info-file for the lha-stripper.\n\nThe last thing you must do to get the offline version to work is configuring\nthe FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE.INI file.\nThe first line of this file is the path where your uploads go when they are\nuploaded, but instead of a node-number you put a %d (LOWER-CASE -d-).\n(Default is: BBS:Node%d/Playpen/)\nThe next lines contail -ALL- the paths where the uploads are moved, when they\nare found error-free.\n\nHere is an example of a possible .INI file:\n---\nBBS:Node%d/Playpen/\nBBS:Private/Upload/\nBBS:Amiga/Upload/\nBBS:Snes/Upload/\nBBS:Coders/Upload/\n---\n\nBe sure that also the last entry is terminated with a return.\n\nIf all is correct, the files are now stripped off-line.\n\n@endnode\n\n@node What "What is FUCKLHA!V3.00"\n\nFuckLha v3.00 is an stripper for lha(-related) files. It can strip most of\nthe bbs-adds. Unfortunately the main program does not check the file, it\njust checks the structure. But the offline-header also checks the file, so\nthat corrupt files will be deleted.\nAnother advantage of the offline-header is that the user does not have to\nwait so long before the stripping is finished.\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Reach "How to reach Crew One ?"\n\nYou can reach the coder of this stripper:\n\nBy leaving a message on a dutch myth board.\nFor example:\n\nMystical Places: (Myth WHQ) +31-10-4779507  3* 21k6 RingDown\n                            +31-10-4774218  1* 28k8\n\nDutch Dreams:    (Myth DHQ) +31-53-319325   1* 14k4\n\nBy e-mail: [email removed]\n\nCrew One greets:\nCFI/Myth           - For the help.\nWhirlwind/Myth     - For the testing.\nOne/GNT            - For the testing.\nTHC/Myth           - For the testing.\n\n@endnode\n\n@node Remember "Remember these things!"\n\nHere are some things you''d have to remember:\n\nFor correct functioning of FUCKLHA (Online):\n- Read the ''configuring'' chapter.\n- Be sure the ''FUCKLHA3.INI'' file is in: BBS:FUCKLHA3/.\n- Be sure there is a FUCKLHA3.WILDCARDS file.\n\nFor correct functioning of FUCKLHA (Offline):\n- Be sure to specify ''FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE'' as the checker.\n- Be sure the first line of the FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE.INI file is correct.\n- Be sure the FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE in the LOGOFFSCRIPT is executed with the\n  nodenumber with the recent uploads as an argument.\n- Be sure ALL your possible download directories are in the\n  FUCKLHA3.OFFLINE.INI file.\n\nFor safe stripping:\n- Be sure to specify only those words that can occur in an possible bbs-add\n  in the FUCKLHA3.ANALYSIS file, AND NO OTHER WORDS. If you fill in the\n  wrong words you will strip more then neccesary.\n\nFor fast stripping:\n- Be sure to add as many adverts to the BBS:FUCKLHA3/ADDS/ directory, and\n  do not forget to run ''FUCKLHA3.MAKE-AF'' or the GUI to update the\n  FUCKLHA3.CHKSUMS file. (So that the changes have their effect.)\n  * ADDS WITH NAMES/TIME/DATE/ETC.. DO NOT HAVE EFFECT IN THIS DIRECTORY **\n\nFor random adds:\n- Run FUCKLHA3.GENERATE-AF in a scriptfile. (Once a hour/day/ logoff-script.)\n  So that a new random name is generated. (No arguments needed.)\n- Specify question marks in your FUCKLHA3.ADDSCRIPT file.\n\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',90844,24,0,NULL,NULL,'mth_flh3','scan',1780048628);
