INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('mth_rw12','MTH-RW12.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/MTH-RW12.LHA','rtw','XIM','rtw',NULL,NULL,'MTH','\_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  | /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____. /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |',replace(' ______  ______   .___ ____.  _______.\012 \_    \/    _/___|   \    |__\____  |\012  /    \_/   \    |    \   _______/  |____.\012 /      \     \___.    /   \    \    .    |\012/________\     \  |   /______    \___|    |\012·-----/_________\____/-------\____\nK|____|\012       /X dIVISION rELEASED tODAY:\012      rEAL tIME wHO V2.1 (27-Jun-95)\012            cODED bY: cREW^oNE\012·------------------------------------------·\012','\012',char(10)),'RTW.guide',replace('@DATABASE REAL TIME WHO V2.1 Documentation © PLL Developments 1995\012@REM This is an AmigaGuide® - Document\012@REM Please use Multiview or any similar program to read this documentation\012@REM Otherwise ignore the @-Commands in this text.\012@NODE MAIN "REAL TIME WHO v2.0 © CREW ONE 1995"\012   .\012   |______________________          ._______.\012   ___________  ______.  /     .____|__     |______._________.\012   \_         \/      |_ ______|     _/  __________|__       |__\012    /         \/       /       |     \   \           /       . /________.\012   /___________\      /________.      \___          /________|          |\012             /_______/    \    |  .____\ /_________/nK       |__________|\012                           \______|     /________________________________.\012                                  ·                                      |\012\012                                 PRESENTS:\012@{b}\012                     Real Time Who V2.1 - 27 Jun 1995\012                        Copyright (c) 1995 Crew One\012                   Documentation Copyright (c) 1995 PLL\012                            All rights reserved\012                          A Myth Production <MTH>\012                                  @{ub}\012                            @{"   Introduction   " LINK INTRO}\012                            @{"   Installation   " LINK INSTALL}\012                            @{"      Usage       " LINK USAGE}\012                            @{" Revision History " LINK VERSION}\012                            @{" Acknowledgements " LINK GREETS}\012\012                            @{"     Releases     " LINK RELEASES}\012                            @{"   Myth boards    " LINK MYTH}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE INTRO "Introduction..."\012\012RTW (Real Time Who) from the Myth /X )-Sign Development team is a small,\012fast and no-nonsense replacement door for the built-in ''WHO'' command in\012AmiExpress. With this door it is possible to spy on all the other nodes in\012real time, so there is no need to type WHO every second to see the actions\012of the other users who are logged on your bulletin board system.\012RTW requires OS2.04 (V37) and AmiExpress V3.xx or higher.\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE INSTALL "Installation..."\012\012To install RTW, just copy ALL files in the RTW/BBS drawer to your BBS:\012directory, that means that you need the logical assignment BBS:\012BBS: is an assignment to the root directory of AmiExpress. (configured in\012the ACP.info, for example, BBS_LOCATION=BBS:) Further you need the logical\012assignment DOORS: (DOORS: is an assignment to your BBS:Doors directory).\012\012\012TOOLTYPES IN BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/WHO.info\012-----------------------------------------\012\012============== CUT HERE =============\012LOCATION=BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/RTW     - Specifies the location of the door\012MULTINODE=YES                        - tells /X if the module may be\012                                       simultaneously accessed from other\012                                       nodes.\012ACCESS=10                            - tells /X the access level required\012                                       to run this door.\012TYPE=XIM                             - RTW is a XIM door.\012STACK=4096                           - Specifies the stack needed to\012                                       launch the door.\012============== CUT HERE =============\012\012If you have done all this then you have installed Real Time Who correctly,\012congratulations!\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE USAGE "Usage..."\012\012Usage is simple, by typing ''WHO'' you can actually launch the door. The\012following text (for example) is displayed on screen:\012\012  Nd   Name                Location           Action            Misc Info\012.----+-------------------+------------------+-----------------+--------------.\012| 00 | Your Node         |                  | uSING rTW v2.01 |              |\012| 01 | cREW^oNE          | -*- M Y T H -*-  | uPLOADING       | MTH-RTW2.LHA |\012| 02 | eUROSOFT          | -*- M Y T H -*-  | iRC-CHAT-bOX    |              |\012| 03 | pLL               | -*- M Y T H -*-  | iRC-cHAT-bOX    |              |\012| 04 | dIABLO            | -*- M Y T H -*-  | iRC-cHAT-bOXL   |              |\012| 05 | dELITE            | -*- M Y T H -*-  | dOWNLOADING     | MTH-RTW2.LHA |\012| 06 | .oO NOBODY Oo.    | .oO NOWHERE Oo.  | aWAITING cALL   |              |\012|____|___________________|__________________|_________________|______________|\012 |___________ _____ ____ ___ ___ __ _            rTW v2.01 bY cREW^oNE!mYTH  |\012                                      - -- --- ---- -------------------------''\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE VERSION "Revision History..."\012\012 V1.0 - 09 Jun 1995\012      - First public release\012 V2.0 - 24 Jun 1995\012      - Now using multicom semaphores\012 V2.1 - 27 Jun 1995\012      - Updated the last bugs & internal changes\012 \012If you have any suggestions, bug reports or questions, please contact Crew\012One at one of the electronic mail addresses.\012\012When sending in bug reports, please state exactly under what circumstances\012the bug occurred, what equipment was used and what happened. If possible\012also try to give me enough information to reproduce the bug. It is very\012difficult to find bugs when you don''t know exactly what happened. Please\012don''t just send messages like "RTW doesn''t work", that really doesn''t help\012me. If possible, submit the offending ''error'' to me so I can test it myself,\012or give me a pointer where I can find the error.\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE GREETS "Acknowledgements..."\012\012                gREETINGS tO tHEZE dUDEZ: (iN rANDOM oRDER!)\012\012     nIKE, iNCOGNITO, eMPiRE, bADSECTOR, tELEKINETIC, aIRCO, vECTOR, \012    pINHEAD, bABYFACE, tDB, hOFFI, rAJ!, mUAD''dIB, vANGOLEN, mAD mAX, \012                sCOPE, tORCH, jAKE, sIGH, mSW, nSC, hAWK, \012                 \012\012         gREETINGS tO tHESE /X dOOR dUDEZ: (kEEP uP tHE gOOD wORK)\012\012          TRSi /X Innovation, MST /X Dezign, yODEL, oTT /X dESIGN,\012           WOA - /X - iNSPiRATiON, cALYPSO, /X Development Team.\012\012    @{"BACK TO MAIN" link "Main" 0}\012@ENDNODE\012\012@NODE RELEASES "Releases..."\012\012MTH-VIEW.LHA                               _ _______ _______     .......\012                                   ______  \\\      |   ___/_____:____ :\012                                  /      \____\____   __\____________/_:____\012                                 /________\     \/_____\  _ /    \___       \\012                                        /________\nK     ///______\./       /\012                                  (--------------------------------/_______/\012                                           mYTH! /X )-SIGN pRESENTS:\012                                    VIEW V1.0 THE ULTIMATE VIEW DOOR BY PLL\012                                    WILL DISPLAY THE CONTENTS OF *ANY* FILE\012                                       ONLY LIMITED TO YOUR IMAGINATION\012                      