 wish to DELETE him\n\n   ZIPPY will search for a user...\n\n   You can configure If the Sysop should be shown or not..\n\n   That should be enough for now.. I have headache.. ouhh.. fuck\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "History"\n\n   0.1ß  lame\n   0.2ß  included config file\n   0.3   included zippy and Lamer-delete.. RELEASE\n\n@endnode\n@node "Install"\n\n   Make sure the DOORS:BelchLIST/BelchLIST.cfg looks a bit like this..\n\n   --------------------- cut ------------------\n   Y\n   Y\n   6\n   14\n   bbs:user.data\n   --------------------- cut ------------------\n\n   1st line - Show the Sysop? Y or N\n   2nd line - Colorize the Lameness? Y or N\n   3rd line - Ratio for the Leech (0 == If you like leechers)\n   4th line - LAST_TIME_ON limit in days\n\n               With this config file for example all users which didnt\n               call in the last 14 days BelchLIST will show the days\n               they didnt call in colour and ask if you want to DELETE\n               that lamer..\n\n\n   5th line - Location of yer user.data\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "4Ndz Console Only"\n\n             The fastest Independent Console Only Board in Europe\n\n                                          \n                               __             __\n                    /\________/ /    .::.:.   \ \________/\\n                    \  .·.      \  .:; `;;:.  /      .·.  /\n                 ___/.o:; _(\    \ :·    `.:./    /)_ ;:o.\___\n                 \_ .:::·(__ \    `::.  .;:;''    / __)·:::. _/\n                   \ ::;    \ \___.:;.   .;:.___/ /    ::: /\n                    \ :::.   \____;:·      ;`____/   .::: /\n                     \ ;:. ·      / o     o \      · .:; /\n                     / ______._.  \___/ \___/  ._,______ \\n                     \/     .     .:\     /:.     .     \/\n                           / ·     '':\   /''`     · \\n                          /.:. .     / · \     . .:.\\n                          \`:;.     / \ / \     .;:''/\n                           \ O:;:; /   Y   \ ;:;:O /\n                           / _·___,\   |   /.___·_ \\n                           \/ Y     `--^--''     Y \/\n                              `                 ''\n                   __ _/\/\__  __  ____/\____/\______/\____/\\n                  /  \  /    \/  \/  ___/  ___/   _   _/ ___/\n                 /      \  |  \   \___  \  _)_|   \   \  _)_\n                 \__\___/_____/___/_____/_____)___/___/_____)nb\n\n                           4 Nodes and Console Only\n\n               USRobotics 16.8 Dual Standart [28.8 coming soon]\n\n                         USRobotics 14.4 Dual Standart\n\n                               2x Euro ISDN 64.0\n\n@next "main"\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',19566,5,0,NULL,NULL,'nb_ist03','scan',1780048634);
