les containing the upload dirs heh... icons are lame... *\n*                                                                          *\n****************************************************************************\n\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "History"\n\n   0.1ß  lame\n   0.2ß  \n   0.3ß  \n   0.4ß  \n   0.5ß  \n   0.6ß  \n   0.7ß  \n   0.8   translated from Arexx to C\n   0.9   Wildcards added\n   1.0   Some small changes\n\n@endnode\n@node "Install"\n\n   Make sure all paths in the DOORS:BelchVIEW/BelchVIEW.cfg file are right\n\n   --------------------- cut ------------------\n   shr=c:shrink\n   arj=c:arj\n   dms=c:dmscli\n   zom=c:zoomchk\n   wrp=c:warpck\n   lha=lha\n   zip=c:unzip\n   zoo=c:zoo\n   arc=c:arc\n   acc=255\n   --------------------- cut ------------------\n\n   [acc=] is the account level minimum to view files which are\n          not in the upload dir\n\n   Install it like a XIM door as V and VS in your BBS.CMD\n@endnode\n\n@node "4Ndz Console Only"\n\n             The fastest Independent Console Only Board in Europe\n\n                                          \n                               __             __\n                    /\________/ /    .::.:.   \ \________/\\n                    \  .·.      \  .:; `;;:.  /      .·.  /\n                 ___/.o:; _(\    \ :·    `.:./    /)_ ;:o.\___\n                 \_ .:::·(__ \    `::.  .;:;''    / __)·:::. _/\n                   \ ::;    \ \___.:;.   .;:.___/ /    ::: /\n                    \ :::.   \____;:·      ;`____/   .::: /\n                     \ ;:. ·      / o     o \      · .:; /\n                     / ______._.  \___/ \___/  ._,______ \\n                     \/     .     .:\     /:.     .     \/\n                           / ·     '':\   /''`     · \\n                          /.:. .     / · \     . .:.\\n                          \`:;.     / \ / \     .;:''/\n                           \ O:;:; /   Y   \ ;:;:O /\n                           / _·___,\   |   /.___·_ \\n                           \/ Y     `--^--''     Y \/\n                              `                 ''\n                   __ _/\/\__  __  ____/\____/\______/\____/\\n                  /  \  /    \/  \/  ___/  ___/   _   _/ ___/\n                 /      \  |  \   \___  \  _)_|   \   \  _)_\n                 \__\___/_____/___/_____/_____)___/___/_____)nb\n\n                           4 Nodes and Console Only\n\n               USRobotics 16.8 Dual Standart [28.8 coming soon]\n\n                         USRobotics 14.4 Dual Standart\n\n                               2x Euro ISDN 64.0\n\n@next "main"\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',183211,6,0,NULL,NULL,'nb_view1','scan',1780048634);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('nbulvw','NBULVW.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/NBULVW.LHA',NULL,'XIM','Real-time updated bulletins. (ARexx)',NULL,'P0T-NOoDLE',NULL,'BullView v1.10 by P0T-NOoDLE',replace('Real-time updated bulletins. (ARexx)\nBullView v1.10 by P0T-NOoDLE\n','\n',char(10)),'NBullview.readme',replace('Short:    Real-time updated bulletins. (ARexx)\nUploader: Leo Davidson <[email removed]>\nAuthor:   Leo Davidson <[email removed]>\nType:     comm/amiex\n\nNBullview.lha - BullView v1.10 by P0T-NOoDLE. (ARexx)\n\n- THE FIRST (and one of the best?) real-time Bulletin Updater to replace "B".\n* When the user selects a bulletin, it updates it before showing it to them!\n* Can also display normal texts.\n* One set of bulletins global to all conferences.\n\n*** This archive is *not* *new*, I am just putting all the Gods''Gift utils\n*** on Aminet for everyone (and so that people can stop bothering me :-).\n\n .--------------------------------------------- ----- ---- --- -- -  -   -  |\n | Leo ''Nudel'' Davidson - Yr1 Computation - [email removed] |\n |  -   -  - -- --- ---- ----- ---------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,14009,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048634);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('nc_lchk_','NC_LCHK_.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/NC_LCHK_.LHA','LHACheck','XIM','LHACheck',NULL,NULL,'NC','|        NO CRACK 1994 PRESENTS :        | |-======================================-| |LHA-Check v1.1! - WORLDS FASTEST CHECKER|',replace('.----------------------------------------.\n|        NO CRACK 1994 PRESENTS :        |\n|-======================================-|\n|LHA-Check v1.1! - WORLDS FASTEST CHECKER|\n|      LHA, LZH, RUN, SFX - SUPPORT!     |\n|    FULL STRIPPING & ADDING AVAILABLE   |\n|   Last Bug on Turbo-Machines removed!  |\n`----------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'LHACheck.guide',replace('@database LHACHECK V1.0 (c)oded by Blade/NoCrack\n\nCopyright (C) 1994 by Blade/NoCrack\nAll Rights Reserved\n\n@Remark $VER: LHACHECK V1.0 (14-02-94)\n\n@Node MAIN "LHACHECK V1.0 Document for /X"\n\n\n\n\n          _ _____  ___       _____________     _     __________ ____\n         / \|   | /   \     /      |      )   / \   /      |   ¡   /\n        /   \   |/  |  \   /    ___|  |  /   / | \ /    ___|   |  /\n       /        |   |   \ /    /____     \  /     \    /____      \\n      /    |    |   |   / \        |  |   \/   |   \       |   |   \\n     /_____|\___|\_____/   \_______|__!____\___!____\______|___!____\\n\n                             -O- PRESENTS -O-\n\n          LHACHECK V1.0 , fastest LHA/LZH CHECKER/ADDER/STRIPPER\n\n                             @{" Introduction  "Link t1}\n                             @{" Requirements  "Link t2}\n                             @{" Installation  "Link t3}\n\n@endnode\n@node t1 " Introduction"\n\nLHACHECK is the fastest LHA/LZH Checker available at the moment.\n\nIt checks integrity of archive-data, kills an variable amount of BBS Adverts\nand adds as many Ads as ya like.\n\nIt works in /X as well as in any other BBS-System with the ability to\ncall extern programs. (like C-NET,PHOBOS,FastCall,SMBX,Phönix etc.)\n\nUSE IT - HAVE FUN WITH IT\n\nBlade/NoCrack                                      @{" Main Menu " Link main}\n@endnode\n@node t2 " Requirements"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLHACHECK requires:\n\n - Kick2.0 or higher\n - LHA1.5 or higher\n - an LHA/LHZ archive to test :)\n\n\n\n That''s it!                                          @{" Main Menu " Link main}\n@endnode\n@node t3 " Installation "\n\nFILES NEEDED :\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nLHACHECK        The Program itselfs must be in the C: Directory\n\nLHA.KILL        List of TextNames followed by <CR>\n                These BBS Ads will be removed from the archive\n                (WildCards permitted)\n\nLHA.ADD         List of TextNames followed by <CR>\n                These BBS Ads will be added to the archive\n                (WildCards permitted)\n\n\nINSTALLATION IN /X :\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nCopy LHA.INFO/LZH.INFO/LZA.INFO/RUN.INFO/SFX.INFO in your FCheck Directory\n(normally BBS:FCHECK)\nIf you only got /X2.xx use LHACHECK as any other LHA/LZH-Checker\n(NO CHECKOPTIONS! Only Checker=C:LHACHECK)\n\n\nINSTALLATION IN FASTCALL :\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nIn Fastcall you have to insert following line in\n"MB:BOXDATEN/UPLOAD.BAT":\n\n LHACHECK $LF KILL\n\n\nINSTALLATION IN OTHER BBS-SYSTEMS :\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nLook in your BBS-Manual how to install an extern program.\nFor BBS-Systems that doesn''t check LHA/LZH-Checker text output, i have\ninserted the "KILL"-Option which will delete the file if its corrupt.\n\n\nCLI-USAGE:      LHACHECK <archive> [KILL]\n\n\nThat''s all!                                          @{" Main Menu " Link main}\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',21380,8,0,NULL,NULL,'nc_lchk_3','scan',1780048634);
