           @{"     gREETINGS     " Link Greetings}\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE First "nEON cOMMENT rEAD mE fIRST!"\n\nsORRY fOR mY bAD sCHOOL eNGLISH .... bUT i gO iNTO tHE 9tH cLASS 8]\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Installation "nEON cOMMENT iNSTALLATION..."\n\n\n\n                         cOPY tHEESE fILES tO bBS:\n\n  bBS:cOMMANDS/bBScMD/C.iNFO\n  bBS:dOORS/nEON-tOOLS/sKY/sKY!cOMMENT/sKY!cOMMENT\n  bBS:dOORS/nEON-tOOLS/sKY/sKY!cOMMENT/sKY!cOMMENT.iNFO\n  bBS:dOORS/nEON-tOOLS/sKY/sKY!cOMMENT/sKY!cOMMENT.iFF\n  bBS:dOORS/nEON-tOOLS/sKY/sKY!cOMMENT/sKY!cOMMENT.gUIDE\n\n\n\n\n  tHEN eDIT ''bBS:dOORS/nEON-tOOLS/sKY/sKY!cOMMENT/sKY!cOMMENT.iNFO'' wITH\n                        yOUR fAVOURITE iCONeDITOR:\n\nNAME.<x>=     sYSOP oR sOMETHING eLSE...\nLOCATION.<x>= lITTLE iNFORMATION aBOUT tHE sYSOP...\nHANDLE.<x>=   nAME oF tHE sYSOP iN tHE bBS...\nOVERSCROLL\n\n                               mAX 9 sYSOPS!\n                  <x> sTANDS fOR tHE nUMBER oF tHE sYSOP!\n   tEST oVERsCROLL bY yOURsELF ... sOMEbODY lIKE iT ... sOMEbODY nOT 8]\n                         eXAMPLE cONFIG iNCLUDED!\n\n\n       tEST tHE dOOR vIA yOUR fAVOURITE bBSsYSTEM (aMIEX/fAME/sIGMA)\n       yOU cAN sIMPLE sTART tHE dOOR, oR wITH aN nUMBER aS aRGUMENT:\n ''c 1'' ( fOR eXAMPLE wILL aUTOMATICALLY wRITE a mESSAGE tO sYSOP 1 iN yOUR\n                       cONFIG... ''c 2'' tO sYSOP 2 8]\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE Greetings "nEON cOMMENT gREETINGS..."\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                      sHORT gREETINGS fLYING oUT tO :\n\n   ·2fAST·aIRwORX·aMIGO·aRGON·bIG-rAT·bYTEANDI·cELATOR·cYZ·dEATH aNGEL·\n   ·dEFJAM·dELTA X·dR.sHARON·fOX·gOONIE·lECTOR·mAD dOC·mAD fORCE·mANGAR·\n ·mIGHTY J·mURDOC·nICO·nORS·rAINER·rED hUNTER·sIEGEL·sPY·sTONE·sTA·sTEEL·\n            ·sTYLEZ·sQUIRREL·vICAR·vOLTAGE·wINE·x-MODUS·zECTOR·\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE Infos "nEON cOMMENT iNFOS ..."\n\n\n\n                    fOR rEGISTRATION cALL dA @{"zERO hOUR!" Link zerohour}\n                    aND lOGIN uNDER tHE @{"gUEST aCCOUNT" Link guest}!\n                      tHE rEGISTRATION cOSTS nOTHING!\n\n   wRITE a mESSAGE tO sKYPHOS tHAT cONTAIN yOUR bBSnAME, yOUR hANDLE aND\n               a rEASON wHY yOU wANT tO rEGISTER mY tOOL 8]\n\n                  fOR bUG rEPORTS aLSO cALL dA @{"zERO hOUR!" Link zerohour}\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE zerohour "zERO hOUR aDVERT aND nUMBER!"\n\n         _________ _________ _________ _________    pOSSE:\n       _|        _Y     ____Y        _Y         |_  · sKYpHOS/nE-/X\n       \_____|   \_    _/__\_    l___\_    |    _/  · sTYLEZ/nE^sDC\n        |    .----|    l    |    |    |    |    |   · aMIGO/nE^aFL!\n        l____     l____     l____| 2F l_________|   · X-mODUS/mTX!!\n             `----''    `----''                       cONFERENCES:\n         ____ ____ _________ ____ ____ _________    · mOTOROLA-gORE\n       _|    |   _Y        _Y    |   _Y         |   · iNTEL-cARNAGE\n       \_        \_    |   \_    |   \_    l____|   · sNES^sEGA^nES\n        |    |    |    |    |    |    |    |        · /X-tOOLS`R''uS\n        l____|    l_________l_________l____|        · wUENSCHdIRwAS\n             `----''                                 · aZKIIaLLSTARS\n\n       bACK tO tHE mANSION ... dREAM yOUR dREAMS ... tAKE yOUR dRUGS\n         bUT dON''T fORGET tO cALL dA zERO hOUR ... tAKE cARE oF iT\n                          nUMBER: +49 30 2177306\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE guest "gUEST aCCOUNT iNFOS!"\n\ntO lOG iN cALL dA @{"zERO hOUR!" Link zerohour}, tHEN tYPE aT tHE\nsYSPW pROMPT: ''yES'' aND lOG oN uNDER :\n\n                             lOGINNAME: gUEST\n                             lOGINPW:   gUEST\n\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,18921,1,0,NULL,NULL,'ne_com01_sky_comment','scan',1780048634);
