replacement for yar /X BBS\n   \n              Multi Choice between unlimited numbers of Sysops\n                         Nice Ansi Logo for Enjoyment\n                 100% Rexx-written (checkable for Backdoors)\n                               Colorful Outfit\n\n  It''s not the best Logoff Door, but very simple and unbelievable cool ;)\n\n   Installation:\n\n   Nice Question :) - Just copy all files to yar Directories and go ...\n\n   For that reason please add the following to yar User-Startup:\n\n   ---------CUT HERE---------\n\n    RPSTART >NIL:\n   REXXMAST >NIL:\n\n   ---------CUT HERE---------\n\n   and make sure that u have the ''rpstart'' and ''rexxmast'' in yar\n   C Directory!\n\n   Do not 4get to copy the libs ;)\n \n   \n   System Requirements:\n\n     Pager requires an Amiga 500, 600, 1000, 1200, 2000, 3000, 3000T,\n     4000 with at least 512K of ram!\n   \n              The Prophet Logoff requires an /X 3.xx - 4.xx\n\n                2 Libraries ( supported in diz package! )\n\n                Sum Commands( supported in diz package! )\n\n\n   Creditz:\n\n                       Coded by The Prophet of N-Joy\n                        Ansi by jOKER/MtS of Mythos\n                         Doc by The Prophet of N-Joy\n\n\n   Trademarks:\n\n           CygnusEd v3.5 is a registered trademark of ASDG Inc.\n         Rexx is a registered trademark of Commodore Electronics.\n          AmiExpress is a registered trademark of Joseph Hodge!.\n        RpStart is a registered trademark of Dineen Edwards Group.\n\n     \n     Releases:\n     \n     Logoff Door               - released\n     Filetransfer Chekk        - released\n     New Files\n     Zippy Search\n     Status Door               - released\n     FileDescription\n     Who Door\n     Fair Trader\n     Operator Pager\n     Comment Door              - released\n     Lha/Lzh, Dms, Exe, Zip, Txt Chekker\n     Dupe Chekk\n     \n     and many many more :))\n     \n\n   Thanks:\n\n\n     Thanks goes to :\n     \n     Joseph Hodge   : for developing this cool AmiExpress =8-))\n     Don/N-Joy      : 4 using his commo, becoz my bbs was Busted on\n                      31.10.1994 at 09:30:00 am by the German Cops ;((\n     \n     Greetings goes to :\n     \n     All Members of : N-Joy, Akira and Neon\n     Murdoc         : Wo bleiben sie denn ? hehe\n     Delta-X        : Thanx for few weeks of a Sysop Axxess ;)\n     Rainman        : Thanx for supporting my BBS\n     Flashlight     : /T\ Tempest suxx - /X roolz .. hehehehe\n     Grandmaster    : Cool pics dude! - Make much more .. hahaha\n     Sargor         : Hope u are online soon again\n     ByteAndi/TRSi  : Bytekiller v2.0 - The best faker i ever saw!\n\n     All Sysops     : Do not Delete my Account! - I call soon as fast\n                      as Possible ;)\n                      and all others i have been forgotten !!!\n\n\n\n   Joining N-Joy:\n     \n   We are always searching for new Members, Coders ( any language ), Trader,\n        cool Sysops, Crackers, Game-Trainers, Supplier. Interested ???\n\n    Call these Boards now, and drop a Message to The Prophet or Hooligan!\n\n- Country -------- Board Name ------ Board Numba ----- Write to -----------\n\n  Germany          Heavens Gate      ++49-Elite-Knows  Hooligan\n  Germany          Black Zone        ++49-Elite-Knows  Hooligan\n> Germany          Alien Factory     ++49-Now Offline  The Prophet <\n  Germany          Teutonic Place    ++49-Elite-Knows  The Prophet\n  Germany          Pirates Gold      ++49-Elite-Knows  The Prophet\n  Germany          Desert Strike     ++49-Elite-Knows  The Prophet\n  Germany          Broken Hope       ++49-Elite-Knows  The Prophet\n  Germany          Wild Boyz Home    ++49-Elite-Knows  The Prophet\n  Germany          Top In            ++49-Elite-Knows  The Prophet\n  Germany          Off Limits        ++49-Elite-Knows  The Prophet\n  \n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n           > For the