r yar /X BBS\n   \n   Here are all Options:  - Logoff\n                          - Relogon\n                          - Page Sysop\n                          - Comment to Sysop\n                          - Enter a Message\n                          - Greetings\n\n  It''s not the best Logoff Door, but very simple and unbelievable cool ;)\n\n   Installation:\n\n   Nice Question :) - Just copy all files to yar Directories and go ...\n\n   For that reason please add the following to yar User-Startup:\n\n   ---------CUT HERE---------\n\n    RPSTART >NIL:\n   REXXMAST >NIL:\n\n   ---------CUT HERE---------\n\n   and make sure that u have the ''rpstart'' and ''rexxmast'' in yar\n   C Directory!\n\n   Do not 4get to copy the libs ;)\n \n   \n   System Requirements:\n\n     Pager requires an Amiga 500, 600, 1000, 1200, 2000, 3000, 3000T,\n     4000 with at least 512K of ram!\n   \n              The Prophet Logoff requires an /X 3.xx - 4.xx\n\n                2 Libraries ( supported in diz package! )\n\n                Sum Commands( supported in diz package! )\n\n\n   Creditz:\n\n                       Coded by The Prophet of N-Joy\n                        Ansi by The Prophet of N-Joy\n                         Doc by The Prophet of N-Joy\n\n\n   Trademarks:\n\n           CygnusEd v3.5 is a registered trademark of ASDG Inc.\n         Rexx is a registered trademark of Commodore Electronics.\n          AmiExpress is a registered trademark of Joseph Hodge!.\n        RpStart is a registered trademark of Dineen Edwards Group.\n\n     \n     Releases:\n     \n     Logoff Door               - released\n     Filetransfer Chekk        - released\n     New Files\n     Zippy Search\n     Status Door               - released\n     FileDescription\n     Who Door\n     Fair Trader\n     Operator Pager\n     Comment Door with Full Screen Editor\n     Lha/Lzh, Dms, Exe, Zip, Txt Chekker\n     Dupe Chekk\n     \n     and many many more :))\n     \n\n   Thanks:\n\n\n     Thanks goes to :\n     