STATiON AMIGA/PC/CONSOLE/ASCII-ANSI/C64        \r\n               Telnet: bbs.masturbationstationbbs.com\r\n\r\n           UPLOAD DATE: 03-06-15  TIME: 21:29:03  ON NODE: 1\r\n\r\n  UPLOADER: Black Beard            LOCATION: mASTURBATIONSTATIONBBS.COM\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,33911,2,0,NULL,NULL,'nvx_vcs1_v_chatscreen','scan',1780048650);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('nvx_vdc1','NVX-VDC1.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/NVX-VDC1.LHA','DirChecker','XIM','DirChecker',NULL,'VENOM/NERVE','NVX','(  //__/_\   ''/___\/__/_  (___\`_\\_ |`---. - --- ---------------------------------\_| V-DIRCHECKER 1.oo BY VENOM/NERVE AXiS ''96',replace(' ___ ___ ____       ___    ___  _  _ . ___\n(  //__/_\   ''/___\/__/_  (___\`_\\_ |`---.\n - --- ---------------------------------\_|\n V-DIRCHECKER 1.oo BY VENOM/NERVE AXiS ''96\n Compares directory & listing and gives a\n list of the missing files/entries and\n duplicate entries\n - --- --[tGø/-T!]------------------- --- -\n','\n',char(10)),'DirChecker.doc',replace('\n     .......   .......  ........  .... ....  .......\n    :::: :::: :::: :::: .....:::: :::: :::: :::: ::::\n    :::: :::: ::::      :::: :::'' :::: :::: ::::\n    :::: :::: ::::...   :::: :::: :::: :::: ::::...\n    :::: :::: :::: .... :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: ....\n    :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: ::::\n    :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: ::::\n    :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: :::: ::::\n    :::: :::: `:::.:::'' :::: :::: `:::.:::'' `:::.:::''\n         ::::                :::: .______________  ___     _   __________\n                                  |.  __    /    \/   \___//__/.   _____/\n - --- -------------------- --- - | \\\_    \ _ _/ ___/   //  \______   |\n   The Phunky Happy Crew Of ''96   |    |    | \\\_    |       |     |   |\n                                  |:   |    |:   |    |:      |:    :   |\n     Present A New Production     |::  |    |::  |    |::     |::       |\n - --- -------------------- --- - |:::.|    |:::.|    |:::.   |:::.     |\n                                  `----|    |----|    |-------`---------''\n                                    tGø`----''    `----''-T!\n\n\n Doors so simple ... the fucking ascii takes more space than the info! =)\n\n\n                          .                            .\n  - ------------------ -./-                       - -./ ----------------- -\n    V-DIRCHECKER 1.oo  //    yet another util =)    //  VENOM/NERVE AXiS\n - ----------------- -//-                       - -// ------------------ -\n                      ·                            ·\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                     .\n - -------------- -./-\n    iNTRODUCTiON  //\n - ------------- -//-\n                 ·\n\nTired  of  dupe  uploads your checker missed?  Files people try to download\nfrom  the listings only to find that they dont exist anymore?  Files in the\ndirectory  not  listed  in  the dirlist?  Well this is for you!  Give it an\nupload dir an /X dir listing and it''ll give you:\n\n   - List of any dupes in the /X listing\n   - Any files without entries in the listing\n   - Any entries in the listing with missing files\n\nNo arsing round & straight to the point ...  what you still reading for?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                     .\n - -------------- -./-\n    iNSTALLATiON  //\n - ------------- -//-\n                 ·\n\n     Just copy it anywhere you want as it''s not a door ... recommended\n             place is BBS:Utils/ draw for ease of use ... joy!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n              .\n - ------- -./-\n    USAGE  //\n - ------ -//-\n          ·\n\nRun it as a normal CLI utility using the following parameters:\n\n                dirchecker <uploadpath> <amiexpresslisting>\n\n\nLlama Example:\n\nSo  if  you wanted to check your amiga conference over 12 months old, you''d\nuse it like this:\n\n             dirchecker BBS:Conf2/Over_12Months BBS:Conf2/Dir1\n\n\nIf  you  can''t  operate it then I recommend psychiatric help or switch your\nbrand of headache pills ...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                     .\n - -------------- -./-\n    REGiSTRATiON  //\n - ------------- -//-\n                 ·\n\nLets be honest ...  it''s taken us a few hours ...  we did it for fun not for\nmoney ...  so DONT send us any cash for a special registered version as this\nis  IT!   All future updates will be free and we have NO intention of making\nyou  pay money to have your name on our door.  What is it?  /X door creation\nor advertising?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                         .\n - ------------------ -./-\n    CREDiTS & GREETS  //\n - ----------------- -//-\n                     ·\n\n              CODiING, ViKiNG HAT & GAME PLAYiNG   ... VENOM\n              ASCii, DOCUMENTATiON & COKE DRINKiNG ... TANGo\n\n\n          VENOM says hello to the following bodacious individuals\n\n MDR, Turbo, Real McCoy, Icon (upload god hehe), TANGo, Ace, Memo, Biggles\n  Cyber, Bill, Hybrid, Crash, Mic Flair ... and all other NVX members ...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                           .\n - -------------------- -./-\n    CONTACT THE AUTHOR  //\n - ------------------- -//-\n                       ·\n\n                        ....     .........    .____.    .____:    .\n                     ..:::::   .:::::::::::.  |.   |__  |.  _|    |\n - --- --------- --- - :::::   :::::    ::::  |    __///| \\\_    |\n   NERVE AXiS UKHQ     :::::         :::::::  |    |____|    |    |\n - --- --------- --- - :::::            ::::  |:   |    |:   |    |\n AQUARiUS ^ TWiSTED!   :::::   ::::.   .::::  |::       |::  |    |\n  DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE ..:::::::..`:::::::::::''  |:::.     |:::.|    |\n - --- --------- --- -                     tGø`---------`----|    |-T!\n                                                             `----''\n\n         + 4 · 4   (O) · 1 · 7 · O · 4       5 · O · 5 · 8 · 4 · 5\n\n.____:    .           .____.____.__________\n|.  _|    | ..:::::.. |.   |    |.  __ ___/ - --- -------------------- --- -\n| \\\_    |::::· ·::::|    |    | \\\_    |   ACE · VENOM · TANGo · BiGGLES\n|    |    :::·     ·:::    |    |    |    |       · CYBER · CRASH ·\n|:   |    :::       ::::   |    |:   |    | - --- -------------------- --- -\n|::  |    :::.     .:::::  |    |::  |    | /X DOORS · AMiGA · MUSiC · SCi-Fi\n|:::.|    |::::. .::::|:::.     |:::.|    | GRAPHiCS · ASCii · /X UK REG SiTE\n`----|    | ··:::::·· `---------`----|    | - --- -------------------- --- -\n     `----''                          `----''\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',6101,1,0,NULL,NULL,'nvx_vdc1','scan',1780048650);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('nvx_vdc2','NVX-VDC2.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/NVX-VDC2.LHA',NULL,'XIM','DirChecker.000',NULL,'VENOM/NERVE','NVX','(  /(__/_\   ''/___\(__/_   (___\`_\\_,|`---. «------------------------------------------'' V-DIRCHECKER V2.00 BY VENOM/NERVE AXIS 96',replace(' ___ ___ ____       ___     ___  _  _ . ___\n(  /(__/_\   ''/___\(__/_   (___\`_\\_,|`---.\n«------------------------------------------''\n  V-DIRCHECKER V2.00 BY VENOM/NERVE AXIS 96\nFAME & /X Clone utility to compare BBS file\nlistings and upload directories for any\nduplicate entries and missing files/entries.\n-------------------------------[tGø/-T!]---»\n','\n',char(10)),'DirChecker.Guide',replace('@DATABASE "DirChecker.Guide"\n@NODE Main "DirChecker"\n\n                                   ::]%[:: n e r v e   a x i s ::]%[::\n                                                  .\n                                               · /-------- -- -\n -  - ----------------------------------------/ /  code: venom/nerve axis\n          door: v-dirchecker 2.oo            / /------------------ -- -  -\n         -  - -- ---------------------------/ /\n                                           /\n\n             :::]%[::: fame util release :::]%[:::\n\n\n                @{"  " LINK "Intro"} Intro        - What the hell is this?\n                @{"  " LINK "Install"} Installation - Where to shove it :)\n                @{"  " LINK "Usage"} Usage        - How to make it go *PING*\n                @{"  " LINK "Credits"} Credits      - Who made it?\n                @{"  " LINK "Contact"} Contact      - Really wanna talk to him?\n                @{"  " LINK "FAME"} FAME         - The nicest system around\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Intro "Introduction"\n\n                                  ..\n                             .---:  :---------.\n                             |   ····         |\n                            [%] iNTRODUCTiON [%]\n                             |         ....   |\n                             `---------:  :---''\n                                        ··\n\nA  small  CLI  utility  for  sysops  that  goes  through  a directory on the\n         hard-drive and the relevant bbs file listing and outputs:\n\n	· duplicate entries in the directory listing\n	· files in the listing but not on the hard-drive\n	· files on the hard-drive but not in the listing\n\nThese are output to the cli window as standard and leaves it up to you as to\nwhether  you  want  to  remove  it.   Basically this was created to clean up\ndirectories on a BBS because we''d had a couple of duplicate files sneak past\nus  on  13th  Hour  due  to old files being deleted by mistake or duplicates\n                    popping up when they weren''t wanted.\n\nThis  version is approximately 3 times faster than version 1.00 so obviously\nwe  recommend  this  one  instead :) On a test listing of one meg it took 10\nseconds  to  check  and output all relevant information, while version v1.00\n                              took 27 seconds.\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Install "Installation"\n\n                                  ..\n                             .---:  :---------.\n                             |   ····         |\n                            [%] iNSTALLATiON [%]\n                             |         ....   |\n                             `---------:  :---''\n                                        ··\n\nJust  copy  this  to  any  directory  you  store  your bbs utilities and run\nwhenever  you  wish.  There are two versions, a standard version and the 020\nversion. Rename the command to "dirchecker" and put it wherever. Simple eh?\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Usage "Usage"\n\n                               ..\n                          .---:  :--------------.\n                          |   ····              |\n                         [%] USiNG THE PROGRAM [%]\n                          |              ....   |\n                          `--------------:  :---''\n                                          ··\n\nOpen a shell window and type:\n\n                          dirchecker <dir> <list>\n\nDir is the directory on the hard-drive you wish to check.\nList is the listing on the hard-drive you wish to check.\n\nIf you run dirchecker without any parameters it will tell you that parameters\n          are required and give a quick rundown of how to use it.\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Credits "Credits"\n\n                                ..\n                           .---:  :-------------.\n                           |   ····             |\n                          [%] CREDiTS & GREETS [%]\n                           |             ....   |\n                           `-------------:  :---''\n                                          ··\n\n                                  All Work\n\n                      Code & Mountain Dew - Venom/Nvx\n                      Docs & Gloom Deluxe - TANGo/Nvx\n\n\n              Quick Hellos From Venom To These Lovely People\n\n Hybrid, Reflex, MDR, Mic Flair, Bill, Video Nasty, Icon, MrFrapp, Memo, MrZ\n   Biggles, Delta TX, Ghostrider, Strider, Dr.Dre, Sigel, Derrow, Mad Dan,\n  Scouser, Narcosis, Neelix, Ordyne, Sidewinder, Stainless Steel Rat, Raoul\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Contact "Contact"\n\n                               ..\n                          .---:  :---------------.\n                          |   ····               |\n                         [%] CONTACT THE AUTHOR [%]\n                          |               ....   |\n                          `---------------:  :---''\n                                           ··\n\n                             1 3 t h   H O U R\n\n                    Nerve Axis UKHQ · Twisted Dist Site\n\n                      + 4 4   0 1 7 0 4   5 0 5 8 4 5\n\n                    33k6 Courier Power - 2 Node Ringdown\n      \n                Ace ^ Venom ^ TANGo ^ Biggles ^ Crash ^ Zone\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE FAME "About FAME"\n\n@{b}@{u}What should FAME costs ?@{ub}@{uu}\n\n Registered Version:  110 USD / 150 DM\n Betatester Version:  145 USD / 200 DM\n\n\n@{b}@{u}What is included in the FAME-package ?@{ub}@{uu}\n\n Server, SystemEditor, MainPart, FAMEHydra.FIM, FAMEError.FIM\n\n FAME.library FAMEChat.FIM programmed by Bloodrock/tRSi\n\n FAMEFullEd.FIM, FAMEScript.FIM programmed by Beatnik/tRSi\n\n MUI UserEditor, FAMEDoorHelp.FIM, FAMEInfo programmed by SieGeL/tRSi\n\n Also some doors and tools from the FAME-Development-Team are included,\n but this doors are only unregistered Versions and have therefor some\n limitations. The registered Versions of those doors and the Informations\n how to get them are available here in the pUNISHMENT iNC. BBS.\n\n It could happen that some of the doors and tools listed here are currently\n missing because there are currently under development !\n\n\n@{b}@{u}Who creates FAME ?@{ub}@{uu}\n\n@{fg fill}Main programmer:@{fg text}\n\n - David ''Strider'' Wettig (tRSi) [email removed]\n\n@{fg fill}Additional programmer:@{fg text}\n\n - Oliver ''Bloodrock'' Lange (tRSi) [email removed]\n - Ulrich Arne ''Beatnik'' Jansen (tRSi) [email removed]\n - Sascha ''Siegel'' Pfalz (tRSi) [email removed]\n\n@{fg fill}FAME-Development-Team:@{fg text}\n\n - David ''Strider'' Wettig (tRSi) [email removed]\n - Oliver ''Bloodrock'' Lange (tRSi) [email removed]\n - Ulrich Arne ''Beatnik'' Jansen (tRSi) [email removed]\n - Sascha ''Siegel'' Pfalz (tRSi) [email removed]\n - Andreas ''ByteAndi'' Petermann (tRSi)\n - Dirk ''Spy'' Holzkampf (tRSi) [email removed]\n - Bodo ''Dr.Dre!'' Hoffmann (tRSi) [email removed]\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',11500,1,0,NULL,NULL,'nvx_vdc2','scan',1780048650);
