                        -CARDWARE-\n\n                                 Coded by :\n\n                                   Melody\n\n\n                        Original idea and ASCII gfx :\n\n                                 Spellbinder\n\n\n        If you really like this door then please let me (Melody) know :\n\n=============================================================================\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "REQ" "Requirements"\n@NEXT "INSTALL"\n@PREV "COPY"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n\n  It has been made on an Amiga 2000 with 3meg ram, OS 2.1 and /X V4.7 but\n    there shouln''t be any problems on other configs.\n\n=============================================================================\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "INSTALL" "Installation"\n@NEXT "USAGE"\n@PREV "REQ"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n\nINSTALLATION:\n\n  Copy the "BBS" dir to your BBS: assign\n\n	Edit the DOORS:OMN/Death/Death.cfg\n  [--- CUT ---]\n	TURNS=25 ; The number of turns available for each player once every day!\n  [--- CUT ---]\n\n  All done! Go for it!\n\n=============================================================================\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "USAGE" "Usage"\n@NEXT "BUGS"\n@PREV "INSTALL"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n\nUSAGE:\n\n  Type ''DEATH'' at the /X main-prompt\n\n=============================================================================\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "BUGS" "Bugs''n''suggestions"\n@NEXT "GREETS"\n@PREV "USAGE"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n\nBUGS & SUGGESTIONS:\n\n  Call the board on the top of the screen and leave mail for MELODY!\n\n=============================================================================\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "GREETS" "Greetings"\n@NEXT "HIST"\n@PREV "BUGS"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n\nGREETINGS:\n\n                       Thanx must go to my BETA testers :\n\n                             Joshua and Spellbinder\n\n Also thanx to ALL who replies on this door and ofcourse everyone in\n                             THE OMEN, especially :\n\n         Azlan, Eniac, Menace, N-GIN, Spellbinder and The Dancing Duck\n\n=============================================================================\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "HIST" "History"\n@NEXT "PROJECTS"\n@PREV "GREETS"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n\nHISTORY:\n\n $HIS: 16-Nov-94 (V0.1) : This project started...\n       17-Nov-94 (V0.1b): Released as beta!\n       24-Nov-94        : Changed the design a bit and now users plays\n                          with their upload credz instead of fake credz!\n                          I''ve also removed the "Death rolls death" coz\n                          it was too easy... In 100 rounds I won 503 credz\n                          which is 50,3 megz of upload credz!! :/\n       24-Nov-94 (V0.2b): Released as beta!\n       24-Nov-94        : Finished the megascores and changed the design\n                          again.\n       24-Nov-94 (V1.0) : Released for real!\n       14-Dec-94        : Bug fix : It didn''t create a dir if it wasn''t\n                          present.\n                          Bug fix : If the libraries wasn''t found it would\n                          write some nonsens.\n       15-Dec-94 (V1.1) : Bug fix : If the user had less than a 5 digit\n                          number of credz, then it would fuck up his credz\n                          Added max. plays per day and changed the design\n                          a bit.\n                          Released for real!\n\n=============================================================================\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "PROJECTS" "Future projects"\n@PREV "HIST"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n\nFUTURE PROJECTS:\n\n  Right now I''m working on a MUCH better version of Hacker! Here''s some of\n   the functions that SUPER HACKER has :\n\n   * Each player runs own board.\n   * Players can buy/sell to each other\n   * Buy/Sell :\n      Hardisks\n      Modems\n      Terminal Programs\n      BBS Programs\n      Virus\n      Virus killers\n   * Each playerboard has it''s own BBS Add which can be placed at other boards!\n   * Each playerboard has it''s own mail\n   * Each playerboard has an individual "last ten callers" bulletin\n   * At the "New Hacker HQ" there are :\n      An effective bank with rates on loan/account\n      A gambler with approx. 5 different games\n      Advertising for other boards\n      Sales section\n      External hacker section\n   *  At the external hacker section there will be functions like :\n       Hack some other users bank account, steal his money and change almost\n        everything\n       Hack the users REAL ulcredz and fuck them\n   * There are currently 6 different bulletins like :\n      Last 10 fights\n      Show all players\n      Show last 10 callers\n      Show your status\n      Top 10 current scores\n      Top 10 winners\n   * Hacking a BBS will not only cause damage to the HD. Also to the\n     different programs the user owns.\n   * There will be a lot of default logos for new boards.\n\n=============================================================================\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',13809,5,0,NULL,NULL,'omn_dg11','scan',1780048657);
