|  |    |    |  |    |    |  |... :.:    :\n     :    :      |    :  l    |  |    |    :  |    |    |  |    :      :\n     :    . .....|       |    |  |    |       |    |    |  |    :......:\n     :......:    |_  _   l____|  !____|____   !____:____|  |\n                   l_____.    l__:    :   l___:    .    l__: OOPS WHQ!\n                         :                    .    :       :\n\n\n  THE ORiGiN   . OOPS WHq! . SYSOP: PRODiGY  . 2ND! . +31-0314-362687 28k8\n                                                      +31-0314-378863 28k8\n                                                             2xTELNET 19k2\n   _ __ ____________________________________________________________ __ _\n \n  WiTCHBOARD   . mEMB SiTE . SYSOP: TRASH    . 1ND! . +31-023-5366098 28k8\n  bROTHERS BBS . mEMB SiTE . SYSOP: SELECTOR . 1ND! . +31-016-4255288 28k8\n   _ __ ____________________________________________________________ __ _\n\n  HiGHLANDER   . DiST SiTE . SYSOP: Hi-Fi    . 1ND! . +31-034-6554319 28k8\n  wONDERLANd   . DiST SiTE . SYSOP: jUNK     . 1ND! . +31-070-3176466 28k8\n   _ __ ____________________________________________________________ __ _\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE quick "Quick View"\n\n\n  - --  ---( Quick View )--- > \n\n  Date:         Name:          Description:\n\n  10-JUL-1995 - SIH-4CHN.LHA - SIH''95 Module Contribution\n  28-AUG-1995 - OPS-AB10.LHA - Express Addbbs v1.0\n  28-AUG-1995 - OPS-BS11.LHA - Express Baudstat v1.1\n  28-AUG-1995 - OPS-BT11.LHA - Express Busytimes v1.1\n  28-AUG-1995 - OPS-DW11.LHA - Express DaWall v1.1\n  05-SEP-1995 - OPS-AB11.LHA - Express Addbbs v1.1\n  05-SEP-1995 - OPS-DW12.LHA - Express DaWall v1.2\n  10-SEP-1995 - OPS-BOLO.LHA - Ascii Collection "Board Logo''s"\n  14-NOV-1995 - OPS-ET10.LHA - Express EasyTrade v1.0\n  15-NOV-1995 - OPS-BTRO.LHA - Boardtro\n  02-DEC-1995 - OPS-HHCR.LHA - Module "HAPPY HARDCORE"\n  09-DEC-1995 - OPS-ANNI.LHA - Anniversary Intro\n  09-DEC-1995 - OPS-OMP1.LHA - Oops Music Pack #1\n  21-FEB-1996 - OPS-CD10.LHA - Express CD-Transfer v1.0\n  13-MAR-1996 - OPS-BC10.LHA - Express Byte Comment v1.0\n  28-MAR-1996 - OPS-DW21.LHA - Express DaWall v2.1\n  25-APR-1996 - OPS-DW22.LHA - Express DaWall v2.2\n  25-APR-1996 - OPS-ET11.LHA - Express Easytrade v1.1\n  25-APR-1996 - OPS-NF10.LHA - Express Newsflash v1.0\n  25-APR-1996 - OPS-OC10.LHA - Express Oopscallers v1.0\n  25-APR-1996 - OPS-TU11.LHA - Express Today-Up v1.1\n\n\n  You can find all these OOPS! releases in the OOPS! RELEASES conference\n  on THE ORiGiN bbs or any other OOPS! support board!\n\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',23430,6,0,NULL,NULL,'ops_oc10','scan',1780048657);
