:\n\n  1st ''TXT'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n  2nd ''ANS'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n  3rd ''DOC'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n  4th ''DOX'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n  5th ''iNF'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n  6th ''LST'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n  7th ''NFO'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n  8th ''REP'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n  9th ''SLV'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n 10th ''SOL'' AS A  TEXT-FiLE.\n 11th ''DMS'' AS A  DMSF-iLE.\n 12th ''LHA'' AS A  LHA-FiLE.\n 13th ''LZH'' AS A  LZH-FiLE.\n 14th ''EXE'' AS AN EXE-FiLE.\n\nTO SEE ALL THE FUNCTiONS OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2 YOU SHOULD\nBETTER TAKE A LOOK AT @{" HOW TO EDiT THE CONFiG-FiLES " LiNK CONFiGS}.\n\nAND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL \nFiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2 :)\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2"\n\n  COPY ALL THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.\n\n  NOW EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} OF ''DiZSTRiP''N''ADD.info''.\n  YOU WiLL FiND iT iN ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/DiZSTRiP''N''ADD/''.\n\n  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"CONFiG-FiLES" LiNK CONFiGS}. YOU WiLL FiND THEM\n  ALL iN ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/DiZSTRiP''N''ADD/''.\n\n  NOTE!\n\n  BE SURE YOU HAVE THE FOLLOWiNG FiLES iN YOUR C-DiRECTORY. WiTHOUT\n  THESE FiLES FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2 WON''T WORK 100% :\n\n  1. DELETE\n  2. COPY\n  3. RENAME\n  4. TXTEXTRACT\n  5. EXEDESCRiPT\n  6. DMSDESCRiPT\n  7. LHA\n\n  YOU WiLL FiND THESE FiLES ALSO iN THE GiVEN LHA-ARCHiVE.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE TOOLTYPES "HOW TO EDiT THE TOOLTYPES?"\n\nTHE iCON ''DiZSTRiP''N''ADD.iNFO'' HAS ONLY ONE TOOLTYPE:\n\n STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=<number>\n\n\n YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWiNG NUMBERS (FOLLOWED BY THE DESCRiPTiON WHAT iS\n DOES).\n\n STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=1\n\n : ADDS A NORMAL TAG-LiNE TO FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED FiLE ONLY.\n\n\n STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=2\n\n : STRiPS LiNES OUT OF THE FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED FiLE ONLY.\n\n\n STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=3 (ONLY AVAiLABLE iN A REGiSTERED VERSiON !!!)\n\n : iNCLUDES THE FEATURES OF STRiP''N''ADDTYPE 1+2.\n\n\n STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=4\n\n : ADDS A TAG-LiNE WiTH UPLOAD-DATE AND UPLOAD-TiME ONLY.\n\n\n STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=5 (ONLY AVAiLABLE iN A REGiSTERED VERSiON !!!)\n\n : iNCLUDES THE FEATURES OF STRiP''N''ADDTYPE 2+4.\n\n\n STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=6\n\n : ADDS A TAG-LiNE WiTH UPLOAD-DATE AND UPLOAD-TiME OR A NORMAL TAG-LiNE\n   TO THE FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED FiLE. THiS iS CHOSEN RANDOMLY WiTH\n   A PERCENTAGE CHANCE.\n\n\n STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=7 (ONLY AVAiLABLE iN A REGiSTERED VERSiON !!!)\n\n : iNCLUDES THE FEATURES OF STRiP''N''ADDTYPE 2+6.\n\n \n TO GET TO KNOW HOW TO GET A REGiSTERED VERSiON WiTH ALL FEATURES AVAiLABLE\n READ @{" HOW TO GET REGiSTERED " LiNK REGiSTER}.\n\n THAT SHOULD BE ALL FOR NOW...\n\n@ENDNODE       \n\n@NODE CONFiGS "HOW TO EDiT THE CONFiG-FiLES OF ''FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2''."\n\nTHERE ARE THREE CONFiG-FiLES WHiCH MUST BE EDiTED. THEY ARE ALL LOCATED iN\n''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/DiZSTRiP''N''ADD/''.\n\n 1st: DiZ.CFG\n\n      1st LiNE: BBSNAME <- MAY BE HAVE A MAXiMUM OF 17 CHARACTERS\n\n      2nd LiNE: PECENT  <- THiS VALUE iS THE PERCENT VALUE FOR THE\n                           COMBiNED (DATE-TAG-LiNE & NORMAL-TAG-LiNE)\n                           OPTiONS GiVEN iN THE TOOLTYPES.\n\n                           E.G.: YOU HAVE SET THE STRiP''N''ADDTYPE=6\n                                 AND THE PERCENT iS SET TO 30 THEN\n                                 THERE iS A CHANCE OF 30 PERCENT\n                                 THAT A TAG-LiNE WiTH UPLOAD-DATE\n                                 AND UPLOAD-TiME WiLL BE ADDED TO\n                                 THE FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED\n                                 FiLE.\n\n\n 2nd: DiZ.ADD\n\n      1st LiNE: NUMBER  <- THiS iS THE NUMBER OF LiNES WHiCH WiLL\n                           BE ADDED RANDOMLY THAT FOLLOW. YOU\n                           CAN HAVE AS MANY LiNES AS YOU WANT.\n\n      2nd LiNE: LiNE    <- FiRST TAG-LiNE THAT MAYBE WiLL BE ADDED.\n      3rd LiNE: LiNE    <- SECOND TAG-LiNE THAT MAYBE WiLL BE ADDED.\n      4th LiNE: LiNE    <- BLAH...BLAH...BLAH...\n\n\n 3rd: DiZ.STRiP\n\n      1st LiNE: LiNE    <- LiNE TO DELETE OUT OF FiLE_iD.DiZ.\n      2nd LiNE: LiNE    <- LiNE TO DELETE OUT OF FiLE_iD.DiZ.\n      3rd LiNE: LiNE    <- LiNE TO DELETE OUT OF FiLE_iD.DiZ.\n\n ATTENTiON:\n\n AS YOU SEE iN THE GiVEN CONFiG-FiLE, THERE ARE NOT ONLY COMPLETE (44\n CHARACTERS LONG) TAG-LiNES. YOU CAN ALSO GiVE A STRiNG, WHiCH iS iN\n THE TAG-LiNE YOU WANT TO STRiP OUT OF THE FiLE_iD.DiZ OF THE UPLOADED\n FiLE. THiS iS VERY USEFUL, SiNCE SYSOPS USiNG THE ADD-FUNCTiON CHANGE\n ONLY A FEW CHARACTERS OF THE TAG-LiNE WHiCH SHOULD BE ADDED.\n\n !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! \n !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!\n !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!\n\n DO NOT MAKE A RETURN AFTER THE LAST LiNE iN THE DiZ.STRiP. LEAVE THE\n CURSOR RiGHT BEHiND THE LAST TAG-LiNE. iF YOU DON''T DO THiS, FiLE_iD.DiZ\n STRiP''N''ADD VERSiON 1.2 WiLL STRiP EVERYTHiNG OUT OF THE FiLE_iD.DiZ.\n\n !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!\n !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!\n !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!! ATTENTiON !!!\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE REGiSTER "HOW TO GET REGiSTERED ?"\n\nYOU WANNA GET A REGiSTERED VERSiON OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2 ?\n\nTHEN DO THE FOLLOWiNG:\n\n 1. CALL KEY WEST - OSiRiS EUROPEAN HEADQUARTER\n\n 2. LEAVE A MESSAGE TO THE SYSOP WiTH THE FOLLOWiNG DATA:\n\n    NAME OF THE BBS WHiCH WANTS TO RUN FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2\n    NAME OF THE SYSOP OF THE BBS WHiCH WANTS TO RUN \n    FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2\n\n 3. CALL BACK WiTHiN 24 HOURS AND YOU''LL GET A FULL REGiSTERED VERSiON\n    OF FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2\n\n 4. HAVE FUN WiTH FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE CREDiTS "CREDiTS FOR FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD V1.2"\n\n   iDEA          : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   AREXX-CODiNG  : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   DOCUMENTATiON : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n\n   BETA TESTiNG  : MuMu   - KEY WEST - OSiRiS EHQ - THE TRACKERS EHQ\n                   JESTER - PLACEBO EFFECT - P.O.D. GHQ\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE GREETiNGS "FRiENDSHiP RULEZ"\n\n               GREETiNGS FROM MuMu TO THE FOLLOWiNG PEOPLE:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nCREEPY/TFP          - HOW iS iT GOiN''?\nJOKER/MTS           - STRANGE GROUP-NAME AND MORE STRANGE\n                      SHORTCUT FOR iT.\nRAF/TFP             - THANX FOR THE LiGHTER.\nMURDOC/NEON         - i WiSH YA FUN WiTH YOUR GROUP.\nJESTER/POD          - THANX FOR YOUR HELP iN AREXX.\n \n\n                  AND A BiG HELLO TO ALL OSiRiS MEMBERS !\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE PROBS "DO YOU HAVE ANY PROBLEMS?"\n\n               FOR TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG OR LATEST UPDATES CALL:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n         |__\  \___________/        \/\  /________|______/|      \   \n             \__\                      \/              EaZ|_______\  \n                  OSiRiS EHQ & SCANDAL DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE             \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n\n                    » aMiGA · /X · cONSOLE · mODULES «               \n\n               aMiXPRESS v4.xx   ø   nUP & sYSTEM pW nEEDED          \n\n                    -:) cALL nOW fOR a goOD rATiO (:-                \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE SLOGAN "OUR SLOGAN..."\n\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n\n                        - WE DON''T WANNA BE THE BEST -\n \n                       - WE JUST WANNA HAVE MORE FUN! -\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE HiSTORY "THE HiSTORY OF ''FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD''"\n\n                  THE HiSTORY OF ''FiLE_iD.DiZ STRiP''N''ADD''\n                 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nVERSiON 0.1 - 0.9 : iNTERNAL BETA-RELEASES\n\nVERSiON 1.0       : FiRST PUBLiC RELEASE\n                    - NO BUGS KNOWN -\n\nVERSiON 1.1       : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n                    - LiTLLE BUG REMOVED - BETTER ERROR HANDLiNG - \n                    \nVERSiON 1.2       : PUBLiC RELEASE\n                    - MAJOR BUG REMOVED - MORE SPEED ADDED -\n                    - UP TO 10% FASTER THAN VERSiON 1.1 -\n\n\n                     !!! OTHER VERSiONS WiLL FOLLOW !!!\n\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),'{"TYPE":"<number>"}','auto-added',155794,4,0,NULL,NULL,'ors_id12','scan',1780048657);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_km21','ORS-KM21.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS-KM21.LHA','AmigaGuide','XIM','AmigaGuide',NULL,NULL,'ORS','/  _______    \   _______    \  __________/ /        |    //     \   /  __/\________ .\ \_____________/_______\      \____________/',replace('  __________________________________________\n /  _______    \   _______    \  __________/\n/        |    //     \   /  __/\________ .\\n\_____________/_______\      \____________/\n |  - o.S.i.R.i.s -    \______\  -tRN!    |\n |                                        |\n | KOMM MAL HER HORST VERSiON 2.1 DELUXE! |\n | iNCLUDiNG CREDiTS-PAGE VERSiON 1.3 FOR |\n | AMi EXPRESS - PROBABLY THE BEST PAGER! |\n `----------------------------------------´\n','\n',char(10)),'KMHH21.GUiDE',replace('@DATABASE "KMHH21.ENGLiSH.GUiDE"\n@REMARK .------------------------------------------------------------------.\n@REMARK | This document is written in AmigaGUiDE format, so please read it |\n@REMARK | with AmigaGUiDE or your favourite guide reader.... ciao now...   |\n@REMARK `------------------------------------------------------------------''\n@REMARK $VER: KMHH V2.1\n@WiDTH 80\n@NODE MAiN "Guide to iCH GEB DiR MAL EBEN ACCESS V1.3 WRiTTEN BY MuMu OF OSiRiS"\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________\n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    /\n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_\n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/\n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n                            ¿S pROUD tø pRESENT:\n\n      >»»»»> KOMM MAL HER HORST V2.1 iNCLUDiNG CREDiDS-PAGE V1.3 <««««<\n\n                          @{"-*-   iNTRODUCTiON   -*-" LiNK iNTRODUCTiON}\n                          @{"-*-     FEATURES     -*-" LiNK FEATURES}\n                          @{"-*-   iNSTALLATiON   -*-" LiNK iNSTALLATiON}\n                          @{"-*-  EDiT CONFiGFiLE -*-" LiNK CONFiGFiLE}\n                          @{"-*- TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG -*-" LiNK PROBS}\n                          @{"-*-    WHO DiD iT    -*-" LiNK CREDiTS}\n                          @{"-*-     HiSTORY!     -*-" LiNK HiSTORY}\n                          @{"-*-    GREETiNGS!    -*-" LiNK GREETiNGS}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR SLOGAN    -*-" LiNK SLOGAN}\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNTRODUCTiON "iNTRODUCTiON OF KMHH VERSiON 2.1"\n\nKOMM MAL HER HORST V2.1 iS FOR SURE THE BEST SYSOP PAGER ARROUND. iT HAS\nNEW AND STUNNiNG @{"FEATURES" LiNK FEATURES} THAT NO OTHER SYSOP PAGER HAS.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF KMHH VERSiON 2.1"\n\nLEMME TRY TO EXPLAiN HOW iT WORKS.\n\niF A USER iS TRYiNG TO PAGE THE SYSOP, KMHH FiRST LOOKS iF THE SYSOP\niS LOGGED iNTO HiS/HER BBS. iF KMHH FiNDS THE SYSOP, THE PAGER WiLL GET\nTHE ADDiTiONAL OPTiON TO SEND THE SYSOP AN ON-LiNE MESSAGE. THAT MAKES\nSURE THE USER CAN REACH THE SYSOP EVEN HE/SHE LOGGED iNTO HiS/HER BBS\nFROM REMOTE. iF THE SYSOP DON''T WANT TO BE REACHABLE BY OLM''S, HE CAN\nDiSABLE THE OLM-FUNCTiON BY ENTERiNG KMHH''S SYSOP FUNCTiONS. KMHH ALSO\nSUPPORTS SAMPLE-PAGiNG AND NORMAL-PAGiNG (USiNG THE KMHH-iNTERNAL-SPEED-\nPAGER). THiS WORKS ONLY iF THE CHAT-FLAG iS TURNED ON. iF THE CHATFLAG\niS TURNED OF, KMHH LOOKS FOR THE CHAT-OVERRiDE-SECURiTY-LEVEL.\nFOR EXAMPLE: THE CHAT-OVERRiDE-SECURiTY-LEVEL iS SET TO 250, SO EVERY\nUSER WiTH A SECURiTY LEVEL OF 250 OR HiGHER CAN PAGE THE SYSOP NORMALLY\nEVEN iF THE CHATFLAG iS TURNED OFF.\n\nTHERE iS ALSO AN OPTiON CALLED CREDiTSPAGE BUiLT iNTO KMHH. iF THE USER\niS NOT ABLE TO PAGE THE SYSOP, HE HAS THE FOLLOWiNG OPTiONS.\n\n1) LEAViNG THE SYSOP A COMMENT.\n2) DO NOT LEAVE THE SYSOP A COMMENT.\n3) PAY WiTH CREDiTS FOR PAGiNG THE SYSOP iN EMERGENCY CASES.\n\niF HE CHOSE TO PAGE THE SYSOP BY PAYiNG CREDiTS (UPLOAD BYTES) FOR iT,\nTHE USER ENTERS A SPECiAL MENU. NOW KMHH CALCULATES HOW MANY BEEPS THE\nUSER CAN SENT TO THE SYSOP (DEPENDS ON HiS UPLOAD BYTES AND ON HOW MUCH\nONE BEEP COSTS - CONFiGURATED iN A CONFiGFiLE). NOW THE SYSOP WiLL BE\nPAGED AND AFTER PAGiNG THE CREDiTS WiLL BE DEDUCTED FROM THE USER''S\nACCOUNT.\n\nTHE NORMAL WAY TO START KMHH iS TO TYPE iN ''O'' FROM THE MAiN-PROMPT.\niF THE SYSOP WANTS TO CHANGE THE MESSAGES-SUPPRESSED-FLAG, HE/SHE\nHAS TO ENTER ''O OLM'' FROM THE MAiNPROMPT (NO OTHER CAN USER THiS\nFUNCTiON).\n\nTHE SUPPORTED SAMPLES ARE MOSTLY CREATED FOR GERMAN SYSOPS, BUT YOU CAN\nUSER OTHER SAMPLES iF YOU WANT.\n\nYOU CAN USE AS MUCH SAMPLES AS YOU WANT BY CHANGiNG THE @{"CONFiGFiLE" LiNK CONFiGFiLE}.\n\n\nAND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL KMHH VERSiON 2.1 :)\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF KMHH VERSiON 2.1"\n\niNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V2.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV2.xx}.\n\niNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V3.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV3.xx}.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMiEXPRESSV2.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V2.xx"\n\nTO iNSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR\nBBS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWiNG LiNE TO THE LiST.\n\n\n          11 SPACES iN         \n          |\n---------------------------------------------          \n*O        RM10BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/KMHH/KMHH\n---------------------------------------------\n||        |||  |           \n||        |||  ` ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/KMHH/KMHH'' iS THE LOCATiON OF\n||        |||     THE FiLE.\n||        |||\n||        ||` 10 THE MiNiMUM ACCESS TO USE THiS DOOR. CHANGE iT TO WHAT\n||        ||     YOU LiKE.\n||        ||\n||        |` ''M'' FOR A MULTiNODE BBS (''S'' FOR A SiNGLE NODE BBS).\n||        |\n||        ` ''R'' FOR A REXX DOOR WHiCH WiLL USE THE ''REXXDOOR''-UTiL.\n||\n|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.\n|\n`-RETARD OPTiON. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE ''O'' & ONLY  ''O'' TO GET THE\n  DOOR TO COME UP. iF NOT USED, THiNGS SUCH AS ''OMA'' AND ''OP12'' WOULD\n  STiLL BRiNG UP THE DOOR.\n\n\n  USE THE LiNE BETWEEN THE LiNES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN\n  EXPLANATiON TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART iS DOiNG (SiNCE\n  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK iN THE DAYS WHERE i DiDN''T KNOW WHAT WAS\n  GOiNG ON!)  \n\n  NOW COPY THE DiRECTORY ''MODULES'' FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.\n\n  THEN COPY THE ''RAWPLAY''-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE\n  LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.\n\n  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"CONFiGFiLE" LiNK CONFiGFiLE} CALLED ''KMHH.CFG'' iN ''MODULES:MM_TOOLS/KMHH/''.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMiEXPRESSV3.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V3.xx"\n\nTHE ONLY THiNG TO DO iS TO COPY THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEVE TO YOUR BBS.\n\nTHEN COPY THE ''RAWPLAY''-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE LHA-ARCHiEVE\niNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.\n\nAT LAST EDiT THE @{"CONFiGFiLE" LiNK CONFiGFiLE} CALLED ''KMHH.CFG'' iN ''MODULES:MM_TOOLS/KMHH/''.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE CONFiGFiLE "HOW TO EDiT THE CONFiGFiLE?"\n\nTHERE iS A CONFiGFiLE CALLES ''KMHH.CFG'' iN THE ARCHiEV. HERE iS HOW TO\nEDiT THE CONFiGFiLE:\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n SYSOPNAME=<name>          : <name> iS THE NAME OF THE SYSOP.\n e.g.: SYSOPNAME=MuMU\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n CHATOVERRiDE=<num>        : <num> iS THE CHAT-OVERRiDE-SECURiTY-LEVEL.\n e.g.: CHATOVERRiDE=250\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n HiGNODE=<num>             : <num> iS THE NUMBER OF YOUR HiGHEST NODE.\n e.g.: HiGNODE=2\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n HiGHSAMPLE=<num>          : <num> iS THE NUMBER OF SAMPLES YOU ARE USiNG.\n e.g.: HiGHSAMPLE=7\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n MAXBEEPS=<num>            : <num> iS THE NUMBER OF MAXiMUM BEEPS A USER CAN\n                             SENT BY USiNG THE BUiLT-iN CREDiTS-PAGE.\n e.g.: MAXBEEPS=100\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n BEEPCOST=<num>            : <num> iS THE AMOUNT OF BYTES ONE BEEP WiLL COST.\n e.g.: BEEPCOST=10000\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n USERS=<num>               : <num> iS THE NUMBER OF USERS WHO DO NOT HAVE TO\n                             PAY CREDiTS iF THEY USE THE CREDiTS-PAGE.\n e.g.: USERS=21\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n FREEUSER.<num>=<name>     : <num> iS THE NUMBER OF THE USER WHO DO NOT HAVE\n                             TO PAY iF HE/SHE USES CREDiTS-PAGE. THE FiRST\n                             USER HAVE ''01'', THE SECOND ''02'' AND SO ON.\n                             <name> iS THE NAME OF THE USER WHO DO NOT HAVE\n                             TO PAY CREDiTS iF HE/SHE USE THE CREDiTS-PAGE.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n SAMPLEPATH.<num>=<path>   : <num> iS THE NUMBER OF THE SAMPLE. ''01'' FOR THE\n                             FiRST SAMPLE, ''02'' FOR THE SECOND AND SO ON.\n                             <path> iS THE FULL PATH AND NAME OF THE SAMPLE.\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nAT LEAST THERE iS A FiLE CALLED ''KMHH.MENU''. THiS iS THE SCREEN WiTH THE\nNUMBERS OF THE SAMPLES WHiCH WiLL BE SHOWN iF THE SYSOP WiLL BE PAGED BY\nSOUND. YOU MiGHT EDiT THE FiLE iF YOU WANT TO USE OTHER SAMPLES.\n\nTHAT SHOULD BE ENOUGH FOR NOW.....\n\n\n@ENDNODE       \n\n@NODE CREDiTS "CREDiTS FOR KMHH V2.1"\n\n   iDEA          : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   AREXX-CODiNG  : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   DOCUMENTATiON : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n\n   BETA TESTiNG  : MuMu   - KEY WEST - OSiRiS EHQ - TFP EHQ - SDX DiST SiTE\n                   \n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE GREETiNGS "FRiENDSHiP RULEZ"\n\n               GREETiNGS FROM MuMu TO THE FOLLOWiNG PEOPLE:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nSTiNGRAY/AFL          - HOW iS iT TO BE iN A GROUP SUCH ALPHA FLiGHT?\nEXAGE                 - THANX FOR THE SUPPORT.\nJOHN SiNCLAiR         - NiCE NAME, BUT YOU SHOULD LEARN SPANiSH ASAP.\nJESTER/POD            - i WOULD LiKE TO TALK TO YOU ASAP.\nSUPER GROVER/AFL      - i MiSS YOU VERY MUCH BUDDY :(.\nKOO KOO KA CHOO/ORS   - i AM WAiTiNG FOR YOUR NEXT CALL.\nEQUiNOXE/ORS          - YOUR DOCS ARE iNCREDiBLE. HOPE TO CALL YOU ASAP.\nCARCASS/ORS           - SEE ABOVE...\n \n\n                  AND A BiG HELLO TO ALL OSiRiS MEMBERS !\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE PROBS "DO YOU HAVE ANY PROBLEMS?"\n\n               FOR TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG OR LATEST UPDATES CALL:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n         |__\  \___________/        \/\  /________|______/|      \   \n             \__\                      \/              EaZ|_______\  \n                  OSiRiS EHQ & SCANDAL DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE             \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n\n                    » aMiGA · /X · cONSOLE · mODULES «               \n\n               aMiXPRESS v4.xx   ø   nUP & sYSTEM pW nEEDED          \n\n                    -:) cALL nOW fOR a goOD rATiO (:-                \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE SLOGAN "OUR SLOGAN..."\n\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n\n                        - WE DON''T WANNA BE THE BEST -\n \n                       - WE JUST WANNA HAVE MORE FUN! -\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE HiSTORY "THE HiSTORY OF ''KMHH VERSiON 2.1''"\n\n                 THE HiSTORY OF ''iCH GEB DiR MAL EBEN ACCESS\n                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nVERSiON 0.1-0.9 : iNTERNAL RELEASES\n\nVERSiON 1.0     : FiRST PUBLiC RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 1.1-1.9 : iNTERNAL RELEASES\n\nVERSiON 2.0     : PUBLiC RELEASE - NEW FEATURES ADDED -\n                  MAiNLY CODED BY DOC iCE OF TSB\n\nVERSiON 2.1     : PUBLiC RELEASE - TOTALLY REWRiTTEN BY MuMu / OSiRiS -\n                  CREDiTS-PAGE ADDED - NEW LOOK - NO KNOW BUGS\n\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',340559,4,0,NULL,NULL,'ors_km21','scan',1780048657);
