Y WEST BBS   -*-" LINK KEYWEST}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR BOARDS    -*-" LINK BOARDS}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR SLOGAN    -*-" LINK SLOGAN}\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE REQUiREMENTS "REQUiREMENTS TO JOiN OSiRiS"\n\niF YOU ARE A CODER (ANY LANGUAGE), GFX-ARTiST, MUSiCiAN, DOC WRiTER, TRADER,\n  TRADER, SYSOP OR ORiGiNAL SUPPLiER ON AMiGA OR PC AND LOOKiNG FOR A NEW\n           GROUP, THEN MAYBE OSiRiS iS THE BEST CHOiCE FOR YOU..\n\n         ALL WHAT YOU HAVE TO DO iS TO CONTACT ONE OF OUR @{"LEADERS" LiNK LEADERS}.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE LEADERS "OUR LEADERSHiP"\n\niF YOU WANT TO JOiN OUR PC-SECTiON THEN CONTACT CRACKDOWN OUR PC-SECTiON-\n    LEADER ON OUR GERMAN HEADQUARTER TRADE iN CENTER - +49-ASK-ELiTE.\n\niF YOU WANT TO JOiN OUR AMiGA-SECTiON THEN CONTACT SPiDER OUR AMiGA-SECTiON-\n               LEADER ON OUR EUROPEAN HEADQUARTER @{"KEY WEST" LiNK KEYWEST}.\n\n\niF YOU WANT TO GET iN TOUCH WiTH OUR WORLD-LEADER THEN CALL FUN FACTORY OUR\nWORLD HEADQUARTER - +1-619-263-5087 - AND LEAVE A MESSAGE TO MuMu OR CONTACT\n                          HiM DiRECTLY ON @{"KEY WEST" LiNK KEYWEST}.\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE KEYWEST "JUST AN ADVERT"\n\n                   CALL NOW AND WiN AN A4ooo/o4o/33mhz\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n         |__\  \___________/        \/\  /________|______/|      \   \n             \__\                      \/              EaZ|_______\  \n                  OSiRiS EHQ & SCANDAL DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE             \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n\n                    » aMiGA · /X · cONSOLE · mODULES «               \n\n               aMiXPRESS v3.XX   ø   nUP & sYSTEM pW nEEDED          \n\n                    -:) cALL nOW fOR a goOD rATiO (:-                \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE SLOGAN "OUR SLOGAN..."                                   \n                                                               \n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER  \n                                                               \n                        - WE DON''T WANNA BE THE BEST -         \n                                                               \n                       - WE JUST WANNA HAVE MORE FUN! -        \n                                                               \n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE BOARDS "ALL OUR BOARDS..."\n\n  ANOTHER CHANCE TO REACH ONE OF OUR LEADER iS TO CALL OUR BOARDS\n  WORLDWiDE. HERE THEY COME....\n\n  FUN FACTORY     - WHQ - SYSOP: KOO KOO KA CHOO - +1-619-263-5087\n  KEY WEST        - EHQ - SYSOP: MuMu            -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n  TRADE iN CENTER - GHQ - SYSOP: CRACKDOWN       -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n  THE HiTCH       - GHQ - SYSOP: BEEBLEBROX      -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n  TATOOiNE        - GHQ - SYSOP: EAZY-E          -   +49-ASK-ELiTE  \n  UNDERGROUND BOX - LHQ - SYSOP: GRAViS          -     +352-505958\n\n  !!! WE ARE STiLL SEARCHiNG FOR A COOL DiST SiTE FOR OUR AMiGA-STUFF !!!\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',24902,2,0,NULL,NULL,'ors_mu02','