INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_nfi1','ORS-NFI1.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS-NFI1.LHA',NULL,'XIM','............   ...........   ..........',NULL,'Small/Faaaast','ORS','...... :::::: .......:::::: ::::::...... :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::. ...... :::::: :::|:: :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::: ::::::',replace(' ............   ...........   ..........    \n ...... :::::: .......:::::: ::::::......   \n :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::. ...... ::::::  \n :::|:: :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::: ::::::  \n :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::: ::::::  \n :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::: ::::::  \n :::|:: :::::: :::::: :::::: :::::: ::::::  \n    +-`-''------------------rS!/aRt`-''--  -  \n(·NFiConEdit v0.95a © 1994 cCs^eQx/OSiRiS·) \n(·World''s First REMOTE Icon Editor! [/X4]·) \n(·Small/Faaaast!/Sexy/Cute/Stylish/Single·) \n','\n',char(10)),'NFiConEdit.DOC',replace('\n     . ..........   ........... . . ...........   . .   .......... .\n       ..... ::::: :::::.....  ....  ......::::: ....  :::::.....\n       ::::: ::::: ..... ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::. ::::: ..... :::::\n       ::|:: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: :::::\n       ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: :::::\n       ::|:: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: :::::\n       ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: :::::\n       ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: :::::\n       ::|:: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: :::::\n       ::|:: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: ::::: :::::\n         | `-''         `-''     :::::             :::::     `-''\n         +-rS!/aRt------------------------ -- ---  ---   --  -  --   -\n\n\n        -  -- ÷(·NFiConEdit v0.95a © 1994 cARCASS!^EQUiNOXE·)÷ --  -\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/     · What The Fuck Is This?! ·     \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   NFiConEdit is just that. An Icon Editor. Big fucking      \/\n           deal eh?.. Well, it is. Seeing that /X relies heavily\n           on tooltypes, I thought i''d write a util that lets\n           REMOTE users edit icons. Yes, thats right, REMOTE users.\n           No more of this downloading-icons-changing-them-then-\n           re-uploading-the-cunts.. Nah, fuck that. use this\n           Instead.\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/    · Features? What Features?! ·    \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   · Written by us [ok, we''re biased]                        \/\n\n           · It''s k-rad.\n\n           · The only one out there, as far as I can tell.\n\n           · Oh, just fucking install it, and look for yourself.\n\n           · NFiTool Seal of Approval(tm). Yes, really!\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/    · Help Me Install it, Daddy ·    \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/ [/X v4.x/v3.x]                                              \/\n\n           Copy the files in the archive to your directories,\n           so they end up like this...\n\n           BBS:Doors/NFiConEdit/NFiConEdit.XIM\n\n           BBS:Commands/BBSCMD/NFiConEdit.info\n\n           LIBS:AEDoor.Library (© Sintax-the-Impending-Saint)\n\n           If you don''t know what to do, you shouldn''t be reading\n           this. If it makes no sense, you''re probably not using /X.\n           In which case, see below.\n\n         [/X v2.x/S-Express]\n\n           Suck shit, this is for /X3/4 *ONLY*. If you don''t like it,\n           blow me. Actually, I can''t see why it wouldn''t work.. apart\n           from the FSE bit.. try it anyway.. you may be shocked. If it\n           does work, tell me. I''ll be shocked too. We can be shocked\n           together. If it does work, and any /X v2.x / S-Express users\n           use it, I may just do a custom FSE-type thing for it.. then\n           again, I may tell you to naff off. It''s worth a shot though,\n           isn''t it?\n\n         [DLG/C-Net/E!/MAXs/Tempest/Xenolink/Reccoon/Paragon/4D/Citadel\n          /Trinity/Elite/etc.]\n\n           Suck my bile, as much as you''d like it to happen, this door\n           will simply NOT work on any of the above mentioned BBS s''ware.\n           No, Not even a little bit. I know you REEEEALLY want to use\n           it, but unless you puchase /X, it just aint gunna happen.\n           Live with it. Fuck, the range of NFi doors is argument\n           enough to go and purchase /X. It''s your loss. Really, it is!\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/     · Duh, theres no config!? ·     \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   Thats right. No Config. None needed. Just install         \/\n           and run. it''s as simple as that. If you can''t live\n           with that, eat my shit.\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/    · Can I Have MY Name On It? ·    \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   No. if you don''t like it, don''t use it. If you don''t      \/\n           like the colours, load it into Hex and change them.\n           Alternatively, you could email us, and ask us to add\n           something to it, or whatever. You could even call it\n           a registered version if you like. Fuck, you can call\n           it Intestinal Juices from a Stillborn Foetus if you\n           really like..\n\n           See also (Registrations Inc.)\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/      · Known Bugs and shit.. ·      \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   None. Well, sorta. Because this uses the internal         \/\n           messagebase to edit the icons, it loads the users\n           preferential editor. [ie, FSE, Line editor, or\n           prompts everytime.] If you''re using the line editor,\n           you''re gunna find it a bitch to edit icons.\n\n           I was going to force FSE everytime, but I got lazy.\n\n           So, the moral of the story is, if you wanna use this,\n           use the FSE, or prompt. If you don''t like it, bite me.\n\n           If i''m ever really bored, i''ll fix it.\n\n           I also want to add a Create Icon (Y/n) option, if the\n           icon doesn''t exist.. Then again, I also want a Ferrari,\n           so we''ll see what happens..\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/    · Backdoors/Virii/Trojans.. ·    \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   There are NO backdoors. However, some smartarse           \/\n           sack of shit, MAY have tampered with the XiM before\n           you got it. So to be sure, call our board, or any\n           of our ß Testers to grab your un-fucked-with-version.\n           Or, email us, and we''ll UUEncode it for you...\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/    · Bugs/Ideas/Money/Hardware ·    \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   If you''ve found a bug [yeh, rite..] or have an idea       \/\n           [that''d be a first..], or you want something added\n           to this, or any other of our doors, or just wanna\n           send us money/hardware/whatever, call us at the\n           number below, or email us, or send us telepathic\n           thoughtwaves or something... If we don''t know what\n           the problem is, we''ll be damned if we know how to\n           fix it! Improvements rely on YOU.\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/ · Official Guild of NFi ß Testers · \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   Do you run a board? Is it an /X or S-Express board?       \/\n           [or Swift for that matter.. ]\n           Do you want to be a ß Tester for the most rad /X tools\n           in existance? Call us, it''s as simple as that. No money,\n           no bullshit, no excuses needed.\n\n           You benefit by getting all the tools before anyone else.\n           Be the envy of all your neighbours. Cool or what?\n\n           Become a member of the Official Guild of NFi ß Testers!\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/        · Registrations Inc ·        \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   Do you want a registered version? Huh? Do ya? Fine,       \/\n           just fill out the registration form included in this\n           archive, [NFiConEdit.REG] and follow the simple\n           directions.. Fuck we''re nice..\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/       · Shameless Plug Inc. ·       \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   Yeh, we had to do it.. we''re heartless bastards..         \/\n\n           If you want *ANY* door''s done, but you are unable\n           [either too lazy, or just plain stupid] to do them,\n           give us a call, and we''ll do em for you. You design\n           em, we code them. Ugh.\n\n              Any Bugs, Suggestions, Death Threats, Money, or\n                 just for the fuck of it, give us a call..\n\n   ____             .   .    .   :                       ____            ·\n __\  /___ .________|___|____|_  |_______________________\  /____________:\n \__\/\__ \|     /  ___/\__   /  /  ______  ___ \_____   /\/\_____  \__  ¦\n  /   |/ \ \    /   /   |/   /   \____  \    \___/\   __/   |/  _   |/   |___.\n_/    ¦   \ \  /   /|   |   /_   ¦  _\   \_   \_/  \   \    |   /_  ¦  __/   |\n\_____:____\  /_________¦________:________/____/____\   \___¦_______:________|\n      ·     \/          :       ____   .   .         \___/  :     . ·\n _ _ ________.__________________\  / __|___|_____________ ._____\/_______\n  \\\\_____  \__ _    /__ _    /_\/|/  ___/\_____   /\__ \|     / ___   /\n      /  _   |/   \__/_/   \__/_   |   /   |/ \____/_./ \ \    /   \___/\n    _/   /_  ¦    !    \   !    \  ¦  /|   |   /_    ¦   \ \  /     \_ _ _\n dZG\________:__________\________\_:_______¦_________:____\  /_______////\n             ·                     ·       :               \/\n   · ·· LOGiC AHQ ^ OSiRiS AHQ ^ DARKPYRE iND. WHQ · · +6¹·²·545·467¹ ·· ·\n           · ·· AMiGA ^ PC ^ CONSOLE ^ TEXT ^ SOURCE ^ H·P·A·V ·· ·\n                         · ·· NUP · KILL FOR ME ·· ·\n\n        Or you can email us at ''[email removed]''\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/      · Ramblings of a Madman ·      \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   Right, theres a few things I wanna say.                   \/\n\n           · Charging money for /X tools is fucked. Fuck you.\n             If you wanna charge money for a commercial product,\n             make something USEFUL, dweeb. Fuck you.\n\n           · If you don''t like /X, don''t use it. Fuck you.\n\n           · If you don''t want to pay US$55 for the /X 4 upgrade,\n             don''t pay it. Simple as that. Fuck you.\n\n           · If the icon looks gay, use 8 colours. Fuck you.\n\n           · STOP using ''C'' and ''fast!'' in the same sentence.\n             C sucks. Learn ASM. Fuck you.\n\n           · Arexx is not coding. Fuck you.\n\n           · Compiled Arexx: See above.\n\n           · Techno is not music. Fuck you.\n\n           · Trading <> Uploading everything in your DL dir,\n             you maladjusted sack of shit. Fuck you.\n             [That one goes out to you Stylemaster DJ]\n\n           · Informing on people, no matter how much you hate them,\n             is fucked. Fuck you.\n\n           · Stop releasing shitty ascii collections. Fuck you.\n\n           · Nobody wants your DOpus config. Fuck you.\n\n           · If you want PD, look in Aminet. Fuck you.\n\n           · Amiga Board, PC Font. Spot the error.\n\n           · Adding 20 board ad''s to archives is gay. Fuck you.\n\n           · Adding pictures to archives is gay. Fuck you.\n\n           · Adding BBSTro''s to archives is gay. Fuck you.\n\n           · Fuck you.\n\n           · Fuck you.\n\n           · Oh, Fuck you.\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/ · Oh Gosh! I''d Just Like to Thank · \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   (EQUiNOXE/LGC)·(For my own personal language :) I talk)   \/\n                          (you assemble/compile/link/debug et al.)\n                          (Electronic Chicken: PROC PROC PROC!   )\n\n           (...SaDuS!...)·(1. For having my ''Peace Sells..'' CD...)\n                          (2. For completely rewriting our code,.)\n                          (whether we wanted you to or not. hehe.)\n                          (And all the coding help.. [of course].)\n\n           (...DANZiG...)·(The most k-rad asc² d00d ever. Thanks.)\n                          (Give us a call sometime...............)\n\n           (-redSkin/aRt)·(Thanks for the logo...................)\n\n           (.SiNTAX/WøT.)·(The E Guru.... Still processing your..)\n                          (sainthood!............................)\n\n           (..Sal-One!..)·(Our account better still be alive! :).)\n\n           (....WHiZ....)·(Call us you schmuck! _OUR_ number isnt)\n                          (disconnected.. Unlike some :).........)\n\n           (...2-Cool...)·(''Swift?'' he said, a glimmer of hope in)\n                          (his eyes..............................)\n\n           (.P0T-NOoDLE.)·(For having an opinion. I like opinions)\n                          (Also, Mr.SelfDestruct doesn''t take too)\n                          (kindly to 3000''s. Not at all..........)\n                          (Give us a call, and i''ll tell you bout)\n                          (it....................................)\n\n           (..Calypso...)·(Dafuk you been?.......................)\n\n           (..nocTurne..)·(Erm.. Got locked outta my home dir, so)\n                          (if/when you read this, resend your msg)\n                          (to the above addy... thanks!..........)\n                          (Damn security teams.. Hmpf!...........)\n\n           (CONtROL/TRSi)·(Pffffft! :)...........................)\n\n           (Zozo/Majic12)·(Why couldn''t you pick a pronouncable..)\n                          (name for your board?... hahaha........)\n\n           (MuMu+Spider.)·(C Schmee. E is cool :)................)\n                          (Thanks for the help too. I still think)\n                          (user.keys is silly.. hehehe...........)\n\n All the OSiRiS lads, LOGiC lads, all the Cydonia lads [including Sourivat]\n    and all the callers.. without you, fuck, there''d be no-one to abuse!\n\n          And a special thanks to BoWeN/SR/OTT/MXM/WTF/HUH/EH?/BLAH\n       for the initial idea for the door.. and for not letting me test\n                                  it.. git! :)\n\n     ____                                                           ____\n ____\  /___________                                     ___________\  /____\n(___ \\// _________/ · The Sky is Falling! Muummmmmyy! · \_________ \\// ___)\n    \ \/ /                                                         \ \/ /\n     \  /                                                           \  /\n      \/   That''s it. The End. More Great Tools Coming Soon-ish..    \/\n           I''d give you a list of what we''re gunna release, but\n           you''d cream your pants just at the thought.. so I won''t.\n\n           Needless to say, we''re working on, without a doubt, THE\n           best door for /X. Ever. Nyah!.\n\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,24300,12,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048657);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_om02','ORS-OM02.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS-OM02.LHA','Move','XIM','Move',NULL,NULL,'ORS','/  _______    \   _______    \  __________/ /        |    //     \   /  __/\________ .\ \_____________/_______\      \____________/',replace('  __________________________________________\n /  _______    \   _______    \  __________/\n/        |    //     \   /  __/\________ .\\n\_____________/_______\      \____________/\n |  - o.S.i.R.i.s -    \______\  -tRN!    |\n |                                        |\n |    Off-Line-File-Mover! Version 0.2    |\n |  for Ami Express - probably the best.  |\n `----------------------------------------´\n','\n',char(10)),'JOiN.GUiDE',replace('@DATABASE "COECP10.ENGLISH.GUIDE"\n@REMARK .------------------------------------------------------------------.\n@REMARK | This document is written in AmigaGUIDE format, so please read it |\n@REMARK | with AmigaGUIDE or your favourite guide reader.... ciao now...   |\n@REMARK `------------------------------------------------------------------''\n@REMARK $VER: COECP V1.0\n@WIDTH 80\n@NODE MAIN "Guide to OSiRiS iS LOOKiNG FOR NEW MEMBERS"\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n                         iS LOOKiNG FOR NEW MEMBERS\n\n                          @{"-*-   REQUiREMENTS   -*-" LINK REQUiREMENTS}\n                          @{"-*-     LEADERS!     -*-" LINK LEADERS}\n                          @{"-*-   KEY WEST BBS   -*-" LINK KEYWEST}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR BOARDS    -*-" LINK BOARDS}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR SLOGAN    -*-" LINK SLOGAN}\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE REQUiREMENTS "REQUiREMENTS TO JOiN OSiRiS"\n\niF YOU ARE A CODER (ANY LANGUAGE), GFX-ARTiST, MUSiCiAN, DOC WRiTER, TRADER,\n  TRADER, SYSOP OR ORiGiNAL SUPPLiER ON AMiGA OR PC AND LOOKiNG FOR A NEW\n           GROUP, THEN MAYBE OSiRiS iS THE BEST CHOiCE FOR YOU..\n\n         ALL WHAT YOU HAVE TO DO iS TO CONTACT ONE OF OUR @{"LEADERS" LiNK LEADERS}.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE LEADERS "OUR LEADERSHiP"\n\niF YOU WANT TO JOiN OUR PC-SECTiON THEN CONTACT CRACKDOWN OUR PC-SECTiON-\n    LEADER ON OUR GERMAN HEADQUARTER TRADE iN CENTER - +49-ASK-ELiTE.\n\niF YOU WANT TO JOiN OUR AMiGA-SECTiON THEN CONTACT SPiDER OUR AMiGA-SECTiON-\n               LEADER ON OUR EUROPEAN HEADQUARTER @{"KEY WEST" LiNK KEYWEST}.\n\n\niF YOU WANT TO GET iN TOUCH WiTH OUR WORLD-LEADER THEN CALL FUN FACTORY OUR\nWORLD HEADQUARTER - +1-619-263-5087 - AND LEAVE A MESSAGE TO MuMu OR CONTACT\n                          HiM DiRECTLY ON @{"KEY WEST" LiNK KEYWEST}.\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE KEYWEST "JUST AN ADVERT"\n\n                   CALL NOW AND WiN AN A4ooo/o4o/33mhz\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n         |__\  \___________/        \/\  /________|______/|      \   \n             \__\                      \/              EaZ|_______\  \n                  OSiRiS EHQ & SCANDAL DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE             \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n\n                    » aMiGA · /X · cONSOLE · mODULES «               \n\n               aMiXPRESS v3.XX   ø   nUP & sYSTEM pW nEEDED          \n\n                    -:) cALL nOW fOR a goOD rATiO (:-                \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE SLOGAN "OUR SLOGAN..."                                   \n                                                               \n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER  \n                                                               \n                        - WE DON''T WANNA BE THE BEST -         \n                                                               \n                       - WE JUST WANNA HAVE MORE FUN! -        \n                                                               \n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE BOARDS "ALL OUR BOARDS..."\n\n  ANOTHER CHANCE TO REACH ONE OF OUR LEADER iS TO CALL OUR BOARDS\n  WORLDWiDE. HERE THEY COME....\n\n  FUN FACTORY     - WHQ - SYSOP: KOO KOO KA CHOO - +1-619-263-5087\n  KEY WEST        - EHQ - SYSOP: MuMu            -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n  TRADE iN CENTER - GHQ - SYSOP: CRACKDOWN       -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n  THE HiTCH       - GHQ - SYSOP: BEEBLEBROX      -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n  TATOOiNE        - GHQ - SYSOP: EAZY-E          -   +49-ASK-ELiTE  \n  UNDERGROUND BOX - LHQ - SYSOP: GRAViS          -     +352-505958\n\n  !!! WE ARE STiLL SEARCHiNG FOR A COOL DiST SiTE FOR OUR AMiGA-STUFF !!!\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',27046,4,0,NULL,NULL,'ors_om02','scan',1780048657);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_sa10','ORS-SA10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS-SA10.LHA','AmigaGuide','XIM','AmigaGuide',NULL,NULL,'ORS','/  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / /       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /',replace('   _____   _____   ____ _____  _________   \n  /  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ \n /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / \n/       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /  \n\______/_______/___/___\___\___/_______/CoZ\n<-- -  -     .p.r.e.s.e.n.t.s.     -  - -->\n.-----------------------------------------.\n| SYSOP-ALARMiNATOR V1.0 FOR ALL /X VERS. |\n`-----------------------------------------''\n          [30;41m  >>>> MEN-TEL ''94 <<<<  [39;40m\n','\n',char(10)),'ALARM10.GUiDE',replace('@DATABASE "ALARM10.ENGLiSH.GUiDE"\n@REMARK .------------------------------------------------------------------.\n@REMARK | This document is written in AmigaGUiDE format, so please read it |\n@REMARK | with AmigaGUiDE or your favourite guide reader.... ciao now...   |\n@REMARK `------------------------------------------------------------------''\n@REMARK $VER: ALARM V1.0\n@WiDTH 80\n@NODE MAiN "Guide to iCH SYSOP-ALARMiNATOR V1.0 WRiTTEN BY MuMu OF OSiRiS"\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________\n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    /\n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_\n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/\n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n                            ¿S pROUD tø pRESENT:\n\n                 >»»»»> SYSOP-ALARMiNATOR VERSiON 1.00 <««««<\n\n                          @{"-*-   iNTRODUCTiON   -*-" LiNK iNTRODUCTiON}\n                          @{"-*-     FEATURES     -*-" LiNK FEATURES}\n                          @{"-*-   iNSTALLATiON   -*-" LiNK iNSTALLATiON}\n                          @{"-*-  EDiT TOOLTYPES  -*-" LiNK TOOLTYPES}\n                          @{"-*-  PRiVATE SCREEN  -*-" LiNK SCREENS}\n                          @{"-*- TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG -*-" LiNK PROBS}\n                          @{"-*-    WHO DiD iT    -*-" LiNK CREDiTS}\n                          @{"-*-     HiSTORY!     -*-" LiNK HiSTORY}\n                          @{"-*-    GREETiNGS!    -*-" LiNK GREETiNGS}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR SLOGAN    -*-" LiNK SLOGAN}\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNTRODUCTiON "iNTRODUCTiON OF SYSA VERSiON 1.0"\n\nSYSOP-ALARMiNATOR VERSiON 1.0 iS A TOOL WHO iNFORMS THE SYSOP ABOUT\nCERTAiN USERS WHEN THEY ARE LOGGiNG iNTO THE BBS.\niT HAS @{"FEATURES" LiNK FEATURES} THAT OTHER TOOLS DOESN''T HAVE.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF SYSA VERSiON 1.0"\n\ni DECiDED TO CODE THiS TOOL BECAUSE i LiKED THE USER-ALARMiNATOR V1.0\nRELEASED BY ABSTURZ-DESiGN LONG TiME AGO. THE USER-ALARMiNATOR V1.0\nFROM ABSTURZ-DESiGN iS VERY NiCE, BUT iT HAS SOME FEATURES MiSSiNG.\niT ONLY LOOKS iNTO A CONFiG-FiLE FOR THE USER-NAMES AND THEN WHEN iT\nFiNDS THE USER WHiCH iS LOGGiNG iNTO YOUR BBS SiMPLY PLAYS A SAMPLE\nTO iNFORM THE SYSOP.\n\niT HAS NO CONFiG-FiLES AND WORKS FULLY WiTH TOOL-TYPES iN THE iCON.\n\nMY VERSiON HAS LOTSA MORE OPTiONS. iT LOOKS FOR THE FOLLOWiNG THiNGS:\n\n 1. USER-NAME\n 2. ACCESS-AREA\n 3. ACCESS-LEVEL\n\n    OR ANY COMBiNATiON OF THOSE...\n\n\niF YOU WANT TO SEND A PERSONAL MESSAGE ALSO TO THE USER EVEN WHEN YOU\nDON''T WANT TO ALERTED WHEN HE iS LOGGiNG ON... NO PROBLEM!\n\nSYSOP-ALARMiNATOR V1.0 LOOKS WHENEVER THE TOOL iS STARTED FOR A SPECiAL\nTEXTFiLE WHiCH iS ONLY FOR THE USER WHO iS LOGGiNG ON.\n\nLOOK iNTO @{"PRiVATE SCREEN" LiNK SCREENS} FOR MORE iNFORMATiON.\n\nAND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL SYSA V1.0 :)\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF SYSA VERSiON 1.0"\n\niNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V2.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV2.xx}.\n\niNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V3.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV3.xx}.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMiEXPRESSV2.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V2.xx"\n\nTO iNSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR\nSYS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWiNG LiNE TO THE LiST.\n\n\n          11 SPACES iN         \n          |\n-------------------------------------------          \n*ALARM    RM010MODULES:MM_TOOLS/ALARM/ALARM\n-------------------------------------------\n||        |||  |           \n||        |||  ` ''MODULES:MM_TOOLS/ALARM/ALARM'' iS THE LOCATiON OF\n||        |||     THE FiLE.\n||        |||\n||        ||` 001 THE MiNiMUM ACCESS TO USE THiS DOOR. CHANGE iT TO WHAT\n||        ||      YOU LiKE.\n||        ||\n||        |` ''M'' FOR A MULTiNODE BBS (''S'' FOR A SiNGLE NODE BBS).\n||        |\n||        ` ''R'' FOR A REXX DOOR WHiCH WiLL USE THE ''REXXDOOR''-UTiL.\n||\n|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.\n|\n`-RETARD OPTiON. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE ''ALARM'' & ONLY  ''ALARM''\n  TO GET THE DOOR TO COME UP. iF NOT USED, THiNGS SUCH AS ''ALARMO''\n  AND ''ALARMATRON'' WOULD STiLL BRiNG UP THE DOOR.\n\n\n  USE THE LiNE BETWEEN THE LiNES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN\n  EXPLANATiON TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART iS DOiNG (SiNCE\n  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK iN THE DAYS WHERE i DiDN''T KNOW WHAT WAS\n  GOiNG ON!)  \n\n  NOW COPY THE ''OBJTEXT''-COMMAND FROM THE UTiLS-DiRECTORY OF THE\n  LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO BBS:UTiLS/.\n\n  NOW COPY THE DiRECTORY ''MODULES'' FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.\n\n  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} OF ''ALARM.iNFO''. YOU\n  WiLL FiND iT iN ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/ALARM/''.\n\n  THE VERY LAST THiNG TO DO iS TO CHECK iF YOU HAVE THE FOLLOWiNG\n  COMMANDS iN YOUR C-DiRECTORY (COZ SYSA V1.0 WiLL NEED SOME OF THEM).\n\n  C:DELETE\n  C:COPY\n\n  NOW ADD THE FOLLOWiNG TO YOUR LOGON.TXT AND LOGON.TXT.GR\n\n  --------------CUT HERE----------------\n  ~CC_ALARM\n  --------------CUT HERE----------------\n\n \n  THAT''S ALL...\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMiEXPRESSV3.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V3.xx"\n\n  COPY ALL THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS AND\n\n  ADD THE FOLLOWiNG TO YOUR LOGON.TXT AND LOGON.TXT.GR\n\n\n  --------------CUT HERE----------------\n  ~CC_ALARM\n  --------------CUT HERE----------------\n\n\n  NOW COPY THE ''OBJTEXT''-COMMAND FROM THE UTiLS-DiRECTORY OF THE\n  LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO BBS:UTiLS/.\n\n  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} OF ''ALARM.iNFO''. YOU\n  WiLL FiND iT iN ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/ALARM/''.\n\n  THE VERY LAST THiNG TO DO iS TO CHECK iF YOU HAVE THE FOLLOWiNG\n  COMMANDS iN YOUR C-DiRECTORY (COZ SYSA V1.0 WiLL NEED SOME OF THEM).\n\n  C:DELETE\n  C:COPY\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE TOOLTYPES "HOW TO EDiT THE TOOLTYPES?"\n\n  ACSTYPE=<number>                       THE <number> DEFiNES FOR WHAT THE\n                                         SYSOP WANTS TO BE ALERTED.\n                                         1 = NAMES ONLY\n                                         2 = ACCESS-AREA ONLY\n                                         3 = ACCESS-LEVEL ONLY\n                                         4 = NAMES & ACCESS-AREA\n                                         5 = NAMES & ACCESS-LEVEL\n                                         6 = ACCESS-AREA & ACCESS-LEVEL\n                                         7 = NAMES & ACCESS-AREA &\n                                             ACCESS-LEVEL\n\n                                         E.G.: ACSTYPE=1 <- iS LOOKiNG\n                                                            FOR USER-NAME\n                                                            ONLY !!!\n\n\n  ACSLEVEL=<number>                      THE <number> DEFiNES THE \n                                         ACCESS-LEVEL OF THE USER BY WHiCH\n                                         THE SYSOP WANTS TO BE ALERTED WHEN\n                                         THiS OPTiON iS CHOSEN.\n\n                                         E.G.: ACSLEVEL=200\n\n\n  ACSAREA=<area>                         THE <area> DEFiNES THE ACCESS-AREA\n                                         OF THE USER BY WHiCH THE SYSOP\n                                         WANTS TO BE ALERTED WHEN THiS\n                                         OPTiON iS CHOSEN.\n\n                                         E.G.: ACSAREA=OSIRIS\n\n\n  USER.1=<user>                          THE <user> DEFiNES THE USER-NAME BY\n                                         WHiCH THE SYSOP WANTS TO BE ALERTED\n                                         WHEN THiS OPTiON iS CHOSEN.\n\n                                         E.G.: USER.1=MUMU\n                                               USER.2=SPIDER\n                                               USER.3=HELION\n\n                                         !!! YOU CAN ADD AS MANY USERS AS\n                                             YOU WANT !!!\n\n\n  SAMPLECONFIG=<path&options>            THE <path&options> DEFiNES THE PATH\n                                         OF THE SAMPLE-PLAYER AND THE SAMPLE\n                                         WiTH iTS OPTiONS WHiCH WiLL BE\n                                         PLAYED WHEN THE SYSOP iS ALERTED.\n\n  E.G.:\n\n  SAMPLECONFIG=SYS:C/RAWPLAY 430 63 BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/ALARM/ALARM.SAMPLE\n\n  THAT SHOULD BE ALL FOR NOW...\n\n\n@ENDNODE       \n\n@NODE SCREENS "HOW TO BUiLT iN THE PRiVATE SCREENS?"\n\niF YOU WANT TO SEND A PERSONAL MESSAGE TO A USER EVEN WHEN YOU\nDON''T WANT TO ALERTED WHEN HE iS LOGGiNG ON... NO PROBLEM!\n\nSYSOP-ALARMiNATOR V1.0 LOOKS WHENEVER THE TOOL iS STARTED FOR A SPECiAL\nTEXTFiLE WHiCH iS ONLY FOR THE USER WHO iS LOGGiNG ON.\n\nMAKE A TEXTFiLE THAT SHOULD BE SHOWN TO THE SPECiAL USER AND NAME HiM\n''ALARM.USER.<number>''. THE <number> iS THE SLOTNUMBER OF THE USER WHO\nSHOULD GET THE TEXTFiLE.\n\nEXAMPLE: ''ALARM.USER.3''    <--- NOW THE USER WiTH THE SLOTNUMBER 3\n                                WiLL GET THE TEXTFiLE.\n\n !!! ATTENTiON !!!\n\nMAYBE YOU JUST WANT TO ANNOY A USER WiTH A PERSONAL TEXTFiLE BEFORE\nDELETiNG HiM. AFTER YOU DELETED THE USER iT MAY BE HAPPEN THAT ANOTHER\nUSER HAS NOW THE SAME SLOTNUMBER WHiCH THE DELETED USER HAD. NOW THE NEW\nUSER WiLL GET THE PRiVATE TEXTFiLE. TAKE CARE OF THE PRiVATE TEXTFiLES\nSO NOBODY WiLL GET A TEXTFiLE WHO SHOULD NEVER GET ONE.\n\nNOW COPY THE ''ALARM.USER.<number>'' iNTO ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/ALARM/''.\n\nTHAT SHOULD BE ALL...\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE CREDiTS "CREDiTS FOR SYSA V1.0"\n\n   iDEA          : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   AREXX-CODiNG  : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   DOCUMENTATiON : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n\n   ANSi-ARTiST   : JOKER øf TAURUS\n\n   BETA TESTiNG  : MuMu   - KEY WEST - OSiRiS EHQ - SCANDAL DiST SiTE\n                   \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE GREETiNGS "FRiENDSHiP RULEZ"\n\n               GREETiNGS FROM MuMu TO THE FOLLOWiNG PEOPLE:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nCREEPY/TFP          - HOW iS iT GOiN''?\nGANDALF/SCL         - ARE YOU DEAD?\n                      i''VE HEARD YOU HAVE A GiRL-FRiEND NOW\nJOKER/TAU           - THANX FOR THE ALARM-ANSi!\nRAF/TFP             - STiLL UPSET, DUDE?\nMURDOC/NEON         - i WiSH YA FUN WiTH YOUR GROUP.\n \n\n                  AND A BiG HELLO TO ALL OSiRiS MEMBERS !\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE PROBS "DO YOU HAVE ANY PROBLEMS?"\n\n               FOR TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG OR LATEST UPDATES CALL:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n       