INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_ax10','ORS_AX10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS_AX10.LHA','AmigaGuide','XIM','AmigaGuide',NULL,NULL,'ORS','/  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / /       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /',replace('   _____   _____   ____ _____  _________   \n  /  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ \n /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / \n/       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /  \n\______/_______/___/___\___\___/_______/CoZ\n<-- -  -     .p.r.e.s.e.n.t.s.     -  - -->\n.-----------------------------------------.\n|  iGDMEA VERSiON 1.0 - ACCOUNT-EDiTiNG-  |\n|    SECURiTY-DOOR FOR ALL /X VERSiONS    |\n`-----------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'iGDMEA10.GUiDE',replace('@DATABASE "iGDMEA10.ENGLiSH.GUiDE"\n@REMARK .------------------------------------------------------------------.\n@REMARK | This document is written in AmigaGUiDE format, so please read it |\n@REMARK | with AmigaGUiDE or your favourite guide reader.... ciao now...   |\n@REMARK `------------------------------------------------------------------''\n@REMARK $VER: iGDMEA V1.0\n@WiDTH 80\n@NODE MAiN "Guide to iCH GEB DiR MAL EBEN ACCESS V1.0 WRiTTEN BY MuMu OF OSiRiS"\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________\n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    /\n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_\n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/\n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n                            ¿S pROUD tø pRESENT:\n\n               >»»»»> iCH GEB DiR MAL EBEN ACCESS V1.0 <««««<\n\n                          @{"-*-   iNTRODUCTiON   -*-" LiNK iNTRODUCTiON}\n                          @{"-*-     FEATURES     -*-" LiNK FEATURES}\n                          @{"-*-   iNSTALLATiON   -*-" LiNK iNSTALLATiON}\n                          @{"-*-   EDiT CONFiGS   -*-" LiNK CONFiGFiLES}\n                          @{"-*- TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG -*-" LiNK PROBS}\n                          @{"-*-    WHO DiD iT    -*-" LiNK CREDiTS}\n                          @{"-*-     HiSTORY!     -*-" LiNK HiSTORY}\n                          @{"-*-    GREETiNGS!    -*-" LiNK GREETiNGS}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR SLOGAN    -*-" LiNK SLOGAN}\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNTRODUCTiON "iNTRODUCTiON OF iGDMEA VERSiON 1.0"\n\niCH GEB DiR MAL EBEN ACCESS VERSiON 1.0 iS A SECURiTY DOOR FOR ACCOUNT-\nEDiTiNG. iT HAS @{"FEATURES" LiNK FEATURES} THAT MAKE YOUR SYSTEM MUCH MORE SAFE.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF iGDMEA VERSiON 1.0"\n\nWELL, iGDMEA WORKS KiNDA SiMPLE. EVERYBODY HAS TO ENTER A SPECiAL PASSWORD\nTO EDiT ACCOUNTS. THEN THE DOOR CHECKS iF THE USER HAS REALLY ACCESS TO\nACCOUNT EDiTiNG OR NOT. iF NOT (ONLY HE HAS THE SECURiTY LEVEL TO START\nTHE DOOR - MAYBE A HACKER) THE DOOR WiLL MAKE AN ENTRY iNTO THE CALLERSLOG\nAND WiLL ALERT THE SYSOP BY FLASHiNG THE SCREEN AND MAKE SOME BEEPS.\n\ni THiNK THAT iS MUCH SAFER iN TiMES EVERYBODY FEARS TO GET BUSTED.\n\nAND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL iGDMEA VERSiON 1.0. :)\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF iGDMEA VERSiON 1.0"\n\niNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V2.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV2.xx}.\n\niNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V3.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV3.xx}.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMiEXPRESSV2.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V2.xx"\n\nTO iNSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR\nBBS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWiNG LiNE TO THE LiST.\n\n\n          11 SPACES iN         \n          |\n--------------------------------------------------          \n*1        RM255MODULES:MM_TOOLS/ACCESS/ACCESS.REXX\n--------------------------------------------------\n||        |||  |           \n||        |||  ` ''MODULES:MM_TOOLS/ACCESS/ACCESS.REXX'' iS THE LOCATiON OF\n||        |||     THE FiLE.\n||        |||\n||        ||` 255 THE MiNiMUM ACCESS TO USE THiS DOOR. CHANGE iT TO WHAT\n||        ||      YOU LiKE.\n||        ||\n||        |` ''M'' FOR A MULTiNODE BBS (''S'' FOR A SiNGLE NODE BBS).\n||        |\n||        ` ''R'' FOR A REXX DOOR WHiCH WiLL USE THE ''REXXDOOR''-UTiL.\n||\n|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.\n|\n`-RETARD OPTiON. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE ''1'' & ONLY  ''1'' TO GET THE\n  DOOR TO COME UP. iF NOT USED, THiNGS SUCH AS ''12345'' AND ''1Z'' WOULD\n  STiLL BRiNG UP THE DOOR.\n\n\n  USE THE LiNE BETWEEN THE LiNES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN\n  EXPLANATiON TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART iS DOiNG (SiNCE\n  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK iN THE DAYS WHERE i DiDN''T KNOW WHAT WAS\n  GOiNG ON!)  \n\n  NOW COPY THE DiRECTORY ''MODULES'' FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.\n\n  THEN COPY THE ''DODELAY''-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE\n  LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.\n\n\n  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"CONFiGFiLES" LiNK CONFiGFiLES}. YOU FiND WiLL THEM iN\n \n  ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/ACCESS''.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMiEXPRESSV3.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V3.xx"\n\nTHE ONLY THiNG TO DO iS TO COPY THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEVE TO YOUR BBS. THEN\nEDiT THE @{"CONFiGFiLES" LiNK CONFiGFiLES}. YOU WiLL FiND THEM iN ''BBS:MODULES/ABSTURZ/COECP''.\n\nAT LAST COPY THE ''DODELAY''-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE\nLHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE CONFiGFiLES "HOW TO EDiT THE CONFiGFiLES?"\n\n1. ACCESS.CFG\n \n   - THiS iS THE PASSWORD THE USERS HAVE TO TYPE iN TO EDiT ACOUNTS.\n\n   E.G.:\n\n     1st Line = PASSWORD\n\n\n2. ACCESS.NAMES\n\n     - THESE ARE THE NAMES OF THE USERS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO ACCOUNT-EDiTiNG.\n\n     E.G.:\n\n     - Line 1 = SPiDER/OSiRiS\n     - Line 2 = DOC iCE/TSB\n     - Line 3 = KOO KOO KA CHOO\n\n     - YOU CAN ADD AS MANY NAMES AS YOU MiGHT WANT.\n\n@ENDNODE       \n\n@NODE CREDiTS "CREDiTS FOR iGDMEA V1.0"\n\n   iDEA          : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   AREXX-CODiNG  : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   DOCUMENTATiON : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n\n   BETA TESTiNG  : MuMu   - KEY WEST - OSiRiS EHQ - SCANDAL DiST SiTE\n                   JOKER  - MAD HOUSE - TAURUS GHQ - PROTECH GHQ\n                   \n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE GREETiNGS "FRiENDSHiP RULEZ"\n\n               GREETiNGS FROM MuMu TO THE FOLLOWiNG PEOPLE:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nCREEPY/TFP          - HOW iS iT GOiN''?\nGANDALF/SCL         - WHY DON''T YOU CALL ME?\nRAPiD/SCL           - THANX FOR THE ANSiS.\nRAF/TFP             - THANX FOR THE KEY WEST LOGO. iT iS PRETTY NiCE.\nDiCE/TFP            - THANX FOR THE BBS-ADVERT YOU CODED FOR ME.\nMURDOC/NEON         - YOUR AT&T''S ARE 100% NO ViRGiN CARDS. BETTER TRY\n                      TO GET A BETTER CARD-SUPPLiER.\nDEFJAM              - THANX FOR BETA-TESTiNG.\n \n\n                  AND A BiG HELLO TO ALL OSiRiS MEMBERS !\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE PROBS "DO YOU HAVE ANY PROBLEMS?"\n\n               FOR TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG OR LATEST UPDATES CALL:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n         |__\  \___________/        \/\  /________|______/|      \   \n             \__\                      \/              EaZ|_______\  \n                  OSiRiS EHQ & SCANDAL DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE             \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n\n                    » aMiGA · /X · cONSOLE · mODULES «               \n\n               aMiXPRESS v3.XX   ø   nUP & sYSTEM pW nEEDED          \n\n                    -:) cALL nOW fOR a goOD rATiO (:-                \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE SLOGAN "OUR SLOGAN..."\n\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n\n                        - WE DON''T WANNA BE THE BEST -\n \n                       - WE JUST WANNA HAVE MORE FUN! -\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE HiSTORY "THE HiSTORY OF ''iCH GEB DiR MAL EBEN ACCESS''"\n\n                 THE HiSTORY OF ''iCH GEB DiR MAL EBEN ACCESS\n                ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nVERSiON 0.1 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 0.2 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 0.3 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 0.4 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n              SOME BUGS REMOVED\n\nVERSiON 0.5 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 0.6 : BETA RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 0.7 : SOME BUGS REMOVED\n\nVERSiON 0.8 : BETA RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 0.9 : FiNAL BETA VERSiON\n\nVERSiON 1.0 : PUBLiC VERSiON\n\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',134034,12,0,NULL,NULL,'ors_ax10','scan',1780048657);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_cp10','ORS_CP10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS_CP10.LHA','AmigaGuide','XIM','AmigaGuide',NULL,NULL,'ORS','/  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / /       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /',replace('   _____   _____   ____ _____  _________   \n  /  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ \n /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / \n/       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /  \n\______/_______/___/___\___\___/_______/CoZ\n<-- -  -     .p.r.e.s.e.n.t.s.     -  - -->\n.-----------------------------------------.\n|CHAT-OVERIDE-EMERGENCY-CREDITS-PAGE V1.00|\n`-----------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'COECP10.GUiDE',replace('@DATABASE "COECP10.ENGLISH.GUIDE"\n@REMARK .------------------------------------------------------------------.\n@REMARK | This document is written in AmigaGUIDE format, so please read it |\n@REMARK | with AmigaGUIDE or your favourite guide reader.... ciao now...   |\n@REMARK `------------------------------------------------------------------''\n@REMARK $VER: COECP V1.0\n@WIDTH 80\n@NODE MAIN "Guide to Chat-Overide-Emergency-Credits-Page V1.0"\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n                            ¿S pROUD tø pRESENT:\n\n                          >»»»»> COECP V1.0 <««««<\n\n                          @{"-*-   INTRODUCTION   -*-" LINK INTRODUCTION}\n                          @{"-*-     FEATURES     -*-" LINK FEATURES}\n                          @{"-*-   INSTALLATION   -*-" LINK INSTALLATION}\n                          @{"-*-   EDIT CONFIGS   -*-" LINK CONFIGFILES}\n                          @{"-*- TROUBLE-SHOOTING -*-" LINK PROBS}\n                          @{"-*-    WHO DID IT    -*-" LINK CREDITS}\n                          @{"-*-    GREETINGS!    -*-" LINK GREETINGS}\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE INTRODUCTION "INTRODUCTION OF COECP V1.0"\n\nCOECP V1.0 IS NOT ONLY ANOTHER NEW SYSOP PAGER. IT HAS @{"FEATURES" LINK FEATURES} THAT OTHER \nPAGERS DOESN''T HAVE. YOU SHOULD NOT REPLACE COECP V1.0 WITH YOUR OLD PAGER.\nLET IT RUN BESIDE YOUR OLD PAGER JUST WITH ANOTHER COMMAND TO START IT.\nSET THE CHAT-OVERRIDE-LEVEL TO AN AMMOUNT THAT EVERY USER IS ABLE TO PAGE\nYOU AT ANY TIME. \n\nTHE USER HAS TO PAY WITH HIS CREDITS IF HE WANTS TO PAGE THE SYSOP AND HE\nWILL DO THIS ONLY IF THERE IS SOMETHING REALLY IMPORTANT. SO, NEVER WILL\nPAGE THE SYSOP JUST FOR FUN AND THE SYSOP CAN BE PAGED AT EVERY TIME.  \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF COECP V1.0"\n\nCOECP V1.0 LOOKS HOW MANY UPLOAD BYTES THE USER WHO WANTS TO PAGE THE SYSOP\nHAS AND CALCULATES HOW MANY BEEPS THE USER CAN USE. IF THE USER HAS ACCESS\nTO THE FREE-MODE HE DOES NOT HAVE TO PAY FOR HIS BEEPS. THE AMMOUNT HOW MUCH\nA BEEP DOES COST, WHICH USERS HAVE ACCESS TO THE FREE-MODE AND HOW HIGH IS\nTHE CHAT-OVERIDE-LEVEL ARE IN THE @{"CONFIGFILES" LINK CONFIGFILES}.\n\nAFTER THE USER PAGED THE SYSOP COECP V1.0 CALCULATES THE NEW AMMOUNT OF\nCREDITS THE USER HAS LEFT (IS SHOWN TO THE USER) AND STORES THIS TO HIS\nUSERDATA.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE INSTALLATION "INSTALLATION OF KMHH V2.1 DELUXE"\n\nINSTALLATION TO @{"AMI EXPRESS V2.xx" LINK AMIEXPRESSV2.xx}.\n\nINSTALLATION TO @{"AMI EXPRESS V3.xx" LINK AMIEXPRESSV3.xx}.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMIEXPRESSV2.xx "INSTALLATION TO AMI EXPRESS V2.xx"\n\nTO INSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR\nBBS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWING LINE TO THE LIST.\n\n\n          11 SPACES IN         \n          |\n-----------------------------------------------          \n*PAGE     RM010MODULES:ABSTURZ/COECP/COECP.REXX\n-----------------------------------------------\n||        |||  |           \n||        |||  ` ''MODULES:ABSTURZ/COECP/COECP.REXX'' IS THE LOCATION OF\n||        |||     THE FILE.\n||        |||\n||        ||` 020 THE MINIMUM ACCESS TO USE THIS DOOR. CHANGE IT TO WHAT\n||        ||      YOU LIKE.\n||        ||\n||        |` ''M'' FOR A MULTINODE BBS (''S'' FOR A SINGLE NODE BBS).\n||        |\n||        ` ''R'' FOR A REXX DOOR WHICH WILL USE THE ''REXXDOOR''-UTIL.\n||\n|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.\n|\n`-RETARD OPTION. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE ''S'' & ONLY  ''S'' TO GET THE\n  DOOR TO COME UP. IF NOT USED, THINGS SUCH AS ''START'' AND ''SA'' WOULD\n  STILL BRING UP THE DOOR.\n\n\n  USE THE LINE BETWEEN THE LINES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN\n  EXPLANATION TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART IS DOING (SINCE\n  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK IN THE DAYS WHERE I DIDN''T KNOW WHAT WAS\n  GOING ON!)  \n\n  NOW COPY THE DIRECTORY ''MODULES'' FROM THE LHA-ARCHIEV TO YOUR BBS.\n\n  AT LAST EDIT THE @{"CONFIGFILES" LINK CONFIGFILES}. YOU FIND WILL THEM IN\n \n  ''BBS:MODULES/ABSTURZ/COECP''.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMIEXPRESSV3.xx "INSTALLATION TO AMI EXPRESS V3.xx"\n\nYOU ONLY NEED TO COPY THE FILES FROM THE LHA-ARCHIEVE TO YOUR BBS. THEN\nEDIT THE @{"CONFIGFILES" LINK CONFIGFILES}. YOU WILL FIND THEM IN ''BBS:MODULES/ABSTURZ/COECP''.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE CONFIGFILES "HOW TO EDIT THE CONFIGFILES?"\n\n1. CREDITSPAGE.NAMES\n \n   - THIS IS THE LIST OF USER''S NAMES WHO HAVE ACCESS TO THE FREE-MODE.\n     \n     E.G.:\n\n     - Line 1 = MuMu\n     - Line 2 = sABINE/AFL\n     - Line 3 = SPIDER\n\n\n     ALL USERS IN THIS LIST DO NOT HAVE TO PAY IF THEY WANT TO PAGE THE\n     SYSOP. \n\n     CAN ADD AS MANY USERS AS YOU WANT TO.\n\n\n2. CREDITSPAGE.CFG\n\n   - Line 1 = 20      <- CHAT-OVERIDE-LEVEL\n   - Line 2 = 102400  <- AMMOUNT HOW MUCH A BEEP DOES COST\n   - Line 3 = 10      <- THE MAXIMUM NUMBER OF BEEPS THE COECP V1.0 WILL\n                         DO, IF THE USER HAS ENOUGH CREDITS  \n\n@ENDNODE       \n\n@NODE CREDITS "CREDITS FOR KMHH V2.1 DELUXE"\n\n   IDEA          : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   AREXX-CODING  : MuMu & nEW uSER øf OSiRiS\n   \n   DOCUMENTATION : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n\n   BETA TESTING  : MuMu - KEY WEST - OSiRiS EHQ - SCANDAL DiST SiTE\n                   DOC ICE - HEADCRASH - TSB WHQ / KBP WHQ\n                   \n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE GREETINGS "FRIENDSHIP RULEZ"\n\n               GREETINGS FROM MuMu TO THE FOLLOWING PEOPLE:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nWARLORD/SCL         - HOPE YOU WiLL PAiNT ME A COOL OSiRiS-LOGO SOON.\nCREEPY/TFP          - HOW iS iT GOiN''?\nGANDALF/SCL         - WELL, iT WAS A NiCE TiME IN FAiTH.\nRAPiD/FTH           - THANX FOR THE ANSiS.\nRAF/TFP             - THANX FOR THE KEY WEST LOGO. iT iS PRETTY NiCE.\nDiCE/TFP            - THANX FOR THE BBS-ADVERT YOU CODED FOR ME.\nWiLDSTYLE/SCL       - THANX FOR ALL YOUR HELP.\nMURDOC/NEON         - YOUR AT&T''S ARE 100% NO ViRGiN CARDS. BETTER TRY\n                      TO GET A BETTER CARD-SUPPLiER.\n \n\n                  AND A BiG HELLO TO ALL OSiRiS MEMBERS !\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE PROBS "DO YOU HAVE ANY PROBLEMS?"\n\n               FOR TROUBLE-SHOOTING OR LATEST UPDATES CALL:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n         |__\  \___________/        \/\  /________|______/|      \   \n             \__\                      \/              EaZ|_______\  \n                  OSiRiS EHQ & SCANDAL DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE             \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n\n                    » aMIGA · /X · cONSOLE · mODULES «               \n\n               aMIXPRESS v3.XX   ø   nUP & sYSTEM pW nEEDED          \n\n                    -:) cALL nOW fOR a goOD rATIO (:-                \n\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',86228,6,0,NULL,NULL,'ors_cp10','scan',1780048657);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_ga23','ORS_GA23.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS_GA23.LHA','GALAGA','XIM','GALAGA',NULL,'RD10','ORS','/  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / /       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /',replace('    _____   _____   ____ _____  _________\n   /  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__\n  /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    /\n /       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /\n \______/_______/___/___\___\___/_______/CoZ\n <-- - .p.r.e.s.e.n.t.s. f.o.r. f.u.n. - -->\n   GALAGA 2.3 unlimited money made by RD10\n','\n',char(10)),'TXT.TXT',replace('    ____     ____   ___ ______   ___   ____\n  .::::::. .::::::. :::|:::::::. :::|.::::::.           SUPPORTING: \n  :::| :::|:::| :::|:::|:::| :::|:::|:::| :::|     AMIGA-PECE-SNES-SEGA \n  :::| :::|`:::.    :::|:::|_:::'':::|`:::.     G  OSiRiS-GHQ / QuaSaR-EHQ         \n  :::| :::|  `:::.  :::|:::::::. :::|  `:::.  -H     \n  :::| :::|___ `:::|:::|:::| :::|:::|___ `:::| Q          SYSTEM:\n  :::|_:::|:::|_:::|:::|:::| :::|:::|:::|_:::|      A2000-9MB-68030/50   \n   `:::::'' `:::::::'':::|:::| :::|:::|`:::::::''     2-aNALOG 2-iSDN nODES\n                             :::|       ©JoKER        \n                             :::|                UPLOAD: 27-Sep-94 19:24:04\n                             :::|              \n                             `::|                     CALL: NOT-HERE-! \n                               `|\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',78078,2,1,'GALAGA','Doors/galaga','ors_ga23','scan',1780048657);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_go10','ORS_GO10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS_GO10.LHA','AmigaGuide','XIM','AmigaGuide',NULL,NULL,'ORS','/  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / /       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /',replace('   _____   _____   ____ _____  _________   \n  /  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ \n /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / \n/       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /  \n\______/_______/___/___\___\___/_______/CoZ\n<-- -  -     .p.r.e.s.e.n.t.s.     -  - -->\n.-----------------------------------------.\n| iMJG VERSiON 1.0 - SiMPLY THE BEST LOG- |\n|  OFF DOOR FOR ALL AMi EXPRESS VERSiONS  |\n`-----------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'iMJG10.GUiDE',replace('@DATABASE "COECP10.ENGLISH.GUIDE"\n@REMARK .------------------------------------------------------------------.\n@REMARK | This document is written in AmigaGUIDE format, so please read it |\n@REMARK | with AmigaGUIDE or your favourite guide reader.... ciao now...   |\n@REMARK `------------------------------------------------------------------''\n@REMARK $VER: COECP V1.0\n@WIDTH 80\n@NODE MAIN "Guide to iCH MUSS JETZT GEHEN V1.0 WRiTTEN BY MuMu OF OSiRiS"\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n                            ¿S pROUD tø pRESENT:\n\n                   >»»»»> iCH MUSS JETZT GEHEN V1.0 <««««<\n\n                          @{"-*-   iNTRODUCTiON   -*-" LINK INTRODUCTION}\n                          @{"-*-     FEATURES     -*-" LINK FEATURES}\n                          @{"-*-   iNSTALLATiON   -*-" LINK INSTALLATION}\n                          @{"-*-   EDIT CONFiGS   -*-" LINK CONFIGFILES}\n                          @{"-*- TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG -*-" LINK PROBS}\n                          @{"-*-    WHO DiD iT    -*-" LINK CREDITS}\n                          @{"-*-    GREETiNGS!    -*-" LINK GREETINGS}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR SLOGAN    -*-" LINK SLOGAN}\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE INTRODUCTION "INTRODUCTION OF IMJG VERSiON 1.0"\n\niCH MUSS JETZT GEHEN VERSiON 1.0 iS PROBALY THE BEST LOGOFF-DOOR ARROUND.\niT HAS @{"FEATURES" LINK FEATURES} THAT OTHER LOGOFF-DOORS DOESN''T HAVE.\n\nALL LOGOFF DOORS i HAVE SEEN HAD NO CHAT-OVERiDE-SECURiTY-LEVEL-FUNCTiON.\nTHAT MEANS EVERY USER WAS ABLE TO PAGE THE SYSOP EVEN iF HE TURNED OFF THE\nCHATFLAG. WELL, THiS iS NO BiG iNVENTiON, BUT iT DiFFERS MY DOOR FROM ANY\nOTHER LOGOFF-DOOR THAT HAS BEEN OUT YET.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF IMJG VERSiON 1.0"\n\ni DECiDED TO CODE MY OWN LOGOFF-DOOR, BECAUSE WHENEVER i iNSERTED A NEW\nNUMBER OF ANY OTHER BBS''S TO MY LOGOFF-SCREEN, THE USERS START CRYiNG,\nBEACUSE ALL OF THEM WANT A NUMBER iN MY LOGOFF-SCREEN. AFTER A WHiLE MY\nLOGOFF-SCREEN WAS THREE SCREENS LONG. NOW WHEN YOU LOG OFF YOU HAVE THE\nOPTiON TO JUMP TO A SPECiAL BBS-LiST WHiCH CAN BE EDiTED BY THE SYSOP.\ni ALSO iNCLUDED A SPECiAL GREETiNGS-LiST WHERE THE SYSOP CAN PUT iN HiS\nSPECiAL GREETiNGS.\n\nHERE ARE ALL OPTiONS:  - LOGOFF\n                       - RELOGON\n                       - BACK TO BBS\n                       - PAGE SYSOP (WiTH CHAT-OVERiDE-CHECK)\n                       - WRiTE COMMENT TO SYSOP\n                       - ENTER A MESSAGE                        \n                       - BBS-LiST\n                       - GREETiNGS\n\n\ni ALSO ADDED SOME iNFORMATiVE USER STATiSTiCS:\n \n1. HOW OFTEN DiD THE USER CALL THE BBS.\n2. HOW LONG WAS HE/SHE ON-LiNE TODAY.\n3. HOW MUCH TiME DOES HE/SHE HAVE LEFT WHEN HE/SHE CALLS AGAiN TODAY.\n4. WHAT iS THE ACTUAL TiME WHEN THE USER iS LOGGiNG OFF.\n\nTHAT ALL WiLL BE SHOW BELOW THE NORMAL LOGOFF-MENU iN THiS STYLE:\n\n\n            THANK YOU MuMu FOR CALLiNG kEY wEST bBS ...            \n                                                                   \nYOU CALLED THiS SYSTEM 746 TiMES. YOU WERE 3 MiNUTES ON-LiNE TODAY.\n                                                                   \n    YOU HAVE 1436 MiNUTES LEFT TODAY. IT iS 00:29:31 RiGHT NOW.    \n                                                                   \n                                                                   \n                        CHOOSE YOUR ACTiON :>\n\n\nAND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL IMJG VERSiON 1.0. :)\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE INSTALLATION "INSTALLATION OF IMJG VERSiON 1.0"\n\nINSTALLATION TO @{"AMI EXPRESS V2.xx" LINK AMIEXPRESSV2.xx}.\n\nINSTALLATION TO @{"AMI EXPRESS V3.xx" LINK AMIEXPRESSV3.xx}.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMIEXPRESSV2.xx "INSTALLATION TO AMI EXPRESS V2.xx"\n\nTO INSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR\nBBS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWING LINE TO THE LIST.\n\n\n          11 SPACES IN         \n          |\n------------------------------------------------          \n*G        RM010MODULES:MM_TOOLS/GEHEN/GEHEN.REXX\n------------------------------------------------\n||        |||  |           \n||        |||  ` ''MODULES:MM_TOOLS/GEHEN/GEHEN.REXX'' IS THE LOCATION OF\n||        |||     THE FILE.\n||        |||\n||        ||` 020 THE MINIMUM ACCESS TO USE THIS DOOR. CHANGE IT TO WHAT\n||        ||      YOU LIKE.\n||        ||\n||        |` ''M'' FOR A MULTINODE BBS (''S'' FOR A SINGLE NODE BBS).\n||        |\n||        ` ''R'' FOR A REXX DOOR WHICH WILL USE THE ''REXXDOOR''-UTIL.\n||\n|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.\n|\n`-RETARD OPTION. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE ''G'' & ONLY  ''G'' TO GET THE\n  DOOR TO COME UP. IF NOT USED, THINGS SUCH AS ''GOOUT'' AND ''GA'' WOULD\n  STILL BRING UP THE DOOR.\n\n\n  USE THE LINE BETWEEN THE LINES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN\n  EXPLANATION TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART IS DOING (SINCE\n  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK IN THE DAYS WHERE I DIDN''T KNOW WHAT WAS\n  GOING ON!)  \n\n  NOW COPY THE ''DODELAY''-COMMAND FROM THE C-DIRECTORY OF THE\n  LHA-ARCHIEVE INTO YOUR C-DIRECTORY.\n\n  NOW COPY THE DIRECTORY ''MODULES'' FROM THE LHA-ARCHIEV TO YOUR BBS.\n\n  AT LAST EDIT THE @{"CONFIGFILES" LINK CONFIGFILES}. YOU FIND WILL THEM IN\n \n  ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/GEHEN''.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMIEXPRESSV3.xx "INSTALLATION TO AMI EXPRESS V3.xx"\n\nYOU ONLY NEED TO COPY THE FILES FROM THE LHA-ARCHIEVE TO YOUR BBS. THEN\nEDIT THE @{"CONFIGFILES" LINK CONFIGFILES}. YOU WILL FIND THEM IN ''BBS:MODULES/ABSTURZ/COECP''.\n\nAT LAST COPY THE ''DODELAY''-COMMAND FROM THE C-DIRECTORY OF THE\nLHA-ARCHIEVE INTO YOUR C-DIRECTORY.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE CONFIGFILES "HOW TO EDIT THE CONFIGFILES?"\n\n1. GEHEN.CFG\n \n   - IN THS FILE ARE SOME IMPORTANT INFORMATIONS WHICH ARE NEEDED BY THE\n     DOOR.\n\n     1st Line = NAME OF YOUR BBS\n     2nd Line = CHAT-OVERIDE-SECURITY-LEVEL\n\n     E.G.:\n\n\n     - Line 1 = KEY WEST BBS\n     - Line 2 = 250\n\n\n2. GREETINGS.TXT\n\n     - THESE ARE YOUR PERSONAL GREETINGS.\n\n     E.G.:\n\n     - Line 1 = SPiDER/OSiRiS - THANX FOR THE SUPPORT.\n     - Line 2 = DOC ICE/TSB   - THANX FOR YOUR SOURCES.\n     - Line 3 = BLAH BLAH BLAH\n\n     - YOU CAN ADD AS MANY LINES AS YOU MIGHT WANT.\n\n   \n3. BBSLIST.TXT\n\n     - THIS IS A LIST OF SOME BBS''S.\n\n     E.G.:\n\n     - Line 1 = FUN FACTORY      - OSiRiS WHQ   - +1-619-263-5087\n     - Line 2 = KEY WEST         - OSiRiS EHQ   -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n     - Line 3 = TRADE iN CENTER  - OSiRiS GHQ   -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n\n     - YOU CAN ADD AS MANY LINES AS YOU MIGHT WANT.\n\n\n@ENDNODE       \n\n@NODE CREDITS "CREDITS FOR IMJG V1.0"\n\n   IDEA          : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   AREXX-CODING  : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   DOCUMENTATION : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n\n   BETA TESTING  : MuMu   - KEY WEST - OSiRiS EHQ - SCANDAL DiST SiTE\n                   JOKER  - MAD HOUSE - TAURUS GHQ - PROTECH GHQ\n                   DEFJAM - GANGSTARS DiSTRiCT - SCANDAL GHQ\n                   \n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE GREETINGS "FRIENDSHIP RULEZ"\n\n               GREETINGS FROM MuMu TO THE FOLLOWING PEOPLE:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nWARLORD/SCL         - HOPE YOU WiLL PAiNT ME A COOL OSiRiS-LOGO SOON.\nCREEPY/TFP          - HOW iS iT GOiN''?\nGANDALF/SCL         - WHY DON''T YOU CALL ME?\nRAPiD/FTH           - THANX FOR THE ANSiS.\nRAF/TFP             - THANX FOR THE KEY WEST LOGO. iT iS PRETTY NiCE.\nDiCE/TFP            - THANX FOR THE BBS-ADVERT YOU CODED FOR ME.\nWiLDSTYLE/SCL       - THANX FOR ALL YOUR HELP.\nMURDOC/NEON         - YOUR AT&T''S ARE 100% NO ViRGiN CARDS. BETTER TRY\n                      TO GET A BETTER CARD-SUPPLiER.\nDEFJAM              - THANX FOR BETA-TESTiNG.\n \n\n                  AND A BiG HELLO TO ALL OSiRiS MEMBERS !\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE PROBS "DO YOU HAVE ANY PROBLEMS?"\n\n               FOR TROUBLE-SHOOTING OR LATEST UPDATES CALL:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n         |__\  \___________/        \/\  /________|______/|      \   \n             \__\                      \/              EaZ|_______\  \n                  OSiRiS EHQ & SCANDAL DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE             \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n\n                    » aMIGA · /X · cONSOLE · mODULES «               \n\n               aMIXPRESS v3.XX   ø   nUP & sYSTEM pW nEEDED          \n\n                    -:) cALL nOW fOR a goOD rATIO (:-                \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE SLOGAN "OUR SLOGAN..."\n\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n\n                        - WE DON''T WANNA BE THE BEST -\n \n                       - WE JUST WANNA HAVE MORE FUN! -\n\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',88361,6,0,NULL,NULL,'ors_go10','scan',1780048657);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('ors_go15','ORS_GO15.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/ORS_GO15.LHA','AmigaGuide','XIM','AmigaGuide',NULL,NULL,'ORS','/  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / /       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /',replace('   _____   _____   ____ _____  _________   \n  /  _  \_/   _/__/___/_\_   \/___/   _/__ \n /   /   /___    /   /   /   /   /___    / \n/       /   /   /   /  _   _/   /   /   /  \n\______/_______/___/___\___\___/_______/CoZ\n<-- -  -     .p.r.e.s.e.n.t.s.     -  - -->\n.-----------------------------------------.\n| iMJG VERSiON 1.5 - SiMPLY THE BEST LOG- |\n|  OFF DOOR FOR ALL AMi EXPRESS VERSiONS  |\n`-----------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'iMJG15.GUiDE',replace('@DATABASE "iMJG15.ENGLiSH.GUiDE"\n@REMARK .------------------------------------------------------------------.\n@REMARK | This document is written in AmigaGUiDE format, so please read it |\n@REMARK | with AmigaGUiDE or your favourite guide reader.... ciao now...   |\n@REMARK `------------------------------------------------------------------''\n@REMARK $VER: iMJG V1.5\n@WiDTH 80\n@NODE MAiN "Guide to iCH MUSS JETZT GEHEN V1.5 WRiTTEN BY MuMu OF OSiRiS"\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________\n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    /\n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_\n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/\n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n                            ¿S pROUD tø pRESENT:\n\n                   >»»»»> iCH MUSS JETZT GEHEN V1.5 <««««<\n\n                          @{"-*-   iNTRODUCTiON   -*-" LiNK iNTRODUCTiON}\n                          @{"-*-     FEATURES     -*-" LiNK FEATURES}\n                          @{"-*-   iNSTALLATiON   -*-" LiNK iNSTALLATiON}\n                          @{"-*-   EDiT CONFiGS   -*-" LiNK CONFiGFiLES}\n                          @{"-*- TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG -*-" LiNK PROBS}\n                          @{"-*-    WHO DiD iT    -*-" LiNK CREDiTS}\n                          @{"-*-     HiSTORY!     -*-" LiNK HiSTORY}\n                          @{"-*-    GREETiNGS!    -*-" LiNK GREETiNGS}\n                          @{"-*-    OUR SLOGAN    -*-" LiNK SLOGAN}\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNTRODUCTiON "iNTRODUCTiON OF iMJG VERSiON 1.5"\n\niCH MUSS JETZT GEHEN VERSiON 1.5 iS PROBALY THE BEST LOGOFF-DOOR ARROUND.\niT HAS @{"FEATURES" LiNK FEATURES} THAT OTHER LOGOFF-DOORS DOESN''T HAVE.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF iMJG VERSiON 1.5"\n\ni DECiDED TO CODE MY OWN LOGOFF-DOOR, BECAUSE WHENEVER i iNSERTED A NEW\nNUMBER OF ANY OTHER BBS''S TO MY LOGOFF-SCREEN, THE USERS START CRYiNG,\nBECAUSE ALL OF THEM WANT A NUMBER iN MY LOGOFF-SCREEN. AFTER A WHiLE MY\nLOGOFF-SCREEN WAS THREE SCREENS LONG. NOW WHEN YOU LOG OFF YOU HAVE THE\nOPTiON TO JUMP TO A SPECiAL BBS-LiST WHiCH CAN BE EDiTED BY THE SYSOP.\ni ALSO iNCLUDED A SPECiAL GREETiNGS-LiST WHERE THE SYSOP CAN PUT iN HiS\nSPECiAL GREETiNGS.\n\nALL LOGOFF DOORS i HAVE SEEN HAD NO CHAT-OVERiDE-SECURiTY-LEVEL-FUNCTiON.\nTHAT MEANS EVERY USER WAS ABLE TO PAGE THE SYSOP EVEN iF HE TURNED OFF THE\nCHATFLAG. WELL, THiS iS NO BiG iNVENTiON, BUT iT DiFFERS MY DOOR FROM ANY\nOTHER LOGOFF-DOOR THAT HAS BEEN OUT YET.\n\nHERE ARE ALL OPTiONS:  - LOGOFF\n                       - RELOGON\n                       - BACK TO BBS\n                       - PAGE SYSOP (WiTH CHAT-OVERiDE-CHECK)\n                       - WRiTE COMMENT TO SYSOP\n                       - ENTER A MESSAGE                        \n                       - BBS-LiST\n                       - GREETiNGS\n\n\ni ALSO ADDED SOME iNFORMATiVE USER STATiSTiCS:\n \n1. HOW OFTEN DiD THE USER CALL THE BBS.\n2. HOW LONG WAS HE/SHE ON-LiNE TODAY.\n3. HOW MUCH TiME DOES HE/SHE HAVE LEFT WHEN HE/SHE CALLS AGAiN TODAY.\n4. WHAT iS THE ACTUAL TiME WHEN THE USER iS LOGGiNG OFF.\n\nTHAT ALL WiLL BE SHOW BELOW THE NORMAL LOGOFF-MENU iN THiS STYLE:\n\n\n            THANK YOU MuMu FOR CALLiNG kEY wEST bBS ...            \n                                                                   \nYOU CALLED THiS SYSTEM 746 TiMES. YOU WERE 3 MiNUTES ON-LiNE TODAY.\n                                                                   \n    YOU HAVE 1436 MiNUTES LEFT TODAY. iT iS 00:29:31 RiGHT NOW.    \n                                                                   \n                                                                   \n                        CHOOSE YOUR ACTiON :>\n\n\nMAYBE SOME USERS DON''T WANT TO SEE THE LOGOFF-MENU. PUHH!!! THAT''S HARD,\nBUT NO PROBLEM. WHEN A USER LOGS OFF THE FiRST TiME, THE DOOR WiLL iNFORM\nHiM, THAT HE HAS NO CONFiG-FiLE. NOW THE USER CAN TYPE iN ''G W'' FROM THE\nMAiN-PROMPT AND THEN HE CAN CHOOSE iF HE WANTS TO SEE THE LOGOFF-MENU OR\nNOT WHENEVER HE LOGS OFF. iMJG WiLL AUTOMATiCALLY WRiTE A CONFiG-FiLE FOR\nEACH USER. iF A USER HAS NO CONFiG-FiLE iMJG WiLL iNFORM HiM.\n\ni ALSO ADDED AN ADDiTiONAL EXTERNAL PROGRAM. ALL OLDER VERSiONS HAVE HAD THE\nPROBLEM THAT THE LOGOFF DOOR DiD NOT SHOW THE REAL-ON-LiNE TiME OF A USER\nWHEN HE/SHE CHATTED WiTH THE SYSOP. THiS WAS BECAUSE /X STOPS COUNTiNG THE\nTiME WHEN A USER ENTERS THE CHAT-MODE WiTH THE SYSOP. WiTH THE SMALL\nEXTERNAL PROGRAM iT DOESN''T MATTER. NOW iMJG WiLL SHOW THE CORRECT ONLiNE-\nTiME WHEN HE LOGS OFF.\n\nTHERE iS ONE SMALL EXCEPTiON. iMJG WiLL NOT SHOW THE REAL ON-LiNE-TiME\niF THE USER WHO LOGS iN DOES NOT PASS THE EXTERNAL TiME-COUNTER. THiS\nPROBABLY ONLY MiGHT HAPPEN iF THE SYSOP LOGS iN WiTH A SYSOP-LOGiN AND THE\nEXTERNAL PROGRAM iS BUiLT iNTO THE LOGON-SCREEN ViA MCi-COMMANDS. ALL\nOTHER WAYS iT WiLL WORK 100%.\n\n\nAND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL iMJG VERSiON 1.5. :)\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF iMJG VERSiON 1.5"\n\niNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V2.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV2.xx}.\n\niNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V3.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV3.xx}.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMiEXPRESSV2.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V2.xx"\n\nTO iNSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR\nBBS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWiNG LiNE TO THE LiST.\n\n\n          11 SPACES iN         \n          |\n------------------------------------------------          \n*G        RM010MODULES:MM_TOOLS/GEHEN/GEHEN.REXX\n------------------------------------------------\n||        |||  |           \n||        |||  ` ''MODULES:MM_TOOLS/GEHEN/GEHEN.REXX'' iS THE LOCATiON OF\n||        |||     THE FiLE.\n||        |||\n||        ||` 020 THE MiNiMUM ACCESS TO USE THiS DOOR. CHANGE iT TO WHAT\n||        ||      YOU LiKE.\n||        ||\n||        |` ''M'' FOR A MULTiNODE BBS (''S'' FOR A SiNGLE NODE BBS).\n||        |\n||        ` ''R'' FOR A REXX DOOR WHiCH WiLL USE THE ''REXXDOOR''-UTiL.\n||\n|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.\n|\n`-RETARD OPTiON. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE ''G'' & ONLY  ''G'' TO GET THE\n  DOOR TO COME UP. iF NOT USED, THiNGS SUCH AS ''GOOUT'' AND ''GA'' WOULD\n  STiLL BRiNG UP THE DOOR.\n\n\n  USE THE LiNE BETWEEN THE LiNES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN\n  EXPLANATiON TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART iS DOiNG (SiNCE\n  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK iN THE DAYS WHERE i DiDN''T KNOW WHAT WAS\n  GOiNG ON!)  \n\n  NOW COPY THE ''DODELAY''-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE\n  LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.\n\n  NOW COPY THE DiRECTORY ''MODULES'' FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.\n\n  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"CONFiGFiLES" LiNK CONFiGFiLES}. YOU FiND WiLL THEM iN\n \n  ''BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/GEHEN''.\n\n\n  THE VERY LAST THiNG TO DO iS TO iNSTALL THE ''ZEiT.REXX''. THE BEST WAY\n  iS TO iT iNTO THE LOGON-SCREEN. HERE COMES HOW iT WORKS.\n\n  ADD THE FOLLOWiNG TO YOUR LOGON.TXT AND LOGON.TXT.GR:\n\n\n  --------------CUT HERE----------------\n  ~CC_ZEiT\n  --------------CUT HERE----------------\n\n\n  TO iNSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR\n  SYS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWiNG LiNE TO THE LiST.\n\n          11 SPACES iN         \n          |\n-----------------------------------------------          \n*ZEiT     RM010MODULES:MM_TOOLS/GEHEN/ZEiT.REXX\n-----------------------------------------------\n\n  THAT iS ALL...\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE AMiEXPRESSV3.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V3.xx"\n\nADD THE FOLLOWiNG TO YOUR LOGON.TXT AND LOGON.TXT.GR:\n\n\n--------------CUT HERE----------------\n~CC_ZEiT\n--------------CUT HERE----------------\n\n\nTHE LAST TO DO iS TO COPY THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEVE TO YOUR BBS. THEN\nEDiT THE @{"CONFiGFiLES" LiNK CONFiGFiLES}. YOU WiLL FiND THEM iN ''BBS:MODULES/ABSTURZ/COECP''.\n\nAT LAST COPY THE ''DODELAY''-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE\nLHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE CONFiGFiLES "HOW TO EDiT THE CONFiGFiLES?"\n\n1. GEHEN.CFG\n \n   - iN THS FiLE ARE SOME iMPORTANT iNFORMATiONS WHiCH ARE NEEDED BY THE\n     DOOR.\n\n     1st Line = NAME OF YOUR BBS\n     2nd Line = CHAT-OVERiDE-SECURiTY-LEVEL\n\n     E.G.:\n\n\n     - Line 1 = KEY WEST BBS\n     - Line 2 = 250\n\n\n2. GREETiNGS.TXT\n\n     - THESE ARE YOUR PERSONAL GREETiNGS.\n\n     E.G.:\n\n     - Line 1 = SPiDER/OSiRiS - THANX FOR THE SUPPORT.\n     - Line 2 = DOC iCE/TSB   - THANX FOR YOUR SOURCES.\n     - Line 3 = BLAH BLAH BLAH\n\n     - YOU CAN ADD AS MANY LiNES AS YOU MiGHT WANT.\n\n   \n3. BBSLiST.TXT\n\n     - THiS iS A LiST OF SOME BBS''S.\n\n     E.G.:\n\n     - Line 1 = FUN FACTORY      - OSiRiS WHQ   - +1-619-263-5087\n     - Line 2 = KEY WEST         - OSiRiS EHQ   -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n     - Line 3 = TRADE iN CENTER  - OSiRiS GHQ   -   +49-ASK-ELiTE\n\n     - YOU CAN ADD AS MANY LiNES AS YOU MiGHT WANT.\n\n\n@ENDNODE       \n\n@NODE CREDiTS "CREDiTS FOR iMJG V1.5"\n\n   iDEA          : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   AREXX-CODiNG  : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n   \n   DOCUMENTATiON : MuMu øf OSiRiS\n\n   BETA TESTiNG  : MuMu   - KEY WEST - OSiRiS EHQ - SCANDAL DiST SiTE\n                   JOKER  - MAD HOUSE - TAURUS GHQ - PROTECH GHQ\n                   DEFJAM - GANGSTARS DiSTRiCT - SCANDAL GHQ\n                   \n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE GREETiNGS "FRiENDSHiP RULEZ"\n\n               GREETiNGS FROM MuMu TO THE FOLLOWiNG PEOPLE:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nCREEPY/TFP          - HOW iS iT GOiN''?\nGANDALF/SCL         - WHY DON''T YOU CALL ME?\nRAPiD/SCL           - THANX FOR THE ANSiS.\nRAF/TFP             - THANX FOR THE KEY WEST LOGO. iT iS PRETTY NiCE.\nDiCE/TFP            - THANX FOR THE BBS-ADVERT YOU CODED FOR ME.\nMURDOC/NEON         - YOUR AT&T''S ARE 100% NO ViRGiN CARDS. BETTER TRY\n                      TO GET A BETTER CARD-SUPPLiER.\nDEFJAM              - THANX FOR BETA-TESTiNG.\n \n\n                  AND A BiG HELLO TO ALL OSiRiS MEMBERS !\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE PROBS "DO YOU HAVE ANY PROBLEMS?"\n\n               FOR TROUBLE-SHOOTiNG OR LATEST UPDATES CALL:\n              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                 sYSOP: MuMu    «·»    1 nODE - 16.8k DHST       \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n               ___                 \          /                      \n        ______/  /___  __  __    ___\        /____  _______________  \n        \_   /  /__  \/  \/  \   \   \      /___  \/  ____/\__    /  \n         | _/ _/ _/  /   /   /    \  /\    /  _/  /\____ \_   \__/   \n         | \  \  \__/\__    /  ·   \   \  /   \__/|    /  /     \    \n         |__\  \___________/        \/\  /________|______/|      \   \n             \__\                      \/              EaZ|_______\  \n                  OSiRiS EHQ & SCANDAL DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE             \n      - -- --- --------------------------------------------- --- -- -\n\n                    » aMiGA · /X · cONSOLE · mODULES «               \n\n               aMiXPRESS v3.XX   ø   nUP & sYSTEM pW nEEDED          \n\n                    -:) cALL nOW fOR a goOD rATiO (:-                \n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE SLOGAN "OUR SLOGAN..."\n\n                                   /\            /\            \n               ___________________/  \__________/  \__________ \n               \_  _   _    _    /  __   _     /  __    _    / \n               /   |   \    |___/\__/\  _|   _/\__/\    |___/_ \n              /    |    \____     \   \  \      /   \____     \\n              \    |    /   /     /   /  |\    /    /   /     /\n               \_______/_________/___/___| \  /____/_________/ \n                                            \/         ©JoKER\n\n                        - WE DON''T WANNA BE THE BEST -\n \n                       - WE JUST WANNA HAVE MORE FUN! -\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE HiSTORY "THE HiSTORY OF ''iCH MUSS JETZT GEHEN''"\n\n                    THE HiSTORY OF ''iCH MUSS JETZT GEHEN''\n                   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nVERSiON 0.1 : iiNTERNAL RELEASE\n              SiMPLE LOGOFF DOOR - UGLY LOOK - ONLY 3 FUNCTiONS\n\nVERSiON 0.2 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n              BETTER LOOK\n\nVERSiON 0.3 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n              2 NEW FUNCTiONS ADDED\n\nVERSiON 0.4 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n              SOME BUGS REMOVED\n\nVERSiON 0.5 : iNTERNAL RELEASE\n              CHAT-OVERiDE-FUNCTiON ADDED\n\nVERSiON 0.6 : BETA RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 0.7 : SOME BUGS REMOVED\n\nVERSiON 0.8 : BETA RELEASE\n\nVERSiON 0.9 : FiNAL BETA VERSiON\n\nVERSiON 1.0 : PUBLiC VERSiON\n              RELEASE DATE: 03-01-94\n\nVERSiON 1.1 : iNTERNAL VERSiON\n              REAL ONLiNE-TiME FUNCTiON ADDED\n\nVERSiON 1.2 : SOME BUGS REMOVED\n\nVERSiON 1.3 : BETA RELEASE\n              CONFiG-FiLE FOR EACH USER ADDED\n\nVERSiON 1.4 : SOME MiNOR BUGS REMOVED \n\nVERSiON 1.5 : FiNAL RELEASE VERSiON\n              SOME SCREEN-BUGS REMOVED, ADVANCED CONFiG-FiLE FOR\n              EACH USER, BETTER LOOK\n\n@ENDNODE\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',145149,12,0,NULL,NULL,'ors_go15','scan',1780048657);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('oset10','OSET10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/OSET10.LHA','oNYxSETTINGS','XIM','.------------------------------------------.',NULL,'cLYDE',NULL,'| oNYxSETTINGS v1.0 bY cLYDE rADCLIFFE/SAD | |------------------------------------------| | Enhanced version of AquaSettings "W"-Door|',replace('.------------------------------------------.\n| oNYxSETTINGS v1.0 bY cLYDE rADCLIFFE/SAD |\n|------------------------------------------|\n| Enhanced version of AquaSettings "W"-Door|\n| Now 100% ASM, 100% Configurable Output,  |\n| Level For Each Command and more...       |\n`------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'oNYxSETTINGS.doc',replace('\n             .----------------------------------------------------------------.\n             ¡ iT`s aNOTHER                                 ______            ¡\n_ ___________!_________ ___________ ____________ ___________\____/_ ________  |\n        ____/_    ____/____  ___  /___     __  /_______   _/_     /    ____/__|\n _ ___       /            /  \___/   /  ______/    |        /    /            |\n_ __________/____________/__________/ ____|        l_______/____/__________ _ |\n             !                                                                |\n             ! .                                         /X DESIGN Production !\n             : .                                           ·                  :\n      .  .:.--¡!-------------------------------------------¡:---.             .\n:  : :: :::|  !: oNYxSETTINGS v1.0 by cLYDE rADCLIFFE/SAD! !¡   |::: :: :  :  :\n      ·  ·:`--:--------------------------------------------:!---''             ¡\n             !                                              :                 !\n             `----------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n     NOTICE THAT THE IDEA AND VERY FIRST DOOR OF THIS TYPE WAS CODED BY\n\n                              * AQUARIUS/OTL *\n\n\n.-==========================================================================-.\n|:::::::::::::::::::::::: oNYxSETTINGS Version 1.0 ::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\n`-==========================================================================-''\n\nThis small AmiExpress®-door let you enhance the internal-settings-door from\nAmiExpress so that you can install other configoptions from other doors like\nnewscan, or whatever into the menu!\n\nThe selection of the menu-points can made directly from the command-line\nExample: "W 1"\n\nNOTE: oNYxSETTINGS + StartIntern able to made resident\n      The location of oNYxSETTINGS is also variable so that you can\n      place it wherever you want, but remember to change the ToolTypes!\n\nI''ve also included some nice "Design Examples" in the Tooltypes you''ve simply\nremove the ";" infront of the ToolTypes\n\n.-=========================================================================-.\n|:::::::::::::::::::::::::::: (C)opyright Notes ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\n`-=========================================================================-''\n\n                 Permission is granted to freely distribute\n               this product for non-commercial purposes only,\n                   as long as all files remain unmodified.\n\n   It`s not allowed to make any kind of PROFIT with this programm without\n          having a WRITTEN permission signed by the AUTHOR himself!\n\n              All © and Written 1995 Sceptic Amiexpress Design\n\nWITH THE USAGE OF oNYxSETTINGS YOU AGREE THAT:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nTHERE  IS  NO LIABILITY TO THIS PROGRAM-PACKAGE, IN REFERENCE TO THE ASSERTED\nLAWS.  THE COPYRIGHT OWNERS, AND/OR A THIRD PARTY, PLACE THIS PROGRAM PACKAGE\nAT  YOUR  DISPOSAL  "AS  IS"  (EXCEPT  WHERE THIS IS FIXED ANYWHERE ELSE IN A\nWRITTEN  WAY)  WITHOUT  ANY  GUARANTEE IN ANY FORM (INDIRECT OR DIRECT FORM).\nTHE  FULL  RISK  OF QUALITY AND FUNCTIONALITY OF THIS PROGRAM IS AT YOUR OWN.\nIF  THE  PROGRAM  HAS  A  BUG,  YOU  HAVE  TO  PAY ALL COSTS OF THE NECESSARY\nSERVICE-WORKS AND REPAIRS FOR YOURSELF.\n\nUNDER  NO  CIRCUMSTANCES,  THE COPYRIGHT OWNERS OR A THIRD PARTY DISTRIBUTING\nTHIS  PROGRAM  PACKAGE,  AS ALLOWED, JUST BEFORE, CAN NOT BE HELD RESPONSIBLE\nFOR  ANY  DAMAGE  CAUSED  IN  ANY USUAL, SPECIAL, OR ACCIDENTAL WAY OR BY THE\nPROGRAM  PACKAGE  (SURROUNDING BUT NOT RESTRICTED ARE THE LOSS OF DATA OR NOT\nCORRECTLY  DISPLAYED  DATA  OR  LOSSES CAUSED BY YOU OR A THIRD PARTY OR BY A\nFAULTY  WORK  OF THIS PROGRAM PACKAGE WITH OTHER PROGRAMS), ALSO IF THE OWNER\nOR A THIRD PARTY HAS BEEN POINTED AT SUCH POSSIBILITIES OF DAMAGE.\n\n.-=========================================================================-.\n|:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::: Requirements :::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\n`-=========================================================================-''\n\n · An Amiga with Kickstart 2.0+\n · AmiExpress v2.x / SigmaExpress or compatible programs\n\n.-=========================================================================-.\n|:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::: Installation :::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\n`-=========================================================================-''\n\nCopy all Files from the "Doors"-directory into your "Doors:"-Assign\n\nDelete The Doors:oNYxSETTINGS/oNYxSETTINGS.info, if you are using oNYxICONS\n(also available from me OICONS10.LHA), otherwise delete the .icfg-File.\n\n/X 3.x+ Users can delete The Doors:oNYxSETTINGS/StartIntern because it''s only\nused to start an internal door on /X 2.x or S!X\n\nCommand-Installation:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n* For /X 2.x or S!X: Add the Commands/BBS.CMD-File To Your Own \n                     BBS:Commands/BBS.CMD File.\n\n* For /X 3.x+ WITH oNYxICONS: Copy The ".icfg"-Files into the corresponding\n                              directories of your BBS: .\n\n* For /X 3.x+ without oNYxICONS: Copy The Icons (.info-Files) into the \n                                 corresponding directories of your BBS: .\n\n\n.-=========================================================================-.\n|:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::: Configuration ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\n`-=========================================================================-''\n \nToolTypes from Doors:oNYxSETTINGS/oNYxSETTINGS.icfg or .info \n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTemplate: STARTTEXT=<string>                                        Optional.\nExample : STARTTEXT=[0;35m--- [36mUser Configuration[35m ---[0m\n\nThis string is displayed before the menu (DON''T INCLUDE A CLEARSCREEN HERE,\nBECAUSE THE DOOR LOOKS FOR THE SCREENCLEAR-FLAG OF THE USER)\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTemplate: BEGINDESC=<string>                                        Optional.\nExample : BEGINDESC=[32m[ [33m\n\nThis string is displayed directly before the number of the menu-point\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTemplate: MIDDESC=<string>                                          Optional.\nExample : MIDDESC=[32m] [36m\n\nThis string is displayed right after the menu-point number (before the\ndescription of the command)\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTemplate: PROMPT=<string>                                           Optional.\nExample : PROMPT=[36mYour choice, [32m([33mEnter[32m)[36m=Quit : [0m\n\nThis string is displayed after all menu-points has been displayed.. so it''s\nThe "ComeOnAndGiveMeTheNumber:" Text :)\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTemplate: ACCESS=<access level>                                     Optional.\nExample : ACCESS=20\n\nIf the user has a lower access level then the door only starts the internal\n"W"-Door.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTemplate: CMD.<num>(.<access level>)=<command>                   ()=Optional.\nExample : CMD.2=CF\n          CMD.3.60=N W\n\nWith this ToolType you specify the <command> for each menu-point, you can\nalso specify a level for the command, if the userlevel is lower than the\nspecified it woldn''t include the command into the menu (if only 1 menu-point\nis selectable it will automaticly start the command, if no menu-point is\nselectable it will automaticly start the internal "W"-Door)\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTemplate: DESC.<num>=<string>\nExample : DESC.2=Conference flags\n\nThis string is the description for the command, DESC.1 if the description for\nCMD.1 and DESC.2 for CMD.2 and so on.\n\n.-=========================================================================-.\n|:::::::::::::::::::::::::: Program Informations :::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\n`-=========================================================================-''\n\n   oNYxSETTINGS Version 1.0 has entirely been coded by cLYDE rADCLIFFE/SAD!\n\n              In 100% 68000 Assembler with ASM-One 1.28 by TFA\n\n Processor...........:  MC680x0\n\n Source Code..oNYxSETTINGS: 17183 Bytes in 703 Lines + Include\n ..............StartIntern:  2065 Bytes in  91 Lines + Include\n\n Executable...oNYxSETTINGS: 1988 Bytes\n ..............StartIntern:  512 Bytes\n\n.-=========================================================================-.\n|::::::::::::::::::::::::::::: How To Contact ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\n`-=========================================================================-''\n\n...Me\n\nEvil Moon     (WHO CARES) +49-3322-208768 - 1ND 33k6 (sYSOP: cLYDE rADCLIFFE)\n\n...Or Worldwide\n\nThe Pub             (WHQ) +49-5551-65139  - 1ND 28k8 (sYSOP:           Fli7e)\nSilent Service     (DIST) +614 955 5119   - 1ND 28k8 (sYSOP:       Rudolf H.)\nRaveLand            (GHQ) +49-7128-3511   - 1ND 28k8 (sYSOP:            H2O!)\nForbidden Planet (IRL-HQ) +353-1-820 8489 - 2ND 33k6 (sYSOP:     Green-Beret)\nAltered Reality    (DIST) +1-305-677-8924 - 3ND\n\n.-=========================================================================-.\n|:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::: About SAD ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::|\n`-=========================================================================-''\n\nFLITE''S WRITING!\n\n    We in SAD are searching some good /X-Door and Tool coder (AIM, XIM etc.)\n\n        If you`re searching a NICE and "WANT-TO-BE-ACTIVE" group then we\n                       might be the right choice for YOU!\n\n      You`ve NOT to leave your actual Group, you can join us just for /X!\n\n       So if you`re a C, E, ASM, AREXX coder or an ANSI artist or a SYSOP\n     who like to open a DST SITE (BETA SITE) then just get in contact with\n\n                                     FLI7e\n\n                         Some closer Information on SAD\n                        +------------------------------+\n\n    SCEPTIC itself was founded in the early month of 1992! We released some\n             demos, intros, trainers, patches and ansi collections.\n\n      Our most famous production was CHIPMANIA (soon to be released under the\n                 HAUJOBB label because I (fli7e) joined them!)\n\n      Then .. In summer 1994 I kicked all inactive members and decided to\n     change the way we go! DEMO-GROUP .. R.I.P .. /X + Toolgroup .. ALIVE!\n\n   From there on we worked a long time in the underground .. NO RELEASES ..!\n\n   But that should change NOW! With your help a famous group could be REBORN!\n\n                                Actual "MEMBERS"\n\n            FLi7e/HAUJOBB ^ N-JOY ^ SAD    (Leader, /X CODER, SYSOP)\n            cLYDE rADCLIFFE/SAD                    (/X CODER, SYSOP)\n            H2o/SAD                            (AZZKY Layout, SYSOP)\n            PIWI/SAD                                      (/X CODER)\n            SLY/SAD                              (TRADER & /X CODER)\n            CASIO/SAD                                        (CODER)\n            WIGWAM/SAD                                       (CODER)\n            SHADOWMASTER/IFT^SAD                          (/X CODER)\n            COUGAR/HOODLUM                             (BETA TESTER)\n\n  Well, not that much I think! And because of that we`ll try to strike again!\n\n                         ·W·I·T·H· ·Y·O·U·R· ·H·E·L·P·\n\n                             !KEEP THE CULT GOING!\n','\n',char(10)),'{"ACCESS":"<access"}',NULL,45053,1,0,NULL,NULL,'oset10_onyxsettings','scan',1780048664);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('otl_aa','OTL-AA.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/OTL-AA.LHA','AquaAdder','XIM','AquaAdder',NULL,'Aquarius/OTL','OTL','/  \___\___   __/   /  _ \     /  _/  ___/ /    \  |  |   |/  _/\  |  \   /\  |____ \ /  Mb  \ |  |   /   |  \ _   \_     |   /  \',replace('   __    /\________________/\_______________\n  /  \___\___   __/   /  _ \     /  _/  ___/\n /    \  |  |   |/  _/\  |  \   /\  |____ \\n/  Mb  \ |  |   /   |  \ _   \_     |   /  \\n\______/    |___\_______\|____/ /\__|______/\n- ---`------''--------`---''----\/------- -- -\n- -->> AquaAdder v1.0 by Aquarius/OTL <<-- -\n- -- ------- ------------------ ------- -- -\n- -- -(- a fast ''n sexy text adder! -)- -- -\n- -- ------- ------------------ ------- -- -\n','\n',char(10)),'AquaAdder.doc',replace('\n       _ _ ___/\______/\__ ____/\___/\__ _ _/\____ _/\_ __ __/\______\n      __ ________   __   /   _   ___   / ______   \___/__/     _____/\n         bIS/   /   /   /   //   //   /___/ __¬   /  /  /  /\__   \\n           /   /   /   /   //   //   /   /  \    /  /  /  /   /   /\n    __  _ _\____  /\____  //_  //_____  /___/\  /\_____  /\ _/   /___\n     _  ___ _   \/  _  _\/_  \/____ __\/ ___ _\/_______\/____   /_ _/\n                                                            \  /\n                                  present                    \/\n\n                 >>> AquaAdder v1.0 by Aquarius/Outlaws <<<\n\n\n                          Copyright ©1994 Aquarius\n\n                 Permission is granted to freely distribute\n               this product for non-commercial purposes only,\n                  as long as all files remain unmodified.\n\n\n\nArchive (OTL-AA10.LHA) Contents\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nAquaAdder.doc                5085 bytes   This document file.\nAquaAdder.iff                2052 bytes   IFF picture of the output.\nBBS/FCheck/DOC.info           542 bytes   Icon for /X 3.x+.\nBBS/FCheck/DOK.info           542 bytes   Icon for /X 3.x+.\nBBS/FCheck/NFO.info           542 bytes   Icon for /X 3.x+.\nBBS/FCheck/TXT.info           542 bytes   Icon for /X 3.x+.\nC/AquaAdder                  3380 bytes   The executable.\nS/AquaAdder.Head              815 bytes   Sample header text.\nS/AquaAdder.Tail             1371 bytes   Sample tailer text.\n\n\nIntroduction\n~~~~~~~~~~~~\nAquaAdder is a text adder! It takes a text file and adds a header\n(S:AquaAdder.Head) and a tailer (S:AquaAdder.Tail) to it. It can be used both\nfrom shell and in BBS systems like AmiExpress.\n\n\nFeatures\n~~~~~~~~\nIt can insert time and date anywhere you like in the header and the tailer.\nThere are two time formats available (HH:MM and HH:MM:SS), and two date\nformats (DD-MMM-YY and MM-DD-YY).\n\nIt is very FAST - as fast as a text adder can be!! Maybe even faster...\n\nAquaAdder is completely system friendly and safe. No memory losses, Enforcer\nhits or any other crash risks.\n\nIf header + tailer + text file don''t fit in memory, the tool enters\n"low-memory mode"; it tries to load only the tailer, to append it. The header\nwon''t be inserted then.\n\nIt is "pure" and can therefore be made resident.\n\nThe output is extremely cool! :) (Look at the IFF picture..)\n\n\nRequirements\n~~~~~~~~~~~~\nAquaAdder requires an Amiga with OS 2.04 or higher.\n\n\nUsage\n~~~~~\nThe command syntax is:\n\nAquaAdder <TextFile>\n\n\nExample:\n\nAquaAdder dh3:tmp/god-bnbr.doc\n\n\nIf you are going to use this tool with AmiExpress 3.x or higher, copy the\nprovided icon ''TXT.info'' to BBS:FCheck/ and duplicate it for every other text\nfile extension: NFO.info, DOC.info, DOK.info etc.\n\nThere is just ONE error message that AmiExpress should recognize as an error\nthat should move the file to HOLD, and that string is "ERROR: Failed to\nwrite" or just "Failed to write". The other possible error messages, for\nexample "ERROR: Failed to open S:AquaAdder.Head!", should NOT cause the\nuploaded file to be put in HOLD.\n\n\nThe Header and Tailer\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nS:AquaAdder.Head is the file that will be put in front of the text file.\nS:AquaAdder.Tail will be put at the end. The header and the tailer may\ncontain codes that will be replaced by the current time and date\nrespectively. The possible codes are:\n\nCode        Format      Example\n---------   ---------   -------\n$TIME       HH:MM       14:52\n$TIMESEC    HH:MM:SS    14:52:45\n$DATE_DOS   DD-MMM-YY   29-Sep-94\n$DATE_US    MM-DD-YY    09-29-94\n\nFor example, if S:AquaAdder.Tail contains the string ''$DATE_DOS'', then that\nstring will be replaced by the current date formatted as ''DD-MMM-YY'', for\ninstance ''29-Sep-94''.\n\n\nContact Me!\n~~~~~~~~~~~\nIf you have any cool ideas for improvement of this tool, questions, bug\nreports or whatever, leave me a message on one of the following boards:\n\nNIGHTFALL ................ Whoosh ............ +46-90-120369  <---  Safest\nHALL OF FAME ............. Dansken ........... +46-910-26665      place to\nHYSTERIA ................. JAC ............... +46-21-842939     reach me!\nMASTURBATION STATION ..... Black Beard ....... +1-305-552-1192\nZION''S HIDEOUT ........... Zion .............. +1-614-876-0807\nDARK TOWER ............... Shadower .......... +1-801-476-9068\nMORTUARY ................. Bloodwolf ......... +1-312-284-7577\nBOONDOCKS ................ Sal-One! .......... +31-548-040-653\n\n\nHistory\n~~~~~~~\n1.0  (11-19-94) First release version.\n\n\nGreetings\n~~~~~~~~~\n                Greetings must go to (in no special order):\n\n           - Vegas/OTL - Biscrok/OTL - Toxic/OTL - AtomiX!/OTL -\n       - Whoosh/OTT^DVS^OTL^CLS - Snake/OTL - Nashua/OTL - SMS/OTL -\n   - Genghis Khan/OTL - Json/OTL - Jawlog/OTL - The Other OTL Members! -\n  - Dansken - CornFlake - Ace Caze - Firehawk! - fanta/THR - Static/THR -\n- JAz - FAX - Juan - Psychopath - Danzig - Sal-One - Metalbasher - BoneIdle -\n  - Wilsom/Obscene - Rize & Frosty - Norad - Doc Whoo - Zion! - MDR/OTT -\n     - WarDancer - Princip - Ezco - Vampire/PDY - The Ones I Forgot! -\n\n\n[EOF]\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',8988,2,0,NULL,NULL,'otl_aa','scan',1780048664);
