e\nLiTHiUM     ·»>  Is your CAPS LOCK broke or what??\nWHiZ        ·»>  What are your new numbers??\n\n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n      ____     ______   ____     ____     ____    _____            HOSTED BY\n    ._\ . \_ __\ ___/___\ . \ ___\ . \ ___\ . \___\ __ \ _____.    \n   _|   |___)\_ _.__)\_   |  \\__. |  \\_  _| __))  \_  \\_.  |___[-lEPROSY-]\n   \    |   \   \|   \    |_  \  : |_ _\_  \.   \    |   \ :  |   \ EXTREME!\n    \   |    \___.    \____/   \___|\   \___l_   \___|    \ _ |    \_\n  .  \  |     /  l_____/ \      /  : \___/   \    /  l_____X  |     /\n  :   \ ·    /            \    /_ -+-----+-   \  /          \ ·    /\n.-:----\    /--------------\  /:-· :(rN!):     \/ .------.  /\    / PRiMUS WhQ\n ¯      \  /    ______    __\/_:___÷----_÷______  : .--. : / ·\  / ANTHROX BhQ\n         \/.____\ .   \ __\   __   \ ___\   .   \_.------./   \\/   REFLEX BhQ\n           |_  _ _|    \\_    \_    \\_    _| ____)) )   |  ___/_ PURPLE TURTLE\n           |\_ \_\      \_     |     \     \.     \      .       \     SITE\n           !      \______/_____|      \_____|_     \_____|        \_\n           :______:______      l_______/     \      /    l_________/\n    .-------------:------·                    \    /\n    `-------------:----------.                 \  /-fOREIGN tOPUPLOADERS\n                   ¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯                   \/-dISABLED fOR eVERYBODY!\n\n                      3 NODES DUAL RINGDOWN  +32-897-16488\n\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',13696,7,0,NULL,NULL,'ps_spg1','scan',1780048679);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('psi_fo10','PSI_FO10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/PSI_FO10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','exe.-l0S-eND0S-bBS-.exe',NULL,NULL,'PSI',NULL,replace('Fuck Off 1.0 A Logoff Door for LamiEx 2.0X+\n','\n',char(10)),'FuckOff.Doc',replace('               ®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®\n               ®®                                     ®®\n               ®       hANNiBAL lECTeR oF PSiONiC      ®\n               ®                                       ®\n               ®             pRESENTs tODAy            ®\n               ®                                       ®\n               ®              FuckOff v1.O             ®\n               ®                                       ®\n               ®          a lOGOFf dOOr fOr /X         ®\n               ®®                                     ®®\n               ®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®® /X DEZiGN ®®®®®®\n\n\n                               ·PURPOSE·\n-============================================================================-\n\n A LogOff door for AmiExpress, you can download latest board add, leave a\n message to next user etc.\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n\n                            ·REQUIREMENTS·\n-============================================================================-\n\n Any AmiExpress version ranging from v2.xx-v3.xx\n Don''t know if it will work with any version less or higher, test!\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n\n                            ·INSTALLATION·\n-============================================================================-\n\n AE 3.xx:\n\n - Copy the FuckOff directory directly to DOORS:\n - Copy G.info to BBS:COMMANDS/BBCMD/\n - Copy your latest board add to BBS: and name it FUCKOFF.ADD\n - Add this text to a logontext: (like LOGON.TXT)\n\n------------------------------[ CUT HERE ]----------------------\n~\n                      -:> Message From Last Caller <:-\n\n\n~SS_BBS:FuckOff.txt\n------------------------------[ CUT HERE ]----------------------\n\n\n AE 2.xx:\n\n - Copy the FuckOff directory directly to DOORS:\n - Then add this to your BBS:COMMANDS/BBS.cmd file\n\n *G        XM001DOORS:FUCKOFF/FUCKOFF.X\n  ^        ^ ^  ^\n  |        | |  `--> Location of the door\n  |        | `-----> Access needed to run the door\n  |        `-------> MUST begin on column 11\n  `----------------> Command to star the door with\n\n - Copy your latest board add to BBS: and name it FUCKOFF.ADD\n - Add this text to a logontext: (like LOGON.TXT)\n\n------------------------------[ CUT HERE ]----------------------\n~\n                      -:> Message From Last Caller <:-\n\n\n~SS_BBS:FuckOff.txt\n------------------------------[ CUT HERE ]----------------------\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                                 ·USAGE·\n-============================================================================-\n\n Type G at the main screen in AmiExpress, there will come up a screen where\n you can choose some different stuff, look for yourself.\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                            ·ERROR MESSAGES·\n-============================================================================-\n\n There are no error messages at this moment.\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                       ·SUGGESTIONS & BUGREPORTS·\n-============================================================================-\n\n If there by any chance should occur any problem or you should find a bug\n in this door then you can contact me or leave me a message on my board:\n\n                      CHaOS    +46 (0)8 550 19819\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                                 ·NOTE·\n-============================================================================-\n\n This program has ONLY been tested with /X 3.35\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                               ·HISTORY·\n-============================================================================-\n\n  V1.0  26-03-94 - The first version\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n \n              ___/\_______/\ ______/\_______/\_______/\_____\n -------------\__ ________  Y  _______  _____ _ _____ _____/--------------\n               /  |    \/___|__ \/___Y__ \/   Y   \/______ \\n              /   !     \\_____  \\_____  \   |    \     |  \\n              \         /   T    /   T    /   !    /     !  /\n --------------\_______/\___|___/\___|___/\_______/\_______/ML------------\n \n                   % SYSOPS: HaNNiBAL lECTeR! & buRSt! %\n                 % AMIEXPRESS 3.x % 200+ Mb % ONLY AMiGA %\n               % PSiONiC WHQ % 0-3 DAY STUFF % EVACUE SHQ! %\n             % 14.4HST % FAST VALiDATiON % DOOR CODiNG SYSOP %\n   \n                          % +46 (0)8 550 19819 %\n \n -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n-============================================================================-\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',13562,7,0,NULL,NULL,'psi_fo10','scan',1780048679);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('psi_sd10','PSI-SD10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/PSI-SD10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®',NULL,NULL,'PSI','®®                                        ®® ®         hANNiBAL lECTeR oF PSiONiC       ® ®                                          ®',replace('®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®\n®®                                        ®®\n®         hANNiBAL lECTeR oF PSiONiC       ®\n®                                          ®\n®               pRESENTs tODAy             ®\n®                                          ®\n®               sHOwdOORs v1.O             ®\n®                                          ®\n®         a dOOrmENu cOMMANd fOr /X        ®\n®®                                        ®®\n®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®® /X DEZiGN ®®®®®®\n','\n',char(10)),'OtherDoors.Doc',replace('           \n              Other Doors Availiable From Hannibal Lecter Are:\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1.  ShowDoors V1.0      - Displays All Doors To Users, Works With /X2.x-3.x\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n2.  ReportUser V1.0     - Tells The SysOp With "Say" That A User Has Logged\n                          On, Different For Each Status Level.\n                          Works With /X2.x-3.x\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n3.  UserInfo V2.2       - A Very Informative User Status Door For /X2.x-3.x\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------- \n4.  FuckOff V1.0        - A Nice Logoff door with functions like, message\n                          to next caller, download of latest board add..\n                          Works with /X2.x-3.x\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n5.  Operate V1.0        - A Nice operator door. If the sysop ain''t\n                          availiable then you can leave him a message.\n                          Works with /X2.x-3.x\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n6.  SystemHandler V1.0  - A good replacement for the sysopcommands, good\n                          for "not so good" cosysops. Works with /X2.x-3.x\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n7.  SysOpAvail V1.0     - A ''FrontEnd'' door thats tells the user if the\n                          sysop is availiable for chat or not. Works With\n                          /X2.x-3.x\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n8.  TransferChecker V1.0- A little unnessesary door that displays UL&DL''s\n                          And gives the user a comment based on the info.\n                          Works with /X2.x-3.x\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n                   And More Doors Developed Each Day..\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,10624,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048679);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('psi_tc10','PSI-TC10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/PSI-TC10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®',NULL,NULL,'PSI','®®                                        ®® ®         hANNiBAL lECTeR oF PSiONiC       ® ®                                          ®',replace('®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®\n®®                                        ®®\n®         hANNiBAL lECTeR oF PSiONiC       ®\n®                                          ®\n®               pRESENTs tODAy             ®\n®                                          ®\n®            tRANSFercHECKEr v1.O          ®\n®                                          ®\n®             a nICe dOOr fOr /X           ®\n®®                                        ®®\n®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®® /X DEZiGN ®®®®®®\n                                    \|/|)''95\n','\n',char(10)),'TransferChecker.Doc',replace('               ®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®\n               ®®                                     ®®\n               ®       hANNiBAL lECTeR oF PSiONiC      ®\n               ®                                       ®\n               ®             pRESENTs tODAy            ®\n               ®                                       ®\n               ®          TransferChecker v1.O         ®\n               ®                                       ®\n               ®           a nICe dOOr fOr /X          ®\n               ®®                                     ®®\n               ®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®®® /X DEZiGN ®®®®®®\n\n\n                               ·PURPOSE·\n-============================================================================-\n\n A little unnessesary door for AmiExpress, show how much you have DL&UL\n and how much you have left, and gives a comment based on that!\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n\n                            ·REQUIREMENTS·\n-============================================================================-\n\n Any AmiExpress version ranging from v2.xx-v3.xx\n Don''t know if it will work with any version less or higher, test!\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n\n                            ·INSTALLATION·\n-============================================================================-\n\n AE 3.xx:\n\n - Copy the TransferChecker directory directly to DOORS:\n - Copy TC.info to BBS:COMMANDS/BBCMD/\n - Add this text to your DOWNLOADMSG.TXT and UPLOADMSG.TXT\n\n---------------------------[ CUT HERE ]------------------------------\n~CC_TC\n---------------------------[ CUT HERE ]------------------------------\n\n AE 2.xx:\n\n - Copy the TransferChecker directory directly to DOORS:\n - Then add this to your BBS:COMMANDS/BBS.cmd file\n\n *TC       XM001DOORS:TRANSFERCHECKER/TRANSFERCHECKER.X\n  ^        ^ ^  ^\n  |        | |  `--> Location of the door\n  |        | `-----> Access needed to run the door\n  |        `-------> MUST begin on column 11\n  `----------------> Command to star the door with\n\n - Add this text to your DOWNLOADMSG.TXT and UPLOADMSG.TXT\n\n---------------------------[ CUT HERE ]------------------------------\n~CC_TC\n---------------------------[ CUT HERE ]------------------------------\n\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                                 ·USAGE·\n-============================================================================-\n\n When you type U or D on the main screen of AmiExpress the door will launch.\n It displays the Information and a comment based on that.\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                            ·ERROR MESSAGES·\n-============================================================================-\n\n There are no error messages at this moment.\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                       ·SUGGESTIONS & BUGREPORTS·\n-============================================================================-\n\n If there by any chance should occur any problem or you should find a bug\n in this door then you can contact me or leave me a message on my board:\n\n                      CHaOS    +46 (0)8 550 19819\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                                 ·NOTE·\n-============================================================================-\n\n This program has ONLY been tested with /X 3.35\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n                               ·HISTORY·\n-============================================================================-\n\n  V1.0  26-03-94 - The first version\n\n-============================================================================-\n\n \n              ___/\_______/\ ______/\_______/\_______/\_____\n -------------\__ ________  Y  _______  _____ _ _____ _____/--------------\n               /  |    \/___|__ \/___Y__ \/   Y   \/______ \\n              /   !     \\_____  \\_____  \   |    \     |  \\n              \         /   T    /   T    /   !    /     !  /\n --------------\_______/\___|___/\___|___/\_______/\_______/ML------------\n \n                   % SYSOPS: HaNNiBAL lECTeR! & buRSt! %\n                 % AMIEXPRESS 3.x % 200+ Mb % ONLY AMiGA %\n               % PSiONiC WHQ % 0-3 DAY STUFF % EVACUE SHQ! %\n             % 14.4HST % FAST VALiDATiON % DOOR CODiNG SYSOP %\n   \n                          % +46 (0)8 550 19819 %\n \n -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n-============================================================================-\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,16547,6,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048679);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('psn_av10','PSN-AV10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/PSN-AV10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','[ POiSON-AVAiL o ]÷[ 23''TH MAY 1996 ]','1.',NULL,'PSN','--- -- -  -                  -  - -- --- a ''sysop available for a chat?'' /X-door it''s a fast and simple XiM door with',replace('[ POiSON-AVAiL v1.o ]÷[ 23''TH MAY 1996 ]\n--- -- -  -                  -  - -- ---\na ''sysop available for a chat?'' /X-door\nit''s a fast and simple XiM door with \ncool dezign. VERY simple to install,...\n      ·.:+::·lEECHED fROM wAREhOUSE·::+:.·  \n','\n',char(10)),'POiSON-AVAiL.DOC',replace('\n                _______      .....\n           _ __/_,   ¯¬\ __/\......____  _ __/\  ________.\n           \\\_________/\__  :   :|·__/__\\__  \|·_    ¯¬|\n            ./:·    ¯¬||·¬''  :\  :l____ ¬\·¬''   \_/      | \n            l_________|l_____:/..:__¯¬''  /______//_______|\n                                    \___/!CE\n\n                          P R E S E N T S \n\n                   2 3 '' T H   M A Y   1 9 9 6\n\n                                A\n\n                 X i M   /X - D O O R   C A L L E D\n\n                        POiSON-AVAiL v1.o\n\n\n- What is it? -\n\nit''s a simple ''sysop available for a chat?'' door coded in E by me iCE,..\nfast and simple and cool dezign.\n\n- How to install? -\n\ncopy avail.info into your command/syscmd/ drawer and copy everything in \ndoors/ into your doors: and add something like this to your logon.txt or \nto your normal.bull if you use aquaquick or wherever:\n\n---%<--------------\n~CC_aVAiL|\n--->%--------------\n\n- How to get support? -\n\nhave a call to my board:\nAMiGA iS ALiVE +46-0371-82218\n\ncall it if you wanna trade doors,. old?, dosen''t matter\nor if you wanna spread your own doors or wanna have POiSON doors\nor in any other reason,..','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,4609,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048679);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('psn_cw10','PSN-CW10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/PSN-CW10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','nO_vIRUS_jUST_a_ADD!.run',NULL,NULL,'PSN','\_  _ \_  _ \_  __\_  __\__\_  _ \_     | ^ ^ |  |  |  |  l___  l___  |  |  |  |  ¦  | : : |  ___|     |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |',replace(' __/\____/\____/\____/\____/\_/\____/\___\n \_  _ \_  _ \_  __\_  __\__\_  _ \_     | ^\n^ |  |  |  |  l___  l___  |  |  |  |  ¦  | :\n: |  ___|     |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |\n| |  |  |  ¦  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |\n| |  |  |  |  |  ¦  |  ¦  |  |  ¦  |  |  | |\n: l__|  l__l__l_____l_____l__l_____l__l__| |\n`-- ---- -- -- -> presents <--- -- --»Tc« -''\n\n(/X TOOL)  » pSn-CrimeWall v1.0 «  (/X TOOL)\n','\n',char(10)),'mMMMySTï½¡CAL-pLACEs!.txt','',NULL,'auto-added',16666,5,0,NULL,NULL,'psn_cw10','scan',1780048679);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('psn_m09b','PSN-M09B.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/PSN-M09B.LHA','Wait','XIM','8',NULL,NULL,'PSN','\_  _ \_  _ \_  __\_  __\__\_  _ \_     | ^ ^ |  |  |  |  l___  l___  |  |  |  |  ¦  | : : |  ___|     |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |',replace(' __/\____/\____/\____/\____/\_/\____/\___\n \_  _ \_  _ \_  __\_  __\__\_  _ \_     | ^\n^ |  |  |  |  l___  l___  |  |  |  |  ¦  | :\n: |  ___|     |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |\n| |  |  |  ¦  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |\n| |  |  |  |  |  ¦  |  ¦  |  |  ¦  |  |  | |\n: l__|  l__l__l_____l_____l__l_____l__l__| |\n`-- ---- -- -- -> presents <--- -- --»Tc« -''\n\n(/X TOOL)   » pSn-MsnGer v0.9ß «   (/X TOOL)\n','\n',char(10)),'reference-board.txt',replace(replace('              W h e r e   t h e   w a r e z   c o m e   f r o m\r\n                                               __                /\_____:\r\n__/\__________________________________________|  \______________/  \    |__\r\n\_   ___________  _______ ________  \__   ___ |   _______  _______  \_  l  \\r\n__\____  \    _l   \    |  \     |___/     |  !    \   _l   \   _| __/\____ \_\r\n\_____    \___\     \___|   \___ !   \__   |_____   \__\     \__\    \____   /\r\n -mNT\_____/---\_____/--l____/-\______/\   |----\____/--\_____/--\____/--\__/\r\n                                        \__|\r\n\r\n- -- --> F A i R L i G H T   S W E D i S H   H E A D Q U A R T E R S <-- -- -\r\n\r\n           reference-board is back 2017 after more than 20 years in coma!\r\n\r\n                        Running on AmiExpress TelNet\r\n\r\n                    Connect to: reference-board.zapto.org:1541\r\n\r\n                    or: www.brysk.se/reference-board/index.htm\r\n               \n              UPLOAD DATE: 01-04-18  TIME: 20:32:38  ON NODE: 0\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',21120,4,0,NULL,NULL,'psn_m09b','scan',1780048679);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('psn_p09','PSN-P09.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/PSN-P09.LHA',NULL,'XIM','PAGE.EXE',NULL,NULL,'PSN','\_  _ \_  _ \_  __\_  __\__\_  _ \_     | ^ ^ |  |  |  |  l___  l___  |  |  |  |  ¦  | : : |  ___|     |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |',replace(' __/\____/\____/\____/\____/\_/\____/\___\n \_  _ \_  _ \_  __\_  __\__\_  _ \_     | ^\n^ |  |  |  |  l___  l___  |  |  |  |  ¦  | :\n: |  ___|     |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |\n| |  |  |  ¦  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | |\n| |  |  |  |  |  ¦  |  ¦  |  |  ¦  |  |  | |\n: l__|  l__l__l_____l_____l__l_____l__l__| |\n:-- ---- -- -- -> presents <--- -- --»Tc« -:\n|(/X)                                  (/X)|\n`-- - [       PSN-PAGER V0.9ß!       ]-- --''\n','\n',char(10)),'PAGER.DOC',replace('   __\n  /_/\      ___      ___       ___      ___   ___  _____    _____      .\n  \_\/  ___/  ¬\____/  ¬\  ___/  ¬\____/  ¬\_/  ¬\/  _ ¬\  /  _ ¬\     o\n   .|:_/   _    \_ _     \/   _____/   _____/     \_ |   \/   |   \--> | .\n   |:.\_  _|     / |  ___/_____   ¬\____   ¬\__ ___/ ¦    \   |    \  +: |\n   o+ /   \_____/       ¬\_   ¦     \_ ¦     \_   ¬\ :     \  |     \_:· .\n   : /      ¬\____/       /   _______/ _______/    /__     /__|      /|__\n   . \_______/ __ \______/____|· \_____|    \_____/  \____/   |_____/ /\_\\n    <-- ------''  `- ---  ------''                                »Tc«  \/_/\n ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                         Extremely fast SysOp-docs for\n \n                  ''pSn-Pager v0.9ß by The Colonel of PASSiON''\n \n                              Dated ''24-09-95''\n ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n LHA ARCHIVE SHOULD CONTAIN THE FOLLOWING FILES :\n \n        ''NAME''                          ''LENGTH''\n \n        bbs             (dir)\n \n        commands        (dir)\n        bbscmd          (dir)\n        o.info         (file)\n        oinfo.info     (file)\n \n        doors           (dir)\n        psn-page        (dir)\n        page.cfg\n        page.dat       (file)         2204 bytes\n        page.log       (file)\n        page.logo      (file)\n        page.head      (file)          450 bytes\n        page.exe       (file)         3196 bytes\n        pager.doc      (file)         6049 bytes\n\n        Screenshots     (dir)\n        GrabIFF.000    (file)\n        GrabIFF.001    (file)\n        GrabIFF.002    (file)\n        GrabIFF.003    (file)\n        GrabIFF.004    (file)\n\n REQUIREMENTS:\n\n        Ami-Express v4.x (possible also v3.x! - haven''t tested it though)\n        rexxmast\n        aedoor.library © SiNTAX/WøT\n        rexxsyslib.library\n        rexxreqtools.library\n\n ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n                                  ''THE DOOR''\n \n WHAT IS IT!?:\n\n        It''s simply a pager for ami-express 8)\n\n FEATURES:\n\n        Simple pageing\n        Users reason for anoying the holy system operator!\n        Optional requester on WB screen.. (i.e if /X-window is closed!)\n        Optional logfile, so that you can see who has been pageing and why\n        Leave mail if sysop ain''t available\n        Optional Logo pops up when the pager goes to work..\n\n INSTALLATION:\n \n        Just copy the files within this lha-arc to your bbs!..\n \n PAGE.CFG:\n\n        REQ=ON  = Requester pops up on WB, when a user tries to page you..\n                  (info about who the user is, his loc, access and reason)\n\n        REQ=OFF = No requester pops up.. (just an ordinary page!)\n\n        LOG=ON  = Logfile is active and records every time the sysop is paged\n\n        LOG=OFF = Hmm (wonder what happens then!? 8)\n\n        tHINK bEFORE pAGEING!! <- This txt appears before the user has\n                                  paged sysop..\n\n        nO rEASON=nO rESPOND!! <- This txt appears if the user decides NOT\n                                  to state his reason!..\n\n        tRA-lA-lA-lA..pAGEING! <- This txt appears while pageing sysop..\n\n NOTE:\n\n        Remember max.22 letters and do yaself a favour and do the lines\n        with the same length..\n\n XTRA NOTE:\n\n        You should only use the requester when you are around, but don''t\n        want to have the /X-window open for i.e reasons..\n\n        Now DON''T WORRY it won''t get your system to hang or any thing, but\n        the req dosn''t go away by it selves, and therefore it just lies\n        there on the WB screen.. (dosn''t look nice!)..\n\n ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n LAST WORDS:\n\n        For bug reports, ideas, and so on. Here''s how to contact the author.\n\n        Leave your mail to ( THE COLONEL ) on one of the boards beneith..\n\n        ELECTRONIC CONFUSION · WAREZ UNLIMITED · SUSPERIA · SKY TOWER\n\n ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n \n                      SUPREME PERSONAL HELLOS MUST GO TO:\n\n \n                          The Whistle · Gramps · Rina\n\n                        & ofcourse the rest of PASSiON\n\n\n                                  FURTHERMORE\n\n .-------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n |      - -÷ pASSiON sENDS tHEIR rEGARDS tO tHE fOLLOWING cREWS! ÷- -      |\n |-------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n |     9 Design, Absolute, Abyss, Accession, Act, Alchemy, Alpha Flight    |\n |   Ambrosia, Analog, Artwork, Avalon, Balance, Banal Projects, Beatless  |\n |      Bizarre Arts, Black Jack, Bomb, Bonzai Brothers, Bronx, C-Lous     |\n |    Cadaver, Chrome, Citron, Compact, Complex, Control, Cryptoburners    |\n |   Damones, Decnite, Depth, Desire, Destiny, Devious Dezigns, Diffusion  |\n |   Disaster, Disorder, Dreamdealers, Energy, Effect, Equinox, Eremation  |\n |    Essence, Facet''s Pussy/Desire, Fanatic, Fairlight, Fear, Freezers    |\n |     Giants, Giga Productions, Gods, Humane, Illusion, Infect, Insane    |\n | Intense, Iris, Jewels, Kinky, LSD, Mad Elks, Movement, Myth, Necropolis |\n | Neo, Nexus 7, Nova, Nuance, Oblivion, Obsession, Orient, Orion, Outlaws |\n |  Parasite, Phuture 303, Polka Brothers, Prestige, Pushkin, Quick Design |\n |  Ram Jam, Razor 1911, Rebels, Retire, RGB, Riot, S!P, Sanity, Sardonyx  |\n | Saturne, Scoopex, Silents, Simplex, Skid Row, Skulls, Spaceballs, Speedy|\n |     Spoon, Static Bytes, Stellar, Stone Arts, Stormtroopers, Subject    |\n |        Surprise Productions, Susperia, Technology, The Dark Demon       |\n |       The Magic Guild, Tom/Python Design, Tribe, TRSI, US, Vacuum       |\n |Virtual Dreams, Visage, Vision, Vixen, Wartec, Waveriders, Wizzcat, Zenon|\n |-------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n |                       - -÷ fRIENDSHIP rULES! ÷- -                       |\n `-------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',23372,1,0,NULL,NULL,'psn_p09','scan',1780048679);
