rfull\n          - no backdoor\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\nrEGISTRATIOn\n\n   This tool is SHAREWARE, so if you use it, you have to register...\n   The registration cost you only 20,- DM or 20 US-$...\n   You only have to transfer the money to me...\n\n   Account Name    : Olaf Gramkow\n   Account Number  : 10141901\n   Bank Code Number: 24050110\n   Sparkasse Lüneburg\n\n   Use: - Registration cONF-MOVEr V1.x\n        - Name/Handle, Group, BBS-Name, State\n        - get the reg. Version from which BBS (fLYING dRAGON, tHE dUNGEON)\n\n   Example for Use:\n      hIGH-SPEEd, rEAL, tHE dUNGEON, Germany\n      get it from tHE dUNGEON\n\n   After you sent me the money, you can get your REGISTRATED VERSION\n   in one of the following BBSs:\n      fLYING dRAGON - rEAL wHQ\n      tHE dUNGEON   - rEAL gHQ\n   Please tell me which one...\n\n   but don''t forget... for the registration I need the following stuff:\n     Name/Handle, Group, BBS-Name, State\n\n   If you want to sent me the money by letter, then write a mail to\n   hIGH-SPEEd in tHE dUNGEON BBS or in the fLYING dRAGON BBS...\n\n   All registered versions without any backdoors...\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\nrEQUIREMENTs\n\n                            Everyone can run it!!!\n\n          - you only need an AMIGA or compatible (DRACO)\n          - and the great AmiExpress V4.x\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\niNSTALLATIOn\n\n                      The installation is very simple...\n\n   - copy the directory rEAL with all the files to DOORS:\n   - copy the directory COMMANDS with all the files to BBS:\n\n   ready...\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\nwORKINg\n\n   With this door you can move files between Confs. You can select Dirs\n   or move with the date of the upload.\n   I hope I need no explanation of the functions. It''s very simple to use.\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\ngREETINGs!\n\n                           ... GReeTz fLYIng To ...\n\n      spEZIaL greETz fROM hIGH-SPEEd 2:\n\n      InTENsiTy , DoC waTSoN , GoroNIt , REvOlVer\n      anD tO aLl PhANTasM MeMBerS...\n\n      spEZIaL greETz fROM [-sAxOn-] 2:\n\n      SIRiAX,aLPHA ONe,pYRO,sLIME!,mARIO,vAMPIRE,JOHN SINCLAIR,\n      gALAXY,HITPOINT,KRYPTON,2FAST,DECCA,SIRE,CHAOS,PET,SABINE,\n      cANNIBAL,sTARLIGHT,H2o,mAGGY,sPIRIT,aNETTE,aNDREA,SPEEDY,\n      fRANK,jAYWALKER,pICARD,BASTARd^aPOLLO,5r,Awson,dEETs,gONZO,\n      BEN.E,aZURE!,trON,cRAsh,Gandalf,CRisi,SLaxx,pedl ^ dello,\n\n      and of coz 2:\n\n                       sPIRIT and tHE aLIEN\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\nmEMBERs, iNFOs, bOARDs\n\nmEMBAS:\n        [-sAxOn-]   mAIN-oRGA , fLYING DRAGOn WHq , cODER , dZ\n        hIGH-SPEEd  mAIN-cODER , oRGA , tHE dUNGEON GHq , dZ\n        Picard      pARADISE LOST EHq , AREXX-CODEr\n        HawKwind    DeZiGn\n        bASHGUARD   DeZiGn\n        mOSH        dANZIG GHq\n        Bastard     DeZiGn\n        Apollo      cODEr\n\nbOARDS:\n        [-sAxOn-]   fLYING DRAGOn - rEAL WHq - gERMANY\n        pICARD      pARADISE LOST - rEAL EHq - gERMANY\n        hIGH-SPEEd  tHE dUNGEON   - rEAL GHq - gERMANY\n        mOSH        dANZIG        - rEAL GHq - gERMANY\n\nbETA TESTER:\n        jOHN sINCLAIR - dRIVE bY SHOOTING - rEAL bETA tESTER - gERMANY\n        cANNIBAL      - eXTREME TERROR    - rEAL bETA tESTER - gERMANY\n\ntRADER:\n        rKR       [ dRAGON-TEAm ] nO rEAL mEMBER ....bOARD tEAM\n        dEVIL     [ dRAGON-TEAm ] nO rEAL mEMBER ....bOARD tEAM\n        TyROX     [ dRAGON-TEAm ] nO rEAL mEMBER ....bOARD tEAM\n        cALAVERA! [ dRAGON-TEAm ] nO rEAL mEMBER ....bOARD tEAM\n\n                  ..... rIGHT rEAL hAS nO rEAL tRADER .....\n                     \---------------------------------/\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\nrELEASEd\n\n   sYS-DOWn V1.2       nOW aVAILABLE...\n   bAUD-cOUNTER V1.1   nOW aVAILABLE...\n   sEC-CHECk V1.3      nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-sTAT V1.1      nOW aVAILABLE...\n   cONF-MOVEr V1.1     nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-CALLERs V1.0   nOW aVAILABLE...\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\ncOMMING SOOn\n\n   rEAL-pAGE V1.0      bETA tEST rUNNING (tHE dUNGEON)\n   rEAL-RECORDs V1.0   bETA tEST sOON\n   rEAL-WHO V1.0       bETA tEST rUNNING (tHE dUNGEON)\n   sTATUS dOOR V1.5    bETA tEST rUNNING (fLYING dRAGON)\n   fRONTWHO V1.7       bETA tEST rUNNING (fLYING dRAGON)\n   lOGOFF DOOR V1.0    bETA tEST sOON\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\n                              ... cALL NOw ...\n     .                                                                :\n  - -+-----------------------[ ThE dUNgEon bBs ]----------------------+-- -\n     |            _______________.                                    |\n     ¦           /               |        ________________            |\n     |          /_______\      __|___.    \    ______    /            ¡\n     |   _ _ ____.       \____/      |_____\___\________/_            |\n     |   ////____|           /       _        /__________/            |\n     !     ______.          /________|       /_ _ ____________________| _ _\n     |    /      |                   |______/  \\\\___________________////\n_____|___/__     | _________. _____________         _________________ |\n\    ______/.____|_\        | \     ______/____.    \    _______    / |\n \__________|       \       |__\____\_.___     |_____\_____   _/   /__|_______.\n     |      |_______________|__       |________|______    /_______/__         |\n     |                |_______/       |b!d  \   \________/_ |_______/         |\n     |                       /________|      \____________/        /__________|\n     ¦                  _ _ __________.                               |\n     !                  ////__________|                               |\n     |                                                                |\n     |                  [ SysOP iZ HigH-SpEEd/rEaL ]                  |\n     |           [ CoSys iZ jACk-daNiEl/iLLuSion deSIgNEr ]           |\n     |           [ NuP iZ -sLimE- aNd sYsPW iZ -pARaDIse- ]           |\n     |                      [ 1.1 gIgZ ONlINe ]                       |\n     |                   [ RuNNiNg wITh /X v4.Xx ]                    |\n     |              [ cALL dIZ nUMbA +49-[0]4131-63965 ]              |\n     |                  [ - iSDn cOMMiNG SooN!¡! - ]                  |\n     |                                                                |\n- ---+--------------------------[ ReAl GHQ ]--------------------------+- -\n     :                                                                ·\n                              ... oR cALL! ...\n\n     _   _  _ ___________________/\_ _ _/\___________________ _  _   _\n                             -  - --\X/-- -  -\n                        ____\n     _ _ _______________\   \__:::__________________ _ _\n      \\\\_   _____    / \   \ :::______   __  ____////\n         /   ____/   _/__ \    :::/    /   /   \__ \\n       |/    /  /    |   \/   /:::    /   /         \\n       /    /   \________/   /_:::___/   /\_________/\n       \   /-------------\  /--:::---\  /---------------------.\n        \_/               \/          \/                      |\n             .-------(OUTLAWS GHQ)-------(ILLUSION GHQ)-------+\n             | _ _ _____\n             |  \\\\    \ _________  /\_____________________________\n             |    __\____\\______  \/    __   _____    __________   \\n             |   /    _____/  __/ _/   |_ \   \__ \   /   \/    /   /\n             |   \    \    \  \    \_ __/  \       \       \   /   /\n             |    \________/___\    /__|    \______/_______/__/   /\n             `------------------\  /---|     \-----(hKWd)-----\  /--.\n                                 \/                            \/\n                       ----( REAL /X DIVISION WHQ )----\n               -( fLyInG dRAGon     rEsPeCt tO tHe maXIMum )-\n\n     _   _  _ ___________________/\_ _ _/\___________________ _  _   _\n                             -  - --\X/-- -  -\n\n       Note #0 = Lokal ServIce  Note #1 = 28.8eR  Note #2 = 19.2 Zyx\n              Note #3 = IsdN   Note #4 = IsdN   Note #5 = ISDN\n\n     _   _  _ ___________________/\_ _ _/\___________________ _  _   _\n                             -  - --\X/-- -  -\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n                          this tool is SHAREWARE\n                   copyright ©1995,1996 hIGH-SPEEd/rEAL\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',29297,7,0,NULL,NULL,'rea_cm10','scan',1780048686);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('rea_pw4','REA-PW4.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/REA-PW4.LHA',NULL,'XIM','rEALdoor.library',NULL,'JiM^bEAM','REA','|     ._______________   ·       ·   | |     |   ________   /___:___.   :   | ___|_____|___\_________/_\__:_  |   |   |',replace('_ _:_____________/\-rEAl-/\_________.___:_ _\n   |     ._______________   ·       ·   |\n   |     |   ________   /___:___.   :   |\n___|_____|___\_________/_\__:_  |   |   |\n\    _   :...../____| ______:_| |   |   |\n \   |________/b!d/_________:___| __|___|___\n  \_______| [ /X dIviSiON ] |    |         /\n   |                        |_____________/\n   |       pASSWORD sECURITy V1.4       |\n   |                                    |\n   |      dONe bY JiM^bEAM / rEAL!      |\n ¯¯:¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯:¯¯\n','\n',char(10)),'pWS.guide',replace('@DATABASE "pWS.guide"\n@NODE "Main" "pASSWORD sECURITY V 1.4 bY JiM^bEAM / rEAL!"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}                _________/\\  _ __ _____ _ ____/\\ ___.@{ub}\n@{b}                \\___.___   \\\       ___/    .___ \\   |______@{ub}\n@{b}                    |  /  _/___  ___)_____ ___/  \\  l      \\@{ub}\n@{b}                     __\\       \\ ______  /_|      \\______ //@{ub}\n@{b}           <------ -----\\_______\\-- - -\\/--l_______\\yop -\\/- -- ->@{ub}\n\n@{b}          ... bRINGz yA ...@{ub}                    @{" iNTRODUCTIOn! " LINK "Introduction_Node"}\n@{b}                                       @{" rEQUIREMENTs! " LINK "Requirements_Node"}@{"tOOLz rELEASEd!" LINK "Tools_released_Node"}\n@{b}       pASSWORD sECURITY V1.4!@{ub}         @{" iNSTALLATIOn! " LINK "Installation_Node"}@{" cOMMING sOOn! " LINK "Comming_soon_Node"}\n@{b}      tHE sYSPW /X dOOR bY rEAL@{ub}        @{" cONFIGURATIOn " LINK "Configuration_Node"}@{"   gREETINGs   " LINK "Greetings_Node"}\n@{b}                                       @{"    wORKINg    " LINK "Working_Node"}@{"    cONTACt    " LINK "Contact_Node"}\n@{b}      - cODED bY JiM^bEAM/rEAL -@{ub}       @{" mEMBERs, iNFOs, bOARDs! " LINK "Members_Infos_Boards_Node"}@{" rEAL" LINK "Real_Node"}\n@{b}    - dESIGN bY ?-sHAOLIN-?/rEAL -@{ub}            @{" e-mAILs aND iRC " LINK "E_Mails_and_IRC_Node"}\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n                           this tool is FREEWARE\n                    copyright © 1997  JiM^bEAM / rEAL!\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Introduction_Node" "Introduction"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}iNTRODUCTIOn@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n           ... here is the pASSWORD sECURITY V1.4 /X Door by rEAL ...\n\n\n  Features:\n\n          - the syspw is fully configurable (but limited to 30 chars)\n          - all wrong syspw''s the user entered will be saved\n            to a logfile\n          - fully configurable pwsansi.txt and pwsend.txt file\n          - no difference between upper/lowercase letters\n          - all code written in pure C language\n          - 68000, 68020+ versions\n          - Because of @{b}NO BACKDOOR@{ub} NO RISK\n            Disassemble the code if ya don''t believe me !!!\n\n  NEW Features in V1.2:\n\n          - the logfile for wrong syspw''s will be created with regard to\n            the node at which the user logsin\n            for example: DOORS:rEAL/Pws/Data/Node0 <-- Logfile for Node 0\n                         DOORS:rEAL/Pws/Data/Node1 <-- Logfile for Node 1\n          - all wrong syspw''s will be saved with date and time of input\n          - Because of @{b}NO BACKDOOR@{ub} NO RISK\n            Disassemble the code if ya don''t believe me !!!\n\n  NEW Features in V1.3:\n\n          - V1.3 of my door and all other rEAL-dOORS in future will need\n            the rEALdOOR.library in Libs: to run\n\n          - Tooltype-Features added\n            You can choose by the CONOUTPUT-tooltype if the syspw shall\n            be displayed to console or not\n            You can choose by the TEXT-tooltype if a textstring shall be\n            displayed instead of a star (*).\n          - Because of @{b}NO BACKDOOR@{ub} NO RISK\n            Disassemble the code if ya don''t believe me !!!\n\n  NEW Features in V1.4:\n\n          - hardcoded filenames for logfile and other removed\n          - now FULL Tooltype support !!!\n          - you can use your own prompt\n          - number of tries for syspw configurable up to 9999 times\n          - Added the following Tooltypes:\n\n            SYSPW, SYSPWCOUNT, LOGPATH, PROMPT, ADVERT, PWFAIL\n\n          - Because of @{b}NO BACKDOOR@{ub} NO RISK\n            Disassemble the code if ya don''t believe me !!!\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Requirements_Node" "Requirements"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}rEQUIREMENTs@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n                            Everyone can run it!!!\n\n          - you only need an AMIGA\n          - KS2.04 or higher\n          - the great AmiExpress V4.x\n          - the AEDoor.library V2.4+ in Libs:\n          - and rEALdOOR.library in Libs: (included in this archive)\n\n          @{b}pASSWORd sECURITy V1.4@{ub} should also work with @{b}S!X@{ub} and @{b}FAME@{ub}\n          but it wasn''t tried yet.\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Installation_Node" "Installation"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}iNSTALLATIOn@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n                      The installation is very simple...\n\n   - copy the rEALdOOR.library to Libs:\n   - copy the directory rEAL with all the files to DOORS:\n   - copy the directory COMMANDS with all the files to BBS:\n   - include the following lines in the BBSTitle.txt in BBS:Screens/node<x>\n     or Node<x> Directory:\n\n       ~\n       ~f      <-- don''t forget a "space" behind the f !!! IMPORTANT !!!\n       ~CC_PWS|\n\n     Maybe you have to create the "BBSTitle.txt" file at first !!\n\n   - remove the SYSTEM_PASSWORD Tooltype from your Node<x>.info ICON\n   - remove the SYS_PWD_PROMPT Tooltype from your Node<x>.info ICON\n   - makesure that your internal computer-clock shows the right time\n     and date\n\n   ready...\n\n\n   nOTE: nEVER START ANSI oR aN oTHER dOOR bEFORE tHE sYSPW-dOOR!\n         cOZ u lOST sECURITY .............\n   \n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Working_Node" "Working"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}wORKINg@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n   This Door asks every User who logsin for the SYSPW you have chosen.\n   He has 3 chances to typein the right Syspw.\n   If he failed, he will get a CARRIER LOST.\n   All wrong SYPWs will be logged to a logfile of your choice.\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Configuration_Node" "Configuration"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}cONFIGURATIOn@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n  You can configurate the door. My door uses the standard /X-Tooltypes !\n\n  PWS.info ICON:\n\n  Tooltypes:\n     ACCESS\n     TYPE\n     LOCATION\n     MULTINODE\n     CONOUTPUT  ( NEW in V1.3 !!!)\n     TEXT       ( NEW in V1.3 !!!)\n     SYSPW      ( NEW in V1.4 !!!)\n     SYSPWCOUNT ( NEW in V1.4 !!!)\n     LOGPATH    ( NEW in V1.4 !!!)\n     PROMPT     ( NEW in V1.4 !!!)\n     ADVERT     ( NEW in V1.4 !!!)\n     PWFAIL     ( NEW in V1.4 !!!)\n\n  ACCESS:\n     Pattern : ACCESS= <num>\n     Function: Tells /X the access level required to run this module.\n               This option is ignored for internal Module options.\n     Example : ACCESS=10\n               Check for a level about 10 or higher.\n\n  TYPE:\n     Pattern : TYPE= < XIM | AIM | TIM | IIM | SIM | MCI >\n     Function: This is the type of door you use.\n     Example : TYPE=XIM\n               For my door the TYPE should be XIM !!!\n\n  LOCATION:\n     Pattern : LOCATION= <string>\n     Function: Specifies the location of the module\n     Example1: LOCATION=DOORS:rEAL/PWS/PWS00.exe\n               If you are using the version for 68000 CPUs !\n\n     Example2: LOCATION=DOORS:rEAL/PWS/PWS020.exe\n               If you are using the version for 68020 CPUs !\n\n     Example3: LOCATION=DOORS:rEAL/PWS/PWS030.exe\n               If you are using the version for 68030 CPUs !\n\n     Example4: LOCATION=DOORS:rEAL/PWS/PWS0x0.exe\n               If you are using the version for 68040/60 CPUs !\n\n  MULTINODE:\n     Pattern : MULTINODE= <YES|NO>\n     Function: Tells /X if the module may be simultaneously accessed\n               from other nodes.\n\n  CONOUTPUT:\n     Pattern : CONOUTPUT= <YES|NO>\n     Function: Tells "Password Security" if the syspw which the user\n               enters shall be displayed to console in readable\n               way or not.\n               The syspw will be displayed to CONSOLE ONLY, that means\n               only the SYSOP or the guy at the CONSOLE-SIDE can see\n               it !!!\n     Example1: CONOUTPUT=YES\n\n     Example2: CONOUTPUT=NO\n\n  TEXT:\n     Pattern : TEXT= <Textstring>\n     Function: If you use this option the textstring behind "TEXT="\n               will be displayed to the user and sysop instead of a star.\n               The textstring will NOT be displayed to the sysop if the\n               CONOUTPUT-tooltype is activated (CONOUTPUT=YES) !!!\n     Example1: TEXT=rEAL!\n               If a user types in the syspw, the textstring "rEAL!" will\n               be displayed to him (and if CONOUTPUT=NO to the sysop too)\n               instead of a star.\n               The lenght of the textstring should be as long as the lenght\n               of the syspw is (it looks nicer) but not more than 30 chars\n               are allowed.\n     Example2: TEXT=fUCK!\n               and the syspw is LUNIZ.\n\n               fUCK! <--| The textstring and the syspw\n               LUNIZ <--| have the same lenght.\n\n     Example3: TEXT=Hello\n               and the syspw is BOYSCOUT\n\n               Hello    <--| The textstring and the syspw\n               BOYSCOUT <--| have NOT the same lenght (it doesn''t looks nice).\n\n               IMPORTANT !!!! IMPORTANT !!!! IMPORTANT !!!! IMPORTANT !!!!\n               The textstring will also be displayed if you have chosen\n               a SPACE as textstring. That''s why you should make sure,\n               that behind the "=" there is no SPACE if you have\n               deactivated the tooltype in the following way:\n               TEXT=           <--- ALL text (also SPACES) behind\n                                    the "=" must be deleted !!!\n\n               It''s better if you deactivate the tooltype in that way:\n               (TEXT=)\n\n               because then you can be sure, that it is REALLY\n               deactivated.\n\n  SYSPW:\n     Pattern : SYSPW= <Systempassword>\n     Function: The Systempassword you want to use for access to your\n               board. (Lenght of syspw limited to 30 chars)\n\n  SYSPWCOUNT:\n     Pattern : SYSPWCOUNT= <Number>\n     Function: The number of chances to enter the right syspw.\n               (the maximum number is 9999... that''s enough i think)\n\n  LOGPATH:\n     Pattern : LOGPATH= <Path and filename of logfile>\n     Function: The path and filename to write the logfile with wrong\n               syspw''s to.\n               (Lenght of string not more than 50 chars)\n     Example : LOGPATH=DOORS:rEAL/Pws/syspwfailed.txt\n               All wrong syspw''s will be logged to "syspwfailed.txt"\n               in "DOORS:rEAL/Pws/" .\n               If ya run the door on "Node 0" the full name of the\n               logfile would be "syspwfailed.txt0".\n               The node-number will be merged to the filename.\n               Remember that the complete path with all it''s\n               directories must exists or the logfile won''t be saved.\n\n  PROMPT:\n     Pattern : PROMPT= <String for Prompt>\n     Function: The Promptstring that shall be displayed if the user\n               is asked for the syspw.\n               (Lenght of string not more than 50 chars)\n\n  ADVERT:\n     Pattern : ADVERT= <Path and filename of advert>\n     Function: The path and filename of an advert (text/ansi) that\n               will be displayed to the user before syspw-input.\n               (Lenght of string not more than 50 chars)\n\n  PWFAIL:\n     Pattern : PWFAIL= <Path and filename of logoffansi>\n     Function: The path and filename of an text/ansi that will be\n               displayed to the user if he entered a wrong syspw\n               3 times.\n               (Lenght of string not more than 50 chars)\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Greetings_Node" "Greetings"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}gREETINGs!@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n                           ... GReeTz fLYIng To ...\n\n\n      greETz fROM JiM^bEAM 2:\n\n      sHALLOW , cHUCK, TMN , eXON, hAMLET, sKELETON,\n      oUR cOPERATION gROUP tEKLORDS,\n      anD tO aLl rEAL-mEMBERS anD dA rEST oF tHE cOOL sCENE...\n\n\n\n      sPECIAL gREETZ fROM JiM^bEAM :\n      ------------------------------\n\n      sAXON         wHEN yOU wILL gET oNLINE aGAIN ??\n\n      hIGH-SPEEd    tHNX fOR tHE gREAT lOOKING rEAL-hOMEPAGE aND\n                    fOR aLL tHE /X sUPPORT... gO ON\n\n      ?-sHAOLIN-?   yOUR aNSIS aRE rEALLY lOOKING gREAT aND tHNX\n                    fOR yOUR aNSI sUPPORT\n\n      iRON          i hOPE wE wILL mEET uS aT sYMPOSIUM ''98\n\n      jAMES wEST    wHEN yOU wILL gET oNLINE aGAIN ??\n\n      tNT^lFC       tHNX fOR aLL tHE hELP i gOT fROM yOU oN iRC...\n                    wE wILL mEET uS aGAIN\n\n      dRICE^OPS     yOU''rE rEALLy cOOL m8... hOPE tO c yA sOON oN iRC\n                    tHNX fOR tHE oNLINE-tEACHING :)\n\n\n      sPECIAL gREETZ fROM sAxOn :\n\n      pYRO & Voice ( rEMEMBER tHE gOOD oLD tIMES ) sCHNIFF ...\n      dIGIMAN cOOL sTUFF aT dA aCID ! gO oN sOOOOOOOOOO\n      dERROW eVERY tIME nICE cHATZ!\n      aLPHA oNE! sTOP cRYING aBOUT yOURE gIRLFRIEND!\n      gOOFY sTART wORKING oN tHE fAME wAY oF fANTASY GENERATIONS\n      sULTAN wELCOME bACK dUDE!\n      bUD hEISER ... sTOP tAKING sHIT!      \n      eDE tHAX 4 hELP aT dA inTERNET\n      vENTURA dON`t sTOP pIXLING\n      tRANSACTOR gOon sTOP tHIS sHIT on MY bOARD!\n      eLRIC cOOL tRADING ....\n      lEMMON hAPPY 2 sEE u AT dA sYMPOSIUM ( oN tHE wATER cOMPO ) !!!\n      cAPLOCKMAN wHATS gOING oN iN PGS??\n      sLAYER ......nO cOMMENT!\n      yOP cOOL cOLLY lAST tIME!\n      nEON dON`t sTOP wORKING oN cDs...\n      jOHN sINCLAIR ... mISSiNG cONNECT tIMES!      \n      bEN.e wHATS aBOUT joINING rEAL 4 gFX sUPPORT ???\n      jOY lIKE sEX lIKE bEER .......lIKE mORE ???\n      sUNSHINE ... cOOL cHATS eVERY 2 wEEKS! grummel ...\n      chAOS sANITY nEVER dIE!\n      cOUGAR wHATS aBOUT uRE bUST ...? aLL rEADY nOW ?\n      nITRO ... lONG tiME nOTHUNG nEW ?\n      rAZOR nICE mEETING in HH !!! hihihi ...\n      lUCAS ... rEMEMBER tHE nEU tOOL! yOURE rEAL - uPLOAD is READY!\n      \n      oKAY fOLKS nOTHING mORE... nEXT tIME i`ll sHOW tHE nEXT gREETINGS!\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Members_Infos_Boards_Node" "Members_Infos_Boards"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}mEMBERs, iNFOs, bOARDs@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\nmEMBERS!:\n\n      ( [-sAxOn-]   lEADER, mAIN-oRGA , cODER , dZ!, gFX )\n        hIGH-SPEEd  lEADER, mAIN-cODER , oRGA , GHq , dZ!, gFX, wEBcODER\n        JiM^bEAM    cODER\n        bUD         cODER, lEADER oF tHE dEMO-sECTION\n        iRON        cODER , iNTROS , BBS e.t.c.\n        sTEEL       cODER, mUSIC, dZ!\n        dARKoNE     cODER\n        gLUE        cODER, pC-sECTION\n        hAZE        cODER, pC-sECTION\n\n        jUNK        dZ!, Dhq\n        dAIM        dZ!\n        ?-SHAOLIN-? dZ!\n        yOP         dZ!\n\n        nEO         gFX, rAYTRACING\n        vARIX       gFX\n\nbOARDS:\n        dIGIMAN     aCID sLAM       - rEAL WHq  - gERMANY\n        sTEVE       dIGITAL wORLD   - rEAL Ehq  - gERMANY\n        hIGH-SPEEd  tHE dUNGEON     - rEAL Ghq  - gERMANY\n        jUNK        wONDERLAND      - rEAL DHq  - hOLAND\n        fLUX        cANADIAN mIST   - rEAL USHQ - uNITED sTATES\n        kGB         sTARGATE        - rEAL UKHQ - uNITED kINGDOM\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "E_Mails_and_IRC_Node" "E_Mails_and_IRC"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}e-MAILs aND iRC@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n        e-MAILS:\n        --------\n        JiM^bEAM + bUD    e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n        hIGH-SPEEd        e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n        iRON              e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n                                     [email removed]\n        [-sAxOn-]         e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n        sTEEL             e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n        sTEVE             e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n        dARKoNE           e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n        hAZE              e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n        jUNK              e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n        kGB               e-mAIL tO: [email removed]\n\n\n\n        nICKS oN iRC (#amielite):\n        -------------------------\n        JiM^bEAM          nICKNAME oN iRC: JB^rEAL, Jim^Beam\n        bUD               nICKNAME oN iRC: Bud^rEAL, Bud\n        fLUX              nICKNAME oN iRC: fLUX, [fLUX]\n        hIGH-sPEED        nICKNAME oN iRC: High-Speed, HS\n        iRON              nICKNAME oN iRC: iRON, iRON^rEAL\n\n        ...tRY tO fIND oUT dA rEST yOURSELF oR aSK oN iRC!\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Real_Node" "Real"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}rEAL@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~@{ub}\n\n@{b}                 .:::::.  .::::.      ..:::::.     ..:::::.\n               .::::::::.:::::::.   .:::··:::::   ::·:::::·\n             .:::::::::::::::::::  .:::·   ::::    .::::·\n         .:::::· :::::::·   :::::: ·::·    ::::   .:::·\n         :::::  ::::::::    ::::::    .... ::::  .:::·\n          :::.  :::::::;   ::::::; .::::::::::: .:::·          ...\n           :::. ·::::::...::::::· .::::··:::::: :::·          ::::.\n           ·:::. ··::::::::::··   ::::    ::::::::·            ::::\n            ·:::.  :::·        ..:::::    :::::::::.......:::::::::\n             ::::; :::    ...::::::::::..::::::::::::::::·····::::;\n              ···  ·::::::::::::· ·::::::::::·····b!d\n                    ·::::····\n\n                     [rEAL!] [tHE cHOICE oF qUALITY!]\n@{ub}\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Contact_Node" "Contact"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}cONTACt@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n       tRY oUR wEBPAGE nOW...\n\n       rEAL hOMEPAGE: http://www.tu-harburg.de/~seog0111/real.html\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Tools_released_Node" "Tools_released"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}tOOLz rELEASEd@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n   pASSWORd sECURITy V1.0       iNTERNAL vERSION... nEVER rELEASED\n   pASSWORd sECURITy V1.1       nOW aVAILABLE...\n   pASSWORd sECURITy V1.2       nOW aVAILABLE...\n   pASSWORd sECURITy V1.3       nOW aVAILABLE... mAYbE iT''S tHE fINAL oNE\n   pASSWORd sECURITy V1.3.1     nOW aVAILABLE... (uPDATE fIX)\n   pASSWORd sECURITy V1.4       noW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-qUICKlOGON V1.0         nOW aVAILABLE...\n   sYS-DOWn V1.2                nOW aVAILABLE...\n   bAUD-cOUNTER V1.1            nOW aVAILABLE...\n   bAUD-cOUNTER V1.3            nOW aVAILABLE...\n   sEC-CHECk V1.3               nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-sTAT V1.1               nOW aVAILABLE...\n   cONF-MOVEr V1.1              nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-CALLERs V1.1            nOW aVAILABLE...\n   sYS-cOMMENT V1.1             nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-pAGE V1.1               nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-wALL V1.1               nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-wALL V1.2               nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-uPLOAD V1.0             nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-uPLOAD V1.1             nOW aVAILABLE...\n\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n@NODE "Comming_soon_Node" "Comming_soon"\n@TOC "MAIN"\n@{b}cOMMING sOON@{ub}\n@{b}~~~~~~~~~~~~@{ub}\n\n   rEAL-LOGOFF V1.0\n   rEAL-WHO V1.0\n   sTATUS dOOR V1.5\n   fRONTWHO V1.7\n   gAME-MANAGEr V1.0\n   rEAL-RECORDs V1.0\n\n   ...and later... R M S - rEAL mAILBOX sYSTEM for Amiga & PC !\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n','\n',char(10)),'{"ACCESS":"<num>","TYPE":"<","LOCATION":"<string>"}','auto-added',49976,1,0,NULL,NULL,'rea_pw4','scan',1780048686);
