----------.\n        \_/               \/          \/                      |\n             .-------(OUTLAWS WHQ)-------(ILLUSION GHQ)-------+\n             | _ _ _____\n             |  \\\\    \ _________  /\_____________________________\n             |    __\____\\______  \/    __   _____    __________   \\n             |   /    _____/  __/ _/   |_ \   \__ \   /   \/    /   /\n             |   \    \    \  \    \_ __/  \       \       \   /   /\n             |    \________/___\    /__|    \______/_______/__/   /\n             `------------------\  /---|     \-----(hKWd)-----\  /--.\n                                 \/                            \/\n                       ----( REAL /X DIVISION WHQ )----\n               -( fLyInG dRAGon     rEsPeCt tO tHe maXIMum )-\n\n     _   _  _ ___________________/\_ _ _/\___________________ _  _   _\n                             -  - --\X/-- -  -\n\n       Note #0 = Lokal ServIce  Note #1 = 28.8eR  Note #2 = 19.2 Zyx\n              Note #3 = IsdN   Note #4 = IsdN   Note #5 = ISDN\n\n     _   _  _ ___________________/\_ _ _/\___________________ _  _   _\n                             -  - --\X/-- -  -\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n                          this tool is SHAREWARE\n                     copyright © 1996 hIGH-SPEEd/rEAL\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',15933,3,0,NULL,NULL,'rea_rw11','scan',1780048686);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('rea_rw12','REA-RW12.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/REA-RW12.LHA','Installer','XIM','Installer',NULL,'hIGH-SPEEd/rEAL!','REA','\___.___  \\      ___/    .___\\   |______ |  /  _/___ ___)_____ ___/  \  l      \ yopl__\       \______  /_|      \______ //',replace('_________/\  _ __ ____ _ ____/\ ___. REAL!\n\___.___  \\      ___/    .___\\   |______\n    |  /  _/___ ___)_____ ___/  \  l      \\n yopl__\       \______  /_|      \______ //\n«=======\_______\=====\/==l_______\=====\/=»\n               rEAL-wALL V1.2\n      A great Wall for /X and FAME !!!\nWith aNONYMOUS-Writeing, Multi-Color-Mode...\n        - dONE bY hIGH-SPEEd/rEAL! -\n      [rEAL!] [tHE cHOICE oF qUALITY!]\n[07-02-96] cOMING sOON: rEFUGEE cAMP [23:56]\n','\n',char(10)),'rEAL-wALL.guide',replace('@database "rEAL-wALL.guide"\n@Index "Index"\n\n@Node Main "rEAL-wALL V1.2 - Documentation - done by hIGH-SPEEd/rEAL"\n@{b}                 .:::::.  .::::.      ..:::::.     ..:::::.@{ub}\n@{b}               .::::::::.:::::::.   .:::··:::::   ::·:::::·@{ub}\n@{b}             .:::::::::::::::::::  .:::·   ::::    .::::·@{ub}\n@{b}         .:::::· :::::::·   :::::: ·::·    ::::   .:::·@{ub}\n@{b}         :::::  ::::::::    ::::::    .... ::::  .:::·@{ub}\n@{b}          :::.  :::::::;   ::::::; .::::::::::: .:::·          ...@{ub}\n@{b}           :::. ·::::::...::::::· .::::··:::::: :::·          ::::.@{ub}\n@{b}           ·:::. ··::::::::::··   ::::    ::::::::·            ::::@{ub}\n@{b}            ·:::.  :::·        ..:::::    :::::::::.......:::::::::@{ub}\n@{b}             ::::; :::    ...::::::::::..::::::::::::::::·····::::;@{ub}\n@{b}              ···  ·::::::::::::· ·::::::::::·····b!d@{ub}\n@{b}                    ·::::····@{ub}\n\n                              @{b}... bRINGz yA ...@{ub}\n\n                               @{b}rEAL-wALL V 1.2@{ub}\n\n                         @{b}- dONE bY hIGH-SPEEd/rEAL -@{ub}\n\n                               @{" iNTRODUCTIOn! " Link "Introduction"}\n                               @{" rEGISTRATIOn! " Link "Registration"}\n                               @{" rEQUIREMENTs! " Link "Requirements"}\n                               @{" iNSTALLATIOn! " Link "Installation"}\n                                  @{" wORKINg " Link "Working"}\n                               @{" cONFIGURATIOn " Link "Configuration"}\n                                 @{" gREETINGs " Link "Greetings"}\n                          @{" mEMBERs, iNFOs, bOARDs! " Link "Members_Infos_Boards"}\n                              @{" tOOLz rELEASEd! " Link "Tools_Released"}\n                               @{" cOMMING SOOn! " Link "Comming_Soon"}\n                                 @{" cALL NOw! " Link "The_Dungeon"}\n                                    @{"iNDEx" Link "Index"}\n\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n                            this tool is SHAREWARE\n                       copyright © 1996 hIGH-SPEEd/rEAL\n-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-===-\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Introduction" "iNTRODUCTIOn"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}iNTRODUCTIOn@{ub}@{uu}\n\n                   ... here is the rEAL-wALL from rEAL ...\n\n  Features:\n\n          - a greate wall for /X and FAME\n          - cool design... real wall design...\n          - no backdoor\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Registration" "rEGISTRATIOn"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}rEGISTRATIOn@{ub}@{uu}\n\n   This tool is SHAREWARE, so if you use it, you have to register...\n   The registration cost you 10,- DM or 10 US-$...\n   You only have to transfer the money to me...\n\n   Account Name    : Olaf Gramkow\n   Account Number  : 10 14 19 01\n   Bank Code Number: 240 501 10\n                     Sparkasse Lüneburg\n\n   Use: - Registration rEAL-wALL\n        - Name/Handle, Group, BBS-Name, State, Processor\n        - get the reg. Version from which BBS (fLYING dRAGON, tHE dUNGEON)\n\n   Example for Use:\n      Registration rEAL-wALL\n      hIGH-SPEEd, rEAL, tHE dUNGEON, Germany, 68030\n      get it from tHE dUNGEON\n\n   After you sent me the money, you can get your REGISTERED VERSION\n   in one of the following BBSs:\n      fLYING dRAGON - rEAL wHQ\n      tHE dUNGEON   - rEAL gHQ\n   Please tell me which one...\n\n   but don''t forget... for the registration I need the following stuff:\n     Name/Handle, Group, BBS-Name, State, Processor\n\n   If you want to sent me the money by letter, then write a mail to\n   hIGH-SPEEd in tHE dUNGEON BBS or in the fLYING dRAGON BBS...\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Requirements" "rEQUIREMENTs"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}rEQUIREMENTs@{ub}@{uu}\n\n                            Everyone can run it!!!\n\n          - you only need an AMIGA or compatible (DRACO)\n          - and the great AmiExpress V4.x or FAME\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Installation" "iNSTALLATIOn"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}iNSTALLATIOn@{ub}@{uu}\n\n                      The installation is very simple...\n\n   - use the Installer\n   - and now include the following line in the BULL.txt\n     if you don''t have it:\n       ~CC_WALL \n\n   ready...\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Working" "wORKINg"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}wORKINg@{ub}@{uu}\n\n   This is a Wall. It works like the other walls out there.\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Configuration" "cONFIGURATIOn"\n@Next "RW_ANONYMOUS"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}cONFIGURATIOn@{ub}@{uu}\n\n  You can configurate the Door. You can change some Tooltypes in the\n  WALL.info Icon in the following directory:\n    using /X  : BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD/\n    using FAME: DOORS:REAL/REAL-WALL/\n\n  Tooltypes:\n     @{" RW_ANONYMOUS " Link "RW_ANONYMOUS"}  (only registered version)\n     @{" RW_BACKGROUND " Link "RW_BACKGROUND"} (only registered version)\n     @{" RW_COLORS " Link "RW_COLORS"}     (only registered version)\n     @{" RW_LINES " Link "RW_LINES"}      (only registered version)\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "RW_ANONYMOUS" "Tooltype: RW_ANONYMOUS"\n@Prev "Configuration"\n@Toc "Configuration"\n\n  @{b}@{u}RW_ANONYMOUS@{ub}@{uu}\n\n     Pattern : RW_ANONYMOUS\n     Function: Write Comments Anonymous or not.\n     Example : RW_ANONYMOUS\n               Write Anonymous is on.\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "RW_BACKGROUND" "Tooltype: RW_BACKGROUND"\n@Next "RW_COLORS"\n@Prev "RW_ANONYMOUS"\n@Toc "Configuration"\n\n  @{b}@{u}RW_BACKGROUND@{ub}@{uu}\n\n     Pattern : RW_BACKGROUND\n     Function: Use the Background-Mode.\n     Example : RW_BACKGROUND\n               Background-Mode is on.\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "RW_COLORS" "Tooltype: RW_COLORS"\n@Next "RW_LINES"\n@Prev "RW_BACKGROUND"\n@Toc "Configuration"\n\n  @{b}@{u}RW_COLORS@{ub}@{uu}\n\n     Pattern : RW_COLORS\n     Function: Use the MultiColor-Mode.\n     Example : RW_COLORS\n               MultiColor-Mode is on.\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "RW_LINES" "Tooltype: RW_LINES"\n@Prev "RW_COLORS"\n@Toc "Configuration"\n\n  @{b}@{u}RW_LINES@{ub}@{uu}\n\n     Pattern : RW_LINES=<num>\n     Function: Number of Lines in the wall.\n     Example : RW_LINES=15\n               You are using 15 lines in the wall.\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Greetings" "gREETINGs!"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}gREETINGs!@{ub}@{uu}\n\n                           ... GReeTz fLYIng To ...\n\n      spEZIaL greETz fROM hIGH-SPEEd 2:\n\n      InTENsiTy , DoC waTSoN , GoroNIt , REvOlVer\n      anD tO aLl PhANTasM MeMBerS...\n\n      spEZIaL greETz fROM [-sAxOn-] 2:\n\n      SIRiAX,aLPHA ONe,pYRO,sLIME!,mARIO,vAMPIRE,JOHN SINCLAIR,\n      gALAXY,HITPOINT,KRYPTON,2FAST,DECCA,SIRE,CHAOS,PET,SABINE,\n      cANNIBAL,sTARLIGHT,H2o,mAGGY,sPIRIT,aNETTE,aNDREA,SPEEDY,\n      fRANK,jAYWALKER,pICARD,BASTARd^aPOLLO,5r,Awson,dEETs,gONZO,\n      BEN.E,aZURE!,trON,cRAsh,Gandalf,CRisi,SLaxx,pedl ^ dello,\n\n      and of coz 2:\n\n                       sPIRIT and tHE aLIEN\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Members_Infos_Boards" "mEMBERs, iNFOs, bOARDs"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}mEMBERs, iNFOs, bOARDs@{ub}@{uu}\n\nmEMBAS:\n        [-sAxOn-]   mAIN-oRGA , sYSOP fLYING DRAGOn WHq , cODER , dZ\n        hIGH-SPEEd  mAIN-cODER , oRGA , sYSOP tHE dUNGEON GHq , dZ\n        Picard      sYSOP pARADISE LOST EHq , AREXX-CODEr\n        mOSH        sYSOP dANZIG GHq\n        Dagobert    sYSOP dAGOBERTS rEVANGE GHq\n        sTEVE       sYSOP dIGITAL wORLD GHq\n        (-rEBEL-)   sYSOP vALHALLA MHq\n\nbOARDS:\n        [-sAxOn-]   fLYING DRAGOn     - rEAL WHq - gERMANY\n        pICARD      pARADISE LOST     - rEAL EHq - gERMANY\n        hIGH-SPEEd  tHE dUNGEON       - rEAL GHq - gERMANY\n        mOSH        dANZIG            - rEAL GHq - gERMANY\n        Dagobert    dAGOBERTS rEVANGE - rEAL GHq - gERMANY\n        sTEVE       dIGITAL wORLD     - rEAL GHq - gERMANY\n        (-rEBEL-)   vALHALLa          - rEAL MHq - gERMANY\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Tools_Released" "tOOLz rELEASEd"\n@Next "Comming_Soon"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}tOOLz rELEASEd@{ub}@{uu}\n\n   sYS-DOWn V1.2       nOW aVAILABLE...\n   bAUD-cOUNTER V1.1   nOW aVAILABLE...\n   sEC-CHECk V1.3      nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-sTAT V1.1      nOW aVAILABLE...\n   cONF-MOVEr V1.1     nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-CALLERs V1.1   nOW aVAILABLE...\n   sYS-cOMMENT V1.1    nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-pAGE V1.1      nOW aVAILABLE...\n   rEAL-wALL V1.2      nOW aVAILABLE...\n\n   gET yOUR rEGISTERED vERSIONS nOW!!!\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "Comming_Soon" "cOMMING SOOn"\n@Prev "Tools_Released"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n@{b}@{u}cOMMING SOOn@{ub}@{uu}\n\n   rEAL-LOGOFF V1.0    bETA tEST rUNNING (tHE dUNGEON, fLYING dRAGON)\n   rEAL-uPLOAD V1.0    bETA tEST rUNNING (fLYING dRAGON, dIGITAL wORLD,\n                                          tHE dUNGEON)\n   rEAL-WHO V1.0       bETA tEST rUNNING (tHE dUNGEON, fLYING dRAGON)\n   sTATUS dOOR V1.5    bETA tEST rUNNING (fLYING dRAGON)\n   fRONTWHO V1.7       bETA tEST rUNNING (fLYING dRAGON)\n   gAME-MANAGEr V1.0   bETA tEST sOON\n   rEAL-RECORDs V1.0   bETA tEST sOON\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "The_Dungeon" "cALL NOw"\n@Next "Flying_Dragon"\n@Toc "Main"\n\n                              ... cALL NOw ...\n     .                                  