u have to send me a e-mail with the Registerstring\n   (Handle or Handle & Group; up to 15 characters long)\n   you would like to have inserted into the Registertext "Registered to:"\n   in the Design.\n   Otherwise the Registertext will look like this:\n   Registered to: UNREGISTERED!!!\n\n   If you register the Registertext will look like this for example:\n\n   Registered to: JiM_bEAM^rEAL!\n\n   The door is fully functional without the Registerstring too.\n\n   My e-mail: [email removed]\n              [email removed]\n\n\n@ENDNODE\n\n','\n',char(10)),'{"ACCESS":"<num>","TYPE":"<","LOCATION":"<string>","STACK":"<Value>"}','auto-added',74872,2,0,NULL,NULL,'rea_st21','scan',1780048686);
