e at my place!\n\n                    [ GLOBAL EFFECT +46(0)500-485978! ]\n\n                         [- RAGE EUROPEAN HQ! -] \n\n\nFast greetings fly out to:\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nnIKE/tRSI,mARWIC/PSE,oRCHID/PSE,bOONE/DFC,ARAGON,iRONUKE! and the rest\nof the scene and of coz my users.\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,6612,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048686);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('rg_mast','RG-MAST.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/RG-MAST.LHA',NULL,'XIM','Status.Xim',NULL,'Xerxes^Rage!','RG','=====\_____  ¬\/~   ¬\_/~    \_/~ ___/====== !:::::7~  /  _/   !   7   l___7  ___)::::::! !:::::!   \  ¬\_  .   !   7  ¬7     ¬7:::::!',replace('      _________  _____   _____   ______\n =====\_____  ¬\/~   ¬\_/~    \_/~ ___/======\n !:::::7~  /  _/   !   7   l___7  ___)::::::!\n !:::::!   \  ¬\_  .   !   7  ¬7     ¬7:::::!\n !:::::l___j\___/__¡___j_______j______j:::::!\n !:::::::::::::PreSeNts:::toDAy:::::::::::::!\n ============================================\n - Master Status v2.1! Code by Xerxes^Rage! -\n -   The very best status door available!   -\n -   It''s FAST, It''s NICE and It''s XIM!!!   - \n ============================================\n','\n',char(10)),'Status.Doc',replace('\n                 [- Master Status v2.1 by Xerxes^Rage! -]\n                 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\nIncluding :\n\n             Door:Rage/ -  Status.Xim    5760 bytes!          \n             \n             BBS:Commands/BBScmd - S.Info     \n           \n             BBS:Commands/SYScmd - S.info\n         \n             BBS:Doc - This Document!\n\n\nHow to Install \n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n    It''s very easy to install this door! Just follow the instuctions ->\n\n                 1.Copy The Status.Xim door to Doors:Rage/\n\n 2.Copy The S.info Commands to BBS:Commands/Syscmd and BBS:Commands/BBScmd\n\n                            3.You are READY!!!!\n\n                           How EASY can it be! \n                    \n\nHOE TO REGISTER!\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n         Just call me or get in touch with me at any cool board :\n\n                                    Ex:\n\n   1.-Flashback-Dagcentral-The East-Undercover-Nightfall-Prophets Hold-\n                 -Outpost-Instant Pleasure-Nuclear Waste-\n\n                  2.And of coz U can call me at my place!\n\n                    [ GLOBAL EFFECT +46(0)500-485978! ]\n\n                         [- RAGE EUROPEAN HQ! -] \n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',6370,2,0,NULL,NULL,'rg_mast','scan',1780048692);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('rg_payus','RG-PAYUS.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/RG-PAYUS.LHA',NULL,'XIM','_________  _____   _____   ______',NULL,'ZWiNX/R-A-G-E!','RG','=====\_____  ¬\/~   ¬\_/~    \_/~ ___/====== !:::::7~  /  _/   !   7   l___7  ___)::::::! !:::::!   \  ¬\_  .   !   7  ¬7     ¬7:::::!',replace('     _________  _____   _____   ______\n=====\_____  ¬\/~   ¬\_/~    \_/~ ___/======\n!:::::7~  /  _/   !   7   l___7  ___)::::::!\n!:::::!   \  ¬\_  .   !   7  ¬7     ¬7:::::!\n!:::::l___j\___/__¡___j_______j______j:::::!\n!:::::::::::::P®e§eNts:::tøÐÆy:::::::::::::!\nPayUSER v1.01 ×<>× For /X 2.x & 3.x ×<>× fOr\ncOnTrOlling YoUr PaY-UsErS, diSabLed winners\n& mOre ×<>× 100% aUtOmaTic! ×<>× EaSy tO UsE\nEaSy tO iNSTaLL ×<>× CodeD by ZWiNX/R-A-G-E!\n--------------------------(dREAm pHASe)----','\n',char(10)),'Pay.doc',replace('PayUSER util V1.01ß by Zwinx/RAGE\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nThis neat little util is written to be used with /X 2.xx and 3.xx. It''s easy\nto use and install.\n\nFEATURES\n~~~~~~~~\n× This little util keeps track of your payusers, and other time-limited\n  disabled-users.\n× Easy to use, built in PayUser-editor, wich is scanning directly from\n  your user.data. When searching for users, you can use wildcards (like\n  the built in User-Editor, or like the wildcard sequence during logon).\n× You don''t have to mind >AT ALL< about the disabled users. When their\n  time comes, their disabled ratio returns EXACTLY to normal. Downloaded\n  bytes during this time WILL NOT be counted or added to the users account.\n\nINSTALLATION NOTICE\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nIF YOU USE /X VERSION 2.x THEN YOU CAN''T USE THE SUPPLIED SCRIPTFILE TO\nINSTALL/UPDATE THIS DOOR!\nYOU MUST FOLLOW THE INSTRUCTIONS EXACTLY DURING THE INSTALLATION, OTHER-\nWISE THE DOOR WILL NOT WORK!\nYOU MUST HAVE USER.DATA IN BBS:\n\n/X 2.x INSTALLATION\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n× Make a directory called "PayUser" in DOORS: and one directory called\n  "Payers" in DOORS:PayUser\n\nex.\nHD:> makedir DOORS:PayUser\nHD:> makedir DOORS:PayUser/Payers\n\n× Unpack the Space.LHA archive in DOORS:Space.\n\nex.\nHD:> cd DOORS:PayUser\nHD:BBS/DOORS/PayUser> lha x RAM:RG-PAYUS.lha\n\n× Insert the following line in your BBS.CMD file. Read /X documentation for\n  further information.\n\n---CUT---\nPAY       RM010DOORS:Space/Space.rexx\n---CUT---\n\n× Edit BBS:<conf>/DownLoadMsg.txt. Remember to edit all conferences!\n\nex.\n---CUT---\n~\n~CC_PAY\n\nGo on an'' download! But don''t forget the "u" key!\n---CUT---\n\n/X 3.x INSTALLATION\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n× Unpack the RG-PAYUS.LHA archive to RAM:\n \nex.\nHD:> cd RAM:\nRam Disk:> lha x RAM:RG-PAYUS.lha\n\n× Execute the AE3.x_Install-script.\n\nex.\nRam Disk:> AE3.x_Install\n\nHOW TO USE\n~~~~~~~~~~\nLet''s make an example: WarezMan have paied you for disabled for two months.\nTo start with, enter the door by typing "PAY" (In fact, you CAN also enter\nthe door by typing "D").\n\nex.\n---\nDaGcEnTRaL 9o²1o [3:[%] MaIN ZooNE [%]] Menu (99998 mins. left): PAY\n\n---\nIf you are the sysop you will get the following screen:\n---\nPayUSER Version 1.01 - Written by Zwinx/Rage!\n                                             \nDo you wish to edit stats (y/N)? \n---\nType "Y" here, everything else will exit the door.\n\nYou will now be asked for the username to edit. Wildcards are allowed.\n\nex.\nUserName: Warez*\n\nExpand: WarezMan Correct (Y/n)? \n---\n\nWhen you have choosen the correct user, the mainscreen will appear.\n\nex.\n---\nPayUSER Version 1.01 - Written by Zwinx/Rage!\n\nPAY-INACTIVE     UserName: WAREZMAN\n               Start Date: NOT STARTED\n         Month(s) Payment: 1\n\n       Original downloads: 220\n       Original downbytes: 34442524\n\nEdit [P]ayment, [C]lear Start Date, [R]emove payuser or E[x]it?\n---\n"PAY-INACTIVE" means that this user has no previous Pay-User Account.\nIf a user has a previous account, the text would say "PAY-ACTIVE".\n"Start Date" is a combined field for StartDate of disabled "session" and\nstatus. There are 2 valid statuses (? spelling?) and they are: NOT STARTED\nand REMOVED. NOT STARTED means that this user have never used his PayUser\naccont. When he uses it for the first time, this field will be changed to\nthe date of the first download.\nex.\nStart Date: 19940201\n            ^   ^ ^\n            |   | |\n            |   | +- Day\n            |   +--- Month\n            +------- Year\n\nThe other possible status in this field is "REMOVED". It will be explained\nlater.\n\nThe P-command.\nDefault settings are one month disabled. This is easily changed by typing\n"P" and enter a new number of months. This can be changed on a user with\nStatus "NOT STARTED" as well as a user wich has already started he''s\ndisabled session. You CAN change it on users with status "REMOVED" as well,\nbut it''s rather pointless.\nThe C-command.\nThis command is used when you for any reason want to reset the disabled\ntime for a user. The "status" will be changed to "NOT STARTED".\nThe R-command.\nThis command is used for removing the PayUser Account for a user. The\nstatus will be changed to "REMOVED". NOTE: The user will be "PAY-ACTIVE"\nand will have DISABLED until he tries to download next time. When he\ndoes, he will be informed that the PayUser Account is removed. He''s normal\nRatio, Downloaded bytes and Downloaded files will be resetted to Normal.\n\nOTHER NOTES\n~~~~~~~~~~~\nWhen a user with a never-used Pay Account downloads for the first time, the\nratio is changed to "DISABLED" and the downloaded bytes and files are\nchanged to zero. Everything will b back to normal when the Disabled time\nis over.\nIt''s really easy to use this door! Try it out!\n\nWORDS FROM BETA TESTERS\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n- This is one of my favorite ones!\n- I got really impressed when I first saw this door!\n- Use it, or die!\n- It''s sooo fast, even though it''s written in AREXX!\n\nIMPROVEMENTS\n~~~~~~~~~~~~\nIn the next version, there will be a complete stats list.\n\nCONTACT\n~~~~~~~\nFor contact, bugreports, suggestions or fun, contact me at:\n_ _ ______  __/\  _______ ________________ :_______________ __/\  ___.\n \\\\_    \ \_  \ \_  __/ \_ __/\_ ___/\_ \¦ _/\     _  _  \\_  \ \_ |\n     |  \  \/    \/  /__  /  l/\/  _)__/   \  \ \_/  | _/  //    \/  |/\\n     |  l\  \ /\  \  l  \/   /  \  l   \ \     \ /   | \   \_ /\  \  /  \ _\n     ¦______///____\_____\_______\___  /_/\____//____| /\____|/____\_____\\\n     :   / _/                        \/              \/  / _/\n         \/               ____: ___  ______  /|  ___ _ _ \/\n                         /    \/   \ \___  \/ | /   \\\\\n  ^ RuNNinG o3o/33MHz ^ /   o  \ o  \/  ___/| |/  o  \   ^ sySoP: zWiN× ^\n                     _ _\___    \    \  l  \| |       \\n       ^ rAgE WHq ^  ////_______/____/______\_|_______/     ^ ¹6k8 Ðs ^\n                                              :\n    Node0  16k8DS              Node1 14k4HST            Node2 14k4HST\n   +46-31-775-9390            +46-31-775-9391          +46-31-PRI-VATE\n\n-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-\nThis is Zwinx, Signing off,\nthe last survivor of the Nostromo.\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,11270,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048692);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('rg_stat','RG-STAT.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/RG-STAT.LHA','cPSTATUS','XIM','_________  _____   _____   ______',NULL,'xERXES!','RG','=====\_____  ¬\/~   ¬\_/~    \_/~ ___/====== !:::::7~  /  _/   !   7   l___7  ___)::::::! !:::::!   \  ¬\_  .   !   7  ¬7     ¬7:::::!',replace('      _________  _____   _____   ______\n =====\_____  ¬\/~   ¬\_/~    \_/~ ___/======\n !:::::7~  /  _/   !   7   l___7  ___)::::::!\n !:::::!   \  ¬\_  .   !   7  ¬7     ¬7:::::!\n !:::::l___j\___/__¡___j_______j______j:::::!\n !:::::::::::::PreSeNts:::toDAy:::::::::::::!\n ============================================\n =        cPSTATUS v1.0 bY xERXES!          =\n =        wORKS oN /X v.#? aND S!X          =\n ============================================\n','\n',char(10)),'cPSTATUS.dOC',replace('                             \n                                (13-mARS-95)\n\n\n                         cPSTATUS bY xERXES·rAGE!\n                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                                 CONTENTS:\n                                 ~~~~~~~~~\n\n                   Main File        - cPSTATUS   (4,276K!)\n               Command Files        - S.info\n\n\n                               INSTALLATION:\n                               ~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n\n                    · Copy the main file to doors:rage/\n          · Put the s.info files into the Syscmd and BBScmd dir''s\n\n\n                            HOW TO CONTACT ME !\n\n             CALL : +46-(0)510-62682 GLOBAL EFFECT! rAGE EHQ! \n\n              I TOLD YA! U SHOULD HAVE KILLED ME LAST YEAR!!!\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,5947,4,0,NULL,NULL,'rg_stat_cpstatus','scan',1780048692);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('rg_tchat','RG-TCHAT.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/RG-TCHAT.LHA',NULL,'XIM','_________  _____   _____   ______',NULL,'Zwinx/RAGE','RG','====\_____   \/~    \_/~    \_/~ ___/====== :::::|~  /  _/   |   |   |___|  ___)::::::: :::::|   \   \_  .   |   |   |     |_::::::',replace('    _________  _____   _____   ______\n====\_____   \/~    \_/~    \_/~ ___/======\n:::::|~  /  _/   |   |   |___|  ___):::::::\n:::::|   \   \_  .   |   |   |     |_::::::\n:::::|___j\___/__A___j_______j______j::::::\n:::::::::::::PreseNts:::today::::::::::::::\n===========================================\n TOPchat V1.00 by Zwinx/RAGE COOL AZ HELL!!\n===========================================\n','\n',char(10)),'TOPchat.doc',replace('TOPchat V1.00 by Zwinx/RAGE\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nThis neat little util is written to be used with /X 2.xx and 3.xx. It''s easy\nto use and install.\n\nFEATURES\n~~~~~~~~\n× Displays the chat-time when you exit chat-mode\n× Works fine on multinode systems\n× Saves a ANSI-bulletin with the system''s 10-top time-chatters\n\nINSTALLATION\n~~~~~~~~~~~~\n× Make a directory called "TOPchat" in DOORS:\n\nex.\nHD:> makedir DOORS:TOPchat\n\n× Unpack the TOPchat.LHA archive in DOORS:TOPchat.\n\nex.\nHD:> cd DOCS:TOPchat\nHD:BBS/DOORS/TOPchat> lha x RAM:TOPchat.lha\n\n× Move, rename or copy TOPchat.dat to S:\n\n× Insert the following lines in your SYS.CMD file. Read /X documentation for\n  further information.\n\n---CUT---\nTOPStart  RM010DOORS:TOPChat/TOPstart.rexx\nTOPEnd    RM010DOORS:TOPChat/TOPend.rexx\n---CUT---\n\n× Edit BBS:NodeX/Startchat.txt and BBS:NodeX/EndChat.txt or use the files\n  supplied with this archive. Remeber to edit all active nodes.\n\nIMPORTANT!\n~~~~~~~~~~\n× T: MUST be assigned!\n\nCONTACT\n~~~~~~~\nFor contact, bugreports, suggestions or fun, contact me at:\n_ _ ______  __/\  _______ ________________ :_______________ __/\  ___.\n \\\\_    \ \_  \ \_  __/ \_ __/\_ ___/\_ \¦ _/\     _  _  \\_  \ \_ |\n     |  \  \/    \/  /__  /  l/\/  _)__/   \  \ \_/  | _/  //    \/  |/\\n     |  l\  \ /\  \  l  \/   /  \  l   \ \     \ /   | \   \_ /\  \  /  \ _\n     ¦______///____\_____\_______\___  /_/\____//____| /\____|/____\_____\\\n     :   / _/                        \/              \/  / _/\n         \/               ____: ___  ______  /|  ___ _ _ \/\n                         /    \/   \ \___  \/ | /   \\\\\n  ^ RuNNinG o3o/33MHz ^ /   o  \ o  \/  ___/| |/  o  \   ^ sySoP: zWiN× ^\n                     _ _\___    \    \  l  \| |       \\n       ^ rAgE WHq ^  ////_______/____/______\_|_______/     ^ ¹6k8 Ðs ^\n                                              :\n   ^ aMiGa EliTe oNlY ^        + 46-31-795-5479        ^ ßlAskaN sUppOrT ^\n\n\n-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-·-\nThis is Zwinx, Signing off,\nthe last survivor of the Nostromo.\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,5536,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048692);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('rhp_om09','RHP-OM09.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/RHP-OM09.LHA','ShowName','XIM','ShowName',NULL,NULL,'RHP','|\___      _________     _ _______      __ | ___\____/  \ ____ \___/|/   \   \____/ / |___/ \ | \ | \ __/ / ___|  |  \ | \  / /|',replace('    \n|\___      _________     _ _______      __\n| ___\____/  \ ____ \___/|/   \   \____/ /\n|___/ \ | \ | \ __/ / ___|  |  \ | \  / /|\n|\__  /    \_  \_ _/__   \  |  /    \  / |\n|  |\ \_|___/___/|    \   \___/_____/ /  |\n|__| \___/     \_:________/   |______/MM |\n                                         |\n^    RhAPSOdy present: "oPeNMeNu v0.9"   |\n|       This is a small OPEN door.       |\n|                                        |\n|  >> LiTTLe/FaST/BeauTiFuL /X DooR <<   |\n`----------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'oPeNMeNu.txt',replace('\n                            E X A M P L E :\n\n               [OPEN] This Menu!......................10\n               [ED]   Edit File List.................255\n               [WALL] Write The Wall..................10\n               [WHO]  Who Is OnLine!?.................10\n               [NUKE] NuKer..........................255\n               [CHAT] Multinode Chat..................40\n               [SENT] Edit Your ''Sent by'' Line........10\n               [UL]   User List.......................10\n               [OLM]  Send OnLine Message.............40\n               [VOTE] Our Referendum!.................10\n               [DLST] Download File List..............10\n               [BBS]  World BBS lister................40\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',46040,6,0,NULL,NULL,'rhp_om09','scan',1780048692);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('rink101','RINK101.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/RINK101.LHA','Rink','XIM','Install.exe',NULL,NULL,NULL,':     \_     ¬\_     ¬\_   /   /  Aquatic  : ¦ ·M!·/   /   /   /   /   /   /  presents  ¦ |    /       /   /   /   /   /             |',replace('·     __/\______/\______/\______           ·\n:     \_     ¬\_     ¬\_   /   /  Aquatic  :\n¦ ·M!·/   /   /   /   /   /   /  presents  ¦\n|    /       /   /   /   /   /             |\n¦   /   /   /   /   /   /   /   Rink 1.01  ¦\n:  /___/___/\___   /\______/ The BBS guard :\n·              ¬\_/                        ·\n','\n',char(10)),'Rink.doc',replace('\n                         Rink 1.01 - The BBS guard\n          Copyright © 1994 Beverage/Aquatic, All rights reserved.\n\n As this documentation is in pure Swedish, non Swedes might have to consult\n        a Swedish-to-English dictionary to understand what it says.\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n Denna produkt är inte Public Domain, utan FreeWare. Detta innebär att du\n får kopiera och sprida arkivet hur du vill så länge som du inte ändrar på\n det på något sätt. Du får absolut inte ta några pengar alls för programmet,\n inte ens lite grann som kopieringskostnad. Programmeraren tar absolut inget\n ansvar för vad denna produkt eventuellt gör mot dig eller din\n datorutrustning. Du måste vara medveten om att du använder det på egen\n risk.\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n                          - Vad är Rink? -\n\n Om du kör en BBS så har du nog många gånger blivit mer än irriterad på att\n om nåt får datorn att hänga sig så blir BBS:en oanvändbar. Om så är fallet\n är Rink definitivt något för dig. Det Rink gör är att kolla om det ringer\n ett visst antal gånger på raken. Om så är fallet så resettas datorn och\n basen kan startas om. Rink kan självklart stängas av när som helst.\n\n En annan bra bak som Rink kan göra är att automatiskt resetta när det\n egentligen ska komma upp en gururuta. På så sätt slipper du att en guru\n meditation hidrar din BBS från att fungera.\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n                     - Hur installerar jag Rink? -\n\n Kopiera bara filen "Rink" till "C:" eller något annat ställe där du vill ha\n den. Spara gärna denna dokumentation någonstans, den kan vara användbar i\n framtiden.\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n                      - Hur använder jag Rink? -\n\n Den nuvarande versionen av Rink kan inte startas från Workbench, utan bör\n startas från Shell.\n\n   Syntax:  "run Rink [options]"\n\n [options] bör bytas ut mot ett eller flera av följande kommandon:\n\n RINGS=n                         Detta kommando anger antalet ringsignaler\n                                 som Rink ska vänta på innan det resettar\n                                 datorn. Notera att du måste ange detta för\n                                 att Rink ska starta.\n\n NOGURU                          Genom att skriva detta slår du på Rinks\n                                 gururutabortplockare. Notera att när du väl\n                                 slagit på denna så kan du inte slå av den.\n\n QUIT                            Avslutar helt enkelt Rink.\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _\n\n Om du av någon anledning skulle vilja kontakta skaparen bakom denna\n exellenta produkt så kan du skicka ett NetMail till adress 2:201/328.1.\n Gör gärna det om du hittar något fel, eller om du vill komma med förslag på\n hur Rink kan förbättras.\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',4456,2,0,NULL,NULL,'rink101','scan',1780048692);
