\n       \r\n         MASTURBATiON STATiON AMIGA/PC/CONSOLE/ASCII-ANSI/C64        \r\n               Telnet: bbs.masturbationstationbbs.com\r\n\r\n           UPLOAD DATE: 04-24-16  TIME: 04:03:11  ON NODE: 1\r\n\r\n  UPLOADER: Black Beard            LOCATION: mSTATION.servebbs.com    \r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,5029,2,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048704);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('s8_ds15','S8_DS15.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/S8_DS15.LHA',NULL,'XIM','-===========SHINING 8 PRESENTS=============-',NULL,NULL,'S8','PSYCHOPATH''S SYSOP DOWNLOAD-PROTECTOR V1.5 This is a AREXX-Door door for ami-express. It''s a protection-door to protect you from',replace('-===========SHINING 8 PRESENTS=============-\n PSYCHOPATH''S SYSOP DOWNLOAD-PROTECTOR V1.5\nThis is a AREXX-Door door for ami-express.\nIt''s a protection-door to protect you from\nhaving BAD GUYS using SYSOP DOWNLAOD (DS).\n-==========================================-\n','\n',char(10)),'reference-board.txt',replace(replace('              W h e r e   t h e   w a r e z   c o m e   f r o m\r\n                                               __                /\_____:\r\n__/\__________________________________________|  \______________/  \    |__\r\n\_   ___________  _______ ________  \__   ___ |   _______  _______  \_  l  \\r\n__\____  \    _l   \    |  \     |___/     |  !    \   _l   \   _| __/\____ \_\r\n\_____    \___\     \___|   \___ !   \__   |_____   \__\     \__\    \____   /\r\n -mNT\_____/---\_____/--l____/-\______/\   |----\____/--\_____/--\____/--\__/\r\n                                        \__|\r\n\r\n- -- --> F A i R L i G H T   S W E D i S H   H E A D Q U A R T E R S <-- -- -\r\n\r\n           reference-board is back 2017 after more than 20 years in coma!\r\n\r\n                        Running on AmiExpress TelNet\r\n\r\n                    Connect to: reference-board.zapto.org:1541\r\n\r\n                    or: www.brysk.se/reference-board/index.htm\r\n               \n              UPLOAD DATE: 01-24-18  TIME: 09:29:24  ON NODE: 0\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,4089,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048704);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('s8_stat','S8_STAT.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/S8_STAT.LHA',NULL,'XIM','-===========SHINING 8 PRESENTS=============-',NULL,'PSYCHOPATH','S8','User-Info V2.0 BY PSYCHOPATH OF SHINING 8 This is a AREXX-Door for Ami-Express V2.30+ It just a simply door that displays the',replace('-===========SHINING 8 PRESENTS=============-\n User-Info V2.0 BY PSYCHOPATH OF SHINING 8\nThis is a AREXX-Door for Ami-Express V2.30+\nIt just a simply door that displays the\nusers infos like the S-command in /X\n-==========================================-\n','\n',char(10)),'s8_user-info2.doc',replace(' Welcome to PSYCHOPATH''s User-Info V2.0\n=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-\nPhu! I hate writing docs! But I''ve to do it.... It''s the hardest thing to\ndo..... So let''s get into it.\n\nThis is a AREXX-Door for Ami-Express V2.30+\nIt just a simply door that displays the users infos like the S-command\nin Ami-Express (But this one is much much COOLER)\n\nINSTALLING:\n===========\nAdd this line to your BBS:COMMANDS/BBS:CMD file\n\n------------------- Cut Here ---------------------\n*S        RM001DOORS:Psychopath/s8_user-info2.rexx\n------------------- Cut Here ---------------------\n\nThen copy the files to the DOORS:PSYCHOPATH-directory (or any other\ndirectory..Just make sure that ya have the right path and pathname in the\nBBS.CMD-file)\n\nVERSIONS:\n=========\nI''ve included some diffrent versions b''cos the ORGINAL-version by me has\nto be changed at some lines to look 100 % cool at your BBS..\nB''cos it uses my BBS ACCESS-LEVELS for the users & my BBS COMPUTERLIST\nbut you can change it by yourself (if you can otherwise use the other\nversions)\nORGINAL-VERSION with all FUNCTIONS: filname S8_USER-INFO2.REXX\nVERSION with COMPUTER-TYPE & ACCESS-LEVELS MESSAGES removed: \nFilename S8_USER-INFO2A.REXX\nVERSION with COMPUTER-TYPE removed: Filename S(_USER-INFO2B.REXX\n\nHow to change:\n==============\nAt line 71 - 85 you can change the COMPUTERLIST (It should look like\nyour BBS:NODEX/COMPUTERLIST and not like mine)\nAt line 90 - 94 you can change the users ACCESS-LEVEL (what it should\ndisplay at diffrents ACCESS-LEVELS) at my bbs i got these levels\n-50 LAMERS\n100 ELITE-USER\n150 GROUP-MEMBER\n250 CO-SYSOP\n255 SYSOP\nbut change it to your levels or change your levels to mine...\n\nSo let''s get on with the mainprogram...\nWell, it look like this!!!\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                 USER-INFO V2.0  written by PSYCHOPATH \n                  BBS - RAISING HELL +46-[0]-23-26893\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nWelcome to RAISING HELL!! - Your great sysop is PSYCHOPATH\n\nPossible Access...........>(123456789)               (0123456789)\nConference Access.........> XXXXXXXXX      # of Nodes XX        \nName......................> PSYCHOPATH\nGroup/Location............> SHINING-8\nPassword..................> password\nPhone Number..............> 023-26893\nComputer Type.............> Amiga 2000 + HD (1)\nUser Number...............> 1\nAccess Level..............> 255	 	   SYSOP! (2)\nRatio.....................> DISABLED (3)\nRatio-Type................> DISABLED (4)\nTimes Called..............> 1589	   One of THE BEST BBS-callers! (5)\nTotal Messages Posted.....> 2044	   One of THE BEST message-writers!!(6)\nNumber of Uploads.........> 0		   It`s COOL! (7)\nNumber of Downloads.......> 0		   It`s OK!   (8)\nUploaded bytes............> 0		   It`s COOL! (9)\nDownloaded bytes..........> 0		   It`s OK!   (10)\nAvailable files befor U/L.> DISABLED                  (11)\nAvailable bytes befor U/L.> DISABLED                  (12)\nDaily bytelimit...........> 9.999.999\nDaily byte DL.............> You''re the SYSOP so you don''t LEECH or?!? (13)\nTimeLimit/day.............> 2 Hours/Day\nTime used.................> 00 Hour(s) 05 Mins 31 Secs\nTime remaining Today......> 23 Hour(s) 54 Mins 29 Secs\nLog-In Time...............> Thu Oct 22 01:43:17 1992\nCurent Time...............> Thu Oct 22 01:43:44 1992\nExpert mode On/Off........> On\nChat Status...............> Sysop Is Available For Chat (14)\nYour linelength...........> 25\nOnline Baud...............> 16800\nCurrent Position..........> Node 0 Conference [3:PURE ELITE DUDES]\n-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=->PSYCHOPATH OF SHINING 8\n(1) This line display the computer type (but ya must have changed line \n71 - 85 and putted your COMPUTERLIST in it instead of mine\n\n(2) This display what access-level the user has this levels has I coded in\n-50 = LAMERS\n100 = ELITE-USERS\n150 = GROUP-MEMBER (Like SHINING 8-Memer)\n250 = CO-SYSOP\n255 = SYSOP\n\n(3) Display the users ratio if the user has DISABLED ratio then DISABLED \nare displayed\n\n(4) Displays the users ratio-type. \n- Only Files\n- Only Bytes\n- Bytes & Files\n- and if the user has DISABLED RATIO it displays DISABLED\n\n(5) Displays times called & displays some messages depending on how many\ntimes the user has called\n- 100   calls = BAD BBS-CALLER\n100-300 calls = Avarage BBS-Caller\n300-400 calls = Pretty GOOD bbs-caller\n400 -   calls = one of the best bbs-callers   \n\n\n(6) Displays messages posted & displays a message depending on how many\nmessages the users has posted\n- 100      messages = Bad message-writer\n100 - 250  messages = Avarage message-writer\n250 - 500  messages = pretty good message writer\n500 - 1000 messages = a cool message writer\n1000 -     messages = One of the best message writers\n\n(7) Displays number of uploads and if NUMBER OF UPLOADS are bigger than\n NUMBER OF DOWNLOADS it displays ''It''s COOL''\nif NUMBER OF DOWNLOADS is bigger than NUMBER OF UPLOADS it displays\n''NOT GOOD''\nNOTE: I thinking of adding in so it displays ''A COOL UPLOADER'' when the\nuser has uploaded over xxx files but we''ll see later on..\n\n(8) Displays number of downloads and if NUMBER OF DOWNLOADS are bigger than\nNUMBER OF UPLOADS it displays ''LEECH'' and if NUMBER OF UPLOADS are bigger \nthan NUMBER OF DOWNLOAD it displays ''It''s OK''\nNOTE: I thinking of adding in so it displays ''A MEGA FILE-LEECHER'' when the\nuser has downloaded over xxx files but we''ll see later on..\n\n(9) Same as (7) but in bytes & it also displays ''COOL UPLOADER'' \nif the user has uploaded over 20 meg nad if the user has uploaded \nover 100 meg it displays '' A VERY COOL UPLOADER''\n\n(10) Same as (8) but in bytes\nNOTE: I''m also thinking of adding in so it displats ''A MEGA LEECHER'' when\nwhen the user has downloaded over 100 meg\n\n(11) Displays available files before uploading (if user has DISABLED\n-ratio than it displays DISABLED instead)\nAnd if the users has downloaded to much files (depending on the ratio)\nit displays ''ACCOUNT OVERDRAW - UPLOAD FIRST''\n(12) Same as (11) but in bytes\n\n(13) Display Bytes downloaded today (if the users has ACCESS-LEVEL 255\nthan it displays ''You''re the SYSOP so ya don''t LEECH or?''\n\n(14) Displays if the sysop is available for chat or not\n\nVALUES:\n=======\nThe hardest thing was to write the doc and put in the values when the\nmessages should be displayed (like when should it display GOOD BBS-CALLER\n?? after 100 calls? after 250? well I don''t really know it''s diffrents\nfrom bbs to bbs.. but i putted in some values that I think are going to\nbe good..Otherwise change it !! or call my bbs and I''ll do the changes\nfor you...)\n\nUPDATES:\n========\nthis is V2.0 and i''ve done a V1.4 for ami-expre V1.1x+ for a long time ago\nBut now I''ve added in some more COOL thinks and a new style\nNow it uses ANSI to look REAL COOL!!\nI''ll probably make some updates of this door. We''ll see in the future what\nhappends...\nI''m also coding some logoff-door at the moment that I hope are going to be\nreleased soon.\n\nI hope ya liked this door and want to see more from me....\nContact me at my BBS - RAISING HELL +46-[0]23-26893\n\nHELLOS:\n=======\nCIBI/S8               - I''m waiting for the T-shirt so send it nooooow!\nLACOSTE/S8            - Are ya going to denmark party? maybe we gonne\n                        KICK ASS & BOOZE together!!\nTHE BIG BAD BUD/AGILE - Stay COOL and stay at the TOP!! YEAH! \nLARGO                 - How are ya? long time since I heard from ya!\nTHE GNN/DUAL CREW     - Are ya going to denmark-party?\n\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,12715,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048704);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('s8_vs15','S8_VS15.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/S8_VS15.LHA','type','XIM','Delete',NULL,NULL,'S8',NULL,replace('XXXX....\n','\n',char(10)),'vs.doc',replace('-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n              =ø= IT''S KEWL, IT''S GREAT, IT''S SHINING 8 ! =ø=\n \n __ _ /\_____  /\__     /\_  /\_____  /\_  /\_____  /\_____     /\_____\n _ ___ __    \/   /__  /   \/ __    \/   \/ __    \/   __  \   /  __   \\n    /   /____/   /   \/    /   /    /    /   /    /   /    /  /  __    /\n   /_____   /___/    /____/___/    /____/___/    /_____   /  /__    __/\n      /____/   /____/        /____/        /____/   /____/    /_____/GDh\n \n              =ø= IT''S KEWL, IT''S GREAT, IT''S SHINING 8 ! =ø=\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                P   R   E   S   E   N  T  S\n\n         VS-DOOR V1.5 BY PSYCHOPATH OF SHINING 8\n                                               RELEASED 30/1-1993 00:01 CET\nWelcome to PSYCHOPATH''s VS-DOOR V1.5\n====================================\nYep It''s another door from me...\nWell this one is a replacement for the ami-x command VS (sysop VIEW)\nBut this one can display TEXT-FILES, BINARY-FILES & LHA-FILES\n(maybe more in the next update)\nYou can also use PASSWORD for using the VS-DOOR\nJust load you favourite text-editor and load S8_VS.REXX\njust enter the password you want at the top of the file at this line\nPROTECT = "PASSWORD" (Must be in UPPERCASE) or if ya don''t want password\njust change the line to this\nPROTECT = "" and it will not ask for the password when ya enter the door\nIt works like this...\nYou type VS at the command-line and it goes into the door\nthen it asks for the PASSWORD (if protect = "" then it skip this question)\nand if ya fail to enter the right password it writes into the CALLERRSLOG\nAnd after that it asks what kind of file ya want to view\n(L=LHA B=BINARY T=TEXT) \nThen it asks for the COMPLETE PATH & FILENAME\neverything is written to the CALLERSLOG\nlike this.. SYSOP VIEW(LHA) filename\n            SYSOP VIEW(BINARY) filename\n ETC..\nwhen You choose LHA option it looks for DH0:LHA\nso you better put LHA there or change my paths\nWhen you choose BINARY option it looks for DH0:C/TYPE\nIt also uses DH0:C/DELETE to delete some files in RAM: that are created\nwhen using the door\nso you better put LHA there or change my paths\nWhen you use TEXT-FILE it uses ami-x VS-Command\nIt doesn''t display the file if it''s RESTRICTED\nif ya type VS FILENAME it displays the textfiles you did enter after VS\nWell I hope that this is all you have to know.....\nJust insert this line into your BBS.CMD\n\n------------ C U T  H E R E --------------\n*VS       RM250Doors:psychopath/s8_vs.rexx\n------------ C U T  H E R E --------------\nBut you can of cos change the sec. level if you want\n\nNEEDED FILES:\n=============\ndh0:C/TYPE\ndh0:C/DELETE\ndh0:LHA\nis the files that my door uses so copy the included files to the right\npath and everything would work or chang the PATH in S8_VS.REXX\nthe included files DELETE & TYPE are for DOS 2.0 so if ya are using\nLOwer version than 2.0 then copy your wb files DELETE & TYPE to the paths\nthat my door uses..\nto contact me call my bbs!!!\n\n _ _ _  ___/\_____  /\_____  /\_  /\_____  /\_  /\_____  /\_____ \n_  __  ___  __    \/ ___   \/   \/ __    \/   \/ __    \/   __  \\n         /   /  __/        /    /   /____/    /   /    /   /    /\n        /___/    /___/    /____/_____   /____/___/    /_____   /\n           \____/   \____/      _/  ___/        \____/ _/  ___/__ _ __\n                                \___/                  \_____ __ _ __\n+46-[0]23-26893  +46-[0]23-26893       +46-[0]23-26863\n                 GDh/\__     /\_____  /\_       /\_\n           ___ _ _ /___/____/    _  \/   \     /   \\n         __  _  ______     /    ____/    /____/    /____\n                 /___/    /_____   /____     /____     /__ _ _  __\n                    \____/ _/  ___/    \____/    \_____ __ __ _ _ _\n                           \___/     \n                       BLASKAN SUPPORT BBS\n        _____________________________________________________\n       / Blaskan support BBS call it and vote for the CHARTS \\n       \_____________________________________________________/\n\nCruel Sysop:   PSYCHOPATH/SHINING-8\nFast co-sysop: S /\/\ S  from luxemburg\n\nif you liked this door PLEASE send me some $ to this address\nLars Norgren\nKallTorpsV. 7 b , 1 Tr\nS-791 53 Falun\nBBS: +46-[0]23-26893\n\nIf you got any problem contact me!!\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',40587,4,0,NULL,NULL,'s8_vs15','scan',1780048704);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('sad_ac10','SAD_AC10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/SAD_AC10.LHA','SAD-DSort','XIM','SAD-DSort',NULL,NULL,'SAD',':___\  ___//\____/\\ _   /____/\\______ \_: ¡    \____   ___           ___        /   ¡ !_____________!______|______|_____________!',replace('    _______        _______      ________\n:___\  ___//\____/\\ _   /____/\\______ \_:\n¡    \____   ___           ___        /   ¡\n!_____________!______|______|_____________!\n:____ ___ __ _:                           :\n:\  //__//_///: -[ aRTcHART v1.o! gREAT ]-:\n: \/          : -[ mONTH tOP fOR aSCII  ]-:\n:             : -[ cONFERENCE(s)!       ]-:\n`->/X dESIGN<-^---------------------------''\n-=[ fRESH fROM *tHE pUB* iT cAME aLONG ! ]=-\n[iSDN][°] lEEChEd fRoM gOd''s hArEm [°][33.6]\n[fOUND oN dA pROGRESS gHQ]-[dREAM pARK bBS!]\n','\n',char(10)),'SAD-ArtChart.doc',replace('\n\n\n\n\n   _________               ________            ___________          ________\n_ _\   ____(_  ________  __\  _____l_  ________\__       (_  ____ __\  _____l_\n    \____    |_\  _____l_    __|     |_\   ___   /____     |_\__/__     |     |\n __ _________|     |     |___________|      \___/  l_______|       |__________|\n           l_____________| ÷f!÷     l________|           l_________|\n\n\n\n                 a·M·I   e·X·P·R·E·S·S   d·E·S·I·G·N   1·9·9·5\n\n                                p·R·E·s·E·N·T·z\n\n\n\n      .  .:.--¡!-----------------------------------------¡:----.\n : : :: :::|  !: sAD-aRTcHART v1.o by fLI7e / SAD^C!^HJB !¡    |::: :: :  :   :\n      ·  ·:`--:------------------------------------------:!----''\n                                                          :\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                                 .-==========-.\n                                 |  cONTENTS  |\n                                 `-==========-''\n\n                                ø  ©opyrights  ø\n                                ø iNTRODUCTION ø\n                                ø rEQUIREMENTS ø\n                                ø   fEATURES   ø\n                                ø iNSTALLATION ø\n                                ø cONTACT sAD  ø\n                                ø   hISTORY    ø\n                                ø  gREETINGS   ø\n                                ø sAD rELEASES ø\n                                ø  sAD mEMBAZ  ø\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-  - -= -===================»> (c)OPYRIGHT nOTES <«=================- =- -  -\n\n                  pERMISSION iS gRANTED tO fREELY dISTRIBUTE\n                tHIS pRODUCT fOR nON-cOMMERCIAL pURPOSES oNLY,\n                    aS lONG aS aLL fILES rEMAIN uNMODIFIED.\n\n    iT`S aLSO aLLOWED tO dISTRIBUTE tHE FULL pAKAGE tROUGH aNY NETWORK lIKE\n                              INTERNET aND AMINET!\n\n\n                            sIGNED: fLI7e / sAD 1995\n\n- -= -=================================================================- =- -\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                  iNTRODUCTION\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n                    ARTCHART is a nice ART GROUP MONTH TOP!\n\n          If you run a ASCII CONF and it`s good used then you may like\n               to support a seperate chart for ASCII GROUPS only!\n\n                    At this point ARTCHART is your solution!\n\n            ArtChart will generate and update a nice looking outfile\n            beeing good for bulletins or Bull.txt in the ASCII CONF!\n\n          The Header is 100% variable so you can have your own header!\n\n          You can also have a variable datafile where you can specify\n                    the groups prefixes and their fullnames!\n\n       All in all it`s a nice looking, fast and easy to handle MONTH TOP!\n     If you don`t wan`t to have ARTISTS ONLY well .. just change the header\n                             and add more prefixes!\n\n          The ONLY limitation is that you can run ONE CONFERENCE only!\n      This is because of ARTCHARTS main meaning! No BBS have more than ONE\n                       ASCII UPLOAD CONFERENCE (I guess!)\n\n                  This may be a feature for further versions!\n\n     I`m also planning to release CONFIG EDITORS for all my FURTHER commin`\n       doors .. but JUST FOR REGISTERED users! Registration will NOT COST\n         any money! Just some calls to my bbs and some days of waiting!\n\n     So If you like my door(s) then consider calling the roots if it/them!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                  rEQUIREMENTS\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n                               /X 3.xx+, OS2.04+\n\n                           !!! REXX SERVER ACTIVE !!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                    fEATURES\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                                  Nice outfit\n\n              one Keycode can be placed to place the actual month!\n\n                            Pffft ... nuthin` more!\n\n           Seperate Group Statistic files in tjhe DATAFILES DRAWERS!\n\n         Packing all datafiles in one LHA file at the end of the month!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                  iNSTALLATION\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n\n  mAKE  A  DIR  named:   "DOORS:SCEPTIC" and copy the dir "F!-ArtChart" to\n  this  location.\n\n  Now copy the "EXAMINE(x).info" to your SYSCMD/EXAMINE(x).info\n\n\n\n                             To the config file(s)\n\n\n  SAD-FIDEnhance.cfg (see examplefile)\n  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n	USECONF		= FULL path to the conf to use\n	OUTFILE		= FULL path & name to the OUTPUTFILE\n	MONTH		= Month to use for! When the next month will\n                          begin it`ll automatically updated!\n\n	IE: USECONF	= "confs:asski/"\n	    OUTFILE	= "doors:sceptic/F!-ArtChart/ArtChart.bullfile"\n	    MONTH	= 10\n\n\n\n\n     Also distributed with The SAD-AC1o Archive a file called CLEANUP.rexx!\n          Using this file will clean up ALL the DATAS in the DAT FILE!\n\n                Just call  RX CLEANUP.rexx  from any CLI/SHELL!\n\n\n    Load the #?.header file and you can edit it to your needs! If you insert\n             the "@@@@@" key the actual month/year will replace it!\n\n                       Just have a look on the original!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                   cONTACT sAD\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n\n                                                  __\n                                                 /\_\\n           -  - -- --- ---------------------.----\/_/---- --- -- -  -   -\n  __________       ________                 | __________   _____________\n  \         \_____/       /_________        !_\_  ___  /__/       / ___/_____\n   \____      /  /       / ____    /       /        / /  /       /  \__     /\n     /       /          /  \______/__     /        __/  /       /     /    /\n     \______/__/       /____________/F!   \________/ \_________/\_________/\n-  -= -=-==-==/_______/==-==-=- =-  -   -   ¡\n                                            !\n                            SAD WHQ - +49-5551-65139\n                                            :\n                                  SYSOP: fLI7e\n                                            |\n                                            |     _  _ __ ______ _\n                                            |     \ \\\\ \\   __\n           _ __ __ __ _                     |      \ \\\\_\\  /___ __ _  _\n   .-----------\\//-------------------------''               \//__//_//// /\n   |            \/\n   |________   ______ ___________         _______   ______   ______   ______\n  _!\ _____/__/     /_\____/    /___    __\ _ _  \__\_    \__\_    \__\___  \\n /   _/   /  /     /      /    /   /   /    / /  /   /    /   /    /     /  /\n/        /  /     /      /        /   /    / /  /   /    /   /    /     /  /\n\_______/\_______/\_____/\_______/    \___/_/__/\_______/\_______/\____/__/\n  _|_\n _\|_                       SAD EHQ - +49-3322-208768\n   \/\n   |                         SYSOP: cLYDE rADCLIFFE\n   |         __\n   `---------\/-----.----------------------------------------- --- -- -  -\n                    |\n                    |     _______ ____ __ ______ __ ____ _______\n                    |    /______//___//_//______\\_\\___\\______\\n                    |    \______\\___\\_\\______//_//___//______/\n     ________    ___!__     ____          _____     ______   ______   _____\n    _\_____ /____\__   \___/    \________/    /_____\__   \__\___  \__\___ \\n   /   __/    / ___    /  /     / ___   /    /   / ___    /     /  /     / /\n  /    \     /  \     /  /     /  \____/__      /  \     /     /  /       /\n  \_____\___/________/\_______/__________/_____/________/_____/__/_______/\n                    ¡\n                    |\n       - -- --------÷--> SAD GHQ - +49-7128-3511\n                    |\n                    |     SYSOP: H2o!\n                    |                 __\n                    |                _\/_\n                    `----.------------\/---------- --- -- -\n                         |\n       ________    ______!_____    ________  ________________\n    ___\    __/____\____/     /____\  ____/__\____   \       \__ ___\n    \   \___    /      /     /   /  __/    /     /   /\____    //  /__\n     \     /   /      /         /         /     /   /   /     //  // /_\n      \_______/\_____/\________/\________/_____/___/    \____//__//_///\n          ________   ____|___  ________      ____   ______ ________  ________\n   ___ ___\    __/___\  ____/__\_____ /_____/    \__\____/_\  ____/__\  ____/_\n __\  \\   \___    /  __/    /   __/    /  /     /      /     /    /  __/    /\n_\ \\  \\     /   /         /    \     /  /     /      /          /         /\n\\\_\\__\\_______/\________/\_____\___/\_______/\_____/\_________/\________/\n                         |\n                         |\n                         |  SAD OZHQ - +616-955-5119\n                         |   SYSOP: RUDOLF H.\n                         |\n- -- --- ----------------÷------------------------------------------- -- -\n                         |\n   ________ _____  ______!  _____    _____ ______   ______   ______   ______\n  _\  ____/_\__ /__\___ _/_/  __/____\___/_\___ /___\___ /___\ ___/___\___ /_\n /  ____/     /  /   _/   /   \__  /    /     /  /     /  /   _/   /     /  /\n/     //        /    \   /      / /    /     /  /     /  /        /     /  /\n\____/ \_______/\_____\__\_______/\___/\_______/\_______/\_______/\____/__/\n                    _____!________     _______  ________  ________________\n _______ _   ___ ___\_  ___  \   /_____\___   \_\____  /__\  ____/_       \__\n \   __ _  __\  \\      \____/  /   / ____    /     /   /  __/    /_____    /\n  \  /    _\ \\  \\      //        /  \      /     /   /         /  /      /\n   \/     \\\_\\__\\____/|\_______/\________/\____/___/\________/   \_____/\n                         |\n                         |\n                         |   SAD IRL HQ - +353-1-820 8489\n                         |      SYSOP: GREEN BERET\n                         |\n                         `-----------------÷----------------- --- -- -  -\n                                           |\n      ______  ______  ______  ____    ____ |  _____   ____    ______  ______\n   _ _\ ___/__\__  /__\ ___/_/   /___/   /_!__\_   \_/   /____\___  \_\___ /_\n        \_  / __/   /  _/   /__ /   /   /   /  /    /   /   /    /  /    /  /\n        /  /  \    /       /       /       /  /    /   /   /    /  /    /  /\n   __ ____/____\  /_______/_______/___/   /_______/_______/____/__/_______/\n               _\/_                  /___/ !\n             __\\//__\n             \ \\// /      SAD IHQ - +39-473-244-839\n              \ \/ /             SYSOP: GURGLE\n               \  /\n                \/                         ¡\n                                           !\n                                           :\n                                           .\n\n                                           .\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                     hISTORY\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                          v1.0 - ø fIRST pUBLIC rELEASE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                    gREETINGS\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAquarius/Outlaws ................ -»> Still in Outlaws? Why don`t you come\n                                      over here!?\n\nSTC/TASK ........................ -»> Where are the NEW doors? Are you dead\n                                      or just sleeping? Come over here and\n                                      join our little family!\n\nTHE PROPHET/NJY ................. -»> Your LOGOFF DOOR is not that good isn`t\n                                      it? Looks like all the other doors you\n                                      can find out there! Wassup!?\n\nCOUGAR/HOODLUM .................. -»> Lousiest BETA TESTER ever! Why don`t you\n                                      install the updates i pump to your system\n                                      so often?\n\nCAPT.CRUNCH/TRSI ................ -»> HEY m8! Nice calls you made! We need\n                                      to chat again soon! btw. your\n                                      RAVE EXTREME ascii you wanted is on it`s\n                                      final steps ... hang on ...\n\nHITPOWER/PRODIGY ................ -»> Erm, Modem damaged? Or quitted scene? Why\n                                      don`t ya call?\n\n       and all slaved SYSOPS and /X-DOOR CODER worldwide! Keep /X going!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                  sAD rELEASES\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          F! = FLITE\n          CR = CLYDE RADCLIFFE\n          WW = WIGWAM\n          SM = SHADOWMASTER\n          BD = BIRD\n\n          /X dOORS                  tOOLS                     oTHERS\n          ~~~~~~~~                  ~~~~~                     ~~~~~~\n          (F!) dOWNLOAD eNHANCE     (F!) mODLISTcREATOR       (F!)mAXON tWIST\n          (F!) uSERlISTER           (F!) fILELIST cREATOR     (CR)/X 4.6td\n          (F!) cOMMENT              (WW) wBSTARTER cHOOSE     (CR)/X 4.9\n          (F!) sTATUS               (WW) dOUBLESORT           (F!)/X 4.10\n          (F!) cHIPMANIA vOTE dOOR  (F!) hACK`O`mATIC         sEACRH 4 YOU\n          (F!) wALL                 (F!) cITY cODE sEARCH\n          (F!) bULLETINS            (F!) LF&ESC KILLA\n          (F!) rEQUEST              (BD) RCT\n          (F!) dOWNlOADdIR          (BD) HYPER ESC KILLER\n          (F!) aCCESScHECKER\n          (F!) fRONTeND             aSCII cOLLS\n          (F!) lASTcALLERS          ~~~~~~~~~~~\n          (F!) fILEiDeNHANCE        (F!) nOBITmap 01\n          (F!) lOGoUT               (F!) nOBITmap 02\n          (F!) oNLINE hELP          (F!) nOBITmap 03\n          (F!) sYSsHELL             (F!) fUCK tHE aRMY\n          (F!) fORCEaNSI            (F!) rEQ`ed 01\n          (F!) dOORSmENU