n\n\n\nThePub [10:aMIGa wAREz] Menu (34 mins. left): g\n\n         __          D·O   Y·O·U\n   ______\/__ ___________  _______  _______  __   _______       _______/\__ _\n_ _)_____\/ /_)_____    /__)_____ \_)_    /__\/___)_    /_______)_    /\n      _/  _/__   _/    /__    __   \_    |   \/ /      |      /   \  |\n      \      /   \____/  /    \     /    |     |       |     |     \___\n       \    /           |          |           |             |       |\n        \  / ·          ¦          ¦           ¦             ¦\n         \/  :          :          :           :             :\n         __  ¦          ·          ·           ·             ·      ·\n        /_/\ |                     W·A·N·N·A   L·O·G·O·F·F   ?      :\n      __\_\/ |                                                      |\n     /\_\    |   [1]  yEP  ! .................. tIME 2 lEAVE  [1]   |\n     \/_/ __ |   [2]  nOPE ! ......... aDD mY bBS 2 bBS-LIST  [2]   |\n          \/ |   [3]  nOPE ! ................. sHOW bBS-LIST  [3]   |\n             |   [4]  nOPE ! ......... lEAVE lAST cALLER mSG  [4]   |\n             |   [5]  nOPE ! .............. cOMMENT tO sYSOP  [5]   |\n             |   [6]  nOPE ! ....................... rELOGON  [6]   |\n             |   [7]  nOPE ! ................. rETURN tO bBS  [7]   |\n             |                                      ________________|\n             |                                     /\n             |   [?]  lOGoFF iNFO  [?]            / sAD lOGoFF v.1.7\n             |___________________________________/   bY fLI7e / sAD\n\nlAST cALLERS-mAIL: gREAT uL`s today ... nEED tO lEECH eM sOON ...\n\n                   You`re leaving ThePub ...\n\nClick...\n\nNO CARRIER\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',22010,8,0,NULL,NULL,'sad_ac10','scan',1780048719);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('sad_ae10','SAD-AE10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/SAD-AE10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','_________________',NULL,'Fli7e','SAD','_/ ___/_  _ /_ ___ \ SCEPTIC /X DESIGN / \_    /     /   / //- Presents in 95 /--. /_______/__/__/_____//  another AIM DOOR   |',replace('    _________________\n  _/ ___/_  _ /_ ___ \ SCEPTIC /X DESIGN\n / \_    /     /   / //- Presents in 95 /--.\n/_______/__/__/_____//  another AIM DOOR   |\n_                                          |\n|   SAD-ADD Enhance v1.0 by Fli7e / SAD!   |\n|                                          |\n| Will add DATE, TIME & NODE of UPLOAD to  |\n|a txtadd! Use it if your Checker dont do! |\n`------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'SAD-AddEnhance.doc',replace('     _________________________________  __________\n     \   __/_ ___/_ ___/_  __  /     /_/___/  ___/_\n.--- /\___  / /   /__/  /  ___/___/   /   /   /   / --------------------------.\n| A /______/_____/_____/___/    /____/___/_______/ /X Design Production 1995! |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n\n      .  .:.--¡!-------------------------------------------¡:---.             .\n:  : :: :::|  !: SAD-ADD Enhance v1.0 by FLI7e/SAD^HJB^NJY !¡   |::: :: :  :  :\n      ·  ·:`--:--------------------------------------------:!---''             ·\n                                                            :\n\n\n-  - -- ---------------------> (c)opyright notes <------------------- -- -  -\n\n                  Permission is granted to freely distribute\n                this product for non-commercial purposes only,\n                    as long as all files remain unmodified.\n\n- -- ------------------------------------------------------------------- --- --\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Introduction                                                                |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n  SAD-ADD ENHANCE is a small but very powerfull FILE ADD ENHANCER!  It`s ment\n  to  be  used  if your LHA, TXT, ZIP or whatever adder did nut support TIME,\n  DATE  and  /  or  NODE  of UPLOAD adding!  With this door you can add these\n  things to the add(s) before the checker grab `em!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Requirements                                                                |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n  I  don`t  know If Mr.  J.  Hodge has changed the /X REXX PORT since /X $Ver\n  2.0!  But If he did so then you need at least /X 2.0+ to run this door!\n\n  Amiga  OS 2.04+ would also be very usefull because of the RexxMAST you need\n  to run this door!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Features                                                                    |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n  · Can ADD DATE, TIME and NODE of UPLOAD to a TEXTFILE\n  · Can execute scripts to copy the add to different places/names to be\n    used by different adder!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Installation                                                                |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n   Copy all the files from this archive to the matching places on your BBS:\n\n     Rename the SYSCMD/EXAMINE(x).info to EXAMINE1.info or what number you\n                               like/need to have!\n\n             Load the config files and edit it to your needs!\n\n  SAD-ADDEnhance.cfg\n  ------------------\n  ARCEXT	= "LHA,LZH,LZX,SFX,RUN,ZIP,ARJ"\n  TXTEXT	= "TXT,NFO,DOC,DOK,ANS,ASC,DIZ"\n\n  Here you`ve to specify which extensions are ARCHIVES (ARC) and which are\n  TEXTs (TXT)! This is just because of the different configfiles you can\n  have! One for ARCs and one for TXTs ... See below for them ...\n\n  SAD-ADDEnhance.cfg.ARC/TXT\n  --------------------------\n  ADATE		= 1\n		ADD DATE?	 0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  ATime		= 1\n		ADD TIME?	 0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  ANode		= 1\n		ADD NODE?	 0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  DORANDOM	= 1\n		USE RANDOM ADDS? 0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  RANDOMLOW	= 0\n		Lowest Randomnumber(also default add if Random is NO)\n\n  RANDOMHI	= 2\n		Highest Randomnumber\n\n  AddSource	= "doors:sceptic/F!-AddEnhance/ADDS/TXT.add"\n                Sourcefile (basename)\n\n                e.g. TXT.add0\n                     TXT.add1\n                     ...\n\n  AddDestination= "dh0:s/frontadd.txt"\n		the file to copy the FINISHED ADD VERSION TO! You can\n                copy it afterwards using the following file.\n\n\n  SAD-ADDEnhance.scriptARC/TXT\n  ----------------------------\n\n  Here  you  can  do anything you can do from SHELL!  It`s an ordinary script\n  which  will  be  executed!  By this way you can copy the add made before to\n  where  you  like!   E.g.   your Zip, LHA and TXT adder use different files!\n  Then  Just  do  ONE and copy it to the places where it belong!  I use it to\n  MULTIPLY  the  adds!   Just  think  about  what  you can do with this!  I`m\n  thinking of including a RANDOM SCRIPT usage!  So if you use RANDOMSCRIPT=ON\n  then a random script will be executed so that you can have always different\n  names or what you like! But that`s just in mind!\n\n\n  KeyCodes\n  --------\n\n  ##-##-##	= DATE\n  ##:##		= TIME\n  N@		= NODE\n\n  You can place THESE Keycodes inside your ADD(s) and ADDENHANCE will replace\n  them with the DATE,TIME and NODE! Maybe more to come soon!?\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Contact S/\D                                                                |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n   The Pub             (WHQ) +49-5551-65139  - 1ND 28k8 (sYSOP:       fLI7e)\n   Silent Service     (DIST) +616 955 5119   - 1ND 28k8 (sYSOP:   Rudolf H.)\n   RaveLand            (GHQ) +49-7128-3511   - 1ND 28k8 (sYSOP:        H2O!)\n   Forbidden Planet (IRL-HQ) +353-1-820 8489 - 2ND 33k6 (sYSOP: Green-Beret)\n\n   SWITCHBOARD          HLM GHQ.     5ND      MSG to "[]-> Fli7e & WTM <-[]"\n   EVIL MOON         RMD^AG! HQ.     1ND      MSG to "[]-> Fli7e & WTM <-[]"\n\n                                  oR wRITE tO\n\n                         EMail: [email removed]\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| History                                                                     |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n             _________________ ____        ____ _________________\n             \________________\\___) v1.0 (___//________________/\n\n                                 First release!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Greetings & Messages                                                        |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\nAquarius/Outlaws ................ -»> Still in Outlaws? Why don`t you come\n                                      over here!?\n\nFOX/AG!^REMEDY .................. -»> Hi Vince! Hope this one is running clean\n                                      and bugfree! Test it!\n\nSTC/TASK ........................ -»> Where are the NEW doors? Are you dead\n                                      or just sleeping?\n\nTHE PROPHET/NJY ................. -»> Hmmm! Same as above!\n\nPIWI GON/SAD .................... -»> You`r /X CFG ED looks great! Letus work\n                                      fast to release it! MUI ROOLZ!\n\nCOUGAR/HOODLUM .................. -»> Lousiest BETA TESTER ever! Why don`t you\n                                      install the updates i pump to your system\n                                      so often?\n\nHITPOWER/PRODIGY ................ -»> Erm, Modem damaged? Or quitted scene? Why\n                                      don`t ya call?\n\nCASIO/SAD ....................... -»> Hey my dear ITALIAN ONE MEN DIVISION! How\n                                      are you?\n\n       and all slaved SYSOPS and /X-DOOR CODER worldwide! Keep /X going!\n\n\n\nNO CARRIER\n\n+++ATH\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,4942,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048704);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('sad_ae12','SAD-AE12.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/SAD-AE12.LHA',NULL,'XIM','_________________',NULL,'Fli7e','SAD','_/ ___/_  _ /_ ___ \ SCEPTIC /X DESIGN / \_    /     /   / //- Presents in 95 /--. /_______/__/__/_____//  another AIM DOOR   |',replace('    _________________\n  _/ ___/_  _ /_ ___ \ SCEPTIC /X DESIGN\n / \_    /     /   / //- Presents in 95 /--.\n/_______/__/__/_____//  another AIM DOOR   |\n_                                          |\n|   SAD-ADD Enhance v1.2 by Fli7e / SAD!   |\n|                                          |\n| Will add DATE,TIME,NODE,UPLOADE,LOCATION |\n|to txtfiles! Usefull if ya Checker do not!|\n`------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'SAD-AddEnhance.doc',replace('\n             .----------------------------------------------------------------.\n             ¡ iT`s aNOTHER                                 ______            ¡\n_ ___________!_________ ___________ ____________ ___________\____/_ ________  |\n        ____/_    ____/____  ___  /___     __  /_______   _/_     /    ____/__|\n _ ___       /            /  \___/   /  ______/    |        /    /            |\n_ __________/____________/__________/ ____|        l_______/____/__________ _ |\n             !                                                                |\n             ! .                                         /X DESIGN Production !\n             : .                                           ·                  :\n      .  .:.--¡!-------------------------------------------¡:---.             .\n:  : :: :::|  !: SAD-ADD Enhance v1.2 by FLI7e/SAD^HJB^NJY !¡   |::: :: :  :  :\n      ·  ·:`--:--------------------------------------------:!---''             ¡\n             !                                              :                 !\n             `----------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n\n\n===============================================================================\n                                (c)opyright notes\n===============================================================================\n\n                  Permission is granted to freely distribute\n                this product for non-commercial purposes only,\n                    as long as all files remain unmodified.\n\n     It`s not allowed to make any kind of PROFIT with this programm without\n           having a WRITTEN permission signed by the AUTHOR himself!\n\n                All © and Written 1995 Sceptic Amiexpress Design\n\n===============================================================================\n\n\n\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Introduction                                                                |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n  SAD-ADD ENHANCE is a small but very powerfull FILE ADD ENHANCER!  It`s ment\n  to  be  used  if your LHA, TXT, ZIP or whatever adder did not support TIME,\n  DATE,NODE etc. of UPLOAD adding!  With this door you can add  these  things\n  to the add(s) before the checker grab `it!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Requirements                                                                |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n  I  don`t  know If Mr.  J.  Hodge has changed the /X REXX PORT since /X $Ver\n  2.0!  But If he did so then you need at least /X 2.0+ to run this door!\n\n  Amiga  OS 2.04+ would also be very usefull because of the RexxMAST you need\n  to run this door!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Features                                                                    |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n  · Can add DATE,TIME,NODE,UPLOADER & ULer LOCATION to a TEXTFILE where YOU\n    want to using KEYWORDS\n\n  · Can execute RANDOM scripts to copy the add to different places/names to\n    be used by different adder!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Installation                                                                |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n   Copy all the files from this archive to the matching places on your BBS:\n\n      Rename the SYSCMD/EXAMINE.info to EXAMINE1.info or what number you\n                               like/need to have!\n\n             Load the config files and edit it to your needs!\n\n\n\n  SAD-ADDEnhance.cfg\n  ------------------\n  ARCEXT	= "LHA,LZH,LZX,SFX,RUN,ZIP,ARJ"\n  TXTEXT	= "TXT,NFO,DOC,DOK,ANS,ASC,DIZ"\n\n  Here  you`ve  to  specify which extensions are ARCHIVES (ARC) and which are\n  TEXTs  (TXT)!   This  is  just because of the different configfiles you can\n  have!  One for ARCs and one for TXTs ...  See below for them ...\n\n  If a file has been UL with an extension not included in this configfile the\n  ADD ENHANCE will be skipped (maybe senseless!?)\n\n\n  SAD-ADDEnhance.cfg.ARC/TXT\n  --------------------------\n  ADATE			= ADD DATE?	      0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  ATime			= ADD TIME?	      0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  ANode			= ADD NODE?	      0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  AUser			= ADD USERNAME?	      0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  ALoca			= ADD LOCATION?	      0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  DORANDOM		= USE RANDOM ADDS?    0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  RANDOMLOW		= Lowest Randomnumber(also default add if\n                          Random is NO)\n\n  RANDOMHI		= Highest Randomnumber\n\n  ScriptDORANDOM        = USE RANDOM Scripts? 0=NO / 1=YES\n\n  ScriptRANDOMLOW       = Lowest Randomnumber(also default script if\n                          Random is NO)\n\n  ScriptRANDOMHI        = Highest Randomnumber\n\n  AddSource		= Sourcefile (basename)\n\n  AddDestination	= "dh0:s/frontadd.txt"\n		          the file to copy the FINISHED ADD VERSION TO! You\n                          can copy/multiply/rename it afterwards using  the\n                          following file.\n\n\n\n  SCRIPTS/SAD-ADDEnhance.scriptARC#/TXT#\n  --------------------------------------\n\n  Here  you  can  do anything you can do from SHELL!  It`s an ordinary script\n  which  will  be  executed!  By this way you can copy the add made before to\n  where  you  like!   E.g.   your Zip, LHA and TXT adder use different files!\n  Then  Just  do  ONE and copy it to the places where it belong!  I use it to\n  MULTIPLY  the  adds!   Just  think  about  what  you can do with this!\n\n  As  explained in the FEATURES section you can now have RANDOM scripts, too!\n  Just  play  around with them!  look up my example scripts delivered in this\n  archive, too!\n\n\n\n  KeyCodes\n  --------\n\n  ##-##-##	= DATE\n  ##:##		= TIME\n  N@		= NODE\n  UN@		= USERNAME\n  LO@		= LOCATION\n\n  You can place THESE Keycodes inside your ADD(s) and ADDENHANCE will replace\n  them with the DATE,TIME and NODE!\n\n  REMEMBER: It will just replace any key ONE TIME! If you have e.g the TIME\n            10 times in your add only the 1st will be changed to TIME! the\n            other ones will left as ##:##!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Contact S/\D                                                                |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n  __________       ________                   __________   _____________\n  \         \_____/       /_________        __\_  ___  /__/       / ___/_____\n   \____      /  /       / ____    /       /        / /  /       /  \__     /\n     /       /          /  \______/__     /        __/  /       /     /    /\n     \______/__/       /____________/F!   \________/ \_________/\_________/\n-  -= -=-==-==/_______/==-==-=- =-  -   -\n                        ______               ______\n      sYzOP: fLI7e      \    /  SCEPTIC WHQ. \    / eVERYTHING sERVED uSING\n  __  coOpz: wINTERMUTe  \  /   HAUJOBB EHQ.  \  /  A4k, 1.2gB HD, 28k8 v34\n /\_\        pIWi         \/     N-JOY  GHQ.   \/\n \/_/\n                               +49-5551-65139\n\n  ···········································································\n\n   Silent Service     (DIST) +614 955 5119   - 1ND 28k8 (sYSOP:   Rudolf H.)\n   RaveLand            (GHQ) +49-7128-3511   - 1ND 28k8 (sYSOP:        H2O!)\n   Forbidden Planet (IRL-HQ) +353-1-820 8489 - 2ND 33k6 (sYSOP: Green-Beret)\n   Altered Reality    (DIST) +1-305-677-8924 - 3ND\n\n   SWITCHBOARD          HLM GHQ.     5ND      MSG to "[]-> Fli7e & WTM <-[]"\n   EVIL MOON         RMD^AG! HQ.     1ND      MSG to "[]-> Fli7e & WTM <-[]"\n\n                                  oR wRITE tO\n\n                         EMail: [email removed]\n\n           If you like to join call THE PUB or use the EMAIL above!\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| History                                                                     |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n             _________________ ____        ____ _________________\n             \________________\\___) v1.0 (___//________________/\n\n                · First PUBLIC release\n\n             _________________ ____        ____ _________________\n             \________________\\___) v1.1 (___//________________/\n\n		· Added RANDOM SCRIPT option\n		· Optimized code: Gained 1172 bytes\n		· FASTER\n\n                -=> NEVER RELEASED <=-\n\n             _________________ ____        ____ _________________\n             \________________\\___) v1.2 (___//________________/\n\n                · Added USERNAME and USER LOCATION adding!\n                · Changed outfit ...\n                · Optimized code: Gained  391 bytes\n\n                · 2nd PUBLIC release\n\n\n.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------.\n| Greetings & Messages                                                        |\n`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\nAquarius/Outlaws ................ -»> Still in Outlaws? Why don`t you come\n                                      over here!?\n\nFOX/AG!^REMEDY .................. -»> Hi Vince! Hope this one is running clean\n                                      and bugfree! Test it!\n\nSTC/TASK ........................ -»> Where are the NEW doors? Are you dead\n                                      or just sleeping?\n\nTHE PROPHET/NJY ................. -»> Hmmm! Same as above!\n\nPIWI GON/SAD .................... -»> You`r /X CFG ED looks great! Letus work\n                                      fast to release it! MUI ROOLZ!\n\nCOUGAR/HOODLUM .................. -»> Lousiest BETA TESTER ever! Why don`t you\n                                      install the updates i pump to your system\n                                      so often?\n\nHITPOWER/PRODIGY ................ -»> Erm, Modem damaged? Or quitted scene? Why\n                                      don`t ya call?\n\nCASIO/SAD ....................... -»> Hey my dear ITALIAN ONE MEN DIVISION! How\n                                      are you?\n\nACRTIC/HOODLUM .................. -»> Trade this one all over m8!\n\n\n       and all slaved SYSOPS and /X-DOOR CODER worldwide! Keep /X going!\n\n\n\nNO CARRIER\n\n+++ATH\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,17127,13,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048704);
