UIREMENTS ø\n                                ø iNSTALLATION ø\n                                ø cONTACT sAD  ø\n                                ø   hISTORY    ø\n                                ø  gREETINGS   ø\n                                ø sAD rELEASES ø\n                                ø  sAD mEMBAZ  ø\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-  - -= -===================»> (c)OPYRIGHT nOTES <«=================- =- -  -\n\n                  pERMISSION iS gRANTED tO fREELY dISTRIBUTE\n                tHIS pRODUCT fOR nON-cOMMERCIAL pURPOSES oNLY,\n                    aS lONG aS aLL fILES rEMAIN uNMODIFIED.\n\n    iT`S aLSO aLLOWED tO dISTRIBUTE tHE FULL pAKAGE tROUGH aNY NETWORK lIKE\n                              INTERNET aND AMINET!\n\n\n                            sIGNED: fLI7e / sAD 1995\n\n- -= -=================================================================- =- -\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                  iNTRODUCTION\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n\n  SAD-DL ENHANCE is a nice DOWNLOAD LAYOUT enhancer ...  It displays an ascii\n  and some infos on the userstatus.\n\n  THAT`S  ALL?  you may think and you`re right then ...  There are some doors\n  out doing this, too!  But do they stay SUSPENDED in background and tell the\n  user  who downloaded what he did AFTER he finished the DL?  no ...  and I`m\n  going to expand the features of it in the future for sure.\n\n  Nothing more ..  Just that you should check it before you judge it!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                        