----------\n          dUPE CHECK DELUXE  - cHECKS more than 10000 files in less\n                               than 1sec. ... aBLE tO uSE UNLIMITED\n                               dIRFILES/UPLOAD DIRS! ...\n\n                               cODE: wIGWAM & fLI7e / SAD\n\n          -------------------------------------------------------------------\n          sUPER -A- rEPLACE  - cOMFORTABLE -A-ltered command replacement\n                               for /X 4.9+ ONLY ... yOU can DeSelect flagged\n                               files using Cursor keys, see the FILE ID`s\n                               and many more features\n\n                               cODE: wIGWAM & fLI7e / SAD\n\n\n          and some more unborn ideas still in our mad brains!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                               __________________\n                           _ __\_              _/__ _\n\n                                   sAD mEMBAZ\n                               _ ___        ___ _\n                                   \________/\n                       _ __ ___ ____ _    _ ____ ___ __ _\n                       \\\_\\__\\___\\\  ///___//__//_///\n                                      \\//\n                                       \/\n\n\n\n\n\n\n   fLITE                (sYSOP WHQ, aREXX cODING, lEADER, aSSKI aRTIST)\n   cLYDE rADCLIFFE      (sYSOP EHQ, aSM cODING)\n   h2o!                 (sYSOP GHQ, aSSKI aRTIST)\n   gURGLE               (sYSOP IHQ)\n   gREEN bERET          (sYSOP IRLHQ, /X oRIG. SUPPLIER)\n   rUDOLF h.            (sYSOP OZHQ)\n   wIGWAM               (aSM cODING, fORMER mEMBER)\n   pIWI                 (C++ cODER, fORMER mEMBER)\n   sHADOWMASTER         (aREXX cODING)\n   sLY                  (lEARNING aREXX cODER)\n   cASIO                (iTALIAN lEADER, aSM cODER)\n   cOUGAR               (ß tESTER)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThePub [10:aMIGa wAREz] Menu (34 mins. left): g\n\n         __          D·O   Y·O·U\n   ______\/__ ___________  _______  _______  __   _______