  pERMISSION iS gRANTED tO fREELY dISTRIBUTE tHIS pRODUCT fOR\n     nON-cOMMERCIAL pURPOSES oNLY, aS lONG aS aLL fILES rEMAIN uNMODIFIED.\n\n              sELLING iS sTRICTLY fORBIDDEN wITHOUT aNY eXCEPTION!\n\n     iF yOU wANT tO pUBLISH tHIS oR aNY oTHER "©sAD" lABELED pRODUCTION oN\n          a PD SERIES mEDIUM get iN cONTACT wITH tHE aUTHOR tO gET aN\n                             hANDSIGNED pERMISSION!\n\n          oFFICIAL dISTRIBUTED tHROUGH aMINET & wORLD wIDE bBS sYSTEMS\n\n          oFFICIAL sAD dISTRIBUTOR sITES: tHE pUB, eVIL mOON, rAVELAND\n\n                            sIGNED: fLI7e / sAD 1996\n\n- -= -=================================================================- =- -\n\n\n\n\n\nStep 1\n~~~~~~\nCreate a DIR named "DOORS:SCEPTIC" and copy the dir "F!-USERLIST" to it.\n\nStep 2\n~~~~~~\nCopy the delivered bbcmd "USER.INFO" to your BBSCMD location.\n\nStep 3\n~~~~~~\nCopy (If needed) the REXXTRICKS.LIBRARY to your LIBS: drawer.\n\nFINISHED ...\n\nNow you`ll have a USERLISTER which shows: USERNAME\n                                          LOCATION\n                                          TIMES CALLED\n                                          MESSAGES WRITTEN\n                                          UPLOAD MB`s\n                                          DOWNLOAD MB`s\n                                          TOTAL STATS OF THE ABOVE DATAS\n                                          INACTIVE USERS ARE LEFT OUT!\n                                          TOTAL "REAL CURSOR" USAGE\n                                          SORT A-Z and BACK (BY SLOTNUMBER)\n\n\n\n\n\n                                   Last Word\n                                   ~~~~~~~~~\nI guess this is enough!  The installation is as easy as the code!  Well it took\nme  a long long time to figure out the easy way of REAL CURSOR and it also took\nme a very long night to get the handling working like it is doing now!  Special\nthanx  to  Gravedancer/Sad  for a hint with the keys ..