O·N·\n\n\n   yOU oNLY hAVE tO cOPY:\n\n   ( mCOMM.rexx )     tO yOUR ( dOORS: ) dIRECKTORY\n\n   ( TRX.mCOMM.cFG )  tO yOUR aSSIGNED ( s: ) dIRECKTORY\n\n   ( mCOMM.info )     tO yOUR ( BBScmd ) oRE ( cONFxcmd ) dIRECKTORY\n\n   ( mCOMM.gUIDE )    tO yOUR dOC dIRECKTORY oRE aNYWHERE eLSE\n\n\n@{" wHAT iT iS " LINK "wHATiS"} @{" rEQUIREMENTS " LINK "requirements"} @{" tHE cONFIG fILE " LINK "configfile"} @{" hOW tO uSE " LINK "hOWTO"} @{" cREDITS " LINK "cREDITS"}\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "configfile" "mCOMM.guide / cONFIG fILE"\n@Next "howto"\n@Prev "installation"\n@Toc "Main"\n@{" mAIn mENU " LINK "main"}\n\n   ·T·H·E· ·C·O·N·F·I·G· ·F·I·L·E·\n\n   tHE cONFIG fILE mUST bE aVAIABLE aS ( TRX.mCOMM.cFG ) iN\n   yOUR aSSIGNED ( s: ) dIRECKTORY . yOU cAN eDIT iT wITH yOUR\n   fAVORITE tEXT eDITOR .\n\n   iMPORTANT fOR yOU iS oNLY lINE 3 , wHERE yOU cAN cHANGE tHE\n   sECURITY lEVEL fOR pRIVATE mAIL cOMMENTING . oNLY uSER wITH\n   a lEVEL , wICH iS sIMMILAR oRE aBOVE tHE oNE iN lINE 3 cAN\n   cOMMENT pRIVATE mAILS .\n\n----(BOF)-------------------------------------------------------------\n           \>  cONFIG fILE fOR tRONIC!`s mAILCOMMENTER </\n» rEQUIRED lEVEL fOR pRIVATE mAIL cOMMENTING\n200\n----(EOF)-------------------------------------------------------------\n\n@{" wHAT iT iS " LINK "wHATiS"} @{" rEQUIREMENTS " LINK "requirements"} @{" iNSTALLATION " LINK "installation"} @{" hOW tO uSE " LINK "hOWTO"} @{" cREDITS " LINK "cREDITS"}\n\n@EndNode\n\n@Node "howto" "mCOMM.guide / hOW tO uSE"\n@Next "cREDITS"\n@Prev "configfile"\n@Toc "Main"\n@{" mAIn mENU " LINK "main"}\n\n   ·H·O·W· ·T·O· ·U·S·E· ·M·C·O·M·M·\n\n\n   jUST tYPE mCOMM iN tHE mAIN mENU pROMPT aND cHOOSE fROM tHE mENU ,\n   oRE tYPE mCOMM fOLLED bY tHE nUMBER oF tHE mAIL , yOUR wANT tO rEPLY\n\n   ex:\n               mCOMM 3862               fOR mAIL nO:  3862\n\n   eASY eHH ?\n\n\n@{" wHAT iT iS " LINK "wHATiS"} @{" rEQUIREMENTS " LINK "requirements"} @{" iNSTALLATION " LINK "installation"} @{" tHE cONFIG fI