64        \r\n               Telnet: bbs.masturbationstationbbs.com\r\n\r\n           UPLOAD DATE: 04-24-16  TIME: 08:54:08  ON NODE: 1\r\n\r\n  UPLOADER: Black Beard            LOCATION: mSTATION.servebbs.com    \r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',18764,1,0,NULL,NULL,'slicktop','scan',1780048732);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('slickw20','SLICKW20.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/SLICKW20.LHA','loggon','XIM','SLICKW20.LHA loggon',NULL,NULL,NULL,'#              SLICKWHO v2.0               # #the worlds best /X who door! options:     # #shows calls per node + totall calls,baud  #',replace('############################################\n#              SLICKWHO v2.0               #\n#the worlds best /X who door! options:     #\n#shows calls per node + totall calls,baud  #\n#rates per node,all filenames u/l d/l      #\n#co-sysops can view hidden nodes,2 diffrent#\n#styles of output fully tested on any /X!!!#\n############################################\n\n','\n',char(10)),'Slickwho.guide',replace('@database SlickWho Dox\n@Author BUGBYTE\n@Index MAIN\n\n@Remark $VER: SlickWho Dox \n@Remark AmigaGuide database for SlickWho\n\n@node MAIN "Slick Who Dox"\n\n  ______.__:   __  ____ ___. /\\n /  ____\  |  |__|/ .  |   |/  )\n \__.  \/  |__|  /  |__|   ''  /\n /  |   |  |  |  \  |  /   .  \\n/_______|_____|  |\___/|___|\__\ WHo V1.0\n              `--''\nBY BUGBYTE 1994\n\n\n                        @{"Why i Wrote SlickWho" Link why}\n                        @{"    InstallAtion    " Link install}\n                        @{"Greets And Bum Licks" Link greets}\n\n\n\nIf you would like to get in touch with me for source or help on doors\nplease click on @{"THIS BUTTON" Link me} NOW!!!!!\n\nPLUG!!!!!\n\nfor all the latest warez and csl cracks call @{"DARK DOMAIN +1 305-989-0718" Link dd}\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n\n@node why "Why i Wrote SlickWho"\nwhy ???\n\ncoz i hate all those shit who doors that dont show filenames and are \nwritten in rexx!\n\nrexx is ok but most doors i have looked at crash when compiled Rexx\nis used!\n\npesonally i think C or asm is the only way to go!\n\nthis who is the best there is i wrote it for a bbs i am a co-sysop on\nall the users really liked it and told me to relise it! so i did =)\ni have wrote lots a doors but never relised any simply coz a sysop asked \nme to do him a specail door for his bbs only. but from now i will relise all\nmy doors to the public so you can use them. \n\nthere is some really cool /X doors about and some exelent door writes\ngreets go to them in the grreets section . i hope ya like this door is is \n100% free of backdoors and anyone who wants the source can get it from me \nread contacting me for more info!..\n\n@endnode\n\n\n@node install "InstallAtion"\n\nContents Of Slickwho:\n\nplease copy the directory doors and commands to bbs:\n\n@{"SlickWho2.XXX" Link xxx}\n@{"Slickwho.info" Link tooltypes}\n@{"Update_nodes " Link Update_nodes}\n@{"   loggon    " Link loggon}\n@{"   logoff    " Link logoff}\n\nPLEASE VIEW ALL THEASE AS EACH ONE HAS A DIRRENT INSTALLATION!\nIF YOU DONT READ THE GUIDE YOU MAY INCOUNTER PROBS INSTALLING SLICKWHO\n\n@endnode\n\n\n@node Update_nodes "Update_nodes"\n\nThis File Should be Added to the Update12am Script File\nThis file is Executed at 12:00 Every night\n\nadd the lines:\n\ndoors:slickwho/Update_nodes\n\nto the Update12am Script File\n\nPlease make sure that This is the LAST thing run in the Script and the \nscript File has +s protection bit set.\n\n@endnode\n\n@node loggon "loggon"\nThis MUST be run soon as a User logs on the system!\n\nthere is 2 ways to do this:\n\nuse the Frontend.info (supplyed in the package)\nor add a MCI command to the private.txt IE ~CC_loggon\nif using the MCI method please make sure you have a loggon.info in \nbbs:commands/syscmd\n\n\n@endnode\n\n@node logoff "logoff"\n\nThis should be added to the logoff script for the node and should be the last\ncommand to be used exept for an ENDCLI\n\nSyntax is:\n\ndoors:slickwho/logoff NODE_NUMBER\n\nexmaple:\n\ndoors:slickwho/logoff 1\n\n\n@endnode\n\n\n@node xxx "slickWho.xxx"\n\nThere is 3 difrent verions of SlickWho\n\n1) SlickWho2.000         For 68000 CPU\n1) SlickWho2.030         For 68030 CPU\n1) SlickWho2.040         For 68040 CPU\n\nPlease Change the ToolType Who.info to\nLOCATION=doors:SlickWho/slickWho2.000 to:\n\nLOCATION=doors:SlickWho/slickWho2.000\nLOCATION=doors:SlickWho/slickWho2.030\nLOCATION=doors:SlickWho/slickWho2.040 \n\nDepending on what CPU You have......\n\n@endnode\n\n\n\n@node greets "Greets And Bum Licks"\n\n             GREETS AND SLOBBERS GOTO: (in no paticular order)\n\n   *WARNING I AM CRAP AT SPELLING SO DONT BLAME ME IF I GOT YA NAME WRONG*\n\n\nINDIO/CSL                           (wibble wibble!)\nYSL/CSL                             \nTIN MAN                             (ill get ya back you know what i mean)\nFLUX\nSCOTT\nIBM\nHARMONICA\nANIMAL                              (alrite calm down!)\nHOMER                               (nice ta have ya back)\nYEKO\nREMIX                               (ok for a classic member hehe)\nJERKY                               (miss ya man!)\nSHOCK\nCARDINAL\nBLASTER                             (sysop x-factor cool board dewd)\nJACKNIFE                            (call DD soon for a chat) \nNAZGUL                              (been a long time! ill be seying ya)\nSNAKE       \nDON DOG\nZION                                (put my access back NOW! =) )  \nNOXOUS (humm)                       \nLEVITATION                          (thanx for the help dewd :) )\nKEN D \n[-POLARIS-]                         (we need to chat call dd )\nMARIO                               (COOL trader!)\nSLEDGE\nRAPTOR\n\n\n                       AND ANY ONE ELSE I FORGOT!!!\n\n@endnode\n\n\n@node tooltypes "tooltypes in the doors:SlickWho/slickWho.info icon."\n\nThere is 4 ToolTypes In slickWho.info Thease are:\n\n@{"SHOW_CONNECT_RATE=" Link SHOW_FAKE_NODE}\n@{"SHOW_HIDEN_NODES=" Link SHOW_HIDEN_NODES}\n@{"STYLE=" Link STYLE}\n@{"SYSOP_ACCESS=" Link SYSOP_ACCESS}\n@endnode\n\n\n\n@node SHOW_FAKE_NODE "option"\n\nSHOW_CONNECT_RATE= YES or NO\n\nthis if YES will show the connect rate that a user is logged on at\n16800,14000,9600,1200 ect...\n\nif turned to NO\nthis us not activated!\n\n@node SHOW_HIDEN_NODES "option"\n\nSHOW_HIDEN_NODES = YES or NO\n\nDefault is SHOW_HIDEN_NODES=YES\n\ni Really Hate ami-express ''q'' command! , so i decided to make this option. \n\nif SHOW_HIDEN_NODES=YES \na normal user will se the node that is hidden\nbut the username that is hiding is replaced by USER HIDING!\n\nif a user with a access of equell to or highr then the access defined in\nthe SYSOP_ACCESS= tooltype the user can se a hidden node!\n\nif SHOW_HIDEN_NODES=NO\nthen slickwho acts like the noram internall /X door and all hidden nodes\ndo not show up.\n                      \n@endnode\n\n\n@node STYLE "option"\n\nSlickWho has 2 options of what it looks like this all depends on pesonal\n\ntaste! STYLE=1 is a expanded mode STYLE=2 is compressed mode!\n\nSTYLE=1 is better for a board that has onky a few nodes because\nit fills the sceen more.\n\nSTYLE=2 is better for a board that has lots of nodes \n\nplease look at the styles.iff for a better look!\n\n@endnode\n\n@node me "getting in touch!"\n        ____________________________________________________________\n       |             _______    /\  ______/\ .___. ____             |\n       |             \___.  \  /  \ \____   \|   |/   /             |\n       |              /  |   \/ __ \|  _/  _/|      _/              |\n       |_____________/   |   :  \   |  \   \ |  \_   \______________|\n       |             \________  /\  :___\___\|___|\___\             |\n       |                     \_/  \/                                |\n       |        ______  _____   /\  _     /\   ___ ____ :__._       |\n       |        \___. \/     \_/  \/ \   /  \ (___)    \|  _/       |\n       |         /  |  \  /   /       \_/ __ \|   :     \  \        |\n       |________/   |        /    \/   :  \       |   \     \_______|\n       |        \_______/\__/\____||____  /\  ____|___|\____/       |\n       |                               \_/  \/                      |\n       |           ___________________________________  ____        |\n       |          /     \      /  /\      /_      /   \/   /        |\n       |         /   /__/   / /__   \   \/ /   /\/ /  /   /         |\n  USHQ |________/   /  /      \ /   /\   \/   /      /   / \________| USHQ\n                \_____/\__/\__ \___/_____ \__/\__/__/\_____/\n                              \/         \/                  \n       SySop - TIN MAN - Co`SYsOpS - BUGBYTE/CSL - JACKNIFE - INDIO/CSL\n\n     AMiExprEss 3.17 - 1.2 GiG Online - 40Mzh - AMIGA - SNES - IBM - XXX\n\n         4 NODEZ RD >>>>>>  (  +1 305-989-0718  )  <<<<<< 4 NODEZ RD\n   \n    ***NUP NEEDED*** LEAVE MAIL TO A CSL MEMBER FOR IT! ***NUP NEEDED***\n\ncall here for help or source or genrall chat on /X doors \nor to get some fast warez! (plug) =)\n@endnode\n\n@node dd "THE BEST BOARD IN THE STATES!"\n        ____________________________________________________________\n       |             _______    /\  ______/\ .___. ____             |\n       |             \___.  \  /  \ \____   \|   |/   /             |\n       |              /  |   \/ __ \|  _/  _/|      _/              |\n       |_____________/   |   :  \   |  \   \ |  \_   \______________|\n       |             \________  /\  :___\___\|___|\___\             |\n       |                     \_/  \/                                |\n       |        ______  _____   /\  _     /\   ___ ____ :__._       |\n       |        \___. \/     \_/  \/ \   /  \ (___)    \|  _/       |\n       |         /  |  \  /   /       \_/ __ \|   :     \  \        |\n       |________/   |        /    \/   :  \       |   \     \_______|\n       |        \_______/\__/\____||____  /\  ____|___|\____/       |\n       |                               \_/  \/                      |\n       |           ___________________________________  ____        |\n       |          /     \      /  /\      /_      /   \/   /        |\n       |         /   /__/   / /__   \   \/ /   /\/ /  /   /         |\n  USHQ |________/   /  /      \ /   /\   \/   /      /   / \________| USHQ\n                \_____/\__/\__ \___/_____ \__/\__/__/\_____/\n                              \/         \/                  \n       SySop - TIN MAN - Co`SYsOpS - BUGBYTE/CSL - JACKNIFE - INDIO/CSL\n\n     AMiExprEss 3.17 - 1.2 GiG Online - 40Mzh - AMIGA - SNES - IBM - XXX\n\n         4 NODEZ RD >>>>>>  (  +1 305-989-0718  )  <<<<<< 4 NODEZ RD\n   \n    ***NUP NEEDED*** LEAVE MAIL TO A CSL MEMBER FOR IT! ***NUP NEEDED***\n@endnode\n\n@node SYSOP_ACCESS "SYSOP_ACCESS"\n\nthis sets the access level for users to see hidden nodes valed ranges are\n10-255\n\n@endnode','\n',char(10)),'{"LOCATION":"doors:SlickWho/slickWho2.000","ACCESS":"\""}','XIM-BBSCmd',75862,1,0,NULL,NULL,'slickw20_loggon','scan',1780048732);
