              \_|  o|           \______//          *G-r-o-o-v-y* \r\n                     /\___/          __ || __||\r\n                    /  ||||__       (____(____)\r\n                       (___)_)\r\n            {{{{Written by SpooNMan}}}}  UPDATE 10/01/95\r\n\r\n**Note L= [L] button  R= [R] button (not Left and Right!)\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!ABC MONDAY NIGHT FOOTBALL *Data East 8Mb 12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\n-offense-\r\nX:call "hut hut"\r\nB:snap the ball(press rapidly to increase running speed)\r\nA:pass to receiver (throw short pass)\r\nX:pass to receiver (throw medium pass)\r\nY:pass to receiver (throw long pass) & jump to catch a pass;dive\r\nL/R:spin out of a tackle\r\n-defense-\r\nB:kickoff\r\nA:switch player control\r\nY:jump,dive,tackle\r\n\r\n(OTHER INFO):\r\n! regular season:13 weeks\r\n! During a passing play watch the matching medallions(A,X,or Y)at the bottom \r\nof the screen.When a receiver is blocked,his medallion will flash.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!ACTRAISER *Enix 8Mb 11/91!  \r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(OUTLINE OF GAME):                  (AREA GUIDE>:\r\n1.start game                        Fillmore   Aitos\r\n2.purify land<action mode #1>       Bloodpool  Marahna\r\n3.develope land<simulation mode>    Kasandora  Northwall\r\n4.purify land<action mode #2>       \r\n\r\n(STATUS OF MASTER):                          (ACTS OF NATURE):\r\nLV:master''s composite strength               lightning<10sp>\r\nSP:power needed to perform act of nature     rain<20sp>\r\nHP:physical strength                         sun<30sp>\r\nMP:magic power available                     wind<80sp>\r\nTOTAL:total number of people in the world    earthquake<160sp>\r\n  \r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n  Professional Mode - After completing the game,press  Up \r\n(or Down twice).  The "Professional" selection will appear below  \r\n"New Game".  You don''t get any magic, and regular monsters take \r\ntwice as many hits to kill.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!Actraiser 2 *Enix 12Mb 12/93! \r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nFight the last boss from Actraiser 1:Xxxx Yyyy Zzzz\r\nPlay Demo: Set Diffuculty to Hard then:BJQX YRKC DLSZ\r\nEnd Credits: MTkM SkTk HNSH\r\nDeath Helm Code: MFCL SYMC MSXF\r\nDeath Helm+38 lives(hard): MFMJ TVSY FVPX\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!ADDAMS FAMILY,THE *Ocean 8Mb  3/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n\r\n   (PASSWORDS):\r\n  V1913        After Pugsley\r\n  B&J15        After Grandma\r\n  BD#K4        After Wednesday\r\n  BL91B        After Fester\r\n  BLKX8        72 Lives, 5 Hearts, only Morticia missing\r\n  21112        100 Lives, 5 Hearts, Sword\r\n  BLKX8        Final Door Open\r\n \r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSnap the fingers:During the opening sequence,pressL&R to make Thing snap! \r\n\r\nSecret Power-up room: \r\nOnce you start the game, go in the hall of stairs and then proceed to the \r\nleft. Once you are past the last door to the left, push UP and there will \r\nbe a secret door that leads to Pugsley''s Den.\r\n\r\nBonus 1-Ups - When your game is over and the Continue/Quit\r\nScreen appears, go all of the way to the left of the screen.You will enter a\r\nsecret room that contains 4 1-Ups.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!ADVENTURES OF BATMAN AND ROBIN *Konami 16Mb  11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(LEVEL PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\nGAME GENIE\r\n----------\r\nDB86-4D19 Start with 9 credits\r\nC988-340D Infinite lives\r\nDD8A-4D6D No damage from enemies\r\nC9A1-34AF Infinite stars\r\nC9A5-34DF Infinite spray gun ammo\r\nC9AB-3D6F Infinite plastic explosives\r\nC9A6-3F0F Infinite smoke bombs\r\n466B-4494 Get full energy from hearts\r\n4DAF-14DF Moon jumping\r\nE6C7-34DF Super jumping\r\nD58D-C765 + E68F-CDD5 Move even faster\r\nCODES 25-27: SWITCH OFF IF YOU GET STUCK\r\nE38D-C765 + DF8F-CDD5 Moon-walk\r\nE88D-C765 + D08F-CDD5 Moon-walk faster\r\nE68D-C765 + E58F-CDD5 Moon-walk even faster\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!ALIEN 3 *LJN 8Mb   8/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(LEVEL PASSWORDS):\r\nstage 2 : QUESTION\r\nstage 3 : MASTERED\r\nstage 4 : MOTORWAY\r\nstage 5 : CABINETS\r\nstage 6 : SQUIRREL\r\nEnding  : OVERGAME\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nDuring Game Press A B Y X on Controller 2.Now On Controller 1 Button:\r\nA = Toggles Invincibility\r\nB = Toggles Do More Damage With Weapons\r\nX = Toggles Unlimited Weapons\r\n  Corner of screen shows total number of Cheats\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!ALIEN VS. PREDATOR *Activision 8Mb  11/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\nLevel Select\r\n1.   On Option Menu\r\n2.   Hold L R X A on Controller #2\r\n3.   Then Press Start on Controller #1\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!ANIMANIACS *Konami 8Mb  11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(CONTROLS):                            (STAGES):\r\nSTART:pauses                           Sci-Fi film stage\r\nA:press twice to dash                  Practice stage/studio HQ\r\nB:jumps                                Aquatic film stage\r\nY:grab and throw items                 Fantasy film stage\r\nX:Animaniacs"short"stack               Editing room\r\nR:use to select the player             Adventure film stage\r\nL:use to stop the slot machine         Water tower/rescue stage\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BALLZ *Accolade 8Mb+DSP 11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TRICKS):\r\n\r\nTurbo Mode!\r\nat the title screen press (A) 9 times.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BATMAN RETURNS *Konami 8Mb  4/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(LEVELS):                                   (ENDINGS):\r\nScene 1:Ambush in Gotham Plaza       Normal=Cat Women\r\nScene 2:Battle in the Streets        Hard=Batman+Penquin+Big Penquin\r\nScene 3:On the Prowl                 Special=Batman+Penquin+Cat Women+Big P\r\nScene 4:The Penquin''s Trap           Mania=Batman+Penquin+Catwomen+Dark Night\r\nScene 5:To the Batmobile\r\nScene 6:Circus Train\r\nScene 7:Penquin''s Lair\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nNine Lives\r\n-----------\r\nAt the "Options screen"press U,U,D,D,L,R,L,R,B,A on controller 2\r\n\r\nNine Continues\r\n---------------\r\nAt the "Options screen"press U,X,L,Y,D,B,R,A,U,X on controller 2\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BATTLE BLAZE *Sammy 8Mb 11/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nExtra Mode: On the Option Screen, hold [R], then press U+X, [R]+A, D+B,\r\n   [L]+Y. If done correctly, you will enter the Extra Play Mode.\r\n\r\nExtra Continues: On the Option Screen, hold [L] and press U+X, [L]+Y, D+B,\r\n   [R]+A simultaneously. A Credits Option will appear on the screen.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!Battle Cars *Namco 8Mb 12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nMystery Mode: \r\nAt the Title Screen, press Up Down, L, R, Select. Go to the\r\nOptions Screen and turn on Mystery Mode to play with a birds-eye view.\r\n\r\nPlay as Opponent: \r\nOn the Title Screen, press L, R, Up Begin a 1-player\r\ngame and you will control your opponent''s car!\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BATTLETOADS & DOUBLE DRAGON:THE ULTIMATE TEAM *Tradewest 8Mb 12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nStart with 5 men/toads:\r\nAt the Player Select Screen, Press and Hold Up+A+B,Then Press Start.\r\n*NOTE:You must re-enter this code at the "continue screen"if you want to \r\ncontinue with 5 men/toads again.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BATTLETOADS IN BATTLEMANIACS *Tradewest 8Mb  6/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(LEVELS):\r\n1.Ragnarok Canyon\r\n2.The Hollow Tree          *Bonus stages appear after levels #2 and #5.\r\n3.Turbo Tunnel\r\n4.The Snake Pit\r\n5.Roller Coaster\r\n6.The Dark Tower\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nExtra toads and continues:\r\nOn controller 2,hold down,A,B before the tittle screen appears \r\nthe press Start for 5 lives and 5 continues!\r\n                                           \r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BEAUTY AND THE BEAST *Hudson Soft 8Mb 8/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSTAGE SKIP:\r\nDuring the game press Start to pause the game then press Left,Y,L,D \r\nSkip the stage by pressing Select & L together.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BLACKTHORNE *Interplay 8Mb  10/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\nMine level 2:FBWC      \r\nMine level 3:QP7R\r\nMine level 4:WJTV\r\nTree level 1:RRYB\r\nTree level 2:ZS9P\r\nTree level 3:XJSN\r\nTree level 4:CGDM      Castle level 1:HCKD\r\nSand level 1:TJ1f      Castle level 2:NRLF\r\nSand level 2:GSG3      Castle level 3:J6BZ\r\nSand level 3:BMHS      Castle level 4:MJXG\r\nSand level 4:Y4DJ      Castle level 5:K3CH\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!B.O.B. *Electronic Arts 8Mb 6/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):     \r\n\r\n     -GOTH-                 -ULTRAWORLD-               -ANCIENA-  \r\n  Area 1 |000000|         Area 1 |743690|           Area 1 |672451| \r\n  Area 2 |171058|         Area 2 |103928|           Area 2 |272578|\r\n  Area 3 |950745|         Area 3 |144895|           Area 3 |652074|\r\n  Area 4 |472149|         Area 4 |775092|           Area 4 |256648|\r\n                          Area 5 |481376|           Area 5 |462893|\r\n                                                    Area 6 |583172|\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n \r\nLOTSA AMO: \r\nGet 99 rounds of ammo in any level by changing the second digit\r\nin the password to a ''9''.|196420| Max Power Up\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BRAWL BROTHERS *Jaleco 12Mb 3/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSecret Japaese title screen: \r\nWhen the "Jaleco" screen appears, press\r\n   B A X Y and repeat and repeat and repeat this. If you do this\r\n   fast enough, the screen will change and be scrambled. Wait\r\n   until a sword slash is heard, then press START. When the\r\n   screen changes, press D D D START. Exit the Option Screen to\r\n   see the Japanese Title Screen.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BRET HULL HOCKEY *Accolade 16Mb  12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\n    -offense-                                         -defense-\r\nY>>slap shot                                 Y>>no use\r\nX>>swith to the player closest to the puck   X>>switch to closest player\r\nB>>pass                                      B>>poke check\r\nL>>switch lines                              A>>body check/speed up\r\nR>>line change                               L>>switch lines\r\n                                             R>>line change\r\n               (OTHER INFO):\r\n*While shooting press up for a higher shot.\r\n*fighting:press Y to punch & B to block\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BRUTAL: PAWS OF FURY *Gametek 16Mb 12/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n \r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nBOSS CODE: \r\nplay as Dali Llama, at the Title Screen press X,A,B,A,L,A\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BUBSY:Claws Encounters of the Furred Kind  *Accolade 16Mb  5/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nA/B->Pounce\r\nX/Y->Glide\r\n\r\n     (LEVELS):                           (PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\n>  1.Cheese Wheels of Doom                 JSSCTS\r\n   2.Forbidden Plummet                     CKBGMM\r\n   3.A Bridge to Far                       SCTWMN\r\n>  4.Fair Conditioning                     MKBRLN\r\n   5.Night of the Bobcat                   LBLNRD\r\n   6.Our Furless Leader                    JMDKRK\r\n>  7.The Good, the Bad, and the Woolies    STGRTN\r\n   8.A Fistfull of Yarn                    SBBSHC\r\n   9.Dances With Woolies                   DBKRRB\r\n>  10.Beavery Careful                      MSFCTS\r\n   11.Rock Around the Croc                 KMGRBS\r\n   12.Claws for Alarm                      SLJMBG\r\n>  13.Eye of the Bobcat                    TGRTVN\r\n   14.No Time to Paws                      CCLDSL\r\n   15.Lethal Woolie                        BTCLMB\r\n>  16.A Farewell to Woolies                STCJDH\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!BUBSY II *Accolade 16Mb 11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n*The following tricks should be done at the Bubsy II title screen.\r\n\r\n50 Lives: Press B, Up, B, Select, Y\r\nInvincibility: Press X, A, B, Y, Up, Down\r\n99 Portable Holes: Press Right, Up, Select, Select\r\nSuper Jumps: Press B, A, B, Y\r\n99 Nerf Shots: Press B, A, Left, Left\r\n99 Diving Suits: Press B, Left, Up, B\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CANNON FODDER *Virgin 12Mb  12/94 <-Euro game!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n        (Complete set of Passwords)\r\n\r\nMission 1 : -----               Mission 13 : ZLWCW \r\nMission 2 : XCYDW               Mission 14 : KNBCX\r\nMission 3 : ZDBGS               Mission 15 : BNSCY   \r\nMission 4 : CDSCH               Mission 16 : WPHCZ\r\nMission 5 : NDYGH               Mission 17 : PPYDB\r\nMission 6 : SGDHC               Mission 18 : YRDDC\r\nMission 7 : GGPHH               Mission 19 : KRPDD   \r\nMission 8 : GHBHT               Mission 20 : KSLDG\r\nMission 9 : WHYCR               Mission 21 : PSPDH\r\nMission 10: KKLCR               Mission 22 : LTHDK\r\nMission 11: WKWCS               Mission 23 : CTYDL\r\nMission 12: HLDCT               Mission 24 : NWDDN\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CHOPLIFTER III *Extreme 4Mb  3/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):                       (PASSWORDS):\r\nA->No function                    1.Operation Bush Burner      DSRTLLN\r\nB->Machine guns                   2.Operation Sand Storm       SHLNTS\r\nL/R->Change direction             3.Operation Hih Seas Terror  CDGGBVN\r\nX->Selects special weapons        4.Operation Asphalt Jungle   WTHDFFN\r\nY->Fires special weapons\r\n\r\nMORE PASSWORDS............JOY!\r\n  lvl   Easy    Normal      Hard         lvl   Easy    Normal      Hardl\r\n |01| QLVDMRP | MZNSTTW | TSSRVBL |     |09| MRXZVXL | NVLLVLT | YPWGMNV |\r\n |02| BCCMQWT | JNGLSTH | GLJHYNZ |     |10| THRSHPS | SHPSLTH | VHTRSNV |\r\n |03| PPNLXZW | BSHSTFR | QVBCCRS |     |11| GDNSSGC | BTSLVFR | HVNKNWS |\r\n |04| SHNLNTS | DSRTLLN | NDRWSCT |     |12| WHTDFFN | MDCTLVN | GDMRNNG |\r\n |05| JMSHLPR | CVRNSGT | GRNTRTH |     |13| WHYSTSW | RRTSTTW | HWMNLVL |\r\n |06| MRKMYNR | DRKNSTR | SNDRSNF |     |14| GRMSCTT | THRNLTH | NMLCLMN |\r\n |07| TCMLLRF | LLVRLVF | XTRMNTG |     |15| RTHKKRS | RQHHSTF | DRRNBRM |\r\n |08| CDGGBVN | MRDSTGN | LPMWWQZ |\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CHUCK ROCK  *Sony Imagesoft 8Mb  11/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nUp->swim up (in water stage)\r\nDown->duck, put down rock\r\nY->belly-butt/kick\r\nB->jump\r\n\r\n(LEVELS):\r\nStage 1. "The Law of the Jungle"(5 parts) -Trceratops boss-\r\nStage 2. "If you can''t Take the Heat..."(4 parts) -Saber-toothed tiger boss-\r\nStage 3. "In the <Primorial> Soup"(3 parts) -Sea monster boss-\r\nStage 4. "Chuck Chills out in the Ice Age"(4 parts) -Wooly mammoth boss-\r\nStage 5. "Dead Dinos, or Are They?"(3 parts) -Dinosaur boss-\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nnone\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CLAY FIGHTER *Interplay 16Mb 12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nBoss Code: \r\nPlay a one-player game until you reach N. Boss. Intentionally\r\nlose both rounds, then don''t press any buttons until the Options Screen\r\nappears. Select Vs. Battle. Player 2 will control N. Boss.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CLAYFIGHTER TOURNAMENT EDITION *Interplay 24Mb 6/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n \r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nTiny Fighters: \r\nSelect a 4-Player tournament, then choose and name the\r\nfollowing fighters in the following order. When the game begins, all will\r\nbe shrunken.\r\n1 Frosty |POSSE|   2 Frosty |JASON A|   3 Blob |STEVE C|   4 Taffy |JOHN S|\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CLAYFIGHTER 2: JUDGEMENT CLAY *Interplay 24 Mb  1/95!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS)->                       KANGOO:\r\n(x)=hold for 2 secs.               <Dashing Punch>    (Back),Forward+P\r\nP=Punch                            <Winding Uppercut> P,P,P...\r\nK=Kick                             <Uppercut>         Forward,Down,Forward+P \r\nx-to-x= -/|\- (half rotation)\r\n\r\nNANAMAN:\r\n<Catch Air>  (Down),Up+P\r\n<Banana Chip>  Down,Forward+P\r\n\r\nOCTOHEAD:                            GOOGOO:\r\n<Octopunch> (360 rotate+P            <Rambutt>        Back-to-Forward+P\r\n<Octospin>  (Back),Forward+P         <Bottle Throw>   Down,Forward+P\r\n<Spin>      Forward-to-Back+K        <Baby Uppercut>  Forward,Down,Forward+P\r\n\r\nBAD MISTER FROSTY:                   TINY:\r\n<Rising Ice> (Down),Up+P             <Medicine Ball>   Back-to-Forward+K\r\n<Ice Breath> Forward-to-Back+P       <Hurricane punch> (Back),Forward+P\r\n<Snowball>   (Back),Forward+P        <Wimp Move>       (Back),Down/Forward+P\r\n\r\nTHE BLOB:                            HOPPY:  \r\n<Clay Blade> (Back),Forward+P        <Carrot Spin> (Back),Forward+P \r\n<Clay Spit> Down,Forward+P           <Spinkick>    (Down),Up+P\r\n<Rocket>  (Down),Up+P                <Uppercut>    Forward,Down,Forward+P        \r\n                    \r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n<Each of the following codes must be done at the "Game Start" screen!\r\n\r\nTurbo Speed(10):\r\nHold the Y button and press L,L,R,Down,Left,R.\r\n\r\nSecret Characters:\r\nPeelgood->Hold Down/Left and press B,Y,Y,A,Y\r\nSarge->Hold the X button and press L,L,Up,Down,Left,Down\r\nIce->Hold the B button and Press Up,L,L,L,Right\r\nJack->Hold Up and press X,A,R,R,Y,A\r\nThunder->Hold Up/Left and press Y,B,X,B,B,X,A\r\nSpike->Hold the R button and Press X,B,B,A,Y,Left,A \r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CLAYMATES *Interplay 8Mb  4/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):                            (CHARACTERS):\r\nStart->pause/along with Select to      Red Clay=Muckster(Cat) <climb trees>\r\nteleport out of a finished stage       Gray Clay=Oozy(Mouse) <fast/small>\r\nB->jump/swim/fly/dig/speed up robots   Purple Clay=Goopy(Fish) <swims>\r\nA->dig                                 Brown Clay=Globmeister(Gopher) <digs>\r\nY->attack/run (hold down)              Green Clay=Doh-Doh(Duck) <flys>\r\n\r\n(ITEMS):\r\nGeo-Shapes...Opens a box with the same shape on it. (hit it from the bottom)\r\nPlungers.....Marks your progress. (continue point)\r\nTeleporters..Moves Clayton to another point within a level.\r\nGolden Star..1-up!\r\nCrystals.....100=1-up. Finish a level with 100 or more to go to a bonus stage.\r\nSwitches.....Switches will change many different things within a level.\r\n\r\n(BONUS LEVELS):\r\n#1 (The Grid): Get 100 or more Crystals and play on "the grid"\r\n#2 (Pachincko): Spell C-L-A-Y to play this one.\r\n\r\n(BOSSES):\r\nBen the Dog, Webigail the Spider, Corky the Clam, and Jobo\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nSecret Warp #1>Go to the 1st flower in "Clayton''s Yard"& quickly jump 4 times\r\nSecret Warp #2>Quickly jump 4 times above the magnet in "Cape Clanavaral".\r\nSecret Warp #3>Quicky jump 4 times on the monster maker in "Lily Pods".\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!COOL SPOT *Virgin 8Mb  9/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):                            (STUFF):\r\nB->jump                                *Collect letters in the bonus rounds\r\nY->shoot                               to build up your continues.\r\nY+L/R->stand while shooting\r\n                                       *For the "best ending" you must \r\n                                       complete the game on the hard setting.\r\n\r\n (LEVELS)\r\n1.Shell Shock        6.Radical Rails\r\n2.Pier Pressure      7.Wound Up \r\n3.Off the Wall       8.Locomotive  \r\n4.Wading Around      9.Back to the Wall      \r\n5.Toying Around      10.Surf Patrol     \r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CYBERNATOR *Konami 8Mb 4/93 !\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\n6 CONTINUES: \r\nOn the Title Screen, hold U,L,R,Start \r\n\r\nFREE NaPalM: \r\nWalk through the first mission without shooting\r\nanything. Defeat the boss without shooting the side guns. If you''ve done\r\nit correctly, your score should be 2800. When the asteroid level starts,\r\nyou will have unlimited Napalm. If you get killed during this mission, you\r\nwill lose the Napalm, but if not, you''ll have it for the rest of the game.\r\nIt cannot be powered-up.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!CYBER SPIN *Takara 8Mb ??/??!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\n         Peru      |MBC27-44111 11111-3P121|\r\n         Kenya     |GYP74-MGD11 2121K-4R161|\r\n         Spain     |NZR78-MRH11 21211-1K179|\r\n         America   |V?X8K-MTH11 21211-2C189|\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!DAFFY DUCK:THE MARVIN MISSIONS *Sunsoft 8 Mb  12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(CONTROLS):                             (TIPS):\r\nSTART>>begin,pause,show map             *After getting five gems you receive\r\nX>>block                                 a continue\r\nY>>shoot                                *Each bag of money=$50\r\nA>>nutty attack                         *A glass of juice will refill your @\r\nB>>jump 2x=jet pack\r\nL/R>>toggle weapons\r\n                      ((MISSIONS))\r\nFirst mission:Where there''s duck there''s fire\r\nSecond mission:20,000 martians under the sea\r\nThird mission:Duck Dodgers on ice\r\nfourth mission:The greatist show on Earth\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSTART WITH 50 DUCKS: \r\nBegin a new game, and when the screen shows "WHERE THERE''S DUCK,\r\nTHERE''S FIRE," press L L R R U D Y A B X. A voice will say "Mother."\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!DAZE BEFORE CHRISTMAS (European) *Sunsoft 16Mb  12/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n2>T N F R N\r\n3>S L J F T\r\n4>S N J L B\r\n5>K R L H G (Mr. Weather)\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!DEATH & RETURN OF SUPERMAN *Sunsoft 16Mb  8/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nLevel skip and energy boost:\r\nGo to the "sound test" in the "options"menu.Play the following sounds in this\r\norder:0B,29,2C,05.Exit the "options" menu and immediately start the game.\r\nNow if you lose lives,your energy gets low,or you need to replenish your \r\nspecial attack you can press buttons A+B+X+Y simutaneously to revitalize your\r\nchracter.\r\nIf you want to skip to the next level.Hold down A+B+X+Y and then press select.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!DEMON''S CREST *Capcom 16Mb  1/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n2) B D L K   3) T R T L  4)\r\n   B X P B      S T G Z\r\n   G H G G      F Q M F\r\n   F Q K L      X F L F\r\n\r\nThis password gives you the crest of heaven and a new boss to fight!\r\n                Q  F  F  F\r\n                K  N  R  R\r\n                D  D  L  R\r\n                X  G  T  Q\r\nGAME GENIE CODES->\r\nC92A-44A7    Invincible after one hit\r\nEE3A-1DAF    More flash time\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!Desert Strike *Electronic Arts 8Mb  10/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nA->Guided missles\r\nB->Hydra missles\r\nY->Machine gun\r\nL/R->Steady copter\r\n                                (TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n(PASSWORDS):                    10 copter code:Enter BS9JS27, then enter\r\nCampaign 1:    ()()()(          the level password.\r\nCampaign 2:    LZ28QH8\r\nCampaign 3:    432LWKQ          GAME GENIE CODE:99 lives->17B1-0F6C\r\nCampaign 4:    48PPF8H\r\nThe ending:    R9SC9M2\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!DISNEY''S ALADDIN *Capcom 10Mb  11/93 !\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(CONTROLS):                              (ITEMS):\r\nB>>jump                 rug>>to glide              chicken>>refills all\r\nY>>run                  jars>>contain items        emerald>>100=1up\r\nA>>throws apples        apple>>for throwing        heart>>adds to life meter\r\nR>>glide (with rug)     bread>>refills one heart   lamp>>adds one continue\r\n\r\n(STAGES + PASSWORD CODES):\r\n1)the market place  :----------------\r\n2)the cave of wonders  :genie,abu,aladdin,king\r\n3)escape from the cave  :jafar,abu,jasmin,genie\r\n4)inside the lamp  :genie,jafar,aladdin,abu\r\n5)the pyramid  :apu,aladdin,genie,jasmin\r\n6)bonus stage  :jasmin,jafar,king,jasmin\r\n7)jafar''s palace  :jafar,jasmin,aladdin,jafar\r\n8)the final battle  :aladdin,jasmin,abu,king\r\n\r\n   (TIPS&TRICKS):\r\n   LEVEL SELECT>>While in the options menu,enter:L,R,START,SELECT,X,Y,A,B\r\n   on cont.#2(enter quickly!)now change levels with L&R at main menu.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!DONKEY KONG COUNTRY *Nintendo 32Mb  11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(LEVELS):            \r\n33 "action levels"    \r\n67 "Bonus Areas"      \r\n07 "Boss Levels"            ÚÄ¿ ÚÄÄÄÄÄ¿  ÚÄ¿ ÚÄ¿ ÚÄ¿ \r\n                           ÚÙ ³ ³ ÚÄ¿ ³ ÚÙ ³ ÀÄÙÚÙÚÙ  \r\n+(33 levels  ) 33%         À¿ ³ ³ ³ ³ ³ À¿ ³   ÚÙÚÙ    \r\n+(67 bonus   ) 67%  =       ³ ³ ³ ³ ³ ³  ³ ³  ÚÙÚÙ       \r\n+(King K.Rool) 01%          ³ ³ ³ ÀÄÙ ³  ³ ³ ÚÙÚÙÚÄ¿  \r\n                            ÀÄÙ ÀÄÄÄÄÄÙ  ÀÄÙ ÀÄÙ ÀÄÙ    \r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSOUND TEST <darbyday>:\r\nGo to the "Select A Game"screen and highlight "Erase Game".With controller \r\none,press:DOWN,A,R,B,Y,DOWN,A,Y.Now press the select button to select the \r\ndifferent music.\r\n\r\n50 LIVES <barral>:\r\nGo to the "game selection screen" and highlight "Erase Game".On controller \r\none enter B,A,R,R,A,L.Now just select a new game or a saved position, but \r\nmake sure "Erase Game" isn''t flashing when restoring a saved game!\r\n\r\nBONUS GAMES <dyddy>:\r\nQuickly press Down,Y,Down,Down,Y before the game select screen appears.\r\n\r\n2nd PLAYER CAN GAIN CONTROL <badbuddy>:\r\nWhen you play a two-player game in the Team Mode, you get to play only after\r\nthe other player messes up or gives you control, but you can change that.\r\nGo to the "game selection screen" and highlight "Erase Game".On controller \r\nOne enter B,A,Down,B,Up,Down,Down,Y,A, then start a Two-player game.\r\n\r\nRAMBI BUG?:\r\nThere''s a way to get Rambi the rino instead of Winky, in "Bouncy Bonanza".\r\nFirst make your way to the hole in the wall where you find Winky.Hop on Winky\r\nand exit.Enter the hole again with the frog.This time, hop on his back, then\r\nthen get off and exit without him.You''ll fall down the passageway with Ramby\r\ninstead of Winky!\r\n\r\nGAME GENIE CODES\r\n========================================================================  \r\nTHERE ARE 2 VERSIONS OF THIS GAME. IF THE FIRST CODE DOESN''T\r\nWORK ON YOUR GAME, THEN TRY THE SECOND CODE\r\nC2C9-4E2C / C2C1-4A9C   Infinite lives\r\n1768-C34D / 1768-C33D   Start with 100 lives\r\n1DCC-CA7A / 1DCA-C2EA   Almost invincible--Switch off if you get stuck\r\nDBC1-3D6D + DCC1-34AD / DBC9-340D + DCC1-3D6D  10bananas = extra life\r\n1D6B-3FDD + 196A-333D / 1D6B-3D6D + 166A-3ECD  Keep animals between stages \r\n3D81-1273 / 3D86-13E3   Mega-jump for Donkey Kong\r\n2D81-1E73 / 2D8B-1AE3   Mega-jump for Diddy Kong\r\n3D8F-C273 / 3087-C3E3   Mega-jump for all animals\r\n========================================================================\r\nPLAY ACTION REPLAY CODES\r\n(((((((((((((((((((((((((((\r\n7E05-8104   ->Secret Language select menu *for best results chose German:>\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!DRAGON''S LAIR *Data East 4Mb  2/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\nAfter Two Snake Bosses:\r\n2D 4C 6A 8B\r\n\r\nAfter Large Bat:\r\n1B 2D 7A 8C\r\n\r\nAfter Grim Reaper:\r\n3D 4B 5C 6A\r\n\r\nDragon''s Lair:\r\n1A 3B 5C 6D\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!EARTHBOUND *Nintendo 24Mb 7/95!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n \r\n(TRICKS & TIPS): \r\n\r\nWaterfall Password: Trying to get to the Base of Belch? No idea what the\r\npassword is? No problemo! When you receive the ''Say the Password'' message,\r\njust sit there! Do not touch the controller... wait... and wait... and wait.\r\nEventually the door will open by itself!\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!EARTHWORM JIM *Playmates\Shiney 24Mb  11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nY:fire gun\r\nX:not used                     (BONUS);Andy Asteroids:Grab 50 or more bubbles\r\nB:jump                         to earn a continue.You must also beat Psy-crow\r\nA:whip                         to the finish,if you don''t you will have to\r\n                               fight him head-to-head.\r\n\r\n    (LEVELS):                (BOSS):\r\n1.New Junk City              Tireman,Chuck\r\n2.What the Heck?             Evil the Cat\r\n3.Down the Tubes/Tube Race    ---------\r\n4.Snot a problem             Major Mucus\r\n5.Level 5                    Robo Chicken\r\n6.For Pete''s Sake            Peter Puppy?\r\n7.Buttville Part 1            ---------\r\n8.Buttville Part 2           The Queens Butt,Queen Pulsating,Bloated,\r\n                             Festering,Sweaty,Pus-filled,Malformed,\r\n                             Slug-for-a-butt\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\nSHINEY CODE("cheat mode","start level","freezability","map view mode"):\r\nDuring game:pause,left+A,B,X,A,A,B,X,A,START\r\nINSTANTLY WARP TO "What the Heck?":Pause game,then:Y,X,Y,X,A,B,A,X\r\nFULL ENERGY RECHARGE:Pause game,then:A,B,X,Y,Y,X,B,A\r\nTHE "WRONG" CODE:Pause game,then:Y,A,B,B,A,Y,A,B,B,A\r\nINSTANT LEVEL SKIP:Pause game,then:A,B,X,A,A+X,B+X,B+X,A+X\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!EARTHWORM JIM 2 *Playmates\Shiney 32Mb 10/95!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nY:fire gun\r\nB:jump (2x for snott-swing)\r\nA:whip\r\nX, L, R:switch weapon\r\n\r\n(LEVELS): -as I find them-\r\n1. Anything But Tangerines\r\n2. Lorenzo''s Soil\r\n3. Puppy Love 1 (4 levels)\r\n4. Villi People\r\n5. The Flyin'' King\r\n...\r\n\r\n(TIPS & TRICKS):\r\ncoming soon....\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!EQUINOX *Sony Imagesoft 8Mb 4/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nB->jump\r\nY->fire current weapon\r\nX->cast current spell\r\nSELECT->call up special screen\r\n\r\n(INFO):\r\nKingdoms                Guardians          Weapon         Strength\r\n---------------------------------          ---------------------------\r\nGaladonia               Bonehead           Dagger           1\r\nTori                    Sung Sung          Shuriken         2\r\nDeeso                   Quetzalcoatl       Axe              3    \r\nAtlena                  Pincha             Twin Dagger      4\r\nQuagmire                Dollop             Sword            5\r\nAfralona                Eyesis             Scimitar         6\r\nDeath Island            Billy Bones        Mace             7\r\n                                           Twin Sword       8\r\n*note: you must collect all 12 tokens from each dungeon to summons the \r\nguardian.\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nInvincibility: \r\nOn the Title Screen, press L,L,R,R,L,L,L,R,R,R,L,L,R,R,L. The bottom of the\r\nscreen should turn green.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!F*ZERO *Nintendo 4Mb 9/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TIPS & TRICKS):\r\n\r\nMASTER CLASS: \r\nReach this racing class by choosing the Expert class and completing all five \r\ncourses in any of the leagues, placing 1st, 2cd, or 3rd in each.\r\n \r\nAN EARLY LEAD: \r\nUnless you drive the Golden Fox (yellow car), you can\r\nalways get an initial speed increase by using the quick start (hold down the\r\naccelerator to full before start) and leaning to the right. By moving into\r\nthe next car''s "lane" you can force him to hit you from behind, giving you a\r\ngood push. If you use the Fire Stingray (Pink), you can do this twice, first\r\nBlue Falcon will hit you then moving a little farther right, Wild Goose\r\n(Green) will hit you. This initial 2nd place position will enable you to\r\ntake the lead rather quickly (beginner and standard levels).\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!F1 POLE POSITION *Ubi Soft 8Mb 12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nAdvantages at Monaco Circuit: \r\nAdjust your car before the race to get an advantage.\r\n                      Steering  Tires   Brakes  Trans  Susp GearRatio  Wing\r\n  McLaren & Willams:     3      A or B    4     Auto    3       3     4 or 5\r\n  Ferrari & Bennetonn:   3        A      3-5    Auto    4       3       4\r\n  Jordan:                2        A      4-5    Auto    3       1       5\r\n  Venturi & Footwork:    2        A      4-5    Auto    3       2       4\r\n\r\n  Settings - Fast Track: 2       B-C      2                    5-7     5-7\r\n          Tight Track:  1-2      C-D      2                    4-6      6\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!F1-ROC: The Race of Champions *Seta 8Mb  9/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(Tricks & Tips):\r\n\r\nHidden Course:\r\n-------------\r\nChoose ''Start'' on the title screen. Get past the\r\nplayer select screen and choose ''Training'' in the Config screen.\r\nWhen the course screen comes up, highlight and choose the MONACO\r\ncourse. Do all of the changes you want to your car and start the\r\nrace. While you are racing, look carefully for a body of water\r\nthat comes to a point between two gray barriers. Once you find\r\nthis, get up to top speed (turn around and come back if\r\nnecessary) and head for the water. If you place your car just\r\nright, you will be able to run your car on the water without\r\nfalling in. Search for a significant opening from the water to\r\ngreen grass. Once you get to this, you will see that it leads to\r\na new course that is not even on the map.\r\n\r\nMusic Test: \r\n---------- \r\nFirst, bring up the Name Register Screen. Next,\r\ninput your initials as ''OTO'' and push START and the Music Test\r\nScreen will appear.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!F1-ROC II: RACE OF CHAMPIONS *Seta 8Mb+DSP 12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSuper Engines: \r\nAfter raising your engine level to the maximum, collect $100,000 in the races \r\nand invest it in the development of a new engine. After the next race, the \r\nSuper Engine will be ready. Oh, by the way, it can only be used ONCE. \r\nTo use it, hold A and B while racing.\r\n\r\nTrack Select: When the Notice Screen appears after the game is turned on, \r\npress Controller 2:4A then 14B before the screen fades. When beginning an F-1 \r\nrace in the Grand Prix mode, go to Course Option and press Up or Down to \r\nchange tracks.\r\n\r\nTime Attack Mode: To play in the Time Attack Mode, where you must finish your \r\nrace before the time elapses, turn on your system and when the Notice Screen \r\nappears, press Controller 2: Up,X,Right,Y,Down,B,Left,A,A before it fades.\r\n\r\nSpecial Game 1: When the Notice Screen appears, press Controller 2: \r\n4X Y Y. You will be able to play a multi-player action game in which you \r\nmust destroy blocks.\r\n\r\nSpecial Game 2: When the Notice Screen appears, press Controller 2: 4Y X X. \r\nYou will now be able to play a 2 player,Pong/Space Invaders type game.\r\n\r\nSound Test: When the notice screen appears, press Controller 2:L,R,L,R,L,R,L, \r\nR,L,R,R.\r\n   **Use Controller one to changes music in the Sound Test.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!FATAL FURY SPECIAL *Takara 32Mb 4/95!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nHidden Fighters:\r\nAt the Takara logo, quickly enter D,D/F,F,D/F,D,D/B,B,X on controller 1.\r\nIf you entered this code correctly, the Fatal Fury logo will change to blue.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!FIGHTER''S HISTORY *Data East 20Mb 6/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nBOSS CODE: \r\nWhen the Title Screen fades in, quickly press Right,Right,Up,Up,L,R\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!FINAL FANTASY II *Square Soft 8Mb 11/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nCLONE YOUR WEAPONS: \r\nTo make a duplicate of any weapon, have a character equip\r\nthat weapon, and when that character''s battle turn comes, select the ITEM \r\noption. Select a blank spot in the list of items, press A, select the weapon\r\nin your hand, and press A again. The weapon will now appear in the list.\r\nPress B to return to battle, then run away. Go to EQUIP and equip the same\r\nweapon that you dropped before, and it will split - leaving 2 of them in \r\nyour hand.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!FINAL FIGHT *Capcom 8Mb  9/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSecret options screen:\r\nAt the title screen:press & hold L, then press START\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!FINAL FIGHT II *Capcom 10Mb  8/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\n2 Player Same Player Code:\r\nAt the Capcom logo press,D,D,U,U,Right,Left,Right,Left,Then L R together\r\nthe screen should Turn Blue to confirm that it worked.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!FIREPOWER 2000 *Sunsoft 8Mb 11/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nReturn To Title Screen From Midgame: \r\nPress Start, then hold Select for a few seconds.\r\n\r\nControl Both Vehicles: \r\nTo control both vehicles in a one-player game, go to the Title Screen and go \r\nto the  Two Player option, then press START and A simultaneously\r\n\r\nStage Skip Codes: \r\nTo use these, pause the game and enter the correct code to skip to the next \r\nstage. \r\n     |_ to _|Keypresses| \r\n     |1 to 2|[R] [L] [R] [R] [L] [L] [R] [L] [R] [R] [L] [L]      |\r\n     |2 to 3|[R] [L] [R] [R] [L] [L] [R]x3 [L] [R] [R]            |\r\n     |3 to 4|[L] [R] [L] [L] [R] [R] [L]x4 [R]x3 [L]              |\r\n     |4 to 5|[R] [R] [R] [L]x3 [R] [R] [L] [L] [R] [L] [R] [L]    |\r\n     |5 to 6|[R] [L] [R] [L]x3 [R] [R] [L] [L] [R] [L] [R] [L] [L]|\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!FIRST SAMURAI *Kemco 4Mb 7/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSTAGE SELECT: At the Options screen. Hold L,R,X,A and the doors will begin\r\nto close. Before they close, press: \r\n      R = Stage 1-2       L = Stage 2-2\r\n      D = Stage 2-1       U = Stage 3-1\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!FLASHBACK *U.S.Gold 16Mb  2/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nSelect->opens/closes inventory\r\nY->run/jump/talk/fire gun/pick-up/hang\r\nB->selects object from inventory (simutaneously press Down&B to drop object)\r\nA->draws gun or puts it away\r\nY,B,A,Select->press simultaneously to reset game\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\n1.Planet Titan->DLRGS\r\n2.New Washington->BGSFM\r\n3.Cyber Tower->PRHG\r\n4.Earth->WNPQVX\r\n5.The Secret Base of Paradise->NMRYL\r\n6.Planet of the Morphs->SNTHN\r\n7.Nuclear Detonator->KLZHT\r\n \r\n\Spoonman/\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!THE FLINTSTONES: THE TREASURE OF SIERRA MADROCK *Taito 8Mb 3/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nA->advance though text quickly\r\nB->jump (double-jumps use clams!)\r\nY->swing club\r\nL/R-> hold to dash\r\nUp->climb\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\n  LA=Left Arrow   BR=Barral Down   GN=Gold Nugget    #E=Egg with #\r\n  RA=Right Arrow  BU=Barral Up     BB=Bowling Ball   SD=Soda\r\n  CK=Cake         HB=Hamburger     HT=Grey Heart     ST=Star\r\n  SN=Sun(Ylw Ball)\r\n    \r\n-Stage 2 (30 guys)- -Stage 3 (50 guys)- -Stage 4 (64 guys)- -Stage 5(80 guys)-\r\n  LA,LA,BR,GN,CK      CK,2E,LA,BR,BB      ST,BR,BR,LA,SD      SD,CK,HT,LA,CK\r\n  RA,3E,GN,SD,3E      HB,SD,HT,RA,BU      3E.3E,CK,CK,SN      1E.3E,ST,BR,ST\r\n  LA,LA,LA,1E,CK      LA,HT,CK,BB,BB      HB,3E,RA,ST,GN      BU,SN,GN,ST,BU  \r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!GODZILLA *Toho 8Mb ??!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n Last Battle.......MCDESG26M \r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!GOOF TROOP *Capcom 4Mb  9/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(LEVEL PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\nLevel\r\n  2  Cher RedD BluD Cher Ban\r\n  3  RedD Cher BluD BluD RedD\r\n  4  Ban  Cher BluD RedD Ban\r\n\r\nCher - Cherry\r\nRedD - Red Diamond\r\nBluD - Blue Diamond\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!GRADIUS III *Konami 4Mb  9/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\n29 EXTRA SHIPS\r\n1.   On title screen\r\n2.   Hold Left on control pad and press A 3 \r\n     times then start\r\n\r\nRANDOM WEAPON SELECT:\r\n1.   On Manual weapons select screen\r\n2.   X, Y, X, Y, X, Y\r\n3.   Weapons are randomly selected\r\n\r\nFULL WEAPONS:\r\n1.   Start Game\r\n2.   Up, Up, Down, Down, L, R, L, R, B, A, START\r\n  This will power up your ship with missiles, force field, all \r\noptions, and more speed.  You can use this code once per level. \r\nOriginal Konami code for Gradius and LifeForce will cause \r\nGradiusIII ship to self-destruct. (Original code used Left and \r\nRight instead of L and R, if you''re curious.)\r\n\r\nMORE CREDITS\r\n1.   On title screen\r\n2.   Press X button as many times as possible before pressing START\r\n3.   The number of restart credits will increase 1 for each 3 or \r\n     4 X presses.  The maximum credits humanly possible using \r\n     this technique is probably 9.\r\n\r\n\r\nARCADE MODE - On the Option Mode Screen, select Game Level \r\nand press the A button as fast as you can until the level reads \r\n"ARCADE".\r\n\r\nBONUS STAGES- There are bonus stages in levels 2, 3, 4, 5, and 7.\r\n  Most bonus stages require that you meet some condition and \r\nthen fly into a seemingly solid area to enter the bonus area.  \r\nThe conditions and areas are described below.\r\n\r\nLevel 2 - (condition: none) fly into the first ship opening \r\nalong the bottom of the screen in the last section of the stage \r\nbefore meeting the boss (area after the giant carbonated \r\nbubbles)\r\n\r\nLevel 3 - (condition: must have destroyed all of the guns on the \r\nground), fly up close to the low rock ceiling toward the end of \r\nthe level right before the last "mountain".\r\n\r\nLevel 4 - (condition: must have no power-up boxes lit at bottom \r\nof screen), fly into the back of the Moai head located in the \r\nmiddle of 3 heads toward the end of the level.  This particular \r\nhead will be facing away from you and all 3 heads are upright - \r\ndifficult to explain location w/o picture).\r\n\r\nLevel 5 - (condition: unknown), fly through the fire at the \r\ncorner of the inverted volcano just before the small passage \r\nwhich leads to the 2-headed fire dragon.\r\n\r\nLevel 7 - (condition: unknown), fly through low corner just \r\nafter the 4 turrets where your ship would normally have to cut \r\ndiagonally upward.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!HOLE IN ONE GOLF *Hal 8Mb 9/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\nSOUND TEST: \r\nEnter "Bmg" at the memory shot password screen.\r\n\r\nMETAL CLUBS: \r\nUse "METAL*PLAY" as your name for Metal Clubs\r\n\r\nHOLE IN 1: \r\nTo watch a hole in one, enter one of these codes:\r\n"CQJB83CFDFJ#H?LBBT7BJCF"\r\n\r\nSECRET 19th HOLE: \r\nIn the Practice Mode, get to the end of the fairway, then hit the ball \r\noff-screen in the direction that the game automatically aims it. If you get \r\nthe right distance, the 19th shot is made!\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!HYPER ZONE *HAL 4Mb  9/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSound Test\r\nPress and hold L+R, then Start at the Title Screen\r\nUse A to select sounds.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!THE IGNITION FACTOR *Jaleco 8Mb  2/95!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\nLevel 1.   X S K J   4 O O 4 \r\n           4 R O D   D O L 2\r\n\r\nLevel 2.   X S 1 N   8 O 5 O \r\n           K 3 4 D   D 2 1 3 \r\n\r\nLevel 3.   8 S 1 D   D O 7 4\r\n           S B 4 G   D O 6 3 \r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!THE INCREDIBLE HULK *US Gold 16Mb 9/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS)\r\n\r\nSecret Moves:\r\n..........Flying Shoulder Slam- hold L or R, then press Left or Right.\r\n..........Pile Driver - grab an enemy then press Y+B.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!INDIANA JONES'' GREATIST ADVENTURES *JvC/LuCaS ArTs 16Mb  11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(LEVEL PASSWORDS):\r\nFor the following codes,"1"represents the triangle-shaped rune,"2"represents\r\nthe Y-looking rune,"3" the circle with little legs,"4"the E-shaped,\r\nand "5" is the circle with with an I through it.\r\n=>Raiders of the Lost Ark\r\npart 1>1214  part 2>4142  part3>4322  \r\n=>Temple of Doom\r\npart 1>4225  part 2>4513  part3>4235\r\n=>Last Crusade\r\npart 1>5124  part 2>5213  part3>5114  part4>5254\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!JIM POWER:IN THE LOST DIMENSION *Electro Brain 8Mb  12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\n                 Level Skip, Extra Lives,Smart Bombs...\r\n\r\n  During game Press X A B Y A B Y X B Y X A Y X A B  on controller 2\r\n            on Controller 2 press:\r\nLeft  - Keys to 9 Right - Time to 5:59  Down  - Smart Bombs to 9\r\nUp    - Lives to 9                      Left Button - Next Level\r\n     \r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!INSPECTOR GADGET *Huson Soft 8Mb 6/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nDEBUG MODE: \r\nWhen the Title Screen first appears, hold L,R,B buttons and press,D,D,Up, \r\nLeft,Right,Down,Right,Left. \r\nThe screen will turn pink. Release the buttons and press START.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!JAMES BOND JR. *T-HQ 4Mb 9/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSound Test: Enter 012345 as the password and press START.   \r\nView credits: Enter 888888 as the password and press START.\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\n  LEVEL 2  0007  LEVEL 3  3675  LEVEL 4  9025  LEVEL 5  1813 LEVEL 6  3353\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!JOE & MAC: CAVEMAN NINJAS *Data East 8Mb 1/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\nPLAY A FINISHED LEVEL: \r\nIn any stage you have beaten, you can replay it and then exit it by pressing \r\nStart & Select.\r\n\r\nRE-ENTER THE DINOSUAR: \r\nWhen you are inside the dinosaur in the last stage, there is a way you can \r\ncontinue inside him if you die.  When you are asked to continue, select "YES" \r\nand you will be shown on the map in the last white "continue" spot. Go to the \r\nlast stage, and when you are in it, press START to pause the game, and then \r\nSELECT. You will automatically be transported inside the dinosaur without \r\nhaving to go through the stage and fighting him all over again.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!JOHN MADDEN FOOTBALL ''93 *EA 8Mb  1/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nClose-up Trick\r\nAt the Title Screen Hold down any button and then press START several times \r\nto get past the screen.  The screen will blank for a couple of seconds, \r\nand then you''ll get a close-up of the fans. \r\n\r\nLast Password:\r\nBBBB5nZ5C\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!JUNGLE BOOK,THE *Virgin 16Mb  8/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\nStage select:\r\nAt the Virgin logo screen press:UP,UP,UP,B,B,Y,Y,SELECT,UP,DOWN.LEFT,RIGHT\r\nB,UP,Y,LEFT,SELECT,and DOWN.If you did the trick correctly you should hear\r\nseveral tones.Now go to the options screen and access the stage select option\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!KA-BLOOEY *Kemco 4Mb 8/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\n  EVERY LEVEL CODE!:\r\n  001. BOMB  021. IRON  041. GOLD  061. TREE  081. VASE  101. SAFE\r\n  002. TEST  022. GAME  042. ZERO  062. TWIN  082. NAME  102. ITEM\r\n  003. SOAP  023. PASS  043. YOLK  063. TUSK  083. NAIL  103. ISLE\r\n  004. RACE  024. WORD  044. YELL  064. TUNE  084. MIND  104. HOST\r\n  005. ROSS  025. LEAD  045. OPAL  065. TONY  085. PILL  105. WORM\r\n  006. FAIR  026. CUFF  046. YARD  066. SWAN  086. MAIL  106. HOLD\r\n  007. QUIZ  027. EPIC  047. WOOL  067. STAR  087. LILY  107. HILL\r\n  008. REED  028. DATE  048. WINE  068. SOLO  088. LENS  108. HERB\r\n  009. RATT  029. WEED  049. SONG  069. LOVE  089. SPOT  109. NOSE\r\n  010. RAFT  030. TIME  050. WIND  070. SOUP  090. LARK  110. HELP\r\n  011. OVEN  031. PAIL  051. WEST  071. ROSE  091. K