ated at the top right.to \r\n                             increase the heath meter,Simba needs to eat\r\n                             African Red bugs,found in levels&bonus rounds\r\n\r\n(SPECIAL ITEMS AND POWER-UPS):\r\n*Plain Beetle:restores half of Simba''s health\r\n*Patterened Beetle:restores all of Simba''s health\r\n*African Red Bug:increases total health\r\n*Blue Beetle:increases Simba''s roar\r\n*Circle of Life:=continue\r\n\r\n           (SIMBA''S WORLD):\r\n1.The Pridelands           6:Hakuna Matata\r\n2.Can''t wait to be King    7:Simba''s Destiny\r\n3.The elephant graveyard   8:Be Prepared\r\n4:The Stampede             9:Simba''s Return\r\n5:Simba''s Exile            10:Pride Rock\r\n\r\n(TIPS&TRICKS):\r\nStage Select and Invincibility:\r\nAt the options screen press B,A,R,R,Y,you will then enter a hidden menu!\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!LOCK ON *Asmik 4Mb+dsp 11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nMission and Lives Select:\r\nAt Title Screen, press: Y B A B Y Y B A B Y B. Mission and Lives Screen\r\nappears. X increases Planes, A decreases Planes, Y increases Mission,\r\nB decreases Mission.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!LOST VIKINGS,THE *Interplay 8Mb  4/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nSelect->choose item to use\r\nA->activate switches,flip switchs,talk\r\nB->performs primary ability (sword,jump,shield)\r\nX->uses highlighted item\r\nY->performs secondary ability (arrows,head-butt,shield)\r\nL/R->switch control the another viking\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n   @Space@          @Jungle@          @Pyramid@          @Factory@\r\nLevel 1:  ----    Level 5:  LLM0    Level 12: QCKS    Level 18: JLLY\r\nLevel 2:  GR8T    Level 6:  FL0T    Level 13: PHR0    Level 19: PLNG  \r\nLevel 3:  TLPT    Level 7:  TRSS    Level 14: C1R0    Level 20: BTRY\r\nLevel 4:  GRND    Level 8:  PRHS    Level 15: SPKS    Level 21: JNKR     \r\n                  Level 9:  CVRN    L