!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nINVINSIBILITY:\r\nAfter selecting your Mech and contract, start the battle, and press Start to\r\npause the game after you land on the planet. Now, press A,L,L,Y,A,L,L,Y,\r\nA,L,L,Y and the word INVINCIBLE should appear across the screen. Your Mech\r\nwill be immune to attacks throughout this entire battle.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!MEGAMAN X *Capcom 12Mb  1/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nB......Jump\r\nA......Run/Dash (When equipped with E.A.S.)\r\nY......Fire Weapon (Hold to charge)\r\nL/R....Switch weapon\r\nStart..View status\r\n\r\n(ENEMIES):         (TIPS):                  ***ACTION REPLAY CODE:\r\n1.Storm Eagle......(Use megabuster)         HADOKEN FIREBALL...\r\n2.Flame Mammoth....(Use storm tornado)          7E1F7E85\r\n3.Chill Penquin....(Use firewave)               7E1F99FF\r\n4.Spark Mandrill...(Use icebeam)                7E1F9A20\r\n5.Amored Armadillo.(Use spark)\r\n6.Launch Octopus...(Rolling Shield)        ->note:to use press,D,DF,F,Y\r\n7.Boomer Kuwanger..(homming missles)         You must have all your health.\r\n8.Sting Cameleon...(boomerang cutters)\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\nChill Penquin dead:      Amored Armadillo dead:     Sting Chameleon dead:\r\n5385-7136-6321           5131-7358-4181             4131-6712-1221\r\nStorm Eagle dead:        Launch Octopus dead:       Spider dead:\r\n6486-8526-2458           1556-6642-7448             5573-4667-2147\r\nSpark Mandrill dead:     Boomer Kuwanger dead:      Eyes dead:\r\n1171-7257-8281           1653-3412-3174             6141-4666-4153\r\nFlame Mammoth dead:      Extra Life Tank:\r\n5617-8528-4416           5447-4177-4526\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!MEGA MAN X2 *Capcom 8Mb+c4 chip 2/95!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nB......Jump\r\nA......Run/Dash (When equipped with E.A.S.)\r\nY......Fire Weapon (Hold to charge)\r\nL/R....Switch weapon\r\nStart..View status\r\n\r\n        BOSS                 USE                   RECEIVE\r\n        -----------------------------------------------------\r\n        W Sponge             Mega Buster           Strike \r\n        O Ostrich            Mega Buster           Sonic  \r\n        W Gator              Strike Chain          Spin   \r\n        B Crab               Spin Wheel            Bubble \r\n        F Stag               Bubble Splash         Speed  \r\n        M Moth               Speed Burner          Silk   \r\n        M Centipede          Silk Shot             Magnet \r\n        C Snail              Magnet Mines          Crystal\r\n\r\nZero:\r\nTo get Zero, you must collect his three body components from the\r\nX-Hunters, who randomly enter the stages and can be found behind the\r\nsilver doors, which will only open if an X-Hunter is inside. Kill all 3 to\r\nretrieve Zero.\r\n\r\nDragon Punch:\r\nTo earn the Dragon punch, first find all the Sub and Heart\r\ntanks within the game. Go to the third X-Hunter stage and make it to the\r\nhalf-way point, where ladders lead both up and down. Freeze a bat to\r\nmake it to the upper ladder, then progress right and destroy the shield\r\nrobot. Stand where it stood and freeze the bat, then use the frozen bat\r\nas a platform to jump over the spikes and to the platform to the right.\r\nClimb the stairs and continue until you reach the spikes. Charge up the\r\nFlame Burner, jump up, and release the button. You''ll drop to the spikes\r\n(unharmed) when the flame dies. Use the Mid-Air Dash to reach the platform\r\non the left side of the room. Hold Left while sliding along the left wall\r\nto fall into a secret room containing a Dr. Light hologram and the power\r\nof the Dragon Punch.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!MEGAMAN 7 *Capcom 16Mb 9/95!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n(maxed out power-ups)\r\n7853   5856   2245   7515\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nSpecial VS mode!\r\nFirst enter thi