nu,and start the game.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!MIGHTY MORPHIN'' POWER RANGERS *Bandai 16Mb  9/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n     (PASSWORDS):\r\nlevel 2. 3847\r\nlevel 3. 5113\r\nlevel 4. 3904\r\nlevel 5. 1970\r\nlevel 6. 8624\r\nlevel 7. 2596\r\nboss  1. 0411     \r\nboss  2. 1007\r\nboss  3. 1212\r\n\r\n<GAME GENIE>:\r\nC286-6DF4 =INFINITE ENERGY\r\n3CAA-DFDF =INFINATE LIVES\r\nEC6A-ADF7 =MEGA-JUMP\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!MLBPA BASEBALL *Electronic Arts 8Mb 4/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nPower Pitching                PWRP\r\nPower Hitting                 PWRHT\r\nRubber Field                  RBBR\r\nSlick Fields                  BRRR\r\nSpeed Pitching                ZZNG\r\nHyper Running                 VRRRM \r\nBetter Opponents              XXXX  \r\nBottom of 9th, 4 runs behind  NNTH \r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!MORTAL KOMBAT *Acclaim 16Mb  9/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nL/R=Block            UP=Jump\r\nY=High Punch         DOWN=Crouch\r\nX=High Kick          LEFT=Move backwards\r\nB=Low Punch          RIGHT=Move forward\r\nA=Low Kick\r\n\r\n|Character      | Move               | Controller movements\r\n=================================================================\r\nSonya Blade     |Leg Grab            |D+LP+LK+B \r\n                |Sonic Rings         |LP,A,LP   \r\n                |Square Wave         |T,A,HP    \r\n                |Fatality            |T,T,A,A,B \r\n=================================================================\r\nScorpion        |Harpoon             |A,A,LP    \r\n                |Decoy               |D,DA,A,HP \r\n                |Fatality            |B+(U,U)   \r\n=================================================================\r\nSub-Zero        |Freeze              |D,T,LP    \r\n                |Slide               |A+B+LP+LK