en hold R,L,\r\nand press START. Choose VERY HARD from the Option Screen.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SONIC BLAST MAN 2 *Taito 12Mb 11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\nSAME PLAYER CODE:\r\nAt the Character Select screen, Highlight the same character with player\r\n1 and 2.Then the 2nd persone to select they''re fighter must hold L and R\r\nwhile selecting the same character.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!STARFOX *Nintendo 8Mb+FX 3/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nROTATING SHIPS: On the Continue Screen, Using controller 2, press SELECT\r\n   and B to check out all the polygon ships in Starfox. \r\n\r\nSECRET AREA: When in stage 3-2, shoot the second giant asteroid on the\r\n   right side of the screen until it explodes. Chase the egg that flies out\r\n   of it, and fly into the claws of the bird that will hatch from it. You\r\n   will warp to the Out Of This Dimension area, where you will contend with\r\n   lots of paper products! If you succeed in surviving to reach the giant\r\n   slot machine, shoot the arm of it until you hit the triple lucky 7 jackpot\r\n   and you will be rewarded with the "Secret Ending."\r\n\r\nBLACK HOLE WARP: In stage 2 of level 1, before you reach the grey Supply\r\n   Rings, you will see three asteroid bars (each made up of 4 gray asteroids\r\n   with a gold one in the center). Destroy the first 3 bars (by waiting until\r\n   as close as possible, then blasting the gold center asteroid). If you are\r\n   close enough when you destroy them, a grey laughing asteroid appears. Blast\r\n   it and enter the Black Hole it reveals. Three exits (which look like\r\n   grey Supply Rings) are within. The first goes to Stage 4 - Level 2, the\r\n   second to Stage 4 - Level 3, and the third to Stage 4 - Level 1\r\n\r\nKILLER WHALE: The whale will appear on the Amoeba level of Path 2, the one\r\n   that ends with the spinning, long-armed boss (the stage right before\r\n   Venom), but only if you do not shoot any Blue Sting Rays. It appears just\r\n   before you reach the boss, and drops enough powerups to give you full\r\n   energy, a shield, double twin blasters, and 5 nova bombs. \r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!STREET FIGHTER II *Capcom 16Mb  8/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nSAME PLAYER VS. PLAYER CODE!:\r\nAt the Capcom logo Quickly press Down,R,UP,L,Y,B on Controller 1\r\n\r\nCHARACTER PROFILES:\r\nAt title screen, press&hold: L & R on controller 2\r\n\r\nGAME GENIE:\r\nFast fireballs->EEE2-D761\r\nDraw more blood->9D23-6D67\r\nMid-air moves->C4A4-6767\r\nMirror Match->72A6-AF64\r\nDie from one hit->DDAC-AFD4\r\nRebounding Fireball->97A6-0767\r\nElectric Fireballs->4536-D46D\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!STREET FIGHTER II TURBO *Capcom 20Mb  8/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nUP TO 10 STARS OF SPEED!:\r\nWhen the words TURBO scroll by:Quickly Press Down,R,UP,L,Y,B on Controller 2\r\n\r\nTURN OFF SPECIAL MOVES IN A ONE PLAYER GAME!:\r\nAt the Capcom logo Quickly Press Down,R,UP,L,Y,B on Controller 1\r\n\r\nTURN OFF INDIVIDUAL MOVES!:\r\nAt the stage select screen Quickly Press Down,R,Up,L,Y,B on Controller 2\r\n\r\nCHARACTER PROFILES:\r\nAt title screen, press&hold: L & R on controller 2\r\n\r\nEASY BEST ENDING!:\r\nFist turn off the special moves, then Set the Difficulty to one star.Beat \r\nthe game to see the best ending complete with digitized "box art".\r\n\r\n*NOTE:Beat the game in both Turbo and Champion versions for two different\r\nendings\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!STREET RACER *Ubi Soft 8Mb 10/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\nCar Modification:\r\nWhen the "driver select screen" appears, press X,Y,X,Y,X,Y, then hold the X \r\nbutton. While holding X, you can use the pad to change your driver''s\r\nabilities. 