te lives:A2C1-AD01\r\nStop timer:A286-0F01\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER HIGH IMPACT FOOTBALL *Acclaim 8Mb  6/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n                *16 offensive and defensive plays*\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nB>>snap the ball\r\nB>>to pass<after the snap> *Press up to pass to the receiver at the top or \r\ndown to pass to the receiver at the bottom.\r\nA>>hand off\r\nY+left or right>>jump\r\nX+up or down>>spin away\r\nL/R>>turbo boost\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER OFF ROAD: THE BAJA *Tradewest 8Mb 9/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nA->Nitro Boost\r\nB->Accelerat\r\nX->Brake\r\nY->Nitro\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nFun Run Track:\r\nBefore starting a new game, go to the Game Select screen and\r\npress X B Y A X B Y A. Select the Fun Run option.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER MARIO KART *Nintendo  4Mb +DSP+  9/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nShrink Characters...At the character select screen press and hold Y, then A.\r\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\nRace a ONE player game using controller 2...Hold L+R, then Start at title.\r\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\nSave a sequence of your race in SRAM...race a track in the "Time Trial", then\r\nat the retry screen hold L,R,Y, then press X.You should hear a ding.\r\n*Note:This trick only works if you race well.Try to stay on the road!\r\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\nPlay against your sequenced racer...Place the arrow in front of the YELLOW\r\nhighlight track, hold L+R, then start.You should now see the "ghost racer"\r\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\n\r\n                                          ( best time Mario Circuit 1 )\r\n                              Big Fuckin''deal!> 1''02"01 -Spoonman-\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER MARIO WORLD *Nintendo 4Mb  8/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n (TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nTOP SECRET AREA:  \r\nEnter the first ghost house and walk to\r\nthe right until the first hole in the floor.  Hold the(Y)button to spin.\r\nRun to the left until able to fly, jump and fly up the left hand wall \r\nuntil you can land on a ledge to your right.  Run all the way across \r\nthe house, off the ledge, and out the door at the end.  Once you exit,\r\nyou will have a path to an area where you can fully power up. \r\n\r\nBACK TO THE CASTLES:\r\nTo reenter castles once you have destroyed them,\r\npress the ''L'' and ''R'' buttons at the same time while standing on the castle.\r\n\r\n<<GAME GENIE>>\r\n9E32-6DAD =BLACK MARIO\r\n3E32-6DAD =NO ENEMIES\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER PUTTY *U.S. Gold 8Mb 12/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nUNLIMITED LIVES/STAGE SKIP:\r\nStart a game, the pause it. Press R,A,L,L,Y and the screen will shift to the\r\nright. You now have unlimited lives!\r\n*you can skip any level by pressing Select.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER PUNCH*OUT!! *Nintendo 16Mb  10/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nup>>guard up/direct punch at head        *While using the Y,B or A buttons,\r\nleft>>dodge left                         use the control pad to direct the\r\nright>>dodge right                       punch to the head or body in \r\ndown>>duck                               addition to the direction that the\r\nstart>>pause/quit                        button is assigned.\r\nY button>>left punch\r\nB button>>right punch\r\nA button>>knock-out punch:(When the S flashes,you can use any of the four\r\npowerful knock out punches by combining the knock out button+the direction.\r\nsuper uppercut=up+A...rapid uppercut=up+A,A...hook=just A...rapid hook=A,A\r\n**Knock out punches have a slight delay.However,they are powerful enough to\r\npenetrate your opponent''s guard!\r\n\r\n(LEVELS):\r\nWVBA Minor Circut:         WVBA Major Circut:    WVBA World Circut:\r\n<<Gabby Jay>>              <<Bob Charlie>>       <<Aran Ryan>>\r\n<<Bear Hugger>>            <<Dragon Chan>>       <<Heike Kagero>>\r\n<<Piston Hurricane>>       <<Masked Muscle>>     <<Mad Clown>>\r\n<<Bald Bull>>              <<Mr. Sandman>>       <<Super Macho Man>>\r\n\r\nWVBA Special Circut:\r\n<<Narcis Prince>>    <<Hoy Quarlow>>    <<Rick Bruiser>>   <<Nick Bruiser>>\r\n\r\n(TRICKS):\r\nSound Test:\r\nWhen the Nintendo logo appears, take controller two and press and hold the \r\nSELECT button. Then press and hold L and R. Now let go of SELECT.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER R-TYPE *Irem 8Mb  9/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS)\r\nStage Select-> At the 2nd Title Screen, press and hold R, then Up nine times.\r\nThen start a game and press Start to Pause it.Hold R,A, and Select. Choose \r\nlevel by pressing up or down on the control pad.\r\n\r\nWeapon Power Ups-> At the 2nd Title Screen,press Down,R,Right,Down,Right,\r\nRight,Down,Right,Down,Down,Start.Press Pause then,R,Right,Down,Y,Down,Right, \r\nDown, Left, Right,Down, Right, Right +\/\r\n\r\n    A=Sky Laser        x2=Homing Missiles\r\n    B=Ground Laser \r\n    X=Reflect Laser    x2=Spread Bomb  \r\n    Y=Spread Laser\r\n    R=ShotGun Bomb\r\n    L=Nothing\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER RETURN OF THE JEDI 16Mb  *JVC/Lucas Arts  11/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\nSuper Return of the Jedi easy codes\r\n\r\n1. Landspeeder                  (Start)\r\n2. Climbing to the palace        RLGQMN\r\n3. Jabba''s dance hall            ZJLMRJ\r\n4. Jabba''s dungeon               LZLKJF\r\n5. Rancor pit                    VTYMZX\r\n6. Attack on sail barge          QZNFPP\r\n7. Inside sail barge             VKCDFD\r\n8. Speeder bikes                 ZCTKFC\r\n9. Ewok village A                QYXYHB\r\n10. Ewok village B               LFWLTQ\r\n11. Shuttle landing platform     QDQGKH\r\n12. Fighting TIE fighters        CPMRZV\r\n13. Power generator              CDWLTY\r\n14. Corridors of the Death Star  BPFFZQ\r\n15. Death Star surface attack    RMNVLC\r\n16. Death Star tower             RVKFKG\r\n17. Vader                        VQXDQJ\r\n18. The Emperor                  HLQMVL\r\n19a. Into the superstructure     VQJGWF\r\n19b. Leaving the Death Star      ZZSTXZ\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\nDebug->           AABB-XXYY-ABXY-ABXY-password. On side-scrolling levels, \r\nchoose ANY character. Hold B and press START to clear the stage! \r\nSound Test->      During any side-scrolling stage press & hold Down+X+Y+A+B\r\nSeven Continues-> At the main menu press A,B,A,Y,A,X\r\nView Credits->    At the main menu press A,B,A,B,A,B,A,B\r\n\r\nGAME GENIE CODES:\r\nC234-34AA Infinite Force power when you use the Force Saber\r\nCB6E-4704 Always have shield\r\nC281-3DB9 Infinite Force power when you use the Freeze Force\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER SMASH T.V. *Acclam 4Mb  2/92!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(ENEMIES):\r\nRound 1:Mutoid Man\r\nRound 2:Scarface\r\nRound 3:Cobra Head\r\nRound 4:Gameshow Host\r\n\r\nCIRCUIT SELECT-> At the "player/Skill"screen, press Right,Right,Up,Down,R,L.   \r\n\r\nLIFE AND CONTINUE INCREASE-> At the "player/Skill"screen, press Down,L,R,Up.\r\n\r\nSPEED_UP MODE-> Put the cursor on ''One Player''.  Left, Right, Left, Up, R, R. \r\n\r\nSOUND TEST-> At the "player/Skill"screen, press L,R,L,L,R.\r\n\r\nNO ENEMIES-> Use the Circuit Select code.  Select a circuit. Now, \r\nif you hold down SELECT while entering a room, no enemies will appear in \r\nit.  You can do this for some rooms and not others, which allows you to \r\nskip Boss rooms, or difficult ones.  Once you have 10 keys, you can use \r\nthis to get to the Pleasuredome pretty easily.\r\n\r\nCREDITS SCREEN->At the Acclaim logo, press and hold down L+R.  \r\nWhen the quill appears press B.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER SOCCER CHAMP *Taito 4Mb 10/91!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TRICKS):\r\n\r\nFor a team filled with Ace Strikers, go to the title screen and\r\npress Up X Left Y Right A Down B Left Up R Down Select Start.\r\nNow, choose your team and Ace Striker.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER STREET FIGHTER II  *Capcom 32Mb  6/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nSAME CHARATER IN GROUP BATTLE\r\n1.   Select Battle Mode Option\r\n2.   On Controller 2\r\n3.   Press L R L R L R R L\r\n4.   Vega will laugh to Confirm\r\n5.   Choose either Match of Elimination \r\n6.   You can choose eight of the same characters\r\n\r\nSPEED UP COMPUTER BATTLE\r\n1.   Press any Button except Start to Speed up\r\n     Computer Battles in Tournament Mode\r\n2.   Select End to have ALL Computer Battles\r\n\r\nEIGHTH SELECTABLE COLOR\r\n1.   You can Change the color of your Fighter\r\n     by pressing either A B Y X L R or Start to "Start"\r\n2.   Press and Hold the Button until the plane flies\r\n     to its destination to gain the "Eighth Color"\r\n\r\nCHARACTER PROFILES:\r\nAt title screen, press&hold: L & R on controller 2\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER STRIKE EAGLE  *Microprose 8Mb  3/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(PASSWORDS):\r\n\r\nMission #2 Libya Day:         4H6F8392\r\nMission #3 Libya NIght:       4GBF8757\r\nMission #4 Gulf War Day:      7F6G4262\r\nMission #5 Gulf War Night:    09BD42F4\r\nMission #6 Cuba Day:          F06D8609\r\nMission #7 Cuba Night:        D0BG83FG\r\nMission #8 Korea Day:         67654475\r\nMission #9 Korea Night:       4HB705FG\r\n\r\nSecret Mission Password\r\nG6CH4228 (Screen says Bonus Mission)\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER TURRICAN *Seika 4Mb  5/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS & TIPS):\r\n\r\nLevel Skip->\r\nDuring game press START to pause the game, then press:Right, Left, \r\nDown, Right, A, then Start  -Can be done in any stage-\r\n\r\nInvincibility->\r\nDuring game press START to pause the game, then press L,L,L,R,R,R,L,L,L,START\r\n\r\nSound and music test->\r\nGo to the Options Screen.Press and Hold L, R, X, A,Then Press START button.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!SUPER VALIS IV *Atlus 8Mb 3/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n\r\nSTAGE SELECT:\r\nAt the Title Screen, press Up, Down, Left, Right, Up, Down, Left, Right, Up\r\nDown, Left, Right, Select, Select, Y, B, Start.\r\n\r\nEASY MODE:\r\nAt the Title Screen, highlight OPTION MODE and press, Left, Left, Right,\r\nRight, B, B, Y, Y. Enter the OPTION MODE and choose EASY.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!T2:The Arcade Game 16Mb  LJN 3/94!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\nSTAGE SKIP:\r\nWhen the title screen appears,press Left,Up,Right,Up,Left,Left,Left,Right,\r\nDown,Down->Before the high scores screen appears.On the high scores screen\r\npress Right,Up,Up,Left,Right,Right,Right,Left,Down,Down,Right,Up.When you \r\nhear a second boom,you can begin a game and start playing.While you''re \r\nplaying,press L to skip to the end of any stage!\r\n\r\nUNLIMITED CREDITS:\r\nAt the T2 Title screen, quickly press Left,Up,Right,Up,Left,Left,Left,Right\r\nDown,Down *Enter before the screen fades! Press R to boost your credits.\r\n\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n!TAZ-MANIA *Sunsoft 8Mb 5/93!\r\n!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\r\n\r\n(CONTROLS):\r\nUp/Down->runs, revives Taz\r\nA->immediate stop\r\nB->jump\r\nX->tornado spin\r\nY->collect items\r\nL\R:look\tantrum\r\n\r\n(TRICKS&TIPS):\r\n*Enter the following codes at the Options screen:\r\n\r\nSTAG