A        21 Sep 95\nMEGAMORE   SN_MMo10.LHA   MegaMore v1.0            C&P A        21 Sep 95\nOLMPP      SN_OLM10.LHA   OLM PromptPrefs v1.0     C&P A        23 Sep 95\nUOMSS      SN_UoMSS.LHA   UoM v1.3R Screen Shots   C&P A        24 Sep 95\nTXTCHG     SN_TCh21.LHA   TextChange v2.1          C&P A        24 Sep 95\nAUTO       SN_AuM21.LHA   AutoMessage v2.1         C&P A        25 Sep 95\nLINES      SN_Lin11.LHA   Lines v1.1               C&P A        27 Sep 95\nCHECKLVL   SN_CLv11.LHA   CheckLevel v1.1          C&P A        28 Sep 95\nLUNAR      SN_Lun11.LHA   LunarStats v1.1          C&P A        29 Sep 95\nCPSGAUGE   SN_CPS10.LHA   CPS Gauge v1.0           C&P A        30 Sep 95\nDOORMENU   SN_DMn10.LHA   DoorMenu v1.0            C&P A        03 Oct 95\nMEGAARC    SN_MAr01.LHA   MegaArc v0.1             n/a A        08 Oct 95\n\nSOCIAL     SN_Soc10.LHA   Socialize! v1.0          I   A        \nCONTRIB    SN_Con11.LHA   Contributor v1.1         I   A        \nBULLS      SN_Bul20.LHA   Bulletins v2.0           I   A        \nWALL       SN_Wal26.LHA   Wall v2.6                I   A        \nRANDOM     SN_Rnd20.LHA   Randomator v2.0          I   A        \nLOGOFF     SN_LPr11.LHA   Logoff Prowess v1.1      I   A        \nCALLSTAT   SN_CSt10.LHA   CallStats 1.0            I   A        \nMAINT      SN_MRc10.LHA   Maint Record v1.0        I   A        \nTOPCHAT    SN_TpC10.LHA   Top Chats v1.0           I   A        \nQUOTE      SN_QBx21.LHA   QuoteBox v2.1            I   A        \nNCMESS     SN_NCM25.LHA   NextCallerMessage v2.5   I   A        \nSNWHO      SN_Who10.LHA   Who v1.0                 I   C        \nSNWHOM     SN_WhM10.LHA   Who Monitor v1.0         I   C        \nCRISS      SN_CRS10.LHA   C.R.I.S.S. v1.0          V   A        \nGANG       SN_GWf10.LHA   Gang Warfare v1.0        V   A/D      \nTANKS      SN_BTk10.LHA   Battle Tanks v1.0        V   A/C      \nANTS       SN_Ant10.LHA   Ants! v1.0               V   A/D      \nTDREXX     SN_TRT10.LHA   TrapRexx Tools v1.0      V   A        \n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nProject Status Codes:\n\nC&P   -   Completed.  Packaged and ready to go...\nC-P   -   Completed.  Needs to be packaged before release.\nI     -   Incomplete and/or beta-functionality only.\nV     -   Very incomplete.  Most likely non-functional, only pieces.\n\nProject Types:\n\nA     -   ARexx PFile         NOTE:  Those with a slash indicate either\nC     -   CNet C PFile               of the choices, maybe both, will be\nD     -   DOS C Program              available.\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,18002,4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048740);
