             heavenstat.xim      -> without anim\n             heavenstatextra.xim -> anim included\n \n- How to install.\n \n             well, hope you can figure it out yourself ;).\n \n- How to get support.\n \n             call one of those spiris boards:\n \n                      cyber design    +46-320-611-11 WHQ storm\n                      access denied   +46-371-822-18 EHQ ice\n                      isengard        +46-526-139-48  HQ fenriz\n                      house of kicks  +46-951-332-76  HQ sinister\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,24575,4,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048749);
