                                             |\n:. :·                                                                     |\n ::· ·--------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\n\nHISTORY:\n\nrelease 1.1: first public! HooraY!\nrelease 1.2: BBS-name is now optional after Uploader! (req. by Darkangel)\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\nThis is the testimony of all that I have seen and all that I have learned:\n\nOn a night a full moon aSPHYX slept well and warm beneath the upper world \nin the realms of the UNdergrouND EMpiRE when, suddenly, his slumber was \ndisturbed by the voice of his humble servant WiiTigO who, after entering \nhis sleeping chamber, gesticulated in a somewhat aroused state:\n\n"Hell shit! Aquaadder is so fucking slow! And it can''t even remove the ads\nof Los Endos that is always faster than we are! I am desperate!"\n\n"Fear not, for help is here!"\n\nWith disbelief in his loyal eyes WiiTigO looked up at his master and felt\nthe passionate flame of perfection burning behind the somnolent but still\nmajestic figure.\n\n"Let the moon and the sun pass and your pain will be releaved!"\n\nAnd aSPHYX descended upon his coding chamber and was not seen until the\ndawn of the following day when he triumphantly opened wide the door to the\ninnermost sanctum.\nKing PEST, WiiTigO and after a while even Z-bOY gathered around the source\ncode of the all new ADDKRUSH BBS-Adder.\n\nAfter a short inspection King PEST could not hold his breath any more:\n\n HARK! THAT''S WHAT WE ALL HAVE WAITED FOR!\n THIS ONE \n *IS FASTER THAN ALL OTHERS BEING WRITTEN ENTIRELY IN OPTIMIZED ASSEMBLER!\n *CAN EVEN ADD TO THE MIDDLE OF A FILE, DIRECTLY ON TOP OF FILE_ID.DIZ!\n *ALLOWS YOU TO REMOVE THE ADS OF OTHER BOARDS VIA BRAINFILE!\n *ADDS DATE, TIME, BBS-NAME AND UPLOADER (if your bbs-soft supports this)!\n *COMES IN CPU-SPECIFIC EXECUTABLES!\n\n"But how" asked Z-bOY "do we use it?"\n\n"That''s all too easy, behold!\nJust run ADDKRUSH <txt-file> and if you want you may also give the name\nof your BBS and the name of the uploader.\nIf you have set the corrsponding options in the ADDKRUSH.config file\nADDKRUSH will then load the .header .tail and .mid data in order to add\nyour logos to the txt-file.\nSetting the KRUSHBRAIN option in your .config file will make ADDKRUSH scan\nthe txt-file for data that matches the patterns found in ADDKRUSH.brain and\nkill it off the txt-file.\nWell, no more to say."\n\n"But if tBf releases this program to the public, how do people know where\nto send bug-reports to?"\n\nFierce and wicked did aSPHYX look upon his co-sysop. Finally, he turned to\nspeak:\n\n"They may ask at any tBF-board or mail me directly at [email removed]!" \n\n"Ok. No more to ask!"\n\nAnd from that day on contentment and joy ruled the realms below and\n*hopefully* many other boards....\n\n \n   _______ __ _ _ /    _____________ __ __   / _______ ____ _ _ _   /  ___ _ _\n                 /  /                     /o/                     // /\n     . ·     ·  /////  TBF reAdMe        ///                     ////\n ______ __ __ _ //_   ____ ___ __ _ __   / /  _______ _ __ __ _ / /o ___ __ _\n                /                         /                      /\n               o\nEOF','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',27185,4,0,NULL,NULL,'tbf_ak12','scan',1780048764);
