n\n\n =========================================================================\n                        - Installing S-Adder v3.3 -\n =========================================================================\n\n\n This is a simple textadder.. just install it!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n =========================================================================\n    For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:\n =========================================================================\n\n                              ·° °     °\n                              : °     ° °·\n                              ¦ REPULSE! :\n                              |   _____  ¦\n    GdH_______________________|__/    /__|_____    __________________g''S\n     _/   _____/   ___________  ¬\   /¬\      /___/   _____/   _____/\n    /    __  ¬\   ___)_/     /    \ /   \    /  ¬\____   ¬\   ___)__\n   /      /    \_ /    ¬\_ _______//     \_ /     \_ /     \_ /    ¬\_\n   \_____/      /__      /_/ _______      /__      /__      /__      /\n         \_____/  \_____/     |    \_____/  \_____/  \_____/  \_____/\n                              ¦          |\n                              :° °     ° ¦ Core of the Underground\n                              . °     ° °:\n                                         .\n\n                          Current NUP: Amfetamin\n                               +46-270-12138\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',51296,4,0,NULL,NULL,'tds_aa10','scan',1780048764);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('tds_ad31','TDS_AD31.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/TDS_AD31.LHA',NULL,'XIM','SADDER.000',NULL,'The','TDS','\   ______________    \_____  siL/ +--\   /     \/    /    /    /____/--------+ |   \ /      /    /    /\____   \  doodles |',replace('  __________________________________\n  \   ______________    \_____  siL/\n+--\   /     \/    /    /    /____/--------+\n|   \ /      /    /    /\____   \  doodles |\n|    X      /   _/    /     /   /   shock  |\n+---/______/_________/______\  /-----------+\n.----------------------------\/------------.\n|   S-Adder v3.1,  by The Silencer / TDF   |\n`------------------------------------------''\n  Finest /X LHA/LZH Checker/Stripper/Adder\n','\n',char(10)),'SADDER.guide',replace('@database S-Adder v3.1 docs\n\n@remark $Ver: v3.1 (03-13-94)\n@remark published by DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n@remark amigaguide transformation by d-Zire/DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n\n@node "MAiN" "S-Adder v3.1 Documents"\n\n =========================================================================\n                        - S-Adder v3.1 Documents -\n =========================================================================\n\n                               S-Adder v3.1\n\n                     by The Silencer of DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n\n                        [ Release date: 03-17-94 ]\n\n\n                  @{"[     ABoUT     ]"link "About"       }    @{"[    PACKAGE    ]"link "Package"}\n                  @{"[ iNSTALLATioN! ]"link "Installation"}    @{"[    CoNTACT    ]"link "Contact"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                  (c)-94 by The Silencer / DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n =========================================================================\n       AMiGAGUiDE TRANSFoRMATioN AND DESiGN by d-Zire/DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n@endnode\n\n@node "About" "About S-Adder v3.1"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "MAiN"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Installation"}\n\n\n =========================================================================\n                          - About S-Adder v3.1 -\n =========================================================================\n\n\n S-Adder is by far the most comprehensive archive handler yet on the\n market. It strips/adds an unlimited amount of BBSads (or whatever) in a\n flash and also tests the arhive in a fashionable way.\n It is also part of the SiLENCER^iZ^Cø0L series and loox pretty decent\n if you ask me :) ...\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Installation" "Installing S-Adder v3.1"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "MAiN"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Package"}\n\n\n =========================================================================\n                        - Installing S-Adder v3.1 -\n =========================================================================\n\n As this is a rather premature release it is not totally configurable YET!\n This will come in the next version of this fab archive handler.\n Therefore you will notice that the paths used are hardcoded into the program.\n\n·Copy the FCheck icons to where they belong.\n\n·Copy the SADDER.000/SADDER.0x0 into your BBS:Utils/ or wherever you want\n according to the CHECKER= tooltype information in the FCheck icons.\n\n·Throw ALL your BBS.DisplayMe, BBSIntro.EXE, Advert.Info ,,, files\n in the "S:SiL/" drawer. All files in this drawer will be added to\n the files passing this checker.\n\n ..and your Set!\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Package" "Contents!"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "Main"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Contact"}\n\n\n =========================================================================\n                       - Contents in this package -\n =========================================================================\n\n                  -[ Files ]-------------------[ Sizes ]-\n \n                   BBS/FCheck/LHA.info              607\n                   BBS/FCheck/LZH.info              607\n                   BBS/UTILS/SADDER.000            9564\n                   BBS/UTILS/SADDER.0x0            9560\n\n                  ---------------------------------------\n\n          The SADDER.000 works on Any member of the 68000 family.\n                   SADDER.0x0 is for 020/030+ versions.\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Contact" "For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:"\n =========================================================================\n\n                              ·° °     °\n                              : °     ° °·\n                              ¦ REPULSE! :\n                              |   _____  ¦\n    GdH_______________________|__/    /__|_____    __________________g''S\n     _/   _____/   ___________  ¬\   /¬\      /___/   _____/   _____/\n    /    __  ¬\   ___)_/     /    \ /   \    /  ¬\____   ¬\   ___)__\n   /      /    \_ /    ¬\_ _______//     \_ /     \_ /     \_ /    ¬\_\n   \_____/      /__      /_/ _______      /__      /__      /__      /\n         \_____/  \_____/     |    \_____/  \_____/  \_____/  \_____/\n                              ¦          |\n                              :° °     ° ¦ Core of the Underground\n                              . °     ° °:\n                                         .\n                             +46-270-12138\n\n =========================================================================\n@endnode\n\n@node "Help" "For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:"\n\n =========================================================================\n    For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:\n =========================================================================\n\n                              ·° °     °\n                              : °     ° °·\n                              ¦ REPULSE! :\n                              |   _____  ¦\n    GdH_______________________|__/    /__|_____    __________________g''S\n     _/   _____/   ___________  ¬\   /¬\      /___/   _____/   _____/\n    /    __  ¬\   ___)_/     /    \ /   \    /  ¬\____   ¬\   ___)__\n   /      /    \_ /    ¬\_ _______//     \_ /     \_ /     \_ /    ¬\_\n   \_____/      /__      /_/ _______      /__      /__      /__      /\n         \_____/  \_____/     |    \_____/  \_____/  \_____/  \_____/\n                              ¦          |\n                              :° °     ° ¦ Core of the Underground\n                              . °     ° °:\n                                         .\n\n                             +46-270-12138\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',52398,5,0,NULL,NULL,'tds_ad31','scan',1780048775);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('tds_c100','TDS_C100.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/TDS_C100.LHA',NULL,'XIM','__________________________________',NULL,'The','TDS','\   ______________    \_____  siL/ +--\   /     \/    /    /    /____/--------+ |   \ /      /    /    /\____   \  doodles |',replace('  __________________________________\n  \   ______________    \_____  siL/\n+--\   /     \/    /    /    /____/--------+\n|   \ /      /    /    /\____   \  doodles |\n|    X      /   _/    /     /   /   shock  |\n+---/______/_________/______\  /-----------+\n.----------------------------\/------------.\n|  /X SiL-COMMENT v1.00,  by The Silencer  |\n`------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'SiL-Comment.guide',replace('@database SiL-Comment v1.00 docs\n\n@remark $Ver: v1.00 (03-17-94)\n@remark published by DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n@remark amigaguide transformation by d-Zire/DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n\n@node "MAiN" "SiL-Comment v1.00 Documents"\n =========================================================================\n                      - SiL COMMENT v1.00 Documents -\n =========================================================================\n\n                             SiL-Comment v1.00\n\n                     by The Silencer of DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n\n                        [ Release date: 03-17-94 ]\n\n =========================================================================\n                  (c)-94 by The Silencer / DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n =========================================================================\n\n                  @{"[     ABoUT     ]"link "About"       }    @{"[    PACKAGE    ]"link "Package"}\n                  @{"[ iNSTALLATioN! ]"link "Installation"}    @{"[    CoNTACT    ]"link "Contact"}\n                  @{"[    CoNFiG!    ]"link "Config"      }    @{"[  ToP SECRET!  ]"link "TopSecret"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                  (c)-94 by The Silencer / DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n =========================================================================\n       AMiGAGUiDE TRANSFoRMATioN AND DESiGN by d-Zire/DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n@endnode\n\n@node "About" "About SiL-Comment v1.00"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "MAiN"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Installation"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                        - About SiL-Comment v1.00 -\n =========================================================================\n\n\n\n I think you know how a comment door works by now so I won''t be going\n thrue all that.\n\n So What''s so different about this Comment door compared to others?\n Well for starters, it''s a hell of a lot cooler looking.\n Just check out the supplied screenshot! SiL-Comment.iff ...\n It''s faster than those slow AREXX scripts (Coded as XiM module using C++).\n It doesn''t need any lame configfiles with thousands of control sequences.\n It has a ''Comment-Counter'' =)........\n\n Read the Install for more...\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Installation" "Installing SiL-Comment v1.00"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "MAiN"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Package"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                     - Installing SiL-Comment v1.00 -\n =========================================================================\n\n\n · Put the Commands/BBSCmd/C.info in it''s place.\n · And the Doors/Comment/Comment.xxx\n                        /Comment.xxx.info where they belong.\n\n The datafile that is created by the door and the icons are relative\n to the Comment-door location so you can put them in any drawer you''d like.\n@endnode\n\n@node "Config" "Config - SiL-Comment v1.00"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "MAiN"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Package"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                       - Config SiL-Comment v1.00 -\n =========================================================================\n\n\n No stupid configfiles needed just these tooltypes in the Comment.xxx.info\n\n NAME.1=The Silencer                            <- Name of The SYSOP\n DESC.1=System Operator, Technical Advisor      <- Description\n\n NAME.2=d-Zire                                  <- Name of CoSysops...\n DESC.2=System Operator, Filenuker, MsgBase     <- Descriptions...\n\n NAME.3=Rabzi!\n DESC.3=HPA Conferences, Apply 4 Axs Here\n NAME.4=Aquarius\n DESC.4=/X SAS/C Conference Chairman\n\n Remember the first NAME.1 MUST be the sysop of the BBS.\n -----------------------------------------------------\n Why? Isn''t that stupid? No, not at all!\n How many times haven''t you logged in to a BBS as a new user being\n prompted to leave a comment? And then when you type C and try to\n choose a sysop it responds:\n\n Command requires higher access.\n\n That''s because the coder of that Comment door used the ''E'' command in /X\n and Not the original ''C'' command.\n And ordinarily E is set to a higher security level for validated users\n unlike the C command wich should be accessable by both New users\n as Validated ones.\n@endnode\n\n@node "Package" "Contents of this package!"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "Main"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Contact"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                         - Contents and package -\n =========================================================================\n\n\n                  -[ Files ]-------------------[ Sizes ]-\n\n                   Commands/BBSCmd/C.info            557\n                   Doors/Comment/Comment.000       17652\n                                 Comment.000.info   1748\n                                 Comment.0x0       17644\n                                 Comment.0x0.info   1748\n\n                  ---------------------------------------\n\n         The Comment.000 works on Any member of the 68000 family.\n                   Comment.0x0 is for 020/030+ versions.\n@endnode\n\n@node "Contact" "For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:"\n\n =========================================================================\n\n                              ·° °     °\n                              : °     ° °·\n                              ¦ REPULSE! :\n                              |   _____  ¦\n    GdH_______________________|__/    /__|_____    __________________g''S\n     _/   _____/   ___________  ¬\   /¬\      /___/   _____/   _____/\n    /    __  ¬\   ___)_/     /    \ /   \    /  ¬\____   ¬\   ___)__\n   /      /    \_ /    ¬\_ _______//     \_ /     \_ /     \_ /    ¬\_\n   \_____/      /__      /_/ _______      /__      /__      /__      /\n         \_____/  \_____/     |    \_____/  \_____/  \_____/  \_____/\n                              ¦          |\n                              :° °     ° ¦ Core of the Underground\n                              . °     ° °:\n                                         .\n                             +46-270-12138\n\n =========================================================================\n@endnode\n\n@node "TopSecret" "Get your AT&T''s here!"\n\n    WANNA CALL FoR FREE ALL oVER THE WoRLD ? AT&T, MCi or SPRiNT 4 YoU!\n   .-------------------------------------------------------------------.\n   |(\)  Abo''s            SEK US$           Lists          SEK US$  (/)|\n   |     ================ === ===           ============== === ===     |\n   |     1 Month......... 600 70            1 Card........  60 7       |\n   |     2 Months........ 900 120           Minimum 10 Cards           |\n   |                                                                   |\n   |                                                                   |\n   |  [°] We Have Thousands Of AT&T, MCi, Sprint Cards For You.......  |\n   |  [¹] They Are 100% Virgin, System Hacked Calling Cards..........  |\n   |  [²] Nobody But You Will Get The Cards..........................  |\n   |  [³] If You Have An Abo'' You Will Allways Get a Backup Card.....  |\n   |  [¢] If A Card Dies You Get A New One Within 24 Hours...........  |\n   |  [5] We Have An Unlimited Amount Of Cards, Never Outta'' Stock...  |\n   |  [6] We Have All The World Wide Links To AT&T, Don''t Worry......  |\n   |  [7] Lowest Price On The Scene..................................  |\n   |  [8] Deal With The No.1, Satisfaction Guaranteed................  |\n   |                                                                   |\n   |(/)  == RePulsE == +46-270-12138, NUP: LAMEBRAiN == RePulsE ==  (/)|\n   `---[ Call == RePuLsE == And Talk To Us Directly For More Info! ]---''\n@endnode\n\n@node "Help" "For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:"\n\n =========================================================================\n    For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:\n =========================================================================\n\n                              ·° °     °\n                              : °     ° °·\n                              ¦ REPULSE! :\n                              |   _____  ¦\n    GdH_______________________|__/    /__|_____    __________________g''S\n     _/   _____/   ___________  ¬\   /¬\      /___/   _____/   _____/\n    /    __  ¬\   ___)_/     /    \ /   \    /  ¬\____   ¬\   ___)__\n   /      /    \_ /    ¬\_ _______//     \_ /     \_ /     \_ /    ¬\_\n   \_____/      /__      /_/ _______      /__      /__      /__      /\n         \_____/  \_____/     |    \_____/  \_____/  \_____/  \_____/\n                              ¦          |\n                              :° °     ° ¦ Core of the Underground\n                              . °     ° °:\n                                         .\n\n                             +46-270-12138\n@endnode\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,35104,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048775);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('tds_sa33','TDS_SA33.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/TDS_SA33.LHA',NULL,'XIM','SADD.ANY',NULL,'The','TDS','\   ______________    \_____  siL/ +--\   /     \/    /    /    /____/--------+ |   \ /      /    /    /\____   \  doodles |',replace('  __________________________________\n  \   ______________    \_____  siL/\n+--\   /     \/    /    /    /____/--------+\n|   \ /      /    /    /\____   \  doodles |\n| /X X      /   _/    /     /   /   shock  |\n+---/______/_________/______\  /-----------+\n.----------------------------\/------------.\n| S-ADDER v3.3 - by The Silencer / TDS^EQX |\n+------------------------------------------+\n| The Best/Fastest LHA/LZH Archive Checker |\n`------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),'SADDER.doc',replace('\n\n\n\n\n\n =========================================================================\n                        - S-Adder v3.3 Documents -\n =========================================================================\n\n\n\n                               S-Adder v3.3\n\n                     by The Silencer of DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n\n                        [ Release date: 06-07-94 ]\n\n\n\n =========================================================================\n              (c)-94 by The Silencer / DoOdLeS^ShoCK^EQUiNOX\n =========================================================================\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n =========================================================================\n                          - About S-Adder v3.3 -\n =========================================================================\n\n S-Adder is a neat & simple to install LHA/LZH checker.\n This is only a small update but a usefull one.\n This time, no matter how big the archive is, you won''t get an\n out of memory problem.\n This version also uses sum trix to make it superior other checkers.\n\n Nothing more to it, get on with it.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n =========================================================================\n                        - Installing S-Adder v3.3 -\n =========================================================================\n\n\n Copy the FCheck icons to their place.\n\n Put the files in my S/ dir into your S: dir.\n LHA.Strip is all the filenames wich will be stripped from the archives.\n All bloody adverts will be gone.\n\n Create a dir on you HD called S:SiL\n And in s:Sil/ you put as many files as you like. All files will\n be added to the archive, BBS adverts or whatever.\n\n That''s all, if you can''t handle it then read the bloody dox for AE\n or something.. Cu\n\n\n                                                / The Silencer\n\n =========================================================================\n    For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:\n =========================================================================\n\n                              ·° °     °\n                              : °     ° °·\n                              ¦ REPULSE! :\n                              |   _____  ¦\n    GdH_______________________|__/    /__|_____    __________________g''S\n     _/   _____/   ___________  ¬\   /¬\      /___/   _____/   _____/\n    /    __  ¬\   ___)_/     /    \ /   \    /  ¬\____   ¬\   ___)__\n   /      /    \_ /    ¬\_ _______//     \_ /     \_ /     \_ /    ¬\_\n   \_____/      /__      /_/ _______      /__      /__      /__      /\n         \_____/  \_____/     |    \_____/  \_____/  \_____/  \_____/\n                              ¦          |\n                              :° °     ° ¦ Core of the Underground\n                              . °     ° °:\n                                         .\n\n                          Current NUP: Amfetamin\n                               +46-270-12138\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                                 - blipp -\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',20628,6,0,NULL,NULL,'tds_sa33','scan',1780048775);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('tds_sc10','TDS_SC10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/TDS_SC10.LHA',NULL,'XIM','__________________________________',NULL,'The','TDS','.-\   ______________    \_____  siL/======-. |--\   /     \/    /    /    /____/--------+ |   \ /      /    /    /\___    \  doodles |',replace('  __________________________________\n.-\   ______________    \_____  siL/======-.\n|--\   /     \/    /    /    /____/--------+\n|   \ /      /    /    /\___    \  doodles |\n|    X      /    /    /    /    /   shock  |\n|---/   ø  /____/  ø /    /  ø /-----------+\n|  /______//________/______\  / PresentS.. |\n`-==========================\/============-''\n /X Security Checker v1.00, by The Silencer\n','\n',char(10)),'SecChecker.guide',replace('@database SecChecker v1.00 docs\n\n@remark $Ver: v1.00 (03-13-94)\n@remark published by DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n@remark amigaguide transformation by d-Zire/DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n\n@node "MAiN" "SecChecker v1.00 Documents"\n\n =========================================================================\n                        - Security Checker v1.00 -\n =========================================================================\n\n                          Security Checker v1.00\n\n                     by The Silencer of DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n\n                        [ Release date: 03-13-94 ]\n\n                  @{"[     ABoUT     ]"link "About"       }    @{"[    PACKAGE    ]"link "Package"}\n                  @{"[ iNSTALLATioN! ]"link "Installation"}    @{"[    CoNTACT    ]"link "Contact"}\n                  @{"[    CoNFiG!    ]"link "Config"      }    @{"[  ToP SECRET!  ]"link "TopSecret"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                  (c)-94 by The Silencer / DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n =========================================================================\n       AMiGAGUiDE TRANSFoRMATioN AND DESiGN by d-Zire/DoOdLeS^ShoCK\n@endnode\n\n@node "About" "About Security Checker v1.00"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "MAiN"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Installation"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                      - About Security Checker v1.00 -\n =========================================================================\n\n If a user logs on your board with a security level over XXX and is not\n listed in your config he will be set to a standard harmless security\n level of YYY.\n\n For instance if you give a user 255 in security for a Sysop DL or\n something and forget to set the securitylevel back, next time that user\n calls his sec.level will drop to a harmless level.\n\n This way your board can not be intruded by lamers zooming private mail,\n account editing, checking private areas or SysopDL''ing.....\n@endnode\n\n@node "Installation" "Installing Security Checker v1.00"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "MAiN"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Package"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                   - Installing Security Checker v1.00 -\n =========================================================================\n\n To enable the door to be run EACH time a user logs on you have\n to launch it as an MCI command like this in for instance your Bull.txt\n\n ---------------------/cut/-------\n ~\n ~CC_doorname|\n ---------------------/cut/-------\n\n      ...and watch out for supress quick logons etc in your /X setup :)\n@endnode\n\n@node "Config" "Config - Security Checker v1.00"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "MAiN"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Package"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                     - Config Security Checker v1.00 -\n =========================================================================\n\n            No stupid configfiles needed just these tooltypes:\n\n    SYSOP_LEVEL = 250          <-Securitylevel to check Sysop.x names\n STANDARD_LEVEL = 20           <-Sec.Level to be set if user not = Sysop.x\n        SYSOP.1 = The Silencer <-Name of The Sysop''s and CoSysop''s\n        SYSOP.2 = d-Zire       <-\n        SYSOP.3 =\n        SYSOP.4 =\n        etc...\n\n@endnode\n\n@node "Package" "Contents of this package!"\n\n                               @{"[ MAiN MENU ]"link "Main"}\n                               @{"[ NEXT PART ]"link "Contact"}\n\n =========================================================================\n                         - Contents and package -\n =========================================================================\n\n                  -[ Files ]-------------------[ Sizes ]-\n\n                   Bull.txt                           18\n                   SecChecker.000                  15044\n                   SecChecker.000.info              1545\n                   SecChecker.0x0                  15044\n                   SecChecker.0x0.info              1545\n\n                  ---------------------------------------\n\n        The SecChecker.000 works on Any member of the 68000 family.\n                  SecChecker.0x0 is for 020/030 versions.\n@endnode\n\n@node "Contact" "For technical support and/or other quality /X doors contact me at:"\n\n =========================================================================\n\n                              ·° °     °\n                              : °     ° °·\n                              ¦ REPULSE! :\n                              |   _____  ¦\n    GdH_______________________|__/    /__|_____    __________________g''S\n     _/   _____/   ___________  ¬\   /¬\      /___/   _____/   _____/\n    /    __  ¬\   ___)_/     /    \ /   \    /  ¬\____   ¬\   ___)__\n   /      /    \_ /    ¬\_ _______//     \_ /     \_ /     \_ /    ¬\_\n   \_____/      /__      /_/ _______      /__      /__      /__      /\n         \___