                          - ---------- -\n\nTHE REGISTRATION FEE IS 15$, SHURE YOU THINK PHUU! A LOTS OF MONEY, BUT READ\nWHAT YOU WILL GET FOR YOUR MONEY.\n\n1. THERE ARE A LOTS OF DOOR CODERS BUT ARE YOU SURE THAT YOU GET A DOOR\n   WITHOUT ANY BACKDOORS?? SO I HATE BACKDOORS AND VIRUSES ETC.\n   SO REMEMBER EVERY DOOR FROM ME IS 120% BACKDOOR FREE!!!\n   THE REGISTERED USER(S) ARE GETTING A PRIVATE VERSIONS, ALL PUBLIC\n   VERSIONS HAVE FROM NOW ON SOME OPTIONS REMOVED OR SOME NERVIOUS REGISTER ME\n   STRINGS WITH WAIT LOOPS heehe  ONLY! THE REGISTERED USER HAVE\n   THE FULL VERSION. REMEMBER THIS!!\n\n2. YOU FOUND A BUG ? -> REPORT HIM TO ME AND YOU GET SOON AS POSSIBLE A\n   FIXED VERSION, NO LONG NEED TO WAIT FOR A NEWER RELEASE VERSION.\n\n3. YOU HAVE SOME GOOD IMPROVEMENTS, TALK WITH ME, AND I WILL SEE IF I CAN\n   RELEASE IT.\n\n4. YOU NEED A PRIVATE DOOR ONLY FOR YOUR BBS, I WILL CODE THEM!!\n\n5. PRIVATE SUPPORT CONFERENCE IN MY BBS FOR ALL REGISTERED USERS.\n\n6. ALL DOORS/UTILS ARE INCLUDING YOUR REGISTER STRING.(CODED!)\n\n7. YOU`LL GET ALL LATER VERSIONS OR NEW DOORS FOR THIS PRICE.\n\n                  SIMPLY YOU GET THE BEST SUPPORT AROUND.\n          THINK ABOUT IT AND KEEP THE PROGRAMMERS PROGRAMMING !!!\n\nIF YOU ARE INTERESTED SO CONTACT ME AT ANY TRSI BOARD OR SIMPLY AT THE\n                        TRSI AHQ - DARK ILLUSION!!\n\n@{"  MAIN  " LINK MAIN}\n@ENDNODE\n@NODE Greetings "GREETINGS"\n\n                          . SOME FAST GREETINGS .\n                           - ----------------- -\n                                  · TO ·\n\n             [*] MARIO,SIEGEL,BYTEANDI,DR.DRE,SPY,UYANIK!, [*]\n   [*] ECS,SAL-1,CAPT.CHURCH,SHADE,SUNJAMMER,KNACKOSOFT,CONTROL/TRSI [*]\n            [*] INSPECTOR,ICE TEA/CLS [*] AUTOPSY,FELON/HLM [*]\n       [*] CALYPSO/GOD [*] DJAX,SAUZER,PRAYER/R^D [*] AYATOLLAH [*]\n         [*] PSYCHO/2KAD [*] ENZO [*] UFO,METAL DEATH/LEPROSY [*]\n               [*] D`STYLE [*] KNIGHT FIGHTER [*] TURBO [*]\n                 