TiON), try to contact us on any TRSI \nBoard Worldwide, or try one of the following (but both 100% LEGAL ONLY!) :\n\n               @{"pUNISHMENT iNC. - WHQ & bETA/rEGISTER sITE" LINK BBSADVERT1}\n\n               @{"   pARALYSIS    - GHQ & bETA/rEGISTER sITE" LINK BBSADVERT2}\n@endnode\n\n@node BBSADVERT1 "HOW TO CONTACT US"\n   _____________  __________               /\\   sYsPW: GURUsUXX\n  |     __     /__\\__      /___________   /  \\             _____\n  |   ________/    /      /_\\____      \\_//   \\___________|_____|_______\n  |     |  \\      /      /      /      _//     \\    ______________      \\_\n  l_____|   \\___________/______/       \\_______/\\______   \\_    l/       /\n                              \\________/      /____________/____/       /\n                                       _________________       \\_______/     \n     ______ /\\____ ____________ _______\\______   ______/\n    /      /_      \\    __    /_\\_____      \\_    |\n  _/      \\/______/   _______/\\      /       /    |    · PUN¡sHMeNT ¡NC. ·\n  \\________\\    _/_____________\\____/  Mo!  /_____|\n                /                  \\_______/\n                                           /\\  ______________  ___________   \n     1oo% LeGaL sTUFF oN aM¡Ga^PC         /  \\_\\_______      \\_\\    _____/___\n                                         //   \\       /       /     /       /\n     RUNN¡NG oN a4ooo/4o · V.FasT      _//     \\_____/       /_____________/ \n                                       \\________/   \\_______/             \n                                                                             \n    TR¡sTaR & ReD seCToR ¡NC. (/X·¡NNoVaT¡oN) WoRLD HeaDQUaRTeR              \n                                                                             \n    aND eTH¡C D¡sT s¡Te   [> +49-(o)-3o-694-84-7o <]   sYsoP: s¡eGeL/TRs¡\n@endnode\n\n@node BBSADVERT2 "HOW TO CONTACT US"\n       ____                                                                  \n    __