r\n           UPLOAD DATE: 08-19-15  TIME: 20:10:08  ON NODE: 1\r\n\r\n  UPLOADER: Black Beard            LOCATION: mASTURBATIONSTATIONBBS.COM\r\n\r\nSTILL GOING STRONG in 2014!\r\n\r\n                ___         ._            _______             ·\r\n   /\  _________)  \________| \___________)__   /_________:__ :________\r\n  /  \/\  __  \    ____ ___/|  \______  \_  / _/___  \_ ____/ ¦__ \___ \\r\n /   /  \ \__  \___  \  |   |   \  _/  __/ /    /\__  \  |¦   | /  \_|  \\r\n/  \/    \_ \   \ !   \_|   !    \_\    \_     /   \   \ ||   |·    /|   \_\r\n\___|     ___\  /__    /l________ /_\    /__  /_____\  / |¦   |    /_|    /\r\n    l____/-A×E\/  \___/_!       \/   \  /   \/       \/__|:   ¦__ /  l___/\r\n       ______            _____        \/      :    ____   ·   : \/\r\n    ___)     \___________)    \__________:___ ¦____)   \__________\r\n    \    _______     _______    \___    ____/ |\_____   \______   \\r\n   /\___   \/        |    _)    \/       ¦    |/    |    \    |    \\r\n _/    !    \        |    \      \_      |    |     !     \   |     \\r\n \______     \___    |_____\      /___   |    ¦            \  |      \_\r\n       \______/ \____!      \    /   \___|    :________     \_|       /\r\n                             \  /        ¦    ·       \______/|      /\r\n   YOUVE HEARD ABOUT IT!      \/         :    ·               l_____/\r\n       \r\n         MASTURBATiON STATiON AMIGA/PC/CONSOLE/ASCII-ANSI/C64        \r\n               Telnet: bbs.masturbationstationbbs.com\r\n\r\n           UPLOAD DATE: 08-19-15  TIME: 21:12:57  ON NODE: 1\r\n\r\n  UPLOADER: Black Beard            LOCATION: mASTURBATIONSTATIONBBS.COM\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',19679,5,0,NULL,NULL,'v_await','scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('v34serdv','V34SERDV.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/V34SERDV.LHA',NULL,'XIM','v34serial.device',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Docs. A Very Fast Serial Device. 68020+',replace('V.34 Serial device for your 28.8K modem with\nDocs. A Very Fast Serial Device. 68020+\n','\n',char(10)),'reference-board.txt',replace(replace('              W h e r e   t h e   w a r e z   c o m e   f r o m\r\n                                               __                /\_____:\r\n__/\__________________________________________|  \______________/  \    |__\r\n\_   ___________  _______ ________  \__   ___ |   _______  _______  \_  l  \\r\n__\____  \    _l   \    |  \     |___/     |  !    \   _l   \   _| __/\____ \_\r\n\_____    \___\     \___|   \___ !   \__   |_____   \__\     \__\    \____   /\r\n -mNT\_____/---\_____/--l____/-\______/\   |----\____/--\_____/--\____/--\__/\r\n                                        \__|\r\n\r\n- -- --> F A i R L i G H T   S W E D i S H   H E A D Q U A R T E R S <-- -- -\r\n\r\n           reference-board is back 2017 after more than 20 years in coma!\r\n\r\n                        Running on AmiExpress TelNet\r\n\r\n                    Connect to: reference-board.zapto.org:1541\r\n\r\n                    or: www.brysk.se/reference-board/index.htm\r\n               \n              UPLOAD DATE: 01-04-18  TIME: 20:39:44  ON NODE: 0\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',19579,4,0,NULL,NULL,'v34serdv','scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('vdcolord','VDCOLORD.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/VDCOLORD.LHA','VDColorDir','XIM','VDColorDir',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,replace('\)AN /)AMME : COLOR DIR (DIR STYLER!)\n','\n',char(10)),'VDColorDir.Doc',replace('\n                      VDColorDir v1.1 By </an /)amme                      \n                     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~                    \n\n       For Any Comments Or Problems, You Can Reach Me On My Board...       \n                                                                       \n             .:| DeATH RoW (416)548-8557/548-9558/548-6632 |:.            \n                          \n                                                           [02/12/93]\n\n I''m going to keep this quick and simple cause I''m in a bad mood..  You need\na config file to run the program.. and it goes in S:.. for an outline of\nthe config.. run the program with a ? as the options should say.. This util\nis rexx compiled, so you''ll need the rexxplus.lib''s in your libs:.. I''ve \nincluded them incase you don''t have it..\n\n Just about everything you need to know about it is in the config help..\nIt is for coloring your dir''s cause I''m sick of the lame whiteness all the\ntime.. it''s boring.. With this you can color anything from the filename\nto the user after the sent by.. It''s all up to you!\n Hopefully more will use it to liven things up around here abit..\n\n Install it usually in your log off sequence.. or if you use the date option\nonly, then have it run only once a day or something.. Keep your dir''s down\nto keep it fast.. I have them at about 10-30k and it''s fast..\n Also remember to only update your most recent dir''s! For those of you that\nwould have it doing the offline one everytime.. :)\n\n That''s about it.. See.. Quick and short..  \n\n NOTES REGARDING OTHER UTILS:\n\n Since this program will add escape codes to your dir''s (unless you have the\ncolor turned off or set to 0) it will affect the way other utils react to it.\nThe only utils really worth mentioning are as follows:\n \n NosNuke: Everybody''s favourite nuker util.. if you color the filenames then\n          you cannot add any descriptions with the util as it won''t be able\n          to locate the file in the lists.. to avoid this, leave the \n          filename color to 0 which will leave it alone.. with it at zero,\n          you will be able to use the long description, but you will still\n          probably have problems with the little one (ie *NUKED* *LAME!*)\n          So the way I do it.. is color everything but the filename, then\n          never use the small descriptions and put everything you need to \n          know about the file into the long one.. Ie.\n>>>           ZEN : 100 Times Credits!! Check Your Stuff!          <<<NosNUKE\n          This will work fine. You can fool around with it to get it the way\n          you like it.. there''s always the remove color option if you manage\n          to fuck something up..  It will also not color the long \n          description lines that NosNuke will leave.. such as the one above.\n          Simpley cause then it would look lame.. right?? \n          If you still want to use the little descriptors, the only way so\n          far is to color only after the filesize.. coloring anything before\n          it will fuck it up! Don''t blame me.. I warned you. If I can get\n          ahold of Nosferatu mabey together we can fix it up so everything\n          works.. :)\n\n  VDEdit: Everybody''s Favourite Dir editor.. Unfortunatly it won''t work at\n          all with the colored dir''s.. trying to do it will cause some\n          really fucked up results.. I will be adding the option on to the\n          VDEdit to check for the escape codes to avoid such problems, so\n          stay tuned..\n\n  These are all the utils (alot eh?) that I feel are worth mentioning.. if\nyou use others.. use it at your own risk.. if you want VDColorDir to work\nwith a util you like to use.. drop me the util and I will configure it for \nyou..\n\n v1.0 - Initial Test Release. Complied. Seemed Okay..\n v1.1 - Fixed Bug That would write a date at the beginning of the list.\n        Forgot to Reset Date for the next dir.\n        Added Null Codes at the end of the lists to avoid\n        colors being carried over to the next lines.\n\n  Greets\n  ~~~~~~\n And a few greets to...\n\n Skol/Anthrox - How''s it doing dude? Long time no talk eh? Call me sometime.\n Nzo/Dual Crew - Ah.. I talk to you too much already. :)\n Nameless - Thanks for the greet in your NodeAct door.\n Nosferatu - Will we see a NosNuke to work with VDColorDir ever???\n Pot-Noodle/Anthrox - Great Last caller util. Also, Nice quote file. Hope\n                      you don'' t mind me using some quotes for my door.\n PMF/Minstry - What happened to those conf calls?? :)\n /\KiRA/Minstry - Anyword on the TT situation?\n Iron Eagle/Tarkus Team - Still waiting for that call dude.\n MAGNUS/LSD - Greets friend!\n mUb/LSD - Greets to you too dude. Thanks for the support!\n Phideaux!/LSD - Don''t forget to call even though your in a cool group!\n Ceejay - Long Live Dytec''s Memory eh?? hehehe\n Rambo/Fairlight - You still haven''t called me voice! Argg...\n Elf-Co/Alpha Flight - Where''d you run off too dude?!?!\n Defcon - I see your getting back in it eh? Don''t forget to call!\n Ice Cube/Anthrox - Long time no talk dude. Call sometime!\n PhARAOh - Hiya dude. See the board''s getting better all the time!\n Zen - Always my best friend around! :)\n Echo/LSD - Let me know about the group then.\n Kidlat - I expect you to be using this update of the door! :)\n\n And those that I know but forgot, and also those users that still value\nfriendship over all else, and of course to all you other ami-express door\nwriters out there. Drop me a line on my board sometime, I''d be glad to help\ntest your utils or give you the latest updates on mine.\n\n Remember to call my board. I need some console users badly.. and amiga\nusers are always more then welcome!\n\n And I''m still groupless.. Any group willing to take me on please get ahold\nof me. I like releasing my doors under a group name. They get spread faster!\n\n                                   Later dudes.. Till then!\n\n                                                            TW,SA\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',97737,7,0,NULL,NULL,'vdcolord','scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('vdeditv2','VDEDITV2.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/VDEDITV2.LHA',NULL,'XIM','Rexxplslib.library','2.0','</an',NULL,'Simply The Best FileListing Editor Made For Ami-Express. Nothing Even Comes Close. Many New Features Including Group Headers,  Real',replace('         VDEdit v2.0 By </an /)amme\nSimply The Best FileListing Editor Made For\nAmi-Express. Nothing Even Comes Close. Many\nNew Features Including Group Headers,  Real\nOverwrite Editing,Protection,New Callerslog\nPlus Much More.  All Sysops  Should Install\nThis Door For CoSysops And Users!  Awesome!\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,NULL,'auto-added',163446,4,0,NULL,NULL,'vdeditv2','scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('vdk_d12','VDK-D12.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/VDK-D12.LHA',NULL,'XIM','LE-win5-96.exe',NULL,'dIzY/vDK!','VDK','____./   /____        _____ /    /______ \   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \ \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \',replace('      ____                   _____\n____./   /____        _____ /    /______\n\   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \\n \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \\n  \___/_________\ ___/  \__\    \_____ /  \\n==============[ v·O·D·K·A ]=================\n==============[ PRESENTS: ]=================\n        dZYpAGE v1.2 bY dIzY/vDK!\n','\n',char(10)),'lOSeNDOS.guide',replace('                   \n                     __  _ __  /\__ _  _ __/\  __ _  __\n                    _\/___   \/              \/   ___\/_\n              ......\/\  /........................\  /\/......\n             :         \/                          \/         :\n             :      .___             .___         .___        :\n             :   _ _|   \      ______|   \  ______|   \       :\n             :   \\\__   7___  \______   /  \__   ____/       :\n             :      /.   |   \__/.  l/   \___/_____   \__ _   :\n             :     /::.  |    _/::.       _/::.  l/    _///   :\n             :     \___________\___________\____________\     :\n             :___        .___        .___        .___         :___\n     _ ______|   \ ______|   \ ______|   \ ______|   \  ______|   \\n     \\\__   ____/ \______   / \______   / \______   /  \__   ____/\n        /.   ___|___/.   |   \__/.  _|   \__/.  l/   \___/_____   \__ _\n       /::.  l/   _/::.  |    _/::. \___  _/::.       _/::.  l/    _///\n       \_ _________\_____|_____\___________\___________\___________ \\n         Y   :                                                :[nM$]Y\n      .------''                                                `------.\n      :eXON/rIOT^jORMAS · gHANDY/gODS · rAHIEM/eSSENCE · cELIC/rEKTUM: \n      `------.                                                .------''\n             `------------------------------------------------''\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',17809,5,0,NULL,NULL,'vdk_d12','scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('vdk_dst','VDK-DST.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/VDK-DST.LHA',NULL,'XIM','____                   _____',NULL,'dIzY/vODKA','VDK','____./   /____        _____ /    /______ \   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \ \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \',replace('      ____                   _____\n____./   /____        _____ /    /______\n\   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \\n \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \\n  \___/_________\ ___/  \__\    \_____ /  \\n<-------dIzY!/___________\--\____\--/______\\n - - --- -----[ v·O·D·K·A ]=-- --- -  --  -\n-  --  - ----=[ PRESENTS: ]=--- --  - ---  -\n-- -=[ dZY-sTAT v1.0 bY dIzY/vODKA ]=--  - -\n','\n',char(10)),'SYSOP_DOC.txt',replace('Welcome to this door by Dizy/Vodka!\n\n\nWell there''s some rules for using this door.. check ''em out!:\n\n1. This door is free to copy\n2. If you use this program then its ALL on your OWN RISK !!!\n3. If you want to use this then you MUST run REXXMAST!\n4. You MUST have all the Rexx-Thingys that will run other Rexx-Doors!!!!!!!!!!\n(det giver jo ligesom sig selv :) !!!!!!!!!!!)\n\n\n..........................................................\n\n\n\n\n                         and it WASNT a bagpack...\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,5664,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('vdk_ms11','VDK-MS11.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/VDK-MS11.LHA',NULL,'XIM','exe.-l0S-eND0S-bBS-.exe',NULL,'Dizy/Vodka...a','VDK','____./   /____        _____ /    /______ \   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \ \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \',replace('      ____                   _____\n____./   /____        _____ /    /______\n\   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \\n \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \\n  \___/_________\ ___/  \__\    \_____ /  \\n<-------dIzY!/___________\--\____\--/______\\n==============[ v·O·D·K·A ]=================\n==============[ PRESENTS: ]=================\nNew /X door by Dizy/Vodka...a USER-MSG door!\n[-----------------------------( dIzY! )----]\n','\n',char(10)),'mastrb8.txt',replace(replace('STILL GOING STRONG in 2014!\r\n\r\n                ___         ._            _______             ·\r\n   /\  _________)  \________| \___________)__   /_________:__ :________\r\n  /  \/\  __  \    ____ ___/|  \______  \_  / _/___  \_ ____/ ¦__ \___ \\r\n /   /  \ \__  \___  \  |   |   \  _/  __/ /    /\__  \  |¦   | /  \_|  \\r\n/  \/    \_ \   \ !   \_|   !    \_\    \_     /   \   \ ||   |·    /|   \_\r\n\___|     ___\  /__    /l________ /_\    /__  /_____\  / |¦   |    /_|    /\r\n    l____/-A×E\/  \___/_!       \/   \  /   \/       \/__|:   ¦__ /  l___/\r\n       ______            _____        \/      :    ____   ·   : \/\r\n    ___)     \___________)    \__________:___ ¦____)   \__________\r\n    \    _______     _______    \___    ____/ |\_____   \______   \\r\n   /\___   \/        |    _)    \/       ¦    |/    |    \    |    \\r\n _/    !    \        |    \      \_      |    |     !     \   |     \\r\n \______     \___    |_____\      /___   |    ¦            \  |      \_\r\n       \______/ \____!      \    /   \___|    :________     \_|       /\r\n                             \  /        ¦    ·       \______/|      /\r\n   YOUVE HEARD ABOUT IT!      \/         :    ·               l_____/\r\n       \r\n         MASTURBATiON STATiON AMIGA/PC/CONSOLE/ASCII-ANSI/C64        \r\n               Telnet: bbs.masturbationstationbbs.com\r\n\r\n           UPLOAD DATE: 08-19-15  TIME: 20:10:23  ON NODE: 1\r\n\r\n  UPLOADER: Black Beard            LOCATION: mASTURBATIONSTATIONBBS.COM\r\n\r\nSTILL GOING STRONG in 2014!\r\n\r\n                ___         ._            _______             ·\r\n   /\  _________)  \________| \___________)__   /_________:__ :________\r\n  /  \/\  __  \    ____ ___/|  \______  \_  / _/___  \_ ____/ ¦__ \___ \\r\n /   /  \ \__  \___  \  |   |   \  _/  __/ /    /\__  \  |¦   | /  \_|  \\r\n/  \/    \_ \   \ !   \_|   !    \_\    \_     /   \   \ ||   |·    /|   \_\r\n\___|     ___\  /__    /l________ /_\    /__  /_____\  / |¦   |    /_|    /\r\n    l____/-A×E\/  \___/_!       \/   \  /   \/       \/__|:   ¦__ /  l___/\r\n       ______            _____        \/      :    ____   ·   : \/\r\n    ___)     \___________)    \__________:___ ¦____)   \__________\r\n    \    _______     _______    \___    ____/ |\_____   \______   \\r\n   /\___   \/        |    _)    \/       ¦    |/    |    \    |    \\r\n _/    !    \        |    \      \_      |    |     !     \   |     \\r\n \______     \___    |_____\      /___   |    ¦            \  |      \_\r\n       \______/ \____!      \    /   \___|    :________     \_|       /\r\n                             \  /        ¦    ·       \______/|      /\r\n   YOUVE HEARD ABOUT IT!      \/         :    ·               l_____/\r\n       \r\n         MASTURBATiON STATiON AMIGA/PC/CONSOLE/ASCII-ANSI/C64        \r\n               Telnet: bbs.masturbationstationbbs.com\r\n\r\n           UPLOAD DATE: 08-19-15  TIME: 21:12:40  ON NODE: 1\r\n\r\n  UPLOADER: Black Beard            LOCATION: mASTURBATIONSTATIONBBS.COM\r\n\r\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',9893,5,0,NULL,NULL,'vdk_ms11','scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('vdk_sp01','VDK-SP01.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/VDK-SP01.LHA',NULL,'XIM','____                   _____',NULL,NULL,'VDK','____./   /____        _____ /    /______ \   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \ \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \',replace('      ____                   _____\n____./   /____        _____ /    /______\n\   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \\n \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \\n  \___/_________\ ___/  \__\    \_____ /  \\n<-------dIzY!/___________\--\____\--/______\\n===========[ JaWloG/v·O·D·K·A ]=============\n==============[ PRESENTS: ]=================\nA Cool new fully configurable SystemPW door.\n    Nice configuration interface+more !\n','\n',char(10)),'reference-board.txt',replace(replace('              W h e r e   t h e   w a r e z   c o m e   f r o m\r\n                                               __                /\_____:\r\n__/\__________________________________________|  \______________/  \    |__\r\n\_   ___________  _______ ________  \__   ___ |   _______  _______  \_  l  \\r\n__\____  \    _l   \    |  \     |___/     |  !    \   _l   \   _| __/\____ \_\r\n\_____    \___\     \___|   \___ !   \__   |_____   \__\     \__\    \____   /\r\n -mNT\_____/---\_____/--l____/-\______/\   |----\____/--\_____/--\____/--\__/\r\n                                        \__|\r\n\r\n- -- --> F A i R L i G H T   S W E D i S H   H E A D Q U A R T E R S <-- -- -\r\n\r\n           reference-board is back 2017 after more than 20 years in coma!\r\n\r\n                        Running on AmiExpress TelNet\r\n\r\n                    Connect to: reference-board.zapto.org:1541\r\n\r\n                    or: www.brysk.se/reference-board/index.htm\r\n               \n              UPLOAD DATE: 05-10-19  TIME: 12:11:03  ON NODE: 0\n','\r',char(13)),'\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,13159,5,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('vdk_vb10','VDK-VB10.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/VDK-VB10.LHA','Bulls','XIM','Bulls',NULL,NULL,'VDK','____./   /____        _____ /    /______ \   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \ \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \',replace('      ____                   _____\n____./   /____        _____ /    /______\n\   |   / __  \   ___/_    /    /_\____ \\n \  |  /  \/   \__\___ \       (  ______ \\n  \___/_________\ ___/  \__\    \_____ /  \\n<-------dIzY!/___________\--\____\--/______\\n==[ gENiUS / vDK pRESENTS 4 yOUR pLASURE ]==\n\n VODKA BULLS V1.0 - Bulletin viewer for /X\n\n  Cursorcontrol, downloading of bulletins,\n       online updating, easy setup...\n','\n',char(10)),'Bulls.doc',replace('                  .\n                  |                                    :\n               ___:_______/\___________________/\______|/)\n               )                                        /\n              /    V O D K A  B U L L S     V1 . 0     (__\n             (_                                          (\n              /    bY gENiUS / vODKA   rELEASED 14-04-96  \\n              )                                           (\n              \_  _____________________  _________________/\n       __/\__   \/:~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\/~~~~~~~~~~~~~~:  \n       \ oO /     :....................................:\n       /_-''_\ \n      .--\/----------------------------------------------------.\n      |         P R O D U C T   I N F O R M A T I O N          |\n      `--------------------------------------------------------''\n       Thiz door is a bulletin viewer... it features cursorcontrol and\n     easy setup, it can view all kinds of texts, also texts that is NOT\n                     located in your BULLETINS/ drawer..\n\n          Also the user can DOWNLOAD a bulletins, if he so wishes!\n\n   Theres only ONE config file, where you setup the entire door, including\n      head-logo and command-line... the bulletins is displayed in three\n   coloums and you can then move around with the cursorkeys and select the\n                               one you want..\n\n     Also theres ONLINE updating of the bulletins... explained later on!\n\n      So far, these not any support for simply typing the numba, but if\n                anyone wishes me to make that option, I will!\n\n\n\n      .--------------------------------------------------------.\n      |         H O W    T O   I N S T A L L   I T  ?          |\n      `--------------------------------------------------------''\n        Unpack the archive, move the dir called VODKA-BULLS/ to your\n       doors: then move the ICONS/B.INFO to your BBS:COMMANDS/BBSCMD/\n       and thats pretty much that... ofcause you now have to edit the\n                    .prefs file, to suit YOUR system... \n\n   The prefs file is made so you have the first 8 lines, for your personal\n     logo ect. what-ever you want in the top... the 2 next lines is the \n    commandline, you might want to change thiz, but i recommend that you \n                                   do not!\n\n       After these 10 lines, all other is the bulletins... like this:\n\nLATEST FILES                    <- What you want to be displayed in the\n				   door...\nBULLETINS:latestfiles.txt       <- the path and filename to the text file!\n\n\n           o                     o o                        o\n       o___/)                   (\/\                       /\__o\n        ) (\                    /))                       _)/ (   \n      .--------------------------------------------------------.\n      |      S O , W H A T   E L S E    C A N    I T   D O  ?  |\n      `--------------------------------------------------------''\n     Well, it automatically looks for the pathname of the bulletin with\n                         an extension like .script \n\n                      BULLETINS:LATESTFILES.TXT.SCRIPT\n\n      If it find such a file, it will execute the file, thiz means that\n      you can have online updating of the bulletins, and gain some time\n         savings when users logoff.. (becoz you dont have to update \n                          the bulletins then... 8))\n         ____\n         \  /\n       ___\/___\n       \  /\  /\n      .-\/--\/-------------------------------------------------.\n      |                  ! W A R N I N G !                     |\n      `--------------------------------------------------------''\n   Some parts of my doors, like the version numba and my name is protected\n   by a checksum code, so DON''T try to change ANYTHING is the mainprogram\n         itself, or the door is very likely NOT to function anymore!\n\n          .\n         ._. \n        `( )''                                              \n      .---U----------------------------------------------------.\n      |       A N Y    G O O D   I D E A s   F O R   M E  ?    |\n      `--------------------------------------------------------''\n      Well, don''t be ashamed to write me, or even contact my board, I''m\n       always open for good ideas! Look later on in thiz text to find \n                                numbas ect...\n                                                       ____\n                                                      (____)\n         _                                        .___|. ..|_.\n        ( )!!!                                --> |...|::::|.|\n        ((                                        |...|:::.|.|\n      .-(_)---------------------------------------:___|:.::|_|_.\n      | /        H O W   T O   R E A C H   M E  ?              |\n      `--------------------------------------------------------''\n      You could post a message on almost any of DK''s larger eliteboards\n                          or try calling my board:\n\n\n                               S Y N E R G Y \n\n                               D E N M A R K\n\n\n                            [pTQ WHQ - tL! dKHQ]\n\n                            +45-3990-2992 (28k8)\n                                                         _\n                                                       _( )_\n                                                      (__O__)\n      .-------------------------------------------------(_)----.\n      |                T H A N X    T O  . . .         `\|/''   |\n      `--------------------------------------------------------''\n\n                                 sUNDOWN/pTQ\n                               MELOMANIAC/pTQ\n                                  dIZY/vDK\n                                  nICKO/tL!\n                                 cHROME/fLD\n                                 mENACE/fLD\n\n                   mY hamster Georg and my goldfish gUDRUN\n\n                              & Mom and dad...\n\n       Danish velfare, 4 supplying me with money for doing just about\n                          nothing all day long.. 8)\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,'auto-added',27680,3,0,NULL,NULL,'vdk_vb10','scan',1780048821);
INSERT INTO door_catalog VALUES('vdpage','VDPAGE.LHA','~/Code/amiexpress_doors/Archives/AmiExpress/VDPAGE.LHA','Say','REXX','VDPage By </an /)amme','2.1','</an',NULL,'·<>· cOCKTAILS BBS  -  /X Tools Support ·<>·',replace('VDPage v2.1 By </an /)amme\n·<>· cOCKTAILS BBS  -  /X Tools Support ·<>·\n','\n',char(10)),'VDPage.Doc',replace('\n                       VDPage v2.1 By </an /)amme                  \n                     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~  \n              \n       For Any Comments Or Problems, You Can Reach Me On My Board... \n                                                                  \n         .:| DeATH RoW (416)548-8557/548-9558/548-6632/548-0240 |:.\n\n                                                                [02/12/93]\n\n  Installing\n  ~~~~~~~~~~\n First off, /X means Ami-Express for those that don''t know already. Now,\nto install the door load up the Customcommands (/X v2.2x or below) or\nBBS.CMD (/X v2.3x). If you don''t have a custom page util already then add\nthe following line. If you do have a custom page, find the "O" or "*O" \ncommand and change it to the following:\n\n          11 Spaces In         \n          |\n----------------------------          \n*O        RM010Doors:VDPage\n----------------------------\n||        |||  |           \n||        |||  ` ''Doors:VDPage'' is the actually location of the file.\n||        |||     Make sure not to change this.\n||        |||\n||        ||` 010 Is the minimum access to use this door. Change it to what\n||        ||      you like.\n||        ||\n||        |` M For a mutilnode bbs (S For single)\n||        |\n||        ` R For an rexx type door which will use the ''Rexxdoor'' Util\n||\n|`Letter to bring the door up on the board. In this case an ''O''\n|\n`-Retard Option. To Make Sure they only use ''O'' & only ''O'' to get the door\n  to come up. If not used, things such as ''Oh'' and ''Over'' would still bring\n  up the door.\n\n Use the line between the lines only. The other parts are just an \nexplanation to make sure you know what each part is doing (Since no one\nwould tell me back in the days where I didn''t know what was going on!)\n\n Now copy the ''VDPage'',''VDPage.Prefs'', and ''VDPage.Prefs'' file to your\nDoors: dir. The ''VDPage.Prefs'' File is not needed to run the program, and\neither is the ''VDPage.Quote'' file, and are meant as extras. The only file\nthat is a must is the ''VDPage'' file. But more on the extras later.\n\n Now, the door also needs the ''Say'' and ''Wait'' programs located in your C\ndirectory. This shouldn''t be a problem as they are standard workbench \nprograms. They are included in the archive incase you don''t have them, just\nin case. :)\n\n Copy the 2 rexxplus libs into your libs: dir, because the compiled doors\nneed these libraries in order to work.\n\n At this point if all things so far are in order and exist, you should be\nready to run the door.\n\n  Extras\n  ~~~~~~\n The quote file and the prefs files are not needed, but at least the quote\nfile should be used. Included in the archive is an example of each that\nyou may use and change to your liking as you wish. The quote file''s rules\nare simple. One quote per line, as many as you like. If your quote is too\nlong, then the page will cut it off, so don''t worry. So you can use any\nprevious quote file, like for example, the one included with Pot-Noodle''s\nSuper Ami-Log. Or use the one included. If you don''t have the quote file,\nthe skull will simple tell the user to tell you to install the quote file.\nIf the quote file does exist, the one of the quotes will be randomly picked\nand displayed to the user.\n \n The preferences file is used for 2 things. Delays and the message that\nyou are paged with. First lets start with the message. When your paged,\nthe util will use the say command and speak to you with this message. If\nthe prefs file doesn''t exist the it will default to paging you with the\nmessage:\n\n        ''Yo Sysop , Username wants to chat so move it over here''\n\n The word ''Sysop'' will be replaced with the sysops name, and likewise the\nword Username will be replaced with the users name. Keep the quote to the\nfirst line, and make sure it doesn''t carry over, as that''s for the delays.\nMake sure to leave a space inbetween everyword, even with the commas or\nperiods etc. If you don''t, it won''t work properly. You can say whatever you\nwant, and use the ''Sysop'' and ''Username'' freely.\n\n Now for the delays. If your using an 030 then you will probably not need to\nadjust them, as that''s what I use and it works fine. If not, and you find\nthe the program running to fast or slow, you can adjust the different delays\nof each part to suit your needs. This is mainly done as I was testing this\non my 500 at the delays where much too slow as they were set for the 2500.\nThe higher the number for the delay, the longer it will be. The smaller the\nnumber, the faster the delay will be. So 0 Would be the Fastest, and 1000 \nwold be slower. Again if the prefs file doesn''t exist, the delays will \ndefault to:\n\n   170          The Delay For When The Mouth Is Moving With Each Word        \n   100          The Delay For When The Mouth Is Laughing\n   1000         The Delay After The Quote Is Done And The Program Ends\n   500          The Delay For How Long The Eye Will Blink (If It Does)\n\n If you want to change them, use the prefs file and edit them accordingly.\nThe part for what the delay is used for is written right after the number\nso their will be no confusion.\n\n  Comment\n  ~~~~~~~\n If you have the page option turned off (F7) and the user tries to page you,\nhe will be informed that you have turned the page off. It will then get\nthe user to leave a message for you. \n\n  Callerslog\n  ~~~~~~~~~~\n As with all my doors, the callerslog is used in this door. A line will be\nadded with the time and message that you were paged with. If the page was \nturned off, the message will be ''Page Turned Off!''. If not, it will be as\nfollows:\n------------------------------------------------------------\nOperator Paged At 11:55PM "These Are Days, We''ll Remember!"\n------------------------------------------------------------\n                  |        |\n                  |        ` Message The User Entered\n                  | \n                  ` Time Paged\n\n  Operation\n  ~~~~~~~~~\n The basic operation of the door is as follows. The user will be prompted\nto enter a message to page you. His name and location will be displayed\non the screen for quick reference to the sysop. If he enters nothing, he\nwill exit without paging you. If not, you will be paged with your saying\n(See Extras). After this, a random quote from the quote file (See Extras)\nwill be picked and the skull will say it in text to the user. The quote\nwill always be centered in the middle of the screen under his stats. After\nthe saying, the skull might wink at you if your lucky. 8^). After this the\ndoor writes the log and then exits. Please don''t hit F1 to break into chat\nrepeatly with the door running. It will not break in until the door is done\nrunning. Wait that extra sec till it''s done and then break in. Sorry for\nthis but I couldn''t find a ''Get'' or similar command in rexx to use for \nsuch as task (Hint for you rexx programmers.If you know anything like it\nplease let me know).\n\n  History\n  ~~~~~~~\n v2.1 -Quotes are now centered on the screen.\n      -Quotes are now read in from a quote file instead of being\n       inside the program\n      -Added a preference file for the delay and page message options\n      -Changed Talking Mouth routine to spead it up more\n      -Now leaves a comment to the sysop when page is turned off\n      -First Public Release\n\n  Greets\n  ~~~~~~\n Special greets go out to Torment. Thanks for drawing the skull for me!\n\n Well that''s the end of another of my doors. I''ve been running this door as\na private util on my board for quite along time, and the users seem to \nlike it. I''ve given it out to a few boards, and so thought why not let \nall sysops that would like it to have it. I bet this would be a great page\ndoor for Skullbuggery BBS. 8^). So give it a try and I bet you''ll be happy\nyou did. As always I update my utils frequently so stay tuned for more\nand better updates of this program. Till then....\n\n And a few greets to...\n\n Skol/Anthrox - How''s it doing dude? Long time no talk eh? Call me sometime.\n Nzo/Dual Crew - Ah.. I talk to you too much already. :)\n Nameless - Thanks for the greet in your NodeAct door.\n Nosferatu - Will we see a NosNuke to work with VDColorDir ever???\n Pot-Noodle/Anthrox - Great Last caller util. Also, Nice quote file. Hope\n                      you don'' t mind me using some quotes for my door.\n PMF/Minstry - What happened to those conf calls?? :)\n /\KiRA/Minstry - Anyword on the TT situation?\n Iron Eagle/Tarkus Team - Still waiting for that call dude.\n MAGNUS/LSD - Greets friend!\n mUb/LSD - Greets to you too dude. Thanks for the support!\n Phideaux!/LSD - Don''t forget to call even though your in a cool group!\n Ceejay - Long Live Dytec''s Memory eh?? hehehe\n Rambo/Fairlight - You still haven''t called me voice! Argg...\n Elf-Co/Alpha Flight - Where''d you run off too dude?!?!\n Defcon - I see your getting back in it eh? Don''t forget to call!\n Ice Cube/Anthrox - Long time no talk dude. Call sometime!\n PhARAOh - Hiya dude. See the board''s getting better all the time!\n Zen - Always my best friend around! :)\n Echo/LSD - Let me know about the group then.\n Kidlat - I expect you to be using this update of the door! :)\n\n And those that I know but forgot, and also those users that still value\nfriendship over all else, and of course to all you other ami-express door\nwriters out there. Drop me a line on my board sometime, I''d be glad to help\ntest your utils or give you the latest updates on mine.\n\n Remember to call my board. I need some console users badly.. and amiga\nusers are always more then welcome!\n\n And I''m still groupless.. Any group willing to take me on please get ahold\nof me. I like releasing my doors under a group name. They get spread faster!\n\n                                   Later dudes.. Till then!\n\n                                                            TW,SA\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,95799,2,0,NULL,NULL,'vdpage','scan',1780048821);
