me F''ing reason why I released the boring cY8ER-COMMENT thingy hehehic!\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n-------------\n\nA BRAIN! A MIGGY & AN YOU MUST BE A SYSOP & RUN /X v3.x+\nOTHERWISE FUCK OFF...\n\n(I WiN NO AWARDS FOR BEING NICE)\n\n(Oh hey it might even work on that lame S!X)\n\n\nWHAT THE SMEGGING HELL IS IT?:\n------------------------------\n\nI''m NOT even going to explain this!\n\nErm, OKi, Just for the thick people...\n\nIt''s a SysOp chat door...\n\nIf some dweeb tries to bug you by paging you, then you`ll be able to answer\ntheir chat-request by simply pressing "F1" (doh!)\n\nthen, obviously, your 88S will display the BBS:NODEx/STARTCHAT.TXT \n\nThis will start this /X AREXX DOOR\n\nOn the sysops side only, He/She will be able to choose between 6 different\nanswer txt files, which by the way are totally configurable to your needs!\n\n\n\nTHE cY8ERCHATx.TXT''s:\n---------------------\n\n"cY8ERCHAT1.txt" is the default txt display file\n\ne.g if you press "1" this file will be shown\n    I have also made it fooproof by against myself, what I mean is\n    if you are pissed up (like I am), then if you don''t press "1-6"\n    just another key for example "spacebar" then "cY8ERCHAT1.TXT"\n    will always be shown, aw fuck it, try the door, you''ll see what\n    I''m babbling on about...\n\n"cY8ERCHAT2.TXT" up to "cY8ERCHAT6.TXT are the other 5 txt files that\nare available to show to your users.\n\npress "2" whwn prompted and you''ll get "cY8ERCHAT2.TXT" and so on!\n\nIt doesn''t take tooo lloonngg to figure it out m8!\n\n\nRESTRICTIONS:\n-------------\n\nYOU WILL FIND NONE IF YOU KNOW YOUR AREXX!\nI LIMITED THE CHATS TO SIX, AS I COULDn''T BE ARSED TO DO ANY MORE WORK\nFEEL FREE (IF YOUKNOW WHAT YOU''RE DOING) TO ALTER THE MAIN FILE!\n\nOTHERWISE TAKE A RUNNING JUMP!\n\n\n\nWHERE O WHERE O WHERE O WHERE:\n------------------------------\n\nI CAN ALWAYS BE REACHED HERE........\n                                   ||\n                                   \/ \n\n           - --{ WHERE iNSANiTY iS CONSiDERED AN ART FORM }-- -\n                          .\n                          .                     .........    .\n    .___________  _______ :__.___.      __.___.:::  | /:::.  |__  _______\n    |  \_____  / /       \/  |   |     /  |   |:::  |/ :::|  |  \/  _ ___\n    |   \_(__  \ \_|   |_/   _   |    /   _   |:::  ·  :::|  |   \  _   /\n    |___/______/   |___| \___|   |    \___|   |:::     :::|______/__|   \_\n                      tGø/wL!`---''        `---''`::.....::''          :____/\n                          :\n                          `-----------------------------.\n              NERVE AXiS & WHALE! UKHQ - TASTE THE EXPER¦ENCE\n                                                        !\n               .----- AQUARiUS UFO DiSTRiBUTiON SiTE ---''\n               |\n POSSiBLY THE B!GGEST /X DOOR - MODULES - ASCii COLLECTiONS CONFS iN THE UK\n               :\n               `-------.\n         - --{ 2 NODE R¦NGDOWN 28.8K & 16.8K - 2 GiGS ONLiNE }-- -\n                       :\n       - --{ SEXiEST ARTWERK - COOLEST CONFS - CRAZiEST SYSOPS }-- -\n                       :\n               ÷ O · 1 · 7 · O · 4     5 · O · 5 · 8 · 4 · 5 ÷\n\n\n\nAnd maybe, just maybe (if my fone bill ain''t too high) on these:\n\nThe Edge - Digital Candy - Beyond Reality - Burger Bar - Cyrogenics\nPhantasm - Soap City - The Citadel of Chaos - Oasis...COME BACK DAN\n\n\n\nWARM (PiSSED) GREETiNGS FLY OUT TO:\n-----------------------------------\n\nPhaid - Tango - Ace - Venom - Rage - sTAB - Patriot - Data-Stream - Hybrid\nHotwire - Dan - Nes - Sonic - cHEM - Ice-D - Pot-Noodle - Sasha - Protocol\nHomer - Linebacker - Dennis T - Hermski - Chumash - Ben.E Wriggle & Daffy!\n\n[eog]\n\n\nBUGS:\n-----\n\nSHOULDn''T BE UNLESS YOU FUCKED WITH THE AREXX :( Doh!\n\n[eof] (thank god)\n\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,12035,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048460);
