 it might even work on that lame S!X)\n\n\nWHAT THE SMEGGING HELL IS IT?:\n------------------------------\n\nIT''S A BIT BL00DY OBVIOUS REALLY AIN''T IT m8????????\n(Sorry didn''t mean to shout!)\n\nWell blow me down with your bad breath.... yup!, it''s another\nComment door! \n\nY''know a replacement for the internal "c" command!\n\n\n\nFEATURES:\n---------\n\n - Crap ansi as usual!\n - Cursor Handling\n - it''s quite Speedy\n - offer free Sex\n - Tooltype configuration :(\n - Allows you to have different names for your SysOp''s like\n   having TANGO being called "FLOSSY" in the door, but when\n   it comes to writing the comment it reverts back to TANGO\n - Gosh, You can even Configure the Comment Header - Wowzer\n\n\n\n\nINSTALLATION:\n-------------\n\n\n \n  Copy All the files to necessary files to your doors: directory.\n\n            Copy the C.info to your "BBSCMD" drawer\n                                \n   Edit the "COMMENT.TXT" in the "cY8ERDOORS/COMMENT" directory\n                       (if you really must!)\n\n\n\nOH YUP THE "TOOLTYPES":\n-----------------------\n\nYou must configure the "cY8ERDOORS/COMMENT/COMMENT.INFO":\n\nBUTTON.x=  Stick your NAME or OTHER NICKNAME HERE\n\n           e.g: "BUTTON.1=cYBER" or "BUTTON.1=PISSHEAD"\n                "BUTTON.2=TANGO" or "BUTTON.2="FLOSSY"\n                "BUTTON.3=?????" and so on...\n\nSYSOP.x=   The name to leave the comment to!\n\n           e.g: "SYSOP.1=cYBER"\n                "SYSOP.2=TANGO"\n                "SYSOP.3=?????" and so on...\n\n\nCOMMENT.x= The Description of each SysOp\n\n           e.g: "COMMENT.1=Yup I''m Pissed Again"\n                "COMMENT.2=I want to mank on ya yubberz?"\n                "COMMENT.3=I really am a Lamer" and so on...\n\n\nF''iNG EASY AIN''T IT....doh\n\n\n\nWHERE O WHERE O WHERE O WHERE:\n------------------------------\n\n\n\nI CAN ALWAYS BE REACHED HERE........\n                                   ||\n                                   \/ \n\n           - --{ WHE