ugga off!\n\n\n\nWHY? O WHY? O WHY? O WHY?:\n--------------------------\n\nCause I was pissed and bored hehehe! (tg0 can vouch for me)\nAnd besides, I love releasing lame /X utils and Rage of NVX\nwould NEVER beat me UPLOADING this to 13th Hr BBS?? hehehe!\n\n\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n-------------\n\n  2 large bottles of Mr.Jimmy & Mr.Gin, 2 packs of Nurofen Plus and no brain!\n   Oh yup, don''t forget a miggy, with /X 2.x+ (doh!), sorry I''m pissed again\n\n                                                      |||||\n              You will also need RexxMAST to run this d0-0r\n                                                        *\n                                                       \_/\n\n         LAME BRAIN DRUNK AGAIN, SILLY DUMB-DUMB, COLD PLUMB INSANE!\n\n\n\nINTRODUCTiON:\n-------------\n\n\nB...b...b..B..Basically...\nDownload Info shows your 88S users useful (?) information about their stats\nwhen they initiate the download sequence by pressing "D" for Dummy.\n\n\n\nFEATURES:\n---------\n\nCrap ansi hehehe, I never was good with colours (maybe that''s cause I''m\nactually colour blind hehehe)  Hic!\n\nShows users some small statistix\n\nThis door replaces the need for the txt file "DownLoadMSG.txt" that lives in\nyour "BBS:CONF/" Directory. (So it''s best if you delete it hehehehe)\n\nAlso, When the user has finished downloading they will be shown either the\n"download.txt" or the "NoCredit.txt", which are obviously located in \nthe"DOWNLOADINFO/cY8ERDOWN" directory.\n\nThe "download.txt" file says something like "Oi cYBER you LEECHING GIMBOID,\nYA BETTER UPLOAD SOMETHING SOON hehehe", you can edit the "download.txt" to\nsuit your needs and your sense of humour.\n\nThe "NoCredit.txt" Just says "NO CREDZ YA LEECHING GIT, YA GOTTA UPLOAD"\n(this also appears if the user aborts downloading)\nThis txt file can also be edited.... jeez\n\n\n\nINSTALLATION:\n-------------\n \n  Copy All the files to necessary files to your doors: directory.\n\n        Copy the D_Internal.info to your "SYSCMD" drawer \n            Copy the D.info to your "BBSCMD" drawer\n     Don''t forget to delete all your "BBS:CONF/DownloadMSG.txt"\n                                \n                 That''s it Dude I think...? Hmmmm\n \n\n\n\nWHERE O WHERE O WHERE O WHERE:\n------------------------------\n\nI can be reached at the following Boards in the U.K...\n(Just incase you want to slag me off or irritate me or whatever)\n\nOh to be in england, in the summer time, close to the EDGE BBS hehe!\n\n13th Hour        +44(01)704-505-845 RINGDOWN (Bloody Kicking Board that!)\nThe Edge         +44(01)I''M-PISSED! (A NVX BBS - COOL BOARD)\nDigital Candy    +44(01)912-325-527 RINGDOWN (5 FUNKy NODES)\nBeyond Reality   N/A... Beyond Reality? too true\nBurger Bar       N/A... You Should be there!\nCyrogenics       N/A... Ditto!\nPhantasm         N/A... Wowzer\nSoap City        N/A... Damn nice SysOp ;)\n\n\n\nWARM (PiSSED) GREETiNGS FLY OUT TO:\n-----------------------------------\n\nTango.............. I''m Sober, honest D!, btw ta for your askii & ansi\n                    And.. yup, I have cheered up ;)\n                    p.s did you ever get to fuck a fresher or what?  ;)\nAce................ I want more axis hehe\nRage............... Stop UPLOADING to my conference hehe!\nCruise............. I''m gonna scan ya m8ty... soOn hehe!\n                    Tell YouknowWHO he''s fucking too PARANOiD :(\nHybrid............. When''s the 6,7,8,9 & 10th Node Coming then aye?\nData-Stream........ I''ll try NOT to pissed when I write you mail ;)\nPhaid.............. I''ll ring you voice soon, don''t 4get 13th Hour!\nDan................ Come back! I miss my Local Board <sniff!>\nDennis T........... Baah I like Cotswold Sheep & the Cows ;)\n                    Bloody Minchinhampton Common :(\nProtocol........... Hope ya oki m8\nHomer.............. Where da fuck are you?\nPatriot............ Love the Board, Kicking m8!\nsTAB............... Where da fuck are you & what you up to?\nDaffy.............. How ya doing? Hope to talk to you soon\nHotwire............ What ya up to? Mail me\nCHEM............... Hope to annoy you soon ;)\nSasha.............. Your bloody mobile is always on ANSWERPHONE :(\n                    Hope you''re having fun at UNi m8ty? hehe!\nIce-D.............. Well how come Phaid''s got a dissy? UNFAIR! hehe!\nPot-Noodle......... OXFORD AYE? GOOD ON YA M8!\nLineBacker!........ All the other Boards allow 12000 hehe NOT FAIR!\nSonic.............. Where are you m8? Mail me\nNes................ Ditto\nAxen............... Do you just upp to Soap City? Mail me.\n\n[eog]\n\n[eof] (thank god)\n\n','\n',char(10)),NULL,NULL,22194,3,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'scan',1780048460);
