\n[32mLast @D Days Uploads in [33m>> Amiga Forever <<[34m :      [0m([35mFiles[33m: [36m@N[0m, [35mFakes[33m: [36m@F, [35mMegs[33m: [36m@M.0[0m)\n[35mYesterdays Statistics [0m: [32m@Y [36mFiles[33m, [32m@Z [36mFakes[33m, [32m@B.0 [36mMegs [33m![0m\n#\nBBS:Conf02/Dir1\n[32mTodays Uploads in [33m>> Console Corner <<[34m :      [0m([35mFiles[33m: [36m@N[0m, [35mFakes[33m: [36m@F, [35mMegs[33m: [36m@M.0[0m)\n[35mYesterdays Statistics [0m: [32m@Y [36mFiles[33m, [32m@Z [36mFakes[33m, [32m@B.0 [36mMegs [33m![0m\n#\nBBS:Conf03/Dir1\n----------------------------(cut here)--------\n\n        \n        You can run the tool from CLI for testing. The output\n        will be sent to your CLI-Window. Install it in your\n        Logoff-Batch using ''>'' to redirect the output to a file !\n        \n        You can also specify the number of days of data to process.\n        This is a new parameter for V2.2 - prior to this it was only\n        able to process yesterday and today. This is equivalant to\n        passing in 1 (which is also the default for backwards compatbility).\n        Passing in 7 for example will display 7 the last 7 days of files and\n        a further 7 days of stats.\n\n        E.g. :\n\n        ----------------------------(cut here)--------\n        QuickNew S:QuickNew.Config 7 >BBS:Screens/QuickNew.txt.gr\n        ----------------------------(cut here)--------\n\n        There is also a limitation that however many days of files you specify\n        they must all exist in the single directory file you specify in the config\n        file. It wont scan to previous directory files, in addition it will only process\n        a maximum of the last 80000 bytes of the directory file for each conference.\n\n        If you call it with different config-files you can make\n        different outputs, e.g. for every conference !\n\n        Example-Outputs are included in the archive !\n\n\n        Now some hints how you can display it in your BBS !\n\n        This is my Node(x)/Bull(x).txt(.gr) :\n\n        ----------------------------(cut here)--------\n        ~SS_BBS:Screens/LastCallers.txt.gr\n        ~SP                               \n        ~SS_BBS:Screens/QuickNew.txt.gr\n        ----------------------------(cut here)--------\n\n        So you can display the Lastcallers and the QuickNew right\n        after each other...        \n\n\nLAST WORDS :\n------------\n        \n        Now have fun with this great tool !\n\n        For Bugs (there are none), Ideas (yeah !) or just for fun\n        call my BBS :\n\n                   bLACK m00N       G·O·D EXPRESS DESIGN WHQ !        \n                  ~~~~~~~~~~~~      L^O^G^I^C wORLDHEADQUARTERS !     \n   16.8 USR DST  +49-7054-8733      iLLUSION/gELBSUCHT hEADQUARTERS ! \n   16.8 USR DST  +49-7054-2737      bIZARRE fASCINATION hEADQUARTERS !\n\n\n        See ya soon mates...\n                                                   Calypso !\n                                                   ~~~~~~~\n\n  .-----------------------------------------------------------------------.\n  |       PLEASE READ THE REGISTER!.TXT INCLUDED IN THIS ARCHIVE !!!      |\n  `-----------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\nTHANX TO :\n----------\n\n        Ron/Esquire for the Conference-Ansis !\n\n        My beta-testers :\n        -----------------\n                Dalai Lama/Point Plank\n                Rotor/Gates of Asgard\n                Freddy Krueger/Boiler Room\n                MKO!/Eleventh Hour\n\n        You also can reach me on these boards !\n\n\nHISTORY :\n---------\n\n        V1.0    Only for my BBS :) !\n\n        V1.1    First public release !\n\n        V2.0    The ultimate major update !\n                - Three different DisplayModes...\n                - Can show deleted files in another color...\n                - Shows lots of additional informations !\n                - Fully configurable (config-file, conf-text, colors, etc.) !\n\n        V2.1    Small changes :\n                - Bigger Internal Buffer\n                - Faster Output (yep, this is possible !)\n                - Detects no longer dates in the description,\n                  which caused blank filenames in the list !\n                - Added registration info, hehe !\n                \n        V2.2    Modified by REbEL/QTX in 2019:\n                - Added date range parameter\n                - Added @D keyword\n                - Removed registration info, hehe !\n                - Also included disassembled source.\n\n  .-----------------------------------------------------------------------.\n  |       PLEASE READ THE REGISTER!.TXT INCLUDED IN THIS ARCHIVE !!!      |\n  `-----------------------------------------------------------------------''\n\nGREETINGS:\n----------\n\n      - G.E.M. - Runt&Scottie - Polaris - Skin - XAD - Deltaforce - Andy -\n      - Wedlock - Blackbird - Planet Master - Sid Vicious - Sigma Seven -\n         - Linebacker - Whiz - Raider - Mitch - Mr.T - Samir - Power -\n\n                         - All LOGIC and GOD Members -\n\n··············································································\n\n           - G·O·D Express Design HQ - LOGIC WHQ - ILLUSION HQ -\n               _ ________           _ ______________\n         /\_______    _ /     _____   ________     /__: _____  sYSOPS:\n        /____  _ /    //_____/o  _/___  /    /____/   |/    /  """""""\n      _____:/  //     /     //   \    \/    /    //   /    /   cALYPSO !\n     /     |\  /__________ /.   /_\   /________ /.    \    \   cASTOR\n __|/____________\       \/_____________\     \/______|\____\  mIKE & dAVE\n   |                                                  :        sPIKE\n                       ·b·L·A·C·K· ·m·O·O·N·       :_______|__\n 0.5      /\ __ /\             _______________     |    _ /|\n gIG hD! // \\//  \____________\________   _ /____ |    //   nUMBERS:\n 68o3o  /.   \/ 